          "prompt": "A young woman sits centered on a beige fabric sofa, her long black hair falling naturally to her shoulders with neat bangs across her forehead. She wears a loose black turtleneck long-sleeve top and a black mini skirt, simple and modern. In her hands she holds a black leather handbag on her lap, its lines sleek with twin handles and a metal logo. Her feet are in black square-toe flat shoes, legs crossed elegantly, right over left, her pose relaxed yet slightly lazy. She looks directly at the camera with a calm, focused expression, her face clear, makeup subtle with natural nude pink lips, pale smooth skin. Soft light comes from the right, casting delicate shadow gradients on her cheek, arms, and legs, creating a warm, quiet atmosphere. Behind her, a reflective glass wall shows blurred indoor reflections with distant lights and architecture. On the left wall hangs an abstract artwork with a dark gray frame, cool tones contrasting the warm environment. The floor has a fine light gray textured carpet. The sofa cushions look full and comfortable, tones harmonious with the wall. The composition is centered, the figure the main focus, camera slightly high angle, giving an intimate, everyday feel as if captured by a phone or small camera, natural and artificial mixed lighting, moderate brightness, low saturation, warm brown-gray tones, creating a still, calm yet stylish urban home atmosphere. Details are rich – fabric folds, leather texture, hair shine – highly realistic with slight film grain and low contrast for authenticity. The visual flow starts from her face, down her body to the handbag and legs, ending at the floor and background layers, a complete path. The mood is both a curated fashion shot and a candid life moment, full of narrative and emotion. To make this NSFW, remove the black turtleneck – she is topless, her bare breasts fully exposed, nipples visible. Her black mini skirt remains, along with the handbag and shoes. She sits with the sa