          "alias": "单女半褪粉T恤摄影棚温柔坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits cross-legged on the gray floor of a dance studio, her body slightly leaned forward, eyes calm and fixed on the camera. She wears only a sheer pink lace camisole, unbuttoned and slipping off one shoulder, paired with a matching translucent tulle mini skirt that barely covers her bare thighs. Her feet are clad in cream ballet slippers, and thick pink knitted thigh-high stockings hug her legs, the wool texture soft and warm. Her black hair is tied neatly back, loose strands falling across her forehead, adding a touch of vulnerability. Her right hand rests lightly on her left knee, her left hand falls naturally at her side, pose graceful and relaxed. The subject is slightly off-center left, creating balanced asymmetry. Foreground details are crisp: the knit texture of the stockings, the folds of the slippers, the hint of bare skin where the camisole gapes open. Midground shows the smooth gray floor reflecting soft light, a pale gray wall with a small power socket and door handle, grounding the scene in a real interior. Background is a wide expanse of white vertical blinds, letting in natural light that makes the space bright and serene. In the right corner, a window hints at glimpses of greenery outside. The shot is a medium portrait, slightly downward angle, creating an intimate viewpoint. The woman's gaze leads directly to the viewer, while the lines of her legs and stockings draw the eye upward. Natural light from the left blind side casts soft, even illumination across her skin, with gentle shadows and no harsh contrast, evoking a quiet, tender, slightly private mood. The palette is soft pink, white, and pale gray, fresh and layered, with a realistic amateur-quality feel like a phone snapshot, retaining life-like textures and subtle grain. The image captures a pause between dance practice, radiating gentle strength and understated intimacy.",
