          "id": "krea2-b58e26b6d25e09caca751d3a",
          "alias": "单女米外套公寓微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the black grand piano bench, wearing a short cream-colored faux-fur coat left open over a form-fitting black bodycon dress, sheer black stockings that catch the light, and black flat shoes with white square metal buckles. Her long hair falls naturally, wispy bangs grazing her forehead. She gazes softly into the lens with a gentle half-smile, poised and relaxed. Her left hand rests lightly on the piano key edge, right hand on her thigh, legs slightly crossed, elongating her silhouette. Behind her, heavy brown pleated curtains create a warm, intimate interior. On the piano to the left: a brown teddy bear in a red Santa hat and a clear glass vase with dried branches, adding artistic flair. To the right stands a tall outdoor heater with an orange-yellow flame visible through the metal mesh, casting a warm glow; its stainless steel top contrasts with the cozy setting. The floor is pale marble or tile, reflecting soft light. Composition is medium shot with the woman as focal point, piano in left background, heater in right foreground—balanced and layered. Foreground emphasizes her lower body and shoes; midground captures her full figure, piano, and heater; background is curtain and wall. Lighting from the heater's warm fire plus ambient soft light creates a cozy, lazy, slightly fashionable atmosphere. Palette dominated by brown, black, cream with accents of red and gold, harmonious and textured. The image has a realistic, amateur-camera snapshot feel with subtle film grain and natural noise, enhancing authenticity. Style blends urban fashion, home comfort, and holiday vibes—quiet, emotionally rich. Visual flow from face to body contours to background details tells a complete narrative; spatial layers and soft light transitions evoke a serene, warm mood. Perfect for personal life record or artistic portrait. The woman's pose and open coat hint at sensuality: the black dress clings to her curves, stockings emphasize her legs, and her subtle smile carries inviting confidence.",
