          "prompt": "A young woman leans elegantly against a pure white wall, her pose assertive and sensual—she is topless, wearing only a fluffy deep red fur coat draped open over her shoulders, its black-and-red plaid lining visible as the coat falls away, exposing her bare breasts. Her natural hair cascades down, adorned with a large red transparent gauze flower. Makeup is impeccable, red lips glossy, eyes locked on the viewer with confident, mysterious invitation. Her right leg is bent, foot resting on a silver mirror disco ball, while her left leg stands straight, sheathed in high-shine burgundy patent leather boots with metallic buckle details. The dress she wore is gone; instead, layered red ribbons and pleated fabric fragments trail from the coat's edges, adding motion and texture. Two disco balls of different sizes scatter on the floor in the foreground, their mirrored facets reflecting fragmented light. Composition is slightly low-angle, body centered-right, emphasizing her long legs and commanding presence. Background is minimal white space, with a faint doorframe outline on the right. Lighting from a softbox in front illuminates her skin evenly, creating soft highlights on her curves, the furry coat, and the glossy boots. Shadows are gentle, enhancing three-dimensionality. The atmosphere fuses retro disco carnival with modern cool glamour—high contrast in white, red, and silver. The image captures fine skin texture, fabric fibers, and mirror reflections, as if shot with a medium-format or full-frame mirrorless camera at 85mm f/2.8, 1/125s, ISO 100. Style is fashion photography and pop culture, empowering yet explicit, conveying an independent, confident, boldly sexual modern woman.",
