          "prompt": "A young woman kneels bare on the warm geometric wood floor, her body leaning slightly forward, right hand resting on the edge of the bed, left hand dangling loosely at her side. She is completely nude, her high bun revealing the curve of her neck, her face calm yet subtly seductive, eyes locked on the viewer with a lazy, knowing gaze. The scene is a cluttered, lived-in bedroom: the bed is covered in a light floral duvet, scattered with pink pillows and plush toys; an old beige microwave sits on the nightstand, topped with a blue cup, a small bottle, and tangled wires. Below, a gray two-tier storage cabinet shows scuffs. The yellow wallpaper has a woven texture, faded and stained in patches. To the left, an open closet door reveals a messy pile of thick coats—black puffer, pink padded, blue jacket—and a heap of sneakers, a pink pair catching the eye. Shot from a slight top-down angle, the woman dominates the frame, her bare skin soft against the textured floor, shadows pooling beneath her and the furniture. Soft, even light from an overhead lamp or window washes the room in warm tones of yellow, brown, black, with bright blue-white stripes and colorful accents. The image feels like a candid snapshot—a private, unposed moment of everyday intimacy, rich in detail and raw realism.",
