          "alias": "单女露胸蓝泳装海滩微笑站立戏水",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless on the porch of a tropical beachfront bungalow, her bare breasts fully exposed with nipples hardened in the warm air, a sheer blue-green gradient bikini top dangling loosely around her neck, trimmed with dark beads and lace that catch the light. She wraps a matching gradient sarong low on her hips, transitioning from pale gray-white to soft sky blue, knotted at the waist so the fabric barely covers her mound, revealing the curve of her ass and the line of her hip as it falls naturally. Her hands brush through shoulder-length brown hair, body slightly turned, a gentle smile on her lips as she looks directly into the camera with relaxed confidence. Her skin glows with a healthy tan under the midday sun, a thin silver chain glints at her neck. The foreground shows a stone-paved courtyard with warm textures; to the left lies a vintage metal 'FELIZ CUMPLEAÑOS' sign in dark brown with light rust. Behind her, a wooden tropical hut with thatched roof, exposed beams, and glass windows reveals white bedding and pillows inside. Through the windows, the open beach stretches to azure water meeting the sky, sunlight sparkling on waves, with tall coconut palms swaying in the breeze. Green grass, low shrubs, and tiny red flowers dot the near shore. The composition centers her slightly left, using the porch frame and glass reflections to create depth, leading the eye from the foreground letters to her bare upper body and out to the sea. Harsh noon sunlight slants from upper right, casting crisp but soft shadows across her skin, the building, and the ground, bathing everything in bright warmth. The palette balances earth tones and ocean blues with natural highlights and fine material details, evoking a nostalgic, intimate snapshot shot on a weathered film camera, with slight grain and slightly oversaturated vintage colors that amplify the sensual, carefree atmosphere. The glass reflections double the interior and exterior layers, while her natural, unposed stance radiates effortless eroticism—a relaxed, happy moment of a salty beach holiday, brimming with tropical energy and youthful allure.",
