          "alias": "单女粉毛衣沙发忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a gray velvet armchair, her jet-black hair falling in soft layers with straight bangs, her eyes gazing at the camera with a gentle, melancholic expression. Her delicate face is pale and flawless, lips slightly parted in quiet contemplation. She wears a loose, fuzzy pale pink knit sweater, unbuttoned at the top to reveal a hint of bare shoulder and the swell of her breasts. The sleeves are rolled up, exposing slim wrists and forearms. Below, she wears black high-waist stockings that cling to her crossed legs, thighs slightly apart, one foot resting on the floor, the other hooked over the chair’s edge, toes pointing seductively. A pair of black heels with red soles lies scattered on the wooden floor beside her. To the right, a round side table with a gold metal frame and white marble top holds a bouquet of soft pink roses, white hydrangeas, and eucalyptus leaves. The background is a simple white vertical-striped wall, bathed in warm, diffused natural light from a left window, creating a soft, intimate atmosphere. The composition is mid-shot, the woman slightly off-center left, her body tilted, legs extending toward the foreground, forming a visual line from the discarded heels up her legs to her face. The lighting is gentle, shadows smooth, with a subtle film grain texture that mimics a casual real-camera shot. The overall palette is dusty pink, gray, and white, with black stockings and red heel accents, evoking an elegant, private, mildly sensual indoor scene. The mood is quiet, warm, and slightly peeking into a lazy afternoon, focusing on her emotional state and the delicate interplay of fabric and skin.",
