          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙闺房困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a luxurious indoor staircase, wearing a revealing black off-shoulder mini dress with exaggerated lantern sleeves—cuffs flipped to expose a stark white lining, the dress cut so low it barely covers her breasts, hinting at bare nipples beneath the sheer fabric. Her long, jet-black hair cascades over one shoulder as she presses her left hand to her forehead, her right arm stretching back to grip an ornate gold-carved banister. She wears black velvet high-heel sandals with bow details, a delicate metal choker, and drop earrings. The dress clings to her curves, the hem riding high on her thighs. The scene is lit by a warm amber sconce on the beige textured wall, casting soft side light that sculpts her face and torso, deepening shadows between her breasts and along her waist. Dark green velvet carpet with gold geometric trim lines the stairs, matching the railing. Shot from a low angle, she stands slightly left of center, her body twisting into an S-curve, her gaze downcast and dreamy, lips parted. The lens opens wide, throwing the background into creamy bokeh, emphasizing her sharp features and the silky sheen of her skin. The mood is elegant, mysterious, and deeply erotic—like a frame from a high-fashion boudoir film.",
