        {
          "id": "krea2-f3ff9ef54a50e0761a9fe810",
          "alias": "单女露胸旗袍微笑脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman poses in an open, modified cheongsam of pale pink with red floral patterns, the silk fabric unbuttoned to reveal her bare breasts and torso, the gloss and fine texture echoing the fabric’s sheen. She wears only long bright red silk gloves extending from wrist to elbow, a pearl necklace at her throat, and her hair is styled in double braids coiled atop her head, adorned with small red flower hairpins, with loose strands falling softly. Her gaze is clear and focused, directly at the camera, with a subtle, knowing smile, her right hand lifted to her chest, fingers gently curled, left hand hanging naturally, body angled slightly right while face faces forward. The composition centers her slightly right of frame, foreground showing her face and upper body, midground with wooden furniture and a lamp, background a mottled gray-blue wall with subtle texture and uneven light. Left side reveals a dark wood cabinet holding a vintage candlestick with a white candle and a metal tray; right side a tall floor lamp with a beige fabric shade trimmed with fringe, the base carved wood with antique details. Soft directional light from the left front creates warm side lighting, casting gentle shadows on face and cheongsam, illuminating the creamy skin of her chest and the glossy red gloves. Overall tones are warm yellow, pink, and red against cool gray, enhancing depth. Shallow depth of field focuses on the subject, with the backdrop slightly blurred, evoking a nostalgic, intimate vintage moment. The image carries a strong East-meets-modern aesthetic, with film-like grain and warm hues, rich in detail and emotion—a timeless, sensual portrait.",
