        {
          "id": "krea2-08fabea806c2e650a50994d8",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙商店媚态坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a black fabric sofa in a clothing store, wearing a short white sleeveless dress with black polka dots, the skater skirt hiked up to reveal her bare thighs and the edge of black lace panties. She crosses her legs naturally, right over left, white ankle socks peeking out from her sneakers. Her light brown hair falls over her shoulders, a blunt fringe above her eyes, and a black silk headscarf wraps from crown to mouth, shrouding everything but her gaze and part of her forehead, exuding a mysterious, seductive allure. One hand rests on the sofa arm, fingers long and nails neatly trimmed, a thin silver ring on her left ring finger. She stares directly into the lens with a lazy, playful expression, lips slightly parted, caught in a candid, mischievous pose. She sits slightly left of center, body turned right, head tilted, creating dynamic balance. Behind her, black metal racks hold clothes—jeans, black leather jacket, white knit, gray hoodie—in monochrome shades with a red “LAST PIECE UP TO -50%” sign hanging above. The ceiling is mirrored, reflecting warm yellow spotlights that cast dot patterns and blurred reflections, adding depth and geometric complexity. A light beige carpet contrasts with the black sofa. The composition is central, with her as the absolute focus; foreground includes sofa edge and her legs, midground racks, background the ceiling and store. Visual lines lead from her eyes down her body to the sign, forming a closed loop. Lighting is soft, top-down, revealing every detail of her face and dress, shadows pooled beneath her and on the sofa. Color palette is black, white, gray with the red sign and her light brown hair. The overall vibe is fashion-forward yet casually erotic, as if a spontaneous snapshot during shopping, with slight film grain, warm tones, and low saturation, evoking a private, intimate urban moment. The image radiates modern feminine confidence, blending street style, consumer culture, and personal expression—young, independent, and unapologetically alluring.",
