          "alias": "单女露胸白连体衣厨房媚态站立持手机",
          "prompt": "A long-haired woman with soft light brown hair stands sideways in a modern minimalist kitchen, leaning slightly forward as she adjusts something inside a black air fryer, holding a tool with both hands. Her white floral-print romper has its straps slipped off her shoulders, exposing her bare breasts, while the shorts still cling to her hips. She wears beige flat sandals and a delicate bracelet, her hair falling naturally behind her. The bright kitchen features white high-gloss cabinets, a warm wooden slatted ceiling, and a black-and-white checkered tile backsplash. An embedded oven and range hood are visible on the left, fresh vegetables and a potted plant sit on the island counter to the right. Warm yellow overhead lighting creates soft, realistic shadows. Medium shot, composition places her on the left, facing right, focus on the air fryer. The scene has slight grain and natural color, like a candid phone snapshot, capturing an intimate, everyday moment with raw texture and subtle eroticism.",
