        {
          "id": "krea2-51c0e8fbeabb1ae8756b1dbb",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙厨房媚态坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a cozy kitchen corner, wearing a white spaghetti-strap sundress with a bow at one shoulder, the strap slipped down to bare one full breast, the other strap barely holding; the soft silk fabric catches warm sunlight, revealing the outline of her nipples through the thin material. She holds an old, yellowed book in her hands, reading with focused eyes, her long fingers with pale pink nails gently turning pages. Her deep brown hair, with light golden highlights, falls loose over her face, a cream-colored bow pinned on top. A thin chain necklace with a small pearl rests against her collarbone, now fully exposed. Her expression is serene, lips slightly parted, as she leans slightly forward, the low neckline gaping to show the curve of her bare chest. The background is a homey kitchen with warm wooden cabinets and countertops; a potted succulent, lemons, a wicker basket with utensils, a soy sauce bottle, a glass jar, books, and a small chalkboard reading \"Milk\" sit on the counter. Wooden utensils hang beside a vintage framed picture, and a white pleated lamp adds warm light. Gentle side light from a window on the right casts soft shadows across her face and body, highlighting the exposed skin and the texture of her dress. The composition is a mid-shot, with her body slightly turned, her gaze downward, drawing attention to the open book and her hand. The foreground shows the book and her fingers; the midground features her figure and the surrounding objects; the background reveals kitchen details and a faint building silhouette outside. The scene is bathed in warm yellow and white tones, evoking a quiet, intimate, nostalgic atmosphere with film-grain texture, slightly desaturated colors, and a shallow depth of field (50mm f/1.8). The visual flow leads from her face along her gaze to the book, then to the kitchen details—a slow, cinematic moment of everyday beauty, unforced and natural, with a sense of private, sensual stillness.",
