        {
          "id": "krea2-1ee142bef8430779475fdc40",
          "alias": "单女黑和服公寓害羞跪注视",
          "prompt": "A silver-haired young woman kneels on a traditional Japanese wooden veranda, wearing an elegant black kimono-style cosplay outfit with subtle dark woven patterns. The lapels and cuffs are trimmed with wide white lace ruffles, and the kimono is left open at the front, revealing a black lace camisole underneath—one strap slipped off her shoulder, exposing the curve of her breast and the edge of her dark nipple. A wide black lacquered obi cinches her waist, adorned with gold tassels and an ornate bow. Gold dragon motifs and crashing wave patterns embroider the hem and sleeves, blending mystery and nobility. Her moonlight-white hair falls smoothly with a straight fringe, pinned back with a black satin bow and a small antler-like hair ornament, adding a fantasy touch. She gazes softly forward, lips slightly parted in a gentle, shy smile, as she lifts the kimono sleeves with both hands, subtly displaying the exquisite garment. Her kneeling pose is graceful and poised—knees together, feet flat against the floor. The background is a classic Japanese interior with dark wooden beams and sliding doors; soft natural light streams in from the right side, casting long, warm shadows across the polished floor. A medium close-up composition places her slightly off-center, body angled toward the camera, eyes meeting the viewer’s with a delicate, inviting expression. Her fingers trace the golden embroidery on the fabric, drawing attention to her bared skin and the luxurious details. The lighting is warm and flattering, with a side-backlight that outlines her silhouette in a soft glow, highlights catching the edges of her hair. The overall palette is black, white, and gold, accented by wood tones and warm yellow light, creating an elegant, intimate, and slightly ethereal atmosphere—like a high-end portrait photograph rich in texture and emotion, blending Eastern aesthetics with fantasy erotica.",
