        {
          "id": "krea2-973af8126495138adc8c2798",
          "alias": "单女挂脖舞台媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her hair styled in two playful pigtails with pink highlights, soft strands falling naturally around her forehead and cheeks for a casual yet edgy look. She wears a deep burgundy sequin halter dress with an extreme plunging neckline that reveals ample cleavage, the fabric gathered and ruched across her chest to create elegant ruffled drapes. The dress cinches tightly at her waist, flaring into multi-layered ruffled hem that catches the light with every subtle shimmer. A bold metal chain necklace with irregular silver charms rests against her bare collarbone, adding a punk-rock accent. In her right hand, she holds a black microphone, fingers grazing her chin in a confident, self-assured pose; her left hand lifts slightly near her neck, as if adjusting the necklace or making a delicate gesture. Her makeup is precise: sharp winged eyeliner, shimmering pearl eyeshadow, and full rose-red lips that highlight her striking facial features. She stares directly into the lens with a cool, enigmatic expression, part sultry, part mysterious. The background is a deep blue stage curtain with a fine grain texture, creating a soft, premium atmosphere. Stage light pours from above, casting a gentle, slightly blurred circular halo behind her, enhancing depth and focus. The illumination concentrates on her body, producing brilliant highlights on her skin, hair, and dress, with strong yet smooth shadow transitions. The composition is medium shot, slightly off-center left, her body turned at a three-quarter angle while her face faces the camera, showcasing both profile and front details. The frame leaves breathing space on both sides for fluid visual flow. The color palette is deep wine, pink, silver-gray, and navy, unified and harmonious, evoking a sexy yet fresh modern pop aesthetic. The lighting feels warm with a cool undertone, blending the passion of a live stage performance with the fine detail of a photoshoot. The overall image has strong artistic expression and fashion sensibility, as if catching a real, vulnerable moment during a meticulously staged concert. Every detail is crisp—from expression to fabric texture to the interplay of light and shadow—rendered in a high-quality amateur-style that mimics a professional camera with a wide aperture in low light, blending natural and stage lights to create a narrative visual language. No distracting elements; the focus remains solely on her, projecting an independent, confident, and boldly individualist contemporary female vibe that balances stage glamour with everyday authenticity, as if the viewer is standing just below the stage, witnessing this electrifying performance firsthand.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
