          "alias": "单女红旗袍沙发微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the floor before a white sofa, dressed in a sheer red lace cheongsam, its front deeply unbuttoned to expose her bare cleavage and midriff. She has short bangs and a delicate white flower pinned in her hair, smiling with a playful wink. Her left hand rests on a stack of red envelopes, while her right hand holds a black-and-red folding fan open in a radiant arc. The short slit of the dress reveals her thighs and the tops of black thigh-high stockings with ribbon ties at the ankles. The pose is elegant yet seductive, the fabric clinging to her curves and hinting at her bare skin beneath. Scattered oranges, a small red paper, and folded red envelopes lie on the carpet in the foreground. The background is a clean light gray wall and the curved white sofa. Soft natural light from the front-left illuminates her, warm and vibrant, with subtle film grain—a perfect red-and-white contrast. The composition centers her slightly bottom-right, using diagonal lines from the fan to draw the eye to her face. The mood is celebratory, cheerful, and sensual, capturing a New Year moment with intimate, artistic detail.",
