        {
          "id": "krea2-a5be2f1a7b0a02536deb35f3",
          "alias": "单女露胸连衣裙沙发困倦躺脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges in a deep gray beanbag, her body reclining slightly backward with legs crossed in a relaxed, lazy pose. She wears a cream-white, tight long-sleeve dress—now unbuttoned to her navel, exposing her bare breasts and smooth cleavage—while the dress's natural waist wrinkles emphasize her slender waist and flowing curves. The hem rides high on her thighs, revealing long, pale legs clad in sheer nude stockings. Her skin is finely textured and luminous. She holds a magazine or book above her head, the cover facing upward, as if she's just about to read or has lowered it. Her long black hair falls over her shoulders, silky and glossy, with neat bangs covering her forehead. Her features are delicate and three-dimensional, with heavy eye makeup and full red lips; her gaze droops downward, pensive or weary. The background is a light gray fabric tent structure with zipper and stitch details, creating a homely or makeshift enclosed space. The floor is warm wooden planks, texture clearly visible. Soft light enters from the right side, forming natural side lighting that illuminates her face, arms, and legs, while casting subtle shadows on her body and the sofa's edge, with smooth light-to-dark transitions, evoking a warm, quiet indoor atmosphere. The composition is slightly overhead, with the subject offset to the right, leaving ample space on the left, enhancing breathing room. The foreground shows her lower body and part of the sofa; the midground features her full body and the tent behind; the background is a blurred indoor environment. Visual flow follows her gaze and body posture, focusing on her face and the book in her hands. The overall palette is cream white, gray, and brown, harmonious and unified, capturing a private, silent moment of everyday life, as if on an afternoon when she enjoys solitude with an artistic and casual air. The image style is realistic and natural, with the texture of a candid shot taken by an ordinary camera at home, rich in detail, layered, and full of narrative and emotional tension.",
