          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an open outdoor landscape, wearing a loose gray workwear jacket unzipped to reveal her white shirt undone at the collar, a yellow-brown plaid necktie loosely hanging, a black pleated miniskirt, black sheer stockings, and tall black Western cowboy boots with flame cutout details. Her long wavy hair blows gently in the breeze, face clear and delicate, eyes meeting the lens with a confident, sultry gaze, lips parted in a soft suggestive smile. Her hands lift to her chest, palms outward, fingers slightly spread, one hand tugging at the tie as if inviting. The foreground shows dry dirt ground with sparse withered grass. The midground centers her, slightly turned body facing forward, full-length, elegant stance. Background is a wide flat gray-blue sky with no clouds, clear horizon line dividing sky and ground. In the upper right corner, a bright graphic logo reads \"大众点评\" with a red panda cartoon and \"宇宙闪烁 请注意\" in cyan-and-orange futuristic art font. Lower left has \"iQIYI 爱奇艺\" white watermark. Overall color palette is gray-blue, gray-white, black, brown with warm yellow tie accent. Soft diffused overcast lighting, no harsh shadows, all details clearly visible. Composition is classic portrait, leading from her face down her body and outfit, then to the minimalist backdrop. The mood is intimate yet cinematic, with slight film grain and desaturated tones, evoking a quiet, distant, but powerfully expressive personal image—youthful independence and exploration, now charged with a raw, sensual electricity.",
