          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a dark metal staircase, her light brown hair tied in twin tails with blunt bangs, eyes locked on the lens with a lazy, melancholic expression. She rests her chin on her right hand, completely topless, her bare breasts exposed in the dim light. She wears only a black choker necklace, black thigh-high socks with silver cross details, and chunky black leather boots studded with metal rivets and gold accents. Her body is slightly turned, head tilted, creating an asymmetrical allure. In the foreground, a metal railing with yellow-black warning stripes shows wear and peeling paint, industrial grit. The staircase extends into deep shadows, its diamond-patterned steps in dark gray with scuffed edges. The background is pitch-black, with only faint ambient light tracing the stairs. Shot from a low angle, she is offset to the right, the staircase diagonally leading from lower left to upper right. Cold tones dominate; a single light source from above front (like a phone flash) casts soft highlights on her face, hands, and breasts, leaving everything else in harsh contrast, evoking a mysterious, lonely, rebellious nightlife aesthetic—an underground bar or abandoned building with post-punk decay. The image feels like a casual amateur shot, slight grain, imperfect exposure, very raw. Wide-angle with mild distortion captures the full scene, low saturation emphasizing blacks, grays, browns, with the yellow warning stripe as the only bright accent. Unpolished, candid, and intensely charged.",
