          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a bridge overlooking the Seine in Paris, wearing a long off-white floral dress with a delicate bow at the neckline—now loosened, the bodice falling open to expose her full bare breasts. The dress has three-quarter sleeves, and her long black hair cascades naturally, catching the sunlight. Her gaze is calm, deep, and seductive, lips painted with a soft nude lipstick. Her skin is pale and flawless. She holds a silver-gray clutch in one hand, standing poised yet provocatively revealing. The mid-shot composition places her on the right foreground, with the Eiffel Tower softly blurred in the background under a clear blue sky. Mid-ground shows a riverboat and the bridge railing covered in colorful love locks, glinting in the sun. The warm yellow and blue tones evoke a bright spring afternoon. Soft left-side lighting creates natural shadows and highlights on her skin and hair, emphasizing her nude upper body. The scene blends a realistic candid snapshot feel with professional composition, evoking romantic freedom and a hint of erotic adventure.",
