        {
          "id": "krea2-21f2d8ac3f040461589e3b4e",
          "alias": "单女半褪牛仔街道媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands sideways, her long, sleek black hair cascading over her shoulders, catching natural light with a glossy sheen. She glances back at the camera with deep, slightly lazy seductive eyes, dark red lips slightly parted, adding mystery and sensuality. Her right hand gently touches her cheek, long fingers painted with glossy black nail polish, pose elegant and relaxed. She wears a loose denim jacket, sleeves rolled to the elbows, slouched off one shoulder, exposing her bare shoulder and the line of her back—the denim shows clear washing marks and stitching details. Below, a high-waisted black patent leather mini skirt, mirror-smooth, reflects surrounding light with bright specular highlights, hugging her curves and accentuating her buttocks. The short hem is neat, fastened by black lace suspender straps with metal clips, holding up black fishnet stockings that stretch from thigh to ankle, fine mesh evenly patterned. The overall look blends street casual with provocative eroticism. She stands slightly left of center, body tilted for dynamic balance. Background: a heavy curtain in off-white or light grayish white, with distinct vertical folds, fine texture, soft warm beige shadows from gentle lighting. Light comes from front-right, evenly illuminating her face and body, creating subtle reflections on the jacket and skirt, with soft, gradual shading. Medium shot portrait, subject dominates the frame but leaves space for background context. Visual focus is on facial expression, neck and shoulder lines, and leg posture. Color palette: black, white, gray, with denim blue and dark red lip accent—strong contrast. Atmosphere: intimate, ambiguous, with a vintage cinematic feel, like a still from an indie art film. Shooting style resembles professional studio lighting but retains a casual, spontaneous touch. Uses a medium-focus prime lens, shallow depth of field, moderate background blur, highlighting the subject. Detailed textures, rich tones, advanced photographic tonal control and color layering. Overall conveys modern urban feminine confidence and self-expression, balancing fashion and emotional tension.",
