        {
          "id": "krea2-a95b28ac063548adcc524e41",
          "alias": "单女露胸粉内裤摄影棚忧伤坐跳舞",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on the floor of a modern dance studio, wearing only sheer pale pink lace panties and beige fishnet tights, with long knitted leg warmers and ballet shoes. Her black hair falls naturally, strands brushing her cheeks. She gazes forward with a contemplative, focused expression, her pose relaxed yet elegant—legs crossed, right foot pointed, toes lightly touching the floor, left hand resting on her knee, right hand bent at her side. Her face and body are sharply detailed, from delicate features to smooth skin texture. The background is a bright dance studio with white walls, gray non-slip floor, and a row of tall windows on the left letting in soft natural light, curtains half-drawn creating contrasting light and shadow. A white ballet barre runs across the right side into the distance, and a large mirror on the back wall reflects part of the space and her form, adding depth. The composition is centered symmetric, with the subject slightly lower center, using the barre and mirror as leading lines. Light from upper left, warm like morning or evening, casts soft shadows on her right side and the floor. The color palette is pink, white, beige, gray with a creamy, natural feel. The image has a candid, snapshot quality with subtle noise and natural light transitions, a slight wide-angle lens distortion enhancing the sense of space. The atmosphere is quiet, poetic—a dancer's moment of rest between practice, combining youthful vitality with inner strength, professional elegance with everyday intimacy, and a gentle melancholic undertone.",
