        {
          "id": "krea2-6ace79ef6298bf019a4ce407",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔室内困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a sleek dark bar top indoors, wearing a deep blue denim sleeveless dress unzipped to her waist, revealing her bare chest and nipples, the dress's pockets and zipper details still visible, her long black hair falling naturally with blunt bangs framing her face. She sits sideways, eyes lowered to one side, expression contemplative and languid, her right hand raised to her chest, fingers slightly curled, left hand resting on her thigh, holding a brown LV monogram handbag adorned with a colorful pumpkin-shaped fabric charm. Her long legs are posed—right leg bent, left leg extended—wearing white sneakers with light texture. She sits on the glossy dark bar top, which reflects the surrounding light into soft shadows, the bar edge metallic and cool. A pair of red-lens sunglasses with white frames lies on the bar, their lenses catching warm light spots, adding depth. The background is a night cityscape through large glass windows, blurry lights and distant building silhouettes visible, creating a hazy urban night view. The interior has an industrial style with exposed metal structures and pipes on the ceiling, warm yellow light from above illuminating the scene, giving a cozy yet mysterious atmosphere. Composition is mid-shot, the woman slightly off-center to the right, body slightly tilted for natural dynamism; foreground is the bar and sunglasses, midground is the subject, background is city night and interior. Lighting comes from warm yellow indoor lights from above and side, clearly defining her face and body contours with soft shadows, emphasizing volume. Strong contrast between light and shadow, smooth transitions, mood is quiet and elegant, capturing a paused moment in the urban night. Image has the realism of a casual daily shot, preserving life-like details and imperfect texture. Color palette dominated by deep blue, brown, warm yellow, with small bright accents. Overall image exudes modern urban woman's independent attitude and casual allure, blending artistic and everyday visual style.",
