          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a modern interior, wearing a black-and-white gingham deep V-neck one-piece swimsuit, the top half a small check pattern with white trim, the bottom half solid black high-waisted, clinging to her curves. She has removed the white long knit cardigan, letting it hang open or fall off one shoulder, revealing the swimsuit's deep plunge and her cleavage. Her black hair falls in soft waves over her shoulders, natural and tousled. She holds a white smartphone in her right hand, taking a selfie in a full-length mirror, her body slightly turned, head tilted, looking at the screen with a confident, gentle smile. The reflection shows her entire figure, the swimsuit accentuating her waist and hips. The scene is bathed in warm natural light from the large floor-to-ceiling window on the right, revealing a city skyline. To the left, a gray fabric sofa with colorful pillows, an abstract art piece on the wall, dark wood floor with a beige rug. Soft shadows play across her skin, highlighting her collarbone and the curve of her breasts. The composition feels intimate and candid, a private moment of self-capture. The mood is sensual, confident, and relaxed, with subtle erotic tension from the swimsuit's cut and the way she poses.",
