          "alias": "单女全裸黑连衣裙摄影棚媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in soft indoor lighting, her long, jet-black hair cascading naturally, with some strands tucked behind her ear to reveal her delicate face and deep, piercing eyes that look directly into the lens with a cold, confident allure. Her lips are slightly parted, inviting and sensual, with flawless pale skin and sharp, sculpted facial features—high cheekbones, a straight nose, and defined eyeliner framing her gaze. Her makeup is refined but not overdone, with a natural reddish nude lip color, creating a paradoxical mix of pure innocence and raw sexiness. She wears a high-neck, shiny black latex-like bodycon dress that clings to every curve, emphasizing her full breasts and narrow waist. The short hem reveals long legs sheathed in black fishnet stockings attached to a black suspender belt, the straps extending from her thighs up to her waist, adding a dark, edgy fetish vibe. Over it, she has a loose, washed-out denim jacket in a gray-blue tone with visible wear and fading, left open to reveal the dress underneath; the sleeves are rolled up, showing the cream lining for layered texture. Her hands are raised, fingers running through her hair—left hand gently resting on top of her head, right hand at the side of her neck—in a casually posed but elegant gesture. Her body leans slightly forward, weight shifted, creating a dynamic balance. The background is a heavy, light beige curtain with visible fabric texture and soft vertical folds. Light slants in from the left side of the frame, casting a warm golden glow that illuminates her right cheek, shoulder, and arm, while leaving her left side in subtle shadow, enhancing three-dimensionality. The composition is a medium shot, with her centered slightly left, leaving space for environmental details. Visual focus is on her face and upper body, with contrast between glossy latex, rough denim, smooth skin, and fishnet texture. The mood mixes vintage film grain with modern fashion style, in a palette of black, gray, brown, and warm yellow light, evoking an intimate, lazy, and highly personal atmosphere—as if shot in a private room or studio with a regular camera or phone, featuring slight noise and low-resolution feel to simulate amateur authenticity. The image tells a story of independence, freedom, and self-expression, with steady yet dynamic framing, moderate color saturation, rich detail, and a unique blend of artistic photography and everyday documentation.",
