          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a polished marble floor indoors, her body leaning slightly forward with legs bent in an elegant squat, her right hand gently brushing the hair at her forehead, her left hand resting on the floor to support herself, her pose lazy yet expressive. She wears a loose beige trench coat styled off the shoulder, revealing a black thin-strap top underneath, the coat cinched at the waist with a matching belt and metal buckle, blending fashion with casual ease. Her long hair falls naturally over her shoulders, smooth and shiny, with neat bangs covering her forehead. She looks down, eyes slightly lowered, her gaze dreamy and contemplative, facial features soft, skin fair and delicate, lips a pale shade, and a fine necklace adds a touch of elegance. She wears sheer black stockings, her legs long and graceful, and dark gray pointed-toe high heels with a bow decoration, giving a vintage yet playful vibe. The subject is in the mid-foreground, dominating the frame. The background is a warm-toned indoor setting, with a wooden door on the left showing clear natural grain, and another half-open door on the right with red light seeping through, creating mystery. A vertical strip of yellow light descends from the ceiling, illuminating the wall and part of the floor, producing strong contrasts of light and shadow. The marble floor displays gray-and-white natural patterns, reflecting ambient light and enhancing texture and depth. The composition is slightly tilted, adding dynamism and tension, with the woman’s body curves forming an oblique line with the floor, guiding the eye toward the center. The doorframes and light divide the scene, building depth and spatial structure. Visual focus is directed by her pose, hand movements, and gaze, drawing attention to her facial expression and overall styling. The lighting is warm yellow, creating an intimate, quiet, slightly erotic indoor atmosphere. Soft and concentrated light emphasizes her silhouette and fabric textures, while shadows add dimension and realism. The overall style blends everyday casualness with artistic photography, as if a spontaneous snapshot from an amateur camera, preserving natural authenticity and life atmosphere, while careful lighting and composition elevate the artistic beauty, presenting a unique visual experience between realism and aestheticism.",
