          "alias": "单女露胸蓝牛仔商店微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before the refrigerated sushi display at a supermarket, completely topless, her long soft brown hair cascading over bare shoulders and curling at the ends, with a few stray strands framing her face. She wears only a pair of tight dark blue jeans, unbuttoned at the waist, her slender wrists exposed as she holds a transparent plastic sushi platter with both hands, the tray pressed gently against her bare chest. Her smile is warm and brilliant, eyes bright and genuine as they lock onto the lens. The sushi platter is perfectly arranged with slices of salmon, tuna, eel, shrimp, and crab stick, glossy under a thin film of wrap. Beside her, a metal shopping cart holds a white paper bowl with remnants of a grilled snack. The background is a cold-glass refrigerated case filled with assorted sushi and sashimi, with subtle reflections and blurred figures of distant customers and staff. Overhead fluorescent lights cast a cool, even illumination, creating a clean modern retail atmosphere. The composition places her slightly left of center, nearly filling two-thirds of the frame, with the cart handle and bowl leading the eye from the bottom left to her nude torso and the sushi. The color palette is cool whites and gray-blues, accented by the warm orange, pink, and green of the sushi. Soft natural shadows and a slight grain give the feel of a candid snapshot, with a shallow depth of field blurring the background. The camera angle is just below eye level, enhancing intimacy. The overall mood is warm, cheerful, and sensually domestic, capturing a moment of everyday satisfaction and desire.",
