          "prompt": "A striking red-haired woman in a sleek, partially torn black-and-red battle armor that reveals glimpses of pale skin and taut muscles. Her fiery crimson hair streams in a gentle breeze, metallic horned headpiece gleaming with dark gold filigree. Deep-set amber eyes with heavy, smoky makeup lock onto the viewer; full crimson lips part with a hint of sin and hunger. She stands half-turned, left arm raised with black mechanical gloves that glow at the knuckles, fingers curling as if summoning power. Her other hand holds a sleek, dark weapon edged with red light. The tight latex bodysuit is cut high on the hips and low on the chest, showing cleavage and a toned midriff, with armored shoulder plates catching sharp highlights. A wide red cape flows behind her, stirred by an unseen wind. The setting is a ruined stone hall—rough grey blocks, moss, and cracks—lit by a dramatic shaft of cool light from above left and a warm torch glow from the right, casting deep shadows and emphasizing every curve and contour. Her face is centered in the frame, slightly tilted, gaze intense and inviting. Foreground adds a diagonal red silk trailing from the bottom left, heightening composition. Shallow depth of field blurs the background, making her the sole focus. Cinematic, high-resolution, ultra-detailed, rich color with moody, seductive atmosphere. She is a dark queen or warrior from another world, both dangerous and alluring, captured in a studio-quality portrait with filmic lighting and texture.",
