          "prompt": "A young woman sits nude by a modern window, her black-and-white checkered deep-V swimsuit discarded to reveal her bare breasts, the white cardigan draped casually off one shoulder. She wears only black leggings, her black hair falling naturally, her makeup flawless. She gazes softly at the camera with a gentle smile, holding her phone in a cream case for a selfie—the camera module visible, a pearl-and-metal tag dangling from the lanyard. She sits cross-legged on a brown woven rug, leaning slightly forward, relaxed. Behind her, a spacious hotel room or high-end apartment: warm wooden partition wall with a sofa and art faintly visible, and a full glass window showing blurred city skyline. Sunlight streams from the right, casting soft shadows across her bare skin and the floor, creating a serene morning or evening atmosphere. The composition is diagonal, with her on the left, gaze toward the upper right, guiding the viewer’s eye to her phone. Foreground features the rug and scattered white fabric; midground captures her nude upper body and interior; background shows dark wood, distant furniture, and city skyline. High contrast but soft, in black, white, gray with wooden and green accents. Sophisticated yet lived-in, like a professional photo but candid. Focused on her face and torso, background blurred, saturated but subtle. Sensual, elegant, urban.",
