          "alias": "单女黑丝袜门媚态蹲注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches in a semi-squat, her long, jet-black hair flowing naturally with soft curls grazing her neck. Her delicate, refined face is fully illuminated, eyes gazing thoughtfully at the camera with a hint of lust, lips slightly parted, and her right hand gently touches her lips, fingertips painted pale pink. She wears a black sequined V-neck top, the sequins shimmering faintly silver under the light, but the V-neck is cut deep, revealing the curve of her cleavage and hinting at bare skin beneath. Below, sheer black stockings cling to her legs, the translucent fabric outlining every contour, matched with black-and-white polka-dot stiletto heels. Her left hand hangs naturally, a simple ring on her finger, beside a black suede bucket bag with gold hardware and a drawstring. The background is an indoor space with a light gray textured wall on the left and a pale brown wooden door on the right, the floor in matching gray tiles. The mid-shot composition places her slightly left of center, her body tilted for dynamic balance, head turned to meet the viewer's gaze. Lighting comes from the front-right, soft and even, highlighting her face, shoulders, and the subtle reflections on her sequined top. The atmosphere is quiet, elegant, and intensely sensual, fusing high-fashion photography with a raw, provocative moment. The color palette is dominated by black, gray, and brown, accented by white and gold, creating a luxurious yet intimate visual.",
