          "prompt": "A young woman sits casually on a vintage wooden carousel horse, completely nude except for a green knit beanie with gold \"nice\" lettering and red-checkered socks, her black hair flowing freely. She rests her cheek on one hand, gazing directly at the viewer with a lazy, confident smirk. Her legs are naturally bent, one foot on the carousel's stirrup. The carved wooden horse dominates the foreground, intricate grain and painted patterns visible. Behind her, a fairytale outdoor scene: a tall dark wood plank wall on the left, a red-and-white striped pillar on the right, and an orange-and-blue roof overhead. In the distance, stone buildings, hanging flower baskets, colorful blooms, and decorative stalls evoke a European theme park. Warm sunlight streams from the upper right, casting sharp shadows on the wood and softly illuminating her skin. The image has a slightly grainy, candid-camera feel, warm tones of orange, brown, green with pops of red and blue. A slight low angle emphasizes her presence, blending everyday life with artistic charm.",
