        {
          "id": "krea2-b74f4b3efa389cdbb649b075",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑毛衣商店冷淡站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in front of a vintage record store on a Korean street, her light brown hair tied in a low ponytail, a few strands falling naturally beside her face. She gazes calmly at the camera, lips slightly parted, expression carrying a lazy, distant allure. She is topless, wearing only an unbuttoned black long-sleeve knit cardigan, sleeves casually rolled to her elbows, revealing her slender arms and bare torso. Low-rise washed blue jeans sit loosely on her hips, accentuating her waist curve. A small black crossbody purse with a thin strap hangs from her shoulder, her outfit simple yet stylish. Her right hand lightly rests on a CD display rack, body slightly tilted, relaxed and graceful. In the foreground, shelves are filled with music CDs and cassettes, transparent plastic cases neatly arranged, some with Korean labels, alongside red and blue price tags reading \"500원 카세트테이프\" and \"1000원 음악 CD\". The midground shows the store's glass display cases stocked with second-hand vinyl records, tapes, and DVDs. Above, multiple signs hang: a black-white-red \"레코드판 카세트테이프\" banner, a yellow neon sign saying \"전속바늘 판매 전기면모기\", a blue-and-white vertical sign \"14K 금계 시계 매입 보당\". To the right, an old radio and electronic parts sit. The background blurs into distant street views with other shop signs and passerby silhouettes, softened to highlight the subject. Composition is centrally symmetrical, the woman slightly left of center, gaze leading to her face, with layered depth from foreground racks and background signs. Visual flow naturally converges on her through color contrast and text placement. Lighting is warm golden-hour, with interior store light casting a soft glow on her face and upper body, creating local highlights while the surroundings fall into shadow. Warm and cool tones blend, orange neon mixing with white light for rich color layers. The image has a film-grain texture, slight overexposure adds nostalgia, warm tones with moderate saturation, evoking a candid street-photography feel as if shot with an old camera, balancing life-like authenticity and artistic tension. The background is slightly blurred, focus sharp on the woman and nearby items, creating a realistic, story-filled moment.",
