          "id": "krea2-650febff15d3b58807a6a411",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服摄影棚媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a stunning black strapless gown stands against a vibrant red backdrop, her deep brown hair swept into an elegant low ponytail with loose strands framing her face. She poses slightly sideways, one hand resting on her hip, the other hanging naturally, exuding poised confidence. Her makeup is refined and subtle, with eyeliner accentuating deep, sultry eyes and soft lips hinting at a knowing smile as she locks gaze with the viewer. She wears a classic pearl necklace with a small cross pendant, simple pearl earrings, and a sparkling ring—adding a touch of opulence. The bodice of the dress is sheer, densely covered in tiny silver sequins forming vertical stripes that shimmer with movement, offering a glimpse of bare skin beneath. The skirt is a voluminous black tulle with cascading ruffles, resembling a blooming black rose. The entire scene is set against a bright red background with white artistic text (blurred but impactful), with the subject positioned slightly left, creating a stable focal point. Lighting comes from the front-upper angle, casting soft natural shadows across her face and picking up the sequins with a warm, glowing ambiance. The background is subtly blurred, enhancing the subject. The palette is dominated by red, black, and white, with creamy pearl tones and natural skin hues. This image exudes high-fashion red-carpet sensuality with a touch of film grain and natural noise, blending studio perfection with a candid, intimate moment.",
