          "alias": "单女黑外套媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits beside a green-and-black Kawasaki racing motorcycle, wearing a black leather jacket unzipped to reveal her bare cleavage, ripped jeans, and light brown hair. Her makeup is sultry, her eyes locked on the camera as she extends her arm in a first-person selfie pose, her hand holding a phone. The shot is high-angle, with her arm and part of her torso filling the lower left foreground, directing the gaze to her face and then to the bike. The motorcycle features carbon-fiber textures, red handlebars, and \"Kawasaki Racing team\" lettering on the tank. The background is a worn asphalt street with dirt, fallen leaves, and a dark van parked in the distance. Soft overcast dusk lighting casts cool tones, making the green tank pop. Subtle grain and low-light noise emulate a candid, amateur camera feel, while her skin glows with sensual detail. The scene captures a spontaneous, confident stallion vibe—racy yet relaxed, alive with youth and rebellious allure.",
