          "alias": "单女白衬衫椅上媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a transparent acrylic barstool, her white long-sleeve shirt left completely unbuttoned and hanging open, a scarlet sleeveless vest pushed aside to expose her bare chest and firm nipples, black loose trousers resting low on her hips. Her dark hair falls naturally, strands brushing her cheeks. She holds a silver-gray professional microphone near her open lips, eyes gazing upward with intense focus, left hand resting casually on her knee. Her simple earrings catch the light. The background: a pink glass brick wall on the left casting warm grid shadows, and a lush green plant wall dotted with yellow and white flowers on the right. The foreground is sharply focused on her torso and face, the transparent chair creating subtle reflections. Composition uses the rule of thirds, with her body positioned right, gaze leading to the upper left. Medium close-up, focal plane on her face and upper body, background softly blurred. Warm, soft key light from front-left, plus rim light on her hair edges. Slight film grain, subtle lens softness, as if shot on amateur film equipment during an intimate recording session. Overall mood: sensual, concentrated, narratively charged — the quiet moment before a breathy whisper into the mic.",
