          "alias": "单女露胸粉外套咖啡厅俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a medieval-style wooden restaurant, wearing only a black dragon-shaped hat with glowing green eyes and pointed ears (like Toothless from *How to Train Your Dragon*), completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, long hair falling naturally, clear features, a gentle gaze toward the camera, a playful smirk on her lips. Her right hand holds a dark drink in a transparent plastic cup with thick white foam and ice crystals on the cup wall, fingers long with light nail polish and a gold ring, pose elegant and relaxed. Foreground focuses on the drink and her hand, details of liquid texture. Midground centers on her nude upper body. Background warm, dimly lit, rough wooden ceiling beams, vintage wall lamps casting soft warm yellow light, blurred silhouettes of other customers dining and chatting, creating a lively yet intimate atmosphere. Right side shows an empty table with a pink thermos and brown coat, adding life. Composition symmetric, her centered, face and hat as visual focus, background slightly blurred, soft shadow gradients from top and side lighting enhancing depth and realism. Overall mood warm, cozy, story-rich, with everyday intimacy and slight fantasy elements. Color palette deep brown, black, warm yellow, with bright green eyes for contrast. Image quality close to amateur camera shot, realistic, slight noise and subtle motion blur, natural light distribution, preserving environment texture and natural state of the subject. A relaxed, playful moment, like a casual break after a theme park visit, full of youthful energy and fairy-tale romance, hinting at a brief escape into a fantasy world.",
