        {
          "id": "krea2-bf2ea0deb6394e260cb7f72f",
          "alias": "单女露胸忍者黑外套街道媚态坐张开双腿",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits astride a Kawasaki ZX-6R Ninja sportbike, her light brown hair tousled, her black leather jacket unzipped and hanging open, revealing her bare breasts with erect nipples. She wears ripped jeans, black riding boots, and black gloves; her body leans forward slightly, legs spread wide over the tank, one hand gripping the handlebar, the other resting on her thigh. She turns her head to the side, gazing off-camera with a cool, brooding, slightly sensual expression. The motorcycle is painted black, green, and red, with sleek lines, tall windscreen, sharp headlights, and \"ZX-6R\" and \"Ninja\" lettering clearly visible. The chrome exhaust reflects soft light. Low-angle shot looking up, making her and the bike appear powerful and dominant. Foreground is sharp; middle ground shows a city street with dark gray asphalt, a concrete curb, scattered fallen leaves, and a row of tropical plants (palms and broadleaf shrubs). Background: a modern residential building with gray stone and white trim, geometric roof eaves, metal fencing, lush trees, and a soft gray-white overcast sky. Diffuse light, even illumination, soft shadows, no strong contrast. Color palette dominated by black, green, gray, with warm hair tones and blue denim as subtle contrast. Diagonal composition draws the eye from lower left to upper right. Shallow depth of field blurs the background slightly. The atmosphere blends urban realism with motorcycle culture—mundane yet charged with a hint of freedom, speed, and raw sensuality. A moment captured with high-resolution, almost photographic detail, natural yet artful. Wide-angle lens adds slight distortion for tension; saturation moderately high, emphasizing green and black. The overall feel is cool, independent, and intensely personal, with an unapologetic erotic edge.",
