          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙街道困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a zebra crossing in a city street, her long reddish-brown hair loosely tied in a low ponytail with stray strands falling across her forehead. She gazes directly at the camera with a sleepy, contemplative expression, her head slightly tilted and lips gently parted, exuding an effortlessly sensual naturalness. Her delicate features are set in pale, flawless skin, cheeks flushed with a soft rosy glow. She wears a deep V-neck black polka dot dress that reveals a generous glimpse of her cleavage, the fabric clinging to her curves. Over it, she has a sheer black knit cardigan, long-sleeved and almost transparent, outlining the contours of her nipples and the shape of her torso beneath. A slim black leather shoulder bag hangs diagonally across her body, its round shape and metallic zipper and buckle catching the faint light. Large silver hoop earrings dangle from her ears, simple yet bold. The scene is a busy city street with the zebra crossing clearly visible, white stripes against gray asphalt. In the distance, a middle-aged man in a light blue shirt and a masked pedestrian in black cross the road. A white car with \"Mycar\" lettering is parked at the curb, next to a blue-and-white bus displaying yellow route number \"260\", passengers faintly seen through the windows. Farther back, a dense wall of green trees forms a deep, cool backdrop, the sky mostly obscured. The lighting is soft and even, overcast or early evening natural light, casting a warm, healthy glow on her skin while the rest of the scene remains cool-toned. The composition is a near close-up, with her body placed center-right, her head slightly tilted, eyes locked on the lens in a direct, inviting gaze. The foreground is sharp and richly detailed, while the middle ground (zebra crossing and pedestrians) and background blur smoothly with shallow depth of field. The overall color palette leans toward a vintage film look, with slight grain and subtle color shifts, evoking a casual street snapshot taken with an old analog camera. The atmosphere is one of urban leisure and quiet detachment—the bustle of the city surrounding her, but she remains calmly, sexually self-possessed. Her posture is natural and unposed, yet the sheer transparency and deep neckline make her body the undeniable focal point, the subtle tension of the scene suggesting ease and desirability.",
