        {
          "id": "krea2-73973f154f1ffac2b8654c71",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫办公室媚态坐脱衣（3）",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a gray fabric armchair, her white long-sleeve shirt unbuttoned to reveal a black lace bra beneath, the gray suit vest left open, black stockings and high heels emphasizing her legs. Her blue lanyard ID card hangs at her neck. Brown hair falls naturally with bangs, her gaze soft and inviting toward the camera, lips slightly parted with a subtle smirk. Hands rest on her thighs, legs crossed and angled to the side, posture relaxed yet alluring. The background is a soft pink wall, warm yellow light from the right rear creating a cozy, intimate indoor atmosphere. Light tiles on the floor, a white door frame visible on the left. Mid-shot composition, the subject slightly left of center, light from the upper right casting gentle shadows on her left side and under the chair, highlighting curves through the thin fabric. Color palette of pink, gray, white, and black, warm and harmonious. Focus is full body, evoking a candid office moment but with an intentionally seductive, unposed feel—like a secret snapshot in a break room. Standard lens, subtle film grain and natural noise, mimicking amateur photography for raw realism. The scene conveys quiet intimacy, focused attention, and a warm, flirtatious mood.",
