        {
          "id": "krea2-41515a1eaf8ba8b194f6fa42",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑连衣裙咖啡厅忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits alone in a black velvet booth at an upscale restaurant, her strapless black dress slipped down to expose her bare breasts, fair skin glowing in the warm light. Her dark hair is pulled into a low ponytail, her delicate profile turned toward the camera with a melancholic gaze. She rests her cheek against her hand, long fingers with nude nail polish, thin gold bangles and a simple ring at her wrist, small round earrings. Before her on the dark wooden table sits a white ceramic bowl with black speckled rim, filled with golden fried food and green herbs, beside silver cutlery and a red-lettered menu. The dim, luxurious restaurant has dark vertical striped walls, two abstract paintings—one warm-toned, one geometric grid—and a deep gray ceiling with subtle wave texture and recessed lighting. To the right, a wine rack with neatly arranged bottles and hanging stemware, behind it a bar counter with a blond server working, back to camera, curved metal structure above. A white spherical lamp on a dark base casts soft light across the table and her face. In midground, a glass vase holds dried branches with gray-green leaves and small round berries. Composition blends close-up and mid-to-far perspective, subject left of frame, gaze directing attention to her expression and bare upper body. Lighting from table lamp and warm yellow backlight from wine rack creates chiaroscuro, highlighting her skin and curves. Atmosphere intimate, romantic, nostalgic urban nightlife, cinematic and narrative. Colors black, gold, brown, gray with green accents. Slightly overhead angle simulating casual phone capture, soft realistic light, detailed textures of fine dining elegance.",
