        {
          "id": "krea2-eab737800663ce6202b6563e",
          "alias": "单女露胸金手套忧伤站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands beneath a blooming plum tree, her long black hair styled in twin tails with a white lace flower accessory, her blue eyes gazing back over her shoulder with a gentle, melancholic expression. She is topless, pallid skin exposed, a gold shoulder strap and black lace glove on one hand as she lightly touches the back of her neck. Her makeup is delicate with blue-purple eyeshadow and soft lips. The scene is filled with dense white plum blossoms, some petals falling, with rough bark and moss on the branches. Foreground branches with buds blur into the background, creating a deep depth of field. Soft natural light from upper right casts dappled highlights on her face, collarbone, and bare chest, with shadows on her cheek and neck. The palette is cold white, pale gray, light blue, with plum pink and brown wood. High detail in lace textures, hair shine, and petal layers. Shot with a wide aperture, sharp focus on her face, bokeh background and foreground, evoking a serene, poetic, melancholic Eastern aesthetic like a classical painting.",
