        {
          "id": "krea2-7ce16489b23a775ab2d0ed87",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫摄影棚戏谑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman in elaborate cosplay sits in a deep brown leather armchair, her silver-white hair flowing with black cat ears atop her head. Her gaze is sharp and intense, face painted with dramatic red lips and liner, a stylized anthropomorphic anime look. She wears only a white high-collared shirt, unbuttoned to reveal her bare chest, accented by a bright red tie and black suspenders. Her lower half is clad in high-gloss black leather pants tight across her hips, with rainbow reflective stripes along the sides. She wears black heels with red soles, one hand gloved in black leather, the other holding a silver can of drink. Her body leans back lazily, legs crossed, head tilted, eyes locked on the lens, exuding a cold, teasing allure. The foreground centers her slightly left, with smooth lines drawing the eye. The leather chair shows rivets, stitching, and worn creases. Behind, a pale gray wall holds a vintage black-framed sign reading “INTELLIGENCE EVERYWHERE DON'T MAKE THINGS BETTER OBEY YOUR THIRST GOOD TO THE LAST DROP” in white. Right side, wooden blinds cast parallel golden sunbeams, dust motes floating in the warm light, creating dramatic contrast. Mid-shot, slight overhead angle, focus on her face, neck, exposed chest, arm, drink, then legs and feet. The lighting is warm, side-lit, highlighting smooth skin and fabric folds. The scene blends retro, fashion, eroticism, and mystery, resembling a high-end studio shoot with cinematic depth yet a touch of amateur realism—subtle grain, natural shadows, true reflections. High clarity, rich detail, saturated colors, layered, visually striking with a narrative feel.",
