          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a wooden bench outside a café, wearing a cream silk halter top with vintage floral and geometric patterns – the necktie is loosened, slipping off one shoulder to reveal her bare breasts and toned midsection. She wears high-waisted light blue denim shorts with frayed uneven hems. Her right hand lifts her bangs, fingers delicate; left hand rests casually on the bench edge, a black woven bracelet around her wrist. Her gaze is direct, confident, slightly seductive, with flawless makeup, full lips, clear skin, defined facial features. Behind her, the café's glass window reflects the street, creating layered visuals. Inside left: stacked paper cups, a white coffee machine, warm yellow fairy lights. Outside: a typical Southeast Asian street with lush trees, parked cars and motorbikes, colorful red-and-yellow buildings, overcast sky with soft, even light filtering through leaves, casting dappled shadows. Medium shot, subject slightly left of center. Foreground: wooden bench and an iced drink in a clear cup labeled \"KIO\" with a straw, condensation on the cup. Background blurred to keep focus on the woman while preserving environment. Warm palette: cream, light blue, brown, with pops of orange and green. Slight film grain and analog texture. Korean text “쌀국수 매웠다” appears in the bottom right corner. The overall mood is calm, intimate, and subtly erotic – a quiet, story-filled moment of urban life with artistic and sensual detail.",
