          "id": "krea2-119aacb140d1a9ed1bf6dc6c",
          "alias": "单女全裸黑衬衫公园忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a weathered green park bench, her shoulder-length dark brown hair falling in soft waves, catching warm sunlight. She leans slightly to the side, right hand cupping her cheek, eyes lowered toward the lens with a pensive, almost melancholy gaze. Her lips are parted slightly, facial features delicate, skin fair and smooth. She wears a black-and-white checkered button-up shirt, unbuttoned halfway to reveal a lacy black bralette and the tops of her breasts, sleeves rolled to the elbows. The shirt is loosely tucked into a high-waisted olive-green soft-pleated midi skirt, the hem hiked up on one side to expose long, smooth thighs. Her legs are crossed, left over right, feet in black stiletto heeled sandals with tiny bow details, ankles elegantly curved, toes painted with pale nude polish. One hand rests on her thigh, fingers long and nails neatly shaped. She sits relaxed yet poised, torso slightly forward, head tilted, creating a languid but focused atmosphere. Beside her on the bench sits a cream canvas tote bag and a vintage Polaroid camera (black body with red flash button and silver-ringed lens). The background is a broad lawn dappled with sunlight, distant trees swaying, city skyline faintly visible. Sunlight streams from upper-left, casting long shadows and golden highlights. Mid-shot composition, woman centered-left, bench diagonally leading right. Warm tones of green, brown, black and soft yellow sunlight. The scene feels candid, nostalgic, with film-grain and subtle vignette. Her bare thighs catch the light, shirt suggestively open, skirt casually lifted — a quiet, intimate moment of youthful beauty and sensual ease.",
