        {
          "id": "krea2-b80f31def7b39cf866b7755d",
          "alias": "单女浴袍庭院忧伤坐出神",
          "prompt": "A young woman in exquisite Hanfu sits on a swing in a classical courtyard, her robe of cream-white with red trim and gold embroidery partially open, revealing the smooth curve of her bare shoulder and the swell of her breasts. The traditional cross-collar garment is loosely fastened, the intricate cloud-and-vine patterns framing her cleavage. A wide red-and-gold brocade belt cinches her waist, a round jade pendant and tassels dangling low. Her black hair is piled high in an ancient updo, adorned with silver hairpins tipped with pearls and gems, long silver earrings swaying as she gently moves. Her right hand grips the rough hemp rope of the swing; her left holds a translucent hexagonal paper lantern of pale blue with orange floral and bird motifs, topped with orange pom-poms and tassels, its warm glow illuminating her face and the exposed skin of her chest. Her features are delicate, eyes soft and melancholic, gazing into the distance with parted pink lips, skin luminous like moonlight. Behind her, hazy ancient architecture with wooden pillars and deep red drapes, flickering candlelight in the distance, dust motes drifting in the warm light. Medium shot, subject slightly left, swing ropes leading from top-left. Side-backlight from upper right casts soft rim light on her silhouette, accentuating the transparent fabric of her sleeves and the subtle shadow between her breasts. Warm palette of cream, vermillion, gold, and dark brown dominates, evoking a classical Eastern aesthetic, serene and poetic, like a flowing painting from a bygone era.",
