          "alias": "单女黑西装城市媚态脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges in the back seat of a luxury sedan, wearing a black blazer unzipped to reveal a black lacy bralette and high-waisted shorts that ride up to show the curve of her hips. Gold chain necklace and dangling earrings catch the glow of city lights; a black handbag with a gold logo rests on the seat beside her. Her hair is swept up in a sleek bun, makeup flawless, eyes locked on the camera with a sultry, self-assured smirk. The backdrop is a blur of neon signs and building silhouettes through the tinted window, creating a motion-blur effect. The dim cabin interior is all black leather and polished chrome, with a seatbelt draped loose across her thigh. Her legs are crossed, clad in sheer black stockings that glisten under the soft overhead light, one stiletto dangling from her toes. The composition centers her slightly left, body tilted forward to emphasize the shadow between her breasts and the arch of her back. Light streaks from passing cars mix with warm interior LEDs, casting dramatic chiaroscuro across her skin and the glossy black surfaces. Every detail—the leather grain, the metal clasp, the faint shine on her lips—is razor-sharp, while the city outside melts into abstract color. The mood is intimate yet fiercely confident, a stolen moment of nocturnal glamour that feels both candid and editorial, like a high-fashion shoot captured with a cinematic lens.",
