        {
          "id": "krea2-a43d9410c5827efacc1f55dc",
          "alias": "单女红旗袍竹林沉思倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman in a flowing red cheongsam leans sideways against an ancient mural, her black hair coiled in a graceful bun with loose strands falling by her ear, a small pearl earring hanging. The high-collared sleeveless dress hugs her curves tightly, fabric glossy with dark patterns. She wears a fluffy white fur stole draping softly over her shoulders. One hand holds an open classical folding fan with pale bamboo ribs and cream paper, edged with dark green stripes, a jade-green silk tassel swaying gently. The cheongsam is unbuttoned at the front, revealing the smooth curve of her breast and a hint of her nipple, the fabric parted just enough to expose her skin. She looks upward to the upper right, a contemplative, yearning gaze. Behind her, a large traditional Chinese mural shows ancient figures in long robes carrying objects, in ochre, earthy yellow, and pale green, brushstrokes rough and aged, the surface worn. In the blurred distance, warm yellow lantern light and architectural outlines create a soft, misty glow. The composition is mid-shot, the figure slightly tilted, forming an elegant S-curve, leading the eye toward the upper right. Light comes from the right, soft and warm, highlighting her face and shoulder, creating subtle shadows, with bright reflections on the white fur and deep red silk. The background lanterns cast orange light contrasting with the cool mural. Colors: red, white, brown, yellow, harmonious and classical. The scene feels artful and story-driven, as if a historic moment frozen. Camera: Canon 5D Mark IV, 85mm f/1.2L II USM lens, aperture f/1.8, ISO 200, shutter 1/125s, slightly low angle to emphasize elegance and grandeur. Rich details, layered focus, professional portrait quality with a touch of everyday realism. Natural lighting, balanced saturation, no over-sharpening, making the viewer feel present in this quiet, exotic moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
