        {
          "id": "krea2-64769ca0d25a4a76256b43a9",
          "alias": "单女露胸棕短裤城市冷淡坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on modern concrete stairs, topless, wearing only brown leather shorts and black mesh Mary Jane shoes. Her arms are crossed loosely over her chest, head tilted slightly, eyes locked on the camera with a cool, lazy expression. Light brown hair with neat bangs, clear facial features, natural makeup, red lips. Long legs stretch out—one hanging down, the other bent with foot lifted, highlighting smooth leg lines. The gray concrete stairs have subtle wear and warm yellow LED strip lights embedded along the edges, casting soft upward illumination on her legs and torso. Background: upper wall pure white, lower wall deep black, creating strong contrast. A large black geometric slanted block stands on the right, adding modern artistic depth. Medium shot, subject center-right, body slightly left, face straight to camera. Lighting from below gives gentle highlights on her legs and chest, with soft shadows above. Atmospheric blend of urban style, fashion, and casual life. Color palette: grays, white, black, accented by the colorful letters (now absent) and warm yellow light, creating cool-warm contrast. The image feels like a real phone snapshot with slight grain and natural color transitions, yet composed with professional lighting—capturing an independent, confident, slightly aloof young woman.",
