        {
          "id": "krea2-4c8cf17307af66f0d76b43ce",
          "alias": "单女露胸粉连衣裙椅上媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a red bench in a traditional Chinese pavilion, wearing a sleeveless pink bodycon dress with white lace trim, unzipped and pushed down to expose her bare breasts and pale cleavage. Her black blazer is shrugged off one shoulder, revealing smooth skin. She wears black high-heeled sandals with sparkling embellishments, her long legs crossed seductively, one foot dangling. Her left hand loosely holds a smartphone on her lap, while her right arm rests along the backrest. She leans slightly sideways, gazing directly at the camera with a soft, confident expression. Her long dark brown hair falls naturally over her shoulders. The pavilion features vivid red pillars and green carved lattice above. The background is dense green foliage, a pond with lotus leaves, and a damp grey stone floor reflecting soft light. The composition is off-center right, framed by the pavilion’s architecture, with natural sunlight casting gentle shadows. The overall tone is warm, intimate, and effortlessly captured — a candid NSFW moment blending classical Chinese beauty with modern sensuality.",
