        {
          "id": "krea2-9ef3c07927947aac661a39f0",
          "alias": "单女金旗袍桌边媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A stunning East Asian woman in a form-fitting gold tiger-striped qipao sits in a classical Chinese interior, the dress’s short sleeves and mandarin collar framing her elegant shoulders, with the top buttons undone to reveal a deep cleavage and the smooth curve of her bare collarbone, the metallic fabric glossy and taut over her curves, a white knot button nestled at the low neckline. Her hands rest on her knees, fingers lightly grazing the exposed skin of her thigh, as she leans back slightly, chin lifted, eyes half-lidded and looking directly at the viewer with a sultry, inviting gaze, a subtle smirk on her glossy lips. Her hair is swept up in a high bun with loose strands cascading down, green jade drop earrings swinging gently. Behind her, a dark wooden bed frame holds vivid red silk sheets, crumpled and glossy, with a red-and-black folding fan slanted on a side table. Warm amber light from the right casts soft highlights across her face, the glossy qipao, and the bare skin of her arms and chest, with deep shadows pooling in the folds of the red fabric and wooden lattice window. Mid-shot composition, she is slightly off-center right, with the foreground emphasizing her body and the undone neckline, the midground showcasing the textured dress and the bed, and the background softly blurred. The scene feels like a high-end 8K photograph, with fine detail in the golden tiger stripes, skin pores, and the sheen of the red silk, a subtle film grain adding realism, while the interplay of light and shadow creates a timeless, sensual atmosphere of restrained luxury and seductive elegance.",
