        {
          "id": "krea2-cfc4f218e9dc7bb3923a08d1",
          "alias": "单女黑内衣街道媚态蹲拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman squats on the asphalt of an outdoor sports court, wearing only a tight black sports bra that hugs her curves and extremely short black shorts with three white stripes down the sides, white knee-high socks with two black bands at the top, and red suede platform sneakers with white lettering and off-white laces. She leans down to tie her shoelaces, hands gently holding the laces, her head lifted slightly to meet the camera with a playful, half-lidded gaze. A red baseball cap with a white \"R\" sits low on her forehead, and large silver over-ear headphones cover her ears, her long wavy brown hair spilling from under the cap over her bare shoulders. Her makeup is precise—sharp eyeliner and soft coral lips. Her body tilts forward, right leg bent, left leg extended, knee nearly touching the ground, creating an open, inviting pose. Behind her, a green diamond-pattern chain-link fence stretches into the blurred distance, with faint grass and building outlines visible. A dark green canvas sports bag rests on the right, slightly tilted. Warm afternoon sunlight from above casts intricate fence shadows across the ground, highlight on her skin—her face, arms, and legs glowing with soft chiaroscuro. The palette is dominated by black, white, red, and green, contrasty yet harmonious. Medium shot composition, subject left of center, the focus on her intimate action and suggestive eye contact. The scene feels like a captured moment during a sports break, blending youthful energy, street-style fashion, and a touch of sensual everyday intimacy. High-quality, detailed, with natural light and a modern nostalgic vibe.",
