          "prompt": "A young woman lies on her side on a bed with blue-and-white gingham sheets. She has voluminous long curly brown hair with blunt bangs, wearing a blue-and-white striped sailor cap with white piping. She is fully nude from the waist up, her bare breasts exposed, a white sleeveless top discarded nearby. She wears tight blue-and-white striped leggings with lacing at the thighs. Her right hand supports her chin, while her left hand holds an ornate gold-rimmed porcelain bowl filled with bright red cherries. Her nails are painted with black-and-white checkerboard patterns. Her gaze is direct, expression slightly languid and contemplative. The setting is a vintage bedroom: behind her is a carved wooden headboard with cream cushions and rumpled white bedding. Above the headboard hangs an ornate gold-framed mirror reflecting a corner of the room. Blue floral curtains frame a window on the right, letting in soft natural light that casts gentle side lighting across her face and body, creating delicate highlights and shadows on her cheeks, arms, and hair. To the left sits a decorative fireplace mantel with gold candlesticks, ceramic vases, and small figurines; inside the fireplace is a black wrought-iron fire screen. The scene is bathed in warm, soft illumination. Composition is a close-up, off-center with the woman slightly left of frame, a subtle high-angle perspective. The foreground includes the sheets and her body; midground is the woman and the cherry bowl; background contains the fireplace, mirror, and curtains. The visual flow starts from her eyes, follows the curve of her body to the cherry bowl, then expands outward through the decorative details. The overall palette is dominated by blue and white, accented by red cherries and gold trimmings, creating a harmonious and layered color scheme. The image has a cinematic, high-quality photographic feel with a nostalgic romanticism blended with modern sensuality.",
