          "alias": "单女粉外套城市忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on an outdoor metal railing, her deep brown shoulder-length hair and straight bangs framing a clear-eyed, slightly melancholic gaze that stares directly at the viewer. Her lips are parted in a natural, relaxed expression, and her right hand lifts gently, fingers brushing against her hair near her forehead, pose elegant and casual. She wears a fluffy pink-brown long-pile coat, open and unbuttoned, revealing a pure white round-neck T-shirt that is hiked up slightly, exposing a strip of toned midriff and the lower curve of her breasts. Over her left shoulder, the coat slips off, baring one shoulder. Below, a black velvet multi-layer pleated mini skirt flares in an A-line, the fabric smooth and shiny, cinched at the waist to emphasize her slender silhouette. Her legs are sheathed in black over-the-knee boots that hug her thighs, and around her neck sits a slim black leather choker, simple and bold. A small black bag with metal hardware hangs diagonally from her shoulder. The setting is an urban outdoor scene, with blurred high-rise buildings in the distance, a bright light blue sky, and warm sunlight streaming from the upper right, casting soft highlights and shadows across her face and body—the left side falling into gentle shadow, enhancing depth. The ground is gray concrete, the railing a reddish-brown metal with slight wear. In the midground, rows of blue benches stand, and behind them, pink blossoms of cherry trees add a spring touch. Composition is centered, with the woman dominating the frame, the railing cutting across the bottom foreground, and the background softly blurred. The overall mood is bright and warm, with a realistic, snapshot aesthetic, but the subtle exposure and bared skin lend a sensual, NSFW character.",
