        {
          "id": "krea2-f9db9c2a2a1d07d34f1714e6",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑手套广场媚态站立比耶",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless, her bare skin glowing under soft light, wearing only a glossy black leather beret tilted at a daring angle, her loose waves cascading over her shoulders. She is adorned with layered gold bead necklaces that drape across her collarbone, her nipples subtly visible through the gaps. She wears long black mesh gloves, left hand raised in a playful V-sign, right hand holding a sleek black square handbag with a metallic logo. Her lower body is clad in sheer black stockings and stiletto heels with sparkling metal buckles, one leg bent with toes pointed, the other straight, creating an elegant S-curve. The background is a light beige wall with vertical stripe panels, a soft gray carpet, and a dark baseboard; a hanging black garment with colorful sequins is barely visible on the left. The lighting is warm and intimate, coming from front-left, casting gentle shadows. The composition is centered, with her occupying the right focal point, exuding a blend of vintage glamour and casual sensuality, as if captured spontaneously in a high-end boutique or private dressing room.",
