        {
          "id": "krea2-b84c6ea9fb0229fdcf2a275e",
          "alias": "单女半褪红旗袍竹林媚态倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A voluptuous East Asian woman in a form-fitting red silk cheongsam with subtle brocade pattern, high mandarin collar hugging her neck gracefully, sleeveless cut revealing her toned shoulders and arms, deep crimson fabric gleaming with satin sheen under warm light. Her jet-black hair is swept up in an elegant low bun, a few stray tendrils framing her face, a single round pearl stud earring catching the glow. Her lips are a soft rose pink, eyes half-lidded with a sultry, inviting smile as she glances over her shoulder at the viewer. She holds a fully opened bamboo folding fan with pale green leaf-patterned paper, the natural bamboo ribs fanning out, a dark green silk tassel dangling from the handle. A fluffy white faux-fur stole drapes loosely over her left arm, the plush texture contrasting with the sleek cheongsam, partially slipping off to reveal the curve of her bare shoulder and the hint of a slender collarbone. Her body leans back slightly against an old wooden pillar, the background softly blurred into warm amber and coral tones, indistinct shapes of traditional rafters and a hanging lantern casting gentle golden bokeh circles. The composition follows the rule of thirds, her figure placed slightly left of center, right side open for visual balance. Shot with a large aperture, shallow depth of field, focus sharp on her face and upper torso, soft highlights across her cheek and neck from a front-right light source, with rich, smooth shadows. The overall atmosphere is warm, elegant, and subtly intimate—a fusion of classical Oriental aesthetic and modern sensual allure. The palette is dominated by red, white, and warm gold, evoking a quiet, slightly mysterious night scene in a traditional courtyard or tea house, with a faint suggestion of sandalwood and tea lingering in the air. The image carries a film-like texture, moderate color saturation with layered detail, a touch of grain and subtle vignetting at the edges, lending a candid yet artful portrait feel. Her expression is naturally relaxed, confident without being posed, exuding a restrained but potent Eastern femininity. The visual lines lead from her gaze and the curve of her body out of frame, inviting the viewer to imagine the story behind the moment—a poetic instant of stillness and desire.",
