        {
          "id": "krea2-c84efac5ddb485dfc2a6786f",
          "alias": "单女红外套摄影棚媚态倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman leans against a pure white wall in an elegant, tension-filled pose. She wears a layered wine-red outfit: a tight crop top with metal ring details, a plush faux-fur wine-red jacket, and a high-waisted wine-red leather miniskirt with a red-and-black plaid tassel sash draping from one side. Her long hair falls naturally with blunt bangs, adorned with a matching wine-red bow. She slightly turns her body, left leg bent and lifted, wearing glossy wine-red patent leather pointed-toe thigh-high stiletto boots. Her right hand gently touches her chin, eyes staring directly at the camera with a lazy, seductive expression. A multi-layered silver chain necklace adds a punk edge. In the foreground left, a pale blue circular geometric furniture piece reflects soft light. The background is minimalist white wall and floor, creating clean spatial division. Low-angle upward shot emphasizes her elongated figure. She occupies the right side of the frame, body stretching diagonally for dynamic balance. Soft, even natural light from front-left creates subtle chiaroscuro on her face, arms, and legs. The wine-red fabrics show rich color layers and gloss, especially the boots' highlights and fur texture. The atmosphere blends modern fashion with private intimacy. Dominant wine-red contrasts sharply with white background, creating refined tension. The image resembles professional studio portraiture but retains amateur-camera realism—slight grain, natural depth of field, true light reflections—as if captured mid-shot with a medium-format or high-end mirrorless camera under indoor lighting. No over-editing, maintaining authentic texture while achieving artistic and everyday beauty.",
