        {
          "id": "krea2-37482efb13616e0128adb8ac",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙桌边微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a sheer black lace cami dress with white lace trim, plunging neckline, thin straps, tight corset waist, and ruffled hem, gothic-lolita style. She wears her deep brown hair in pigtails with blunt bangs, soft strands falling naturally. Her clear eyes gaze directly at the lens, lips curved in a sweet, playful half-smile. She holds a white plush teddy bear with black star patterns. The bear's limbs are soft and fluffy. The dress has slipped slightly, revealing the upper curves of her breasts, with the thin straps barely holding. She sits on a white fluffy rug over light brown wooden floor. Background: a mint-green wall with two framed prints—left: white frame, pink background, crossed red heart lollipops; right: white frame, yellow background, pink letters \"BLA BLA BLA\". A small white round table corner visible bottom right. Soft front-left lighting illuminates her face and upper body, creating natural shadow transitions. Centered composition, slightly left of center. High saturation colors: teal, black, white, pink, yellow. Slight film grain and noise for realism. Warm, sweet, youthful atmosphere with a hint of playful seduction. The focus is sharp on her face and the teddy bear, with mild background blur. Visual flow from her eyes to the bear to the wall art.",
