          "prompt": "A topless female warrior with long black-and-emerald gradient hair sits gracefully on an ornate sofa in a lavish room. Her forehead is adorned with a gold geometric tiara, and her ears feature sharp horn-like ornaments. Her eyes are deep and expressive, her face delicately sculpted with a mysterious makeup, lips pale pink. She wears only a deep blue tight bodysuit unzipped to expose her bare breasts, with intricate gold and teal metal pauldrons on her shoulders and chest, the shoulder armor studded with glowing gemstones. Her arms are covered in black long gloves ending in sharp metallic claws, gold rings at the wrists. A wide gold belt with teal sashes and runic charms hangs at her waist. Her legs are sheathed in translucent pale green stockings, with gold straps at the ankles. She sits sideways on the plush lace-draped sofa, one hand resting on her thigh, the other raised to her chest, body slightly tilted, exuding confident poise. In the foreground, a gold lace tablecloth covers a classical tray holding gold tea set and candlestick, with antique vessels and incense burners beside it. The middle ground focuses on the figure. The background wall is hung with blue-and-white Persian-style rugs, with goblets, crystal bottles, and decorative candlesticks on the floor. Warm yellow light falls from the upper left, creating soft chiaroscuro on her skin and armor, evoking a retro-luxurious and slightly mysterious mood. Central composition, the figure is right of center, looking directly at the viewer, drawing attention to her facial expression and costume details. Rich lighting layers, warm tones with cool accents, enhance depth and visual impact. The overall style blends Eastern fantasy with Western court aesthetics, like a priestess or sorceress from an ancient kingdom. The image is fine-textured, richly saturated yet harmonious, with cinematic photographic quality and surreal beauty.",
