        {
          "id": "krea2-c42a5be8e3af1175b219249d",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫商店害羞坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a beige fabric armchair printed with vintage English lettering, her jet-black hair flowing smoothly with blunt bangs, porcelain skin flawless, eyes calm and direct to the camera, lips painted natural orange-red, makeup subtle yet refined. She wears a black-and-white horizontal striped turtleneck knit sweater with clear woven texture and cut-out details on the sleeves, adding breathability and layered intrigue. Below, sheer black stockings encase her crossed legs, knees slightly bent, one hand gently cradling her left knee while the other rests loosely, creating an elegant yet slightly shy pose. Her feet are clad in glossy black pointed-toe high heels that contrast with the stockings. The armchair’s back and seat are densely printed with words like \"Ceylan\", \"Mandarin\", \"The\", \"Provence\", \"Barjeeling\", and a crest reading \"Est 1926\", evoking a nostalgic tea shop or spice shop theme. A dark gray square cushion sits on the right side of the sofa, adding contrast and comfort. The background is a blue-and-white checkered tile wall with crisp lines, giving a bright, clean homey feel. A light wooden floor is visible at the edge. Light comes from above and in front, soft and even, casting no harsh shadows, revealing every detail of face and clothing. The overall lighting is warm and natural. The composition is medium shot, the woman slightly off-center to the right, body turned slightly, face straight toward the lens, engaging the viewer. The foreground shows the armrest and part of the seat, the midground has the woman and the cushion, the background includes the wall and a hint of ceiling, creating clear depth. The palette is dominated by black, white, and gray, accented by the orange-red lips and blue checkered wall, harmonious and muted. The scene exudes a quiet, tender, slightly intimate everyday atmosphere, as if captured by a domestic camera, with subtle film grain and low saturation. Details are rich but not cluttered. The visual focus is on the woman, conveying a calm, contemplative, slightly melancholic aesthetic—a story of solitude. The style blends realistic photography with fashion, balancing everyday authenticity with artistic taste.",
