        {
          "id": "krea2-6cd3152d6a92634c0cee844b",
          "alias": "单女黑外套花园媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands inside a traditional Chinese pavilion, wearing a short black faux-fur jacket left unzipped to reveal her bare chest and a pale pink lace mini skirt that rides high on her thighs, paired with black thigh-high stockings and silver stiletto heels. Her long hair falls naturally, one hand gently touching her hair while the other rests on her hip, her pose both elegant and provocative. She gazes directly at the camera with a calm, slightly distant expression. The red wooden pillars and green carved railings of the pavilion frame her, with intricate painted patterns on the ceiling. Behind her, dense green trees and a lake reflect leafy shadows, with lotus leaves floating on the water. Dappled sunlight filters through the leaves, casting soft, contrasting patches of light and shadow on her body and the ground. The composition uses the pavilion’s framework as a natural frame, with close-up focus on her figure, the red bench and pillars in the foreground, and layers of foliage and water in the background. The lighting is soft and natural, with warm, vivid tones blending traditional Chinese elegance with modern sensuality. The image has a realistic, amateur-camera feel, with moderate color saturation, slight film grain, and natural lens distortion, capturing a candid, documentary aesthetic in a serene summer garden moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
