        {
          "id": "krea2-a0e4f1c40aab6603c282f519",
          "alias": "单女全裸白T恤床困倦躺拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies sideways on soft white sheets, her body slightly curled with legs bent and knees raised high in a relaxed, lazy pose. She wears a simple white camisole top and sheer nude stockings with delicate stripe patterns and subtle lace trims, the fabric hugging her smooth legs. Her brown short hair is tousled on the pillow, a few strands falling over her forehead. Her hands are folded beside her face, fingers slightly curled, nails painted dark, and a thin metal bracelet adorns her wrist. Her expression shows a hint of shyness and pleasure, lips slightly upturned, eyes half-closed as if lost in a lazy morning or quiet afternoon nap. The background is filled with white bedding, natural wrinkles, soft texture, creating a warm, intimate home atmosphere. A gray pillow corner is faintly visible in the distance, adding a cool contrast to the warm tones. The composition is a top-down angle, with the subject slightly right of center, forming visual focus. Diagonal folds of the bedsheet guide the eye toward her body, enhancing spatial depth. The foreground highlights her bent legs and stockings; midground shows her torso and face; background is bedding and pillow, with a mix of sharp and soft focus to emphasize the subject. Soft natural light from the left, possibly morning sun through curtains, evenly falls on her skin and clothes, creating subtle shadow transitions and strong three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is warm, private, and full of life, with a palette of white, cream, and skin tones, accented by light pink stripes of stockings and dark nail polish. The image feels like a candid moment captured by an old film camera, slightly out of focus, grainy edges, slightly overexposed, but retaining original warmth and emotion, conveying unpolished natural beauty and intimacy. The composition is tight, close to life, evoking a quiet, comfortable, slightly ambiguous private moment. Details are rich, from the stockings' texture to the sheets' wrinkles, creating an artistic yet everyday realistic visual effect.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
