        {
          "id": "krea2-512a528fc54fbc548f6d62a7",
          "alias": "单女短裙忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully in a classical Chinese chamber, wearing an exquisite white embroidered hanfu made of sheer, translucent silk that clings to her curves, the layered skirt pooling like soft clouds around her. Two wide red silk ribbons cinch her waist, starkly contrasting the pale fabric, while the open collar reveals her bare neck and the swell of her breasts, the red high-necked inner robe pushed aside to expose her creamy skin. Her glossy black hair is pinned in an elegant ancient updo adorned with silver hairpins and tassels, each embedded with sparkling pearls and gems that dangle near her ears, catching the light. Her clear eyes hold a melancholic, thoughtful gaze, staring straight ahead as if lost in a distant memory. She wears a subtle red lip tint, her hands folded delicately on her lap, fingers slender and poised. The composition centers her in the foreground, dominating the frame to emphasize facial features and sensual details. In the midground, soft interior décor—a wooden screen, carved furniture, and warm drapes—blurs into a gentle backdrop. Light falls from above, casting natural shadows across her face and body, illuminating the sheer fabric and the revealed skin, creating a warm, hazy atmosphere. The color palette of white, red, and gold contrasts with dark hair and background, evoking classical Eastern aesthetics with a realistic, photographic quality—a timeless, poetic yet explicit portrait that captures both vulnerability and desire.",
