        {
          "id": "krea2-3470a6f63e1766536d32af80",
          "alias": "男女露胸造型师粉连衣裙车厢站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young female model stands topless, her pale pink pleated strapless mini dress slipping down to expose her breasts, the fabric sheer and translucent, a high-slit chiffon train flowing behind. She holds a black Chanel compact mirror, staring intently at her reflection. Her brown hair is braided into a side ponytail, gold hoop earrings, flawless makeup, pale pink lips, fair glowing skin. In the foreground, a translucent pink veil floats, held by a crew member. To her left, a male stylist with tattooed arms and a black T-shirt, baggy jeans, and a camera bag brushes her hair, his wrist adorned with colorful bracelets and metal bangles. To her right, another male stylist in a gray undershirt and black vest, a green work lanyard around his neck, uses a makeup brush to apply powder to her cheek, leaning in close. Behind them, a large wooden display board covered in colorful fashion sketches – blue, white, red dresses. The shot is mid-range, centered slightly left, with the two male staff symmetrically framing the model. Lighting from above and front creates soft shadows, highlighting her body and the sheer fabric. The scene has a warm, professional studio feel with slight film grain and natural noise, as if captured by an amateur device. The camera angle is slightly overhead, giving a voyeuristic perspective of the backstage preparation. The composition is full but uncluttered, with visual flow from the foreground veil to the model to the sketches in the background, creating depth. The atmosphere blends high fashion with candid intimacy.",
