        {
          "id": "krea2-cec025d9b75f6deb87c7d59d",
          "alias": "单女透视米外套广场媚态坐跳舞",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a deep black leather armchair, wearing a beige faux fur short jacket left open to bare her breasts, black sheer stockings, and black square-toe heels with double rows of shiny metal buckles. She crosses her legs elegantly, right hand resting on the chair's arm, left hand casually at her thigh. Her long wavy hair falls over her shoulders, face clear, eyes locked on the camera with a lazy, confident smirk. The scene is sensual and intimate: her bare skin contrasts with the soft fur, the stockings glisten in the warm light, and the metal heels catch a gentle reflection. Foreground highlights her legs and feet, the fine texture of the stockings visible. Midground: the black leather armchair with simple wooden frame and plush cushion, a black leather handbag beside it. Background: dark vertical blinds with warm orange light filtering through, creating striped shadows. To the left, a black outdoor heater glows with dancing flames inside a glass tube. To the right, a wooden display stand with rough texture holds a red ceramic pot of dried light-brown flowers, an open book, and a small red box; the stand bears worn \"COFFEE\" lettering. Concrete grey floor with fine scratches. Composition centers on the woman, symmetry balanced by heater and display. Visual flow from her face down her legs to the upper right where the flowers and text draw the eye. Warm lighting from the heater and backend lamps cast soft shadows and layered highlights across her skin and the room. The overall aesthetic blends modern city style with a cozy cafe vibe — a casually captured moment full of detail, color harmony, and erotic tension.",
