          "alias": "单女白背心摄影棚媚态脱衣",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman strikes a powerfully dynamic pose, clad in a futuristic combat outfit—a white sleeveless top unzipped to reveal her bare chest and black high-waisted tight leather pants with a liquid-metal sheen. Black harness straps and gold accents wrap her waist and thighs; black shoulder armor and dark wrist guards complete the look. She stretches her right leg forward, left leg bent for support, body angled diagonally. Her head tilts back slightly, gazing directly at the camera with cool confidence, lips parted, makeup flawless. Her left hand holds a red-and-black cape or coat high overhead, fabric flowing in an arc, adding motion. Studio white background, clean and stark. Lighting from above-front, soft and even, with natural shadows accentuating her curves and leather texture. Low-angle shot elongates her silhouette, emphasizing power and presence. Composition uses diagonals and curves to guide the eye from her boots up to her face. Color palette is black and white with red and gold accents, creating a cold, elegant atmosphere. The image feels like a high-end fashion editorial, crisp and sensual, blending sci-fi and eroticism.",
