          "prompt": "A topless young woman sits in a vintage wooden chair at an antique desk, her white puff-sleeve dress slid down to her waist, baring her full breasts with perked nipples. She wears a white lace polka-dot hairband, her dark hair cascading freely. She reads a worn green book, her hands gently gripping its pages, a gold watch on her left wrist. Her legs are crossed, clad in white knit stockings. On the desk, a yellow-shaded lamp casts warm light, surrounded by an old typewriter, scattered books, a glass jar of pens, and a QR code sticker. Behind, tall green bookshelves brim with books, punctuated by lush plants and a lemon tree bearing bright yellow fruits. Soft illumination from the lamp and a window creates gentle shadows. Colors of white, green, and brown are accented by vivid lemon yellow. The scene feels intimate and nostalgic, like a quiet afternoon captured on film grain, with a sensual, relaxed aura.",
