        {
          "id": "krea2-e0acfc9eb68fdf416e86ac66",
          "alias": "单女透视外套办公室媚态站立持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman in a deep burgundy wool overcoat stands by a floor-to-ceiling office window, her coat wide open, revealing a barely-there pink sequin scarf tied as a massive bow across her chest, her nipples subtly visible beneath the sheer fabric. She wears a pink mesh headband, tousled golden curls spilling over bare shoulders, heavy makeup accentuating her sultry eyes and full lips. Her right hand holds a vintage red rotary phone receiver to her ear, the coiled cord snaking down to the matching base on the desk. Her left hand hangs loosely at her side. The coat’s lapels are adorned with black geometric diamond-encrusted buttons. Black sheer stockings and stiletto heels elongate her legs, body slightly angled with a languid, commanding pose. The backdrop is a blurred city skyline under a gray-blue sky, reflections of indoor lights and her silhouette in the glass. In the foreground, a pristine white desk holds an old-fashioned white mechanical typewriter with paper loaded, and a silver flip phone. The composition is a mid-shot from a slightly low angle, with the subject right of center, head slightly above eye level, exuding dominance. Soft key light from the left front sculpts her features and the sheen of her outfit, casting shadows that enhance depth. The color palette contrasts deep red, hot pink, black, white, and silver, blending retro nostalgia with high-fashion sensuality, as if a still from a luxury editorial or film noir. The atmosphere is warm yet coldly urban, with sharp detail and shallow depth of field from a 50mm prime lens, giving a polished commercial photography look.",
