        {
          "id": "krea2-a8f823d0f23750b19ca5fb77",
          "alias": "单女露胸米风衣城市媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in the corner of a beige leather sofa, her body slightly turned toward the camera. She holds a white smartphone in her right hand, fingers lightly touching the screen, her gaze direct, calm, and focused. She has long hair with straight bangs, fair delicate skin, natural yet polished makeup, and refined features. She wears a loose beige trench coat, fully open, revealing she is completely topless underneath—her bare breasts exposed, nipples visible. She also wears black stockings, and her legs are crossed elegantly, one knee over the other, showcasing her smooth thighs and the sheer fabric. Her left hand rests casually on her thigh; a simple silver bracelet wraps her wrist, and a thin chain necklace with a small pendant hangs at her collarbone. The overall look is chic and urban, emphasizing her confident nudity. The background is a warm interior: a softly textured beige wall on the left, dark brown wood paneling on the right reflecting subtle light, a small round white side table behind the sofa, and marble floor tiles with gray-white veining. Soft golden light streams in from the upper left, illuminating her face, bare torso, and arms, casting gentle shadows on the sofa and walls. The medium-shot composition places her slightly right of center, with the sofa's curved lines guiding the eye toward her. Her smartphone and hand become key focal points. The image has a shallow depth of field, with background blur and a cinematic, high-end feel. The warm beige and yellow tones contrast with the black stockings and dark wood, creating a harmonious yet intimate atmosphere. It captures a quiet, private moment of modern urban independence and seductive composure.",
