          "alias": "单女黑西装城市媚态蹲侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches low in a sensual, powerful pose on a modern indoor hallway floor, wearing a short black velvet blazer over a deep V-neck black sheer bodysuit that clings to her curves, paired with black fishnet stockings and glossy patent leather stiletto heels. A delicate ankle chain glints at her slender ankle. Her left hand slides slowly over her thigh, while her right rests on the polished floor, her body arched with confident allure. Her long jet-black hair cascades in soft waves, slight strands brushing her cheek. Her makeup is sharp—clear eyeliner, full lips—and she wears gold tassel earrings. She is positioned slightly left of center, body angled toward the camera, head tilted up, eyes locked forward with a cool, seductive gaze that dares you to look. The low-angle shot emphasizes her height and dominance, with the hallway's straight lines creating leading lines to her figure. Warm amber light from ceiling LED strips casts soft highlights on her skin and the dark sheer fabric, revealing the outline of her body beneath the translucent top. The floor is light brown wood with subtle reflections, the walls are matte dark gray tiles, and abstract black-and-white art hangs behind her. The background fades into deep shadows, with a distant door and green indicator light adding narrative depth. The overall mood is luxuriously intimate, a nocturnal urban vibe blending high-fashion editorial with raw sexuality. Slight film grain and natural color rendering mimic a real candid capture.",
