          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市媚态坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a stylish boutique fitting room, wearing a form-fitting black long-sleeve bodycon dress with delicate wrinkle texture and subtle sheen, hugging her curves—but she has slipped one shoulder strap down, baring her breast, nipple visible, her expression subtly seductive. She has long straight black hair falling naturally, glistening under soft light. She is turned sideways to the mirror, holding a white smartphone in her right hand for a selfie, phone camera visible. She looks down at the screen, left hand gently touching her chin, pose elegant and focused, with a hint of contemplation and confidence. Her long legs are toned, right leg bent, left leg straight, wearing black pointed-toe stiletto heels with metal studs and multiple strap details, thin stable heels creating visual tension. Several pairs of shoes scattered on the floor: gray sneakers and another pair of black heels, contrasting materials and styles. Floor is beige plush carpet blending into gray irregular stone tiles. Background shows neatly arranged wooden shelves with various bags, accessories, and clothing in black, white, gray with some bright accents. Walls are light gray speckled texture reflecting soft indoor light. Ceiling spotlights emit warm white light, illuminating the space with chiaroscuro effects. The figure is positioned slightly right of center, body angled, directing viewer's attention to her exposed breast, face, and phone. Composition is close-up with environmental storytelling, creating an intimate private shopping atmosphere. Overall color palette black, white, gray with warm yellow lighting, delivering a high-end modern urban vibe. Image has realistic everyday snapshot quality, as if taken by a regular camera or phone, rich details, clear layers, natural light transitions. It conveys contemporary youth's pursuit of self-expression and identity, with slight noise and color saturation control to enhance realism and immersion.",
