        {
          "id": "krea2-19b157152c9a9ddf3e5c945a",
          "alias": "单女半褪绿T恤书店媚态坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A red-haired woman sits in a dark fabric armchair, wearing only a tight green tank top (pulled down to bare her breasts) and a plaid mini skirt, her legs crossed, showcasing intricate cream fishnet stockings with ruched ankle details—a casual yet explicitly sensual outfit. She holds an open book titled \"KAYBOLUŞ\" by Ken Grimwood, the pages legible, the cover featuring an abstract black brain shape. The book covers most of her face, revealing only her forehead, nose bridge, and part of her cheek. Her hair is tied high in a ponytail, cascading naturally over her shoulders, slightly wavy with a rich maple hue glistening warmly under the indoor lighting. She sits in a modern interior space—a bright café or bookstore with wooden floors reflecting soft light, a glass partition showing a street scene with faint moving figures outside. Exposed metal pipes and industrial-style lamps form complex ceiling lines; a circular LED light hangs above emitting cool white light contrasting with warm ambient tones. The composition is a low-angle shot, the woman positioned center-right, body slightly tilted, relaxed yet tense. The foreground shows her legs and the book, midground her upper body and the chair, background the blurred indoor setting and outdoor view. Visual flow starts from the book, follows her body lines into the deep space. Lighting is warm yellow—natural window light interwoven with interior lamps—creating a quiet, contemplative, slightly intimate atmosphere. The image is richly textured, deeply colored, highly realistic like a professional photograph, yet retains everyday details and authenticity. The lens captures a dynamic moment of her reading, focusing on her absorbed expression and languid pose. The scene exudes an artistic, modern urban vibe; subtle vignetting emphasizes the central subject. Color saturation is moderate, contrast high, highlighting the delicate skin texture and fabric details. The overall aesthetic balances art and everyday realism with an explicit NSFW edge.",
