          "alias": "单女露胸粉短裤小巷冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an outdoor industrial back alley, her long pink hair braided to one side and draped over her bare chest. Her skin is fair and smooth, features delicate yet sharp, with a calm, slightly lazy gaze locked directly into the lens. She is completely topless, her breasts exposed, wearing only a pair of high-waisted pink shorts that cling to her toned legs. A cream canvas bag hangs from one shoulder, and she holds a coffee cup with a black lid in her right hand, her left hand resting on the brim of a pink baseball cap on her head. She wears white thick-soled sneakers and white socks, giving off a youthful, effortlessly cool vibe. She stands in the foreground, slightly right of center, with the camera tilted up at a low angle to emphasize her form. Behind her, two corrugated metal walls—silver-gray on the left, dark brown on the right—show rust and wear, with a \"STAFF ONLY\" sign and a black iron door. The ground is rough concrete, scattered with black trash bags and a blue handcart. Distant buildings and a sliver of sky are visible in the background. Natural daylight streams from above left, casting soft shadows that glide across her skin and clothes. The palette contrasts cool grays with warm pinks, creating a realistic urban street feel. The scene captures a casual, everyday moment, like a snapshot from a lazy weekday afternoon. Shot with an 85mm portrait lens, the image has slight grain and natural color, mimicking a phone or small camera's quality. The composition guides the eye from her face to the coffee cup, then to the background details, enriching the narrative. The light and shadow are rich, with natural edges, balancing modern urban alienation with intimate personal warmth—striking and emotionally resonant.",
