          "prompt": "A young woman sits by a window, her black hair pinned up in a high bun with loose strands falling across her forehead, wearing an unbuttoned blue-and-white plaid dress that slips off one shoulder, revealing a bare breast and a deep blue bow tied at the shoulder. Her arms are crossed on the rough wooden sill, her head resting on them as she gazes softly into the lens, her expression calm and slightly pensive. Her skin is fair and smooth, delicate features with youthful innocence and serenity. To the left on the sill stands a transparent glass filled with vivid blue liquid, a fresh lemon slice perched on the rim, the glass sparkling with soft reflections. In the foreground, small yellow wildflowers emerge from below, their slender stems gently curving, petals in delicate bloom, some out of focus creating depth and a natural casual feel. The background is blurred green foliage and light window frame, with hints of dense trees and dappled sunlight outside. The shallow depth of field focuses on her face and hands. The composition centers her slightly right, guiding the eye from the flowers up to her face and then to the drink. Light falls from the left, wrapping her profile and arms in soft natural glow with subtle shadows. The overall palette is cool—teal, pale blue, and white—evoking a quiet, refreshing summer afternoon. The image feels like film photography with slight grain and desaturated color, resembling a casual snapshot from a daily camera, emphasizing real light and environmental detail, avoiding over-polish. It captures a still, lazy, slightly melancholic literary moment, as if time has paused, blending inner world with outer surroundings.",
