        {
          "id": "krea2-3ccbc7d8ad988afbfc1cb249",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙摄影棚媚态坐托腮",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a white wooden chair, leaning slightly forward, chin resting on her hands as she cups her face, head lightly supported by her arms. Her gaze meets the camera with a lazy, seductive allure. Her long brown hair is tied in a high ponytail with a deep red satin ribbon bow, strands falling naturally, a few wispy bangs framing her face and adding a playful touch, glossy and smooth. She wears a deep red shiny satin slip dress with a low-cut neckline, the material glossy like patent leather, reflecting light with high-end texture. The dress is pulled taut, accentuating her cleavage and curves, hinting at bare skin beneath. Paired with white fishnet thigh-high stockings, the net pattern clearly visible from ankles to thighs, sheer and lightweight. On her feet, deep red patent Mary Jane platform shoes with white accents and thick black heels, retro and visually striking. The overall outfit blends Japanese kawaii and vintage fashion. The subject is positioned slightly left of center, filling most of the frame. The foreground focuses on her legs and shoes, with rich details and strong contrast between the stockings and shoes. The midground shows her upper body and pose, with a tight composition emphasizing the figure. The background is a plain gray gradient wall, soft tones, no distractions, creating a minimalist studio atmosphere. Lighting comes from front-right, soft and even, illuminating her face and body with natural shadow transitions, highlighting skin texture and clothing shine, casting faint shadows on the floor and chair for depth. The overall lighting is quiet, elegant, and slightly mysterious. Color palette dominated by red, white, and gray, contrasting yet harmonious. Close-up composition, focusing on her expression and clothing details, guiding attention to her face and legs. Through body language and gaze, she conveys a gentle yet confident mood. The image is finely textured, as if shot by a professional camera with high resolution and realistic details, while retaining slight film grain and natural noise to mimic the realism of casual amateur photography. The overall image is artistic, blending fashion and life, evoking an intimate and refined personal expression, suitable for magazine covers or fashion photo sets, presenting a unique aesthetic that is both modern and retro.",
