          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a sensual pose, wearing a revealing black and gold baroque bodysuit that is unzipped low to expose her full bare breasts, with intricate golden embroidery and crystal embellishments around her chest and waist. She sports tall black rabbit ears with ornate gold tips, a black lace choker with metal fittings, and a black leather cuff with silver studs on her right wrist. Her left hand gently strokes one rabbit ear, fingers extended elegantly, while her body is slightly turned to emphasize her curves. Her right arm hangs down, holding a large fan-like decoration of white feathers and sheer tulle, edged with tiny beads and sequins, swaying softly. She wears transparent plastic platform heels with black soles, her ankles clearly visible. The floor is gray worn concrete with an industrial feel, and the background is a silver-gray wall with fine glitter, reflecting soft stage lights that create a starry effect. Top spotlights cast bright halos and subtle shadows, with main light from the front-left illuminating her face clearly. She looks directly at the camera with a confident, mysterious smile, lips slightly parted. Composition is centered, with the feather prop spreading outward to frame her, focusing attention on her exposed upper body and facial expression. The cold-toned background contrasts with warm gold accents, creating a dramatic, artistic, and dreamy scene suitable for a high-end nightclub or fashion show. The image has rich detail, realistic textures, and a natural amateur-camera feel with slight noise, soft depth of field, and authentic light reflections, balancing professional quality with intimate, life-like immediacy.",
