          "alias": "单女旗袍地牢困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a Chinese-style interior, wearing a high-collared, short-sleeved celadon silk cheongsam embroidered with delicate butterflies and floral motifs in blue-green, gold, and purple, the fabric glossy and tight, perfectly tracing her slender curves; the front placket is partially unbuttoned, exposing the upper curve of her breasts and a glimpse of her bare skin. She sits sideways with legs crossed, one foot dangling in light-colored high-heeled sandals with yellow straps, her dark long hair slightly tousled with straight bangs, eyes directly meeting the camera with a languid, contemplative expression, red lipstick, flawless makeup, fair and smooth skin. In the foreground, a dark wooden tabletop reflects soft ambient light; a metal round tray with green trim holds a small heating device. The midground shows her body from waist to thigh, the cheongsam’s high slit revealing her bare thigh up to the hip. Low-angle shot looking up, making her appear tall and commanding. Background left: a wooden window frame with bright natural light filtering in, casting dappled shadows, with hints of green plants on the windowsill. Right: an intricately carved wooden screen with geometric cutouts emitting a faint green glow. Far right: an old electric fan, metal cage and blades faintly visible. Overall palette: celadon, dark brown, warm yellow, strong warm-cool contrast. Light from front-left creates a soft chiaroscuro, one side of her face and body lit, the other in gentle shadow, enhancing dimensionality. Atmosphere: serene, elegant, nostalgic, like a quiet private afternoon moment. Composition center-left, with depth of field blurring the background, visual line from her gaze down to her bare leg and back, creating a closed loop. Image texture fine, blending studio portraiture with everyday life, embodying Eastern aesthetics and modern sensuality.",
