          "id": "krea2-88061cad9dd07877a17d2754",
          "alias": "单女模特黑束身衣摄影棚媚态拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young female cosplayer in a highly detailed blue-white-black magical-themed outfit, with pale blonde hair and blunt bangs, deep purple eyes, flawless layered makeup, parted lips in a seductive, knowing smirk. She wears an enormous wide-brimmed blue hat with intricate white geometric patterns and silver trim, the crown flaring like wings. Her top is a black off-shoulder corset with a deep plunging neckline, revealing ample cleavage; a heart-shaped cutout and keyhole detail directly over the chest expose the curves of her breasts, with just a hint of nipple at the edges. The waist is cinched by a multi-tiered blue-white ruffled miniskirt so short it barely covers her hips, the layers edged with lace and fringe, revealing the tops of black thigh-high stockings and garter straps. Puffy lantern sleeves in black satin with white sheer mesh lining, blue floral accents at the cuffs. She holds a towering crystal staff in her left hand—spiral-twisted, transparent, with flowing blue energy inside and a giant rainbow gem at the top emitting prismatic sparks. Her right hand gracefully touches the brim of the hat, her body angled slightly, facing the camera with a direct, provocative gaze. She wears black knee-high boots with leather straps and metal buckles hugging her thighs. The style blends gothic lolita with dark fantasy, every seam and fabric texture emphasized. Background: a dim, cavernous interior—abandoned industrial or futuristic—gray floor tiles, blurred metal framework and pipes, a few warm yellow light spots in the distance, creating strong depth of field. Centered composition, the figure perfectly symmetrical, with dramatic front-left key lighting from cold white LEDs and blue-violet fill lights, casting deep blue-purple shadows and intense highlights on the costume and staff. The overall mood is mysteriously erotic and dreamlike, with cinematic sharpness, rich color saturation, and photorealistic detail, as if captured by a high-end camera in a controlled studio setup, merging hyperrealism with fantasy.",
