          "alias": "单女露胸短裙忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless in the corner of a dim, vintage laundromat, leaning against a worn blue industrial washing machine. Her plaid skirt is slightly hiked, revealing black stockings and a hint of thigh, her black sneakers resting on the concrete floor. She holds a vivid blue scarf with her right hand, draping it across her bare chest to partially conceal one breast, while her left hand rests on her knee. Her short hair falls to her shoulders, bangs brushing her forehead, and she looks directly at the camera with a pensive, melancholy gaze. Soft side light from the right caresses her skin, highlighting the texture of the scarf and the folds of the skirt, casting gentle shadows. The background features a blue-and-white washing machine with Japanese labels, a speckled cement floor, and a slightly dusty wall. The composition is close and intimate, her legs in the foreground, her torso centered, the machine and wall to the left. The atmosphere is quiet, nostalgic, and sensual, with a grainy film-like quality that enhances the mood of solitude and desire.",
