        {
          "id": "krea2-42a13d7bf504a26fb06beaf6",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣车厢沉思坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a modern train carriage, her long ash-blonde hair with light gray highlights and straight bangs, gazing out the window with a focused, contemplative expression, her face slightly turned to reveal soft profile lines. She wears a loose, unbuttoned beige knit cardigan with black ribbed details at the shoulders and cuffs, two bold yellow horizontal stripes across the chest and sleeves, left open to expose a black lace bralette that barely cups her full breasts. Below, she sports tight blue denim shorts and white sneakers, legs crossed naturally on the seat. Her left hand holds a purple smartphone case with a heart-shaped charm and a string of pale purple beads, while her right fingers lightly tap the screen, as if browsing or snapping a photo of the passing scenery. Beside her rest a small lavender backpack and a beige canvas tote. The carriage interior is modern minimalist, with dark leather seats and metallic window frames. Through the window, open suburban landscape unfolds: green lawns, low-rise housing, electricity towers, and a white landmark structure reading “THE WINDOW ICON OF KARAWANG.” Clear sky, thin clouds, warm sunlight streams through the window, casting soft light-and-shadow transitions on her face and clothes. The overall lighting is bright and even, with a warm palette of beige, lavender, blue, and green, creating a peaceful, everyday travel atmosphere. Composition is mid-shot, figure placed on the right, visual center, with ample space on the left showing the outdoor scenery, forming a dynamic contrast and spatial extension. Focus on the moment of her interacting with the phone, background slightly blurred to emphasize the subject. The image has a realistic photographic feel, as if taken with a professional camera in natural light, delivering high resolution, fine texture, and rich color layers. It exudes youthful urban vitality while conveying a leisurely, relaxed longing for the horizon.",
