          "alias": "单女黑泳装户外媚态跪注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman kneels on a green inflatable paddleboard, wearing a sleek black high-neck one-piece swimsuit with daring side cutouts that reveal her bare hips and ribcage, the fabric clinging wetly to her toned curves. A bold gold pendant rests between her breasts, drawing attention to their shape. Her long, wavy hair falls naturally, makeup impeccable, eyes locked on the viewer with a confident, slightly lazy gaze. She holds a black paddle shaft in her right hand, left hand resting on the board's edge, a silver bracelet and ring catching the light. The paddleboard is a mix of mint green and cream with graffiti-style logos and textured grip lines, floating on still water that reflects warm orange and lavender tones from a massive circular LED screen behind her. The screen displays a sunset lake scene with golden ripples and distant bird silhouettes, while above, a metallic grid ceiling casts soft amber light, creating a halo of backlighting on her silhouette. The composition is centered, the board and her legs extending forward, the perspective drawing the eye deep into the scene. The lighting is a blend of overhead artificial glow and ambient screen light, sculpting her body with fine rim light, leaving subtle reflections on the wet board and water. The mood fuses futuristic tech with natural poetry, a sensual, hyper-real portrait that feels both artificially staged and effortlessly outdoor. Color palette is black, green, orange, and violet, saturated yet smooth, with high detail and rich contrast, evoking a luxury fashion shoot or digital art piece with an intimate, erotic undertone.",
