          "alias": "单女金礼服城市困倦倚靠",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a stunning gold sequin gown bends gracefully over a table laden with exquisite pastries. Her low-cut neckline reveals the swell of her breasts, her black velvet opera glove slides down slightly as her fingers reach for a pink macaron. Her long black wavy hair cascades forward, eyes half-lidded, glossy red lips parted in a languid, seductive expression. Sparkling earrings and a choker catch the light. The foreground is a lavish spread of macarons, petit fours, cupcakes, glazed donuts, and fruit-topped tarts arranged on white ceramic, green, and pink plates. The middle ground shows her torso leaning in, the gold fabric clinging, the black glove contrasting sharply with the gleaming dress. Behind her, floor-to-ceiling windows frame a sprawling cityscape at dusk—skyscrapers in soft haze, sky tinged with lavender. Natural side light sculpts her silhouette and highlights the sequins, while dark shadows deepen the folds of the glove and gown. The composition is a stable triangle: her face on the left, desserts occupying the right and center, leading the eye to the distant city. Warm golds, pinks, and whites dominate with black and steel-blue accents. The image feels like a high-fashion editorial shot with a large-aperture lens—sharp subject, creamy bokeh, yet retaining an intimate, candid realism. Elegant, decadent, and charged with sensual allure.",
