          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the center of an indoor space, her soft brown hair cascading naturally, catching the gentle light with a subtle sheen. Her face is sharply defined, eyes meeting the lens with a calm, inviting gaze, lips curved in a faint, knowing smile—elegant and utterly relaxed. She wears a simple white sleeveless dress that hugs her torso before flaring into an A-line skirt with soft folds and a matte sheen, the fabric clinging to her curves. Beneath, she has paired it with light blue, slightly distressed jeans, cuffed at the ankles, and smooth brown pointed-toe boots. Her hands rest just below her belly, fingers long and adorned with delicate rings, a thin bracelet glinting at her wrist—a casual yet deliberate sense of style. The dress is unbuttoned at the back, revealing a hint of bare skin, and she tugs at the hem, baring a strip of her midriff and the top of her lace underwear visible above the jeans. The scene is bathed in warm, even light from overhead, casting soft shadows. To the left, a pale wooden door with a black metal handle and an electronic lock, a grid of black-and-white fashion photos taped to it. Beside the door hangs a silver-gray shopping bag with \"KILO\" in bold black lettering. The wall is covered in small beige and light gray mosaic tiles, reflecting the light. On the right, a stainless steel counter holds an open laptop glowing blue, scattered with water bottles and folders. Exposed white pipes and cables above add an industrial touch. The composition is centered and balanced, with the woman as the focal point, her pose natural yet provocative, her gaze both intimate and direct. The slight lens distortion and grain suggest a real-life snapshot, adding authenticity to this sensual, artfully candid moment.",
