          "id": "krea2-9c5d75bf791dc01bf70e3043",
          "alias": "单女拳击长裤镜前微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the center of a boxing ring, wearing a tight gray high-neck sleeveless crop top that highlights her long neck and toned shoulders. She pairs it with dark camo cargo pants, a wide black leather belt with metal studs cinching her waist, and black boxing gloves hanging loosely at her sides. Her relaxed stance radiates professional confidence and focus. Her brown wavy hair is casually tied back, with a few strands falling across her forehead. Her makeup is subtle yet refined, her eyes locked intently on the viewer, lips slightly parted with a small, knowing smile. The composition is a mid-shot with her centered and taking up two-thirds of the frame. The background is an indoor boxing gym: white ropes clearly marking the ring, several punching bags hanging behind her—one bright yellow with a leopard print stands out—and rows of fluorescent lights on the ceiling casting cool white illumination, creating soft shadows on the floor and walls. The lighting comes from above and slightly left, giving her face full front light with gentle side/back shadowing for depth. The backdrop is slightly blurred yet retains details like mirror reflections, pipes, and distant blurred figures, adding realism. The color palette is gray, black, green, with yellow as an accent. The overall image is sleek, athletic, sexy, and subtly sensual, as if captured with a high-quality camera yet retaining a natural, spontaneous feel.",
