          "id": "krea2-bd2f7be1b1f80a33221c19de",
          "alias": "单女全裸橙浴袍门媚态站立",
          "prompt": "A young woman in exquisite Hanfu stands before an antique wooden door frame, her orange-yellow velvet outer robe hanging open to reveal her bare chest and shoulders, the white fur-collared skirt clinging low on her hips. She wears only the skirt, her skin exposed, a string of warm pearls resting against her cleavage. Her hair is swept up in a high bun, adorned with silver hairpins and bead ornaments, a small floral decoration on her forehead. Her makeup is elegant, red lips parted, eyes clear and playful. She tilts her body, right hand raising a V sign while her left hand gently touches her bare stomach. The background is a traditional Chinese wooden structure, dark brown frame with natural grain, green carved lattice above, a cream gauze curtain with blue-black brocade edge swaying on the left. Soft natural light diffuses across her skin and the rich fabric, highlighting her curves. The composition is centered, the doorway framing her nude upper body. Warm tones of orange, cream, dark brown, with green accents. Slight film grain and natural depth-of-field, as if shot with an old camera, giving an intimate, amateur realism. The atmosphere is poetic, sensual, and timeless, full of oriental aesthetic warmth.",
