        {
          "id": "krea2-da9b275254779b57b144fe0e",
          "alias": "单女制服霓虹夜景媚态倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A pink-haired female officer in a futuristic sci-fi uniform, her slim-framed glasses perched on a sharp, focused face—cold, determined, with a hint of icy sensuality. Her short pink hair glows under blue-violet neon lights, edges sharply defined by cool light, bangs neatly covering her forehead with a few strands falling naturally, adding motion. She wears a white high-collared shirt, unbuttoned to reveal her bare chest and firm nipples, the crisp collar and black cuffs contrasting against her pale skin. Over it, a dark green long coat with complex mechanical structures and metal clasps across the shoulders and chest, a round pocket watch dangling from one side. A wide black leather corset cinches her waist, studded with metal rings and chains, emphasizing her combat-ready silhouette. Below, a short black skirt rides high, paired with sheer black stockings and stiletto heels, legs long and powerful. She leans forward in a low-angle shot, right leg lifted and bent, ankle secured in a metal brace. Her right hand grips a sci-fi pistol—dark grey with teal circuit patterns and glowing elements, the stock a mass of intricate machinery. The background is a dim industrial ruin or underground space, a massive red metal beam cutting diagonally across the frame, guiding the eye. Blue and purple neon strips cast cold light, highlighting her body with strong contrast, the ground reflecting faintly to create a damp, shadowy atmosphere. In the distance, blurred pipes, metal structures, and scattered debris add depth and realism. The low-angle composition emphasizes her commanding presence, face slightly tilted, eyes locked on the viewer, creating intense emotional connection. Foreground dominated by her body and weapon, midground her legs and pose, background the complex neon-lit industrial environment. Lighting mainly from side and above neon tubes, blue and purple mingling, casting delicate highlights and shadows on her skin, clothing, and metal parts, enhancing texture and three-dimensionality. The overall vibe is cold, mysterious cyberpunk, blending gritty amateur-camera roughness with artistic light control and color—a liminal aesthetic between virtual and real, as if captured from a future city's midnight street, with powerful visual impact and narrative tension.",
