        {
          "id": "krea2-1f0b3be46580dd40371b4adf",
          "alias": "单女露胸白连衣裙废墟戏谑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits sideways on a modern metal-framed rattan chair, wearing a sheer off-white long-sleeve dress that hangs open, revealing her bare breasts and black lace high-waist suspender panties beneath. The dress hem is lifted, exposing her long thighs. Her right leg is bent with foot resting on the seat, left leg dangling, barefoot against the floor. She tilts her head back, dark brown curly hair spilling over shoulders; her intense gaze meets the camera through heavy eyeliner, lips slightly parted in a teasing, mysterious expression. One hand grips the chair back, a simple silver bracelet at her wrist. In the foreground, a pair of black patent leather stilettos lies discarded on the concrete floor. The background is a gray-white wall with peeling paint and industrial wear, a slightly dusty concrete floor with scratches. Soft natural light from the left casts gentle shadows, creating a warm, nostalgic atmosphere. Colors are muted: off-white, gray, black. The composition leads the eye from the shoes up along her body to her face. The scene feels like a spontaneous fashion shoot in an abandoned warehouse, with subtle film grain and slight overexposure, capturing a moment of poised, confident sensuality.",
