          "alias": "单女黑长裤街道媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the rear seat of a matte gray Yamaha Grande scooter, her fluffy short pink hair and blunt bangs framing a confident, sultry face. Her makeup is sharp, eyes locked on the camera with a cool, defiant stare. She wears a black high-waist velvet pants, but her torso is bare—only an unzipped red-black-gray racing jacket with white stripes and \"PRO JAPAN\" lettering hangs open, revealing full breasts and a silver zipper detail at the shoulders. A thin chain necklace with a small tag rests on her collarbone. Her left hand lightly grips the scooter's handlebar, right hand resting on her hip. Behind her, towering stacks of blue and brown shipping containers (ZIM logo, star patterns) create a harsh industrial backdrop. Overcast sky, gray-white clouds, soft diffused light. Low-angle shot emphasizing her dominance, the scooter's front end filling the lower frame. Streamlined bike details visible—tail light, emblem, seat, dash. Cool blue-gray tones with vibrant pops of the red jacket and pink hair. A mix of street fashion and brutalist aesthetic, high contrast, cinematic quality. Her pose is relaxed yet powerful, exuding raw independence and untamed freedom.",
