          "id": "krea2-dc5151760f9b8aec320a28f1",
          "alias": "单女半褪连衣裙图书馆冷淡坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a red circular lift stool in the center of a library aisle, wearing a white strapless, rucked dress with lace trim that is slightly pulled down to reveal the tops of her breasts and her bare shoulders. She is turned slightly to the side, her long hair falling naturally to partially cover one side of her face, her gaze focused intently on the book in her hands. She holds an open book, her posture relaxed and elegant, with her right leg bent and lifted, the toe of her white high-heeled sandal resting on the bottom shelf of the right bookcase. Her legs are smooth and well-shaped. The composition places her in the left foreground, occupying about one-third of the frame, shot from a low angle looking up, creating a strong sense of depth and visual extension. Tall wooden bookshelves extend symmetrically into the distance on both sides, their colorful spines—red, blue, yellow, green—arranged in orderly rows, some texts legible. In the midground, the corridor of shelves recedes, with light streaming in from a window at the far end, forming a bright backlit area. The sky is a pale blue, the window frame clearly visible, and the contrast between light and shadow is strong. The ceiling is a striped metal grille reflecting soft cool white light. The floor is light polished tile, smooth and reflective, showing the mirrored images of the figure and bookshelves. The overall environment is quiet and solemn, filled with an atmosphere of knowledge and academia. The visual guide starts from the foreground figure and follows the aisle of shelves, eventually converging at the bright window. Lighting is natural, bright but not harsh, with soft backlight illuminating the woman's face and body, creating subtle shadow transitions. The background is tastefully blurred to emphasize the subject while retaining enough detail. The color palette is dominated by white, beige, wood tones, and the colorful accents of the books. The style is both artistic and realistic, like a high-quality photo taken with a professional camera, with a slight film grain and delicate texture. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field precisely controlled, composition balanced and dynamic, capturing a poetic moment of quiet reading while blending a touch of modern urban ease and spontaneity. The image is rich in detail, from the folds of the dress to the texture of the pages, the material and sheen of the bookshelves, all highly realistic. The overall mood is serene and warm, as if one can hear the rustle of turning pages and feel the calm and beauty within the sea of knowledge.",
