          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙椅上困倦坐招手",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a dark wooden chair, wearing a black off-shoulder long dress that has slipped lower to expose one full breast, the fabric draping elegantly off her shoulder. The dress is long-sleeved with a loose, flowing skirt pooling on the floor in soft folds. Her long legs are clad in sheer black stockings, one leg slightly bent, the other extended with toes pointed lightly on the ground—a poised yet languid pose. Her jet-black hair is straight with subtle waves at the ends, a neat fringe across her forehead, catching the blue light with a faint sheen. She looks directly at the camera with a calm, clear gaze, lips slightly parted, her expression neutral with a hint of distant allure. The foreground shows her figure and part of the polished light marble floor, reflecting ambient light. Midground includes the chair and a curved small table behind her, pale blue to match the wall. On the table, a bouquet of white roses in a clear glass vase, lush petals and fresh green leaves, beside two upright decorative frames—one beige with vertical stripes, the other a light gray gradient. To the right, a small silver-framed mirror reflects part of the scene. The composition is centered with the woman slightly left, body turned a little, face straight to camera. The background is a huge blue arched wall with delicate, cloud-like textures, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. Soft cold blue light from above and sides casts gentle shadows, with rim lighting on her face and body, enhancing depth. The floor and table reflect blue halos. The mood is still and ethereal, with a refined, cool, slightly melancholic aesthetic. The dominant blue contrasts with her black dress and white flowers. Every detail—skin texture, fabric folds, flower shapes—is hyper-realistic, like a high-end fashion editorial, yet retains a candid, poetic moment.",
