ith sunlight overpowering the dim interior, forming high-contrast highlights and lens flares. The mood is dreamy and melancholic, with the bright exterior contrasting the dark interior, emphasizing a sense of isolation and sacredness. The color palette is dominated by white, cream, and gold, with small accents of black and red. The image texture is fine, with cinematic visual impact, rich details, and layered depth, capturing a fleeting moment of eternal stillness. It feels like a climax scene from a classical ballet, both ethereal and mysterious, with a touch of tragedy. The lighting mimics a professional studio setup blended with natural environment realism—as if shot with a DSLR in natural light, medium focal length, shallow depth of field, slight background blur, and sharp focus on the subject. The overall atmosphere is serene and solemn, resembling a meticulously painted oil painting that merges realism with fantasy.",
