          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a weathered wooden bench in an outdoor courtyard, looking back over her shoulder, black hair cascading naturally. She wears a white sleeveless tight dress that is unbuttoned and slipping off her shoulders, exposing her bare breasts, paired with a white ruffled miniskirt and white thigh-high socks, and bright red patent leather bow flats. Her pose is elegant yet languid—right hand brushing hair from her forehead, left hand resting on her thigh. To the left, a clean white iron chair contrasts with the dark bench, where an open book rests with slightly curled pages. Lush layered greenery fills the background, with hints of orange building walls, air-conditioning units, power lines, and blurred pedestrians in the distance, creating an urban oasis. Natural sunlight streams from above and right, casting warm, soft shadows on her skin and the leaves, with the stone arch of a nearby doorway framing the scene. The composition leads the eye from the chair, across the bench and her figure, then through the plants to the street beyond. The atmosphere is calm, nostalgic, with a slight film grain and muted greens, whites, and browns, punctuated by the vivid red shoes. High-resolution, photorealistic, rich in texture and story.",
