        {
          "id": "krea2-7c0f49571018da91506c8893",
          "alias": "单女黑旗袍窗边媚态站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a revealing black cheongsam with vivid floral patterns, low-cut neckline and high slit exposing her thigh, sleeveless and form-fitting, accentuating her elegant curves. She stands sideways by a wooden window frame, right hand holding an open book, fingers slender with neatly trimmed nails, a simple metal bracelet on her wrist. Her hair is styled in a high bun with a few loose strands falling over her forehead, adorned with two red and pink flowers matching the dress pattern. Her head is slightly tilted, gaze lowered, lips slightly parted, expression a mix of serene contemplation and subtle sensuality. The background features a large wooden window opening onto a classic Jiangnan waterside view—lush green trees, reflections in clear water, white-walled buildings with dark tiles and upturned eaves on the opposite bank. On the windowsill, a white mesh lantern glows softly, beside a ceramic vase with purple flowers and green plants. Medium shot composition, woman on the right as main focus, left side open to the scenic view, creating a contrast between interior and exterior. Warm sunlight streams from the left, softly illuminating her facial features and arm, casting gentle shadows and highlighting the silk texture of the cheongsam, which clings to her body, revealing the curves of her breasts and waist. The skin glows with a soft halo, enhancing three-dimensionality. The distant scenery is slightly blurred, shallow depth of field focusing on her. The river sparkles, blue-green tones contrasting with the warm yellow indoor light. The overall palette harmonizes classical Oriental aesthetics with a modern, intimate atmosphere, as if captured in a tearoom or riverside inn on a lazy afternoon. The image mimics a real film photograph with subtle grain, slight overexposure at edges, and mild lens distortion, giving a candid, amateur-shot warmth and authenticity. The composition follows the rule of thirds; her eye line leads leftward toward the window view, creating visual flow. A quiet, reading-filled moment, time suspended, full of narrative and emotional tension.",
