          "alias": "单女露胸白衬衫纯色背景忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits before a pure white background, her jet-black hair with a subtle grey-blue sheen cascading over bare shoulders and falling across her face. She is topless, her full breasts exposed, nipples erect, skin flawless and luminous under soft overhead lighting. Her delicate features are sharply defined – slender elegant brows, warm earthy eye makeup, eyes lined and bright with a hint of sadness, mouth slightly open with glossy pale pink lips. She wears a white bubble-sleeve blouse unbuttoned and hanging open, a large bow undone at the neck, with a green houndstooth pencil skirt sitting low on her hips. Her pose is relaxed: body leaning slightly forward, hands resting on the floor, fingers long and manicured, one hand brushing suggestively along her inner thigh. A pair of small green tassel earrings dangles from her ears, swaying as she moves. In the foreground, scattered flowers – a blooming pale yellow rose, pink and orange buds – lie on the clean white floor. The composition is vertical, centered slightly left, focus on her face and torso. The lighting is soft and even, no harsh shadows, highlighting every curve and detail of skin and fabric. The atmosphere is serene, intimate, sensual, with a palette of white, green, and warm floral accents, creating a high-end editorial portrait that blends elegance with raw desire.",
