          "alias": "单女灰毛衣咖啡厅困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at an outdoor café or restaurant at night, her long black hair partly tied in a low ponytail with straight bangs across her forehead, pale smooth skin, delicate and refined features, her clear gentle eyes gazing directly at the camera, lips slightly parted in a relaxed, slightly languid expression. Her right hand loosely holds a tall glass of red cocktail filled with ice, a slice of orange, a slice of lemon, a few mint leaves, and a strawberry; a transparent straw slants inside, the glass beaded with condensation, showing the drink’s cold freshness. She wears a gray-and-white striped knit long-sleeve top, unbuttoned and hanging open, revealing a black lace bralette (or bare chest), a thin gold cross necklace resting against her collarbone and cleavage. Her left hand supports her chin, pose elegant and casual, her body slightly turned to the right, head tilted, forming a soft triangular composition. In the foreground are the cocktail and the intricate geometric pattern of the black metal table, sharply detailed. The background features a glass wall hung with warm yellow LED fairy lights, creating soft bokeh orbs; faintly visible in the distance is a male customer facing away, in a white T-shirt, seated on a red chair, with the city night skyline and neon lights beyond. A bouquet of sunflowers sits in a clear glass vase at the lower right, bright and vivid, adding warmth to the otherwise cool-toned scene. The composition is a close-up, with the woman dominating the frame, focus on her face and the drink; bokeh background enhances the subject. Visual flow leads from her eyes to the cocktail, then to surrounding details. Lighting is warm yellow from the fairy lights, casting soft highlights and shadows on her face and clothing, creating a romantic, intimate nighttime social ambiance. The overall palette leans cool but is punctuated by warm light, enhancing depth. The style blends candid realism with artistic beauty, as if shot with a professional camera and wide aperture, shallow depth of field, rich details, moderate saturation, subtle film grain, evoking a genuine night-out atmosphere. The image feels alive and emotionally warm, capturing a moment of urban youth enjoying quiet relaxation. Composition is stable, eye-level, the woman and environment harmoniously coexisting, conveying a mood of ease, tenderness, and serene pleasure.",
