          "id": "krea2-54babd3c64c9c01d260823de",
          "alias": "单女半褪蓝连衣裙广场忧伤坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a black metal-framed chair, legs elegantly crossed, body slightly turned, eyes cast downward to the lower left in a quiet, melancholic mood. Her long, silky black hair spills naturally over her shoulders and chest, held back by a wide white headband that reveals a smooth forehead and delicate features. Her fair, flawless skin, defined jawline, and soft pink lips contrast with her deep, story-filled eyes. She wears a blue dress with black zebra stripes, but it has slipped off one shoulder, exposing her bare breast with a hardened nipple, the fabric clinging to her curves. The square neckline and thin straps are askew, the knee-length skirt split high on one side, revealing a long, toned leg. Her feet are in shiny black stiletto heels. A dazzling diamond necklace and matching earrings add a touch of luxury. Her hands rest calmly on her knees, fingers long and manicured. In the foreground, a round black table holds three glass tumblers—one with amber liquid, two with clear and pink drinks, reflecting light. The floor is dark gray textured concrete, the wall a modern mix of pale blue and white, casting sharp layered shadows. The background is a night cityscape with warm yellow and orange lights blurred into bokeh circles against a deep navy sky. The composition is a mid-shot portrait, subject slightly left, with a gentle top-down angle emphasizing her pose and the exposed skin. Light from the left highlights her face, right arm, and bare breast, creating soft chiaroscuro, while long diagonal shadows add depth. The scene feels cool, luxurious, and intensely sensual, with a realistic, slightly grainy, amateur-camera aesthetic.",
