        {
          "id": "krea2-0efb469f80f46940c1822b3a",
          "alias": "单女全裸白衬衫椅上忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a green bench in an indoor tennis court, her soft light-brown hair falling naturally, with a few strands brushing her forehead. Her eyes are lowered, gaze directed at the ground, her expression thoughtful and slightly melancholic, a quiet, introverted mood conveyed through her gentle downward tilt. She is completely nude, her bare skin exposed, with the white short-sleeved shirt and blue-white plaid skirt discarded beside her on the bench. Her long legs are revealed, crossed at the ankles, wearing delicate pink strappy high-heeled sandals with bow details, adding a touch of elegance and playfulness. Her hands rest loosely on her knees, fingers lightly intertwined, body slightly turned to the right, forming a soft S-curve. The shot is a medium view, with her positioned left of center. The background shows the blue indoor court, court lines clearly visible, the net and blue posts intact, the mesh extending into the distance, creating depth. Above is a beige arched ceiling with slight wear and stain marks, metal support beams adding an industrial feel. Lighting comes from even fluorescent overheads, giving a cool tone, but soft fill light on her face and skin details makes her complexion glow, with clear skin folds and natural shadow transitions. The foreground includes the green bench's wood grain and scratches, enhancing realism. The middle ground connects her to the court, with visual layering between her and the net, while the net and distant lines subtly blur for depth of field, guiding the eye from her to the far end. Composition follows the rule of thirds, with her on the left third, leaving space on the right for breathing room. The visual flow is directed by her head tilt, leg extension, and bench lines, creating a diagonal dynamic path into the scene. The overall atmosphere is cool-toned, dominated by blue and green, with her bare skin and the pink sandals as accents, contrasting sharply yet harmoniously. The image feels like a real-life snapshot from amateur equipment, with slight noise and natural lens distortion, exposure well-handled, details preserved. It captures a quiet, private moment in a sports break, evoking youth, fatigue, and introspection.",
