          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a wooden folding chair at an outdoor café, her soft light brown hair falling naturally over her shoulders, strands gently blown by the breeze, catching soft light and showing fine texture. Her eyes are lowered, gaze tender and slightly contemplative, face soft, skin fair and luminous, straight nose, lips slightly parted, overall calm and elegant. She wears a cream-colored short-sleeved round-neck top, the fabric slightly wrinkled and draping loosely, hugging her figure. She is topless, the top pulled down to expose her full breasts, nipples erect, skin glowing in the warm light. Her high-waisted skirt of the same color rises slightly, revealing long bare legs. A dark purple knit cardigan is tied around her waist as an accent, creating a striking color contrast and adding a retro chic touch. Her hands gently rest on the edge of the skirt, natural and relaxed. On her left ring finger is a simple silver ring, and a thin black cord bracelet on her wrist. She wears knee-high cream-colored boots that wrap her calves, low heels suitable for walking. Her posture leans slightly forward, body angled toward the camera, creating a casual yet refined atmosphere. In the foreground is a raw wood-colored coffee table with visible grain. On it, a iced latte in a glass shows clear layers of coffee, milk foam, and cocoa powder with latte art. Next to it, a smartphone with a light purple case lies screen-down, beside an empty metal spoon on a white ceramic saucer. The background is a typical Korean street alley, lined with gray brick and blue multi-story buildings in a modern, simple style, windows neatly arranged, some with potted plants. In the distance, a few parked trucks and scattered items, a utility pole with multiple signs including Korean text \"유관순길\", \"보행자우선도로\", and a traffic sign \"구간시작 250m\". Pedestrians cross the street opposite, some carrying shopping bags, some chatting. The road is asphalt with yellow lines marking parking zones, a few cardboard boxes and an orange traffic cone scattered along the curb. The sky is a pale blue with white clouds, light coming from above left, suggesting early morning or late afternoon, casting warm golden light on the woman and objects, with long, soft shadows. The composition is a close-up portrait with a mid-ground street view. The woman is positioned slightly right of center, her gaze directing attention to her expression and pose. The background buildings, signs, and people create depth and a sense of realism. Colors are warm brown, cream, deep purple, accented with gray, blue, and yellow. The overall mood is warm, authentic, everyday, like a casual street photograph, full of urban life and personal emotion.",
