        {
          "id": "krea2-9228b95bd667a218080b6acc",
          "alias": "单女露胸米毛衣寺庙媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in an outdoor café on a woven wicker chair, wearing a delicate cream-colored lace knit cardigan with ruffled and cut-out details at the collar and cuffs—now left wide open, exposing her bare breasts, nipples visible through sheer lace. Her shoulders are bare, and she pairs this with high-waist tailored shorts, also cream, unbuttoned at the top to reveal a hint of her hip and the waistband of white lace panties. She wears sheer white thigh-high stockings instead of tights, adding a sensual sheen. Her brown hair is styled in double ponytails, a silver butterfly clip adorning the side. She lifts a white ceramic teacup printed with \"PAULETTE\" to her lips, eyes glancing up and to the left with a dreamy, contemplative expression. Her left hand steadies the saucer beneath the cup, fingers splayed delicately. On the foreground table rests an ornate white tray with a golden-crusted scone, red jam pot, yellow cream dish, and a white-handled knife and fork; a small mirror embedded in the tray reflects part of the scene. The chair is blue-green woven wicker with dark brown wooden armrests and back. Behind her, a red-and-white striped brick path leads to a traditional Thai temple with golden tiered roofs, intricate decorations, cream walls, red doors, white railings, a green tree, and a fluttering Thai flag. The sky is clear blue with white clouds; sunlight falls from the upper right, casting soft shadows and warm highlights across her bare skin and the lace fabric. The composition centers on her, shot from a low angle emphasizing her body and the sensual opening of the cardigan, the tea set adding depth, and her gaze drawing the eye toward the distant temple. Color palette: cream, white, pale blue, gold, with touches of red and green. The mood is both intimate and dreamy, capturing a serene yet explicitly erotic afternoon moment.",
