          "prompt": "A sophisticated woman in a tailored black tweed short-sleeved mini dress stands elegantly inside a modern elevator. Her deep brown hair is loosely curled and pinned up, with stray strands framing her face. Her makeup is flawless, lips slightly parted in a deep red, eyes looking directly at the camera with a confident, seductive gaze. The fitted black tweed dress features a ruffled hem and a sheer black lining that reveals her long, toned legs. She holds a vivid red velvet clutch in one hand, nails painted dark crimson, and wears simple gold necklace and bracelet. Her black pointed stiletto heels accentuate the sleek line of her calves, her smooth skin glistening under the light. She stands in the metal-clad elevator cabin—reflective silver walls behind her, mirrored floor catching her silhouette and the surroundings. Dark marble panels flank the sides, adding a touch of luxury. The composition is centered, with the woman dominating the frame. Horizontal strip lights from above cast parallel beams across the metal surface, enhancing depth and a futuristic feel. Lighting is strong from above and front, evenly illuminating her face and body, creating sharp highlights and reflections. The overall palette is monochrome—black, white, gray—with the red purse as the sole vibrant accent, creating a striking contrast. The atmosphere is cool, sophisticated, and highly sensual. Her pose is confident and inviting, one hand lightly touching her thigh, the dress slightly hiked up to reveal more skin. The angle is slightly low, giving her an imposing, powerful presence. The scene feels like a high-end fashion shoot, cinematic and charged with tension. Every detail—from the soft texture of tweed against the cold metal to the subtle sheen of her skin—builds an air of restrained desire. The woman exudes a mature, independent, and dominant allure, as if waiting for an intimate encounter. The background is slightly blurred, making her the absolute focus.",
