          "prompt": "A young woman with smooth, flowing silver-gray curly hair that catches pearl-like highlights in the sunlight, the ends flicking up lightly, stands in front of a KakaKaca photo booth. Her fair skin is flawless, her facial features delicate and three-dimensional. Her eyes are clear and bright, with a playful, confident spark. A slight smile curves her lips. She wears a white cat-ear headband with red heart decorations, the ears made of soft fleece, adding a cute touch. Her top is off—she is topless, her bare breasts fully exposed, nipples firm in the natural light, the T-shirt she was wearing now loosely held in one hand, showing the black \"I Love my\" lettering and bear print. Her lower body is clad in light green washed jeans, loose-fitting, with a white leather belt studded with metal rivets at the waist. A cute Hello Kitty plush keychain hangs from her belt, red and white, detailed. She raises both hands, index fingers pointing upward, a lively pose. On her wrist are a pink smart band and a few simple bracelets, the screen faintly glowing. Behind her, the silver-gray KakaKaca photo booth prominently displays pink \"KakaKaca\" art lettering with white outlines and cherry decorations. To the left, an electronic screen scrolls through tourist photos, below which are four black-and-white cartoon illustrations of anime-style characters. A dark curtain at the booth entrance shows a faint \"Kaka\" logo. The lighting is soft, even natural daylight from above, casting subtle shadows on her skin and clothes. The composition is centered, with her positioned slightly lower center, the background elements balanced. Her bare torso is the main focus, with the photo booth and display as midground, and a blurred street or mall environment in the background. The perspective is standard, with sharp focus on her and a shallow depth of field. Colors are pink, white, light green, with black and silver accents, giving a fresh, youthful vibe. The atmosphere is playful and carefree, as if capturing a spontaneous, lucky street-shot moment. The image feels realistic, like a high-resolution compact camera photo, retaining casual details and subtle grain, evoking a genuine, warm feel—like hearing laughter and the soft whir of the photo booth. This scene embodies modern urban youth's trend culture, blending fashion, otaku elements, and street photography aesthetics, showing a young, free, life-loving attitude.",
