          "alias": "单女广场困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on an indoor bed, her wet black hair hanging naturally, a few strands clinging to her forehead and cheeks, giving a lazy, authentic look. She tilts her head slightly towards the camera, her eyes clear and gentle, with a hint of tiredness and relaxation. Her lips are slightly parted, naturally pink, her skin fair and delicate with a subtle sheen, as if fresh from a shower or after exercise. Her facial features are soft, with a straight nose and refined but not exaggerated beauty, an overall fresh and natural aura full of everyday life. She wears a loose white cotton pajama top, unbuttoned to reveal her bare chest and the soft curve of her breasts, the puff sleeves and wrinkled fabric creating a cozy homey feel. Her right hand holds a transparent plastic bag containing a square light green ice cube, surface smooth with crisp edges, exuding a cold, clear texture. Her hand is naturally posed, fingers long and nails neatly trimmed, casual yet elegant. The background is a modern bedroom with a warm brown wall, smooth with faint texture. The headboard is dark gray fabric with a delicate weave. The bed is covered with a light gray sheet, soft with natural wrinkles. A pink square box, possibly cosmetics or skincare packaging, sits beside the bed, along with a black metal stand holding a gold decorative item, perhaps an aroma lamp or small ornament. In the corner behind, several shopping bags are stacked—one light blue paper bag and one pink hard-box packaging with a blurred brand logo. The overall environment is cluttered but tidy, full of signs of living. The composition is a close-up, with the figure occupying most of the frame, head slightly tilted, eyes directly meeting the camera, creating strong visual engagement. The foreground features her face and the ice cube in her hand; the midground is her body and the bed; the background shows the room furnishings—clear layers. Focus is on her face and the ice cube, shot with a large aperture lens, background blur prominent, emphasizing the subject. Lighting comes from a warm indoor yellow source, softly and evenly illuminating her face, creating a cozy, comfortable atmosphere. Light and shadow transition naturally, with delicate shadows and no harsh edges. Overall tones are warm yellow, beige, and gray-brown, punctuated by the cold green of the ice cube and the light blue and pink of the shopping bags, forming a warm-cool contrast that enhances visual appeal. The image quality resembles a phone selfie, with slight noise and compression artifacts, edges slightly blurred, simulating the realism of amateur everyday equipment. The scene conveys a private, relaxed, spontaneous moment of daily life, combining the tenderness of a young woman with the calm of adulthood, as if capturing an ordinary yet precious afternoon. The air feels misty and cool, evoking a quiet, genuine warmth.",
