          "prompt": "In a rainy city street at night, a young woman stands topless on the wet pavement, her orange-red strapless dress pooled around her waist, exposing her bare breasts and shoulders. Her long dark hair is soaked, strands clinging to her face and neck. She stares directly into the camera with a sultry, dreamy gaze, lips parted slightly, as if about to whisper a secret. The camera angle is tilted, close-up on her face and upper body, occupying the left third of the frame. Background is blurred city buildings, dim yellow streetlights in the rain creating soft halos. Wet ground reflects the lights, with a diagonal beam of light cutting across the scene. Lighting from upper right side-back gives rim light on her wet skin and hair, with delicate highlights. Sky is dark gray-blue, contrasting with the warm orange-red of the dress. Shallow depth of field makes the subject sharp while the background is softly blurred. The mood is lonely, cinematic, sensual, with a mix of melancholy and erotic tension. The scene feels like a film still, with rainy haze, slight grain, and film texture. Time seems suspended, heavy with emotion and unspoken desire.",
