          "alias": "单女露胸白连体衣门俏皮站立持杯",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the doorway of an outdoor café, wearing only a sheer white lace bodysuit that leaves nothing to the imagination, her nipples visible through the delicate fabric. Her wide-brimmed straw hat casts soft shadows over her face, while her long hair falls freely in the sun. She holds a clear plastic cup of dark iced drink labeled \"INDIGO\" in one hand, the straw glistening. She poses sideways, body slightly tilted, looking directly at the camera with a confident, playful smirk. Her left wrist sports a thin silver chain. Behind her, the \"INDIGO\" café sign hangs on the wall, a blue-and-white circular logo with a jellyfish design. To the left, a black metal woven chair with sharp radial lines sits on black-and-white checkered tile floor. Lush green shrubs and trees frame the scene, with distant white and beige buildings under bright sunlight. Warm golden light from upper right creates rim lighting around her body, highlighting her curves and the sheer fabric. Center composition, with her head and the sign as focal points. Overall warm yellow, cream, light green, and blue tones, blending summer freshness with high-end fashion editorial style.",
