          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙舞台困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, wearing a tight black-and-blue zebra-print mini dress with a single shoulder strap that bares one shoulder and her collarbone. The fabric has a slight reflective sheen, catching purple lights in flowing highlights. Her long hair falls naturally, ends slightly curled, with a few strands drifting as she moves. She raises both arms high, right hand gripping a pink rhinestone-studded microphone that sparkles intensely. Multiple layered metal bracelets and decorative accessories adorn her wrist. Her gaze is lowered, focused and sensuous, lips slightly parted, makeup soft and layered under the purple glow. Her body tilts slightly, arms arched overhead in an elegant curve, emphasizing her toned legs and hourglass figure. The dress hugs every curve, the short hemline accentuates her long thighs. Foreground shows crisp details of her figure and outfit; midground blurs stage equipment and lights; background is a deep dark violet void scattered with circular light spots and haze, creating a dreamy concert atmosphere. Medium close-up composition, subject slightly left of center, diagonal lines enhance dynamic energy. Visual flow leads from the microphone up to her face, then down along her body curves. Lighting comes from purple spotlights above and behind, softly sculpting her form with strong chiaroscuro, casting a faint reflection on the floor. Smoke refracts and diffuses the light, adding depth. The mood is both modern and mysterious, capturing a climactic concert moment. Low-angle view amplifies her presence and the stage's grandeur. Shot with a large-aperture telephoto lens, background blurred, subject sharp. High detail, professional photography quality.",
