          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙庭院媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a metal rattan chair in an outdoor courtyard, wearing a dark blue sequin strapless dress with the hem slightly lifted, revealing black lace shorts and black stockings on her thighs, ankle strap decorations. Her right hand gently lifts the skirt, left hand resting naturally on her leg, fingernails painted red. She looks directly at the camera with exquisite makeup, red lips slightly parted, short wavy black hair with bangs, a fine chain necklace around her neck. Her pose is elegant yet sensual, body slightly leaning, left leg bent and raised, right leg extended, forming a graceful S-curve. The foreground is dense tropical foliage with large layered green banana leaves, some slightly wilted at edges, partly drooping to almost cover the background. A gray flowerpot with vertical stripes on the left holds tall greenery. The ground is brown tiles. The midground features the woman and the silver-gray metal-framed chair with an arched back, beside a matching square rattan coffee table with geometric weave pattern and metal corner supports. The background is a blurred indoor space with faint white walls and furniture outlines. The composition is centrally symmetric with the figure slightly right of center, surrounded by plants, creating a visual focal point. A low-angle upward shot enhances the woman's height and presence. Soft side lighting from the right illuminates her face, shoulders, and arms, creating subtle chiaroscuro, smooth skin texture, the sequined dress reflecting tiny sparks of light, giving a dreamy sheen. Shadows fall on the left and behind, strengthening three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is quiet and mysterious with romantic nighttime vibes. Colors are deep green, deep blue, black, accented by red lipstick and nail polish, high contrast. The scene tells a story like a private urban night moment, with strong cinematic and fine-art photography style. Shot with a professional camera, high resolution, rich detail, well-handled bokeh, natural plant growth patterns in background, layered light and shadow. It feels high-end yet intimate, with delicate image texture, moderate color saturation, no overexposure or underexposure, balanced composition full but not crowded. Her expression is calm and captivating, her gaze hinting at seduction and confidence. The scene is realistic and lived-in, as if captured by a photographer with amateur equipment in a home courtyard, blending documentary feel with artistry.",
