          "prompt": "A blonde woman stands topless in a sleek black blazer left open, matching high-waist shorts, and black stiletto heels. She leans confidently against a modern cosmetics display, her left hand tracing the edge of a product poster, right hand resting on her hip, lips parted in a sultry half-smile. Warm orange-red LED light spills from one display cabinet, contrasting with cool blue neon strips on the opposite side, illuminating her bare skin and the curve of her breasts. The symmetrical wooden grid shelves hold shu uemura makeup bottles. Soft overhead diffusion blends with the colored lights, creating a high-end commercial yet intimate atmosphere. Her gaze is direct, inviting, the scene framed by polished gray floors and dark purple gradient posters with circular light effects. Photorealistic, shallow depth of field, detailed textures of wood, glass, and skin.",
