          "id": "krea2-e1920a5319bfc1933612a438",
          "alias": "单女露胸粉外套沙发微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A close-up shot of a young woman sitting on a pink sofa. She has long, deep green-to-black hair with straight bangs, gazing directly at the camera with a lazy, confident expression. Her lips are slightly parted, hinting at a subtle smile. Her skin is fair and smooth, with delicate facial features, a straight nose, and soft, three-dimensional contours. She wears a pink tweed short jacket dress, unbuttoned to reveal her bare breasts and toned torso. The skirt sits just above her thighs, highlighting her long legs. She wears white sheer stockings and shiny pink high-heel mules with block heels and bow details at the toes. Her left hand rests naturally on the sofa arm, fingers long with dark nail polish. Her right hand is gently placed on her thigh. Her body leans slightly to one side, left leg bent and raised, right leg extended, creating an elegant curve. The background is a pink-toned interior with soft pale pink walls and subtle texture. On the left is a stack of pink boxes of various sizes, topped with a pink plastic basket filled with pink peaches or similar fruit. The scene blends minimalism with cute elements. Lighting is soft and bright, coming from the front left, creating even diffused light with minor shadows under her body and along the sofa edge, producing a warm, dreamy atmosphere. The overall color palette is unified in pink tones, from light to deep pink, forming harmonious visual layers. The composition is a medium shot; she is on the right side, occupying most of the visual space, with empty space on the left for balance. A slight high angle enhances intimacy. Foreground shows the sofa and her lower body, midground her full body and some furniture, background the wall and stacked boxes with fruit basket. The visual lines—from her pose, gaze direction, and leg lines—guide the viewer’s eye to her face and overall styling. Lighting is delicate with no harsh contrast, emphasizing a soft-focus effect. The overall atmosphere is like a fashion magazine spread or high-end brand ad, blending artistic and commercial beauty while retaining a sense of everyday intimacy, as if a private moment at home, but carefully staged and lit for a surreal aesthetic.",
