        {
          "id": "krea2-e9b86e6e2c970b1345aa8f9b",
          "alias": "单女灰短裙咖啡厅媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman with flowing pink hair stands in a classical arched doorway, wearing a sheer white high-neck short-sleeve crop top that barely covers her breasts, revealing the curves of her torso, paired with an ultra-short dark gray tight skirt that rides high on her thighs. She balances on black strappy stiletto heels, right leg raised and bent seductively, left foot planted firmly, left hand resting on the doorframe, right hand holding a translucent glowing green folding fan with delicate lace patterns. Her gaze is low, lips slightly parted, expression one of sultry contemplation. A small gold ornament adorns her forehead, and a black lanyard with a black ID badge hangs around her neck. The foreground shows a dark wooden door frame and a wine rack with bottles and glasses. In the midground, a blue fireplace with decorative frames and a warm fire glows behind her. The background features a vaulted ceiling with an ornate crystal chandelier casting soft warm yellow light, a pale beige textured ceiling, and geometric parquet flooring reflecting cool violet-blue tones. The composition is symmetrical, with the arch framing her body, strong perspective guiding the eye. Warm light from the chandelier and fire mixes with cool floor reflections, creating a dreamy, luxurious, and slightly mysterious vintage atmosphere, full of cinematic and artistic appeal—as if captured in an upscale restaurant or private club, with rich detail and sensual elegance.",
