          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙摄影棚忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a sheer, light blue gradient tube dress with a deep plunging neckline and corset-style bodice, the fabric so thin it reveals the outline of her breasts and nipples; the asymmetrical skirt has an extreme high slit exposing her inner thigh, trimmed with delicate lace. She wears layered pearl necklaces and a sparkling diamond pendant. Her natural wavy hair falls freely. She has fair skin, delicate features, and a serene, slightly melancholic expression with downcast eyes. Both arms are raised above her head: her right hand flashes the rock sign, while her left hand gently touches her scalp. White feather cuffs adorn her arms, matching the dozens of white feathers floating around her, some crisp and close to the lens, others soft and blurred in the background. The backdrop is a deep blue gradient curtain, transitioning from light blue at the top to dark blue at the bottom. A professional lighting stand is visible on the left, with a strong light source from the upper left creating intense backlight, lens flares, and starburst effects. The light penetrates the floating feathers, making them translucent. The composition is a medium shot, with the woman's body slightly turned, head tilted, forming an elegant S-curve. The lighting produces strong chiaroscuro, with her face and front uniformly lit while her back and sides fall into deep shadow, enhancing the three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere merges high-fashion editorial with a dreamy, erotic fantasy; color palette is cool blue and white, with subtle film grain and slight noise to evoke an amateur, candid feel, as if captured spontaneously in a studio.",
