        {
          "id": "krea2-476b5ad02622f6eaa28a4bf2",
          "alias": "单女露胸棕连衣裙桌边媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in the red leather booth of a café, wearing nothing but a deep brown and wine-red plaid suspender dress that has slipped off her shoulders, her bare breasts exposed, the tiny golden star embroidery now highlighting her left nipple. A pale yellow silk scarf is loosely tied around her neck, draping over one shoulder and grazing her nipple. Her short hair is a soft gradient from light brown to blonde, slightly wavy and tucked behind her ears. She wears a dark brown beret with wrinkled texture, tilted down. She looks directly at the camera with a calm, seductive gaze, lips parted, a hint of lazy desire in her expression. Her hands rest on the table in front of her, fingers long and neatly manicured. Beside her sits a brown leather handbag with visible stitching and metal clasps. The background is a rough gray brick wall on the left, white mortar in the gaps, and a light gray cement wall on the right with cracks and stains. A warm yellow light strip from the upper right casts soft golden light across her face and chest, creating intimate shadows and highlights. The composition is a medium shot, slightly off-center, her body slightly turned but face straight to the lens. The foreground shows a corner of the table with a white woven placemat. The overall atmosphere is warm, nostalgic, and literary, with a sensual, real-life snapshot feel. Tones of brown, burgundy, gray, and warm gold light. The image feels like a subtly erotic, everyday moment captured in soft, natural light.",
