        {
          "id": "krea2-0787a31943f52178716d5e2c",
          "alias": "单女全裸蓝衬衫桌边媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young female model stands in a vintage interior, wearing a blue-and-white thin-striped long-sleeve shirt with the collar open and tied in a loose bow, revealing the upper swell of her breasts and a hint of cleavage, paired with deep blue high-waisted shorts that hug her hips and thighs. She angles her body slightly toward the camera, left hand casually tucked into her pocket, right hand resting on a brown suede and dark leather handbag. Her gaze meets the lens with a calm, sultry expression—serene yet slightly lazy. Her long, wavy hair falls naturally over her shoulders, catching warm light that highlights its softness. Her skin is pale and smooth, her makeup subtle with a nude pink lip. The composition is a medium shot, from above her waist down to her thighs, making her and the handbag the visual focus. The background features an antique wooden apothecary cabinet with multiple drawers and brass handles, a dark green marble countertop, and to the right an ornate golden safe with \"Amount Purchase\" engraved, its surface covered in complex relief patterns. Above the safe sits a white ceramic bird figurine. In the background, wooden stairs and a large bronze sculpture—part of a human arm or torso—add artistic depth and mystery. The walls are pale gray-white with slight patina, and a framed warm-toned painting hangs on the upper left. Soft natural light from the left creates gentle chiaroscuro, casting subtle shadows across the model's right side and the objects. The overall color palette is warm—browns, blues, golds—producing a quiet, narrative atmosphere reminiscent of a century-old boutique or private collection room. The texture is rich: fabric wrinkles, leather grain, metal reflections, wood grains. No watermarks or text. The scene feels like a high-end fashion advertisement, balancing everyday intimacy with artistic elegance, capturing a moment suspended in time.",
