        {
          "id": "krea2-940e0bf1a538ac824eba7c87",
          "alias": "单女露胸红外套街道媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a high wooden stool outside a street florist, dressed in a carefully coordinated pink and red outfit. She wears a pale pink beret with embroidered letters, her dark brown curls twisted into a low bun with loose strands falling naturally. Dark vintage sunglasses cover her eyes, her gaze focused forward. In her right hand she holds a strawberry milkshake in a clear plastic cup, topped with fresh strawberry slices and whipped cream, a cute snowman decoration on the lid; she sips through a pink straw. Her left hand rests lightly on the cup, posture elegant and relaxed. Her wine-red velvet baseball jacket hangs open, white stripes on the cuffs, embroidered text on the chest, revealing a pink knit cardigan beneath, completely unbuttoned, exposing her bare breasts and nipples. A white pleated miniskirt rides high, the hem barely covering her upper thighs, one leg crossed over the other, knee slightly bent, showing long bare legs. She wears a pink quilted shoulder bag with brand logo, and white Nike Air Force 1 sneakers with wine-red accents and \"Air\" lettering. The scene is a lively street: left side a flower shop with roses, carnations, hydrangeas displayed on wooden shelves and white pots, some climbing the wall; warm yellow pendant lights above. Right side extends the street with Korean signs, including one reading \"도망에커리\". Gray asphalt pavement slightly wet, reflecting ambient light. Blurred pedestrians in the distance. Slight low-angle view, framing her centered-left. Natural overcast daylight provides soft, even illumination, no harsh shadows. The overall mood is casually sensual, blending urban romance with everyday poetic beauty, like a candid street fashion shot, sharp and detailed, saturated colors, dreamy yet realistic.",
