        {
          "id": "krea2-41a29b0191aaf3cc5413f81d",
          "alias": "单女米T恤街道媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a street, her shoulder-length brown bob with neat bangs, eyes calm and focused on the lens, lips slightly parted, holding a clear plastic cup with an iced drink, straw inserted, cup tilted as if she just sipped. Her left hand hangs naturally, holding a cream-colored canvas tote with blue bear print and red tag, strap long, bag slightly wrinkled, casual and real. She wears a beige short-sleeve T-shirt with a bright red apple print on the chest, collar and cuffs trimmed in light gray, the hem casually rolled up to reveal her bare midriff. Below, high-waisted blue-and-white vertical-striped shorts with white lace trim at the waist and hem, showing off her slender thighs. She wears white over-the-knee stockings with fine mesh texture and horizontal folds, and bright red leather sneakers with white-and-red bow laces, white stripes on toe and side, light brown rubber soles. She stands with legs crossed, left in front, right behind, body slightly tilted in an effortless, relaxed pose. The background is a large billboard wall: left side torn blue paper with black QR code, English \"le\" and \"NU\" and Chinese character \"号\"; right side a food poster with a white bowl of clear soup, ripples, a pink meat chunk floating, two empty plates, glass outlines above, red \"CHEF'S\" text on top, and blue-white abstract pattern like glacier or waves below. Tape marks and irregular tear lines on the billboard edges create a street collage feel. Foreground is dark gray rough concrete with fine grain and wear. Midground: black metal railing with dense vertical bars, slight rust and reflections. Composition is symmetrical, subject centered, head slightly tilted, direct eye contact. Natural daylight, soft and even, with delicate highlights on face and clothes. Overall atmosphere is relaxed, everyday, with a touch of urban street fashion and life. Color palette: beige, blue-white, red, harmonious. The scene has a documentary-style, candid snapshot feel, blending intentional outfit details with raw environmental texture—both refined and grounded, now with a sensual, NSFW edge.",
