        {
          "id": "krea2-ba40d16c051d7296b643ddca",
          "alias": "单女黑内衣节庆害羞站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the center of an outdoor festival, her dark hair in two thick braids resting on her shoulders, skin pale and luminous, eyeshadow shimmering, lips full and red, cheeks flushed with a natural pink. She grins brightly at the camera, eyes sparkling with energy and joy, body leaning slightly forward, relaxed and confident. In her left hand she holds a gray water gun, nozzle aimed right, her right hand open, palm up as if inviting or showcasing something. She wears a tight black Adidas sports bra with white trim, the trefoil logo and brand name clearly visible on her chest, paired with white Adidas shorts bearing the same logo. A black lanyard hangs around her neck, ending in a transparent waterproof phone pouch holding a black smartphone, screen facing out. Her fingers are long with pale nail polish, neatly trimmed and glossy. The scene is a lively nighttime outdoor venue, ground wet and reflective, mirroring lights and figures. In the background, a large yellow tent with golden letters reading \"SINGHA\" and a golden lion logo—iconic Thai beer branding—glows with warm yellow string lights inside. Crowds of tourists in summer attire chat, photograph, and play with water, creating a joyful, relaxed social atmosphere. The sky is twilight blue with a hint of dusk, distant trees and blurred structures visible. Composition is centered, subject slightly lower, foreground includes wet ground reflections, midground the crowd and tent, background the night sky and environment. Lighting comes from warm tent lights and overhead strings, casting strong reflections on the wet ground, producing dappled, textured shadows. Her face receives soft fill light, emphasizing defined features and detail. Overall mood is warm, festive, summery, with a strong sense of presence and participation. Colors balance yellow, black, white with blue sky and multicolored crowd attire, vivid yet harmonious. Visual flow follows her gaze and body toward the water gun and surrounding interaction, creating dynamic narrative. The image has a candid, amateur-camera feel, standard lens, capturing close-up details with environmental context, slight grain and compression, unretouched, preserving authentic beauty. Composition is tight yet not crowded, person and background well-balanced, conveying youthful, carefree, present-moment attitude, full of movement and life, as if you can hear water splashes and laughter, feel the festival heat and summer coolness.",
