          "alias": "单女黑旗袍楼梯害羞站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a vintage wooden stairwell, wearing a modified black velvet cheongsam with intricate gold buttons and embroidery, the collar and cuffs trimmed with gold piping. The dress features high side slits that reveal her long legs clad in black over-the-knee stockings, the slit rising high enough to show the top of her thigh and the garter line. Her dark hair is braided into two pigtails resting on her shoulders, small earrings glinting. She gazes downward at the camera with a shy yet sultry expression, lips slightly parted. Her right hand lightly grips the wooden railing, left hand hanging naturally, her pose poised but subtly inviting. The composition is medium shot slightly from below, emphasizing her curves. In the foreground, carved wooden banister and steps partially frame the scene, adding depth. Midground shows her full figure against dark wood paneling and a decorative wall sconce. Background is deep brown wood with intricate carved ceiling, classical Chinese architecture style. A warm yellow glass wall lamp on the right casts soft light across her face and dress details, while a white candle flickers on a small table to the left, creating a mysterious ambiance. The warm amber lighting creates strong chiaroscuro, highlighting the sheen of the velvet and the smooth skin of her thighs visible through the slits. The entire scene has a film-photography texture with slight grain and natural noise, saturated tones, rich details, evoking a private, intimate, nostalgic atmosphere. The composition guides the eye from the railing to her body, then into the background, blending traditional aesthetics with modern sensuality, full of storytelling and erotic tension.",
