        {
          "id": "krea2-11b693b0433d2a7d45d7aa09",
          "alias": "单女露胸内衣厨房俏皮站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a modern minimalist kitchen, her long, straight black hair falling naturally, fair skin and delicate features visible as she smiles and covers her mouth with one hand, a playful glint in her eye. Her right hand holds a tall glass of amber iced drink filled with clear ice cubes and an orange slice, the glass featuring vertical ridges that catch the soft light. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, with no bra or clothing above the waist, her left hand hanging casually, red nail polish visible, small gold earrings in her ears. She wears only a pair of sheer black lace panties, her black floral-print dress discarded on the counter behind her. In the foreground, a white countertop holds a black Nespresso machine pouring dark coffee into a clear glass, with scattered colored coffee capsules in brown and green, a woven basket of fresh oranges, and a pale green ceramic container. The background is a beige wall with wooden shelves displaying two rows of colorful coffee capsules, a framed art piece reading \"MATISSE\" with a flower illustration, a beige abstract sculpture, and small white bowls. The lighting is bright and soft, with cool white ceiling spotlights and warm yellow under-counter LED strips, creating a cozy atmosphere. The composition is centered with the woman slightly to the right, camera at a low angle, giving an intimate, everyday feel. The scene is realistic, with slight grain and natural depth of field, capturing a warm, playful moment of domestic life with an NSFW twist.",
