        {
          "id": "krea2-377d75e560e85279b5d81746",
          "alias": "单女歌手黑背心城市媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on pink steps, her glossy black hair cascading freely, fair skin flawless, delicate features sharp and captivating. She stares directly at the camera with a cool, slightly mysterious expression, deep red lips parted just enough to draw attention. Her body leans forward slightly, arms resting on her knees—right hand gently touching the step edge, left hand behind her for support, poised and relaxed. She wears a black off-shoulder sleeveless top with a large bow accentuating her cleavage, paired with a high-waist denim mini skirt—asymmetrical with a side slit that reveals her thigh. Black fishnet stockings hug her legs, right leg crossed over left, a delicate chain around her ankle. A black choker and silver necklace add edge and attitude. Behind her, a light green wall is covered in hand-drawn graffiti—hearts, smileys, question marks, stars in red and black—lively and youthful. A mirror on the wall reflects her silhouette, adding depth. A white sink stands to the left beside a yellow wall. Soft, even lighting from above front highlights her curves and the texture of her outfit, creating a modern urban chic with K-pop idol polish and casual street photography authenticity. The composition is centered, drawing the eye from her face down to her legs and fishnets. High-resolution, 4K quality, rich detail, balanced saturation—sensual yet playful, a blend of edgy fashion and youthful rebellion.",
