        {
          "id": "krea2-5b165f926b803f928d9687c6",
          "alias": "单女红内衣健身房媚态站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A toned young woman stands beside a squat rack in a gym, her back to the camera in a three-quarter view, long black hair cascading down her spine. She wears a wine-red barely-there sports bra and low-rise shorts, cut high to reveal the full curve of her hips and the deep V of her lower back. The bra is open-backed, exposing every muscle and vertebrae as she leans forward slightly, gripping the barbell with both hands. Her thick-soled retro sneakers and white high-top socks complete the sporty yet sensual look. A mirror on the left captures her profile, reflecting the smooth line of her waist, the round of her glutes, and the tension in her thighs. The squat rack’s industrial steel frame dominates the foreground, with “AlvaFit Private Training” engraved on the top bar. The barbell runs horizontally, loaded with black plates, one bearing the “NOG” logo in crisp detail. Beyond, the gym is spacious with gray textured flooring, rows of treadmills, dumbbells, and ellipticals softened by warm overhead spotlights and purple LED strips that cast a futuristic glow across the floor. An abstract black-and-white portrait hangs on the far wall, adding an artistic contrast. The composition follows the rule of thirds: the woman is set slightly right, the rack left, drawing the eye from the metal structure to her form, then through the mirror into the depth of the room. Lighting is layered—key light from above and in front highlights the sheen of her skin, the definition of her back and legs, while purple ambient light creates a soft gradient on the floor, enhancing depth. The color palette is rich: burgundy, black, gray, with accents of purple and warm yellow, bold yet harmonious. Shot from a low angle with a slight lens blur at the edges, the image captures a powerful, intimate moment of strength and beauty—every pore, fabric fold, and metallic reflection rendered with lifelike realism. The overall feel is a fusion of athletic discipline, urban edge, and erotic tension, portraying a woman in full command of her body and space.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
