        {
          "id": "krea2-018bc8eaa9cdbb32983f270f",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙摄影棚媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman in a tight, low-cut red velvet minidress with one bare shoulder and a flirty bow strap, the dress hugging her curves and revealing deep cleavage, sheer fabric hinting at her nipples. She holds a glittering black clutch studded with silver rhinestones and a large crystal centerpiece. Black stiletto heels with thin ankle straps and pearl toe details. Her long shiny hair falls loose, makeup bold with smoky eyes and glossy lips. She stands slightly left of center, staring directly at the camera with a confident, sultry expression. Behind her, a wall covered in shoe sketches and photos—zebra-print stilettos, black boots, leopard-print designs—creating a studio backdrop. To the left, a metallic display stand with black pointed pumps; to the right, a stand with beige low heels. Warm light wood floor adds depth. Mid-shot composition, her body taking up two-thirds of the frame, head just above the upper third. Soft side/top lighting eliminates harsh shadows, highlighting her red dress and the metallic stands. Background slightly blurred for depth. The overall mood is high-fashion boudoir, sensual and polished, with fine grain and commercial-grade sharpness.",
