        {
          "id": "krea2-cae93bd019aa4ad2a89bd59e",
          "alias": "单女湿身蓝外套霓虹夜景媚态蹲脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches in the center foreground, her silver-gray hair flowing, large rabbit-ear headband with pink inner fluff and gray-white outer gradient outlined in black, secured by metal clips. She wears a shiny blue silk tight jacket unzipped to reveal black lace bra and bare cleavage, matching black high-waist pants (unbuttoned, hint of panty), and black boots. Her right hand rests on her knee, left hand hanging loose, body slightly leaning forward, head tilted, a seductive smirk on her lips as she stares directly into the lens with lustful eyes. Background: nighttime amusement-park themed street, colorful neon signs and cartoon buildings mid-ground, green pillar lamp on the left with gold base and vintage top, glowing billboards—one yellow 3D “GAZELLE” with cartoon animal, another purple “CONCERT” in white. Distant futuristic structures in blue, purple, red, wavy roofs and spires, lit up, surrounded by greenery and artificial rocks. Lower right: potted plant with pink flowers and green leaves. Other blurred visitors in thick coats and cartoon hats add realism. Central-focused composition, lamp post frames subject, neon signs and buildings create depth, light sources: cool white from ads, colored architectural lights, warm yellow street lamps casting soft shadows on her face and body, highlighting glossy skin and fabric. Dreamlike, joyful nightlife vibe with fantasy cosplay and real urban energy. Rich details, high saturation, strong contrast, professional photo quality with slight night-grain for authenticity.",
