          "id": "krea2-3a10cdfedc88227c9e028a31",
          "alias": "单女露胸灰毛衣桌边害羞脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with glossy black hair woven into a delicate braid resting over her shoulder, straight bangs framing her forehead, clear bright eyes gazing softly at the camera with a shy, gentle smile, her skin fair and smooth with a healthy flush on her cheeks. She is completely topless, her bare breasts fully exposed, nipples perked and rosy in the warm firelight, wearing only a soft gray sweater with blue geometric patterns that is partially unbuttoned and slipped off one shoulder, the fabric bunching loosely around her arms. Her hands rest lightly on the warm wooden tabletop, fingers long with neatly trimmed nails painted pale pink, the wooden surface showing natural grain and slight wear. Behind her, a black fireplace crackles with orange-red flames, casting flickering shadows and a golden glow across her skin, highlighting the curves of her chest and the soft arch of her neck. The dark brick wall behind the fire shows rough texture and aged mortar, while pale brown wood paneling completes the room. Composition is a close-up portrait, woman on the right, fireplace on the left, the table extending to the bottom edge, drawing the eye upward. Lighting comes from the fire and a soft side source, creating gentle highlights on her nose and forehead, smooth shadow transitions, overall warm, cozy, intimate ambiance. The palette features warm yellows, oranges, browns, with the blue sweater accents providing contrast. The image feels professionally shot yet casual, like a candid moment at home, deeply sensual and inviting.",
