        {
          "id": "krea2-3edfdb90967c95e380ce2d19",
          "alias": "单女舞者T恤舞台沉思倚靠跳舞",
          "prompt": "A young female dancer performs a dynamic, high-energy routine center stage, her short red-brown hair tied with a blue headband, face meticulously made up with shimmering highlights, eyes intense and expressive, lips slightly parted as if singing or shouting into a small microphone clipped near her mouth, exuding professional pop-star charisma. She wears a cropped T-shirt with yellow sleeves and a deep blue body, a white rose pattern and \"Paelice\" printed across the chest; a military green camouflage pleated mini skirt, wide camo belt with a silver metal buckle, her bare midriff exposed with a small navel piercing visible. She sports white thigh-high socks and bright yellow sneakers, the sock tops loosely bunched at the ankles. Multiple tattoos adorn her arms, including stars and text designs, merging street fashion with idol aesthetics. Her pose is powerful—arms raised and bent in a dance move, body leaning slightly forward, legs in a half-squat, radiating rhythm and explosive motion. The foreground is sharply focused on her, while blurred silhouettes of other dancers fill the midground, all moving but out of focus. Behind, a massive LED screen displays abstract colorful geometric patterns in blue, purple, pink, and yellow, creating a digital-art vibe. Countless gold confetti pieces swirl through the air, some resting on the floor in dappled shadows, amplifying the celebratory atmosphere. Composition is centrally symmetric, with a shallow depth of field that softens the background and midground, drawing the eye to the dancer. Her body language and gaze direct attention inward, while the falling confetti adds layered motion. Lighting comes from stage spotlights and colorful follow spots, from above and front, sculpting her figure with strong chiaroscuro effects; the reflective materials on her shirt print and shoes catch subtle highlights. The cool tones of the LED screen contrast with the warm stage lights, producing rich, complex lighting layers. The overall vibe is fervent, joyful, bursting with youthful energy, combining modern pop concert fashion with live-performance authenticity. Every detail is crisp, colors highly saturated, yet retaining the natural immediacy and spontaneity of a real stage show—capturing a peak moment with the clarity of a high-pixel professional camera, offering an immersive, visceral experience.",
