          "alias": "单女米连衣裙沙发媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits bare-legged on a beige fabric armchair, wearing only a short unbuttoned beige trench dress that hangs open, revealing her bare chest and nipples, the Peter Pan collar and gold buttons framing her exposed skin. A matching beret sits on her head, a black-and-white checkered scarf draped from the brim, her dark brown hair loosely pinned with strands falling free. She wears a silver watch on her left wrist, her right hand resting on a colorful \"CARAVELLE TIMES\" magazine placed over her thigh. Her legs are crossed, left over right, black high-heeled open-toe boots with metal buckles on her feet. A black diamond-stitched handbag sits beside her on the sofa, gold chain and hardware gleaming. The background shows a snug interior: a light brown velvet sofa to the left, a dark wood side table with a classic lamp casting warm yellow light, and floor-to-ceiling windows with sheer beige curtains filtering sunlight that falls in dappled patterns on an abstract-patterned rug. The composition is mid-shot, the woman slightly turned to the right, gazing off-frame in a pensive, waiting mood. Natural light from the right creates a soft backlight, rimming her silhouette, while the lamp adds local fill on her face and bare skin, highlighting the contrast of fabric and flesh. The scene feels like a high-fashion yet intimate moment, evoking a sensual, refined atmosphere.",
