          "alias": "单女黑束身衣办公室媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an indoor stairwell, wearing only a sheer black lace corset with satin panels that leaves her breasts partially exposed and a matching ruffled mini skirt, her fishnet stockings held up by lace-trimmed suspenders. A black rabbit-ear headband crowns her dark brown hair that falls naturally around her shoulders. She gazes directly at the camera with a cold, sultry expression and a hint of playful challenge. In her right hand, she holds a transparent plastic cup with a pink straw, the cup bearing a cartoon sticker and filled with dark liquid; her left hand hangs loosely at her side. She leans back against the metal railing, her body slightly turned to emphasize her curves. The background features grey concrete steps and black metal railings, pale grey-white walls. Light streams from above left, casting soft shadows across her face and body, with darker shadows pooling on the right wall and stairs. The overall mood is warm yet industrial. The mid-shot composition places her slightly right of center, with staircase lines leading from bottom left to upper right. Foreground shows her and the drink, midground the stairs and railing, background the wall and distant blurred stair structure. Rich lighting and shadow play. Color palette dominated by black and grey, accented by the cup's bright label and pink straw. The image feels like a candid, realistic snapshot taken with everyday amateur gear—maybe in a backstage area or ordinary workplace—raw, personal, and full of attitude. The camera angle is slightly high, focus is medium, depth of field well-controlled to keep her sharp while softly blurring the background. The atmosphere is intimate, fashion-forward, and effortlessly confident.",
