          "alias": "单女全裸米风衣室内媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands beside an interior doorframe, wearing only an unbuttoned cream double-breasted trench coat-style dress, the fabric falling open to reveal her bare chest and smooth skin, the coat's cinched waist and A-line skirt framing her nude form. She keeps a chic cream beret with a black band and a hint of plaid, her deep brown hair swept up with loose strands framing her face, her makeup bold with smoky eyes and soft pink lips. She poses sideways, leaning slightly, one hand resting on the doorframe, the other holding a small black quilted leather handbag with gold chain and D-ring. A silver watch adorns her left wrist. The lighting is soft, warm, and directional from the left, highlighting her face and the exposed skin, while the background is a clean cream wall and white door. The composition is a medium shot, focus on her confident yet gentle gaze and the erotic elegance of her topless state under the open coat.",
