        {
          "id": "krea2-7204fb7f3ac9f6646a4a6a30",
          "alias": "单女蓝和服门媚态坐喝",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a traditional Japanese room, wearing a deep blue kimono that is loosely draped open, revealing a pale lavender inner robe with her bare shoulders and collarbone exposed. The kimono fabric is rich with subtle texture and natural folds, fine stitching visible at the sleeves and collar. Her hair is pinned up with a straight fringe, soft strands falling beside her cheeks. Her eyes are clear and direct, with a thoughtful, sensual expression. She rests her chin on her hands, fingers long and elegant, posture relaxed yet inviting. Her body is slightly turned to the right, head tilted, forming a soft triangular composition that connects intimately with the viewer. In the foreground, a light wooden low table with smooth grain holds a small blue-and-white porcelain teacup painted with vivid floral patterns, placed on a green ceramic coaster with a faint glaze sheen. The woman is centered-left in the midground, at a 45-degree angle to the camera. The background is a typical tatami room: pale green tatami mats with black stitched edges, beige paper sliding doors with wooden lattice frames letting in warm yellow light. A closed wooden sliding door is on the left; on the right, a translucent shoji door divided into fine wooden grids allows soft light to pour in, casting gentle shadows on walls and floor. The shot is low-angle, slightly upward, emphasizing her silhouette and spatial depth. Composition is balanced with the subject left of center, leaving negative space on the right. Focus is sharp on her face and hands, with moderate background blur from a wide aperture, giving a shallow depth of field. Lighting is soft, coming from the right front, creating natural chiaroscuro with subtle highlights on her nose and cheekbones, warm tones of beige, brown, and blue-gray, with the teacup adding a colorful accent. The overall image has a film-photography texture with slight grain, moderate color saturation, and layered detail—fabric textures, wood grain, painted patterns—rendered in high-resolution realism. The atmosphere is warm, quiet, and intensely sensual, evoking a moment of intimate stillness as if caught in a sunlit afternoon, the woman pausing while sipping tea, blending Eastern zen with human warmth and desire.",
