          "alias": "单女半褪空姐制服室内媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a vintage air stewardess uniform sits in a warm-toned interior, her black cloche hat tilted slightly, hair neatly coiled to reveal elegant features and a deep, slightly hazy gaze. She wears a rich brown-red fur coat, its wide lapels falling open to expose the black high-neck top beneath, the contrast drawing attention to her curves. Her hands are clad in glossy black long leather gloves, one hand resting over the other at her chest in a poised but inviting gesture. The fur coat is deliberately slipped off one shoulder, revealing bare skin and the strap of her brassiere, adding a sensual edge. Her legs are pressed together, knees slight apart, the skirt of the uniform riding up to expose smooth thighs. The lighting, soft and golden from the side, casts shadows that accentuate her face and gloved hands, highlighting the texture of fur and leather. A red circular object (possible seat) adds a pop of color. The background is blurred warm wooden slats. The atmosphere is nostalgic, romantic, and distinctly provocative—a mid-shot low-angle composition that makes her appear both commanding and vulnerable. The entire scene feels like a film noir still, dripping with vintage eroticism.",
