          "prompt": "A young woman stands elegantly on a lavish marble spiral staircase, topless, wearing only a deep blue velvet pleated mini skirt and a black bow tie necklace that dangles between her bare breasts. Her natural hair cascades in soft waves over her shoulders, and she looks back over her shoulder with a confident, seductive gaze. Her left hand loosely grips a white quilted handbag with a gold chain, while her right hand rests on the ornate gold wrought-iron railing, intricate baroque patterns catching the warm light. The steps are pale marble with delicate curved edges, and the background features a beige brick wall with classical relief carvings and a vintage wall sconce casting soft yellow light, creating rich shadows and a warm, intimate atmosphere. A green emergency exit sign glows faintly in the distance, adding a modern contrast. The composition is a mid-shot with the woman on the right, her body forming an elegant S-curve, the golden railing leading the eye upward. Lighting comes from the sconce and overhead diffused sources, highlighting her smooth skin, the texture of the velvet skirt, and the glossy leather of her heels. The scene exudes luxury, classic elegance, and sensual modernity, like a behind-the-scenes moment from a high-fashion editorial, rich in detail and cinematic mood.",
