        {
          "id": "krea2-7b245528aac9ebb4c5e78178",
          "alias": "单女半褪灰毛衣咖啡厅微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a wooden table in a Japanese restaurant, her long black hair tied in two neat braids hanging over her bare chest, bangs lightly brushing her forehead. She flashes a bright, genuine smile, showing perfect white teeth, eyes sparkling with joy and mischief. She wears a light grey sweater unbuttoned and slipping off her shoulders, revealing her full, perky breasts with erect nipples. She holds two cooked king crab legs in her hands, the vibrant orange-red shells glossy and textured, as if inviting a taste. She tilts her head slightly toward the camera, pose relaxed and confident, sharing the sensual pleasure of the food. In the foreground, a black ceramic plate piles high with crab legs on green lettuce, garnished with lemon slices and shredded purple cabbage. The background is a warm yellow wall lined with handwritten Japanese menu slips (“本日特選”, “七〇〇円”, “天ぷら”), evoking a cozy izakaya atmosphere. The composition is a medium shot, the woman centered slightly above, her facial expression clearly visible, food below creating visual balance. Soft directional indoor lighting casts a warm golden tone, with gentle shadows accentuating her curves and the sweater’s texture. The background is subtly blurred, drawing focus to her nude torso and the crab. Overall palette: warm yellow, cream white, orange-red, with dark tableware and green accents. A filmic grain and slight vignette mimic a candid photo, with natural light falloff and a touch of diffused edge softness. The scene feels intimate and lively, as if capturing a quiet moment of shared indulgence—her nakedness and the steaming crab legs blending into a suggestion of feverish delight.",
