          "prompt": "A young woman sits elegantly by the open rear door of a black Mercedes-Benz S-Class sedan. She wears a sheer lilac-and-white ombre dress that flows over her body, the fabric so translucent it reveals the contours of her bare breasts beneath a delicate white lace bralette. The dress has a deep V-neckline that plunges to her navel, and a high slit running up her thigh, exposing her smooth skin. A matching sheer long-sleeve duster hangs open, barely covering her shoulders. Her dark wavy hair falls loosely; she looks down at her lap with a coy, teasing smile, lips slightly parted, eyes half-lidded. Her left hand lightly lifts the hem of her dress, hiking it higher to reveal the inner curve of her thigh. Her right hand rests flat on her leg, fingers spread. She wears light purple flat shoes with floral embroidery. She is rising from the seat, one foot already out of the car, body leaning forward, her back arched, emphasizing her slim waist and the swell of her hips. The car interior is beige leather, with two water bottles in the cup holders. The open door bears the \"Mercedes-Benz\" logo. Multi-spoke silver alloy wheels. The background is a sunlit city street with gray asphalt, slight reflections, blurred distant buildings and another car. A male driver in a black suit, white shirt, and black tie stands beside the car, his expression neutral, eyes forward. Medium shot, subject left of center, car dominating the frame. Natural daylight, soft and even lighting. Colors: black, white, gray with lilac and beige accents. The image has a high-fashion editorial feel with a candid, street-photography authenticity.",
