          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the base of a grand spiral staircase in a luxury mall or hotel, wearing only a black off-shoulder short fur coat, unbuttoned to expose her bare breasts, matched with a tiny black skirt and high black fur boots. She holds a black leather handbag in her left hand and raises a pink phone with her right, capturing a selfie as the screen casts a soft glow on her face. Her long center-parted hair falls naturally, makeup flawless, eyes locked on the screen with confident focus. Lips slightly parted, pale skin, sharp jawline. She stands slightly left of center, body twisted into an elegant S-curve. The foreground shows polished marble floor with dark gray circular patterns reflecting ambient light. The midground features symmetrical gold metal railings and white marble steps forming the spiral staircase, ornate European lines. Background reveals an interior through glass walls, subtle ceiling lights and store displays. Light pours from above, warm and bright, creating a luxurious atmosphere. The palette is black, white, and gold—high contrast yet harmonious. Central symmetry and mirror effects enhance depth. Arcing stairs and her pose guide the eye from base to her body. Main lighting from recessed ceiling spots and ambient sources casts even light on her, soft shadows, subtle reflections on floor and walls. The scene feels elegantly lavish, a curated high-fashion selfie that blends modern urban style with artistic flair, as if shot with a professional camera and wide aperture—rich details, layered depth, full of narrative tension and sensual allure.",
