          "alias": "单女半褪绿旗袍椅上困倦倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman leans sideways against a weathered wooden bench, her long black hair slightly curled with strands falling across her face, a pink orchid tucked behind her ear, its petals fresh and vivid. She holds a single pink petal lightly in her right hand, fingers slender and graceful, posture languid yet elegant, eyes lowered in a hint of melancholy and thought. Her face is delicate, fair skin smooth, lips light pink, nose straight, brows soft, overall gentle and captivating. She wears a deep green modified cheongsam patterned with large pink flowers, the back cut out to show her bare shoulder blades and spine, the fabric clinging to her curves. The top is left partially open, revealing one full breast with a rosy nipple, the other still covered but the silk slipping off her shoulder. The skirt drapes naturally over her hips, the material lustrous like silk. Her left hand rests on the edge of the bench, arm graceful, a simple silver bracelet adorning her wrist. In the foreground, a cluster of purple daisies lies scattered, dense and layered, vibrant against the old wood. Mid-ground, the aged bench shows wear and rough grain. Background: a moss-covered stone wall, irregular stones, deep green and yellow patches, with thin vines climbing the crevices, some leaves brushing her shoulder and hair. Above, broad leaves hang, casting dappled shadows. The scene is lit by warm afternoon sun from the upper left, creating soft shadows on her face, clothing, and ground. The composition follows the rule of thirds, her body forming an S-curve, her gaze directed lower right, leading the eye to the flowers and wall. The right side is left with negative space for balance. Colors: dark green, pink, purple, grey-brown, with a faded, film-grain look, as if captured by an old analog camera. Shallow depth of field focuses on her face and upper body, background slightly blurred, evoking an artistic, romantic, and slightly melancholic nostalgia.",
