et, story-rich moment as if recording a precious memory. The image is finely detailed with rich color layers, blending high-fashion elegance with everyday warmth, as if shot with a professional camera in low light, moderate focal length, good depth of field, natural background blur preserving city details while highlighting the subject. The image is photorealistic, evoking strong presence and emotion. The palette is dominated by black, white, and gray, accented by pink flowers and diamond sparkles, forming a harmonious yet striking visual combination.",
