          "alias": "单女白浴袍庭院戏谑站立",
          "prompt": "A stunning Eastern classical beauty in elaborate Hanfu stands in an ancient courtyard. Her jet-black hair is swept into a high bun adorned with white jade and emerald ornaments; a few strands fall beside her ear, where tassel earrings sway. Her face is exquisitely refined—arched brows like distant hills, clear autumn-water eyes, and rouge-tinted lips parted in a soft, inviting expression. Her porcelain skin gleams in the warm light. She has let the white outer robe slip off her shoulders, baring them and the full curve of her breasts. Her arms cross just beneath her chest, pressing her bare bosom upward, fingers lightly teasing her own skin. The wide sleeves of the fallen robe are embroidered with pale green floral motifs. Beneath, her yellow underdress with green patterns wraps her waist, tied with a long green silk sash, and a layered dark green skirt flows down, soft and lustrous. In the foreground, part of another figure in deep purple with a light blue lining adds a quiet narrative. Mid-ground shows simple wooden railings and steps; background blurs into traditional Chinese wooden doors and eaves. Center composition, shallow depth of field focuses on her face and exposed chest. Sunlight from the right casts warm, soft light, illuminating her profile, sleeves, and hair ornaments, while creating delicate shadows on the ground and fabric. The color palette—pale white, soft green, light yellow, dark brown—is harmonious and poetic. A subtle film-grain and natural exposure enhance realism, capturing a timeless, sensual classical beauty—a single frame of ancient elegance with a modern, erotic allure.",
