          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a vintage-style bed, wearing a red velvet cheongsam that is unbuttoned and pulled open to expose her full, bare breasts. The cheongsam is richly embroidered with dark rose patterns, has a high collar, off-shoulder design, and black fur-trimmed sleeves. Her right hand lightly rests on her chest, fingers gracefully splayed, while her left hand grips the wooden bed frame, long nails painted scarlet. She has lustrous black curly hair with delicate bangs, heavy makeup with full crimson lips and sharp winged eyeliner, her gaze lifted diagonally upward—dreamy, contemplative, subtly seductive. Her pale skin glows, a string of white pearls contrasting against her flushed décolletage. The background features ornate beige wallpaper with gold motifs, heavy gold-brown silk curtains with natural folds and warm light streaming from a left window, casting soft highlights across the scene. The bed is dressed in red silk sheets and matching red pillows. On the nightstand, a white lampshade casts a warm glow, beside a dark ceramic vase holding orange-red flowers. In the foreground, a floral cushion with blue, pink, and white blossoms and tasseled edges. Composition: medium shot, subject center-right, body slightly angled, head tilted back—viewer's focus drawn to her face and exposed upper body. Shallow depth of field blurs background textures. Side-backlighting creates warm rim light on her skin, with deep shadows. Overall palette rich in reds, golds, black, white, and beige, with a grainy, color-shifted film look—intimate, uncommercial, and laden with sensual story.",
