          "id": "krea2-d2681876fc16e39e2188b68f",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙舞台冷淡站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her long black hair in two thick braids falling over her shoulders, strands slightly windswept and clinging to her forehead and cheeks. Her skin is fair and flawless, with heavy, layered eye makeup emphasizing her deep-set eyes—bright, confident, locked on the viewer. She wears a tight black strapless dress with a metal zipper-embellished bodice that cinches her waist, the neckline plunging dangerously low to reveal the swell of her breasts and a generous amount of cleavage. The skirt is a high-waisted mini with wavy ruffled edges trimmed in silver sequins that shimmer under the lights. Her arms are lifted, fingers long with pale nail polish, multiple silver chain bracelets encircling her wrists. She is mid-performance, lips parted, a small microphone clipped near her mouth. In the foreground, she is sharply in focus, centered in a mid-shot that captures her full figure and every detail of her outfit. Blurred male band members play electric guitar and bass on either side, wearing black T-shirts, their movements indistinct. Behind her, a massive LED screen displays abstract black-and-white geometric patterns with flowing light and colored halos at the edges. Colorful confetti—silver, blue, green, purple—fills the air, sparkling and crystalline under the stage spotlight. The lighting is intense and layered: a front-top spotlight fully illuminates her, creating strong contrast with soft shadows behind and below, while cool blue-white light from the screen blends with warm foreground tones, producing dramatic color clashes. The overall palette is black, white, gray with metallic silver and neon accents. Symmetrical composition emphasizes her centrality, with visual lines from her face to her hands and into the dynamic background. The atmosphere is electric, festive, as if capturing a peak moment in a live concert—highly detailed, professional photography-quality.",
