          "alias": "单女蓝制服广场媚态脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a deep blue school uniform jacket, white shirt unbuttoned to reveal her bare chest, red and black striped tie loosely hanging, gray knit vest pushed aside, her golden wavy hair cascading over her shoulders, strands catching the warm sunlight. She holds a light blue book titled \"Daily Exercises\" in one hand, her gaze direct and slightly detached, lips parted softly, a hint of sensuality in her expression. Her other hand grips the strap of a black shoulder bag, posture relaxed yet inviting. The foreground focuses on her face and exposed skin, pale and luminous, subtle makeup enhancing her eyes and lips. The background is a school campus with red brick buildings, neatly trimmed bushes, and a square-tiled plaza. Sunlight streams from the upper right, casting sharp shadows and dappled light across her body and the ground. The composition is a close-up from a slightly elevated angle, her body turned naturally, emphasizing her eyes and the book, blending youth, study, and raw erotic tension. The color palette is blue, white, gray, brown, with golden hair and warm sunlight, creating a fresh, quiet, yet overtly adult atmosphere. The image has a realistic, film-grain quality with shallow depth of field, the background softly blurred, capturing an intimate, candid moment of a student in a sensual, unguarded instant.",
