        {
          "id": "krea2-74f0cf7e16fc20874b70dac5",
          "alias": "单女蓝泳装海滩媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands under a red-and-white striped umbrella outdoors, her long silky brown hair cascading over her shoulders and chest, strands dancing lightly in the breeze. Her face is refined and perfectly contoured, porcelain skin smooth and luminous, with deep-set eyes framed by smoky shadow, thick curled lashes, and a clear focused gaze aimed directly at the lens. Her lips part slightly, painted with a soft pink gloss, the overall makeup elegant yet sensuous. She wears a vintage blue-and-white one-piece swimsuit printed with classic blue-and-white porcelain motifs—tropical leaves, palm trees, and ancient architectural elements—the design uniquely artistic. The suit clings to her curves, accentuating her long slender figure. Her left hand plays with her hair, fingers elegant with neatly trimmed nails in a pale polish; her right hand rests casually on her thigh. Her body is slightly turned, showing off her graceful silhouette. Behind her, a bright ice cream shop displays colorful scoops in the window—yellow, pink, white—with cone models perched above, adding a sweet summer vibe. To the left, a lush green shrub with vivid leaves contrasts with the red umbrella; to the right, another similar red-and-white umbrella creates depth. The composition is centered, the umbrella’s circular rim and lifesaver ring framing her head like a natural halo, drawing all focus to her. Natural sunlight streams diagonally, casting soft shadows across her skin and highlighting the texture of her swimsuit. The overall mood is fresh, sweet, and bursting with summer vacation sensuality. The palette—red, white, blue—strikes a classic note, visually striking yet refined. Details are crisp, from her expression to the patterns on her suit to the background environment, evoking a hyper-real, idealized everyday scene shot with a high-end camera on a sunny afternoon, with slight film grain and natural noise for authenticity. The image radiates youthful vitality and romantic allure, hinting at lazy seaside afternoons with a distinctly NSFW edge—her wet lips, the way the fabric hugs her curves, and the subtle shift in her pose suggest she's aware of her body and unashamed.",
