          "alias": "单女露胸粉西装摄影棚媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a white swivel stool, wearing only an unbuttoned pink tailored suit jacket draped open, a matching mini skirt, sheer fishnet stockings, and transparent stilettos. Her legs are crossed, one toe pointed, revealing the curve of her thigh. Brown hair cascades over bare shoulders, makeup is sultry with smoky eyes and glossy lips, a gentle smirk directed at the camera. Long dangling earrings sway slightly. In the left foreground, a large professional video camera on a metal tripod points at her. Background is a soft light blue gradient backdrop, with a bouquet of pink, white, and yellow roses plus baby’s breath blurred to the right. White reflective floor catches her silhouette. Symmetrical composition, soft overhead lighting, 85mm lens at f/1.8, shallow depth of field, natural skin texture and fabric folds. Tones of pink, white, light blue, with black camera contrast. Clean, modern, professional studio atmosphere with sensual edge.",
