        {
          "id": "krea2-f5dd2fcd2514e6ca8b902319",
          "alias": "单女露胸牛仔公寓站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands indoors, her long black softly curled hair cascading naturally over her shoulders, fair smooth skin, refined delicate features, her gaze calm, deep, and direct, with a serene and elegant expression. She relaxes naturally, body slightly angled to one side, one hand slips inside the pocket of her unbuttoned denim shirt, the other hand holds a minimalist cream handbag. She wears a deep blue washed denim shirt, sleeves casually rolled up, shirt fully open, exposing her bare chest and neckline, no bra, nipples visible against the crisp fabric edge. Her lower body is clad in military green high-waisted shorts, uniquely designed with a large cloth knot and pleated folds at the waist, layered texture, stiff cotton material, the hem flutters slightly with movement. On her feet are white flat sandals with layered petal-like fabric uppers, intricate details providing a soft contrast to the outfit. The subject is centered slightly right, occupying about two-thirds of the frame, full body from feet to head. Foreground shows a light gray geometrically patterned carpet with slightly frayed edges, soft texture, laid over dark brown polished wooden floor with faint reflections. Background is a light beige vertical striped wooden wainscoting, smooth surface, vertical lines enhancing depth. On the right, a faint black doorframe or wall partition; on the left, part of the wall structure visible. Composition centrally symmetrical, subject centered, clean unified background, focus on the person. Light comes from upper left, warm directional sunlight, casting clear shadow contours on wall and floor, soft light transitions, distinct chiaroscuro, creating a quiet morning or evening atmosphere. Highlights and shadows delicately define her face, arms, legs, and clothing, emphasizing skin texture and garment folds. Overall warm tonality: yellow, beige, dark blue, military green, harmonious, conveying a calm, comfortable, everyday aesthetic. Image looks photorealistic, mimicking professional camera quality, slight depth of field blurring the background while keeping subject sharp. Camera angle is standard portrait, slightly downward, capturing full height from head to feet. Style leans toward modern urban lifestyle photography, combining fashion and approachability, as if taken with a high-end mirrorless camera in natural indoor light, no extra decorations, emphasizing the relationship between subject and environment, understated luxury with warmth.",
