        {
          "id": "krea2-1e7be46226a4f69fa9eea638",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣广场害羞站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands barefoot on a wooden staircase indoors, wearing only a loose, soft gray sweater unbuttoned to reveal her bare chest, the geometric blue-and-yellow pattern contrasting with her pale skin; her blue-and-white plaid skirt is hiked up, exposing the curve of her thigh. Her dark brown hair is woven into a thick braid draped over one shoulder, bangs falling across her brow. She leans sideways against the stair railing, one hand resting on the square wooden post, body slightly tilted, soft gaze toward the camera with a shy, inviting half-smile. Warm window light streams from the right, casting gentle side illumination across her face and torso, highlighting skin texture and the folds of the sweater. Background shows a large window with diffused golden glow, blurred wooden textures, natural wood tones. Composition: mid-shot, figure left of center, staircase railing leading diagonally from bottom-left upward. Warm palette: cream, pale gray, wood brown, soft blue. Slight film grain and natural color saturation, creating a cozy, intimate domestic atmosphere with artistic realism.",
