          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a sunlit interior, her beige double-breasted trench coat hanging open to reveal her completely nude body. The coat's classic Peter Pan collar and four vintage tortoiseshell buttons frame her bare skin, the soft matte fabric catching warm light. She wears a matching beret, a black-and-white check scarf tied at the side, and a delicate silver watch on her left wrist. Her dark brown hair is pinned up, loose strands falling around her face. She holds a black quilted leather handbag in one hand and a curled magazine in the other, her gaze direct and confident with a subtle, knowing smile. Soft natural light from a right-side window illuminates her skin, casting gentle shadows. The background features pale beige walls and sheer curtains, with a warm toned lamp on the left. The composition is a medium portrait, centered slightly right, with a blurred background creating depth. The mood is elegant, sensual, and sophisticated, blending high-fashion photography with intimate realism.",
