          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a light gray fabric sofa, her beige double-breasted dress unbuttoned to the waist, the bodice falling open to expose her bare breasts. She wears a beige beret with a black leather brim and plaid silk scarf detail, her hair in a high bun with loose strands framing her face. Makeup is subtle but defined—emphasized eyes, soft lips—with a thoughtful, slightly distant expression. Her right hand rests on the sofa cushion, while her left hand holds a black leather handbag with gold buckle hardware; a silver chain bracelet adorns her wrist. The interior scene features light beige vertical-striped curtains on the left and bright white window sheers on the right, with warm sunlight streaming in, casting soft, natural shadows across her skin. Composition is mid-shot, the woman slightly right of center, body angled toward the camera, head turned to look off-frame. In the foreground, a corner of the sofa and a magazine open to a coffee image and text add depth. Color palette is beige, cream, light gray, with black accents from the hat and bag. Lighting is soft and warm, creating a tranquil, nostalgic mood with the refined detail of professional fashion photography.",
