        {
          "id": "krea2-a38e74848ee37d40b3b6b920",
          "alias": "单女半褪红连衣裙沙发媚态跪拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman kneels on the floor, her body slightly forward as she gazes directly into the camera with confident, clear eyes. She wears a striking red satin dress, but the fabric has been pulled down to expose her full, bare breasts, the tight skirt still hugging her hips and thighs. Her black hair falls in a straight fringe, with a delicate braid on one side adorned with small white flowers. Silver earrings, a thin chain necklace, and multiple rings and a bracelet catch the light. Her pale fingers rest gracefully on her thigh. In the background, a lush arrangement of pink peonies and peonies blooms in soft focus, with the dark red back of a sofa adding depth. Warm, front-left lighting highlights her collarbone, nose bridge, and the curve of her breasts, creating a luxurious, romantic, and slightly mysterious atmosphere. The shot is a close-up, with subtle film grain and natural color saturation, blending artistic elegance with raw sensuality.",
