        {
          "id": "krea2-0755894a98fc02f3dff2ca09",
          "alias": "单女半褪米外套户外坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on rough outdoor concrete, her long black hair cascading softly. She wears a loose, lightweight cream jacket, unzipped and slipping off one shoulder, revealing her bare chest and smooth skin. Her light shorts are hiked up, and she leans forward, one hand gently cupping her chin while the other reaches down to tie her right shoelace on a white sneaker with pale blue accents and a brown rubber toe, paired with white mid-calf socks. Beside her rests a glossy pink-purple hard-shell suitcase with vertical stripes, a matching retractable handle, and four spinner wheels; on top sits a dark grey drawstring backpack with a black leather patch and metal rivets. The background is a pale yellow tiled wall in soft sunlight, dappled with tree shadows, creating warm highlights and deep shadows. Asphalt ground contrasts with smooth concrete steps. Strong side lighting from the upper left illuminates her left side, casting clear shadows to the right. The composition follows the rule of thirds—she is slightly left of center, the suitcase balances the right—guiding the eye from her face to the luggage. Warm tones of pink-lavender, cream, and pale yellow create a serene, travel-themed atmosphere. High detail, realistic texture, as if captured by a professional camera, evoking a fleeting moment of a traveler ready to depart, full of anticipation and freedom.",
