        {
          "id": "krea2-020e2d489f79399246b24b26",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙森林微笑坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a modern light blue curved leather armchair, wearing a white sheer lace dress that clings to her curves, the fabric so translucent it reveals the hard outline of her nipples and the bare skin beneath, the deep V-neckline plunging to her navel, the short hem barely covering the tops of her thighs. Her long dark brown hair cascades over her shoulders, her face delicate with a soft smile, her eyes locking onto the lens with a sultry gaze. In her right hand she holds a clear glass of ruby-red juice, her left hand resting casually on the armchair. She is barefoot on the polished dark wood floor, legs crossed with the right leg forward, emphasizing the long, smooth line of her thighs. The armchair is walnut with a gold metal base, next to a warm yellow floor lamp. Behind her, a large floor-to-ceiling window frames a dense forest, sunlight dappling through the leaves onto the floor. The scene is lit by soft natural daylight and warm indoor light, casting gentle shadows across her skin and the sheer fabric. The composition is centered but slightly off, her body subtly turned, drawing the eye down from her face to her exposed chest, then along her leg to the floor. The overall mood is intimate, sensual, and elegant, with a high-end cinematic look that captures the interplay of nudity and refined luxury.",
