        {
          "id": "krea2-061a81eae31f115646a99863",
          "alias": "单女露胸米西装城市神秘站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless before a blue-and-white striped wall, her beige suit jacket unbuttoned and pushed open to bare her chest, paired with high-waisted shorts, black inner lining visible at the cuffs. She wears black pointed stiletto heels, legs long and straight, body leaned slightly against the wall, right hand holding black sunglasses to her lips, left hand hanging by her side with fingers curled. Her voluminous curly black hair blows in the wind, dynamic. Her sharp features look directly at the camera, lips slightly parted, gaze coolly mysterious. Small silver earrings add detail. The background is deep blue and white horizontal stripes, clean and modern. The floor is dark with reflective surface and white stripe patterns, echoing the wall. Centered composition, figure slightly right, low-angle view emphasizing her height and presence. Soft key light from front-left, even, with subtle shadows, enhancing texture of skin and suit. Overall mood: cold, high-end, urban fashion meets art photography. Tones: beige, black, deep blue, white, strong contrast but harmonious. A refined yet natural image, with slight grain and real reflections, blending professional and amateur aesthetics. The viewer's eye is drawn to her naked torso, then along her body lines and hand gestures to the stripes, then back to her face, creating a complete visual loop.",
