        {
          "id": "krea2-4a3e443bf0ede74b24466a58",
          "alias": "单女露胸红连衣裙霓虹夜景自信侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman glances back over her shoulder, her long black curly hair cascading down to her waist, catching soft light with natural volume and layered strands brushing her shoulders and neck, creating delicate shadow transitions. She is topless, her bare skin smooth and flawless, with a subtle sheen, her spine's elegant curve fully exposed as she turns. One shoulder is bare, collarbone prominent. Her right hand holds a clear glass with pale yellow liquid—white wine or cocktail—fingers long, nails polished in pale pink or nude. Multiple layered gold bracelets on her wrist: chains, rings, charms, some with small plaques or letter pendants, adding vintage luxury. A small black leather crossbody bag hangs from her right shoulder to left hip, sleek modern design with metallic hardware and zipper details. Her pose is relaxed yet confident, head slightly tilted back, eyes meeting the camera with a calm, slightly lazy seduction. Lips parted naturally with a hint of lipstick. Makeup is refined: earth-tone eyeshadow, defined eyeliner, thick lashes, well-groomed brows, straight nose, fair glowing skin. Lighting from front-right creates soft frontal and side illumination, enhancing facial contours and rim light on hair edges. Background is a beige marble-textured wall with regular stone blocks, subtle grain, natural light and shadow variation. Medium portrait shot, subject center-right, body in S-curve dominating the frame. Slight low-angle perspective boosts presence and impact. Warm color palette: the red dress (if any) is discarded, but the warm tones remain from lighting and skin, gold accessories contrast, black bag balances. Atmosphere is warm, intimate, upscale nightlife—a private party or high-end bar moment. Image quality reminiscent of professional studio photography but with a handheld realism, rich details, layered depth, strong visual allure and artistic expression.",
