        {
          "id": "krea2-326669bb611611251240f48e",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙室内害羞站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A young female figure skater stands center ice in an indoor rink, wearing a revealing pink dance dress with a plunging neckline that exposes her cleavage and bare midriff, the bodice tight with scattered rhinestones and pearl embroidery, delicate ruffled shoulder straps. The short skirt is made of multiple layers of sheer tulle, flaring softly as she stands, hands cradling a bouquet of pristine white peonies against her chest, the flowers lush and full, contrasting with the pink fabric. Her jet-black hair is pulled back in a low ponytail adorned with a tiny gold floral crown studded with pearls and glittering accents. Her skin is pale and flawless, features delicate, eyes clear and bright with a hint of shy stillness, lips slightly parted as if about to whisper a story of ice and dreams. She wears flesh-toned skating tights that hug her long, toned legs, showing the outline of the blade at the ankle, hinting she's just finished a routine or waiting for the next jump. The background blurs into the indoor rink environment, with faint yellow lines at the ice edge and vague stadium seating, all out of focus, leaving her as the sharp subject against a soft grey backdrop, creating a dreamy, intimate atmosphere. Medium shot, her body slightly leaning forward, head tilted up, gaze locked directly at the viewer, strong visual pull to her face and the bouquet. Soft diffused front lighting evenly illuminates her skin and highlights the glossy texture of the dress and leaves, no harsh shadows, giving her a natural luminous glow. The overall mood is fresh and bright with a fairy-tale romanticism, capturing a fleeting moment on the ice, blending athletic grace with pure, sensual youth, the scene frozen in time like a dreamlike portrait.",
