        {
          "id": "krea2-711dba49c041b6222be11763",
          "alias": "单女白高跟鞋商店媚态站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands confidently in the center of a bright indoor store display area, wearing a pale pink one-shoulder ruffled minidress with a wide single strap and bow detail, revealing one shoulder and a curve of bare waist, the hem extremely short at upper thigh. She wears white strappy stiletto heels with delicate ankle straps, her long jet-black hair falls smoothly over her shoulders, her lips slightly parted, eyes locked on the camera with a sultry, inviting smile. In her right hand she lightly holds a pink fluffy cat plush toy with pink-and-white fur, red cheeks, and black eyes, topped with a pink bow. Her left hand rests at her side, a gold bracelet catching the light. Her posture is poised yet provocatively sensual, the dress riding up to expose the bare side of her hip and a hint of lace-edged panties. The background shows two curved display shelves: the left shelf reads \"Sinnkawa SINGAPORE\" above rows of pink cat keychains; the right shelf has a cartoon logo and \"SINGAPORE EXCLUSIVE 新加坡限定\" above brown monkey keychains, some with green decorations or necklaces. Soft LED strip lighting inside the shelves creates a warm, bright glow. Below are light blue cabinets and light gray tile floor. The scene is centered symmetrically, shot from a slightly low frontal angle, with even top and shelf lighting, soft shadows, and clean commercial photography quality. The viewer's eye is drawn to the woman's exposed skin and the plush toy before moving to the merchandise. The overall mood is playful, dreamy, modern, yet intensely erotic—a perfect promotional moment for limited-edition collectibles in a boutique store. The image is crisp, detailed, with moderate saturation, capturing a refined, warm, and invitingly seductive commercial style.",
