          "id": "krea2-7c363f6a08cdd2109c547829",
          "alias": "单女露胸白连衣裙樱花媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands under a blooming cherry blossom tree, her head tilted back slightly as she gazes upward at the branches, lips parted in a soft, breathless sigh, her expression one of quiet longing and sensual surrender. Her short hair catches the warm golden light, a few strands falling across her forehead, cheeks flushed with natural pink, skin pale and translucent. She wears a sheer white lace slip dress with delicate straps, the neckline plunging low to reveal the full curve of her breasts and dark nipples visible through the fabric, lace trim at the hem and edges adding a romantic, teasing detail. The dress clings to her body, hinting at the shape of her waist and hips. Her hands rest loosely at her sides, body leaning back in a graceful arch, emphasizing her exposed collarbones and the subtle shadow between her breasts. The composition places her slightly left of center, her gaze drawing the viewer upward to the dense cherry branches overhead. In the foreground, heavy clusters of pale pink blossoms and buds hang low, some petals drifting down in a gentle breeze, creating a sense of motion. The middle ground highlights her nude-torso-through-fabric silhouette, with soft light accentuating her collarbone and shoulder line. The background shows a dark, textured tree trunk, deep in shadow, contrasting with the bright flowers, while distant blurred cherry trees create depth. Shallow depth-of-field focuses on her face and the nearest flowers, the background fading softly. Diagonal visual lines guide the eye from the lower-right branches up to her face, and framing compositions enclose her within natural floral arches. Lighting comes from the upper right, warm and gentle, like early morning or late afternoon sun, filtering through petals to cast dappled light across her face, with highlights on her cheekbones, nose, and forehead, while her neck and shoulders fall into half-shadow, creating subtle chiaroscuro. The overall tone is warm white, pale pink, and gray-brown, with low saturation, evoking a soft, dreamy, slightly melancholic spring atmosphere. No harsh contrast; all elements blend harmoniously, giving a quiet, poetic, and carnal mood. The style mimics a real-life candid handheld shot, with slight film grain and natural exposure, as if capturing a fleeting intimate moment. The entire scene feels like an oil painting, a frozen memory of ephemeral youth and raw natural beauty.",
