          "alias": "单女白礼服摄影棚媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman poses in a flowing white gown with an asymmetric off-shoulder design, the sheer fabric translucent under soft light, revealing the curves of her bare torso and hinting at her nipples. The dress clings to her body, accentuating her waist and hips, with a high slit that exposes her long, toned leg up to the thigh. She wears simple white strappy stiletto heels and a delicate metal bracelet watch. Her hair is elegantly pinned up, with a few loose strands framing her face. She stands sideways, one hand gently resting on her chest, the other on her hip, exuding confident composure. Her gaze drifts into the distance, expression serene and contemplative. A pure black backdrop creates stark contrast, while a subtly textured grey carpet extends beneath. Light slants from the left, casting soft shadows across her face, arms, and the dress’s folds, emphasizing the smooth texture of her skin and the intricate fabric wrinkles. The vertical composition places her slightly right of center, leaving space to showcase her full silhouette. The natural curves of her body and the dress’s trailing hem guide the eye downward. The mood is quiet and sophisticated, with cool-toned lighting that feels both modern and artistic—like a high-fashion studio shot yet capturing an intimate, natural moment. The lens focuses sharply on her, with a blurred background that highlights her form and expression. The palette is predominantly black, white, and grey, accented by subtle metallic glints from her jewelry. Every detail is crisp, from the dress’s folds to the pores of her skin, conveying an elegant, independent, confident femininity. The composition is balanced and rhythmic, the light masterfully applied to blend realism with idealized beauty, resulting in a sensual, high-end aesthetic.",
