          "prompt": "A young blonde woman sits in an outdoor courtyard on a woven rattan chair, topless, wearing only a deep blue pleated mini skirt, her breasts bare and smooth in the warm sunlight. She leans back casually, right hand raised to shield her eyes, fingers spread naturally, her gaze lowered, expression lazy and serene. Her long, wavy blonde hair falls loosely over her shoulders, skin fair and glowing under the sun. The shot is mid-frame, slightly tilted, with the rattan chair's woven texture and red cushion in the foreground, contrasting with the blue skirt. Background shows lush greenery—tall palm trees, dense bamboo, silvery-leafed plants, and ferns—with a gray robotic lawnmower parked on the grass in the distance. Behind, a brown metal fence and faint European-style rooftops. Sunlight streams from upper right, casting warm highlights on her skin and sharp shadows on the ground. Natural, handheld-camera look with slight lens distortion and grain, capturing a lazy, intimate summer afternoon. The scene feels real, candid, and beautifully sensual.",
