          "alias": "单女露胸白衬衫舞台冷淡站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a metal scaffolding stage, wearing a loose white long-sleeve shirt dress unbuttoned down the front, completely exposing her bare breasts and torso. A black polka dot tie hangs loose at the open collar. The sleeves are rolled to her elbows; the hem falls to mid-thigh, revealing her long, slender bare legs. She wears scuffed white casual sneakers. Her thick, naturally wavy black hair spills over her shoulders, strands brushing her face. She gazes directly into the camera with a calm, slightly distant expression, lips barely parted. Her skin is pale and smooth. Her posture is relaxed yet assured, arms hanging at her sides, a gold ring on her left ring finger. In the foreground, a horizontal silver metal pipe stamped “Art Design” is wrapped in black tape. A large black professional stage light with visible branding enters the right foreground. The background is dense silver-gray metal scaffolding with yellow warning tape. The industrial floor shows dust, scratches, and water stains. Farther back, structures fade into deep shadow. Overhead, metal trusses and coiled cables hang under cold white stage lights that cast sharp highlights on her skin and face, leaving the surroundings in harsh chiaroscuro. The low-angle shot emphasizes her height and centrality; diagonal scaffold lines draw the eye upward. The color palette is mostly black, white, and gray with cold metallic reflections and a hint of warm accent. The atmosphere feels cool, dramatic, and candid—like a spontaneous behind-the-scenes snapshot. Slight film grain and motion blur add a raw, amateur quality, preserving real flaws: wall stains, rust spots, tangled cables. The overall mood is calm, detached, and intensely personal, capturing her quiet independence away from the stage noise.",
