        {
          "id": "krea2-433f425ef9391de337efbc93",
          "alias": "单女全裸银高跟鞋公寓媚态倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman leans elegantly against the floor-to-ceiling window of a high-rise apartment, completely nude except for a pair of shimmering silver stiletto sandals strapped around her ankles. Her black hair falls in soft, glossy waves, framing a face with flawless makeup—sharp eyeliner, full lips, and a gentle, focused gaze at the camera. She touches her cheek with one hand, displaying a simple ring and a delicate silver bracelet. Her left leg is bent, foot resting against the glass, emphasizing the long line of her thigh. In the foreground, a light wood railing holds three fresh green apples, their vibrant color contrasting with her bare skin. The midground is dominated by the vast window, revealing a modern city skyline with glass buildings reflecting pale blue sky and distant traffic. The background blurs into a cityscape of layered towers. The composition is slightly low-angle, with her body forming a diagonal line from her face to the window. Natural light pours in from the right, casting soft highlights on her skin and subtle shadows in the folds of the empty room. The overall mood is serene, luxurious, and deeply sensual—like a cinematic still capturing a quiet moment of urban intimacy. The color palette is creams, pale grays, soft blues, and the bright green of the apples, creating a fresh yet opulent feel. The image is photorealistic, rich in detail, and carries a narrative of elegant solitude and desire.",
