        {
          "id": "krea2-0ba7a8e8eaf395418505de42",
          "alias": "单女黑西装舞台困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her long jet-black hair cascades naturally, catching soft highlights as strands lazily brush against her face, adding a languid, sensual allure. Her pale skin is flawless, makeup intensely layered: smoky charcoal eyeshadow, thick curled lashes, and clear bright eyes staring directly at the viewer with a dazed, seductive haze. Her full lips are painted a rich coral, slightly parted as if whispering or about to sing. One hand rises gracefully, fingertips touching her lips, a small pearl ring catching the light—a deliberate, performative gesture. She wears a black pinstripe blazer with subtle shimmer, adorned with gold sequins and beaded patterns on the shoulders and sleeves. Beneath, a crisp white collared shirt is casually tucked in, exposing a sliver of her narrow waist. A black high-waisted cropped top stacks with layered gold chains and pearl necklaces, contrasting cold metal against warm pearls. Her matching black pinstripe trousers sit high on her hips, with metal rivets and frayed edges, blending rebellion with elegance. Large gold hoop earrings with intricate cutouts dangle, refracting tiny sparks. The background is pure black, with only faint blurred stage light silhouettes far away, creating stark chiaroscuro. The main light pours from front and above, simulating professional stage spotlights, focusing on her face and upper body, making her the absolute center. Soft highlights and shadows define her cheeks, neck, and hands, while clothing folds and jewelry catch scattered glints. The shot is a medium-close portrait, slightly angled but head-on, her gaze piercing through the viewer, building intense emotional connection. The camera is slightly low, making her appear taller and more commanding. The overall mood is mysterious, high-fashion, and dramatic. The palette is black, white, and gold, high contrast, visually striking. Warm, concentrated light gives an immersive stage performance feel, capturing a climactic moment. The image is hyper-detailed, crisp, with high-end DSLR realism and the raw spontaneity of a concert snap. Subtle vignette around the edges pulls focus inward, blending artistic beauty with pop-culture visual language.",
