        {
          "id": "krea2-fb09e3ba3d156d2f315fccb2",
          "alias": "单女黑旗袍室内坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a light-colored indoor floor, wearing a sleek black cheongsam with a high collar, gold frog buttons, and gold trim. The three-quarter sleeves hug her arms, and the side slits rise high, exposing her long, black-stockinged legs up to mid-thigh. She poses gracefully in a three-quarter turn, one hand resting on the floor for support, the other casually laid beside her thigh. Her curly black hair falls loose over her shoulders, makeup is polished with dark eyeshadow and lipstick, and she gazes calmly at the camera with clear features and fair, smooth skin. The background is a minimalist space with off-white walls and curtains; a gray stone pot with an oval-leaved plant sits on the left, its foliage drooping naturally, while translucent white gauze curtains on the right let in soft, diffused light. The medium shot positions her slightly to the right, with the plant as a foreground element on the lower left for visual balance. Light comes from the right, mixing natural and indoor light, with smooth tonal transitions and soft shadows, creating a warm, serene atmosphere. The color palette focuses on black, gold, white, and green, with sharp yet harmonious contrast. The image has a realistic, slightly grainy texture with natural exposure, as if captured casually on a phone or ordinary camera—a lived-in yet artistic still moment. The focus is on her upper body and leg lines, highlighting the dress's details and the beauty of the human form, conveying a low-key elegance blending modern and traditional Eastern aesthetics.",
