          "alias": "单女米外套窗边媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands by an indoor doorframe, wearing a short, double-breasted beige coat, unbuttoned to reveal her black lace lingerie and bare skin beneath. The coat's Peter Pan collar and three-quarter sleeves with tightened cuffs frame her figure; the deep brown buttons remain fastened only at the waist, drawing the eye to her curves. A matching beige beret with a black striped brim sits atop her casually pinned hair, with loose strands brushing her cheek. She gently touches the hat's brim with her left hand, while her right hand holds an open magazine featuring the Caravelle Times cover and food photos. She wears glossy black leather heeled ankle boots with metallic buckles and zippers, exposing slender skin at the ankle. Her body turns slightly toward the camera, head tilted, eyes locked forward with a thoughtful, sensual gaze. The indoor setting shows a white doorframe with silver hinges and handle, pale walls, wooden floor, and a gray-beige rug. Soft, diffused light from a left-side window creates gentle shadows and highlights her silhouette. The composition is a medium shot, centered slightly right, with the door framing her figure. The scene feels like a refined, intimate fashion portrait with a natural, everyday sensuality, focusing on her exposed décolletage and the magazine. Colors are warm beige, cream, black, and soft highlights.",
