        {
          "id": "krea2-e9d3867465d6f25327891cba",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a pedestrian crossing in a city street, her long black hair falling naturally, shimmering slightly in the sunlight. Her face is delicate with clear makeup, deep layered eye makeup, soft full lips, giving off an elegant and cool vibe. She wears a black long coat with a smooth, slightly leather-like texture, gold metal button decorations at the cuffs and waist, paired with black leather gloves that fit snugly, revealing a small gold accent at the wrist. Over her shoulders drapes a thick, fluffy white fur scarf with soft, rich detail and irregular grey spots, adding a wild, luxurious touch. She dons oversized pearl earrings, layered in different sizes, gleaming with a warm luster. She stands slightly sideways, arms crossed in front of her chest, pose dignified and confident, gazing softly at the camera with a slight smile. The composition centers on her, mid-shot, filling most of the frame. The background features modern European-style buildings with beige stone facades, tall pillars, symmetrical dark-framed windows, trimmed hedges, and leafy trees with bright green and some yellowing leaves, hinting at autumn. The street is gray asphalt with clear white crosswalk lines. Light falls from the upper right, casting long shadows, soft and warm, suggesting afternoon sunlight. The sky is clear. The color palette is mostly black and white, accented by warm yellow sunlight and green leaves, creating contrast yet harmony. The crosswalk and buildings create depth, with the subject slightly right of center, body tilted for dynamic balance. The lighting is exquisite, with highlights on face, hair, and fur, smooth shadows adding volume. The image feels like a professional fashion editorial or a candid street shot, rich in detail: the fluffiness of fur, smoothness of leather gloves, texture of stone, all conveying a sense of luxury mixed with everyday realism, as if you can feel the autumn breeze and warm sunlight. Her coat is slightly open at the front, revealing a glimpse of bare skin and the curve of her breasts, the fur draped casually, her posture suggestive of quiet confidence and sensuality.",
