        {
          "id": "krea2-dc5e5c283b9e46a0a2977158",
          "alias": "单女半褪白连衣裙室内戏谑倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman leans gracefully against a classical interior corner, wearing an elegant white short dress with a deep V-neckline and delicate lace trim, thin shoulder straps, and a high-waisted cut. The dress features voluminous ruffled layers forming a flared hem with an asymmetrical design that adds dynamic motion. Her black hair is styled in a neat side French braid adorned with small white flower accessories, with a few loose strands falling softly to frame her face. She wears minimal necklace, earrings, and a slim bracelet. She has on pale floral-patterned lace stockings and light pink ballet flats with ribbon bows at the toes. Her pose is elegant: one hand lightly touches her hip, the other rests against the textured wall. She gazes directly at the camera with a soft yet confident expression. The dress is slightly pulled down to reveal a teasing glimpse of her cleavage and the curve of her breasts, while the lace stockings and footwear add a sensual contrast. The background features a beige textured wall with natural patina, dark wooden baseboards, vertical panel lines on the right, and dark brown hardwood floors with visible grain. The composition centers her slightly left, with soft, warm light falling from the left, creating gentle shadows that emphasize the fabric's texture and her body lines. The overall color palette is white, beige, and brown, giving a high-end, artistic fashion-photography feel, intimate and romantic, with a touch of elegant eroticism.",
