        {
          "id": "krea2-39e7f307778718a2818f898c",
          "alias": "单女毛衣酒店媚态站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the hallway of a classical European building, wearing a striking black mesh see-through ensemble—a geometric-knit transparent short-sleeve top and matching high-waist skirt, with a black bikini underneath barely concealing her breasts and crotch. The top has a cut-out cross neckline and an irregular wavy hem; the sheer fabric glistens in the warm light, revealing every curve. The skirt ends at mid-calf, with tiny green accents at the edge. Her hair is in a sleek high bun, makeup flawless, eyes locked on the camera with calm confidence. Her right hand holds a matte burgundy handbag, left hand hangs naturally. She stands with a slight S-curve, one hip pushed out, body turned revealing the outline of her nipples through the mesh. Background: cream walls, arched black-framed windows showing Parisian stone facades, reflections in the glass creating a symmetrical composition. Ornate plaster reliefs of curling flowers and geometric patterns adorn the upper corners; classical meander border on the ceiling. A spherical honeycomb sconce on the right wall casts warm golden light, creating soft halos on wall and floor. Light gray marble tiles with dark grout lines show clear shadows and gradients. Warm yellow lighting spotlights the woman, emphasizing her silhouette and the delicate mesh texture. Composition: rule of thirds, figure on right, left space filled by mirror and window view, guiding the eye across her full-body stance and confident expression. The scene blends modern high-fashion with classical architecture, feeling both like a polished editorial shoot and a casual moment captured in a luxury hotel or art gallery—a cinematic freeze-frame of elegance, independence, and sensual sophistication.",
