          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a dim backstage area, her glossy, long black curls cascading naturally over her shoulders and chest—healthy, deep brown with subtle waves and volume. Her skin is fair and smooth, facial features chiseled and delicate: sharp, elongated brows, heavy, flawless eye makeup with sharp eyeliner, thick, long lashes, large bright eyes with a deep, focused, confident gaze. Her full lips are painted vivid crimson red, slightly parted in a seductive smile. She wears a sparkling silver tiara adorned with tiny crystals or gems, catching the light with a regal gleam. Her dress is a black off-shoulder, V-neck, tight ribbed knit mini—fabric hugging every curve, revealing her collarbones, cleavage, and the top of her chest. The short hem falls to mid-thigh, accentuating long legs clad in sheer black stockings with a subtle sheen, held up by wide black garter straps. She has long, dangling tassel earrings made of small beads, swaying slightly with her movement. Behind her left, a few gray metal cases, scuffed and weathered, marked with a \"6\". On the right, a white warning sign with Korean text \"접근금지\" and a cartoon figure in a helmet making a \"stop\" gesture, inside a red circle. Further back, stage equipment, metal scaffolding, wires, and lights add a cluttered, realistic feel. The composition centers her slightly left of frame, body angled slightly to the side, head straight on, eyes locking onto the viewer. Foreground shows her upper body and partial legs; midground includes her full figure, cases, and sign; background fades into distant stage gear. Lighting is soft from above and front—warm, intimate stage lights that illuminate her face and body clearly, casting gentle shadows for depth. Tones are mostly black and gray, accented by her red lips and silver crown, creating high contrast. The overall mood is sexy, confident, and luxurious yet raw—like a high-resolution real photograph, rich in detail, natural saturation, and artistic 