        {
          "id": "krea2-2bb03b9bae9b00d2d40fa75b",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑旗袍广场媚态站立持灯",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a dim Zen-inspired interior, her body topless except for a sheer black modified qipao, open at the front to fully expose her bare breasts and smooth skin. The fabric's delicate sheen catches the warm lantern light, and a star-shaped crystal ornament glitters at her waist. She holds a black lace folding fan in her right hand, the intricate cutouts casting shadows on her skin. Her left hand hangs naturally, long fingers with pale polish, a simple chain bracelet and ring. Black high-heeled sandals with metal buckles complete the look. A wall of white paper lanterns glows softly behind her, their vertical rows creating a dramatic backdrop. A square floor lamp emits warm light to the left. Dark gray tiles and scattered white pebbles reflect highlights. The medium shot captures her slightly turned posture, head angled toward the camera, eyes direct and mysterious, exuding a sensual, film-noir elegance. The scene balances black, white, and gold tones, with a shallow depth of field (85mm equivalent) isolating her nude torso against the soft-focus lantern grid. The overall mood is intimate, poetic, and charged with a subtle erotic tension.",
