        {
          "id": "krea2-6eabf2ba7f9335b506cd1364",
          "alias": "单女白丝袜椅上自信坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits bare-breasted on a pale beige carpet, wearing only white sheer pantyhose and white sneakers, with a black cat-ear headband perched on her dark brown hair that falls naturally over her shoulders. Her makeup is precise, with defined eyeliner and soft lip color, small silver stud earrings. Her hands are folded in her lap, posture elegant and composed, eyes warm and direct at the camera. The background is a pale beige wall with white pleated curtains creating soft wave textures. To the left stands a classic dark brown wooden chair with intricate carved backrest and yellow-and-white striped upholstered seat. Soft light enters from the right, casting a warm, bright indoor atmosphere. The overall palette is white and beige with touches of black and pink. The composition is balanced, with the figure slightly right of center; the foreground shows the carpet and lower body, midground includes the full figure and part of the chair, background the wall and curtains. Visual focus is on the model's face and exposed upper body, with natural light transitions and soft shadows, evoking a serene, elegant, intimate home portrait style, high-quality cinematic feel with fine texture and layered depth, a quiet, poetic afternoon moment.",
