        {
          "id": "krea2-82b54170d4c78ecddf8f1edf",
          "alias": "单女女仆银女仆装沙发忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A silver-haired girl in a revealing black maid dress reclines sideways on a luxurious red velvet armchair. Her short lavender hair gradients into soft blue-purple highlights, straight bangs resting above her brows. Her deep, slightly melancholic eyes meet the lens with a cold, mysterious allure, lips pressed thin. The sleeveless dress features cascading lace and ruffled trim at the neckline and shoulders, with a deep blue scalloped hem. A wide white apron tied at her chest is adorned with delicate lace and a bow, now slightly loosened to hint at the swell of her breasts. Black elbow-length gloves cover her arms, one hand resting casually on the armrest, the other trailing suggestively down her thigh. Black thigh-high stockings are fastened with deep blue lace garters just above her knee. The backdrop is heavy crimson velvet curtains with rich folds, soft light filtering from behind, creating dramatic chiaroscuro. The ornate European-style chair boasts gold filigree and carved roses, a fluffy white faux-fur cushion at its base. She sits center-right, body angled, head turned slightly, inviting eye contact. Medium shot with 85mm portrait lens, focus sharp on her face and upper body, background softly blurred. Strong side lighting from the left accentuates her skin’s texture and the fabric’s depth, leaving the right side in shadow. The palette is deep red, black, white, and blue, high contrast, evocative of Gothic romanticism. The scene exudes a cinematic stillness, charged with sensuality and narrative.",
