        {
          "id": "krea2-58c2e2b611400aa9c9ac1d62",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫商场媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a modern commercial stairwell, wearing a white blouse with the top buttons undone, revealing the curve of her cleavage and a black lace bra beneath, paired with a tight black miniskirt that rides high on her thighs. Her hair is swept up into a sleek high bun, black-rimmed glasses framing her eyes. She gently adjusts the glasses with her right hand, gazing directly into the lens with a cool, seductive confidence. In her left hand she holds a green cup with a white lid, while her other hand grips a pink phone; a black leather handbag hangs from her shoulder. Her body is turned slightly to the left, head tilted, exuding a relaxed, effortlessly sexy elegance. In the foreground, her figure is crisp and dominant. The midground features a broad staircase ascending upward, pale gray steps edged with blue decorative stripes, red metal railings contrasting with silver stainless steel handrails. \"Galaxy S26 Series\" posters line both sides of the stairs. Behind her, a massive purple wall bears white \"Galaxy\" lettering, a glowing electronic display casting soft violet light, and a \"VGI\" sign visible in the distant blurred interior. The scene is lit with bright, even overhead cool white light blending with the purple glow, creating a futuristic tech atmosphere. Center composition places her slightly below center; the diagonal lines of the stairs add depth and dynamic movement. Lighting is delicate, with even illumination on her face, soft shadows, and crisp fabric creases. The color palette is dominated by white, black, and purple, accented by red and green for strong visual contrast. The overall image feels like a candid, stylish moment captured in a mall with a professional camera, with subtle film grain and natural noise, cool yet warm tones, rich detail, and bold artistic impact.",
