          "alias": "单女全裸靴子花园戏谑蹲过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches on a garden path, wearing a low-cut olive green strappy sundress with one thin strap slipped off her shoulder, baring the curve of her breast and a teasing hint of nipple. She sports thick-soled fluffy boots and a white polka dot headband, her long hair loose over her shoulders. Her makeup is sultry: red lips parted, eyes half-lidded, gazing seductively at the camera. Her left hand toys with the collar of her dress, pulling it lower, while her right hand gently holds a small white ceramic duck figurine. The pose is relaxed but provocative, exuding lazy, pastoral sensuality. In the foreground, colorful potted flowers – purple and pink blooms among green leaves – and a terracotta pot. In the midground, a white wooden storage cabinet with clay pots, a succulent, and an orange vintage telephone; the cabinet door is ajar, revealing more gardening tools. To the right, a wooden-handled iron fork leans against the wall next to a woven rattan chair. The background is dense green shrubs and foliage, with warm afternoon sunlight filtering through leaves, casting dappled shadows on her skin and the ground. Low-angle shot, subject off-center right, composition layered: visual flow from the flowers and duck up to her exposed cleavage, then to the cabinet and greenery. Soft, bright light with a hazy, golden hour glow. The scene feels like a candid snapshot of a lazy summer afternoon: film grain, natural color transitions, dominant greens and creams accented by purple flowers and warm orange pottery. The objects are casually yet deliberately arranged, blending her nude-toned skin with the environment. Shadows and highlights play across her bare shoulder, the curve of her waist, and the glossy ceramic duck, enhancing depth and realism. The overall mood is tranquil, inviting, and quietly erotic – a carefully composed pastoral portrait celebrating simple, sun-drenched intimacy.",
