          "alias": "单女黑西装广场微笑注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long, pale blonde hair tied in a low ponytail, a few loose strands falling across her forehead, her skin fair and luminous. She wears subtle, flawless makeup with defined eyes, thick curled lashes, and soft pink glossy lips. Her gaze is focused and confident, turned slightly to the right, a faint smile on her lips. She is dressed in a tailored black blazer with matte finish, sharp shoulders, and four circular metal buttons at the cuffs—worn open, with nothing underneath, revealing her bare chest, collarbone, and neck. In her right hand she holds a white tube of skincare product with black lettering and a brand logo, her fingers long and elegant with light gray gradient nails and two silver rings (one thin, one wide). She holds the product at chest level, directly in front of her exposed cleavage, making it the visual center. In the foreground, a smooth light wood table reflects her and the product; other blurred bottles (a brown glass jar, black-capped containers) are scattered on it. The midground shows a blurred audience of people holding up phones to take photos, one woman with green-streaked hair in dark clothing. In the background, a light wood lattice wall with geometric square panels, with a mirror or glass structure faintly visible behind it. The composition is a close-up portrait, slightly tilted, drawing the eye from her face down to her hand and product, then to the table and crowd. Lighting comes from a soft front-left source, creating natural highlights and shadows on her body and face, with warm background tones contrasting the cool black blazer. Overall color palette: black, white, wood tones, accented by green hair and warm light spots. The image looks crisp and real, as if shot with a professional camera, blending high fashion with everyday authenticity.",
