          "alias": "单女透视黑手套楼梯媚态倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A sultry woman in a black sleeveless minidress leans seductively against the ornate spiral staircase, her long glossy black hair cascading over bare shoulders. Her face is exquisite, with a lazy, intense gaze into the lens, head slightly tilted, showcasing the elegant arch of her neck. She wears a long black leather glove on her right hand, fingertips resting lightly on the gold-and-black wrought-iron balustrade, while her left hand hangs loose at her side, posture relaxed yet charged with tension. The short black dress is dotted with delicate white geometric patterns, its hem flaring with fluffy feather trim that lifts slightly as she arches her back, hinting at the curve of her hips. Black sheer stockings cling to her long, streamlined legs, ending in shiny stiletto pumps, one foot poised on a crimson-and-beige patterned carpeted step. The staircase is draped in heavy brocade, intricate floral motifs, classic European palace style. The brass handrail glows softly, contrasting with dark iron scrollwork—curling acanthus leaves, spirals, and gilded ornaments. Behind her, a tall stained-glass window with blue-violet light bathes the scene in dreamy, mysterious hues. The wall is pale cream, a vintage sconce casting warm yellow light on her face and décolletage, creating dramatic chiaroscuro. Medium shot, she stands slightly right of center, body forming an elegant S-curve that echoes the staircase's upward sweep. The composition leads the eye along the railing then back to her exposed skin, where the dress's low neckline reveals the swell of her breasts. The interplay of warm interior light and cool window light gives a luxurious, melancholic cinematic feel. Color palette: black, gold, red, cream, with blue accents from the glass. The texture is like high-end fashion photography with a soft-focus lens, grainy film, and subtle shadow transitions—a freeze-framed moment of refined eroticism, real yet dreamlike.",
