        {
          "id": "krea2-f1398b6ad0d195d244040709",
          "alias": "单女露胸红短裙舞台戏谑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A topless young woman sits center stage, wearing only the lower half of a red stage outfit—a high-waisted ruffled miniskirt densely covered in sequins and beads, her bare chest exposed, hands gently pressing against her cheeks with fingers spread, head tilted slightly, eyes locked directly on camera with a focused, teasing expression, lips parted as if singing or enticing the viewer. Her long dark brown hair falls naturally with straight bangs, a professional black headset microphone visible on her ear. A simple silver bracelet adorns one wrist. The background is a giant LED screen displaying blurred colorful abstract patterns and the white text \"LE SSERAFIM CHAEWON,\" with subtle pixel noise and lens flares. Stage lighting in purple and blue casts soft gradients and highlights across her skin, the remaining costume, and her hair, emphasizing curves and texture. The composition is a close-up on her torso and face, with midground out-of-focus stage equipment like speakers and stands, while the entire background is washed in saturated screen light and ambient glow. Dominant red of the skirt contrasts sharply with the cool-toned backdrop, creating visual tension. The image has a polished, professional photography quality mixed with the raw aesthetic of live event capture.",
