        {
          "id": "krea2-cb63516fc806c6445e255dae",
          "alias": "单女露胸桥媚态注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a sensual half-body portrait, wearing a deep blue velvet wide-brim hat tilted slightly to reveal her forehead, soft waves of dark brown hair spilling from under the brim. Her calm, deep eyes gaze directly at the camera with a subtle light reflection, lips coated in soft rose lipstick, full and defined. Flawless skin with a natural glow, cheeks lightly flushed, straight nose, delicate and classical features. She wears gold flower earrings with tiny chains and sparkling gems, catching light as she moves. Around her neck, a matching deep blue velvet choker adorned with a layered, detailed rose. Her shoulders are bare, skin pale and smooth; a small cluster of white orchids rests diagonally on her left shoulder, flowers creamy white with pale yellow centers, thin stems and green leaves adding freshness. Close-up composition, head slightly turned to the right, eyes front. Background is dark green and blurred, hinting at foliage, creating depth. Soft light from front left illuminates her face, highlights on forehead, nose bridge, cheekbones, lips, shadows naturally under cheeks and neck. The atmosphere is quiet, elegant, with a vintage artistic feel, as if shot with a professional camera and wide aperture in natural light. Cinematic quality, moderate color saturation, cool yet warm tones, extremely fine detail in skin texture, velvet fibers, translucent petals, and metallic reflections. NSFW: The image is topless, her breasts fully exposed, nipples slightly erect, the orchid arrangement partially covering one breast but leaving the other fully visible, adding a sensual yet artistic touch.",
