        {
          "id": "krea2-84edc3bcac8704573d6b602f",
          "alias": "单女露胸桌边微笑坐侧头（2）",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a pristine white table, her black hair swept into a loose low bun with soft strands falling across her forehead and ears. She is topless, her bare breasts gently exposed, skin pale and smooth, the delicate collarbones and subtle curves highlighted by soft left-front lighting. She rests her chin on her right hand, fingers slightly curled, while her left hand lifts to touch her right shoulder, a relaxed yet inviting pose. Her gaze drifts to the right, lips parted in a tender, knowing smile, eyes half-lidded with a serene, introspective expression. A small gold hoop earring catches the light. The composition is a mid-shot, head slightly tilted, body turned to form an elegant S-curve. The background is a plain light gray wall, with a blurred dark shape to the left. The scene is minimalist modern interior. Light from the left front creates natural chiaroscuro, with highlights on cheekbones, nose bridge, and exposed breasts, shadows soft and nuanced. The white tabletop in the foreground reflects faint light. The color palette is white, cream, light gray, warm skin tones, and gold accents. The atmosphere is clean, serene, elegant, with a cinematic art-photography quality, capturing a quiet, intimate moment.",
