        {
          "id": "krea2-b05e452de40b9a623e870c64",
          "alias": "单女湿身橙连衣裙街道忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands alone on a rain-soaked city street at night, her body turned slightly sideways under a transparent umbrella. Her long black hair clings wetly to her cheeks and neck, loose curls catching the dim amber light. She tilts her head back, gazing upward into the distance with deeply dazed eyes, lips parted just a little, a faint expression of melancholy and thought crossing her soft, pale face. The skin is cool-toned, almost translucent in the shadows, fragile and real. She wears a thin orange-red spaghetti-strap dress, the straps so narrow they barely hold, the light fabric molding to her curves and revealing the heat of her skin underneath; the dress is damp, clinging to her breasts, the nipples clearly visible through the thin material. Her arm hangs loosely at her side, hand gripping the clear handle of the umbrella. Raindrops bead across the umbrella's surface, catching warm yellow streetlight halos and scattering tiny glittering highlights. The background is blurred—a quiet street, wet pavement reflecting neon signs and headlights, a few golden street lamps casting soft glows through the rain curtain. The scene is empty except for occasional passing cars leaving brief light trails. The whole atmosphere is quiet, lonely, intimate. Close-up composition: the woman fills the left two-thirds of the frame, her face in profile, gaze directed upward-right, leading the eye into an unseen distance. Foreground focuses on the umbrella's metal frame and raindrops, enhancing immersion. Midground: the semi-transparent shelter of umbrella and figure. Background: out-of-focus city night. The light comes from a high street lamp on the right, creating side-backlighting that outlines her silhouette and carves subtle chiaroscuro on her face, her shadowed skin deep and dimensional. The raindrop reflections on the umbrella and ground add motion and wetness. The overall image has a cinematic film-grain quality, moderate grain, low but layered saturation, slight vignetting and subtle lens distortion, like a snapshot from an old camera. The mood is poetic, tension-filled, capturing a private night moment of waiting, memory, self-conversation—a silent monologue, still and deep.",
