        {
          "id": "krea2-23c88be81ad3054acc34b6b6",
          "alias": "单女露胸牛仔商店媚态坐呼喊",
          "prompt": "A topless young woman sits astride a vintage Harley-Davidson motorcycle in a gritty auto repair shop. She wears ripped jeans and large circular earrings, her long hair flowing, mouth wide open as if shouting or singing. Her bare breasts are fully exposed as she leans forward gripping the handlebars with powerful, expressive arms. Warm yellow top-light casts dramatic highlights on the silver fuel tank, chrome engine, and exhaust pipes, with sharp metal reflections. In the midground, a blue wall and orange metal shelves are stacked with car tires, rims, seats, and bumpers; an old Samsung monitor and plastic-wrapped items clutter the background. Foreground includes the black grip and dashboard. Composition: close-up diagonal from her face along the bike’s rightward line. A red pillar on the left and monitor edge on the right frame the scene. Gritty, amateur camera aesthetic with slight noise and lens distortion, cool-toned yet warm-lit. Color palette: red, black, silver, blue. The atmosphere fuses punk street culture, rebellious youth, and raw industrial realism, capturing a fleeting moment of unbridled freedom and sensual confidence.",
