        {
          "id": "krea2-7838c238a873a633c4a99e6b",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑连衣裙公园忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a dark green park bench, her long, glossy black curls cascading over her shoulders and framing her face. Her skin is porcelain-pale and flawless, with sharp, delicate features. She stares directly at the lens with a lazy, confident smirk, lips parted and glistening. Her black satin slip dress is unbuttoned at the bodice, the fabric hanging open to fully expose her bare breasts — nipples hard, skin smooth. The dress cinches at her waist with metal buttons, hugging her curves, while the high slit rides up past her right thigh, revealing bare skin almost to the hip. One hand rests casually on the bench back, the other lies on her thigh, fingers slender with sheer nude polish. A delicate necklace with a tiny purple gem grazes her collarbone; small stud earrings catch the soft light. To her left, a white shopping bag with black handles sits on the bench. The background is a dense, layered forest of emerald and teal, with a patchy yellow-green meadow and a few wooden posts and a fence in the distance. The sky is overcast, soft gray-white, casting even, diffused light. The scene is cool-toned — blacks, greens, grays — evoking a quiet, slightly melancholic mood. Composition places her just left of center, with the bench and bag in the foreground, the forest receding behind. The image has a subtle film-grain texture, as if snapped on a casual afternoon, blending urban fashion with natural stillness, intimate and story-rich.",
