        {
          "id": "krea2-069acd1ebf01f83d0e48bc97",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫酒店微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman with shoulder-length brown hair, naturally fluffy and slightly wavy, straight bangs covering her forehead, gazes warmly at the camera with a soft, knowing smile, delicate and fair skin, exuding a gentle yet confident allure. She wears a white vertical-striped long-sleeve shirt, top buttons undone, revealing a hint of black lace bra and the curve of her breasts; a thin black-and-white tie loosely draped; a black sleeveless knit vest discarded aside, leaving her shoulders bare. Her high-waisted two-tone skirt combines pale pink and dark gray panels, hugged by a thin black leather belt emphasizing her slim waist. Her long legs are crossed and sheathed in sheer black stockings, ending in transparent pearl-decorated stiletto heels with sparkling ankle chains. She sits elegantly sideways on a round marble-topped dark table, right knee bent and lifted inward, left leg dangling, right hand resting lightly on the tabletop, left hand caressing her own thigh. Her body leans forward slightly, head tilted, accentuating the graceful curves of her torso. In the foreground, a gray-and-white checkered fabric chair with black piping partly obscures her lower leg, creating depth. The table holds stacked books with colorful spines and a sleek black cylindrical lamp. Behind her, a light gray wall displays two framed abstract art pieces in warm tones; white vertical blinds on the left let in soft natural light, casting gentle, diffused shadows across her skin and clothes. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with the woman slightly right of center, making direct eye contact with the viewer. Shot from a low angle, slightly from the side, the overall palette is black, white, and gray, accented with pink and warm yellows—a sophisticated, cool yet tender modern atmosphere, like a high-end hotel suite or private study. The image is crisp, richly textured, with refined lighting, reminiscent of a high-fashion editorial.",
