        {
          "id": "krea2-134b3386a78dbc6d0f1e97d8",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服摄影棚媚态注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman poses in a sheer black velvet gown, the asymmetrical off-shoulder cut sliding down to expose one bare breast, her nipple hardened in the cool studio light. The dress clings to her curves, a high slit riding up past her upper thigh, revealing smooth, pale skin. Black stiletto heels add a glossy shine. A diamond necklace sparkles across her collarbone, a single gem nestling between her breasts. One hand rests on her hip, the other dangles loosely. Her gaze is direct, confident, slightly haughty. Behind her, a cream wall features two vintage photos: a black-and-white man in a tuxedo (\"1925, Paris\") and a FRED boutique storefront from 1960s Paris. A gold shelf holds a dark vase with white and yellow blossoms. Soft flash lighting highlights every detail: the velvet texture, the sheen of skin, the delicate shadow between her legs. The scene feels like a high-end jewelry launch: opulent, romantic, and intensely erotic.",
