        {
          "id": "krea2-835f3256b4402af66d2337bf",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙桌边媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a cosmetics counter, wearing an elegant white one-shoulder dress with a large silk bow at the shoulder, the fabric glossy and smooth. The hemline falls mid-thigh, accentuating her long, bare legs. Her skin is pale and flawless, features finely sculpted, dark hair pulled back to reveal her high forehead and clear facial lines. She gazes directly into the lens with a soft, sensual focus, lips slightly parted in a faint, inviting smile. Her hands rest naturally on the counter edge; a simple ring adorns her left finger, a delicate bracelet on her right wrist. Her nails are painted deep red, echoing the products behind her. The counter surface is light-toned, neatly displaying makeup items such as foundation, cushions, and lipsticks in modern bottles of white, pink, and red with metallic caps. She stands slightly off-center, body angled, head facing the camera, posture elegant and confident. The background shows retail shelving filled with identical cosmetics, forming geometric patterns, with red decorative strips contrasting white walls and ceiling. Bright linear LED lighting above bathes the scene in uniform, soft illumination. Composition follows the rule of thirds, with the woman dominating the frame; the repeating background elements add depth. A slightly low angle captures her from waist up, emphasizing her proportions and dress details. Her gaze draws the viewer in, while her hand placement suggests a subtle, inviting gesture. The overall mood is bright, clean, and luxuriously commercial, with a warm palette of whites, creams, pinks, and reds. The lighting highlights the smooth texture of her skin and the sheen of the dress fabric, creating a high-fashion advertisement aesthetic with a realistic shopping-moment intimacy. Color saturation is moderate, transitions natural – an idealized yet genuine beauty.",
