        {
          "id": "krea2-c4d3060f4135bcd20214542b",
          "alias": "单女半褪棕T恤室内媚态脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman takes a selfie indoors, wearing a deep brown long-sleeve top over a light brown tank top, with her hair loosely tied back and a few strands falling across her forehead and cheeks. One eye is covered by a beige eyepatch secured with a white thin strap, looking realistic and casual. Her visible eye gazes at the camera with a playful, confident expression, lips slightly puckered in a cute pout. Both hands reach forward with fingers curled like claws, mimicking an animal or playful gesture. The setting is a simple indoor wall in soft light beige with slight texture, a gray edge of furniture or appliance visible in the corner, creating a private, domestic atmosphere. The close-up composition fills the frame with her upper body, head tilted slightly to one side, body turned slightly, dynamic angle. Soft front-left lighting casts even illumination, minimal shadows, warm tones of brown, beige, and skin color. The image has a slight grain and low-resolution feel, as if taken with an ordinary phone camera, edges slightly blurred with light noise, enhancing realism and candidness. The mood is relaxed, humorous, and cozy, capturing an ordinary yet charming moment. The outfit is slightly disheveled, the top slipping off one shoulder, revealing the curve of her collarbone and a hint of bare skin, adding a subtle sensual touch.",
