        {
          "id": "krea2-f135dc0a60c5705997b9e1f5",
          "alias": "单女半褪白连衣裙衣帽间媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a bright dressing room, wearing a delicate white lace dress that is slightly sheer, with the bodice slipping off one shoulder to reveal a bare breast. The skirt is layered like soft clouds, puffy and voluminous, with wide ruffled sleeves in an elegant court style. Her dark hair is pinned in a high updo, with loose strands falling naturally around her forehead and cheeks, adding a soft, playful touch. She is slightly turned toward the camera, her left hand gently pulling at the hem of the skirt, her right hand resting casually on her hip, pose relaxed and sensual. Her eyes gaze softly at the lens, lips curved in a subtle, knowing smile—pure yet seductive. Behind her, a large vanity mirror covered with circular ring lights casts soft, even white glow, creating a dreamy bokeh of blurred light spots. Light streams from the back and side, defining her silhouette, smoothing her skin texture, with an overall palette of white and light beige for a minimalist, high-end feel. Medium close-up composition: she stands slightly left of center, body tilted, chin lifted, making direct eye contact with the viewer. Foreground shows her upper body and part of the skirt; midground captures her full figure and surroundings; background is soft-focus lights and mirror reflections. Visual lines are guided by her gaze and hand gesture, drawing attention to her facial expression and the sheer fabric of the dress. The lighting is warm and bright, with a strong theatrical, ceremonial atmosphere, as if capturing a quiet, intimate moment right before stepping on stage. The entire scene radiates youthful vitality, an erotic innocence, and a hint of nostalgia, like a professional fashion photo but with genuine, spontaneous emotion. Tones are clean, layered, and richly detailed, blending commercial polish with natural warmth.",
