          "prompt": "A young woman with short black hair tied in a low ponytail, stray strands brushing her cheek, stands in a side profile, her head bowed and eyes half-lidded in a sultry, introspective gaze. She wears a deep burgundy oversized shirt, fabric soft and wrinkled, the top buttons undone to reveal her bare collarbones and the subtle curve of her cleavage. Sleeves are casually rolled up, exposing her forearms. A black leather PRADA handbag with white embossed lettering hangs diagonally across her shoulder, the thick strap resting against her chest. Warm golden light from the upper left sculpts her face, catching the delicate skin of her neck and the folds of the shirt, casting soft shadows. The background is a pale beige wall with a faint texture, blurred green plant silhouette on the right. Shallow depth of field from a large aperture lens throws the background into creamy bokeh, keeping her face, shoulder, and the branded bag in sharp focus. The composition follows a diagonal line from top-left to bottom-right, drawing the eye from her face down to the bag. Color palette: deep wine, black, beige, with a warm golden hue. The mood is intimate, quietly sensual, exuding understated luxury and self-assured femininity. As if captured in a stolen moment of urban reverie, her expression holds a subtle, inviting mystery.",
