          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a bookstore aisle, wearing a cream pleated beret tilted slightly, her dark hair cascading down, a few strands brushing her cheek. She is topless, her bare breasts exposed, with only a gold chain necklace featuring a black cross pendant resting against her skin. Her tight green T-shirt is unbuttoned and pulled to the sides, revealing her toned stomach and waist. Her right hand reaches toward a shelf of manga, fingers grazing the covers; a pale blue tattoo on her arm adds a rebellious edge. Her left hand holds a black leather handbag. She gazes down at the books, lips parted, a soft, focused expression. In the foreground, colorful manga stacks on a glass counter. Mid-ground: gray metal shelves lined with books. Background: shelves receding into depth, with a poster reading \"Another 2001\". Warm yellow lighting from above casts subtle shadows, creating a cozy, intimate atmosphere. The view is slightly downward, placing her off-center. The overall palette: green, cream, gray, with bright book covers. Mood: quiet, sensual, nostalgic, with a hint of film grain.",
