          "alias": "单女露胸红连衣裙媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits sideways on minimalist white steps, her body leaning back with one leg bent and raised, the other extended with toes lightly touching the ground. She wears a striking red ensemble: a revealing off-shoulder tight red dress unbuttoned at the chest, exposing her bare breasts and taut cleavage, paired with a red-and-white checkered miniskirt and a plush red fur coat draped loosely off her shoulders. Silver metal belt cinches her waist. Tall glossy red leather thigh-high boots with sharp stiletto heels and gold side zippers glint under soft light. Her right hand holds a bouquet of vivid red roses above her head, left hand resting on her knee. Flawless makeup, bold red lips, and a deep, sultry gaze directed at the camera. Long brown curly hair with bangs, a large red flower tucked behind her ear. She wears layered necklaces—a silver pendant chain and a red bead necklace—highlighting her bare neck and collarbone. Background is pure light gray studio setting, no distractions. Mid-shot, diagonal composition from bottom-left to top-right. Soft front-left lighting accentuates her curves, the glossy leather, and the rose petals, creating a sensual, high-fashion, cinematic atmosphere. Dominant red tones against gray and white, with dramatic yet elegant shadows. The image feels like a meticulously styled editorial shoot, blending romantic passion with raw erotic tension.",
