          "prompt": "A young woman stands outdoors in sunlight, her long, silky black hair falling naturally, a sultry smile revealing perfect white teeth, eyes bright with playful confidence. She wears a cropped olive green bomber jacket with white faux fur collar, unzipped to reveal a tight gray high-neck top that hugs her curves, paired with low-rise light beige joggers with black zipper details, the waistband dipping to show a hint of smooth skin. Her right hand reaches forward, palm open, fingers slightly curled as if beckoning or signaling \"stop,\" the delicate veins and soft skin catching the warm light. The background is a pale yellow tile wall with neat grout lines, slightly aged but clean, topped with green corrugated metal and a faint chain-link fence, suggesting a school or street corner. Dark asphalt ground with a concrete curb, rough texture. Sunlight streams from upper left, casting strong chiaroscuro, her left side and face brightly lit, the right side in soft shadow, the jacket glowing with golden highlights, skin and hand details sharp. Composition centers her slightly right, head tilted, body in a dynamic pose, the extended hand leading the eye to her face, creating depth. Mid-ground shows her full figure and environment, background softly blurred. Warm yellow tones dominate, with olive, cream, and deep gray. The mood is relaxed and erotic, a stolen moment of casual seduction. Film-grain texture, natural daylight, slightly shallow depth of field, realistic photographic style with rich texture on clothing folds, wall grains, and ground reflections.",
