        {
          "id": "krea2-9e9d17caf4ad2d6632de20d7",
          "alias": "单女露胸红连衣裙户外严肃站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on the lush green lawn of an outdoor golf course, wearing a red plaid sleeveless dress with a ruffled hem and black lace trim, but the dress is unbuttoned down the front to fully expose her bare breasts and torso; she pairs it with black thigh-high boots, black stockings, and a black lace long glove on her left hand, while her right hand holds a bright yellow plastic watering can. Her long hair falls naturally, her gaze is fixed directly at the camera, her expression serious yet confident, her body slightly turned toward the lens with her head tilted, creating a surreal tension between everyday life and fashion. The foreground features detailed green grass with soft shadow transitions, the midground includes the woman and a prominent red \"no entry\" traffic sign on a silver metal pole to her left, and the background opens into a well-manicured golf course with distant fairways and dense trees under a blue sky with wispy white clouds. Light comes from above, casting soft natural illumination with clear shadows on her face, exposed skin, and clothing, as well as distinct shadows from the watering can and sign. The composition is centrally balanced, with the woman as the visual focus, heightened by the warm color clash of her red plaid dress and yellow watering can against the cool blue sky and green grass. Layers of depth run from the foreground grass to the midground figure and sign, then to the distant course and trees, with sightlines from her gaze, the watering can’s direction, and the sign’s vertical lines drawing the eye deeper. The atmosphere is bright and fresh, evoking a tranquil yet energetic summer afternoon, blending surrealistic style with high-fashion editorial quality—every detail from the fabric textures and plastic reflections on the watering can to the worn edges of the traffic sign is rendered with hyper-realistic precision, creating a poetic, absurdly beautiful still life.",
