        {
          "id": "krea2-2c12765a6f7a8e59c39e30b2",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙摄影棚媚态坐比耶",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a blue hard-shell suitcase, her long jet-black hair cascading naturally over her shoulders, glinting softly in the gentle light. Her delicate, sculpted features are framed by a dark, gothic makeup style—sharp eyeliner shapes an intense gaze, deep red lips, a tiny black heart-shaped sticker adorns her cheek, and a sparkling silver star shines beneath her right eye, adding an air of mystery. She wears a black velvet off-shoulder fitted dress with lace-trimmed neckline forming a sensual V-shape, long sleeves hugging her arms, hemline cut high to mid-thigh, revealing her legs and black lace-top stockings with intricate floral borders. A fine chain cross necklace catches the light, lending a subtle religious-metaphor mystique. Her posture is poised yet slightly teasing, leaning forward with hands folded demurely on her knees, long fingers with light nail polish. The background is a simple white wall and white door with a silver round lock and handle, clean and uncluttered. The composition is centered, with a slight high-angle shot emphasizing her figure. The blue suitcase in the foreground adds a cool color contrast. The lighting comes from front-left, soft and diffused, simulating natural indoor light, creating a warm, intimate ambiance. The overall palette is black-and-white accented by the blue suitcase, evoking a modern, private atmosphere—a moment of rest on a night journey or a pause before departure. The visual flow draws the eye from her face down to her chest, waist, legs, and finally the suitcase. The scene blends casual realism with studio-style precision, with slight grain and imperfect color balance for a natural, approachable feel.",
