          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a sunlit seaside rocky path, completely topless, her bare breasts exposed with firm nipples visible, a pale pink silk dress slipped down to her waist, the large 3D rose ornament still pinned to the fabric near her hip. She has long straight brown hair blown by the sea breeze, a pair of black sunglasses casually perched on her head. She turns slightly to the side, right hand raised, fingers brushing her forehead in a soft, sensual gesture. Her makeup is natural with glossy red lips and subtle shimmer on her eyes, gaze direct and playful. A single silver pearl necklace hangs between her breasts. In the foreground, white daisies bloom among green grass; midground shows scattered gray rocks covered in moss; background is a clear blue sky with a distant coastline and a weathered wooden power pole on the right. The composition uses rule of thirds, subject off-center to the left, low-angle shot emphasizing her long legs and the open sky. Strong midday sunlight from the upper left creates sharp contour light and soft shadows across her skin and the folds of the fallen dress, enhancing the natural, candid feel. The atmosphere is fresh, romantic, and summery, capturing an everyday moment of erotic beauty, rich in texture and natural light.",
