        {
          "id": "krea2-97392b38bb9301987cf96d0e",
          "alias": "单女透视灰短裙广场媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a vintage-styled interior, wearing a black off-shoulder tight long-sleeve top and a gray high-waist mini skirt, paired with sheer stockings and black square-buckle high-heel sandals. She leans sideways against an intricately carved wooden chair in an elegant, sensual pose. Her right leg is bent naturally and extended forward, while her left leg crosses over it. Her right hand gently holds a red wine bottle with the label clearly visible, and her left hand rests casually on the chair’s back. Her head is slightly lowered, eyes fixated on the camera with a soft, intimate gaze, long hair falling naturally over her shoulders. Flawless makeup with full lips, fair and smooth skin. The overall look is fashionable, sexy, and alluring, with a hint of exposed cleavage and skin. The foreground focuses on her body from feet to torso, the midground includes the dark carved wooden chair, a wooden table with decorative items. The background features a large floor-to-ceiling mirror reflecting the other side of the room, including a chandelier, windows, ceiling beams, and distant furniture. Left side is rough red brick wall, right side a dark wooden door with arched glass windows. Exposed beam ceiling. Warm yellow overhead light creating soft shadows on walls and floor, giving an industrial-meets-vintage atmosphere. Composition slightly off-center right, using mirror reflection for depth. Visual guidance through her pose and gaze toward the camera. Lighting is warm golden from above, with delicate highlights and shadows on skin, fabric folds, and metal accessories. Color palette deep brown, black, gray, accented by warm yellow lamp light and the golden label of the wine bottle. The image has a high-end, cinematic, low-light photography feel, like a professional camera capturing a quiet, private moment in a personal wine cellar or upscale restaurant at night. Rich details and textures: rough brick, silky fabric, wood grain, metal reflections. Every element crafted for an artistic yet intimate aesthetic. The mood is serene, mysterious, and story-rich.",
