        {
          "id": "krea2-4024b655591398d1607c1edc",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙办公室媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a black bench in an office, wearing a tight black spaghetti-strap dress with a plunging neckline that reveals her alluring collarbone and cleavage. The dress has a zipper at the waist and a delicate textured fabric. Her long legs are clad in sheer black stockings, and she wears black high heels. Her right hand gently pulls at the waistband of the stockings, a natural yet provocative gesture. Her hair is styled in a low ponytail with soft curls, a few loose strands falling over her forehead. She wears thin-rimmed glasses, the lenses reflecting soft light. Her gaze is direct, expression cool with a hint of seduction. Her pose is relaxed but tense, body slightly leaning back, left leg bent, right leg extended with knee slightly raised. The composition is dynamic, with the subject dominating the foreground. Behind her is a desk with a white computer monitor (screen off) and neatly arranged office supplies. Background is a simple white wall with the text \"COFFEE PATIS\" in modern minimalist font. Two long fluorescent ceiling lights emit cool white light, casting sharp shadows and creating strong contrast. Lighting comes from above, highlighting her curves and skin texture. The palette is black, white, and gray, giving a minimalist yet fashion-photography aesthetic. The slightly tilted angle enhances visual impact. She is positioned left-center, facing right, guiding the viewer's eye. The overall mood is calm, restrained, yet filled with desire and mystery—like a private portrait from a fashion magazine or a candid shot by an amateur photographer in a real office, blending lifelike authenticity with artistic expression. Rich details, realistic textures, and delicate lighting produce a high-end visual effect.",
