          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless at a wooden café table, her side profile turned toward the window, deep brown curly hair cascading in soft waves, natural bangs falling across her forehead, strands catching the warm light with a gentle glow. Her skin is fair and smooth, delicate facial features sharp and refined, lips slightly parted as if in a whisper or deep thought. She wears a white off-shoulder dress, ruffled edges and a lace-up bodice now pushed down to reveal her bare breasts, the lightweight fabric pooling at her waist, exuding an elegant vintage allure. She wears a simple necklace and thin dangling earrings, adding a touch of refinement. Her body leans forward slightly, relaxed yet composed, right hand resting on her thigh, left hand near the table edge. On the table sits a black Harman Kardon portable Bluetooth speaker, its smooth surface gleaming, silver handle curved gracefully, brand logo visible. Behind it lies a Canon EOS camera, lens cap off, placed on the wood surface. Nearby are a few drinks and small objects. The background features a light brick wall and large white-framed windows, glass reflecting the interior and blurred figures, creating layered depth. In the midground, a person in a floral dress walks in the distance, adding realism and everyday life. The composition combines close-up and mid-shot, the main figure positioned right of center, forming an asymmetrical yet balanced visual structure. The foreground speaker and table edge guide the eye into the scene, while the vertical window lines contrast with the woman's posture, enhancing depth. Natural light pours through the window, softly illuminating her skin and body, creating subtle shadows that define her facial contours and the folds of her dress, with warm highlights on her bare chest. The overall atmosphere is cozy and intimate, full of daily life texture, with warm yellow and beige tones contrasting against the black speaker and dark hair. Colors harmonize, light and shadow interplay to convey a quiet, languid, and slightly artistic vibe, as if capturing a real, unfiltered moment in an afternoon café. The image has the look of amateur photography, with slight grain and natural depth of field, focus on her face and upper torso, background gently blurred to emphasize the subject. The scene tells a story, inviting the viewer to imagine what she’s thinking or whom she’s waiting for, using the window and wall geometry to frame the shot while leaving enough negative space. The visual flow moves naturally from the speaker in the foreground to her body and on to the reflections in the background, forming a complete path. Every detail brims with life and warmth, creating an atmosphere both private and open—like a carefully captured instant, preserving the often overlooked beauty of ordinary moments.",
