        {
          "id": "krea2-212a6aeb250ad1dc084679b0",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑丝袜办公室媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with black hair in twin pigtails and straight bangs sits in a black mesh office chair, legs crossed, wearing black stockings and a black T-shirt with pink lettering that is unbuttoned, leaving her breasts exposed. She has black-rimmed glasses, a slightly lazy yet focused expression, and holds a cup of instant noodles in her right hand while using a fork in her left to lift a strand of noodles toward her mouth. Around her wrist is a white fluffy rabbit bracelet. Pure white background with even, soft lighting, slightly overhead medium shot centered on her. Her lips are slightly downturned, eyes looking directly at the camera with a quiet, stubborn gaze. The image has a 35mm f/2.8 look, 1/125s shutter, ISO 200, realistic skin texture, natural colors, minimal shadows. The black-and-white palette is accented by the pink lettering on her T-shirt and the noodle cup. The scene feels candid, intimate, with a slight amateur photographic quality, capturing a moment of solitary comfort. Her body is relaxed, leaning forward slightly, knees bent, feet dangling, chair details visible, noodle cup branding clear, noodles stretched realistically. The composition is clean, with her bare upper body and the food as the focal point, emphasizing a quiet, sensual everyday atmosphere.",
