        {
          "id": "krea2-f933f389d929ba0b53f2a372",
          "alias": "单女黑衬衫摄影棚冷淡站立叉腰",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands against a pure white background, wearing a black silk long-sleeved shirt left open, exposing her bare chest and toned torso, with no top underneath. She pairs it with a fluffy white layered lace ruffled mini skirt, black satin bow ties at the side seams, and black pointed-toe high-heel ankle boots. Her long black hair falls naturally, strands lifted by a breeze for motion. Makeup is precise—sharp eyeliner, soft lip color, direct eye contact with a confident, slightly cold expression. She wears a simple black-and-white bead necklace and thin dangling earrings. Hands on hips, posture tall and strong, body slightly turned to create a graceful curve. Medium full-body shot, subject slightly left-center, negative space on the right. Clean, minimalist composition. Soft, even lighting from above-front creates clear contours, subtle shadows, smooth skin texture, natural fabric folds. The black silk shirt shows delicate gloss reflections; the white lace skirt is layered with rich detail. Background fades from light gray to pure white, giving a high-fashion studio feel. Overall monochrome palette with skin and metallic accessories adding subtle highlights. Visual focus on the subject’s face and outfit design. Light transitions smoothly without harsh contrast. Atmosphere is cool, modern, artistic—like a commercial or fashion editorial shot with professional equipment. The image conveys a blend of strength and femininity, tension and elegance, with refined detail and harmonious color, delivering strong visual impact and aesthetic value.",
