        {
          "id": "krea2-c0a74c5834d749befc0a977d",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝衬衫城市媚态站立脱衣（2）",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands by an indoor window, her light blue long-sleeved shirt unbuttoned and falling open, revealing her bare breasts, the fabric slipping off one shoulder. She wears a deep blue denim mini skirt, hiked high to expose the curve of her hips and smooth thighs, black stiletto heels, and a small white handbag dangling from her fingers. Her posture is elegantly turned, one leg slightly forward, weight on one foot, as she gazes out the window with a soft, contemplative expression. Her long hair falls in loose waves, catching the sun's glow on the strands. In the foreground, a wooden table with ornate carved metal frame reflects warm amber light, its surface smooth with subtle wear. She occupies the left third of the frame, body leaning slightly forward, the hem of her skirt riding up to reveal her bare skin, every line of her legs and arms lit by the side-shafted natural light. Behind her, a large window with sheer off-white curtains stirs in the breeze, casting dappled shadows from the trees outside. To the right, a vintage fabric armchair in deep green striped upholstery holds a patterned cushion. The floor is covered in a green geometric rug, its layered tones adding depth. The composition follows a rule of thirds: her figure on the left, the room opening to the right. The natural light streams from the left, illuminating her side face, bare chest, arm, and legs, while casting soft, defined shadows on the floor and furniture, creating a warm, intimate atmosphere. The color palette blends warm amber, cream, deep blue, and dark green, evoking a slightly grainy, desaturated film look as if shot with an old analog camera at 85mm, with shallow depth of field that keeps her skin and every curve in sharp focus while the background softly blurs. The scene feels like a still from a movie, capturing a quiet, sensual moment of urban life—her nipples visible, the edge of her skirt provocative, her posture inviting the viewer into her private, serene world.",
