          "id": "krea2-067140b16384a708f2b7c4db",
          "alias": "单女米风衣室内媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands inside a warm, richly textured interior, wearing an open cream double-breasted trench coat with crisp tailoring, classic lapels, and vintage metal buttons, her bare torso and nipples fully exposed beneath the unbuttoned coat, her long hair falling naturally with neat bangs framing her face, her gaze calm and deep as she slightly tilts her head towards the camera with a subtle expression of detached confidence and sensuality, delicate earrings adding a fine decorative touch, a thick blue-green woven scarf draped diagonally over one shoulder, its fringe swaying gently, injecting vivid color and layering into the composition, her right hand holding a checkered handbag in classic brown and beige pattern with gold metal clasp, a cute teddy bear charm dangling from it, her left hand resting on her hip in a relaxed and poised stance, foreground scattered with wooden chairs whose curved backs show natural wear and age, background featuring a dining table covered with light gray cloth, topped with stemware, candlesticks, and white flowers, candles casting weak warm light with flickering flames that project soft shadows, creating an intimate and private atmosphere, in the distance a wooden wine rack with neatly arranged glass bottles reflecting tiny sparkles, the overall color palette dominated by warm yellows and tan browns, rough-textured walls and exposed wooden ceiling beams enhancing the realism and sense of history, center-symmetrical composition with the woman positioned in the middle, visual guide leading to her face and clothing details, near figure close-up and mid-ground dining table forming visual layering, background softly blurred to emphasize the subject, lighting from candles and hidden warm sources coming from the side, creating soft chiaroscuro transitions on her face with delicate natural shadows, overall warm and tranquil light atmosphere as if capturing a quiet afternoon or early evening moment, the image presents a casual elegance and artistic feel of everyday life, as if a real moment captured with an amateur camera, rich in details, realistic texture, strong narrative and emotional resonance, with the explicit adult element of her toplessness under the open trench coat.",
