          "alias": "单女西装雪地忧伤行走脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman walks through a rain-snow mix on a city street, her classic plaid blazer unbuttoned and hanging open, revealing her bare chest—nipples erect and damp from the wet air. She wears a tiny blue denim miniskirt with orange-and-black geometric trim, barely covering her hips, and high-shine black patent leather boots that glisten with moisture. Her right hand holds a simple black leather tote, strap dangling, while her left touches her ear as if on a call. Her deep brown hair is loosely curled, strands plastered to her cheek by rain. She gazes down at her phone screen, lips slightly parted. Snow flurries drift through the air, blurred streetlights and car beams scatter behind her. The wet asphalt reflects the night, crosswalk stripes sharp in the rain. A mid-shot catches her mid-step, body slightly leaning forward, the vanishing lines of the street pulling the eye toward her. Mixed ambient light from lamps and headlights casts a cool, moody glow with soft shadows on her thighs and the ground, the cold tones punctuated by warm orange accents on her skirt. The image has a raw, cinematic feel—like a candid capture from a high-end camera in the rainy city night, exuding independence, confidence, and a subtle melancholic sensuality.",
