          "alias": "单女全裸灰短裙酒店媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands nude from the waist up in the center of a luxury hotel lobby, wearing only a high-waist gray long skirt with black decorative trim, white stockings, and black-and-white flat shoes with tassels. Her long wavy hair cascades naturally, reflecting soft light. She stands slightly turned, left hand resting on a round marble tabletop, right hand sensually lifting her hair, baring her full breasts. Her gaze is direct, expression composed and confident. Foreground: a round table with black-and-white geometric mosaic inlay, gold cross motifs, a glass vase of lush blue hydrangeas, stacked hardcover books with blurred English titles, two white candles in black metal holders (unlit). Background: spacious lobby with black-and-white geometric tile floor reflecting warm golden light, tall indoor green plants, distant reception desk and seating area with dark leather and metal frames, curved ceiling with recessed lighting, a black door with woven beige panels and circular details on the left, an arched passage on the right. Symmetrical composition, woman slightly left of center, layered depth from foreground table to background foliage and architecture. Warm amber lighting casts soft shadows, creating a serene, elegant, intimate atmosphere. High detail, slight film grain, natural color palette of gray, blue, black, white, and gold—a blend of modern luxury and living aesthetics, like a stylized fashion editorial shot in a premium hotel.",
