          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a deep blue velvet couch, her dress unzipped and slipped down to her waist, exposing her bare breasts. The light gray fitted bustier top bunches around her hips, paired with a short black fluffy skirt. Her long black hair falls smoothly over her shoulders, a delicate pink flower hair clip tucked behind her ear. She wears a simple shiny necklace and sparkling high heels. One hand gently touches her chin, the other rests on her inner thigh. She looks directly at the camera with a soft, inviting expression. Behind her, an art gallery with dark gray walls, a large yellow abstract painting and a blue portrait illuminated by spotlights. A white pedestal holds a small sculpture in the background. Low-angle shot, cool blue-grey tones with warm accent lighting on the paintings. Professional photography with a candid, sensual atmosphere.",
