        {
          "id": "krea2-dd348b7f7dc56fb02d02b404",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣媚态躺交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies on a lush vintage floral carpet in a top-down view, wearing a tight white ribbed high-neck cropped sweater and high-waist shorts covered in green polka dots and tiny black flowers, paired with sheer white thigh-high stockings. Her long hair spills freely across the carpet, one hand gently resting on her neck, the other stretched out beside her with fingers slightly spread, creating an elegant, artful pose. She gazes directly into the lens with a calm, slightly hazy expression, lips parted, exuding subtle sensuality and mystery. Pearl earrings and multiple rings add delicate fashion details. The background is a light blue carpet with ornate gold scroll borders and vibrant roses in pink, orange, and yellow. The composition is centered and symmetrical, with her body forming an S-curve, legs crossed and bent, arms extended outward, shot from directly above for an intimate, private perspective. Soft, diffused overhead light creates gentle shadows on her skin and clothes, highlighting the ribbed texture of her sweater and the faint sparkle of sequins on her shorts. The color palette is predominantly white, light blue, and cream, warmed by floral tones, evoking a romantic yet modern atmosphere. The mood is serene and poetic, like a lazy afternoon sunbeam, blending high-fashion polish with casual authenticity.",
