        {
          "id": "krea2-7f153036d1ad29c7e7e314c1",
          "alias": "单女湿身蓝牛仔窗边微笑躺脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies sideways on a white windowsill, wearing an unbuttoned light blue denim shirt, sleeves casually rolled to her elbows, revealing slender arms and bare skin beneath—shirt open to expose her breasts and lacy black bra. She tilts her head slightly, smiling softly, eyes clear and bright, gazing directly into the lens. Her long black hair falls naturally in loose waves, a few strands brushing her cheek, adding a soft, lazy allure. Her legs are crossed and raised, toes pointing upward, clad in sheer black stockings, showing long, shapely lines. One hand rests under her chin, the other lies relaxed on the windowsill edge, fingers slender, nails neatly trimmed. The overall pose is carefree yet elegant, with a subtly erotic domestic atmosphere. In the foreground, the smooth white windowsill surface has a slight reflective gloss. The subject occupies the center-right of the frame, her body extending diagonally, creating visual flow. The background is large white curtains, light and airy, filtering soft natural light that spills in from outside, forming even diffused illumination, rich in shadow gradation and smooth transitions, creating a warm, tranquil indoor setting. The composition uses a low angle, emphasizing her height and leg lines while enhancing depth. Her gaze and pose guide the viewer’s eye upward, with raised legs adding dynamic upward motion. The overall mood is cozy, intimate, and sun-drenched, capturing a quiet afternoon moment. The color palette is primarily white and pale blue, fresh and elegant, with a slight cool undertone neutralized by warm light, achieving a soft balance. Details highlight delicate light play: curtain folds, skin sheen, fabric texture. Shot with a professional camera, high resolution, 8K quality, realistic feel with natural amateur-device imperfections—visible pores, slight hair frizz—enhancing authenticity. Style leans toward lifestyle portrait or fashion editorial, blending artistic beauty with everyday intimacy.",
