        {
          "id": "krea2-dde4f8a261af8b5e4a0099e2",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙摄影棚沉思坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in front of a pure white background, her jet-black straight hair with blunt bangs falling naturally, glossy and layered in soft light, the ends slightly curling inward for a delicate, flowing look. Her skin is fair and luminous, features sharply defined, eyes clear with a hint of lazy allure, lips slightly pursed, the corners lifting in a quiet, captivating expression. She wears a black-and-white checkered off-shoulder top with loose, ruffled sleeves—lightweight fabric—and the deep blue strap of a slip dress is visible at the neckline, creating color contrast. Her bottom is a fitted deep blue miniskirt that hugs her hips and thighs, emphasizing long legs. She crosses her left leg over the right, feet in sheer black stockings that have a smooth, slightly reflective finish, showing fine texture and even shade. One foot rests in a white pointed-toe stiletto heel, the other dangles bare-stocked, the shoe’s sleek patent leather and thin heel adding elegance and sexiness. She sits on a white fabric-covered platform, the material soft and plush, with natural folds and shadows for comfort. Mid-shot composition, she occupies the center-right, body slightly angled, head turned, eyes locked on the lens, creating strong eye contact. Foreground shows her legs and feet details, midground her upper body and outfit, background pure white, no distractions. The lighting is front-top, soft and even, casting subtle shadows that enhance volume and texture, a quiet, high-end atmosphere. The palette is black, white, blue, with touches of skin tone and white; modern minimalist with fashion-forward and artistic flair, like a professional studio shot yet carrying a candid, everyday moment—a meticulously styled personal portrait or editorial, with strong visual impact and emotional pull. Details are rich, layers clear, composition precise, colors harmonious, exuding the confidence and allure of a modern urban woman.",
