        {
          "id": "krea2-d9f8b216517b30df203720e5",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙竹林忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits outdoors on a bamboo chair, wearing a deep blue sleeveless dress that clings tightly to her curves, cut well above the knee with a low neckline revealing the white fabric of her inner garment beneath, the thin straps slipping slightly off her shoulders, the dress bunched at the waist with natural wrinkles. Her long silky black hair falls across her shoulders and chest, catching golden highlights in the sunlight. Her face is defined with sharp, delicate features; her eyes are focused yet heavy-lidded, lips parted with a faint, melancholic hunger. A thick gold chain necklace hangs against her cleavage, stark against the dark fabric. Her right hand rests lightly on the chair arm, fingers long and graceful; her left hand lies open on her thigh. She crosses her legs, right over left, showing off the smooth skin of her thighs, wearing brown boots with vintage metal buckles and blue-striped socks rolled just below the knee, the pattern adding texture. The bamboo chair is aged and weathered, its natural grain prominent. Behind her, dense green foliage fills the frame—layers of leaves in varied shapes and sizes, some withered, lit by dappled sunlight filtering through the canopy. The ground is earthy with scattered dry leaves. Light streams from the upper left, illuminating her side profile, arms, and legs, casting soft shadows across her body. The composition is slightly tilted, placing her off-center, creating a diagonal flow from her face to her feet, guiding the viewer down her form. Foreground leaves blur into the edges, enhancing depth. The palette is rich in deep blue, vibrant green, gold, and warm brown tones. The mood is intimate, quiet, and charged, like a stolen moment of sensual solitude—perfect for a high-end editorial or a raw, erotic portrait.",
