        {
          "id": "krea2-7d63768ba313693259ea1bd4",
          "alias": "单女女仆蓝女仆装沙发害羞跪脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young blonde woman with blue eyes kneels in a half-crouch indoors, wearing a delicate blue-and-white checkered maid outfit with the bodice partly unbuttoned, revealing a hint of cleavage and a lacy white camisole beneath. Her white maid cap is adorned with a blue bow and lace trim, and her long golden hair cascades naturally, with neat bangs covering her forehead. She rests her right hand lightly under her chin, fingers long and slender, as she gazes at the camera with a soft, shy yet subtly inviting expression. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee. She wears pure white thigh-high stockings and a short skirt trimmed with white lace, showing a generous amount of bare thigh. The ruffled blue-and-white sleeves and neckline evoke vintage elegance, while the layered skirt features smooth blue-and-white stripes, giving the overall look a Rococo sweetness with a sensual edge. The figure is in the center-right of the frame, body slightly turned, head tilted, forming a gentle S-curve. The composition is a medium close-up from the waist up, with a bright indoor background. To the left, part of a dark brown leather sofa is visible; behind her, a white-framed window lets in soft natural light, with blurry green foliage outside. On the right, a woven rattan basket holds dry branches as decoration, stacked with a few old books with yellowed covers and faint text on the spines. The warm-toned room is illuminated from the upper left, creating a soft backlight that outlines her hair with a bright halo. Her face is evenly lit with smooth shadows, giving a serene, cozy afternoon atmosphere, like a Japanese-style portrait with a pure yet erotic sensibility. The shot is taken with professional photography gear: high resolution, fine detail, moderate color saturation, soft contrast, sharp focus on the face, slight background blur, using an 85mm portrait lens at f/1.8, shutter 1/125s, ISO 100, simulating a real camera with a film-grain texture and natural color gradation. The overall image feels like a timeless fairy tale scene—blending modern precision with nostalgic poeticism, composition following the golden ratio, the subject placed at two-thirds of the frame, her gaze guiding the viewer’s eye, creating emotional connection. Soft, layered light and warm yellow tones infuse the scene with comfort and domestic bliss, evoking the sound of wind rustling leaves outside and the warmth of sunlight on skin. The image is full of life and artistic beauty, like a carefully crafted still-life portrait or a classic movie scene, inviting the viewer into this gentle, sensual world.",
