        {
          "id": "krea2-aa75a54b0349fd066821bb2e",
          "alias": "单女露胸白T恤博物馆俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a soft pinkish-purple floor, leaning slightly forward with her hands braced behind her on a brushed metal bench, her posture relaxed and playful. Her jet-black medium-length hair falls with light bangs across her forehead, her clear eyes gazing directly at the camera with a thoughtful, tender expression. She is topless, her bare breasts exposed and softly lit, with a discarded white short-sleeved t-shirt bearing a cute brown kitten print lying beside her. She wears a high-waisted navy blue ruffled miniskirt with delicate layered pleats, and a matching navy blue knit cardigan casually draped over one shoulder, its sleeve hanging loosely. Black sheer stockings hug her smooth legs, and a pair of black pointed-toe stiletto heels with cross-strap details lie scattered on the floor. The scene is a modern space with pale pink walls and floor, slightly reflective, and a silver-gray brushed metal bench with sharp geometric edges. The composition is a top-down view, the woman positioned center-left, her legs extended in a graceful S-curve that draws the eye from her face down to her feet and back. The background is clean and minimalist, emphasizing her outfit and pose. Soft diffused overhead light evenly illuminates the space, creating gentle shadows and a bright, airy atmosphere. The color palette blends pinkish-purple, navy blue, black, and white, balancing sweetness with mature, individual style. The image has a fine-grained, professional camera quality yet retains a spontaneous feel, as if capturing a real moment in an art gallery or designer studio.",
