          "alias": "单女半褪黑外套庭院微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the indoor courtyard of a classical European building, wearing a black-and-white houndstooth cape coat that is wide and flowing, with the collar pulled back to expose her bare shoulders and the black silk bow-tie choker around her neck, her pale gray high-neck top now undone and slipping off one shoulder, revealing the curve of her cleavage. Her dark hair is styled in an elegant bun with loose strands framing her face, and she gazes directly at the camera with a soft, confident smile, her hands gently crossed in front of her, one hand holding a small black handbag with metallic hardware gleaming faintly. Her fingers are long and adorned with a simple ring. In the foreground, lush green palm leaves spread wide, layered and vibrant; to the left, a beige sofa is partially visible with soft cushions, while to the right stands a decorated white stone pillar carved with golden Baroque scrollwork. Behind her, arched dark-wood windows let in soft natural light, casting warm shadows across the scene. The overall composition is symmetrical, centered on the woman, with the plants and pillar framing her. The focus is sharp on her bare skin and the rich textures of the cape, with the background slightly blurred. The palette is dominated by black, white, and gray, accented by green and gold, evoking a cinematic, nostalgic yet modern aesthetic. The mood is warm and intimate, as if capturing a private, sensual moment in an elegant afternoon.",
