        {
          "id": "krea2-bf2833bc02e6a1fbf23e8996",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫窗边困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on an indoor windowsill, her body turned sideways as she gazes out the window. Her long black hair falls softly over her shoulders. She wears a loosely unbuttoned white shirt that falls open, revealing the curves of her breasts and the edge of a white lace bra, and matching white shorts that ride up high on her thighs. Her bare ankles are crossed, feet resting on the wooden sill. One hand gently touches the back of her neck, the other rests lightly on her calf—a relaxed, languid pose. Her face is delicate, her eyes focused and slightly contemplative as she stares outward, savoring a quiet, private moment. The overall mood is serene and intimate, with a natural, casual elegance. The composition places her on the right, forming a strong visual anchor, with her body’s smooth lines and extended legs leading the eye from her face to the expansive view outside. Beyond the window is a lush green lawn dotted with wildflowers; farther off lies a calm lake with faint ripples, and distant buildings and trees on the far shore. The sky is pale blue with thin clouds, the light soft and even. Indoors, the warm wooden walls and windowsill show natural grain; the black metal window frame is sleek and modern. A beige woven hanging ornament with dangling tassels adds a handcrafted warmth, and a pair of sunglasses on the sill catches a faint reflection. The lighting comes from natural daylight filtering through the glass, casting gentle, shadowless illumination across her face and body—evoking early morning or afternoon. The color palette is fresh and natural: whites, greens, browns, with small accents of black and blue. The scene blends a close-up foreground (her body, the sill), middle ground (grass, lakeside vegetation), and distant background (lake and hills), creating depth and guiding the eye along her gaze, emphasizing the connection between human and nature. The style feels like a candid, real-life moment captured on a simple camera, with a hint of film grain and natural exposure, prioritizing authenticity and emotional expression over polish—a quiet, tender, poetic everyday scene with no artificial traces, as if recording an ordinary yet moving instant.",
