        {
          "id": "krea2-957402fd81b5829aabd7c21c",
          "alias": "单女露胸米上衣走廊媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the center of a long, narrow indoor corridor, her body tall and poised, face delicate and clear-eyed. She gazes calmly into the lens, a hint of thoughtful distance in her expression. Her dark brown hair is casually pinned up, with loose strands falling beside her cheeks, adding a lazy, natural sensuality. She wears a sheer cream-white lace top with intricate ruffled cuffs and neckline, the fabric so fine that her bare breasts are visible beneath the translucent lace, nipples faintly outlined. The top is tied loosely at her chest, revealing a generous glimpse of smooth cleavage. Her matching high-waist skirt is unbuttoned at the side, slipping low on her hips, exposing the curve of her hipbone and the top of her thong. The hem is uneven with lace trim, light and flowing. Over one shoulder hangs a short camel jacket with white embroidered flowers at the cuffs and shoulders, now partially falling off, baring her left shoulder and arm. In her right hand she holds a bright yellow mini handbag by its thin strap, a sharp pop of color against the muted tones. On her feet are black cowboy boots with pointed toes, scuffed metal details, reaching mid-calf. Her stance is naturally relaxed, arms slightly spread, jacket falling open, as if she just stepped out of a room or is about to move deeper into the space. Behind her, a pair of white double doors with black metal handles stand slightly ajar, hinting at an unseen interior. The walls are white above, white horizontal planks below. The floor is dark brown hardwood, rich grain visible. Sunlight streams in from a window on the right, casting long sharp beams across the floor, creating alternating strips of light and shadow. The light is soft and warm, illuminating the right side of her body and face, leaving her left side in gentle shadow, enhancing contours and depth. The overall palette is cream, tan, deep brown, with the yellow bag as accent. The composition is symmetrical, with her centered, drawing the eye. The image feels like a high-quality candid portrait—intimate, timeless, gently nostalgic, and deeply sensual, capturing a moment of quiet erotic tension.",
