        {
          "id": "krea2-b0cb0f3b25f2ec32151938cd",
          "alias": "单女半褪米毛衣沙发微笑脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges on a white sofa draped with a beige diamond-knit throw, her deep green velvet Lolita dress unbuttoned at the chest, revealing pale cleavage and the lace of her cream blouse slipping off one shoulder. Her black thigh-high boots press into the cushion, one leg bent, the other extended, sheer black stockings glossing her thighs. A deep green velvet bow pins back her cascading black hair as she gazes directly at the camera with a soft, inviting smile. Her right hand rests on the sofa back, left hand trailing loosely. In the foreground, a round ottoman holds a gift box tied with a gray satin bow. Behind her, a large white-framed window filters gentle sunlight through sheer curtains and tassel trim, casting a soft halo around her silhouette. To the right, a white bed is adorned with a lace coverlet and beige pillows; dried flowers hang in the corner. The room is a palette of white, beige, and deep green, warm and intimate. The camera captures her from a medium angle, slightly off-center, with shallow depth of field blurring the background into a dreamy haze. Natural light from the left creates a soft rim light on her curves, emphasizing the delicate texture of velvet, lace, and skin. The image feels like a candid, sensual home portrait—elegant, inviting, and subtly explicit.",
