        {
          "id": "krea2-6d1f98a130e2e7dc884311fb",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑短裙摄影棚媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long straight brown hair, fair skin, stands topless in front of a pure white background, wearing only a black pleated skirt and a red wide-brim hat with cream edging and tiny gold lettering. Her right hand gently cups one bare breast, fingers splayed, as she pouts slightly with a sultry, direct gaze. Her body forms an elegant S-curve. A black microphone cable diagonally crosses the frame from upper right to lower left, with a long white tape strip trailing from it, adding motion. In the upper left corner, a hand-drawn sun and moon symbol in gold and silver. Soft, diffused front-left lighting highlights her skin and the fabric texture. The overall image is a studio portrait with a surreal, artistic feel, black and white tones accented by the red hat.",
