        {
          "id": "krea2-b609a7dc49b6345e9b623122",
          "alias": "单女透视黑连衣裙宅邸媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a lavish European classical staircase, wearing an extremely short black sleeveless dress with tiny white polka dots and feathered fringe trim, the hem riding high to expose her long, sheer-stockinged thighs. She dons long black leather gloves that stretch from wrist to upper arm, contrasting sharply with her sheer black stockings and stiletto heels. Her long, straight raven hair falls over her shoulders; her face is delicate, with a calm yet subtly seductive gaze fixed forward. She is positioned slightly right of center, body turned, left hand resting gracefully on an ornate wrought-iron railing, right hand hanging loosely. A luxurious red-and-white Persian rug covers the foreground, its intricate patterns echoing Eastern motifs. The midground features a spiral staircase with stone steps draped in deep red and gold baroque carpet, the black wrought-iron handrails adorned with golden scrollwork and relief details, evoking 18th-century French opulence. Behind, a light beige stucco wall holds a framed classical portrait of a figure in red, a gold frame signifying heritage. Warm yellow light from a wall lamp bathes the scene, creating a vintage, intimate atmosphere. The composition is offset: the subject occupies the right third, leaving space to showcase the staircase and decor. Diagonal lines lead the eye upward while the curved iron railing frames her. Lighting from the wall lamps creates soft chiaroscuro on her face, dress creases, and railing, with layered shadows lending a serene, aristocratic mood. The palette—black, white, gold, red, beige—is harmonious and striking, evoking a high-fashion editorial shot in a historic mansion. Her dress hugs her curves, hinting at her figure, while the sheer stockings and high heels amplify the sensual tension. The overall feel blends classical elegance with modern sensuality, capturing a cross-temporal aesthetic of poised allure and inner strength.",
