        {
          "id": "krea2-bb16a26471fa1eb9e82d1d1e",
          "alias": "单女露胸短裙沙发微笑坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long, thick dark curly hair and blunt bangs, porcelain skin, delicate and sharp features, calm and focused gaze into the lens, lips slightly parted with a faint smile, elegant and slightly aloof. She is topless, her torso bare except for a short tweed skirt in beige and deep brown, the skirt featuring a heart-shaped cutout at the waist with metal clasp details, sleeveless, form-fitting, with irregular dark pattern and slightly flared hem. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, while her right hand holds a small smooth brown leather bag with a metal zipper and handle, positioned to partially cover her left breast. Gold bracelet and rings adorn her wrist and slender fingers. She sits on the edge of a gray velvet sofa with a dark wooden frame, two decorative pillows behind her—one light blue with pale pink floral embroidery, the other solid gray. On the right, a tall black metal floor lamp with layered crystal drops and warm yellow bulbs casts soft, dappled light. On the left, a glass door reflects the night outside with blurred greenery and distant building lights in cool blue-purple tones, contrasting with the warm indoor glow. Deep blue carpet with subtle texture underfoot. Medium shot, slightly turned to the left, legs crossed, feet partially out of frame, direct eye contact engaging the viewer. Lighting from the right lamp and ambient sources, face evenly lit, shadows soft, contours sharp. Color palette warm yellow, beige-brown, gray-blue, with black and metallic accents. Film-like quality with slight grain and natural noise, as if shot with a 50mm f/1.8 lens at low light, shallow depth of field, stable eye-level composition. The atmosphere is serene, luxurious, intimate, and narrative, like a captured moment from a cinematic film, blending everyday realism with artistic aesthetic.",
