        {
          "id": "krea2-4a1ab70682fbd22c46e0a049",
          "alias": "单女蓝礼服媚态倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman in a revealing blue-silver sequined gown leans seductively against a white classic fireplace, the dress featuring a plunging neckline and sheer panels that expose her breasts and curves, the fabric clinging to her body with sparkling waves of sequins and dangling fringe, the skirt a translucent mist of blue-silver fading from deep to pale, falling in soft folds that catch the light. Her long black wavy hair cascades over bare shoulders, her makeup sultry with smoky eyes and soft lips, wearing only a diamond necklace and earrings, her hands resting lightly on the mantelpiece, her gaze confident and inviting toward the camera. Behind her, a textured beige wall and white tiles flank the fireplace, atop which sits a clear glass vase with white flowers and green leaves, and to the right an amber glass oil lamp. Below, a warm brown rug, a pale green vase with purple flowers and scattered petals. Medium shot, subject centered slightly right, the fireplace draws the eye upward. Light from front-left, soft and natural, casts clear shadows and highlights on her skin and the dress’s shimmer, creating depth and a sensual, luxurious atmosphere, with fine skin texture and color transitions, the blue-silver and warm background contrasting for visual impact, embodying a blend of opulence and intimate elegance.",
