          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a dim, moody room, her jet-black hair cascading over bare shoulders, her porcelain skin glowing under cool blue light. She gazes off to the left with deep, melancholy eyes, lips slightly parted, a hint of desire in her expression. Her hands are clasped beneath her chin, fingers long and elegant, nails painted a pale pink. She wears a black suit jacket left open, revealing a black-and-white striped shirt unbuttoned to mid-chest, her pale breasts partially exposed, the curve of her cleavage catching the light. A thin gold chain necklace rests against her collarbone. The scene is bathed in a dramatic interplay of warm red and cold blue light—a heavy red velvet curtain behind her, vertical folds rich and textured, while a floor lamp with a white shade casts a cold blue glow from the left, highlighting her face, nose, and hands, leaving the opposite side in deep shadow. To the right, an old retro TV with a dark wood frame displays snowy static, emitting a ghostly blue fluorescence, sitting on a polished wooden cabinet. A small audio device sits nearby. The floor is covered with a floral red rug with fringe edges. A large monstera plant on the left is partially illuminated by blue light, its leaves casting mysterious silhouettes. The camera angle is low, focusing on her face and hands, with background elements softly blurred for depth. The visual flow leads from her gaze leftward, then back to the TV screen's blue light, creating a circular path. The lighting is uneven, with the main cold blue source sculpting her form, leaving the other side in shadow, creating a dramatic, sensual tension. The mood is both futuristic and vintage, capturing a solitary, erotic moment—a modern urban woman lost in thought, her half-bared body a blend of vulnerability and seduction. The image has high saturation, strong color contrast, rich detail, and a raw, photographic quality, free of watermarks or text, focused solely on her emotion and the char