          "prompt": "A young woman stands gracefully in a bright indoor setting, wearing a sheer white lace slip dress with subtle sequins and fringe—the fabric nearly transparent, clinging to her curves and exposing her bare breasts, erect nipples clearly visible through the lace. The dress ends above her thighs, revealing her long, slim legs. She wears silver strappy casual shoes with a glossy sheen. Her long black hair falls naturally, partially pinned up with decorative clips, exuding a soft, refined elegance. She stands in a slight side pose, her left hand lightly resting on the handlebar of a mint green vintage bicycle, right hand hanging down, looking calm and confident, her gaze soft toward the camera with a faint smile, conveying a serene, joyful mood. The bicycle is a key element: mint green frame, classic metal basket in front filled with lavender and white wildflowers, and a wicker basket on the back, all adding pastoral charm. Black tires, silver metal rims and handlebars reflect gentle light. Background is a white wall with a light beige stone niche featuring empty shelves on the right, adding depth and modern design. Floor is light beige square tiles with subtle texture. The composition is a medium shot, person slightly left, bicycle extending from left to right creating a diagonal visual line. Lighting is soft and even from the left, with gentle shadows. The atmosphere is warm, fresh, dreamy—like a candid moment on a quiet afternoon. Color palette: white, mint green, beige, with touches of purple and silver. Highly detailed, from skin texture to lace and bike metal, with slight film grain and natural color for realism. The style fuses fashion, pastoral, simplicity, and modern aesthetics.",
