        {
          "id": "krea2-cb6f3662fe6cda5ada45f3c9",
          "alias": "单女全裸外套广场媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman posing in a fully white, high-fashion ensemble stands before a warm, soft-toned background, her long, jet-black wavy hair cascading over bare shoulders, strands catching the light with a glossy sheen, ends slightly curled for elegance. Her facial features are refined and sculptural, with clean, dewy makeup—sharp eyeliner accentuating deep, confident eyes, and a natural nude pink lip. She stares directly into the lens, exuding poised self-assurance with a subtle, seductive smile. Her jacket is a white structured blazer with a subtle textured matte finish, left wide open to expose her entire bare torso—no top underneath, her breasts fully visible, nipples erect against the pale fabric edges. The blazer's cuffs have slight ruched detailing, adding effortless structure. Below, a high-waisted white pleated floor-length skirt hangs in crisp, even folds, swaying as if caught mid-step, revealing the curve of her hips. Her hands are clasped gracefully in front, left hand wearing a simple silver ring, right ring finger adorned with a blue-green gemstone. Her fingers are long and slender. She wears white pointed-toe high heels with smooth leather, sharp toe, thin stiletto heel, and crossed strap detailing for a vintage touch. In one hand, she holds a small white square handbag with gold hardware and short handle, brand logo visible. The background is a pale beige or apricot-toned wall with a fine-grained texture, bearing the text \"PRADA FW26\" in uppercase sans-serif, blending subtly into the background for understated luxury. The floor is pure black, creating stark contrast with the white outfit, emphasizing the subject. Composition is centered, full-body, slightly low-angle to elongate her form. Lighting is soft diffused from above front, casting even exposure on skin and clothing, with gentle natural shadows. The overall palette is white dominant, with beige background and black floor—clean, modern, high-end. Visual focus is on her face and exposed nude torso, the folds of the skirt, hair texture, and reflective accessories. The image carries a studio-quality yet candid feel, like a captured moment during a high-fashion runway or brand event, exuding elegance, cool restraint, and sensual power—a striking artistic fashion portrait.",
