          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the center of an airport terminal, wearing a long cream-colored coat open to reveal a pink silk dress underneath, the coat slipping off one shoulder to expose bare skin and a delicate silver chain strap of her dress. Her black hair cascades softly over her shoulders, a few strands falling across her face as she looks down with a subtle, knowing smile. She holds a small white chain bag in both hands, fingers lightly caressing the leather, a thin silver bracelet catching the light. Her posture is relaxed, slightly leaning forward, her body language suggesting a moment of private sensuality amidst the crowd. Behind her, a semicircle of male photographers in dark coats and masks aim their cameras at her, their lenses reflecting the bright overhead lights. The glossy floor mirrors her figure and the equipment, creating a sleek, modern atmosphere. The lighting is cool and crisp, emphasizing the smooth contours of her body through the thin fabric of the dress and the open coat. She is slightly off-center in the frame, her tilted pose adding dynamic tension. The composition draws the eye from her face down to her hands and the bag, then along the curve of her hip and the exposed leg. The scene feels like a high-fashion shoot caught in a candid moment, with a subtle, erotic undertone in her exposed shoulder and the way the dress clings to her form.",
