          "alias": "单女全裸广场媚态自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman takes a nude mirror selfie indoors, her short black bob with natural bangs framing a clear-eyed, focused gaze into the lens. Head slightly tilted, she rests her chin on her right hand, a gold ring glinting on her finger, while her left hand holds a small black digital camera aimed at the mirror. Her bare shoulders and full breasts are reflected, skin fair and smooth, with soft facial contours, a straight nose, and slightly pursed lips in a contemplative, gentle expression. The white tabletop in the foreground meets her midriff; behind her, the mirror shows the room's warm yellow-white light from a frosted square pendant lamp, wooden shelves, and a dark beam against pale gray-beige walls. Composition is mirror-symmetrical, with her body centered-left and the camera right, creating depth. Warm ambient lighting casts soft shadows, highlighting her skin's texture and the subtle sheen of her naked torso. Slight film grain and low contrast emulate an amateur camera's realism at 35mm focal length, shallow depth of field blurring the background. The scene feels private, sensual, and artistic, capturing an intimate moment of self-reflection in the quiet afternoon.",
