          "alias": "单女全裸红长裤摄影棚媚态坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "A young nude woman sits on a giant black teddy bear, her red high-waist pants and black stiletto heels the only clothing, one leg bent with the shoe's gold trim catching the light. Her brown wavy hair falls over bare shoulders, delicate makeup and bright eyes meet the camera with a sweet, playful smirk. Her hands rest gently on the bear's ears, the massive plush toy nearly her height, its black fur thick and soft, creamy muzzle and shiny dark eyes contrasting. She poses with relaxed confidence, right foot perched on the floor, left heel lifted. The background is a soft, pure pink, no clutter. Lighting from above front creates even skin tones and vibrant color saturation, no harsh shadows. Canon EOS R5 style, 85mm, f/4.0, ISO 200, 1/125s, softbox studio lighting. The scene balances high-fashion sensuality with innocent playfulness, the red and pink palette dominant, black accents adding depth. Fine details visible: hair gloss, fur texture, skin smoothness. Centered composition, intimate mid-shot, direct eye contact draws the viewer into a dreamy, warm, and erotic moment.",
