        {
          "id": "krea2-c07a01faaa88704d43591170",
          "alias": "单女银礼服舞台忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman with deep auburn hair is captured in a side profile, her hair styled in an elegant low bun with a few loose strands softly falling against her cheek, gleaming with warm highlights under soft light; her hair transitions from rich crimson to wine red with natural gradation. Her skin is fair and smooth, with delicate facial features—a straight nose, full lips coated in pale pink lipstick, and eyes lowered with a quiet, melancholic expression. She wears a silver-gray sequined gown with a completely open back, exposing the long, elegant curve of her spine and shoulder blades; the fabric has a fine metallic shimmer that catches the light. The shoulder straps are layered chains intertwined with thin cords, one black cord extending from behind her ear to the front, connected to a small device resembling a wireless microphone or earpiece receiver. She wears in-ear monitors with red decorative accents, and transparent crystal drop earrings shaped like water droplets or petals, sparkling with reflections. The subject is positioned in the left-center mid-shot, with a close-up side profile; the composition places the figure about two-thirds of the frame, head slightly tilted, gaze directed off to the left, creating dynamic visual flow. The foreground shows the back of the figure and her side profile, rich detail in skin texture, fabric folds, hair strands, and accessory reflections. In the midground, blossoming branches appear—gray-brown twisted stems dotted with pink flowers of various sizes, some buds, some fully open with slightly curled petals, layered to create depth. The background is a pale gray wall with subtle texture and age marks, casting branch shadows that contrast with the real branches, enhancing spatial depth. The overall composition follows a diagonal line, with the figure's body echoing the branch direction, guiding the eye from the face to the ear and out to the floral background. Light comes from the upper right, a soft warm source illuminating the right side of the face, neck, and shoulder, creating delicate highlights and shadows; the back receives less light, producing subtle chiaroscuro that accentuates the body's curves, with faint shadows cast on the wall and floor. The atmosphere is quiet and intimate, like a stage backstage or a moment between shots. The palette features silver-gray, deep red, pink, and warm yellow tones, cohesive and artistic with a fashion-forward vibe. The image has a high-resolution, professional camera quality with fine grain and natural depth of field, focus sharp on the face and back details, background softly blurred, maintaining a realistic, natural feel as if captured spontaneously with amateur equipment under indoor natural light, conveying a serene, elegant yet slightly distant mood.",
