          "alias": "单女露胸灰西装城市媚态站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a wide marble staircase inside a magnificent classical building. She wears a tailored dark gray blazer left open to expose her bare breasts, paired with sheer black pantyhose clinging to her legs and shiny red stiletto heels. Her long hair falls naturally, her face delicate, her eyes calm as she looks into the lens. One hand rests lightly on an intricately carved marble balustrade, the other holds a wine-red chain bag. Behind her, the opulent Baroque interior features massive stone pillars, multi-level galleries, ornate reliefs and sculptures, and vintage crystal chandeliers casting warm golden light. A wooden sign reading \"AMPHITHEATRE BAGNOLE ORCHESTRE\" hangs on the far wall, with other tourists in the background. The composition is a low-angle upward shot, placing her slightly off-center right, with staircase lines leading the eye upward, creating depth and spatial layers. The foreground shows crisp steps and her lower body, the midground her full figure and part of the railing, and the background layered architectural details and distant crowds. Light from above and the chandeliers creates chiaroscuro on the marble, illuminating her face and clothing details, while shadows add volume and atmosphere. The overall palette is warm yellow and gray-brown, accented by the bright red heels. The visual flow starts from her feet, follows the staircase lines up to her head, then into the background. The mood is both dignified and erotic, blending elegant poise with a modern urban woman's confident sensuality, captured as a cinematic still with lifelike texture.",
