          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a plush pink velvet chair, wearing a sleeveless black dress with a deep V-neck and sheer lace trim, the short A-line skirt riding high on her thighs, paired with black stockings and stiletto heels. Her right hand holds a microphone close to her lips, as if whispering secrets, while her left hand rests casually on her inner thigh, fingers long with pale nail polish. Her gaze is slightly downcast, lips parted, expression focused yet seductive. Her hair falls in soft, tousled waves over her shoulders, partially concealing a hint of cleavage. The scene is a stage edge with a black equipment case in the foreground, framing her legs. A pink chair is surrounded by abundant floral arrangements—white, pink, and lavender roses and hydrangeas with green leaves. To the right, several pink-and-white gift boxes with blue ribbons sit beside a fluffy feather floor lamp emitting warm pink light. The background is a large LED screen showing blurred floral patterns and silhouettes, pixels visible for a modern tech contrast. The composition is centered with her slightly left, strong pink-black color contrast. Soft stage lighting falls on her face and body, creating delicate chiaroscuro, with shadows behind her enhancing volume. The warm pink-toned light creates an intimate romantic atmosphere. Photorealistic, high resolution, natural amateur photography feel, low angle from audience perspective, slight background blur to focus on her and the foreground decorations. The style blends modern fashion with sweet romance, a private, sensual sharing moment.",
