          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a black leather booth, wearing only a leopard-print beret tilted over her forehead, her dark hair spilling over bare shoulders. She is completely topless, her full breasts exposed, nipples slightly hardened in the warm light. Her right hand rests against her cheek, fingers long, a thin gold bracelet on her wrist. Her left hand holds dark wooden chopsticks, poised mid-air. Her gaze drifts upward right, lips parted, expression pensive and lazy. Before her: a dark wood table with a printed paper placemat, a light green ceramic bowl (empty) and matching teacup, a paper menu clipped with metal at the corner, edges curling from use. To the left, a multi-compartment plate holds Korean side dishes—orange pickled radish strips, emerald seaweed salad, golden fried vegetable chunks, white rice balls, chopped kimchi—vivid colors, slight wear on the plate's edge. Behind the plate, a glossy black handbag with metal studs, a cute plush toy keychain (fluffy yellow hair, round glasses, blue outfit) hanging from it. Background: warm yellow restaurant wall, a horizontal LED strip casting soft yellow light downward, creating a gradient glow over a dark gray panel (acoustic or decorative). The scene is a close-up, the woman positioned center-right, head slightly tilted, her nakedness contrasting with the casual setting. Warm ambient light highlights her skin, the sheen of her hair, the glossy ceramic, and the cool metal of the bracelet. Atmosphere: intimate, sensual, everyday yet artfully composed, with a slight grainy texture suggesting a real low-light candid.",
