          "alias": "单女露胸白背心摄影棚微笑坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits indoors, her long black hair styled in a high bun adorned with delicate red flowers and berries, a few glossy strands falling naturally over her shoulders. She wears a sheer white sleeveless top loosely tied at the neck, left open to reveal her bare breasts with nipples subtly visible, paired with light shorts that show off her long legs. Her body leans forward slightly, hands resting gently on her knees, her expression serene and inviting as she gazes directly at the camera with lips parted in a soft, knowing smile. Beside her right side, a thick red knitted blanket with visible chunky stitches and tassels is piled over her legs and onto the floor, adding texture and warmth. The background is a soft beige wall with delicate white floral wallpaper on the right, the pattern symmetrical and elegant. The floor is pure white, clean and stark, creating strong color contrast. The composition is a mid-shot portrait, subject slightly left of center, body tilted to draw attention to her face and the detailed makeup. Lighting comes from the front left, soft and even, illuminating her face and upper body with gentle shadows that enhance depth. The background is slightly darker, making her stand out. The overall mood is warm, serene, and artistic, with rich red, white, and beige tones, a mix of cool and warm contrasts. The image has a high-end photographic quality, blending studio precision with natural intimacy, from the sheen of her hair to the texture of the blanket.",
