        {
          "id": "krea2-64157b7a8906a01ebd7208f0",
          "alias": "单女半褪粉外套摄影棚困倦站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a tiered indoor staircase, her long, voluminous dark brown curls cascading naturally over her shoulders, with a few soft strands brushing her face for a gentle, lazy allure. Her features are refined and sculpted, with subtly shimmering eye makeup and a matte pale pink lip color, the overall look clean and luminous. She gazes directly at the camera with a confident, composed expression, a slight upward curl at the corner of her mouth exuding sweetness and elegance. She wears a loose pink satin jacket draped off one shoulder, the left side slipping down to reveal bare skin, the wide sleeves slightly wrinkled, with a few silver metal buttons accenting the chest; beneath it, she is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, the white pearl necklace resting against her skin, its glossy beads layered and prominent. A simple silver bracelet encircles her wrist. Her left hand rests on her hip, while her right hand lightly touches the edge of the jacket, her posture relaxed and open. Below, she wears a matching pink miniskirt, clean and short, ending mid-thigh. Her legs are sheathed in sheer pale pink stockings with delicate white embroidered floral patterns, and her feet are encased in tall fluffy boots made of soft pink plush, thick and voluminous, rising from ankle to above the knee, with wide, exaggerated cuffs. The overall ensemble is fashion-forward, blending girlish charm with modern edge. The setting is a stepped architectural space: shallow gray or off-white stone or concrete stairs with crisp edges forming strong geometric lines. Above, a decorative wall is composed of countless small warm yellow and orange floral tiles arranged tightly, glowing with a soft, dreamy warmth. The floor is pale marble or tile with subtle texture and moderate reflectivity, capturing faint reflections of the figure and environment. The lighting is bright and even, coming from above and slightly front, like professional studio lights, highlighting every detail of her face and outfit, with soft, natural shadows and no harsh edges. The color palette is dominated by pink, accented with white, beige, and warm yellow, harmonious and cohesive. The composition is a medium-shot portrait: the woman stands slightly right of center, body angled slightly toward the camera, her face directly facing the viewer, creating a stable focal point. The foreground captures her full figure, emphasizing her attire and pose; the middle ground shows the surrounding steps and part of the background; the background extends into the floral wall and further stair structures, layering depth and perspective. The visual flow directs the eye along her pose and gaze toward her face and overall styling. The lighting and atmosphere feel warm and romantic, with a high-fashion editorial quality yet an intimate, everyday spontaneity, as if shot in a carefully curated indoor event or art exhibition space. The image is finely textured, with moderate color saturation, rich details, and strong visual impact and artistic beauty, blending modern fashion, sweet femininity, and premium sophistication—suitable for magazine covers, advertising, or personal portrait photography.",
