        {
          "id": "krea2-d211e63e3aed04089ee62c84",
          "alias": "单女短裙霓虹夜景困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a high stool, her jet-black hair falling partly across her face, piercing gaze aimed straight at the camera, cold and mysterious expression, lips slightly parted, radiating a sexy yet aloof aura. Her skin is fair and smooth, facial features sharp and elegant, long arched brows, heavy metallic purple-and-silver eye shadow, long curly lashes, straight nose bridge, overall makeup blending futuristic and chic styles. She wears a purple gradient strapless top with unique pleating that looks like scales or honeycomb, color shifting from deep to light purple, material soft and plush like velvet or lace, paired with a matching short skirt of intricate woven texture, a gold chain belt at the waist, a pearl bracelet on her wrist, multiple rings including a prominent pink diamond ring, and a black pendant necklace—luxurious and detailed. She sits on a beige padded high stool with metal legs reflecting cool light. The background is a retro-tech control room: warm orange walls, reflective pink tiles on the floor, a large console on the left covered with buttons, knobs, and screens glowing in colored lights, and old electronic devices on the right including a monitor and metal frame structure. The space is illuminated by strong neon lights in purple, pink, and orange, creating sharp contrasts and psychedelic futuristic atmosphere. Composition is mid-shot, subject slightly to the right, body leaning slightly, arm resting on the stool back, pose elegant and relaxed. Foreground emphasizes her upper body and clothing details, midground shows the console and equipment, background blurred for depth. The viewer's eyes are drawn to her face and upper body through her gaze and posture. Overall vibe blends cyberpunk, retro-futurism, and fashion aesthetics, with an artistic yet everyday feel like a real photo taken in an amateur-built set. Lighting soft but colors highly saturated, slight grain and film texture for realism, rich details, layered composition, harmonious yet intense colors, creating a dreamy visual experience.",
