          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the center of a traditional Southeast Asian market interior, wearing a backless, short yellow dress with intricate bead and fringe details—now fully unzipped and slipping off her shoulders, leaving her bare-breasted. She pairs it with fluorescent yellow stiletto heels and a wide-brimmed pink hat dripping with shiny fringe. She turns back over her shoulder, left hand touching the hat brim, right leg lifted elegantly with toe pointed, her pose both confident and seductive. Her long wavy hair falls naturally, makeup polished, lips bright, eyes locked directly on the camera. The dim surroundings make her skin and outfit glow. In the foreground left, stacked yellow and green plastic crates hold fresh fruit (apples, oranges), some with Thai text. A blue pickup truck in the background carries white foam boxes; beyond it, market stalls display hanging colorful toys, groceries, a red plastic bucket, a bicycle. Overhead, green metal beams and fluorescent lights cast harsh shadows from the upper left, creating strong chiaroscuro and depth. The composition is centrally balanced, with the subject at the golden ratio, foreground crates leading the eye, and dramatic light sculpting her body. Color palette: yellow, green, blue—pop against the mundane environment. The scene blends urban fashion, street art, and raw daily life, feeling like a candid amateur street photo with slight grain, warm tint, slightly blown-out highlights, yet rich texture and documentary realism. Her bare breasts are prominently featured, nipples visible, the wet look of her skin under the fluorescent light adding a sensual, gritty edge.",
