        {
          "id": "krea2-cfe83c7bf8f09ba6fa28aab9",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫办公室媚态坐脱衣（4）",
          "prompt": "A young woman with sleek black straight hair and blunt bangs sits at a white office desk, wearing thin-rimmed glasses. Her gaze is focused yet slightly lazy, lips parted in a natural, relaxed expression that hints at sensual confidence. She wears a white long-sleeved cropped shirt, unbuttoned to reveal a black lace bra and her toned midriff. A high-waist shiny purple patent leather mini skirt hugs her hips, the glossy surface contrasting sharply with the white top. Around her neck, a purple heart-shaped metal choker adds a sleek, edgy touch. Her legs are crossed, fully encased in black fishnet stockings, the net texture visible from thigh to ankle. Her hands rest lightly on the desk, beside scattered makeup brushes and eyeshadow palettes on the left, with an open notebook and gold smartphone behind her right. The background is a clean white wall with blurred pink abstract art, one featuring red line accents, and two vertical red decorative strips on the right. The lighting is bright and soft, shot from a slightly angled front view, centered on her figure. The color palette is predominantly white, purple, and black, with pink and red accents, creating a modern, high-fashion aesthetic. The overall scene feels like a professional studio portrait, emphasizing sharp textures and a subtly erotic atmosphere.",
