        {
          "id": "krea2-2a46487e402fe1bd0511b03e",
          "alias": "单女透视黑外套高塔媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands outdoors, her brown hair with blunt bangs, makeup with pink-to-purple gradient eye shadow, natural pink lips, pale smooth skin, direct gaze with a lazy, confident expression, lips slightly parted, wearing a black sleeveless jacket open over a white tight tank top, black shorts, sheer stockings, and high black leather boots. Her jacket is unzipped, arms spread—left hand resting on a blue metal railing, right hand hanging loose, body slightly tilted, right leg bent, left leg straight with toe pointed. The blue grid-patterned fence gleams slightly, leading the eye to her. Background: left side shows white tent fabric with natural folds, right side gray wire mesh, distant blur of city buildings and a traditional Japanese castle tower in deep green and gray-brown under twilight clouds. Soft backlight outlines her figure, making her stand out against the cool tones. The scene feels cinematic, with medium focus, shallow depth of field, slight film grain and desaturated colors. She is the center, body crossing diagonally with the railing, creating dynamic tension. The overall mood is a blend of modern fashion and nostalgic, everyday eroticism.",
