        {
          "id": "krea2-68d77573171c092bfedbe0cc",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服博物馆困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman in a luxurious black ancient-style gown sits gracefully on an intricately carved wooden bed. Her jet-black hair is coiled into an elaborate bun, adorned with ornate silver hairpins and tassel earrings, with a vermillion floral mark on her forehead. Her expression is cold and elegant, eyes deep and penetrating, lips slightly curved with a hint of mystery and seduction. Her right shoulder is bare, skin luminous and smooth, while her left arm rests naturally, fingers long and pale with subtle pink polish. She wears a black velvet wide-sleeved robe with a strapless neckline, embroidered with golden dragon motifs and floral patterns, edged with gold thread. The voluminous gown pools on the floor in rich folds and shadows. Her legs are crossed, right leg slightly raised, revealing a glimpse of her ankle. The background features misty white gauze curtains drifting gently, creating a dreamy atmosphere. The bed has dark wooden carved headboard, soft deep-blue brocade quilts and multiple pillows with subtle patterns. Overall color palette is black, gold, and gray with soft blue light. Mid-shot composition, woman positioned slightly left of center, body angled toward the camera, head slightly tilted, eyes gazing directly at the viewer. Foreground shows detailed fabric textures, mid-ground captures her full posture and surroundings, background softly blurred to emphasize depth. Lighting comes from the left, creating soft chiaroscuro, highlights on face, hands, and gold embroidery, shadows smooth and nuanced, evoking warm, mysterious interior mood. The overall style blends classical Eastern aesthetics with modern sensibility, like a carefully painted court portrait or a dramatic still from a costume drama, exuding poetic beauty and narrative tension. Shot with professional equipment: 85mm lens, f/2.8, ISO 100, 1/125s, softbox fill light, ensuring sharp detail and true color, with mild film grain and slight noise for realism and vintage feel. Composition follows rule of thirds, subject at golden ratio, bokeh moderate, aspect ratio 4:3, suitable for art exhibition or high-end fashion magazine cover. The mood is serene, dignified, and story-rich, inviting the viewer to imagine the legendary life behind this woman.",
