        {
          "id": "krea2-6802a467f9a5bea13a402f20",
          "alias": "单女透视连衣裙椅上困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a moss-covered rattan bench, wearing a sheer off-shoulder lace dress with delicate pink, blue, and yellow floral patterns. The translucent fabric clings to her curves, revealing the soft contours of her bare skin and the swell of her breasts, one strap slipping down to expose her shoulder and the edge of her nipple. Her long black hair cascades loosely, a few strands brushing her cheek. She holds a white porcelain teacup in her right hand, the pale liquid floating a small white blossom; her left hand rests a long golden teaspoon. Her eyes are half-closed, lips parted in a serene, sensual smile, as if lost in a dreamy afternoon. Behind her, a pink wall with soft watercolor-like textures and dappled light, surrounded by lush green plants, white daisies, and pink flowers. Sunlight streams from the upper right, casting warm side lighting that highlights her skin and the sheer dress, creating delicate shadows on her cleavage and the outline of her nipples. The composition centers her slightly left, body angled right, head tilted back in an elegant S-curve. Foreground foliage with dewdrops frames the scene. Colors: soft pink, white, green with warm gold tones. Film-like quality, warm, nostalgic. The overall mood is quiet, romantic, poetic, capturing a fairy-tale tea moment, with every detail crisp yet soft.",
