        {
          "id": "krea2-7470118d3aa59b7d06333360",
          "alias": "单女湿身金礼服微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a deep blue velvet backdrop, the focal point of the image, wearing a form-fitting gold sequined mermaid gown that hugs every curve, its tiny metallic sequins shimmering with luxurious light and a gradient from top to bottom; thin silver chain straps trace her elegant shoulders and collarbone, the skirt drapes and narrows at the hem, accentuating her hourglass figure. Her long red-brown wavy hair cascades over her left shoulder and chest, glossy and warm-toned against the cold light, complementing the gold dress. Her makeup is flawless—bold eyeliner, thick lashes, soft coral-pink lips—her eyes bright and confident, staring directly at the camera with a subtle, alluring smile. She wears layered necklaces of fine chains and geometric pendants, a minimalist watch and bracelet on her wrist, rings on her fingers. The dress is cut low and sheer enough to reveal a daring glimpse of cleavage and the sides of her ribcage, while her pose—body slightly turned, right hand gently lifting the hem, left hand relaxed at her side—is both elegant and provocatively sensual. In the foreground, the blurred edge of a white object hints at a live audience or photographer. The deep blue velvet background has a fine-grained texture, with the word “Tiffany” in pale green artistic script above, flowing and cohesive. The composition is centered, with the woman as the main focus, lit by soft front overhead lighting that casts subtle highlights and shadows on the sequins and her skin, creating depth and a glossy, almost wet look. The overall mood is high-fashion luxury with a dreamy, seductive edge, like a red-carpet event or brand launch, evoking cinematic quality with blue and gold as the dominant cool-warm palette. Every detail is crisp, layered, and professionally captured, retaining a sense of candid intimacy and glamorous sensuality.",
