          "id": "krea2-3c3a5074941b992f16bd2286",
          "alias": "单女蓝旗袍摄影棚微笑注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a tight, shiny blue satin qipao with gold dragon-and-phoenix embroidery, the side slit pulled high to reveal the tops of her thighs, sheathed in sheer purple lace-top pantyhose. She balances on one leg, the other hooked over the arm of a white metal-frame chair, the qipao’s hem riding up to expose her upper thigh and the lace edge of her stocking. Bright blue stiletto heels. Her right hand loosely holds a red New Year couplet bearing gold characters for “fortune and prosperity,” surrounded by “福” and cloud patterns. Her black wavy hair falls over one shoulder, her eyes half-lidded and smiling, lips slightly parted, giving a warm yet sultry gaze at the camera. The room is cozy: cream wallpaper with subtle floral pattern, light brown wainscoting on the lower walls, decorative prints including an Eiffel Tower scene and an arched doorway. To the right, a small white round table with a green plant and a clear glass vase. To the left, a leafy plant in a white pot by a window. The floor is covered with a vintage rose-patterned rug. Soft light filters through the left-side Venetian blinds, creating gentle chiaroscuro. Medium shot, woman positioned center-left, S-curve posture, the couplet as a foreground focal point. Warm, bright, festive atmosphere with a subtle film-grain texture and harmonious pastel tones, blending traditional and modern aesthetics in a tastefully seductive home or studio setting.",
