        {
          "id": "krea2-45c466504e40d72b17fe6c10",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑T恤城市冷淡站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a high-tech server room, positioned center-right with her body slightly angled toward the camera, her gaze direct, cool, and confident, exuding urban fashion and bold individuality. Her hair is messily pinned up, with a few strands of reddish-brown hair falling across her forehead and cheeks, adding a carefree, rebellious charm. She wears a black sleeveless printed T-shirt with bold red \"NEBRASKA\" text and a blue-and-white owl graphic, now unbuttoned to expose her bare torso and firm, natural breasts, her nipples visible against the dark fabric. Over it, she has a black vest with matching owl details and metal buttons, left open to fully reveal her chest. A black silk scarf is tied around her neck, one end hanging loosely, the other in a bow, blending elegance with a retro edge. Long silver earrings composed of geometric shapes dangle and shimmer with slight movements. Her hands are tucked into the pockets of high-waisted blue jeans, fingers adorned with several rings—one prominent blue gemstone ring—and a silver bracelet on her wrist. The jeans show visible stitching and wear marks, giving a street-style distressed finish. The background features server racks: on the left, a large black cabinet with a white \"DO NOT ENTER\" warning label, its indicator lights flashing blue and red, creating a strong tech atmosphere. In front of it, a yellow-and-black foldable safety barrier adds realism. On the right, a light gray wall with evenly spaced small holes (likely for ventilation or soundproofing) casts a sharp silhouette of the woman, enhancing spatial depth. The scene is bathed in cool-toned lighting from above and the side, producing soft but shadowed illumination that highlights textures—the silk’s sheen, denim’s weave, and metal reflections. Composition is a mid-shot, with the woman dominating the frame; background elements are slightly blurred to emphasize her while retaining context. Overall mood blends modern urban nightlife, technology, fashion, and expressive individualism, evoking a moment backstage at a music festival, an electronic music party, or a high-tech exhibition. The color palette is deep blue and black, accented with red, yellow, and white, with high contrast, layered tones, and delicate light-and-shadow interplay that creates a cool yet warm unique atmosphere, telling a story of youth, freedom, and exploration.",
