        {
          "id": "krea2-a4c03e970d735abce19a270c",
          "alias": "单女半褪灰连帽衫舞台害羞站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the dim backstage lighting, her long, jet-black hair cascading over bare shoulders as strands catch the purple and blue stage lights, with a few loose wisps brushing against her flushed cheeks. Her porcelain skin glows with an almost translucent pallor under the cool tones, her eyes lined with dark smudged liner and thick lashes, meeting the lens with a sultry, direct gaze. Her nose is delicate, her lips slightly parted in a teasing pout, a tiny black mole above her left brow adding a seductive mark. She wears an oversized light gray hoodie, unzipped and slipping off one shoulder to reveal the bare, pale skin of her collarbone and chest—no top underneath. A pink lanyard with blurred text hangs loosely between her breasts. The soft fabric drapes over her form, hinting at the contours beneath, sleeves loosely bunched. From the left foreground, a hand extends into frame, slender fingers wrapped around a pale violet card, the ring finger adorned with a thin gold band, a white-strapped watch on the wrist, offering the card toward the woman in an intimate, narrative gesture. Behind her, the chaotic backstage: black equipment cases stacked with white logos like “Fresnel” and “MS,” a large LED screen displaying pixelated graphics and the word “START” in pink and white, with heart-like decorations casting a warm pink-purple glow. Gold and silver confetti scatters on the floor, catching dim reflections. The composition is a close-up, the woman slightly off-center, head tilted, body facing forward in a natural stance, camera at a low angle inviting intimacy. The visual flow leads from the offering hand to her face, then to the screen behind. Lighting is a strong cool-warm contrast, with blue and purple dominating, while soft fill lights accentuate her skin and the exposed chest, shadows merging into the background for depth. The overall mood is modern, youthful, and electric—a captured moment backstage after a show, raw and authentic, with subtle grain and color shifts like a candid phone shot, but charged with an explicit, sensual tension.",
