        {
          "id": "krea2-9ef23a0e3e2b1ee142d3092b",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市媚态跪过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman kneels at the entrance of an old wooden doorframe, wearing a black spaghetti-strap dress with petal-like cutouts, paired with black leather shorts—her outfit is both sensual and artistic. Her long, jet-black hair falls naturally over her shoulders, with straight bangs across her forehead. She has heavy, defined eyeliner, full lips, and a glossy red lip, staring into the lens with a dreamy, seductive gaze. Her left hand rests lightly on the edge of the wooden door, her right hand on her knee, fingers tipped with deep red nail polish. A beaded bracelet circles her wrist, and tassel earrings dangle from her ears. The foreground features her body and the doorframe, made of dark brown aged wood with rough, weathered texture. To the right, a mottled brick wall, dark-toned and coarse. In the deep background, a dark alley reveals a thick tree trunk with cracked bark, stone steps, faint plant silhouettes, and a warm yellow lantern hanging in the distance, casting a soft glow. The scene is nighttime, dimly lit, with the main light coming from a front-left fill lamp, creating strong chiaroscuro. The side light gently illuminates her face and body, highlighting delicate skin texture and sculpted muscle lines, while shadows remain deep, adding an air of mystery. The composition is centered, with the subject slightly right, the doorframe acting as a natural frame that draws the eye toward her. Depth of field blurs the background, focusing attention on her. The visual flow begins at her face, down her body curves and dress details, then back to the lantern and alley, adding layers. Overall color palette: deep browns and blacks, accented by warm yellow light, blending vintage and modern styles—like a cinematic frame, rich in narrative. The texture is fine, resembling professional photography but with subtle film grain and slight noise, mimicking amateur everyday realism. A medium focal length captures her expression and pose from a slightly low angle, accentuating her height and presence. Background blur is smooth, no blown highlights or crushed shadows. Saturation is moderate, details abundant, evoking a private, sensual atmosphere under urban night lights, like street-style fashion photography—visually striking and artistic.",
