        {
          "id": "krea2-1a221d908f527b821b044442",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝浴巾海滩微笑坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a blue-and-white striped beach towel, completely topless, her bare breasts exposed in the warm evening light. She wears only a delicate silver bracelet on her left wrist and a simple ring on her right ring finger. Her burgundy halter one-piece swimsuit lies discarded beside her, its gold metal clasp catching the glow. Her long brown hair falls in soft waves over her shoulders, straight bangs framing her face. She turns slightly toward the camera with a gentle, warm smile, hands resting folded on her knees, fingers long with light nail polish. The background is a tropical beach resort: fine golden sand, tall palm trees with rough trunks, a folded blue umbrella and a white one nearby, dense green shrubbery in the distance, and blurred resort buildings with curved roofs and faint purple neon lights. The sky shows a soft gradient from pale pink to light blue at dusk. The lighting is warm, low-angle, from the front-left simulating natural evening sun, casting soft shadows on her face, arms, and legs. The composition places her slightly right of center, with the towel and her feet in the foreground, the background softly blurred. The image has a film grain texture, moderate color saturation, a candid, life-like feel, capturing a lazy, intimate summer vacation moment.",
