          "alias": "单女露胸霓虹夜景微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a bright indoor space, completely topless, her bare skin glowing under warm lights. Her long, naturally wavy hair falls loose, catching soft highlights as she gazes tenderly at the camera with a gentle, confident smile. She holds a huge red heart-shaped gift box in both hands, the box printed with \"WITH LOVE. SINCE 1986\" and accompanied by a small bouquet tied with a purple ribbon. Her body is slightly turned, leaning just enough to create a dynamic balance, with the gift box partially covering her chest, hinting at her bare nipples. In the foreground, her clear face and the present dominate the composition, shifted right of center. Behind her, a full red wall bears the white text \"NESPRESSO 40 YEARS OF ICONIC\" in sleek modern font. On the right, a glowing red neon heart shaped like a coffee capsule emits a warm, soft halo, its light spilling onto her skin. The ceiling is pale beige with exposed industrial pipes and spotlights casting cool white downlights, contrasting the red wall. The scene is centered symmetrically, with her eyes, hands, and the heart box guiding the viewer’s gaze. Vertical lines of the wall and the curved neon create visual rhythm. The warm red light bathes her skin, sculpting her curves with fine highlights, while the gift box reflects subtle gloss. The saturated, high-contrast palette is softened by gentle transitions, giving the image a polished commercial-photo quality with an intimate, everyday feel—as if caught at a brand event or pop-up. Shot on a Canon EOS R5 or Sony A7R IV with a 24-70mm f/2.8 lens at f/2.8, blurred background, three-point lighting: key from front, fill from side, rim light to accentuate her silhouette. The overall style blends fashion, art, and life, magazine-cover quality with natural realism.",
