          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a makeup mirror, her deep brown wavy hair cascading naturally, strands brushing her cheek in a lazy, sensual fall. She wears only a black-and-white striped bandeau top with asymmetrical neckline, but the top is pulled down to bare her full breasts, nipples visible under warm light. Her lower half is in fitted dark gray jeans that hug every curve. Her right hand rests on the glossy black counter, deep nail polish and a silver ring catching the glow. Her left hand drapes over the edge, revealing a small wrist tattoo. She turns slightly to glance back at the camera, lips painted a bold red, gaze cool and inviting. The frame includes a large black-framed mirror circled by vertical warm white bulbs, casting a soft, even radiance. The mirror reflects her partially nude figure and the room beyond—brown leather chairs against the wall, white gear, pale gray walls, recessed ceiling lights. A wooden accent wall adds warmth. The composition is a mid-shot, her body placed on the right, leaning just so, creating an elegant S-curve. The glossy countertop reflects her hands and the light, deepening the sense of space. Background blurs to keep focus on her skin, hair, and the mirror's halo. The lighting is intimate, warm yellow from the bulbs highlighting her face, breasts, shoulders, and hands, with soft highlights and shadows on her skin and clothes. Colors are mostly black, white, gray, punctuated by warm light and red lips, giving a modern, slightly theatrical look—like a backstage or studio moment, raw yet artistic, evoking a private, candid sexuality.",
