          "alias": "单女黑靴子泳池微笑坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits slightly left-center on a deep navy velvet sofa, her body tilted right, left hand gently brushing her tousled dark brown waves, right hand resting naturally on the sofa edge, legs crossed and stretched forward, black high leather boots gleaming. She wears a low-cut floral sleeveless dress—abstract blooms and geometric patterns in pink, yellow, blue, and black—the neckline plunging to reveal her smooth collarbone, a thin chain necklace glinting at her throat, the fabric strained over her chest, hinting at bare skin beneath, her nipples subtly visible through the thin material. Her expression is relaxed and inviting, a soft smile on her lips, eyes locked directly at the viewer. The backdrop is dark gray vertical striped wallpaper, a circular recessed light above casting a warm golden glow, creating a gentle halo around her. A light brown wooden trim runs behind the sofa; to the right, a medium-brown circular side table holds a glass of red drink with a straw. The composition is centered, focusing on her face and upper body, with the sofa and table in the midground. Warm light from above falls across her skin, sculpting soft shadows on her collarbone and the curve of her breasts, while deeper shadows pool on the sofa and floor. The overall tone is intimate, quiet, and modern, with a palette of deep blue, charcoal, and warm gold, giving a candid snapshot feel—slight grain and natural lens distortion, as if captured with a phone or casual camera, blending artistic beauty with raw, spontaneous sensuality.",
