        {
          "id": "krea2-a99f63f7f2ef7cd0eab14f0a",
          "alias": "单女黑旗袍舞台媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands against a pure white background, wearing a fitted black cheongsam with intricate golden dragon embroidery that coils from the shoulder down to the hem, the scales, claws, and tail sharply detailed, exuding an aura of Eastern mystique and power. The collar is accented with pale blue frog buttons, adding a touch of elegance. Over it, she wears a long, open, dark gray pinstriped coat with a subtle sheen, lined in light blue silk that flutters slightly in the breeze, creating layered visual contrast. The coat hangs open, revealing the cheongsam's extremely high slit that bares the full length of her smooth, toned thigh, with the hemline grazing the hip. Her legs are flawless and elongated, ending in sleek black pointed-toe high heels with glossy reflective surfaces. Her hair is styled in double buns, jet-black and glossy, adorned with blue-and-white butterfly hair ornaments; the buns are full, with a few loose strands falling on either side, adding playful allure. Her makeup is exquisite: sharply lined eyes with a cold, piercing gaze, full red lips, and an expression of icy detachment mixed with smoldering sensuality. She stands in a three-quarter turn, body forming a natural S-curve, right hand hanging casually, left hand lightly touching the edge of the coat, posture elegant yet provocative. The background is a clean light gray-white wall, no distractions. Lighting comes from front-left, softly illuminating her face, arms, and legs, creating subtle shadows that sculpt her curves, especially along the bare thigh and the contours of her collarbone. No overexposure or dead blacks. The overall palette is black, gray, gold with blue accents, harmonious and striking. The visual flow starts at her face, moves down the dragon motif on the cheongsam, then lingers on the high-slit-revealed leg, and finally to the heels, while the coat's flowing lines expand the composition outward. The style blends traditional Eastern aesthetics with modern fashion, evoking a staged performance yet feeling like an intimate, artful portrait—as if you can sense her breath and heartbeat, the fiery soul behind her cool facade. The image appears shot with professional equipment, ultra-high resolution, yet retains the natural authenticity of a casual home moment, capturing an unexpectedly transcendent beauty.",
