          "prompt": "A young woman stands confidently at the center of a warm vintage café, nude except for a pair of white lace stockings rising above her thighs and high, polished brown leather boots. An olive green cardigan with black polka dots hangs open, framing her bare shoulders and breasts, the bronze buttons undone, a wide dark brown leather belt cinched at her waist. She wears no top; the white fluffy layered miniskirt sits low on her hips, exposing the curve of her belly. Her right hand holds a cream canvas tote bag, left hand on her hip, gaze calm and inviting toward the camera. Her skin is pale, makeup natural, lips soft, hair loose with small clips. Behind her: dark wood walls, a blackboard menu listing “Cappuccino” and “Flat White,” a silver espresso machine, ceramic jars, a white cup and saucer on a round wooden table, scattered wooden chairs. Warm light from the left illuminates her body, casting soft shadows on the wooden floor. The scene is tender, nostalgic, and sensual—a captured moment of quiet eroticism in a cozy afternoon café.",
