        {
          "id": "krea2-6c1ace76fbd4b2160e0aa103",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝衬衫公寓忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the indoor floor, leaning back against a beige wall, her black shoulder-length hair falling naturally, bangs neatly framing her forehead. She gazes at the lens with a calm, slightly melancholic expression, lips parted in thought. She wears a loose blue-and-white striped shirt, sleeves rolled to elbows, completely unbuttoned, exposing her bare breasts, neckline, and smooth torso. Her lower body is nude, legs crossed—right ankle over left—feet flat on the floor, hands resting folded on her knees. A thin black rope bracelet adorns her left wrist. Her skin is pale and flawless, legs long and toned. She sits on a brown-and-white geometric woven rug with repeated diamond and wave patterns. Behind her is a simple light-beige wall with subtle shadow gradients at the corner; the floor is light gray tile. Medium shot composition, subject slightly left of center, shot from a slightly elevated angle, soft natural daylight from the left creates even highlights on her face, arms, and legs, smooth shaded transitions. Warm color palette with the blue shirt contrasting against beige background. The atmosphere is quiet, intimate, capturing a moment of private solitude. Detailed realism: cotton texture of the shirt, skin softness, rug fibers, flat wall surface. Style is realistic with a blend of fashion and everyday life, evoking a gentle, introspective mood and a quiet beauty.",
