        {
          "id": "krea2-99f4835146b156843d2b867b",
          "alias": "单女露胸灰连衣裙酒店媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the warm light of a modern luxury hotel lobby, her gray short-sleeve dress unbuttoned and hanging open, revealing her bare breasts and torso. The white trim at the neckline and waist accents her curves, while a black triangular metal pin remains pinned to the open fabric. Her black vintage cat-eye glasses with metallic details frame her confident gaze, and her brown hair is swept to one side, secured by a black clip. Small silver stud earrings catch the light. Her right hand lifts gracefully to her forehead in an elegant salute, while her left hand holds a cream diamond-quilted handbag with gold logo. Her makeup is precise, lips a soft coral red, as she looks directly at the camera with controlled sensuality. The background shows the high-end hotel lobby: a glass display cabinet on the left reflecting the interior, dark wood walls with vertical metal grilles, and polished dark brown wood floors mirroring the scene. In the center, olive-green fabric sofas with woven cushions hold small items like teacups and an ashtray; a round black coffee table in the distance displays two small red bottles. Afternoon sunlight streams from the left, casting golden light and dramatic shadows across walls and floor, creating a warm, intimate atmosphere. The composition is centered with the woman slightly left, her body turned, head facing the camera as the focal point. Foreground: crisp, clear subject; midground: sofas and table; background: decorative wall and glass partition. The depth and lighting guide the eye from her face into the space beyond, blending soft, dramatic illumination with a warm, luxurious feel. It captures an elegant, unguarded moment—as if she just returned from a business meeting or a date, pausing for this casual yet deliberate shot. The image texture is fine, with a subtle grain and natural exposure transition, giving it both a professional fashion sensibility and a lifelike, intimate quality.",
