        {
          "id": "krea2-bcac9dd54291623500b82d53",
          "alias": "单女露胸白衬衫害羞站立手持物",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center frame, her long, sleek black hair cascading over bare shoulders and partially veiling her full, exposed breasts. Her skin is fair and luminous, flushed with a warm blush across her cheeks, lips painted a soft nude pink, slightly parted in a coy, seductive half-smile. Her eyes are half-lidded, a playful glint and hint of shyness beneath thick lashes. She wears an ornate silver crown set with pink heart-shaped gems and glittering crystals, a large heart jewel at its peak. A delicate pearl necklace rests against her collarbone. She is topless, wearing only a sheer white lace blouse with ruffled edges and flower appliqués, the translucent fabric clinging to her breasts, nipples visible through the lace. Over it, a black ribbed knit cardigan is worn off-shoulder, baring one shoulder and the curve of her cleavage. In her right hand, she holds a decorative scepter topped with a heart studded with pink gems and crystals, the silver shaft gleaming. Her left hand hangs at her side, fingers long, nails painted light pink. The background is a blurred gradient of cool blue, from pale to deep, with faint geometric patterns softened into bokeh. Lighting is soft and warm from above, casting gentle shadows across her face and torso, highlighting the lustrous hair, the jewels, and the creamy skin. The composition is a near close-up, focusing on her face, crown, and scepter, with the sheer lace and bare flesh creating an intimate, dreamy, and erotic fairy-tale moment.",
