        {
          "id": "krea2-ca5c4096a82f49afe30c6aa1",
          "alias": "单女上衣街道害羞站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on an outdoor street, her brown hair in a blunt fringe with a light gray headband, eyes downcast, expression shy and contemplative, head slightly tilted toward the left. Her fair skin is flawless, makeup precise, defined eyeliner, thick curled lashes, natural soft lips. She wears a low-cut black top that exposes her cleavage, paired with a black-and-white-and-gray plaid miniskirt with lace trim, layered under a black oversized glossy coat with puffy wide sleeves. In her left hand she holds a black microphone, fingers wrapped around it close to her lips; in her right hand she carries a bright green canvas tote bag with white lettering “Vietcombank” and “napas.” A gold bracelet and pearl bracelet adorn her wrist, multiple rings including a silver cross on her fingers, and intricate layered earrings of chains, pendants, and beads. Her posture is relaxed, body slightly leaning, suggesting she just finished an event or is waiting. The foreground highlights the green bag and microphone. Shot in medium frame, slightly high angle. Background is a bright green textured wall with faded red Vietnamese signage, rough and peeling. On the right edge, part of another person in green-and-white clothing is visible, indicating a public setting like a street interview, fan meeting, or commercial event. Natural sunlight from front and above illuminates her face and clothing evenly, with soft shadows. Overall green tone dominates, accented by black, white, gray, and skin tones. Balanced composition, figure centered-left, leaving space on the right for movement. A candid, documentary feel with rich details, capturing a youthful, vibrant yet professional atmosphere—a mix of idol glamour and everyday authenticity.",
