        {
          "id": "krea2-77547e75bbace0d12fde8090",
          "alias": "单女露胸棕背心花园微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a white wooden bench in an outdoor garden, her soft pink hair braided into a long plait over her right shoulder, shining gently in the sunlight. Her makeup is flawless—defined eyes, subtle lip color—and she wears a warm, inviting smile. She is topless, her firm bare breasts exposed, with the zipper of her deep brown sleeveless tight vest partially undone to reveal her cleavage. A decorative belt cinches her waist, and she wears a light plaid skirt (cream, light brown, gray-blue) that rides up to expose long, smooth legs. On her feet, thick brown sandals with cutout details and straps, plus white lace-trimmed socks with bow decorations. Her left hand rests on the bench armrest, while her right arm is raised high, palm open, revealing layered metal, leather, and beaded bracelets and rings on her fingers with light nail polish. Her pose is graceful and confident, legs slightly parted. Behind her, lush tropical greenery—large monstera leaves, dense ferns, colorful flowers (white daisies, pink blossoms, hydrangeas)—creates a layered, vibrant background. The scene is lit by warm natural sunlight from upper left, creating dappled light and soft shadows on her skin. The composition is a mid-shot, slightly low angle, with the woman offset to the right, her gaze directed toward the top left. Foreground grass and legs in focus, midground shows her and the bench, background softly blurred. The overall mood is fresh, romantic, and summer-like, with a dreamy yet realistic photographic quality. Color palette dominated by greens, with accents of pink, yellow, and brown. The image feels intimate and sensual, capturing a quiet, beautiful moment of youthful vitality and natural serenity.",
