          "alias": "单女短裙门媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at the entrance of a white curved wooden structure, wearing a sheer pale blue lace long-sleeve top with embroidered flowers, no undergarment, revealing her nipples and bare skin beneath the open lace. She has a multi-layered floral maxi skirt with lace trim and fringe, hiked up to expose her bare thigh. Her long black curly hair drapes over her shoulders, adorned with a long necklace of teal beads and white shells, and thin silver drop earrings. Her right hand rests lightly on the white doorframe, left hand placed on her exposed thigh, gazing directly at the camera with a soft, contemplative yet subtly seductive expression, leaning gracefully against the door. Background shows blue-and-white striped walls, with colorful climbing holds on the right, and blue and yellow soft rubber floor mats, evoking a children's play area. Medium shot, subject slightly left, white arched doorway creates a natural frame. Cool-toned lighting from soft natural daylight, highlighting facial contours and fabric textures. Overall mood relaxed, candid, with a blend of fashion photography and everyday realism.",
