        {
          "id": "krea2-2c57caa4461b1407a7d18bc1",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙酒店媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands beneath a lush green arch at the Conrad Shenzhen entrance. She wears a beige short-sleeved dress, but the top is fully unbuttoned, baring her firm breasts and a sliver of her toned stomach. The hem is hiked high to her waist, revealing black lace panties and the curve of her hips. Her medium-length straight brown hair cascades over her shoulders, and black thin-rimmed glasses frame her seductive, gentle gaze toward the camera. Her left hand teases the dress strap, while her right hand rests casually at her side. She carries a small brown vintage leather bag with a metal buckle and double straps. She stands slightly left of center, body angled, half-length portrait. Foreground: dense tropical foliage—tall palm fronds, colorful crotons, low shrubs—planted in log planters, creating layered depth. Midground: a stone stairway flanked by greenery, leading the eye to the hotel. Background: a modern glass high-rise with \"CONRAD SHENZHEN\" sign, blue sky reflections. Symmetrical composition frames the woman through the plant arch and steps, offering strong urban depth. Lighting: warm late-afternoon sun from upper right, golden rays filtering through leaves, casting dappled shadows on her skin and ground. Her face is evenly lit, contours sharp, skin glowing, shadows soft. Palette: warm yellows and greens contrast with cool gray building, creating an elegant, serene mood. Shot with an 85mm f/2.8 portrait lens, shallow depth of field blurs the background while preserving architectural details, fine-grained texture, natural exposure, capturing a spontaneous yet sensual moment of modern urban elegance.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
