          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the rainy night under a transparent umbrella, her long, jet-black hair falling naturally, wet strands clinging to her face and shoulders with a glossy sheen. Her fair, delicate skin is flawless, her features refined and three-dimensional. She gazes slightly to the right, her eyes carrying a hint of melancholy and introspection, lips slightly parted. Her right hand gently supports her chin, fingers slender and elegant, her pose graceful and languid. She wears a red slip dress with thin straps, revealing smooth shoulders and a deep cleavage, the fabric clinging to her curves, hinting at her full breasts. The transparent umbrella is beaded with fine droplets, sparkling under the warm yellow lights. Rain runs down the umbrella in streaks. The background is a blur of night cityscape with soft bokeh lights, some forming circular and linear halos, creating a dreamy atmosphere. The sky is deep dark, contrasting with the bright foreground. Close-up composition, the woman occupies the center-right of the frame, head slightly tilted, leaving space in the direction of her gaze. The background is heavily blurred, emphasizing the subject and depth. Light comes from the warm yellow streetlights, illuminating her face from the side, creating soft rim lighting and reflections on the umbrella, with strong chiaroscuro. The overall color palette is cool, dominated by black and gray, punctuated by warm yellow and red dress, forming a cold-warm contrast. The scene carries a slight film grain and retro filter, with subtle vignetting at the edges, enhancing the texture and artistry, as if captured by an old camera, full of nostalgia. The motion blur of raindrops and the bloom of light spots make the scene vivid and poetic. The composition is tight and tense, focusing on her expression and pose, conveying a sense of quiet solitude and beauty. The style is realistic yet artistic, blending the spontaneity of everyday life with cinematic aesthetics.