          "alias": "单女全裸红毛衣沙发媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a white sofa, her short brown hair with delicate bangs framing a fair, porcelain complexion. She gazes softly at the camera, lips slightly parted with a hint of rosy blush, her expression sweet yet subtly seductive. She wears a fitted red knit short-sleeve dress, unbuttoned low at the front to reveal a glimpse of cleavage, the fabric clinging to her slender waist and long legs. Her hands are crossed under her chin, arms bent naturally, a delicate gold bracelet on her wrist. Her fingers are long and well-manicured. She sits cross-legged, thighs pressed together, toes barely touching the floor, sheer nude stockings accentuating the smooth lines of her legs. Her body leans slightly forward, pose elegant and relaxed. The background is a cozy home setting: on the left, a bed with a beige plaid sheet, an open book on it, and a hanging spider plant with vines cascading; on the right, light wood blinds letting in soft sunlight that casts gentle shadows. A decorative print reading \"Bochner\" hangs on the wall, with a white garment on a hanger nearby. The room is bright and clean, dominated by white and light wood tones. Lighting comes from the front side, softly and evenly illuminating her face and body, creating natural shadow transitions and enhancing depth. The composition is a medium shot, with her centered slightly to the right, background slightly blurred to keep focus on her. The white sofa has soft leather or fabric texture in the foreground. The red dress contrasts vividly with the white surroundings, adding visual impact. The overall look feels like a candid snapshot taken at home, with a slight film grain and subtle noise, warm and soft tones emphasizing realism and domestic intimacy. She exudes a quiet, private, sensual atmosphere—a moment frozen in time, with the whisper of breeze and faint scent in the air. The image retains natural textures: fabric folds, skin detail, and the sheer quality of the stocking