          "alias": "单女半褪白T恤厨房戏谑坐指向",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a modern minimalist kitchen, wearing a loose white t-shirt dampened and clinging to her skin, the fabric pulled down to expose one bare shoulder and the curve of a firm, erect nipple beneath the thin cotton; the t-shirt's gray ink pattern blurred. Her dark hair is piled high in a messy bun, strands falling across her neck. She holds a metal whisk in her right hand, left hand pressing against her own face, fingers grazing her lips and smearing a streak of white cream across her cheek. A dollop of whipped cream balances on the tip of her nose, just above a sly, knowing smile. She looks directly at the camera with a playful, inviting gaze. In front of her is a white countertop and a vintage-style kitchen mixer with a stainless steel bowl; a glass jar of marshmallows sits nearby. Sunlight streams in from a window with horizontal blinds, casting soft, sensual shadows across her body and the clean white tile wall. The composition centers on her, body slightly turned, the whisk pointing toward her face. The mood is intimate, playful, and casually erotic—a high-quality, realistic photograph with warm tones and fine detail, emphasizing her bare legs and the subtle wetness of her shirt.",
