        {
          "id": "krea2-79c465c0b6b39465b09211bf",
          "alias": "单女露胸米毛衣微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits before a blooming field of orange-red tulips, topless, with her long jet-black hair and straight bangs cascading around a cream-colored hollow knit beanie that sits playfully on her forehead. Her porcelain skin glows in soft diffused light, her delicate facial features perfectly defined, large bright eyes gazing softly to the left with a hint of curiosity and warmth, a gentle smile curving her lips. She wears a light blue knitted cardigan, unbuttoned, hanging open to reveal her bare breasts, the soft fabric texture visible; a pure white skirt hugs her lower body. Her hands cradle her chin, slender fingers relaxed, the pose natural and inviting. The composition is a close-up portrait occupying the left third of the frame, with the foreground showing her face, shoulders, and exposed chest. The middle ground is filled with vivid orange-red tulips in full bloom, their layered petals and upright green stems creating a stark contrast. The background blurs into a soft sea of flowers and dark earth, emphasizing depth. Lighting is warm and even, like overcast morning sun from the upper left, casting delicate highlights on her cheeks, nose, and hands, with smooth shadow transitions. The color palette mixes orange-red, sky blue, and white for a romantic, pastoral atmosphere. The image feels like a film photograph, rich in detail, intimate and timeless, capturing a serene moment of youthful beauty and nature.",
