        {
          "id": "krea2-9f10e0188743b6c951edb9fb",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑短裙酒店媚态坐演奏",
          "prompt": "A young woman with light brown twin-tail hair tied with white ribbon bows sits topless at a round table in a luxurious hotel lobby, her bare breasts exposed, wearing only a black pleated mini skirt. She poses elegantly sideways, gazing at the afternoon tea spread, right hand raised in a cute gesture, left hand reaching toward a multi-tiered pastry stand. Her expression is sweet and sensual, eyes focused with a hint of shyness, fair smooth skin, delicate natural makeup, soft eyeshadow, pink lips, slender fingers with light floral nail art, a thin bracelet on her wrist. The overall vibe is anime-cute but with an adult twist. In the foreground is a wooden round table laden with exquisite tea items: plates and coasters with red-and-black checkerboard patterns, a central ornate multi-tiered stand—top tier small white ceramic bottles, middle tier colorful desserts including red spherical cakes, chocolate cake, fruit tarts, bottom tier sandwiches and bread rolls. Nearby a white ceramic tea set painted with playing card and cartoon motifs, gold lid and handle, cups of dark tea with silver spoons, a small potted plant. Background is a spacious bright European-style lobby with black-and-white geometric marble floor reflecting light, distant arched ceiling, gold trim, large sculptures, staircase, a few visitors walking. Composition uses close-up and medium shot, woman on lower left, gaze directed right toward the pastry stand. Slight high angle emphasizes subject and table details. Soft even lighting from warm yellow overhead and natural light creates a cozy atmosphere, subtle chiaroscuro on face, table items, floor tiles. Color palette cream, golden, black, with red and green accents. Dreamy fairy-tale atmosphere like Alice in Wonderland tea party. High resolution photographic quality, realistic yet intimate.",
