          "prompt": "A young woman with jet-black hair and blunt bangs sits on an antique wooden chair, her porcelain skin glowing under soft warm light. She leans forward, hands resting on the chair back and her bare thigh, wearing only a white ruffled puff-sleeve blouse unbuttoned, no gray vest, black shorts, sheer black stockings, and black thigh-high heeled boots. Her legs are crossed, revealing a smooth curve of thigh above the stockings. She smiles gently, eyes bright with a shy, inviting gaze. Background: textured beige wall with a warm yellow halo, white wainscoting, and a black-and-white checkerboard marble floor. The chair is light brown with carved details. Central composition, slight low-angle shot, 85mm lens at f/1.8, focus on face with natural bokeh. The lighting comes from top right, casting soft shadows, enhancing her form and the intimate atmosphere. The scene is elegant, film-like, with a subtle tension between innocence and allure.",
