          "prompt": "A young woman sits elegantly on a vintage black leather sofa, wearing a dark floral-patterned gown with a deep V-neckline that exposes her cleavage, a fluffy white fur stole slipping off one shoulder to reveal bare skin. She layers a multi-strand pearl necklace and a sparkling diamond pendant, a warm jade bracelet on her wrist. Her black hair is styled in a sleek low bun, small stud earrings glinting. Her delicate face is downcast with a subdued, melancholic expression, eyes slightly hooded, lips parted in a soft sigh. Her right arm rests on the sofa arm, left hand relaxed on her thigh. A crushed cream satin handbag with gold clasp and beaded chain sits beside her. The dim interior features dark textured walls and a frosted glass window with blinds casting faint blue light; a door with a brass handle stands at left, a red glow seeping from behind it. Main light comes from upper left, sculpting her face, the fur, and jewelry with sharp highlights and deep shadows. Mid-shot composition, she leans slightly to the right, gaze directed downward toward the bag and legs. Camera angle slightly above eye level, creating a voyeuristic distance. Color palette: black, white, gold with accents of deep red and cool blue. Shallow depth of field blurs the background, emphasizing the subject. Film-noir style, high-resolution digital capture, rich detail in fur texture, jewelry reflections, and skin glow. Atmosphere: quiet, sensual, cinematic, as if a stolen moment in a private evening club.",
