        {
          "id": "krea2-d4827e2d1da040301b27163b",
          "alias": "单女透视蓝制服机场微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A stunning flight attendant in a form-fitting dark blue striped uniform sits gracefully on the aisle seat edge inside the aircraft cabin. Her white blouse is slightly unbuttoned at the collar, revealing delicate collarbones and a hint of cleavage above a blue-and-white silk scarf. The fitted blazer is buttoned neatly, hugging her curves over a dark waistcoat and a short skirt that accentuates her toned thighs. Her brown hair is swept up in a tight bun, her makeup polished with soft smoky eyes and natural lips, a gentle and confident smile directed at the camera. One hand rests lightly on her thigh, the other hangs casually by her side. She crosses her legs, showcasing long, shapely legs sheathed in glossy black sheer stockings, her feet in polished black low-heeled Mary Janes. The composition is a close-up from a low angle, emphasizing her poised posture and professional elegance. Behind her, the real cabin interior features cream passenger seats with \"EXIT\" signage glowing red, an old-fashioned telephone receiver hanging on the seatback with a coiled cord, and purple seats with gray headrests and green seatbelts. The deep blue carpet has a subtle texture. Lighting from overhead LED strips casts soft, cool white illumination, creating delicate highlights and shadows on her skin, clothing, and the leather shoes, enhancing the sensual texture of the stockings and the metallic buttons. The overall scene blends the strict professionalism of aviation with an intimate, almost voyeuristic moment, capturing the flight attendant's poised yet subtly sensual presence during a brief break. The color palette is rich in deep blue, gray-purple, and cream, with meticulous detail in the fabric folds, stockings' sheerness, and leather shine, exuding a cinematic realism and narrative depth.",
