        {
          "id": "krea2-3ffcfda66d2d5f184d1f47e4",
          "alias": "单女黑内衣泳池戏谑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a white windowsill or low cabinet indoors, leaning slightly forward, her head tilted toward the camera. Her gentle eyes meet the viewer's gaze, lips curved in a faint, teasing smile that blends sweet innocence with a hint of mystery. Her long black hair falls in natural waves, straight bangs framing her forehead, catching soft light that gives it a deep, glossy sheen. She wears only a black lace bralette under a sheer black knit top left open and pushed off her shoulders, with the pink polka-dot chiffon blouse beneath it loosened so its lacy bow hangs undone, revealing a glimpse of her bare skin. Her bottom is wrapped in a black-and-white checkered pleated miniskirt with ruffled tiers and delicate lace trim. Black lace thigh-high stockings hug her legs, intricate floral patterns circling her ankles. Her fingernails are painted pale; she rests her hands lightly on the windowsill, a thin black bracelet around her left wrist. The background is a clean white wall with vertical panel lines; to the left, a tall mirror in a dark wooden frame reflects part of her body and the corner of the room, showing a fluffy white garment and blurred furniture. The composition is a medium shot, the subject positioned slightly left of center, drawing focus. Light streams from the right, soft natural daylight casting bright highlights on her face, arms, and skirt, while gentle shadows pool on her left side and the wall, creating a warm, intimate atmosphere. The mood is quiet and private, evoking the delicate aesthetic of Japanese pin-up photography. The color palette is mostly black and white punctuated by pink and cream, with a slight film-grain texture and vintage filter. Details are sharp—smooth skin, natural fabric folds, layered light—giving the image a candid, everyday feel, as if captured spontaneously by a simple camera, real and full of story.",
