          "id": "krea2-792ad28101d670c10a81b2ad",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝衬衫办公室媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a black office chair, her light blue striped shirt fully unbuttoned and pulled open, revealing her bare breasts with erect nipples, sleeves rolled to her elbows, the hem of the shirt riding up to expose her toned midriff. She wears sheer black stockings and black pointed-toe high heels, blending office sharpness with raw sensuality. Her long, jet-black hair falls loosely over her shoulders, makeup flawless, lips a vivid red, eyes locked on the camera with cold confidence and allure. Her right hand lightly grips a silver pen, tip upward, while her left hand rests on her knee, a delicate gold bracelet at her wrist. She leans slightly forward, legs crossed, posture elegant but deliberately teasing. The foreground shows a dark gray marble floor, polished and reflecting the curves of her legs and subtle light changes. The middle ground is her body, positioned center-left as the focal point. The background is a plain light gray wall with a vertical black line (perhaps a door seam), smooth and unadorned. The composition is a slight overhead angle, her body forming a stable triangle, head and arms leading the upper lines, legs extending diagonally for visual tension. Lighting comes from the front-left, soft and even, illuminating her face and bare torso, with natural shadow transitions, soft highlights on her waist and thighs, emphasizing skin texture and stocking sheen. The background fades into darker tones, enhancing the subject. The overall atmosphere is quiet yet charged, blending everyday office familiarity with intimate eroticism. The color palette centers on blue, gray, and black, with red lipstick as an accent, creating a clash of cool rationality and heated temptation. Details are crisp—from shirt wrinkles to stocking reflections, floor texture to chair contours—with a raw, snapshot quality suggesting a phone or compact camera shot, subtle grain and color shifts adding realism. The style sits between fashion editorial and candid capture, artistic yet grounded.",
