        {
          "id": "krea2-2e0c99baf7d8235f37565e41",
          "alias": "单女露胸连衣裙酒店微笑坐喝",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless in a gray fabric armchair in a luxury hotel lobby, her sheer lace dress slipped off her shoulders, pooling around her waist, the floral embroidery and ruffled hem catching the warm light. She rests her chin on her hands, fingers gently pressing against her cheeks, eyes soft and inviting as she looks directly at the camera with a subtle, knowing smile. Her long, slightly curled hair falls naturally around her bare shoulders and neck. In the foreground, the edge of a dark glass round table with vertical striations reflects the ambient glow. Midground shows the tufted vertical channeled back of the armchair, a beige plush cushion beside her. Background is a modern luxury interior: left wall has warm wooden vertical slats with embedded LED strips casting a soft golden halo; right side features a large stone fireplace with a glass-enclosure, flames glowing in flickering orange-yellow light. Behind the fireplace, a partial view of dining chairs and tables, with red upholstered sofas and beige armchairs in the distance. The space is arranged with an asymmetrical layout, tones of gray, brown, and beige, accented by warm lighting and red elements. Composition is slightly off-center with the subject to the right, occupying the main visual focus but allowing ample environmental context. Camera angle is slightly above eye level, nearly flat, shot with a medium focal length at shallow depth of field, making the woman crisp against a smoothly blurred background. Visual guide leads from her face and hand-on-chin gesture to her eyes, then extends to the fireplace flames, creating a warm emotional focus. Lighting is predominantly warm, from the fireplace, wall lights, and indirect ceiling illumination, forming a soft, layered effect. Light comes from the upper left and front, casting delicate highlights on her cheeks, arms, and the lace of the dress, with natural shadows on the side of her body and chair edge, enhancing volume. The overall image exudes high-end sophistication and daily-life intimacy, as if captured by professional gear in low light, yet feeling like an honest snapshot of an urban leisure moment—quiet, elegant, and slightly private, with a sensual charge.",
