        {
          "id": "krea2-3c2ae83445f63f153178e5fc",
          "alias": "单女椅上困倦坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman with dark brown hair piled into a messy bun, stray strands framing her face, sits in a vintage café. Her fair skin glows under warm light, her delicate features relaxed, eyes half-closed, lips curved in a satisfied, sultry smile. She holds a ceramic coffee cup with blue polka dots, bringing it close to her mouth as if savoring the aroma. She wears a white lace cami top with floral embroidery and a vertical zipper, cut low to reveal her cleavage and bare shoulders, hugging her curves. A thin gold chain with a tiny pendant rests on her collarbone. On her right arm, a faint pink heart tattoo adds a personal touch. She sits on a dark wooden wicker chair, her posture confident. Beside her, a pink quilted leather handbag with a metallic chain strap. On the round wooden table: an iced coffee in a glass with layered espresso and milk, condensation beading on the glass, a wooden coaster, and a silver fork. The café interior features cream walls, framed abstract and landscape paintings, a paper-shaded lamp casting warm light, a modern floor lamp illuminating a bookshelf filled with books, sheet music, and small sculptures. A ceiling fan with dark wooden blades hangs overhead. Soft side lighting from the floor lamp sculpts her face and body with gentle shadows, highlighting the sheen on the coffee cup and her skin. The composition centers on her upper body and the cup, with the ice coffee and tableware in the foreground, creating depth. The scene feels like an amateur snapshot, with slight film grain, warm tones, and a natural, intimate atmosphere. The overall mood is cozy and artistic, capturing a serene afternoon moment with a hint of sensual elegance.",
