          "prompt": "A young woman stands against a white wall in an indoor corridor, wearing a full black leather outfit—a short zip-up jacket left open to reveal a black thin-strap camisole, paired with high-waist leather shorts, the glossy material hugging her curves. Her long hair falls naturally, strands brushing her cheek, a lazy, sensual touch. She places her hands folded just above her navel, rings glinting on her fingers, dark nail polish visible. Her body angles slightly to the side, head tilted, eyes locked on the camera with a sultry, knowing expression, lips parted just enough to hint. The warm, directional light from a square wall lamp above casts soft shadows across her face and body, highlighting the sheen of the leather, the smooth skin of her décolletage and legs. A dark wooden stair railing is visible to the left, the white background clean and minimalist. The camera angle is slightly low, emphasizing her long legs and commanding presence. The mood balances urban cool with intimate warmth—black, white, and warm yellow light create a luxurious, rebellious aesthetic. Every detail is crisp: leather texture, metallic zipper glints, flawless makeup with defined liner and full lips. The composition is a medium shot, centered left, with space on the right for visual balance, her gaze drawing the viewer in for a direct, erotic connection. The lighting and shadows are soft, no harsh spots, focusing on the matte and glossy contrasts of the leather, her skin, and the subtle sheen of her lips.",
