          "id": "krea2-2124686efe7be11eca795a86",
          "alias": "单女露胸米外套街道媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the center of a nighttime outdoor event, topless, her creamy bare skin glowing under warm amber lights. She wears a cream-colored short faux-fur coat loosely open, the fluffy collar and cuffs framing her shoulders and bare chest, her nipples softly visible. A gray knit top is absent, replaced by her smooth torso; a dark high-waist skirt hugs her hips, its fabric catching the golden glow. Her long wavy hair falls naturally, a blunt fringe brushing her brow, strands slightly tousled. She smiles gently, eyes looking off-camera right, lips curved with a relaxed, happy sensuality. Her left hand lifts, fingers lightly touching the top of her head in a playful, inviting gesture. Her right hand holds a white string handbag at her side, body at ease, as if laughing with a friend. In the foreground, a hand enters from the upper right frame—fingers painted deep red, palm open—either taking a photo or playfully blocking the lens, creating a first-person immediacy. Behind her, a golden multi-tiered tower structure rises, decorated with colorful lights that cast a warm yellow halo. Wooden railings, blurred human-shaped sculptures, distant green tree silhouettes, and warm lanterns complete the scene. A vivid red carpet stretches beneath her feet, leading into depth, flanked by metal barriers and glowing grass. The composition centers her, with the foreground hand directing the eye to her bare torso, then to the festive background. Lighting is predominantly warm yellow from the tower and street lamps, softly illuminating her skin and facial features, creating subtle chiaroscuro and natural shadows. The image feels like a candid phone snapshot—slight grain, motion blur, authentic nighttime social capture. Color saturation is moderate; the red carpet contrasts with the golden lights while blending harmoniously. The overall mood is romantic, celebratory, and intimate—a joyful night out with friends, capturing a moment of spontaneous pleasure and closeness. The style blends documentary realism with a curated aesthetic, delivering a genuine, visually striking experience.",
