          "alias": "单女黑上衣车厢戏谑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the entrance of a New York subway station, her long black hair with straight bangs framing her pale, flawless face. Her delicate features are sharp and refined, eyes soft and slightly hazy, locking onto the camera with a subtle, teasing smile. She crosses her arms beneath her bare chest, her black-and-white top unbuttoned and pushed aside, revealing full breasts with erect nipples. The top combines a square-neck short sleeve with a puffed-sleeve blouse design, left open to expose her torso. She wears a high-waisted black pleated mini skirt that barely covers her ass, and black thigh-high boots. In the foreground, a red fire hydrant with visible wear and a metal top bolt, beside yellow tactile paving bricks with scuffs and dirt. Midground: green metal railings with rust and chipped paint, a “Subway” sign above. Background: subway entrance steps, white tiles slightly aged, exposed ceiling pipes and wires, a vintage square pendant lamp casting warm yellow light. On the right wall, signs for “Architecture & Interior Design” and “U.KUN Art Lounge,” plus an MTA notice reading “Bicycle or other property attached to these railings will be removed…” A classical lamppost with a soft warm glow. The scene is lit by warm artificial light, creating strong chiaroscuro with shadows on the walls and ground. The composition places the woman slightly left of center, with leading lines from rails and steps drawing focus to her. A slight downward camera angle captures natural proportions, crisp details, and a cinematic, documentary feel. Color balance leans between warm highlights on her skin and cool shadows on the environment, heightening the sensual and urban tension.",
