          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at an elegantly decorated birthday party scene, her black velvet strapless dress plunging low to reveal the curve of her breasts, shimmering crystal embellishments on the shoulders catching the candlelight. A lavish diamond necklace rests against her collarbone, dark hair swept into a loose updo with a few strands falling seductively across her cheek. Her makeup is flawless—metallic eyeshadow, soft lips, and a gaze that is both tender and knowing, slightly mysterious, as she turns her body toward the camera with a poised yet inviting pose. Her right hand, clad in a long black mesh glove, rests lightly on her chest, fingers subtly drawing attention to her décolletage, while her left hand hangs casually. The foreground features a beautifully set table with flickering white candles, crystal goblets, and a silver candelabra, the warm candlelight casting soft shadows across her skin. A few scattered feathers add a romantic touch. To the right, a pink multi-tiered cake with delicate icing and a black ribbon sits beside a bouquet of blooming pink roses with layered petals. The background is a pale blue wall with a softly blurred \"HAPPY BIRTHDAY\" projection in elegant script, creating depth. The composition places her slightly right of center, using shallow depth of field to keep her face and torso sharp while the background melts into a dreamy haze. Lighting comes from the front and side—warm golden candlelight contrasting with cool ambient tones, producing rich gradients. The overall mood is intimate, luxurious, and sensual, evoking a cinematic portrait shot with a wide aperture in low light, with subtle film grain and natural noise, revealing every texture from the velvet gown to the sparkle of jewels. The result is an elegant, dreamy, yet vividly real artistic image with a palpable NSFW allure.",
