          "prompt": "A young woman sits bare-chested on the hood of a vintage American sedan, her plump breasts fully exposed, skin glowing with natural texture. She wears only a sheer white lace lingerie top partially undone, paired with a fluffy white fur coat draped open over her shoulders. A wide-brimmed white cowboy hat shadows her face, long black hair falling straight, bangs neatly framing her forehead. Her features match the reference exactly: confident, relaxed eyes gazing directly at the camera, lips parted, expression serene and slightly lazy. No visible makeup, real skin pores and highlights. Body poised with elegance, legs crossed — right leg lifted, knee pointing left, left leg bent with toes touching the hood. Right hand rests casually on her left knee, left hand lightly touches the car body. Arms smooth, shoulders relaxed, back straight. Composition exudes casual yet refined fashion. Background: a typical American suburban roadside commercial area with brick buildings, a \"HILLY STORE\" sign, and other shops and billboards blurred in the distance. Sky clear blue, sun setting low, golden sunset light floods the scene — warm, soft, strong backlighting, rim light gliding along her silhouette, high contrast with bright highlights and deep, layered shadows. Car surface reflects orange-yellow light, enhancing dimensionality and texture. Several vintage cars parked nearby in metallic gray and brown, details like headlights, grilles, wheels clearly rendered. Atmosphere blends retro Western flair with modern urban life. Dominant colors: warm yellow, cream white, light brown, contrasting with cool blue sky, evoking nostalgic yet stylish visuals. Low-angle mid-shot, camera slightly tilted upward to emphasize the woman, incorporating sky and surroundings. Composition centers on her, with the car hood and background buildings framing the view, guiding focus onto her body. Light and shadow handled delicately, accentuating sunset's golden tones and long shadows. Color saturation moderate, preserving real material textures — fabric folds, fur fluff, metal reflections. Style merges vintage Western, pop music culture, street aesthetics, and high-fashion photography, resulting in a dynamic yet elegant modern chic vibe. Image rich in detail, from clothing textures to architecture, highly realistic and artistically compelling.",
