          "prompt": "A young woman squats indoors, her long jet-black hair cascading in soft layers with neat air bangs, the silky strands catching subtle light. Her delicate features are perfectly defined—natural brows, smoky earth-tone eye makeup with a subtle winged liner, her gaze locking onto the camera with a lazy, playful intensity. Lips parted slightly, she rests her chin on slender fingers, her body leaning forward, head tilted in an inviting pose. She wears a loose, sheer white high-neck sweater that clings to her curves, her nipples visible through the thin knit, the fabric falling open to reveal a hint of bare skin. Beneath, a sliver of black shorts sits high on her hips, barely covering the top of her mound, her long legs smooth and bare. Olive green suede over-the-knee boots hug her thighs, their thick black soles and stitched details drawing the eye. A light gray braided rope hangs from her waist, its knotted end trailing on the floor. The setting is a warm, intimate space with a textured off-white wall split by a vertical seam, a light beige fabric sofa behind her holding a small white remote and a tag reading \"HK\" next to a stray wire. The floor is marble with cloud-like veining. Warm front-left light bathes her face and body, creating soft shadows and a glow that highlights the fine grain of the photo. Mid-shot composition, candid yet sensual, evoking a private moment shot on a smartphone with natural grain and slight color shifts.",
