          "prompt": "A young woman with long dark brown curly hair pinned with a small gold hairpin, fair porcelain skin, delicate refined features, languid and contemplative eyes, head slightly tilted toward the camera, lips gently pressed, expression quiet and slightly melancholic. She is topless, her bare breasts exposed, nipples visible, wearing only the delicate pink Lolita-style skirt with intricate lace trim, ruffled collar and cuffs, a few sparkling rhinestones and pearl accents at the bodice, the short sleeves gone to fully reveal her torso. The skirt falls above her knees, revealing her long slender legs. She wears a diamond-encrusted ring on her left ring finger, pale pink nail polish, and a white pearl bracelet on her right wrist. Her left hand rests under her chin, fingers delicate; her right hand lies on her thigh. On her feet are pale pink Crocs-style clogs decorated with flower-shaped pearls and crystal ornaments, beige soles. She sits on grey stone stairs with a fine granular texture, legs crossed, body leaning slightly forward in a relaxed yet modest pose. Beside her is a white gathered fabric bag with a black-and-white cow plush charm, drawstring closure, soft and fluffy. The background is a wall of beige square tiles, clean and bright. To the left, a large red rose wall installation on a metal frame, lush red petals and green leaves, some petals scattered on the floor. To the right, clusters of red roses extend from a mesh fence, creating layered depth. The scene is illuminated by soft natural light from upper left, creating subtle chiaroscuro on her face, arms, and bare chest, shadows gentle and non-harsh. The overall atmosphere is warm, romantic, vintage sweet. Composition centered slightly right, with the woman, bag, and roses in foreground, stairs and rose wall in mid-ground, tiles in background. Colors: pink, red, beige, white, green. A lifelike, artful private photo style, as if taken in a cozy café or courtyard corner, with a sense of realism and artistic beauty.",
