        {
          "id": "krea2-69575b5bc4c3f0054543f434",
          "alias": "单女透视灰连衣裙城市微笑站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in front of a full-length mirror with ornate vintage carvings, captured in a selfie-style shot. She wears a black lace-trimmed gray polka-dot sheer strap dress with delicate lace straps and neckline, hemmed with black-and-white striped piping—elegant and subtly sexy. She shows off her body through the sheer fabric, hinting at her lace bra beneath. Deep red sheer stockings and gray-black plaid stiletto heels (chunky heel) complete the look. Her left hand holds a black smartphone angled toward the mirror for a selfie; her right hand lightly holds a lit cigarette—long fingers with pale nail polish. A metal chain bracelet dangles on her wrist, and oversized black tassel earrings swing from her ears. Light brown hair is swept up neatly, revealing a bare forehead. Large-frame dark sunglasses (with decorative pattern on the rim) mask her eyes, while dark red lipstick and flawless makeup give her a confident, commanding gaze through the lenses. She stands centered in the foreground, occupying most of the frame. The background is a lived-in interior: to the left, a dark wooden dining table and chairs set with a glass vase of greenery, white candle, and small objects; a bright red handbag sits nearby. On the wall hangs a black-and-white portrait of Marilyn Monroe, her smile frozen in time. Behind and to the right, a white door with a small black photo taped to it. The floor is covered by a red-and-white traditional Persian rug with intricate geometric and floral patterns layered over pale wooden planks. The mirror reflects more of the room’s details, creating a symmetrical mirrored composition. The mirror’s frame shows signs of age—scratches and wear—adding a nostalgic feel. Lighting is a soft mix of natural and ambient light, evenly distributed without harsh shadows, with a warm tone dominated by red-brown, black, and gray, accented by bright red and green. The visual focus is on the woman’s face and body contours, with the mirror providing multiple perspectives and depth. Overall, the image has a slight grain and everyday amateur-device quality, as if capturing a private moment—oozing retro fashion and personal expression. The scene exudes urban femininity, self-surveillance, and a blend of intimacy and boldness, rich in detail and storytelling.",
