          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a pale green metal-framed chair, her jet-black hair in a high ponytail with blunt bangs, sharp side profile, eyes gazing right, lips slightly parted as if whispering or lost in thought. She leans forward naturally, left hand resting lightly on the orange fabric chair beside her, right hand on her right knee, long fingers with dark nail polish, a yellow butterfly sticker and a white square tag on her arm, intricate tattoos covering her left forearm. She wears a tight gray sleeveless dress with a low neckline, black number \"03\" printed at the waist, layered ruffled hem that's short and flirty, paired with gray thigh-high socks trimmed with white lace, black platform shoes. A thin chain necklace with a white spherical pendant, a green beaded bracelet on her wrist. Her pose is relaxed yet sensual, exuding youthful energy and edgy style. The background is an indoor studio with white walls, pale gray scuffed concrete floor, a table covered with a light blue cloth scattered with colorful paper, origami, notebooks, pink tape, and craft supplies—messy but creative. Nearby, a yellow-cushioned green metal chair, and to the right, an orange-cushioned blue metal chair. Medium shot, slightly low angle, woman offset left, emphasizing her curves and details. Soft natural light from left creates gentle shadows, bright and airy atmosphere. Color palette dominated by grays and whites, accented with yellow, orange, green, blue. Slight film grain and candid photography feel, as if a spontaneous moment captured in an art studio, rich in detail and emotional depth.",
