          "alias": "单女露胸灰短裙室内微笑侧头",
          "prompt": "An Asian female figure skater performs a graceful spin at the center of an indoor ice rink, wearing a striking purple gradient sequined costume that is practically sheer—her top cut into a daring deep V with no back, exposing her bare breasts and toned torso, while a translucent dark gray tulle skirt and matching shorts barely cover her hips. The skirt lifts with the spin, revealing the smooth curve of her thigh. Her arms are crossed loosely over her chest, one hand gripping the opposite wrist, body arched slightly back as she tilts her head upward, a radiant, almost breathless smile on her face, eyes shining with pure passion. Her black hair is sleek in a low bun, a few strands falling softly at her forehead. The background is a blur of warm-skinned audience silhouettes; the foreground is a mirror-like white ice surface reflecting cool blue light, with a clear blue barrier line at the edge. A mid-close-up composition places her slightly left, leaving room for dynamic motion. The focus is on her facial expression and body curve, with a shallow depth of field blurring the background. Light from above and side stage spotlights creates soft highlights and shadows, emphasizing the contours of her bare skin, the glitter of the sequins, and the delicate details of the costume. The overall atmosphere blends competitive tension with artistic romance, in tones of purple, gray, white, accented by blue ice reflections—dreamy yet real. The shot feels cinematic, like a professional camera captured a live competition moment with an 85mm lens at f/2.8, fast shutter speed, slight motion blur on the skirt but sharp focus on her face and body, rich in detail and expression, perfectly merging athletic power and sensual beauty.",
