          "prompt": "A young woman sits in the back seat of a luxury car, wearing only a delicate white pearl-encrusted lace bodice that leaves her breasts fully exposed, with taut nipples visible through sheer fabric. Her legs are crossed, right over left, clad in pristine white over-the-knee boots that hug her thighs, a hint of bare skin at the tops. Her hands rest on her lap, pale pink nail polish, a simple silver ring on her ring finger. Wavy light brown hair falls over her cheeks, soft eye makeup, rose lips. She gazes at the camera with a coy, intimate smile, exuding elegant seduction. Behind her, white leather seats with fine stitching, high headrests. Dark gray door panels with metal trim, black window frames reflecting blurred interior lights. A black handbag with silver clasps rests on the seat. Ambient purple LED glow from under the dashboard and door edges bathes her legs and the seat, with warm white overhead light creating a cozy, inviting glow. Slightly high-angle composition, woman centered-left, body angled slightly right, face straight to camera. Foreground shows door controls and seat details, midground her nude form, background softly blurred window and space. Shallow depth of field, dramatic yet smooth lighting, shadows in seat crevices, realistic skin texture. Luxurious, intimate, sensual atmosphere, like a cinematic low-light shot with a large-aperture lens, film-graded warm tones, high-end realism.",
