        {
          "id": "krea2-9a370291f93bbcd8c08a7a66",
          "alias": "单女露胸丝袜废墟困倦坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a white sofa, her voluminous jet-black hair cascading naturally. She stares directly at the camera with deep, slightly drowsy eyes, exuding a lazy and aloof demeanor. She leans slightly sideways against the armrest, her left hand resting lightly on her knee while her right hand hangs near the floor. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, with the abandoned white off-shoulder top and rolled-up sleeves draped loosely over one arm, revealing her slender arms. She wears a black miniskirt, translucent lace-patterned stockings, and black-and-white stiletto heel sandals with crisscross straps. Her posture is relaxed yet elegant, body slightly forward, legs crossed with the right bent and the left extended, creating a dynamic balance. In the left foreground, a pile of scattered books and magazines lies on the floor—spines showing titles like “Delicious Places,” “Romeo and Juliet,” “Darwins Teor,” with covers featuring portraits, botanical illustrations, and art photography—some tilted, some flat, lending a lived-in, cultured atmosphere. Midground: the white sofa and a standing floor lamp with a cream lamp shade, thin metallic stem, emitting a warm yellow glow that illuminates the scene from above. Background: an ornate white wall with delicate relief moldings and classical paneling, European vintage architectural details, clean and uniform, enhancing depth and elegance. Composition centers the woman slightly right of frame, creating asymmetrical balance. The lamp behind her left side adds vertical contrast to her curves, guiding the eye upward. The books in the lower left form a stable triangular base. Her gaze and body angle slightly away from the lens, evoking an introspective narrative. Light from the lamp casts soft shadows, evenly lighting her face, emphasizing her skin texture, clothing folds, and fabric details—low-contrast, diffused lighting for a warm, quiet indoor atmosphere. Color palette dominant in white and light gray, with black clothing and dark hair providing stark contrast, retaining rich grayscale transitions for a refined, restrained look. The mood is quiet, intimate, with an artistic flair—as if capturing a serene moment between afternoon reading. Style blends modern fashion with classical aesthetics, balancing everyday casualness with professional photographic refinement, rich in detail and layered, delivering a realistic and beautiful visual experience.",
