          "prompt": "A young woman sits sideways on an intricately carved wooden chair, her nude body partially draped in a black velvet modified qipao, unbuttoned to expose her full, pale breasts with erect nipples. The qipao is embroidered with pink, orange, and green floral motifs, petals softly blurred at the edges for a vintage, elegant look. She leans forward, right hand resting on her knee, left hand hanging loosely—a lazy, classical pose. Her jet-black hair is pinned up, a large, lush pink peony nestled in the bun, contrasting her creamy skin. Her eyes are wide and bright, deep pupils carrying a melancholic, pensive gaze directly at the viewer. Lips painted vivid red. Her left leg is bent, foot in a purple gradient butterfly wing sandal with black lace trim. In the foreground, a giant purple butterfly rests near her foot, wings spread, colors shifting from magenta to deep blue, fine spots and veins visible. Background: an aged indoor space with beige walls showing cracks and peeling paint. A window behind with wooden frame lets in soft natural light, casting warm shadows. On the windowsill sits an antique wooden cabinet with gold carvings. Low-angle shot, subject slightly right-center, negative space on left for balance. Light falls from upper right, illuminating face and arms while the rest of her body is in semi-shadow, soft chiaroscuro. Warm tones: brown, gold, purple, black, with pink and red accents. Film grain texture, slight lens blur, nostalgic photographic quality. The composition blends near close-up and mid-shot, guiding the eye from her eyes down her nude curves to the butterfly’s wings, then back to the light. A fusion of Eastern classic beauty and surreal fantasy—an intimate, lonely, romantic moment captured.",
