          "prompt": "A delicate young woman stands in a classical Chinese garden, her elaborate hanfu partly discarded to reveal her bare shoulders and the soft curve of her breasts. She wears a light blue wide-sleeved robe pushed down to her elbows, the fine silk crepe fabric with subtle damask patterns slipping off one shoulder, exposing her upper body. The deep brown cross-collar ruqun is undone around her waist, revealing the smooth skin of her torso. A wine-red brocade belt with tassels and jade pendants hangs loosely at her hip. Her high bun is adorned with silver flower hairpins, and long tassel earrings sway beside her serene face. Her lips are lightly tinted, eyes carrying a hint of melancholy and longing. Her hands rest gently on her bare chest, fingers slightly splayed as if holding something precious. Behind her, a traditional Chinese garden with carved lattice windows and upturned eaves fades into soft focus. To the left, a branch of red plum blossoms reaches inward with vivid petals, contrasting with her pale skin. To the right, a wooden railing spans the bottom of the frame, its rough grain visible. The composition is rule of thirds with the subject slightly left of center, leading the eye to her face. The foreground includes blurred wooden pillars and railing, creating depth. Lighting is soft diffused overcast, giving a calm early-morning atmosphere. The color palette is cool blue, warm brown, and soft pink, harmonious. The scene has a classical poetic feel combined with modern photography, as if captured with an 85mm portrait lens. The shallow depth of field gently blurs the background, highlighting her expression and the intricate details of the hanfu and her skin. The overall mood is quiet, narrative-rich, and full of traditional aesthetics, resembling a meticulous painting or a candid moment from a historical drama shoot. The image is rich in detail, with fine textures and natural light transitions, resulting in a high-quality visual.",
