          "alias": "单女露胸棕外套椅上媚态坐戏水",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a red tile bench at an outdoor café, her brown corduroy jacket hanging open to expose her bare breasts, the white top discarded beside her, a beige lace skirt slightly hiked up. She leans forward naturally, right hand lifting a white ceramic cappuccino cup with velvety foam that catches the soft light, left hand holding the matching saucer, pale pink nails carefully manicured. She smiles directly at the camera, eyes warm and bright, lips painted in coral, her brown hair falling in soft waves with airy bangs. Behind her, a white wall bears bold red hand-painted graffiti reading \"NO Idea Any Idea,\" the letters raw and uneven, a black potted shrub with withered leaves beside it, gray stone slabs underfoot. On the right side of the bench rests a silver vintage digital camera, lens pointing down. The composition centers her slightly below mid-frame, a gentle downward angle creating intimacy, with the coffee cup and saucer in the foreground, her body and the bench in the midground, the wall and plant in the background, forming a visual loop from the cup to her face to the text. Soft overcast light eliminates harsh shadows, bathing the scene in warm browns, creams, reds with touches of gray and green, evoking a film-grain, snapshot aesthetic that feels candid, sensual, and effortlessly alive.",
