        {
          "id": "krea2-0ae5c24c84f6ee45d014f30b",
          "alias": "单女露胸红连衣裙镜前微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a polished wooden floor in a lavish classical room, her vibrant red dress pulled down to her waist, revealing her bare breasts. The dress features delicate silver sequin trim and black lace ties at the plunging neckline, creating a stark visual contrast. Her dark hair is swept up in a high bun secured with black hairpins. She gazes softly at the camera with a gentle, slightly playful smile. Her hands are covered in long black leather gloves, one holding a small metallic-chain purse. Her legs are crossed, clad in branded black stockings and black high heels. Before her, a large ornate gold mirror frame reflects the entire space, creating a multi-layered mirrored effect. She sits slightly left of center, surrounded by a few green-covered books. The background is an opulent European-style room with green wallpaper adorned with gold patterns, complex moldings, and a white French door with gold trim to the right, a brass handle, and a gilded chair with fabric cushion nearby. In the distance, a marble fireplace with a large mirror above reflects curtains, chandeliers, and furniture outlines. The ceiling features delicate plaster reliefs and recessed lights emitting warm yellow illumination. The overall lighting is soft and layered, with warm tones casting subtle chiaroscuro across her face, body, and floor, evoking a vintage, romantic, and slightly dramatic atmosphere. Composition balances symmetry and asymmetry, using mirror reflection for symmetry while her offset position adds dynamic tension. Her gaze and body language direct the viewer's eye into the scene, while the mirror extends vision deep into the background. The aesthetic merges fashion, art, and everyday life with a cinematic, photographic quality—a high-end portrait that feels both posed and candid. The color palette is dominated by red, contrasting with green, gold, white, and black, creating a warm yet elegant visual experience. Rich details, from fabric textures to room ornamentation, are crisp and clear, imbuing the scene with narrative richness and emotional allure.",
