          "alias": "单女露胸黑束身衣户外微笑倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a black gothic Halloween costume, wearing small black devil horns, her long hair falling loosely, a bright playful smile on her face. She wears a black lace corset that leaves her breasts fully exposed, her nipples visible against the sheer fabric, paired with a fluffy black pleated skirt trimmed with delicate lace. Black lace long gloves cover her arms; her left hand lifts the skirt slightly, right leg bent in an elegant, dynamic pose. Black high-heeled boots complete the look. Her body leans gracefully into an S-curve, exuding sensual confidence as if showing off her costume. Foreground: worn wooden floorboards with warm brown-yellow grain. Midground: the woman stands centered left, slender, expressive face with bright eyes and a joyous smile. Background: a large Halloween backdrop with bold white \"HAPPY HALLOWEEN\" lettering, a gothic castle with spires and arched windows, carved jack-o'-lanterns glowing warm orange, small pumpkins, a floating white ghost left, a tombstone with the same text, bat silhouettes right, another smiling ghost. Colors: deep purple, orange, black. Composition: symmetrical, subject slightly left, background filling the frame with clear depth of field—subject sharp, background softly blurred. Camera at eye-level with a slight low angle, emphasizing her height and pose. Visual flow: from her glowing smile, down her exposed chest and corset, along the skirt and legs, then to the Halloween props. Lighting: soft, even front light illuminates her face and bare skin, with warm pumpkin glow contrasting against the cool castle and pale sky. Sky: light blue fading to gray-white, mimicking an overcast outdoor setting. Overall mood: festive, playful, sensual, with a hint of mystery; the image has a natural, amateur-camera feel with slight grain and true color, like a candid snapshot from an outdoor Halloween event.",
