          "alias": "单女黑外套车库微笑脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman takes a selfie in a racing garage, her bright smile revealing perfect white teeth, eyes sparkling with energy. Her long brown hair falls naturally, strands brushing her cheeks, small silver studs in her ears. She flashes a peace sign with her right hand—slender fingers with pale pink polish, a simple gold ring on her ring finger. Her black zip-up jacket is unzipped, revealing her bare chest and perky nipples, the gold Nike logo glinting at the front. The fabric shows casual wrinkles. Close-up on her face and hand in the lower-right frame, shot from a low angle upward, making her look approachable and sexy. In the background, a white-and-blue Formula-style race car covered in sponsor stickers (“Jeep”, “Mobil 1”, “SMART CAR LIFE”), Japanese text and numbers. The cockpit visible with black steering wheel and seat. Midground shows the rear of the car and clutter: blue toolbox, transparent storage box, yellow packaging bags, metal drums on the floor and workbench. A device with a screen and buttons on the left. The space is messy but authentically work-like. Walls are light gray tiles, floor is concrete. Top industrial lighting casts cool white light, uneven with shadows, creating highlights on metal surfaces like the car body and toolbox. Light comes from upper left, brightening the right side of her face, leaving the left slightly shadowed, enhancing her curves. Overall tones: black, white, blue with accents of gold and pink. Visual flow starts from her smile, follows her gaze and hand gesture to the race car, then spreads to background details. Perspective is close-far, layered. Image quality mimics an amateur phone camera, slight noise and natural color shifts, subtle lens distortion at edges, like a real candid snapshot. The vibe is upbeat, playful, and sexually charged, blending youthful energy with racing culture.",
