          "prompt": "A cosplayer in a revealing black-and-white maid outfit crouches low in the sunlit outdoor scene, her sharp red eyes and jet-black blunt bangs framed by a spiked white headdress with silver metal accents. The long-sleeved maid dress is heavily detailed with white ruffles and layered lace at the collar and cuffs, her neckline plunging to expose cleavage, black armbands with red trim gripping her wrists. She holds a massive mechanical weapon with a gray-white body, red accents, and \"SAME\" lettering, its curved blade blending futuristic tech and steampunk. Kneeling on one leg, the other stretched back, her right arm extended forward with a gauntlet of gray metal plates, her hand dangling naturally. Black high-heeled boots and black stockings complete the look. The ground is a concrete parking lot littered with orange traffic cones, yellow-black barriers, a pink suitcase, a black backpack, folding chairs, and scattered gear. Distant blurry figures and building outlines add depth. Low-angle shot centers her, guiding the eye from the weapon up to her face and posture. Harsh sunlight from above-left creates strong chiaroscuro, highlighting fabric textures and metallic shine, while shadows enhance volume and presence. The scene balances dramatic cosplay realism with a gritty, immersive feel—black, white, and red dominate, with crisp detail like a professional photo, capturing the vibrant, adult energy of the outdoor event. NSFW.",
