        {
          "id": "krea2-e029d778b1348c1f6df992e1",
          "alias": "单女卧室微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on her bed in a bedroom, wearing a deep red velvet one-piece pajama set that is unbuttoned to reveal the smooth curve of her cleavage and the swell of her breasts. Her dark hair falls naturally, with bangs across her forehead, as she gazes softly at the camera with a gentle, intimate smile. She wears fuzzy orange-red animal ear headbands, adding a playful touch. She cradles a giant panda plushie against her chest, its soft white fur and dark gray patches contrasting with her bare skin. Her body leans back slightly, relaxed, basking in a lazy afternoon. The background is a simple, light gray-white wall with a tall green potted plant on the right. The bed is covered in light gray sheets, with a matching pillow behind her. Soft, diffused natural light from the front-side creates a warm, cozy, and slightly private atmosphere. Medium shot, with the woman and panda forming the visual center. Warm tones of red, gray, and white, accented by orange-red ears and green leaves. The image feels like a candid, film-grain photograph with gentle bokeh, emphasizing the soft texture of the velvet, the plush, and the warm glow of her skin. The mood is peaceful, domestic, and subtly erotic, conveying a quiet sensuality and childlike innocence intertwined.",
