        {
          "id": "krea2-5336414bc9edd4fe1fbdcff5",
          "alias": "单女露胸白短裙街道害羞站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "A young woman with voluminous curly auburn hair stands on the cobblestone street of an ancient Chinese town, leaning sideways against a thick wooden pillar. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, soft nipples visible against the warm sunlight. She rests her right hand gently in her hair, while her left hand hangs naturally, holding a natural-fiber woven beige handbag. A sheer, semi-transparent white chiffon long skirt falls from her waist, the fabric light and airy, with delicate fringe and small shell-shaped ornaments catching the light. She wears a simple vintage wooden pendant necklace and tiny pearl earrings. Her expression is serene and sweet, lips slightly parted, eyes bright and shy, looking directly at the camera. Behind her stretches a cobblestone lane lined with traditional Chinese buildings: dark gray tiled roofs with upturned eaves, wooden shop signs reading \"吉奴古\", storefronts displaying clay jars, handicrafts, and local goods. Distant tourists walk lazily, some with backpacks, some with cameras, their figures blurred. The sky is clear blue, sunlight pouring from the upper left, casting sharp shadows on the ground and walls. The composition places her left of center, with the street receding diagonally to the right, creating strong perspective. The wooden pillar frames the foreground, adding depth. Color palette: warm yellows, soft greens, beige, deep brown. The image has a slight film grain and natural exposure, like a spontaneous street snapshot captured on an old analog camera, evoking a nostalgic, everyday warmth.",
