          "alias": "单女露胸白背心船上微笑躺注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies topless on a white yacht deck lounger, her long black hair spread across the white cushion, strands softly blown by the breeze, some clinging to her cheek and forehead, giving a lazy, natural look. A simple white sleeveless top is discarded beside her; the only accent is a delicate white fabric flower on the strap, now partly undone. She wears dark blue jeans, cuffs rolled casually, pulled low on her hips, exposing her bare midriff and the curve of her waist. Her right hand rests lightly on her lower belly, fingers gently curled, her body relaxed in a natural S-curve. Her gaze is soft, directed at the lens, with a faint, contemplative smile. The foreground shows the white deck and metal railing, lines sleek and reflecting dim light, wooden deck behind in warm tan tones contrasting with the cool sea and sky. Midground: wide ocean, deep blue with tiny ripples, calm and deep under overcast light. Distant mountain silhouettes blur into layers toward the horizon, shrouded by heavy clouds. Background: gray, thick clouds in varying shades, a weak blue-white glow hinting at twilight or dawn. Low-angle shot, close to the figure, emphasizing intimacy and immersion. The woman occupies the lower-right visual center, the line of sight leading from her face to the far sea-sky boundary, creating depth. Natural light, soft and diffused, no harsh shadows, her skin’s texture clear with subtle highlights and shadow layers. Overall cool palette—blue, gray, white—with warm wooden accents, a quiet, free, slightly melancholic seaside atmosphere, as if a spontaneous snapshot, retaining slight grain and noise for realism, yet artistically composed.",
