          "alias": "单女白衬衫公寓媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young adult woman with long jet-black hair cascading over her shoulders, wearing a white long-sleeve shirt unbuttoned to reveal her bare chest and cleavage, a short black pleated skirt barely covering her thighs, and black leather shoes, seated provocatively beside a sleek bright blue Yamaha R15 sport motorcycle. She gazes softly into the camera with a slight smile, one hand resting gently on the handlebar, the other hanging loosely at her side, her posture elegant and relaxed. The motorcycle features sharp lines, visible \"YAMAHA\" branding and \"R15\" lettering, aggressive headlight, blue accents on front and rear wheels. Background is a barren hillside with sparse dry yellow grass and green shrubs, gray-brown dirt ground, a wire fence above, and a flat asphalt road with yellow double center lines in the foreground. Sunlight streams from upper right, casting soft shadows on the ground, creating a warm afternoon atmosphere. Mid-shot composition, subject and bike slightly left of center, motorcycle angled diagonally to guide the eye, background blurred to emphasize the main subject. Vivid color contrast between blue bike, white shirt, black skirt, and earthy tones. The scene feels like a candid moment captured with a professional camera in natural outdoor light, rich in detail and realistic lighting transitions, exuding a sensual, youthful, and artistic vibe.",
