        {
          "id": "krea2-529387cae19a7ffd2999f185",
          "alias": "单女露胸公寓困倦侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a mid-close-up shot, with jet-black shoulder-length hair and neat airy bangs, strands falling naturally, some curling slightly behind her ears for a casual yet elegant look. Her skin is fair and flawless, facial features clear with long, smooth eyebrows. Heavy, refined eye makeup with layered brown eyeshadow, long curled lashes, and deep eyeliner, her gaze focused, slightly languid, staring directly at the camera. Lips are soft pink, slightly parted with a hint of a smile. She is topless, wearing only thin black sequin straps that cross her bare chest, leaving her breasts exposed; the sequins catch the light with subtle sparkle, adding mystery and sensuality. Her right hand gently rests on her cheek, long fingers with black-and-white geometric nail art, avant-garde and artistic; a simple silver ring on her ring finger. Background is a light gray wall with slight texture and irregular light-and-shade patterns, creating a clean, minimalist indoor setting. Flat camera angle, centered composition, the subject dominates the frame, head slightly tilted, exuding an elegant, serene mood. Soft, even lighting from a front-top source illuminates the face, with natural shadow transitions, highlighting the nose bridge, cheekbones, and jawline, while subtle highlights on hair edges enhance depth. Horizontal light stripes on the background wall, possibly from blinds, add spatial depth and visual rhythm. Overall color palette is black, white, gray, with warm accents from skin and lip tones, contrasting yet not jarring, creating a modern, fashionable, slightly cool artistic feel. Image is finely textured, rich in details, as if shot with a professional camera under indoor lighting, yet retaining natural, authentic emotion. The atmosphere is quiet and introspective, full of urban female independence and confidence. At the top center of the frame is the black text \"LE SSERAFIM CHAEWON\" in a simple, modern font, harmonizing with the overall style without distraction, reinforcing the subject's identity. The scene has no extra decorations or clutter; minimalist design language draws full attention to the figure, from makeup to hairstyle to clothing details meticulously crafted, presenting a highly aestheticized personal image. Stable composition, clear visual guidance, viewer's focus naturally falls on the facial expression and hand gesture, conveying a gentle yet determined emotion. Light and shadow handling is delicate, with reasonable light-dark relationships, featuring both sharp contour lines and soft transitions, resulting in an image style blending fashion and everyday life.",
