          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a soft white shaggy rug, wearing an off-shoulder white dress that has been pulled down to expose her bare breasts, the nipples visible and slightly erect. The dress has layered tulle and a bubble sleeve, now bunched at her waist. Her legs are crossed, clad in pink lace-edged sheer stockings with visible lace trim at the ankles. A small silver tiara with faux diamonds sits on her light brown wavy hair, which falls in soft curls framing her face. She wears a pearl necklace with a teardrop crystal pendant and crystal earrings. Her gaze is soft and inviting, a gentle smile on her lips, pose both demure and playful. The indoor scene has a white wall, a large window with sheer white curtains on the right, sunlight streaming in, creating soft diffused light. A white chair is faintly visible near the window. The floor is light wood. Medium shot composition, subject slightly left of center, body turned slightly, head facing camera. The rug's plush texture is sharp in the foreground, the background softly blurred. Warm, dreamy pink and white color palette, film-like grain, natural lighting, amateur realness, Japanese-style soft NSFW portrait.",
