          "alias": "单女白浴巾舞台害羞站立交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, wrapped only in a loosely tied white bath towel that barely conceals her curves, arms crossed over her chest in a shy, protective pose. She gazes downward with soft, contemplative eyes, her black straight hair with blunt bangs cascading around her shoulders, catching a warm red backlight. Her pale, flawless skin glows under cool blue and lavender stage lights, creating a dreamy, intimate atmosphere. In the distant blur, another dancer moves gracefully, hand extended in a flowing gesture. The composition is central, shot from a low angle, emphasizing her silhouette and the subtle tension in her body. The main light comes from above-front, sculpting soft highlights and shadows, while a warm red rim light from behind adds a sensual warmth. The image has a slight handheld, amateur feel—uneven exposure, subtle grain, and motion blur—capturing a raw, candid moment mid-performance. The towel's fabric texture, the smoothness of her skin, and the glossy strands of her hair are all rendered with fine detail. The scene is quiet yet charged, a private interlude beneath the dramatic blue-purple haze, with the suggestion that the towel might slip at any moment.",
