          "prompt": "A young woman stands outdoors at a Japanese festival, her black-and-white striped kimono with black floral patterns gaping open to expose her bare breasts, a deep crimson wide belt cinched loosely at her waist. She smiles warmly, eyes bright and locked on the viewer, her glossy black chin-length hair with straight bangs framing her fair, flawless skin. Her right hand lifts a wooden stick with a semi-circular paddle, a green cord tied to it ending in a red lantern charm with white script, her left hand gently cradling its underside, as if finishing a prayer. In the foreground, a wooden display stand brims with red-and-yellow candy-like ornaments, a white cylinder with Japanese text beside it. Sunlight filters through leaves, casting dappled patches across the blurred courtyard, where wooden fences, colorful banners, and traditional buildings appear. A white easel stands to the right. Shallow depth of field focuses on her, centered left, with soft, warm light from above left. The scene feels festive, intimate, and candid—a sunny summer afternoon captured with professional realism, blending joyful tradition with a bold, sensual allure.",
