          "alias": "单女露胸白短裙广场自信倚靠",
          "prompt": "Eye-level full-body shot. A young model-like woman leans against a yellow New York taxi, topless, her slender frame and perky nipples exposed. She has long, wavy shiny blonde hair, black sunglasses, a green baseball cap. One hand touches her lips with lipstick, confident and relaxed. She wears a high-waist cloud-style extremely short white ruffle skirt, revealing her bare waist and smooth skin. Brown platform sneakers, white high socks, a red small square bag slung over one shoulder. The taxi door is open, body marked \"TTC\", windows reflecting street, wheels and mirrors detailed. Mid-ground: line of other yellow taxis, roof lights on, blurred pedestrians. Background: NYC skyscrapers, glass facades, brick storefronts, traffic lights glowing yellow, white road markings. Composition: subject center-left, taxi lines lead the eye, dynamic balance, shallow depth of field. Lighting: soft afternoon sun from upper right, casting fine shadows, warm yellow reflection on ground and metallic taxi. Evening urban scene, vibrant colors: yellow taxis, white skirt, brown shoes, red bag, warm building tones. Magazine cover style, strong visual impact, real city atmosphere.",
