        {
          "id": "krea2-690e70f6d4e5bf28de9ec2c6",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙街道媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a street in a tropical Southeast Asian town, wearing a sheer floral-print pink spaghetti-strap maxi dress with ruffled edges, the fabric clinging to her curves and partially see-through, hinting at her bare skin beneath. Her long black hair falls naturally, adorned with several pink and red plumeria flowers. She holds a bouquet of blooming plumeria high in her right hand, petals layered and vibrant against green leaves; in her left hand, she cradles a fresh coconut with its top cut open and a straw inserted, revealing white flesh and clear juice. She stands slightly to the side, a graceful yet sultry pose, eyes meeting the camera with a lazy, seductive gaze. Her fair skin is flawless, makeup precise with defined eyeliner and full lips, small earrings and an orange-red bracelet adorning her. The foreground features lush plumeria branches entering from the upper right, framing the composition naturally, leaves glossy in sunlight, some petals trembling in a breeze. Midground shows traditional Thai wooden houses on both sides of the street, red doors, and colorful triangular flags hanging under eaves, printed with an ice cream brand logo. In the background, a golden stupa rises in the distance, conical and gleaming under a cloudless blue sky. Overhead wires crisscross, adding urban texture. Sunlight streams from the upper left, creating strong chiaroscuro—her body illuminated on one side, soft shadows on the other, dappled light on the ground. The low-angle shot emphasizes her figure while revealing layered depth, guiding the eye from foreground flowers to her, then to the stupa. Color palette centers on pink, red, green, and gold against blue sky and gray pavement, balanced and harmonious. The overall vibe blends everyday street life with dreamlike artistry, capturing a moment of exotic youth and beauty. Image quality is refined, with natural light and a slight film grain, like a professional travel portrait but with an edgy, sensual undertone. (NSFW: dress is sheer and reveals her bare shoulders, back, and the outline of her nipples; her posture and gaze are inviting.)",
