        {
          "id": "krea2-91b28c1e963032c47ced1b78",
          "alias": "单女棕外套车厢忧伤站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a retro green steam train beside the tracks, her brown wool coat unbuttoned and falling open to reveal her bare chest and erect nipples, the plush dark brown fox fur collar framing her pale skin. Low-angle sunlight from the right casts a warm golden glow on her face and hair as she turns slightly, looking back over her shoulder with a clear, melancholic gaze. Her wavy black hair lifts in the breeze, soft strands brushing her cheek. Her skin is fair and smooth, lips light pink, nose straight, features delicate and refined. Behind her, an old steam train sits at the platform, its paint chipped and faded with rust and dark green, windows reflecting pale blue sky and soft clouds, faint white numbers and markings on the side. The platform is gray stone slabs with worn edges, distant station building blurred in the background. Close-up portrait composition, the subject occupies the left two-thirds of the frame, the right side showcasing the train and environment, shot with a telephoto lens for a shallow depth of field. Light is from early morning or late afternoon low angle, creating strong chiaroscuro—warm light on the figure, cool tones behind. The atmosphere is nostalgic, quiet, and slightly melancholic. Colors are brown, green, cream, and gray-blue. Highlights catch on her hair edges and shoulders, shadows fall on her face and coat folds. Fine details visible: hair texture, fabric fibers, metal reflections. The style is cinematic and filmic, mixing a spontaneous candid feel with artistic lighting. The scene evokes a story of departure, waiting, or memory. The viewer's eye is guided from her gaze into the distance and back to her face, forming a circular path. Balanced composition, harmonious colors, natural light gradient, and subtle analog film grain. The overall mood is restrained, introspective, and emotionally charged with a blend of loneliness and tenderness.",
