          "prompt": "A young woman kneels on a Pilates reformer bed, wearing a skimpy pale yellow sports top that barely covers her breasts and high-waisted shorts, revealing her toned midriff and the curve of her hips. She grips the white fluffy handles attached to black straps, arms slightly bent, body held in a steady pose. Her gaze is soft, directed at the camera with a natural smile. Her hair is in a bun with a few loose strands falling over her forehead, adding casual sensuality. Her feet, in light-colored socks, press against the bed, knees firmly supported on the black leather cushion. The reformer has a cream metal frame, black leather pad with \"FIGURE 8 Pilates\" text, and visible black pulleys, adjustable weights, silver crossbar, and multiple black straps and pulley systems. In the background, a large floor-to-ceiling window shows lush green trees and faint building outlines; sunlight streams in from the right, casting soft shadows on her body, creating a bright, airy atmosphere. The room has white walls, a blue exercise ball and black circular device on the left, a broad-leafed plant in a white pot, and a tall bamboo-like plant on the floor. The composition is slightly low-angle, placing the woman slightly left of center, her body diagonally extended, guiding the eye from her hands to the handles and the window view. The overall tones are white, pale yellow, green, with metallic gray and black accents, evoking a fresh, healthy, modern home-gym scene. The image has fine grain, soft color saturation, slight film grain, and realistic camera exposure, with minor motion blur and noise at edges for a candid, lived-in feel. The woman’s top clings tightly to her breasts, hinting at their shape, and the high-waist shorts hug her hips and thighs, emphasizing her curves. The pose and lighting accentuate her athletic yet sensual form.",
