        {
          "id": "krea2-fb4c16754faed264bbb8e903",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝西装办公室微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a modern office chair, wearing only an open deep-blue blazer and matching skirt, her white shirt completely unbuttoned to expose her bare breasts with clearly visible nipples. Her brown medium-length hair with natural bangs glows in soft light. She beams a bright, genuine smile at the camera, eyes sparkling with confidence and delight. Her right hand holds a bright blue folder lightly above her head as if in a playful hat game, while her left hand rests casually on her side. She leans back slightly in the blue mesh-backed office chair, the black seat pad and metal frame visible. The composition is a close-up, slightly tilted angle, dynamic and candid. In the foreground, her exposed torso dominates the frame, highlighting her expression and the curve of her breasts. The mid-ground shows a light wooden desk with a black keyboard, mouse, and red pencil holder. The background is a softly blurred open-plan office with other cubicles, gray partitions, and distant windows. Lighting is bright and even from overhead and natural window light, creating soft diffused illumination on her face and chest, with delicate shadow transitions. Color palette is blue, white, gray—the blue folder and chair accent the scene. Shallow depth of field blurs the background, focusing on her joyful face and exposed chest, guiding the viewer's gaze from her smile upward along the raised folder. The mood is playful, confident, and sexually charged—a candid moment of workplace flirtation, captured with realistic detail and natural grain.",
