        {
          "id": "krea2-37c9855f3c95bbbf0e8e2220",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙沙发媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges sideways on a beige-and-yellow plaid sofa, her slightly wavy brown hair cascading naturally with bangs brushing her forehead. She wears a soft, flirtatious smile, her eyes half-lidded and directly meeting the lens, exuding a sensual calm. Her right hand rests gently on her knee, while her left hand holds a black flip phone face-down, as if she just snapped a photo. She is dressed in an off-white lace ruffled short-sleeve top, unbuttoned enough to reveal a hint of cleavage and bare shoulders, paired with a pink floral-print dress hiked up to expose the tops of her thighs. White ankle socks complete the playful look. Her body tilts slightly, relaxed yet poised, capturing a lazy, intimate afternoon. In the foreground, a transparent glass vase holds a lush bouquet of blooming purple daisies and small yellow flowers, set on a woven straw mat floor beside a pale green vintage fan with still blades. Midground, blue-and-white plaid pillows echo the sofa pattern. A large green houseplant with glossy leaves and tiny purple flowers sits behind, next to a wooden retro radio with visible dials and knobs. The composition is a low-angle overhead shot, with the woman offset to the left, the vase and phone guiding the eye from her face to her hand and the flowers. Warm, diffused sunlight filters through a window, casting soft, gentle shadows. The palette is warm yellow, cream, lavender, and light green, creating an intimate, nostalgic, pastoral atmosphere—a peaceful summer afternoon captured with subtle film grain and natural light transitions, evoking both everyday closeness and artistic photographic quality.",
