          "alias": "单女半褪黑连衣裙桌边媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an elegant vintage room, wearing a black-and-white plaid short-sleeve dress with the front zipper pulled down past her waist, exposing her bare breasts and toned stomach. The dress's classic tweed fabric shows fine woven texture; the A-line skirt has subtle ruffled hem. Her deep brown hair falls naturally with a straight fringe, some strands loosely tied in a low ponytail, a few loose wisps framing her face. She gazes directly at the camera with a cool, slightly seductive expression, lips naturally pink and slightly parted. Her left hand rests on her hip, right hand hangs loosely, long fingers with light nail polish. Background: an ornate European-style room with soft cream walls featuring delicate molding and vertical grooves. On the left, a large table lamp with a conical beige fabric shade emitting warm golden light, its base carved like a classical vase. On the right, a gold vintage candle-style wall lamp casts bright warm light, illuminating her side face and creating soft shadows. Warm-toned lighting from the lamps gives a cozy yet slightly mysterious atmosphere. Medium shot, she stands slightly right of center, body angled, head facing camera with direct eye contact. Foreground shows a corner of a light pink or beige velvet sofa with gold stitching and tassels, adding a touch of luxury. The scene feels like a high-fashion editorial but retains a natural, unretouched look. Subtle shadows enhance depth. Focus is on her face and exposed upper body, with harmonious colors and balanced composition.",
