          "alias": "单女露胸粉连衣裙广场戏谑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in front of a modern café bar, wearing a delicate pink short-sleeved dress made of fine jacquard fabric with subtle textured patterns that create a soft three-dimensional effect. The square neckline and a row of silver buttons run from her chest down to the waist, with the dress left unbuttoned to the navel, revealing her bare breasts and a teasing glimpse of her side. Her deep brown hair is tied in a low ponytail with straight bangs, her makeup is delicate and natural with soft eye shadow and peachy coral lips. Her gaze is direct into the camera, a gentle confident smile on her lips. She holds an orange-red cocktail in a tall Champagne glass with a straw and mint leaf garnish. The background shows a bright, clean café interior with a white bar extending into the depth, lined with empty highball glasses, some containing the same orange drink. Behind the bar is an open kitchen area with a black coffee machine, metal kettle, and other equipment. Above hangs a transparent ring light with white LED strips emitting soft cool light, beneath which is a glowing \"Café & Bar\" sign in simple sans-serif font with warm white edges. The ceiling is white grid with recessed downlights providing even illumination. The floor is light gray marble tiles with natural veining. The overall environment is clean, with a palette of white, off-white, and light gray, creating a fresh modern urban atmosphere. The subject is positioned slightly left of center, her body turned slightly, left hand gently resting on her skirt hem, lifting it just enough to reveal the top of her thigh. Composition is a medium shot from slightly below eye level, making her stand out. Lighting comes from indoor ceiling lights and the sign, creating soft diffuse light with minimal shadows. Color saturation is moderate, the overall tone warm and harmonious, with smooth light transitions, evoking a candid everyday feel as if captured on a regular weekday afternoon with a standa