          "alias": "单女半褪黑西装露营地微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young female race car driver sits on the asphalt ground beside an outdoor track, her black racing suit unzipped and pulled down to her waist, revealing only a tight pink sports bra that clings to her sweat-sheened skin, her toned midriff and cleavage fully exposed. Her curly hair falls naturally, a slight smile on her face as she looks directly at the camera. One hand rests on a carbon fiber helmet with red stripes, its visor reflecting the sky and surroundings. Her right leg is bent, left leg stretched out, wearing black racing boots with visible brand logos and an orange wristband on her wrist. The background shows a clear blue sky, blurred track facilities, and several colorful go-karts parked nearby, one blue kart with the number 342, alongside other racing vehicles. A large tent structure and parked cars are visible in the distance. The composition centers on her, shot from a low angle, with the rough, textured asphalt in the foreground. Strong sunlight from the upper right creates dramatic chiaroscuro, casting sharp shadows, with high saturation and bright exposure, evoking the hot, vibrant atmosphere of a summer afternoon. The image has a natural, amateur equipment feel, with slight wide-angle distortion, fine detail, natural grain and dynamic range, realistic colors, and smooth light transitions. The viewer’s eye is first drawn to her exposed upper body and smile, then follows her pose to the racing environment. Balanced composition with layered depth from foreground ground details, midground driver and cars, and background elements. The overall mood is relaxed yet professional, capturing a candid moment of a female athlete during a race break, blending artistic beauty with everyday life.",
