          "alias": "单女全裸和服舞台困倦坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a blue velvet high-back chair center stage, wearing an oversized silk kimono-style robe with black base and gold vintage lettering/geometric patterns, deep V-neckline revealing a black lace bra, wide flowing sleeves, glossy satin texture catching stage lights. She has medium-length wavy brown hair with blunt bangs, naturally falling over her shoulders, slightly wind-tossed. Her gaze is focused and tender, looking up diagonally, lips parted as if whispering or singing. In her right hand she holds a white microphone close to her mouth, left hand rests on her thigh, light nude nail polish, delicate silver geometric earrings. Her posture is elegant and expressive. Mid-shot composition, subject centered left, waist-up framing. Background is deep black curtain with soft blue bokeh light spots, dreamy stage atmosphere. Lighting from front-right spotlight softly illuminates her face, chest, and hands, creating chiaroscuro that accentuates contours and volume, smooth shadow transitions, rich light layers. Color palette black/gold/blue with strong cool-warm contrast. Leading lines from her gaze extend out of frame, enhancing depth. Overall mood blends high-fashion sophistication and live-performance realism, as if captured from a premium concert or brand event. Professional portrait lens simulation, 50mm, extreme sharpness, detailed skin texture, realistic fabric rendering. Artistic yet candid documentary aesthetic, strong visual impact and emotional tension, cinematic narrative. Cool-toned but warm, precise light distribution, focus on face and upper body, background tastefully blurred for separation. Style fuses modern fashion, stage performance, and humanitarian portraiture, exuding elegance, confidence, and charisma. Perfect for luxury brand campaigns, album covers, or gallery works. Full details, layered, highly collectible.",
