        {
          "id": "krea2-7abc16184069da029586f4f3",
          "alias": "单女露胸灰牛仔城市媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits indoors by a window, her deep brown hair falling naturally, soft strands brushing her face in a lazy, sensual sweep. Her pale, smooth skin catches the dim light, jawline defined, eyes deep and slightly glazed as she stares directly into the lens, lips parted with a faint red hue. She wears a light gray denim jacket, rough and worn with creases and frayed edges, unbuttoned to reveal her bare chest—nipples visible, skin flushed. A thin chain-and-bead strap hangs diagonally across her left shoulder, metal and beads glinting softly. Her arm reaches forward as if holding a phone for a selfie, the pose candid and dynamic. The composition is a tight close-up, head and torso filling the frame, shot at a slight tilt for an informal, intimate angle. Behind her, a dim interior—likely a bar or café—with a large window showing the night city, reflections of warm indoor lights and blurred building outlines. On the windowsill, two bottles: left a black wine bottle with a red label, right a dark bottle with vintage religious-themed artwork. The sill is pale stone, rough-textured. In the background, track lights cast cool white beams, walls are pale with texture, distant figures and furniture out of focus. The main light is warm yellow from above and side, creating soft highlights on her face and hair, with strong chiaroscuro—one side lit, the other in shadow. Overall tone is warm, with sepia, gray-green, and black hues, slight film grain and low saturation for a realistic, amateur feel. The scene captures a quiet, private moment, evoking urban nightlife solitude and introspection, the bottles and cityscape hinting at a social setting, yet her expression holds a blend of inner stillness and melancholy, deepening the narrative tension.",
