        {
          "id": "krea2-f8354f470b32dff6cfeea91f",
          "alias": "单女黑背心室内微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a minimalist interior, her short brown hair falling naturally along her cheeks, soft and glossy. She wears clear thin-rimmed glasses, the lenses catching soft light. Her smile is bright, revealing clean white teeth, her eyes clear and warm. Her skin is fair and smooth, with delicate natural makeup that accentuates her features. She wears a sheer black sleeveless top—the transparent fabric reveals her nipples and the full curves of her breasts—with semi-transparent mesh detailing at the shoulders and neckline, adding depth and elegance. Below, a light pink long skirt flows wide and soft, with slight creases and an intricate white lace hem in a wavy pattern, giving a romantic vintage feel. Her legs are crossed, body leaning back against a plain white wall, right hand resting on the floor for support. Her fingers are slender, nails painted pale yellow, a simple modern silver ring on her ring finger. The background is a clean white wall with subtle texture; to the right rear, a corner of a white geometric object (possibly furniture or decor) is barely visible. The floor is smooth gray concrete. The composition is a medium shot, the woman positioned slightly left, creating asymmetrical balance. Her head tilts slightly, eyes looking directly at the camera, inviting intimacy. Light comes from the left, soft and even, creating natural chiaroscuro across her face, arms, and the skirt, highlighting skin texture and fabric details. The overall mood is warm, cozy, with a hint of artistic elegance. The palette is black, white, pink—simple yet layered, evoking a fresh, gentle, everyday sensuality. Every detail, from the shine in her hair to the lace pattern, is crisp, capturing a low-key but refined aesthetic of life, as if a candid moment shot with a professional camera in natural light, blending artistic beauty with raw authenticity.",
