        {
          "id": "krea2-60b601cb3e16ec3a77a46bac",
          "alias": "单女露胸粉毛衣博物馆媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a green bench in an art museum gallery, her soft brown hair tied with two pink bow clips, her face delicate and calm as she gazes toward the camera. She is topless, bare breasts gently exposed, her legs crossed elegantly, one hand resting lightly on the bench armrest, the other hand hanging down, wrist adorned with a fine bracelet and watch, a small white quilted bag held loosely. She wears only a pink knit short-sleeve top unbuttoned and pushed aside, paired with a matching high-waist peplum skirt with ruffled hem and delicate lace trim, white mesh ankle socks, and white woven flat shoes with black bow details, revealing long, toned legs and graceful ankles. The background is a refined museum interior with soft olive-green walls, white wainscoting, and two classical oil paintings in ornate gold frames—one depicting a court scene with figures seated in conversation, the other an indoor gathering, painted in a detailed realistic style. The floor is polished dark brown wood with a soft sheen, and behind the bench a metal stanchion with rope barrier protects the artworks. Warm, even lighting creates a serene, elegant atmosphere. The composition centers on the woman, slightly right of frame, with the bench forming a diagonal leading line from lower left to upper right, adding depth. The paintings and barrier create layered visual structure. The foreground emphasizes her clothing details and topless pose, the midground shows the bench and part of the floor, and the background establishes the environment. Soft, uniform light without harsh contrast, evoking a quiet, tender, slightly vintage daily art-life moment, as if a candid shot of a young girl visiting a museum—real, natural, and beautifully sensual.",
