          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a wooden floor, her vivid sapphire blue blazer unbuttoned and hanging open, revealing a black lace bra that barely contains her full breasts, the lacy cups pushing them up with visible cleavage. She wears only a matching black lace thong, her legs crossed high, the inner thigh exposed, one ankle delicately resting on the other. Her brown hair falls naturally, soft bangs brushing her forehead, her eyes half-lidded and smoldering as she gazes into the camera, a subtle, knowing smile on her lips. Her right hand lifts to lightly touch her cheek, fingers grazing her skin, as if lost in thought or inviting intimacy. The composition places her slightly right of center; to the left, a lush white rose bouquet in a simple pale ceramic vase sits on the floor, petals full and layered, a thin bamboo support visible. A pink cherry blossom branch arcs from the top left corner, its delicate blooms echoing the spring mood. Behind her, a beige vintage-patterned sofa cushion shows faint wrinkles from use. The background wall is divided into dark wood grid squares filled with gray-white marble-textured wallpaper, the cool tones contrasting with the warm flowers. Light from the left pours softly across her face, shoulder, and arm, casting gentle shadows on the right side of her body and the floor, where the wood grain glistens. The scene is captured at a slightly low angle, intimate and natural, with shallow depth of field creating a smooth bokeh. The color palette centers on blue, white, pink, and brown—the blue blazer the focal point, the roses and cherries adding romance, the wooden elements grounding it. The mood blends modern fashion with traditional aesthetic, sensual and poetic, with film-like grain and digital clarity, evoking a personal, voyeuristic snapshot of a private moment. NSFW.",
