          "alias": "单女露胸蓝连衣裙窗边困倦站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands sideways by a window in a minimalist room, her black hair pinned in an elegant low bun with loose strands falling across her forehead. She gazes outward, lips parted in a soft, contemplative whisper. Her body tilts slightly, right hand languidly pulling aside the sheer fabric of her pale blue dress, revealing a slender arm and bare shoulder. The dress is a delicate, semi-transparent layered chiffon with a single shoulder strap tied in a large bow—now slipped down, leaving her top completely bare, her breasts exposed and nipples faintly defined by the cool window light. The short skirt fans out in multiple ruffled tiers, its transparent material clinging and parting to show the curve of her hips and the shadow between her thighs. She wears cream-white suede pumps with gold metallic heels that catch the light. She stands slightly left of center, the main focus. Behind her, a large window with white mullions splits the frame, flooding the scene with soft, diffused natural light that creates a backlit glow around her silhouette, casting delicate shadows on the pale wall. The floor is light wood with visible grain, warm-toned. The composition is a mid-shot, camera level just below eye height, emphasizing her long legs and the elegant line of the heels while keeping her full torso and upward-tilted face. The space is sparse, no clutter; the eye is guided from her naked upper body toward the window. The light is cool white, warmed by the wooden floor, a clean blue-and-white palette accented with cream and gold. The scene feels like a still from an art film—dreamlike yet hyper-real, with shallow depth of field and soft bokeh on the window grid, capturing her most honest, breathless moment in nature’s glow.",
