        {
          "id": "krea2-6ca47859d9986b348cabc0f9",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙椅上媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits elegantly on a sleek white modern chair, wearing a form-fitting blue-and-black zebra-print slip dress with a plunging V-neckline that reveals the swell of her breasts and sharp collarbones. The A-line skirt hits mid-thigh, its glossy fabric clinging to her curves. Her long, jet-black hair cascades over one shoulder, topped with a pure white headband. Her face is flawless, porcelain skin, high cheekbones, and soft, smoky eyes gazing off to the right with a suggestive, parted-lip expression. A lavish sapphire-and-diamond choker rests at her throat, the deep blue gemstone dominating her décolletage. She crosses her legs, one black stiletto heel dangling from her foot, the other pressing into the floor. Her right hand rests lightly on her upper thigh, fingertips brushing the hem of her dress, while her left hand hangs lazily beside the chair. The foreground frames a close-up of her crossed legs, exposed thighs, and the shiny black heel, with the dress riding up to reveal bare skin. In the midground, she is the focal point against a pale blue wall; a small white circular table to the right holds a highball glass filled with amber liquid, catching soft candlelight and warm fairy lights in the distant dark background. The lighting comes from the left, casting dramatic shadows across her body and the floor, emphasizing her silhouette and the glossy texture of her dress and shoes. The overall palette is cool blue with warm amber accents, evoking a luxurious, nocturnal editorial shoot—sophisticated, sensual, and intensely alluring.",
