        {
          "id": "krea2-a2d8571af7c6b3dd4474826a",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装门冷淡坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the open door edge of a white sports car, wearing only a deep blue blazer unbuttoned, braless, with the grey sweater and white shirt collar discarded, her black skirt hiked up revealing sheer black stockings and black stiletto heels. She smiles confidently at the camera, long hair with blunt bangs cascading over her shoulders, left hand gently gripping the door interior, right leg dangling down, left leg bent to emphasize toned thighs. Her body leans slightly forward, head tilted, soft gaze inviting. Shot as a close-up mid-frame, she occupies the center-right, the car sleek beside her. Background: modern car showroom with white walls, brand logos, posters, distant glass windows reflecting daylight, grey tiled floor, bright even top lighting. Tones of black, white, silver with minimal red accents. Light casts soft shadows on her face, highlights on the car's metallic finish. Visual flow from her eyes down her bare torso to her legs, then to the vehicle details. Scene feels like a candid real-life luxury showroom shot, realistic style with subtle grain, natural depth, casual composition, conveying cool sophistication and a hint of raw sexual confidence.",
