        {
          "id": "krea2-285ea9bd29539b628ffaacb6",
          "alias": "单女露胸制服泳池微笑自拍",
          "prompt": "Underwater selfie perspective, a young woman in a clear blue pool, wearing a transparent diving mask with light blue frame and \"COCO\" logo, lenses slightly reflecting water ripples. Deep blue-gray eyes, focused and clear gaze, gentle smile, light pink lip gloss. Her skin has a natural cool tone with a subtle wet sheen. Black hair braided into two thick braids with purple-red gradient, trailing over her chest, strands floating and clinging to her wet face and forehead. She is topless, bare breasts with nipples hardened by water, arms reaching forward as if holding a camera or phone, soft muscle definition, skin slightly blurred by refraction but fine texture. Close-up composition, subject centered left. Background: uniform blue water with subtle grain and drifting bubbles. Soft diffused light slanting from above, creating gentle chiaroscuro on her face, hair, and body. Tiny rising bubbles add dynamic detail. Dominant blue tones, warm skin, purple-red hair gradient. Low-angle shot enhancing intimacy and presence. Atmosphere: serene, fresh, summery, everyday amateur camera feel, yet artistically dreamlike. Detailed textures, clear water, natural expression conveying freedom, relaxation, and sensual self-expression.",
