        {
          "id": "krea2-52b75504dc6d6af85ca65fa7",
          "alias": "单女露胸白连衣裙室内媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the green artificial turf of an indoor tennis court, wearing a white CHANEL tennis dress that is provocatively unzipped at the front, the delicate black thin straps and collar trim falling loose to reveal her bare breasts, the double C logo visible on the fabric near her waist. The skirt is hiked up high, exposing her smooth thighs and the edge of white lace panties. She wears white high-top sneakers with CHANEL-printed socks and a wristband, her dark hair tied up in a sleek bun, her makeup flawless with soft eyeliner and pink lips. She smiles sweetly, her eyes clear and direct, looking into the lens. Her left hand rests lightly on her right arm, her right hand lies casually beside her knee, her body leaning slightly forward in a relaxed yet confident pose that exudes sensuality. A black tennis racket with a white handle and colorful trim leans against her side. In the background, a black metal basket is filled with green Wilson tennis balls, the red \"W\" logo prominent, behind it a white wall and blurry indoor space. A single bright yellow tennis ball lies in the foreground right, contrasting with the green turf. The tennis net cuts across the middle of the frame, its black mesh creating a grid. The lighting is soft and even from the front-left, casting no harsh shadows, creating a bright, clean atmosphere. The color palette is dominated by white, green, and black, with accents of yellow and red. The image has the look of a high-end commercial photoshoot captured with a full-frame camera and wide aperture, rich in detail from the texture of the fabric to the sheen of her skin, achieving a hyper-realistic digital render with the warmth of genuine photography, freezing a quiet yet vibrant moment in time.",
