          "alias": "单女露胸灰连衣裙摄影棚冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young female model stands in a professional studio, topless, her light gray one-shoulder sleeveless dress slipped down to her waist, exposing her bare breasts with pale nipples. Her long black hair cascades naturally, catching soft side light with a gentle sheen. She gazes downward at a white script in her hands, lips slightly parted, expression focused and introspective. She wears simple pearl earrings; her skin is fair and smooth, with delicate facial contours, straight nose, natural brows, subtle eye makeup, long curled lashes, and clean makeup. Her right hand grips the edge of the script, fingers slender; her left hand rises slightly, palm up, as if adjusting light or signaling. A hand from the left holds a black reflector umbrella near her head, its inner surface casting warm orange light, creating soft highlights on her hair and cheeks, a warm backlit glow. The background is a blurred studio with lighting gear, cables, black stands, partial dark-clothed crew arms, conveying a live shoot. Close-up composition, subject slightly right, umbrella and hand left, balanced. Focus on face and upper body, background defocused. Light from upper left simulates daylight or fill light, natural contrast and depth, soft shadows, crisp details. Color palette: gray, white, black, with warm orange glow. Atmosphere is quiet, professional, with a raw, amateur-camera feel, capturing a candid pre-shoot moment. Storytelling, immersive, documentary style, artistic impact. Tense yet calm, like a film still. Cool tones warmed by light, strong visual contrast. Fine details from hair strands to skin texture, respecting the craft.",
