        {
          "id": "krea2-707549c2a77fca828141b2d6",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫街道冷淡站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on an outdoor stone staircase, wearing a deep blue check shirt and matching check pleated mini skirt. The shirt is unbuttoned halfway, revealing the swell of her breasts and a delicate black lace bralette. Sleeves are rolled up, exposing slender wrists. The check pattern weaves deep blue and pale yellow, crisp lines, premium cotton-linen texture with a subtle sheen. The high-waisted skirt hugs her hips, with metal button accents, the hemline barely covering the tops of her thighs, showcasing long, toned legs. Her long wavy dark brown hair cascades naturally, strands lifted by the breeze, adding motion. Makeup is flawless—sharp eyeliner, soft smoky eyes, warm orange-red lips. She gazes directly at the camera with a calm, confident expression. A beige canvas bag with white leather strap hangs diagonally across her shoulder; one hand rests lightly on the strap, fingers grazing the metal logo plate. The backdrop is an ancient stone staircase with rough, weathered surfaces and black metal railings. Dense dark green broad-leaved foliage creates dappled shadows. Medium shot composition, subject slightly offset to the left, body turned slightly, head facing the lens, evoking a fashion street-style editorial. Foreground shows detail of stone steps and railing, midground focuses on the woman, background is blurred greenery and stone wall, shallow depth of field. Lighting is natural diffused daylight, soft and even, no harsh shadows. Color palette leans cool—blues, greens, grays dominate—with the warm beige bag as an accent. Atmosphere is serene yet urban sophisticated, high-fashion editorial aesthetic meets natural environment, as if captured by a professional full-frame camera with a prime lens, rich in detail and narrative tension.",
