          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙街道媚态行走阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman walks sensually outside a French café on a European street, wearing a light blue sleeveless dress with a deep back cutout exposing her black inner top, tied waistband and high side slit revealing bare skin, her long wavy hair blowing lightly in the wind. She holds a brown leather handbag with a small toy charm, black high heels paired with dark gray scrunched socks, stepping elegantly onto the crosswalk with a lingering gaze back at the camera. Background: a Parisian café with wooden tables, a chalkboard menu reading \"PLAT DU JOUR\" and \"CROQUET AU MIEL\", an electronic menu screen, orange awning, warm interior lights casting soft haze through windows. Cobblestone street, clear crosswalk lines, soft golden afternoon sunlight creating delicate chiaroscuro on her curves. Mid-shot composition, subject on the right, body slightly tilted, eye contact inviting. Foreground crosswalk and pavement, midground woman and café front, background blurred architecture. Vivid photographic style with creamy bokeh, balanced saturation, blending fashion editorial allure with everyday intimacy, capturing a modern woman's seductive stroll in a lazy, romantic Parisian afternoon.",
