          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a deep red velvet bench, her long, jet-black, silky hair cascading smoothly over her shoulders and chest, with slight curls at the ends for a lazy, elegant look. Her delicate features are sharply defined: thin, clear brows, soft earthy-toned eyeshadow, flawless eyeliner, thick lashes, and bright, confident eyes staring directly at the lens. Her lips are full, coated in light pink gloss, and her skin is fair, luminous with a natural dewy glow. She wears a cream-white vintage-style sheer lace bra and high-waisted panties set, intricately embroidered with floral patterns in rust red, gold, and forest green. Over it, a loose, open-front robe with fringe details at the cuffs and hem hangs open, leaving her bare midriff and cleavage fully exposed. A wide ribbon tie made of striped fabric adorns the collar, with lace trim beneath. Her skirt is a ruffled mini with an asymmetrical, wavy hem, soft and flowing. Her legs are together, knees bent, one foot on the floor, the other lifted, showing white sheer tights that cling to her thighs, and dark brown leather ankle boots with woven texture and a slightly pointed toe. She rests her right hand on the bench, fingers long with pale yellow nail polish; her left hand lies casually on her thigh. The background is a warm, deep red art studio with matte walls, featuring built-in shelves holding white plaster sculptures and mannequins—busts and abstract forms—on small trays. Light from the upper left casts soft side lighting, illuminating her face, arms, and the folds of her clothing, with natural shadows to the right and in the background, creating depth and drama. The composition is a medium shot, centered slightly left, with the bench's red velvet texture visible in the foreground. The overall mood is quiet, elegant, like a high-fashion editorial shot in a private art studio or vintage study. Shot with professional camera, 85mm, f/2.8, 1/125s, ISO 200, three-point lighting, delivering cinematic lighting and film grain.",
