        {
          "id": "krea2-ee0123428e44c7b36608c8aa",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙办公室媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a modern office, wearing a fitted black sleeveless dress with a white collar flipped open, her cleavage visible as she leaves the top buttons undone, the dress hugging her curves. Her long black hair is sleek, one side tucked behind her ear, the other adorned with a black velvet bow. She holds a white sheet of paper aloft in her right hand, catching a breeze, while her left hand clutches a stack of documents. A silver bracelet glints on her slender wrist. Her makeup is sultry with smoky eyes and full, glossy lips; she gazes directly at the viewer with a confident, playful smirk, as if displaying a hard-won result. In the foreground left, a white file cabinet holds two gray folders with visible labels and metal rings; the bottom drawer spills over with wildflowers in yellow, white, and purple, contrasting the sterile office. A vintage beige computer monitor peeks in from the right edge, its screen dark. The background is a plain light gray wall with a deep blue baseboard. The composition is centered with the woman slightly offset to the right, shot at eye level with a subtle low angle to emphasize her height and presence. Soft frontal-left lighting casts gentle shadows, creating a clean, bright atmosphere. The palette is mostly black, white, and gray, accented by the warm flowers and blue floor, evoking a polished commercial aesthetic. The scene captures an empowered, independent urban professional in a moment of sensual confidence and beauty.",
