        {
          "id": "krea2-3acbeab2bb3b8bb124fad9dd",
          "alias": "单女露胸米毛衣街道害羞站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless on a twilight street, her open cream fluffy-sleeved cardigan hanging loosely over bare shoulders, leaving her full breasts exposed, nipples perked from the cool evening air. She wears a sheer white lace dress, unbuttoned and clinging to her hips, paired with black thigh-high boots that frame her long, pale legs. She elegantly lifts her right leg, balancing gracefully, as both hands gently tug on two long braided pigtails, her face tilted down with a sweet, shy smile, eyes sparkling with playful mischief. Her silky hair falls in soft waves, bangs neatly across her forehead. The dress features delicate bow and ruffle details, the layered hem fluttering in the breeze. Behind her, a warm street scene: a rustic stone lantern and wooden building on the left, a vibrant shop window on the right displaying orange-print garments. Gray stone pavement, interwoven light and shadow, warm yellow light spilling from the store, illuminating her figure in a soft, dreamy glow. Mid-shot composition, subject slightly left of center, natural relaxed stance. Her gaze and hand motion lead the eye to the braids, then to the neon-colored background. Light from upper right creates strong chiaroscuro, casting shadows on the ground and wall, enhancing depth and dimension. Overall warm yellow tones mixed with white, black, and colorful accents—a candid, artistic snapshot style with slight film grain and natural exposure transitions, full of everyday life and youthful vitality. The balanced composition layers depth: foreground stone lantern and potted plants, mid-ground lively subject, blurred background shops and passersby framing her form. The scene radiates warmth, sweetness, and a hint of mystery—a captured beautiful afternoon moment.",
