          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a cozy indoor setting, her dark hair cascading naturally over her bare shoulders, skin fair and flawless. She is topless, her full breasts exposed, nipples taut, as she gazes at the camera with a calm, slightly lazy expression, lips parted in quiet contemplation. She wears only a light pink V-neck dress that is unbuttoned and slipping off one shoulder, the fabric pooling around her waist, revealing her torso entirely. Her hands rest lightly on her thighs, fingers gently grazing her skin. She sits on a sleek black metal-framed chair, its modern lines contrasting with her soft curves. In the foreground, a round wooden table holds a white ceramic cup, a small golden-brown cake on a plate, and a bouquet of pale yellow and white flowers in a terracotta vase. A small potted plant adds a touch of green. Behind her, a wooden bookshelf displays books, a black ceramic vase, and a large leafy plant. A black-framed abstract artwork hangs on the wall. A large white paper lantern glows warmly overhead, casting a soft golden light from the upper right, creating gentle shadows on the deep gray carpet. The composition centers on her, slightly left, her exposed skin and sensual calm drawing focus. The atmosphere is intimate, warm, and artfully nostalgic, like a film still capturing a tranquil, erotic moment in a café.",
