          "id": "krea2-3531d649f38050ec886342ea",
          "alias": "单女全裸街道自信跳舞",
          "prompt": "A naked young woman performing a high-difficulty ballet stretch on an indoor white windowsill, her right leg lifted straight up, right hand gripping her foot, left leg supporting her weight, poised with elegance and strength. Her black hair cascades naturally over her shoulders, delicate facial features, eyes intently focused on the camera, wearing a thin silver necklace and a simple black wristband on her left wrist. Her bare breasts are fully exposed, nipples visible, as her body is stretched in this athletic pose. Sunlight streams through a bright floor-to-ceiling window behind her, revealing a clear blue sky, bare tree branches, distant high-rises, and a yellow vehicle on the street. The room is a modern dance studio with exposed industrial white pipes and lighting fixtures, warm yellow spotlights casting soft light that contrasts with the natural daylight. Walls and floor are light gray. On the right side, white vertical blinds partially block the view, and a white metal staircase railing is visible. The composition uses a diagonal perspective, with the figure positioned to the right, her body lines forming a diagonal with the window frames. The visual focus is on her raised leg and her facial expression. The lighting is warm and layered, natural light from the left creating clear shadows on the floor and wall, while indoor lights fill details in shadowed areas. The scene has a candid, artful feel, as if captured by an amateur photographer in the early morning or afternoon with a phone or ordinary camera, catching the dancer's focused yet relaxed state during training. The image has strong realistic texture and everyday life atmosphere. The color palette is dominated by green, white, and gray, with accents of blue sky and yellow car outside, creating a fresh, natural, slightly urban visual effect. The composition is tight yet open: foreground shows the dynamic pose, midground reveals the windowsill, railing, and indoor environment, while the background provides a distant city view. Layers are distinct, visual guidance clear, highlighting the subject's flexibility and beauty while integrating real-life scene elements, giving the image both artistic expression and a sense of familiarity.",
