          "prompt": "A young woman stands by a crosswalk on a Parisian street, wearing a pale blue sleeveless dress with a shirt-style collar and open back crisscross lacing, the fabric slightly sheer and catching the light—her black camisole underneath is visible, but the top buttons are undone, revealing the straps and a hint of cleavage. The A-line hem falls just above mid-thigh, the skirt lifting slightly with a breeze. She wears grey thigh-high stockings with a subtle sheen, and dark brown stiletto heels with metal buckle and bead details. Her long wavy hair cascades freely, catching the warm golden-hour light. She leans against a black cast-iron bollard, hips cocked, body forming an elegant S-curve, one hand holding a brown leather handbag, the other hanging loosely. Her gaze is direct, sultry, with a soft smirk. The background shows classic Parisian architecture—grey-blue buildings with French windows, a sign reading \"LE 8 CLOS\" in blue on white, green street signs, cobblestone pavement, and a faint bicycle in the distance. The scene is bathed in soft twilight glow, with long shadows, cool blues and warm browns creating a cinematic, intimate atmosphere. Medium shot, subject right of frame, visual flow from her face down through her body to her heels and bag, then into the street. The mood is romantic, sensual, and fashionably candid—a woman caught in a moment of urban elegance with an undercurrent of desire.",
