          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a weathered red brick wall, wearing a long black-and-white striped coat with fluffy white trim at the collar and cuffs, the coat slightly open to reveal her bare chest and a hint of cleavage. Her black hair falls straight with blunt bangs, her eyes locked directly on the camera with a mix of defiance and contemplation. She stands slightly angled, arms crossed at the chest, one hand gripping the opposite wrist, fingers pressing into her skin. A small white shoulder bag hangs from her shoulder, the thin strap contrasting against the coat. She wears black lace-up boots with thick soles, standing on reddish-brown square tiles scattered with a few dry autumn leaves. The red brick wall behind her shows patches of moss, uneven coloring, and a cement base covered in green lichen. Soft, diffused light—overcast or early morning—creates a calm, moody atmosphere with no harsh shadows. The composition centers on her, mid-shot, her head in the upper third, body slightly tilted for dynamic balance. The vertical lines of the wall echo her silhouette, while the foreground leaves and brick texture add depth. The color palette is rich red, brown, black, and white, harmonious and subdued. Her expression is quiet, slightly melancholy, as if she’s posing for an intimate winter street portrait, the coat falling open just enough to reveal her is firmed enough to maintain an air of controlled eroticism. The scene feels both candid and artistic, evoking the solitude and self-expression of a young urbanite in autumn, with a subtle breeze seeming to stir her hair and the fallen leaves.",
