          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a low cabinet with yellow gingham tiles, her body slightly turned toward the camera. She holds a bouquet of pink roses in her left arm, her right hand hangs naturally with fingers resting lightly on her knee. She is topless except for a pair of beige high-waisted shorts, her bare breasts fully exposed. Her ankles are slightly bent, bare feet dangling. Her wavy dark brown hair is casually pinned back with a red clip, a few loose strands falling over her forehead. She looks directly at the camera with a subtle, lazy, mysterious expression, lips slightly pressed. Her right shoulder and arm rest softly on her leg, forming a gentle curve. The background is a light gray-green wall with a fine, slightly grainy texture. Above to the right is a white table lamp with a pleated shade and fringe trim, casting warm, soft sidelight that illuminates her face, arm, and the flowers. The left side of her face is lit, with natural shadow transitions on the right. Overall warm light, vintage film color tone. In the midground, on the cabinet, an open record cover shows a fuzzy pink texture, next to a black vinyl record with a white label, a small Virgin Mary statue, and a red cross ornament, arranged in the lower right corner as a still life. In the foreground, the rose bouquet is at lower left, layered petals from light to deep pink, green leaves, curved stems. Low-angle composition, subject dominates the frame, focus on face and flowers. The lamp light creates a diagonal line from upper left to lower right, enhancing spatial depth. The dividing line between wall and floor forms a simple geometric split. Color palette: warm yellow, beige, light pink. Nostalgic, gentle, slightly intimate atmosphere. Strong film grain texture, rich details, natural noise, moderate saturation. Captures a candid moment, as if shot with an old camera in dim light. Slight vignette to enhance center focus. Overall warm and serene, like a silent poem recording a quiet