          "prompt": "A young woman with shoulder-length black hair and straight bangs sits on a shallow blue stepped seat. She stares directly into the camera, her expression cool and slightly seductive, lips painted soft coral, makeup flawless. She wears a tight black short-sleeved knit dress, now unbuttoned and pulled down to fully expose her bare breasts, with sheer black stockings and legs crossed. Her nails are deep blue gloss. She gently holds a round brown Miu Miu plush handbag with a leather strap. Body leans slightly forward, medium close-up shot. Background is a blurred indoor fashion show scene—other guests talking or on phones, dim ambient light but her figure is hit by a bright spotlight, creating dramatic high contrast. The blue stepped seats echo the foreground. Light comes from front-top, casting shadows behind her. Overall aesthetic feels like a high-end fashion photo with subtle grain and natural skin tones, blending polished sophistication with raw intimacy. Composition is triangular, focusing on her face and the handbag. Tones are black, blue, brown with strong cool-warm contrast. The scene radiates urban female independence, confident sensuality, and understated luxury.",
