          "alias": "单女露胸蓝牛仔媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a sunny grassy lawn, wearing unbuttoned wide-leg light blue jeans and bright yellow H-strap sandals. Her sheer high-neck long-sleeve shirt lies discarded on the grass beside her. Dark brown hair is in a loose messy bun, with stray strands caressing her cheek. She gazes intently at a white smartphone held in her left hand; her right hand rests on her knee. Gold bracelet and chain adorn her wrist. A small pale yellow crossbody bag hangs from her shoulder. Red-framed sunglasses lie on the grass nearby. Background: lush tropical foliage, a tall palm tree with broad fronds casting dappled shade, a stone wall with two black ceramic pots, neatly trimmed green shrubs, and rolling hills beneath a clear blue sky. Warm sunlight falls from the upper right, creating soft backlight that glows around her body and casts delicate shadows across the grass and clothing. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with her positioned right of center, her gaze leading toward the phone, while the left side extends into the natural landscape. The scene conveys a sensual, tranquil, intimate afternoon—photorealistic, rich in detail, with a subtle, artful eroticism.",
