          "alias": "单女牛仔船上媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits astride the front of a vintage black cruiser motorcycle, wearing a red sleeveless athletic crop top with white stripe accents, her toned midriff exposed as the top rides up, paired with loose ripped denim jeans that reveal glimpses of bare thigh, black boots, long hair flowing over her shoulders, large hoop earrings, her gaze soft and inviting toward the camera, left hand lightly gripping the handlebar, right hand resting casually at her side, her pose relaxed yet confident, exuding effortless sensuality and strength. She leans slightly, her body in dynamic harmony with the bike, the foreground showing the metallic tank with smooth reflective silver tones and a transparent windshield with intricate mechanical details. Midground features a blue metal sheet wall and orange shelving stacked with car parts—rims, tires, seats, bumpers. Background is a cluttered garage or customization workshop, overhead light casting soft shadows, the overall vibe industrial and street-culture. Composition centers on the woman and motorcycle, drawing focus to her facial expression and body posture. Warm lighting creates a nostalgic, slightly gritty feel with natural grain and noise, as if captured on amateur film, enhancing the raw, documentary quality. The scene pulses with youthful energy and individuality, a candid snapshot of a free-spirited lifestyle. Contrast of red and blue, coarse industrial elements against her soft femininity, generates unique visual tension. Stable yet dynamic composition fuses subject and environment into a realistic, story-rich everyday moment.",
