          "prompt": "A young woman sits on modern indoor stairs, her slightly wavy short brown hair falling naturally across her forehead, skin pale and flawless, makeup subtle with a touch of shimmer on her eyelids, lips a soft nude pink. She gazes directly at the camera with a lazy, playful expression, hands cupping her chin, fingers slightly curled in a relaxed yet focused pose. She wears a completely sheer light gray short-sleeve shirt, unbuttoned, no bra, revealing her bare breasts with erect nipples visible through the fabric. A thin chain necklace rests at her collarbone. Below, she has on high-waisted ripped denim shorts, frayed edges and a small floral embroidery on her left thigh, the shorts loosely hugging her hips. On her feet are bright red Puma sneakers with white logo, laces neatly tied, paired with thick white socks bunched at her ankles. Her legs are together, knees slightly bent, body leaning forward in a casual, youthful pose. The stairs are gray stone with metal edges, dark gray textured wall tiles, a warm wooden handrail on the right with white metal supports. Low-angle shot from below, emphasizing her dominance in frame. Lighting from front-top, soft and even, with no harsh shadows. Her face and upper body are in sharp focus, legs and shoes mid-ground, staircase receding into a blurred background for depth. The atmosphere is clean, modern, lifelike, with slight film grain, moderate saturation—the red shoes pop against the cool tones. The image feels like a street-style snapshot, shot on a professional camera or high-end phone, cinematic, warm yet cool, rich in detail, with a natural visual flow from face to legs to stairs. The overall vibe: young, free, confident urban youth, bold and expressive.",
