          "alias": "单女露胸白衬衫惊讶呼喊",
          "prompt": "A woman floats upside-down in the center aisle of a commercial airliner, her body inverted with head pointed down and feet up, as if lifted by an invisible force. She wears a white short-sleeve button-up shirt undone to expose her bare breasts, a black miniskirt hiked up to reveal her bare ass, and bright red high heels. Her long hair cascades nearly to the floor, her arms slightly spread, mouth wide open in a shocked yet helpless scream, eyes wide with dramatic terror. The cabin is filled with rows of dark gray airline seats with silver metal headrest adjusters and control panels, light gray plastic armrests, blue carpet with white stitching, and warm yellow-white overhead lighting casting soft halos. Shot from a low angle with a slight tilt, center composition, the surrounding seats create strong leading lines converging into the distance. The foreground shows detailed seats and aisle structure, midground features the floating woman and tiny dust particles, background blurs into the cabin end and windows. Warm ambient light creates gentle shadows and highlights on clothing folds, skin texture, and hair shine, with a realistic amateur photo quality including slight grain and imperfect exposure. The scene balances everyday reality with surreal fantasy, evoking a sense of gravity-defying chaos and erotic vulnerability.",
