          "id": "krea2-97df272362b4893491aaaa8f",
          "alias": "单女黑外套媚态坐脱衣（2）",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a smooth, dark reflective floor, leaning forward with her right leg bent and raised, knee close to her chest, left leg stretched out naturally — a pose that is elegantly relaxed yet exudes confident sensuality. Her long, jet-black hair falls softly over her shoulders and chest, strands gently brushing her cheek, adding a dreamy, lazy allure. She wears a short black tweed jacket, tailored and open, revealing her bare chest and full breasts; the lapels and cuffs are edged with creamy white lace trim. A V-neck cream silk blouse is left unbuttoned, a matching silk scarf loosely tied at the neck, its folds cascading in graceful lines. She wears a high-waisted mini skirt, clean and sharp. On her feet are cream-colored high leather boots, smooth and shining, hugging her calves with delicate ankle straps. Her right hand rests on her raised knee, fingers long and elegant; her left hand lightly touches her thigh. Flashing crystal tassel earrings catch the light. Her makeup is refined: full red lips, sharp eyeliner, eyes locked on the viewer with a deep, commanding gaze. The background is a pale gray wall with rough texture, a blurred brown shadow cast on it, enhancing depth. Light strikes from the left, creating soft chiaroscuro, highlighting her face, the tweed’s grain, and the silk’s sheen. The floor reflects her image, slightly hazy. Composition is mid-shot, her body diagonally placed, drawing the eye to her face. The atmosphere is elegant, high-fashion, and charged with quiet erotic tension. Colors are black, white, gray, with accents of red lips and silver earrings. The scene feels like a meticulously styled fashion moment, yet retains the warmth of a spontaneous capture.",
