          "id": "krea2-099eb39a0fa5700352843182",
          "alias": "单女露胸短裙市场微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless at a vibrant outdoor drink stall, her gradient strapless mini skirt pooled around her waist, revealing her bare breasts and toned body. The skirt blends blue-green top into orange-red bottom, tied with a matching ribbon at her hip. Her long brown hair falls naturally, a soft smile on her lips as she gazes directly at the camera with confident, inviting eyes. Her left hand rests lightly on the wooden counter, right hand hangs casually, silver metallic stiletto heels adding a sleek touch. The ground is gray stone tiles with patches of grass and scattered leaves. The counter is thick raw wood with visible grain and knots, a yellow lemon slice sticker on the front, plus star and glitter decals. Behind her, a bright yellow shipping container serves as the drink booth, LED strips glowing along the top. A large Korean sign \"효민 시원\" in 3D yellow letters with red shadow hangs above, flanked by orange stars and green cloud cartoon shapes. The back wall is vivid yellow with white polka dots, menu posters advertising drinks at 5,000 won, featuring cartoon characters and bottle designs. On the counter, transparent glass and plastic bottles with yellow labels and black pumps sit alongside cups, straws, and mixing tools. To the right, a worker in a yellow T-shirt wears a black face-filter mask, standing at another wooden counter with \"COUN\" printed on it, next to a mineral water bottle and clutter. A second worker is faintly visible on the left. The sky is light blue with thin clouds, natural sunlight from the upper right casting soft shadows and bright highlights, warm and luminous. The composition is centered slightly left, standard wide angle, making the woman the clear focal point against the strong color contrast of yellow stall and blue sky. The image style blends realistic photography with slight post-processing, feeling like a candid yet polished shot from a summer market or music festival, rich in detail from her skin to every item in the environment, exuding vibrant urban street culture and sensual appeal.",
