          "prompt": "A young woman in a deep blue silk sleeveless cheongsam, the dress fitted with a high collar, side slit rising to mid-thigh, revealing her smooth leg and the curve of her hip, topless beneath the open front, her breasts partially exposed, one hand lightly holding a folded cream fan inscribed with black calligraphy \"风起云涌\" and a red seal, the fan slightly worn, the other hand resting on her thigh, her glossy wavy hair cascading over her shoulders, a few strands falling across her forehead, delicate makeup, light lip color, her eyes gazing softly at the camera with a hint of invitation. She leans sideways against a pale grey wall, the fabric of the cheongsam clinging to her body, the slit opening higher as she shifts her weight. Beside her leans a blue-and-white pipa, its strings visible; on the left floor sits a small ceramic vase with dry branches and tiny green buds, all on a light brown woven mat. The scene is indoors with plain grey walls, soft lighting from the front left, cast shadows, warm and intimate atmosphere. Centered composition with the woman slightly right, the fan extending diagonally, the pipa and vase balancing the frame. Color palette of deep blue, cream, grey-white, with hints of green. High detail, naturalistic texture, as if a professional photograph, evocative of traditional Chinese elegance but with a sensual, modern twist.",
