          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the center of a hotel corridor, wearing a vibrant red leather cropped jacket with fluffy collar and cuffs, unzipped and open to reveal her bare chest and nipples, paired with a matching puffy mini skirt and thigh-high black boots. The jacket features lace-up hollow ties at the waist, emphasizing her curves. She holds a purple plaid handbag with silver sequin tassels. Her shoulder-length wavy hair falls naturally, and she smiles confidently back at the camera, eyes bright and self-assured. Her body is slightly turned, left hand on the bag, right hand hanging casually, creating an elegant silhouette. The corridor has white doors with gold hinges, light beige textured wallpaper, and warm modern wall sconces. A small marble-top side table with a round convex mirror in a silver frame stands to the right. The deep perspective shows the corridor extending into the distance, with dark blue carpet featuring abstract orange and gray wave patterns. Recessed ceiling lights provide soft, warm illumination. Composition is central with the woman slightly left, leading the eye from her face down along her body to the bag and into the depth. Lighting is warm, highlighting her skin and the glossy leather, with soft shadows. The overall atmosphere blends intimate sensuality with stage-like drama, capturing a confident, independent urban woman in a provocative moment.",
