          "alias": "单女全裸空姐白制服室内媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A blonde female flight attendant sits naked on the edge of a large commercial jet engine intake, her white short-sleeved uniform shirt unbuttoned and open, black skirt removed, leaving her in only black stockings, silver high heels, and a red-and-blue scarf loosely tied around her neck, her work ID badge clipped to her bare chest. She smiles directly at the camera with confident elegance, body slightly leaning back, legs crossed naturally, hands resting lightly on the inner metal of the engine nacelle. The foreground is dominated by the massive engine intake, its smooth silver-gray casing reflecting sharp highlights, with deep black fan blades radiating inward creating strong leading lines toward her. Midground shows part of the aircraft fuselage with white paint and blue lettering, plus a row of round windows. Background is a clear blue sky and tarmac of light gray concrete, slightly rough, with distant outlines of other aviation equipment. Low-angle shot emphasizes the engine's immense size and her dominant presence, strong perspective and depth. Lighting is harsh midday sun from above and front, casting bright highlights on engine walls, her skin and clothing, with sharp shadows on ground and engine interior, creating vivid contrast and tense realism. Color palette is cold: metallic gray, sky blue, white, with the red scarf providing a focal point. Overall style blends documentary realism with artistic composition, as if captured by a high-quality camera with slight film grain and natural noise, highly detailed textures of fabric wrinkles, metal reflections, skin glow, and ground grit. The image exudes power and modern industrial aesthetics, conveying the professional allure of aviation and a sensual harmony between human and machine.",
