        {
          "id": "krea2-0c8f9f5bc5aa53c4c2925089",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙公寓媚态坐",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a black barstool, her short blonde hair with pink highlights tied in a low ponytail, loose curls falling naturally. Her face is sharply defined, with heavy, layered makeup—deep eyeliner and bold red lips emphasize her cold, sultry beauty. She rests her chin on her right hand, fingers lightly touching her lips, eyes locked on the camera with a lazy, confident expression. She wears a vibrant floral print dress—red base with blue, yellow, purple blossoms—one-shoulder, off-shoulder style, with ruffled sleeves and hem. A black leather belt with a heart-shaped metal buckle cinches her waist, adding a retro, edgy touch. White socks and black flat shoes. Her legs are crossed, right over left, knees slightly bent, body angled toward the camera, showing long, toned thighs. The composition is a medium shot, framing her from thighs up, positioned left of center. Background: left side, a heavy black curtain with fine texture; right side, a light gray wall with a red fire extinguisher, a black metal-framed glass cabinet with dim contents inside. Concrete floor with a yellow circular warning sticker featuring black footprint patterns and Korean text. Two wooden chairs and another black padded barstool on the right. The environment feels like a backstage area or studio corner. Lighting: overhead diffused top light, slightly front and above, casting soft shadows beneath and behind her, revealing facial and clothing details with natural, realistic shading. Atmosphere: quiet, intimate, with a candid behind-the-scenes feel. Color palette dominated by black and gray, the bright floral dress becoming the visual focal point, creating strong contrast. The composition is stable and balanced, placing her near the golden ratio, drawing the eye to her face and clothing details. The overall style is a lifelike, documentary yet artistic image, as if shot with a professional camera in natural light, preserving the raw texture of the scene and the subject's genuine state—powerfully evocative and story-rich.",
