          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a giant inflatable yellow rubber duck float, wearing a skimpy black one-piece swimsuit with a white collar, the fabric clinging wetly to her curves. Her dark brown hair is damp, strands sticking to her forehead and cheeks, adding a lazy, sensual vibe. She flashes a bright, flirtatious smile, teeth white, eyes sparkling with playful energy, looking directly at the camera with her chin resting in her hands, body slightly leaned forward. Her skin is sun-kissed and glistening with water droplets, suggesting she just climbed out of the pool. The massive yellow duck float dominates the left foreground, its glossy surface reflecting light, with a big black cartoon eye and orange beak. She sits at the center-right, legs bent and together, feet dangling over the edge. The pool water is crystal clear blue, rippling with light patterns, surrounded by gray stone coping. In the background, a white circular water feature cascades a fine curtain of water into the pool, creating a cool, refreshing atmosphere. The distant view shows pale gravel and blurry building outlines, evoking an indoor water park or resort pool. The composition is a low-angle close-up mixing foreground and midground, with the duck and woman as focal points. Vibrant colors: yellow, blue, and healthy skin tones. Soft, diffused overhead lighting with gentle shadows. Slight camera tilt and subtle vignette give a candid, amateur home video feel, as if captured on a phone. The overall mood is carefree, sensual summer fun, with a natural, intimate vibe.",
