          "alias": "单女半褪黑旗袍门媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a doorway, wearing a black cheongsam with gold floral patterns, the high-neck design slipping off one shoulder to fully expose her bare breast, while the other side remains wrapped, creating an asymmetrical sensual look. The dress clings to her curves, with a thigh-high slit revealing smooth, long legs. Her dark hair is pulled into a low ponytail, makeup sharp with thick lashes and defined eyes, skin glowing. In her right hand she holds a stack of red envelopes, left hand relaxed at her side, nails painted black and white, a delicate gold bracelet on her wrist. Behind her, a white door is adorned with red spring couplets in gold characters reading “Wan Shi Ru Yi” and “Hao Yun Chang Lai.” Soft light from the front-left illuminates her face and body, no harsh shadows. Medium shot, she stands slightly off-center, head turned to camera, gaze confident and warm. The color palette is red, black, and gold, blending traditional Chinese New Year festivity with overt eroticism, captured in a natural, home-like photographic style that feels both intimate and celebratory.",
