        {
          "id": "krea2-7de47a1926e77a21211ce94d",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤床戏谑跪过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman kneels on an off-white bed, her back to the camera, dense dark brown curls cascading over her shoulders and back. She wears a black lace-trimmed thin-strap camisole and dark gray high-waist jeans with classic double-stitched back pockets, the legs slightly loose. Pure white short socks cover her feet, which are together and turned slightly inward, a silver bracelet circling her right ankle. Her body leans forward slightly, left hand resting on the bed’s edge, right hand in front, striking a lazy yet teasing pose. The composition is low-angle, from slightly left of center, emphasizing the curve of her hips and the line of her body. The background is a simple interior: a pale sage-green wall with subtle texture, a white ceiling with a visible horizontal pipe or cable track; in the left corner, a clear glass vase holds dried baby's breath, adding a lived-in touch. The bed is neat with an off-white sheet, soft creases at the edge, and a stack of white pillows with lace-trimmed cases, looking plush and warm. The floor is light brown wood with distinct grain. The light is soft and even, coming from the left—natural light or a softbox—casting subtle shadows that contour her back, legs, and the bed, creating quiet contrast. The palette is neutral: off-white, light gray, dark gray, black—low saturation and low contrast with a vintage film feel. A slight grain and motion blur mimic an amateur snapshot, as if taken with a phone or compact camera. Composition allows plenty of negative space, drawing focus to her back and posture, the interplay of body curves, fabric textures, and light defining the scene. The atmosphere is calm, private, real, and full of everyday intimacy—a captured moment that feels both artistic and casual, charged with subtle emotion and story.",
