          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a Hong Kong street, her face delicately made up with twin bun hairstyles—brown locks twisted into cute buns with a few loose strands falling naturally, adding a carefree vibe. She wears an oversized gray long-sleeved hoodie with black lettering \"I ❤️ MY SWEET HOME\" and a red heart print, the hem loosely tucked into a blue denim pleated mini skirt adorned with a silver heart-shaped metal chain belt, giving a playful retro edge. Her left hand rests on a yellow streetlamp pole, fingers long with pale pink nail polish; her right hand holds a red handbag with a red-and-white plush toy dangling from it. A thin chain necklace with a small pendant highlights her collarbone, and a delicate butterfly tattoo is visible on her left shoulder. She gazes directly at the camera with clear, confident eyes, a slight upward curve of her lips exuding warmth and calm. The subject is positioned in the foreground, slightly right of center, commanding visual focus. The background is a typical Hong Kong street scene with towering buildings blending modern and traditional elements: a \"G住好O D盐\" shop sign visible on the left, a green trash bin, traffic signs, pedestrian railings, a red car parked at the curb, and air conditioning units and windows on buildings. The midground shows depth with pedestrians walking in the distance, while the yellow lamppost cuts through the frame from right to bottom, guiding the eye and enhancing spatial layers. The sky is grayish-white with soft, diffused natural light—overcast or early evening. Shadows are gentle, with even light on her face. The color palette features grays, blues, and yellows, accented with red and green, creating a harmonious urban feel. The image has a casual real-life snapshot aesthetic, slightly grainy with motion blur, simulating a real camera phone shot. The background is blurred just enough to keep her as the focus while preserving the environment. The composition is tight yet balanced, 