        {
          "id": "krea2-6029be50d4afa6f29bc9263d",
          "alias": "单女橙衬衫媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits bare on warm wooden floorboards, her body leaning forward with legs crossed and tucked beneath her, one hand braced on the floor beside her hip while the other rests on her thigh. She wears an unbuttoned sheer orange long-sleeve shirt, fabric so thin it does nothing to hide the swell of her breasts and the hard nipples beneath, the shirt hanging open to reveal her collarbone, neck, and the curve of one exposed breast. Her hair is pulled into a loose high ponytail, strands falling across her forehead and cheek as she looks directly into the lens, lips parted in a soft, sensual pout. Her expression is lazy, teasing, with a hint of playful shyness. In the foreground, her body dominates the left-center of the frame; to the right sits a black monitor with a white keyboard, the screen dark, and beside it a stack of upright books with white, gray, and blue spines, edges slightly worn. The floor is pale honey-brown wood with visible grain, and a black dome lamp overhead casts a warm golden light from the upper right, illuminating her face, neck, and the exposed side of her breast, leaving soft shadows across her skin and the floor. In the midground behind her, a large canvas on a simple wooden easel leans against the wall – a vivid sunflower painting in thick yellow and ochre strokes against a green-blue background, reminiscent of Van Gogh. The wall is light beige with slight texture; the right edge shows the outline of a doorframe. The camera is close-up, eye-level, focusing on her direct gaze and the subtle tension in her hand and arm, the sheer fabric clinging to her skin. The lighting casts a side glow, enhancing the curves of her shoulders and the soft shadow under her breast, the overall tone warm orange, cream, and brown with cool green and black accents. The image feels intimate, candid, like a private moment captured on a phone or amateur camera, with slight grain, natural skin texture, fabric creases, and wood grain all visible – a cozy, quiet, artful domestic scene with a distinctly sensual edge.",
