        {
          "id": "krea2-ee7e4c3be707f820caded641",
          "alias": "单女精灵短裙竹林微笑坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an elaborate ancient-style cosplay sits on a classic wooden bench, her deep brown hair cut in blunt bangs and adorned with red tassel hair ornaments and gold accents. Her slightly pointed ears give her an elven look, and she wears a gentle, warm smile, her bright eyes gazing directly at the viewer with an elegant yet playful allure. Her costume is intricate and opulent, dominated by white, black, and gold, with complex gold metal fixtures on her shoulders and chest, a red ribbon at the collar, and sheer translucent sleeves that reveal the contours of her arms. A wide black belt embroidered with gold patterns cinches her waist, and her skirt consists of multiple layers of light white tulle, flowing and ethereal. She wears gradient stockings that transition from white at the thigh to vivid red at the ankle, paired with black high heels. Her right hand is covered in a red glove, while her left hand rests naturally. She sits sideways with an elegant posture, legs crossed—right leg forward, left leg back—her body leaning slightly forward, creating an intimate and relaxed atmosphere. A few small purple flowers are scattered in the foreground, adding a romantic touch. The floor is smooth dark material, reflecting the figure and surroundings like a mirror. In the background, a massive circular moon installation with a textured surface glows with a hazy moonlight quality. Bamboo and wooden lattice structures flank the moon, with faint smoke drifting on the right side, crafting a dreamy scene. The composition is centrally symmetrical, with the figure positioned slightly below center, emphasizing her presence, while the moon dominates the upper space as a visual focal point. Soft front lighting from a diffused source evenly illuminates her face and costume details, casting delicate shadows on the floor and fabric, enhancing depth and dimension. Light produces subtle sheen on silk, metal, and skin, amplifying texture. The overall atmosphere merges Eastern classical aesthetics with modern fantasy, evoking a serene, poetic nighttime courtyard with a strong anime influence. The palette is primarily black, white, red, and gold, accented by purple flowers, creating a vibrant yet harmonious contrast. The composition is rich but uncrowded, with clear layers from the foreground petals and floor reflections to the midground figure and bench, then to the background moon and bamboo, building a strong spatial depth. The figure's pose and gaze direct the viewer's attention, while the moon's circular shape frames and focuses the scene. The entire image resembles a meticulously crafted illustration, blending artistic beauty with cosplay realism, conveying intense visual impact and emotional resonance, as if capturing a fleeting dream that immerses the viewer completely.",
