          "alias": "单女全裸短裙森林媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young nude woman sits on a forest path carpeted with golden ginkgo leaves, her body partially wrapped in deep brown traditional Hanfu fabric, her breasts fully exposed, one hand delicately holding a bright ginkgo leaf that partially obscures one eye as she gazes sensually into the camera with a soft, inviting smile. Her long black hair flows naturally in the breeze, the Hanfu's wide sleeves and skirt pooling around her in soft folds with subtle dark patterns. Warm autumn sunlight filters through bamboo and trees, casting dappled shadows across her skin and the leaves. She leans forward slightly, hands resting on her knees, posture elegant yet relaxed. The foreground features scattered dry leaves, rough gray stones, and a gnarled piece of wood. Background is a blurred green depth of tall bamboo and tree trunks. Slight overhead angle, natural lighting, warm yellow and brown tones with hints of green and gray. The composition is centered but intimate, capturing a real, unposed moment with soft focus on the subject and a poetic, Eastern aesthetic.",
