          "alias": "单女露胸护士护士服室内微笑侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a revealing Lolita nurse outfit poses against a rough concrete wall, slightly turned with her body angled toward the camera, head tilted, gentle smile, eyes locked on the viewer. She is topless with bare breasts, nipples visible, wearing only a white nurse cap adorned with a red cross and lace trim, her black hair in twin tails tied with red bows. A short white lace skirt with a fluffy hem, red heart-shaped buttons at the waist, a \"LARMA\" embroidery just above her exposed cleavage, pale yellow puff sleeves, white lace gloves, pink wrist accessories. She holds a scroll wrapped in white lace tied with a red ribbon, like a ritual prop. Red thigh-high stockings with white lace patterns and cross-strap details, black chunky Mary Janes with metal buckles and heart charms. Full body shot centered against the textured gray concrete wall with irregular holes and industrial grit. Soft natural front lighting, minimal shadows, crisp details on fabric and skin. Red-and-white palette with gray backdrop, creating a sweet-goth aesthetic. Amateur camera realism, as if casually captured indoors, but artfully composed. The scene is still, narrative, and sensual.",
