          "alias": "单女露胸黑西装媚态站立交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a sleek commercial event backdrop, her black suit jacket loosely open to reveal a sheer mesh crop top that barely contains her bare breasts, nipples visible through the fabric. She wears high-waist shorts that hug her hips, showcasing long, toned legs. Her blonde hair is tied back, with loose strands brushing her cheek, makeup flawless, eyes confident and sultry as she gazes at the camera. One hand rests on her chest, fingers slightly brushing the sheer mesh, a simple ring glinting. Her body angles slightly, legs crossed, creating an elegant curve. The foreground features a light wood display table emblazoned with “shu uemura” and “shu sento” logos, plus “NO.1 底妝霸主” text, beside giant product models of “shu uemura unlimited” and “shu uemura unlimited care”, accented by red hearts and blue-white check patterns. The composition is symmetrical, with the woman centered. The background is an indoor event space with frosted glass walls diffusing warm light, recessed spotlights casting a soft glow that highlights her skin’s dewy texture and the fabric details. Color palette is black, white, beige with pink, red, blue accents. The overall feel is modern, professional yet sexually charged, as if captured candidly with a handheld camera, slight grain and motion blur adding realism.",
