        {
          "id": "krea2-97842049259bc027c2649940",
          "alias": "单女白外套室内媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a warm indoor setting, wearing a fluffy off-white faux fur coat that is unbuttoned and hanging open, revealing her bare chest and perky nipples, the soft fur texture creating delicate shadows where the fabric falls. She rests her chin on her hands, fingers slightly curled, gaze seductive and playful, lips parted in a subtle smirk, skin glowing with a natural dewy finish. Her makeup is refined with a faint shimmer on the eyelids and soft pink lipstick. Her hair is piled up in a messy bun, with wispy light brown bangs falling across her forehead, small stud earrings catching the light. In one hand she holds two red-and-white candy canes with \"RAVE\" printed on the wrappers, the other hand lightly gripping the base of one cane, fingers trailing down suggestively. In the foreground, a transparent glass bowl is filled with more candy canes, some unwrapped, the edges reflecting warm light. Behind her, a heavy crimson velvet curtain with vertical folds creates dramatic depth and contrast. A white cardboard box edge peeks from the right side. The composition is a close-up portrait, her head slightly tilted, eyes locking with the viewer, guiding the gaze from her face to the candy canes and down to the bowl. Soft light comes from the front right, illuminating her face and upper body, casting subtle shadows on the fur coat, enhancing the texture. The scene feels festive, intimate, and warmly sensual, with a high-end commercial photography quality, perfect for a sensual holiday campaign or social media.",
