g in a harmonious look. The scene has a strong Japanese everyday-life aesthetic, presenting a realistic and story-rich captured moment, as if taken by an amateur camera with slight grain and film texture. A mild defocus enhances realism. The setting is a normal but lived-in home environment, rich in details: curtain folds, table grain, fabric draping. The overall atmosphere is quiet, healing, and full of everyday poetry, evoking a simple, beautiful slice of life.",
