        {
          "id": "krea2-ff5c9962f5c1f9bf70cf7524",
          "alias": "单女黑连体衣舞台媚态倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman in a sheer black lace bodysuit leans sideways on a dark gray velvet sofa, her long black hair spilling over her shoulders and across her bare neck and chest, strands catching the light with natural gloss and texture, some falling in soft shadows to enhance the mystery. She tilts her head downward, eyes half-lidded, lips slightly parted, wearing a lazy, seductive expression. Her makeup is polished: sharp black eyeliner, long curled lashes, full crimson lips, porcelain skin glowing under dim light. Her body language is elegantly relaxed—left arm resting on the sofa back, right leg bent with toe pointed, clad in black stilettos with metallic accents, revealing long, shapely legs. The lace pattern is an intricate floral and vine design covering her entire body, semi-transparent, giving glimpses of her skin and the outline of her curves, her nipples faintly visible through the fabric. The sofa foreground shows rich fabric texture with seams and stitching, emphasizing its softness. The subject is centered slightly to the right, body forming an S-curve—narrow waist, gentle curve of her buttocks—creating a perfect silhouette. The background is a light gray-white wall with vertical paneling, simple and modern, splashed with red light patches that fade from deep crimson to soft pink, irregular and blurred like stage lighting, adding a dreamy, intimate vibe. Warm red light strikes from the left, illuminating the right side of her body and hair, casting soft shadows on the wall and sofa. The composition is diagonal from lower left to upper right, with a slight high-angle view, drawing attention to her pose and the intricate lace details. The lighting is soft yet layered, with strong chiaroscuro, blending intimacy with subtle drama. The color palette is dominated by black, gray, and warm red accents, heightening visual impact. The scene feels like a still from a cinematic night sequence—casual yet meticulously composed, with ultra-detailed textures from the lace weave to the velvet grain to the light reflections, exuding high realism and artistic sensuality.",
