          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the compact RV kitchen counter, wearing a tight beige long-sleeve knit top unzipped just enough to reveal a pale blue bikini beneath. Her short cream skirt sits loosely on her hips, slipping aside to expose long bare thighs. She holds her phone high in her right hand, taking a selfie, her head tilted back, eyes locked on the screen. Her left hand rests lightly on the counter edge. Her long black hair falls softly over her shoulders, glossy and smooth. The pose is relaxed but provocative, body slightly arched forward. The counter is white tile with worn edges, a white electric kettle beside her, some scattered utensils. Overhead, exposed wires and ducts, a vintage tungsten bulb casts warm amber light. Wooden cabinets behind, one door ajar. The perspective is slightly low, emphasizing her legs and the curve of her body. Soft shadows and gentle highlights play across her skin and clothing, with subtle grain and imperfect light transitions, giving an intimate, voyeuristic snapshot feel. The scene feels lived-in and authentic, sexy but natural.",
