        {
          "id": "krea2-b3a541c402a02603947e5552",
          "alias": "单女露胸歌手舞台微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young female singer performs passionately on stage, her soft, long, wavy champagne-blonde hair cascading over her shoulders, with some strands gently pinned back to reveal her delicate forehead and elegant neck. Her skin is fair and smooth, makeup refined and layered, with soft pearlescent eyeshadow, thick curled lashes, and bright, clear eyes. A slight smile parts her full lips, revealing neat white teeth, her expression sweet and mesmerizing. She is topless, her bare breasts full and natural, with pale pink nipples visible. She wears only a black mesh choker and a thin pearl bracelet on her wrist. Her hand grips a black microphone close to her lips, while her other hand touches her ear. Her fingernails are painted light pink. She stands naturally relaxed, lost in the music. The background is blurred stage lights in deep blue and purple, creating soft halos and bokeh. Medium shot, subject slightly left of center, focus on her face and upper body. Lighting from front and above, warm tones with natural shadows. Saturated, detailed, with a professional yet candid concert photography style.",
