        {
          "id": "krea2-298ae8c88a4033b3b5905473",
          "alias": "单女露胸灰毛衣商店害羞站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a convenience store snack shelf, her blunt bangs and shoulder-length deep brown hair falling softly. Her fair skin glows, cheeks flushed with a faint pink blush; her eyes are clear yet lazy, staring directly into the lens with a subtle, teasing smirk. She wears a gray V-neck knit cardigan unbuttoned, revealing her bare breasts and a hint of erect nipples against the pale skin. One hand loosely holds a white-lidded coffee cup, the other carries a light yellow leather handbag with metal chain accents and \"FOFO\" print. Her body tilts slightly, side-on, giving a casual yet elegant stance—topless and sensual. In the foreground, her face and exposed chest dominate, with the drink and bag visible. The midground shows densely packed snack shelves: colorful Japanese wrappers—grape gummy candy, Kumamon salt chips, Doraemon cookies, matcha chocolate, plum jelly—with price tags at 16, 25, 18 yuan. The background stretches into more aisles and store interior, pale gray tiles reflecting soft light. The overhead cool white light creates even illumination with subtle shadow transitions for depth. Composition: close-up portrait on the lower right, facing camera, with shelves diagonally from upper left to mid-frame, guiding the eye into depth. Warm packaging (yellow, orange, red, green) contrasts against cool gray-white surroundings. The atmosphere is everyday, candid—like a handheld phone snapshot with slight noise and lens distortion. Lighting highlights her face and bare chest, background softly blurred to emphasize the subject. The overall aesthetic is youthful, sweet, healing urban life, steeped in social media shareability—a casually perfect shopping moment.",
