        {
          "id": "krea2-57febedfe9985e48a38b412f",
          "alias": "单女全裸红连衣裙镜前忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits nude before a mirror, her red-and-white retro dress discarded, leaving her bare skin exposed. She wears a wide-brimmed red cowboy hat with reflective stripes and white stitching, black buttons accenting the brim. Her blonde hair is braided into two thick plaits resting on her chest, ends loose. She sits sideways, legs crossed, knees slightly bent, right hand cradling her cheek, fingers brushing her chin. Her gaze locks on her reflection, expression pensive and melancholic. The mirror captures her face with precise makeup, deep red lips, fair smooth skin. Side lighting casts soft shadows across her face and arm. The dress lies on the black surface beside her, white with red stars and a blue belt, red straps. Background: light gray tiled wall, white column corner, dark flooring reflecting faint light. Close-up composition, diagonal framing, body and mirror image creating symmetric/asymmetric tension. Slightly tilted lens for instability and dynamic feel. Foreground: body and hand details; midground: face and reflection; background: blurred wall and column. Strong left lighting, high contrast, highlights on face, hand, and hat edge; shadows on right side and back wall. Intimate, quiet, slightly theatrical, like a moment before a shoot. Red dominates, with white, blue, gray; saturated but natural, film-like with grain, simulating 35mm camera, slow shutter creating slight motion blur. 85mm focal length, shallow depth of field, focus on face and hand, vignette for nostalgia. Authentic and artistic, like an unretouched snapshot of an ordinary yet emotional moment. Light and shadow nuanced, rich layers, natural pose, introspective mood. No distractions, all focus on subject-mirror interaction, generating intimate yet detached tension. Warm tones, not harsh, red providing visual impact, contrasted with white and blue for rhythm. Retro, fashion, and daily life blend, strong personal narrative, as if hearing her inner whisper, feeling that silent contemplation.",
