        {
          "id": "krea2-5bd759d96989cb28d029440a",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔街道俏皮站立喝",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long, sleek black hair cascading over her shoulders, fair and flawless skin, delicate facial features, and a soft, slightly lazy gaze stands in a beautifully decorated indoor space. She turns her body slightly, glancing back at the camera with a calm yet playful expression, her lips slightly pursed. Her right shoulder holds a beige suede vintage handbag with smooth lines, metal clasps, and a brand plaque, the strap slung casually across her shoulder. She wears a black backless top that bares her left shoulder and reveals a delicate tattoo on her back, paired with tight dark blue high-waisted jeans that hug her curves. Her right hand lightly touches the fur trim on her shoulder in a relaxed, unconscious gesture. In the foreground stands a decorated Christmas tree with white fairy lights glowing warmly, red berries, pinecones, and cute plush toys—a yellow bear and a white animal. Behind the tree, a white wall holds a simple round clock showing 10:10, with a glass door revealing a street view. In the midground, a café interior with wooden tables, potted plants, a round mirror reflecting the woman's back and surroundings, and a vintage wooden speaker beside a white pot with trailing greenery. A large window on the right shows a night cityscape with blue neon lights casting hazy reflections; a golden chandelier with radiating shades emits warm yellow light, complementing the interior lighting. The warm golden tones contrast with the cool blue night, the composition centered slightly left with the Christmas tree as a visual guide, the mirror adding depth, and a slight low angle emphasizing her stature. The overall atmosphere is romantic and festive, with rich details and a realistic, professional photo quality.",
