        {
          "id": "krea2-faefe1f79682ea68d0074c77",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙椅上冷淡坐喝",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a wooden chair in front of a black backdrop, wearing a vibrant one-shoulder floral-print dress with a red base and blue, yellow, and green flowers. The asymmetrical ruffle-cut design features layered ruffles on the sleeve and hem, catching light and shadow. A black leather belt with a heart-shaped metal buckle cinches her waist, adding vintage detail. Her soft pink-blonde hair is slightly messy, falling over her shoulders. Her makeup is natural yet polished, with red lips slightly parted, eyes locking onto the camera with a lazy, confident gaze. She lounges sideways against the chair, left arm relaxed, right arm slightly raised, body tilted for a casual yet elegant dynamic. In the foreground, part of a black metal stand and backdrop edge show subtle wrinkles and reflections. The background includes a simple gray wall with a red fire extinguisher, a small black metal table with a glass top holding some equipment, and a black stool in the corner. The floor is light gray concrete with a yellow circular warning sign featuring black footprints and Korean text. The scene feels like a backstage or prep area, realistic and everyday. Medium shot, subject slightly left, leaving right space for environmental details. Visual flow from her face down her body to the waist and dress hem, then to background objects. Lighting from front-left, soft and even, casting gentle shadows with low contrast, creating a warm, cozy indoor atmosphere. The bright colors of her dress dominate, contrasting with the cool black and gray background, highlighting her vitality and personality. Strong documentary feel, as if captured spontaneously with a portable camera, slight grain and natural noise, mimicking amateur gear. Overall style blends everyday life, fashion, and artistic flair.",
