          "prompt": "A young woman stands on the stone bridge over the Dotonbori Canal in Osaka, Japan, wearing a black down jacket unzipped to expose her bare chest, her long hair flowing over her shoulders. She looks back over her shoulder at the camera with a sultry smile, her right hand holding a Canon DSLR aimed forward, the camera lens catching the golden hour light. Her left hand rests lightly on her chest, fingers long with dark nail polish, her pose relaxed and playful. The composition places her on the right third of the frame, leaving the left side open to show the canal lined with vibrant Japanese signage—\"白木屋\", \"大牧場\", \"文化堂\"—and colorful cartoon logos. The wide canal reflects the warm sunset sky and buildings. A few small boats drift on the rippling water. The sunset sky shades from pale blue to gold, casting a soft, warm backlight that outlines her silhouette and highlights her bare skin. The gray stone railing runs across the bottom, its rough texture contrasting with the smooth nylon of her jacket. The overall mood is candid and nostalgic, like a casual street snap, with natural light from behind-left illuminating her face, making her eyes bright. The scene combines urban energy with intimate sensuality, drawing the eye from her body along the canal to the fading sunset.",
