          "prompt": "A young woman poses in the open red doorway of a fast food restaurant, topless except for a black-and-white striped apron loosely tied around her waist, a black cap perched on her head, and a dark braid falling over one shoulder. She flashes a confident, playful smile as she lifts her hands, fingers pointing back at the white sign above her featuring the red burger icon and \"BURGERRY\" logo. The bright red door behind her is glossy and warm, with a white promotional poster stuck above it. To the left, a pale pink wall holds a blurred food photo; the lower right corner reveals red-and-white diamond tile, and the floor is dark gray rough-textured tiles reflecting faint light. An orange-red plastic chair with a curved back sits at the lower right, complementing the color scheme. She stands slightly off-center, body angled for dynamic composition, shot from a high angle that draws attention to her bare chest and the brand signage. Warm yellow indoor lighting spills evenly across the scene, casting soft natural shadows that highlight her facial expression and the fabric of the apron. The overall palette is red, black, white, and orange, with vibrant contrast and a candid, almost phone-snapshot feel—slight grain and realistic light transitions adding authenticity. The composition is tight, focusing on her and the brand, with background details enriching the scene without clutter, conveying a cheerful, teasing work ambiance and brand identity.",
