        {
          "id": "krea2-980790d5246dd60dcaac7510",
          "alias": "单女空姐蓝制服机场媚态倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young female flight attendant in a deep blue uniform jacket, unbuttoned to reveal a sheer white blouse pulled aside, baring her breasts and erect nipples, black stockings hugging her thighs, black high heels, her blonde hair pinned up elegantly, her face delicate with soft makeup, eyes locked on the camera with a seductive gaze, lips parted in a welcoming smile, right hand raised in a gentle wave, body leaning slightly forward, posture poised and inviting. The uniform features yellow stripe trim and a name tag, a scarf with airline insignia loosely tied at her neck, metallic badge and necklace glinting at her exposed chest. In the foreground, a wooden luggage rack holds an open black suitcase, revealing clothing, a makeup bag, and pens; beside it hang yellow hangers, a pair of beige slippers discarded on the floor. Midground shows a hotel room interior: light brown wood floor clean, off-white walls, wooden partition and sconce on the left, a dark gray door on the right with a note, silver handle, electronic lock, and security camera above. Part of a bed edge visible with fluffy white sheets. Ceiling has recessed lights and vents, soft brightness. Composition centers the woman slightly left, drawing focus with her pose and eye contact, creating an easy sensual atmosphere. Warm overhead lighting, even shadows, color palette of blue, white, brown, rich details, a candid moment in an airport hotel or lounge, feeling of real life and intimacy, as if captured with a casual digital camera, full of story and allure.",
