        {
          "id": "krea2-73b62c0645370aa602d29b7a",
          "alias": "单女全裸高跟鞋庭院微笑蹲注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman squats on the cement floor of an outdoor courtyard, her long black hair cascading over her bare shoulders. She wears only a pair of deep red Mary Jane shoes, strapped at the ankles, her body completely nude except for those vintage heels. She turns slightly toward the camera, a playful smile on her face, eyes half-closed, cheeks flushed with a soft blush. Her right hand gently strokes a lazy tabby cat lying beside her, its brown and black striped fur relaxed, paws stretched out, tail curled, gazing calmly to the side. In front of her rests an old wooden bench with a beige canvas tote bag, its metal flower-shaped clasp catching the light. The background is a wall tiled in white, lush green plants including large Monstera leaves, spider plants, and variegated pothos, some vines climbing the wall. To the right, an open white shutter with peeling paint reveals an interior view: an old electric fan, wooden furniture, and small decorations. Soft natural light streams from the upper left, casting warm, gentle shadows across the scene. The composition places the woman at the lower left, the cat at the lower right, creating visual balance. The foreground shows the ground and some foliage, the middle ground holds the woman, cat, and bench, while the wall, window, and interior form the background. The lighting is diffused, realistic, with subtle film grain and tactile details. Colors are dominated by green, white, brown, and beige, with the red shoes as accent. The atmosphere is intimate, serene, capturing a candid moment of human-animal interaction in a quiet urban corner.",
