        {
          "id": "krea2-319d2b7b7a160e78b8949243",
          "alias": "单女全裸金高跟鞋广场媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands sensually at the corner of an indoor corridor, completely nude except for a pair of golden high heels, her hand gently touching her cheek, the other hand resting on her hip, fingers curled, lazy confident gaze directly into the camera, lips slightly parted, exuding a retro and captivating aura. Her long deep brown hair falls naturally, strands blown by a gentle breeze. The subject is positioned center-right, full body visible. Background: a light beige textured wall with four gold-framed vintage fashion design sketches, symmetrically arranged. On the right, a small white cabinet holds a glass dome with a white candle, its soft glow illuminating the scene. Below, dark wood structure and metal mesh vent. To the far right, a gray coat hangs over a gold metal rack, with plaid fabric draping down. The floor features white tiles with gold square patterns, creating a classic geometric design. The composition is vertical, with the subject slightly right, framed by a dark wooden door on the left, enhancing depth. The atmosphere is warm and intimate, with indoor warm yellow light softly highlighting her skin, emphasizing curves and natural shadows. The candle adds a faint romantic glow. The color palette is warm yellow, beige, black, and gold, creating a retro cinematic feel, as if captured in a high-end hotel or private residence. The scene is artistic, like a carefully shot fashion photograph, yet retains a sense of everyday reality and intimacy, full of elegance and nostalgia. Details are rich and layered, composition precise, visual flow from her eyes to hand movements to background decor, smooth and captivating. The lighting is delicate, ambiance rich, presenting a refined yet relaxed aesthetic.",
