        {
          "id": "krea2-2666c4820f735a103d26c374",
          "alias": "单女全裸蓝短裤舞台俏皮站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands backstage in front of a metal equipment case, her long blue-black hair cascading over her shoulders, partly tied up to reveal a delicate face and elegant neck. Her sharp features are focused on the camera with a playful smirk, radiating youthful confidence. She wears only a pair of high-waisted metallic blue pleated mini shorts with multiple pockets, zippers, and rivets, her bare torso exposed—a pink bunny-shaped badge pinned just above her left breast, a small black heart decal on her spine, and a thin chain necklace around her neck. She wears a professional headset microphone with a black wire curving from her ear to her mouth, multiple exaggerated black earrings, and a ring on her right ring finger. Her left hand rests lightly on the black equipment case behind her, right elbow propped on the box, body slightly tilted in a relaxed yet elegant pose. The backstage environment features off-white walls, a row of diamond-tread metal plates at the base, two large black transport cases with yellow warning stripes and “2x LG” plus red “3” markings, and a scratched stainless steel cabinet on the right reflecting blurred surroundings. Soft, front-facing lighting creates even illumination, highlighting her facial details and bare skin, with subtle shadows and cool tones emphasizing the metallic blue shorts against the gray walls. Mid-shot composition, subject centered-left, diagonal lines leading from bottom-left to top-right, layered foreground (equipment case), middle ground (her nude torso), background (backstage). The atmosphere is calm and professional, like a candid phone snapshot capturing an idol’s private pre-show moment—blending high-fashion stage styling with raw, everyday realism.",
