        {
          "id": "krea2-7fc0bc4a9224d83b20b96714",
          "alias": "单女黑制服公寓媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "In the spacious, brightly lit cabin of a commercial airliner, a flight attendant in a black uniform sits elegantly on a seat in the center aisle. Her long blonde hair cascades naturally, and she turns her head slightly toward the camera, her gaze confident and seductive. One hand caresses her hair while the other rests casually on her thigh, her pose relaxed yet provocative. She wears a fitted black short-sleeved uniform top, unbuttoned at the top to reveal a hint of cleavage, with blue trim at the collar adding a professional touch. Her legs are crossed, and she wears black flat shoes with a simple metal anklet. She sits slightly left of center, becoming the visual focal point. Surrounding her are orderly rows of gray aviation seats with soft fabric, delicate stitching, and curved backrests and headrests, creating a strong sense of depth and repetition. The overhead bins are closed, and the white ceiling features evenly spaced LED strips emitting warm white light that illuminates the cabin cleanly and modernly. Window frames are visible, with faint natural light streaming in from outside, hinting at the flight's real-time status. A few black carry-on bags rest on the right overhead bin, adding realistic detail. The composition is classic symmetrical perspective, with the aisle as the central axis, leading the eye deep into the cabin. The foreground seats are sharp, the midground focuses on the subject, and the background gradually blurs for natural depth of field. Lighting comes primarily from the overhead LEDs, soft and uniform with no harsh shadows, but subtle highlights on the figure accentuate her curves and texture. Cool-toned reflections from the window light create a contrast with the warm interior, evoking a calm, slightly mysterious atmosphere. The overall scene captures a casual yet story-driven moment, like a mid-flight pause filled with relaxed sensuality. The image feels like a documentary-style shot from a mid-range consumer camera, with realistic grain, natural color saturation, and slight dynamic range limitations, enhancing the live feel. The color palette is dominated by gray, black, and white, accented with blue and gold, visually harmonious yet tense. The composition is rigorous, elements well-placed, conveying a unique blend of tranquility, professionalism, and personal allure.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
