        {
          "id": "krea2-ca08f587c2d377861c7c335b",
          "alias": "单女半褪白衬衫沙发媚态倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges on a black leather sofa, her loose white long-sleeve shirt unbuttoned and slipping off one shoulder, exposing the bare curve of her breast and the soft fabric of her white camisole beneath. The shirt's hem drapes across her thighs, partially revealing the smooth skin of her legs. Her dark hair is partially tied back, the rest falling in soft waves that catch the light. Her profile is sharp, eyes fixed on the smartphone in her right hand, its cool blue glow casting delicate shadows across her face. Her left hand rests lightly on the sofa's textured leather, body leaning slightly forward in a relaxed, absorbed posture. The black leather sofa features a crosshatch pattern, rich and tactile. Behind her, a wooden wall in pale brown reveals visible grain, with a row of large glass windows framed in dark metal. Outside, faint greenery and building shapes are visible, while glass reflections layer the indoor lights and her silhouette. A distant pendant lamp casts warm yellow highlights, blending industrial and cozy vibes. The composition is angled, with her body on the left and her gaze leading right—from her face to the phone to the window. Light streams from the right, mixing natural daylight with warm indoor tones, creating soft chiaroscuro on her skin, arms, and open shirt. The palette is dominated by black, white, and gray, with touches of warm yellow and green. The atmosphere is intimate and still, as if capturing a lazy afternoon moment, with a photographic realism that carries slight film grain and natural lens distortion—a poetic blend of the everyday and the erotic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
