          "id": "krea2-e10f33d201069b0d99b60e77",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫广场媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a black leather chair, leaning slightly forward, her long, sleek black hair cascading naturally with a soft sheen under gentle light. She wears a loose white silk blouse with a smooth, slightly wrinkled texture and natural drape; the sleeves are rolled up, revealing her slender arms. The blouse is unbuttoned low, exposing a black leather collar with a metal buckle, accentuating her edgy, icy allure. Her lips are painted vivid red, and she stares directly into the camera with a lazy, confident gaze, her eyes deep and intense. The background features diagonal light brown wood-paneled walls with visible grain, topped by parallel metal strips (possibly a door or trim). To the left, a white wall and a black square power outlet are visible; the floor is dark, matching the chair. The scene is modern and minimalist, captured from a low angle looking up, with the woman dominating the frame. Lighting comes from above right, soft and directional, highlighting her face, shoulders, and hands, casting natural shadows that enhance depth and creating subtle reflections on the silk, emphasizing its texture. The palette is predominantly black and white, with her red lips as the sole pop of color, evoking a mood that blends fashion, sensuality, and urban edge. The image feels like an intimate, storytelling moment shot on a casual camera, with slight grain and a film-like quality, realistic and tightly composed, with a relaxed yet expressive pose and the background tastefully blurred to keep focus on the subject.",
