          "prompt": "A young woman stands by an intricately carved European stone pillar at night, completely nude except for a fluffy light-brown fur collar wrapped loosely around her neck. Her deep brown hair is tied in a high ponytail, strands falling over her bare shoulders. She leans against the pillar, one hand resting on her hip, her expression a mix of shyness and confident allure, lips slightly parted, eyes locked on the camera. The stone pillar features detailed Corinthian acanthus leaf scrolls, topped with classical volutes. Behind her, a towering dark stone castle glows with warm yellow windows. Christmas decorations—golden bells and red ribbons—hang from the pillar’s side. A low gray-green evergreen shrub and cobblestone ground with faint moss complete the scene. Warm side-backlighting from hanging lanterns and interior lights casts soft shadows, accentuating her curves and facial features. The night sky is deep ink blue, clear. The overall composition is centered, with the pillar framing her, creating a dreamy yet candid street-photo aesthetic that feels both real and artfully sensual.",
