          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the railing of a baseball stadium, her white Los Angeles Dodgers jacket unzipped and hanging open, revealing her completely bare chest with nipples slightly hardened in the warm light. She wears a white knit crop top pushed up beneath her breasts, and light wash denim shorts that ride low on her hips. Her black hair falls in a straight fringe to her shoulders, side profile turned away, lips curved in a soft, knowing smile. Her hands rest on the metal railing, one wrist wrapped in a blue-white patterned cloth bracelet. The low-angle shot captures her from below, body slightly arched, the open jacket framing her naked torso. In the midground, empty yellow seats and scattered fans occupy the stands; beyond, a green baseball field stretches with red dirt infield, pitcher’s mound, and bases. High stadium lights and a giant electronic scoreboard marked “76” stand against the sky, with Coca-Cola and other billboards visible. Distant mountains and a clear blue sky complete the scene. The sunlight is warm, casting soft shadows across the grass and her skin, highlighting every detail—the sheen on her bare chest, the texture of the jacket fabric, the glint on the railing. The composition draws the eye from her relaxed pose out to the expansive field, evoking a carefree, sensual moment of a fan’s game-day memory.",
