          "alias": "单女半褪连衣裙媚态倚靠",
          "prompt": "A young woman leans seductively against a pale gray wall, her side profile accentuated by deep, flawless features and elaborate makeup—warm brown and gold gradient eyeshadow, thick curled lashes, full crimson lips. Her glossy black hair is woven into a thick braid falling over her left shoulder, crowned with a classical headdress of circular gold plates. She wears a tight, shimmering champagne sequin dress that clings to every curve, but the top has been pulled down to fully expose her large, firm breasts, nipples hard against the fabric edge. The dress is strapless, low-cut, with delicate pleating at the sleeves. Her left hand caresses the wall, long red nails gleaming, while heavy gold bangles stack on her wrist; her right hand hangs loose, a thin gold chain dangling. Behind her, a lavish still-life oil painting in an ornate gold frame shows deep purple and green grapes hanging from vines, a terracotta vase below, the style baroque and textured. Light comes from the front right, casting soft shadows, creating a warm, dramatic atmosphere. She is positioned at the left third of the frame, her head turned slightly toward the camera, eyes locking with the viewer, confident and inviting. The right side of the frame is left open, balancing the composition. The color palette is cream, champagne gold, deep purple, dark green. The image looks like a high-resolution fashion shoot, rich in detail—skin texture, fabric sheen, hair gloss, brushstrokes on the painting—conveying a romantic, retro courtly sensuality mixed with modern eroticism.",
