          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the front row of the basketball arena's audience seats, her long, silky wine-red curls shimmering under the lights, cascading over her bare shoulders and between her full breasts. She wears nothing but a pair of high-waist light blue jeans that sit low on her hips, exposing her toned midriff and the curve of her waist. Her black baseball jacket (Lakers, with yellow stripes, purple \"LAKERS\" and number \"80,\" and a Lakers logo on the left arm) is draped loosely over one shoulder, one hand lightly touching the hood's edge, the other tucked into her pocket. She gazes directly at the camera with a playful, confident smirk, lips glossed in pale pink, makeup fresh and flattering. Her skin is pale and flawless, her eyes bright and clear. Behind her, the indoor basketball court blazes with lights—a giant LED screen displays \"SCAN HERE!\" in white with QR codes and \"FAN CAM\" below. The crowd is a blur of noisy fans, some raising phones, others chatting. The court floor is yellow with white lines; players in red and white jerseys move in the distance. Neon blue and purple lighting bathes the scene, creating a modern, energetic night-game atmosphere. The composition centers her slightly left of center, sharp in focus with a shallow depth of field—the background subtly blurred to emphasize her. The main light comes from overhead spotlights and the LED screen, casting soft shadows to the side and back; the cool blue-purple glow from the screen highlights her hair and jacket, adding a futuristic gloss. The overall palette is cool with warm accents (skin, hair), giving a realistic, slightly grainy film look that feels both artistic and candid.",
