          "alias": "单女半褪白衬衫博物馆微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands indoors in a modern gallery space. Her red-brown hair cascades in soft waves to her shoulders, catching warm light. She has fair, luminous skin, delicate makeup with defined eyes, long lashes, bright gaze, and a tender smile with coral pink lips. She wears a loose white long-sleeve shirt dress, the front unbuttoned halfway to reveal a barely-there lace bralette and the gentle swells of her breasts. The fabric is sheer in places, hinting at her skin beneath. The shirt falls to mid-thigh, with wide, flowing sleeves that slip off one shoulder, exposing her collarbone and upper arm. She holds a dark gray leather handbag with a vivid green interior, the slender strap wrapped around her fingers. Behind her, a wall displays colorful yarn-doll framed pictures and round relief decorations. Soft, even overhead lighting casts natural shadows across her body, emphasizing her curves and the subtle drape of the dress. Medium shot, she stands slightly turned, head angled to the right, eyes locked on the viewer with an inviting, confident expression. The composition balances her figure and the handbag below. The scene feels like a quiet, intimate gallery moment. Realistic amateur look: Canon EOS R5, ISO 400, shutter 1/125s, aperture f/2.8, focal 85mm. Slight grain and natural color shifts enhance the authentic, sensual atmosphere.",
