          "alias": "单女黑外套城市媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "Night falls over the city as a massive futuristic art installation glows in the dark—layer upon layer of white metal frames and grids form a hollow dome filled with cold white LED strips, light spilling through the gaps like scattered stars. Polished stainless steel pillars reflect the surroundings with flowing silver sheen, while blurred high-rise buildings in the background show warm yellow windows, hinting at urban life. In the foreground, dark green artificial turf meets light gray concrete steps. A young woman stands on the steps, wearing a puffy black down jacket unzipped all the way, revealing her bare chest and firm nipples in the cold air. She pairs it with a very short off-white skirt that just covers the tops of her thighs, leaving her long legs exposed. Her feet are clad in high black leather boots with subtle texture and shine. She stands with one leg slightly lifted, weight on the other, body slightly turned. Her left hand gently touches her chin, right hand hangs naturally, and she smiles softly, eyes clear and focused on the camera. Her hair falls smoothly over her shoulders. Low-angle shot looks up, emphasizing her tall figure and the installation's grand scale. Visual lines lead from the steps and vertical structures up to her face, creating strong central focus. Lighting comes primarily from the cool white installation light and ambient indirect sources, softly illuminating her face with clear contours and delicate shadows. Warm building lights in the background provide a contrasting tone, adding depth. The atmosphere blends modern urban coldness with the woman's tender sensuality, both sci-fi and grounded. The image feels like a real night shot taken with a professional camera—rich detail, true colors, slight film grain and natural lens distortion—a candid moment as if casually captured by a friend on a smartphone, full of life’s warmth and youthful energy.",
