          "prompt": "A young woman sits on an indoor floor, her jet-black hair falling naturally, her fair, smooth skin glistening under warm light. She gazes softly at the lens with a gentle smile, leaning forward slightly, her legs crossed and barefoot on gray marble tiles. Her right hand rests on her knee, left hand loose, a delicate gold bracelet around her wrist. She wears a sheer, open-front qipao in pale grey-blue with gold embroidered floral vines—the fabric translucent, revealing her bare breasts and the curve of her waist. The high mandarin collar hangs open, with exposed clavicles and no bra beneath. The dress clings to her body, highlighting her S-curve. A red folding fan lies on the left side, its bright stripes contrasting sharply with her outfit. The background is a simple off-white wall. Side lighting from upper-right casts soft, warm shadows, illuminating her face, arms, and legs, creating sharp but natural shadows on the wall and floor. Shot as a mid-view, she is slightly left of center, body forming an elegant S-curve. The fan adds a vivid focal point. The overall filmic tone blends Eastern traditional aesthetics with modern sensuality, captured in a casual, handheld style with subtle grain and realistic texture. Camera: Canon EOS R5, ISO 400, f/2.8, 1/60s, handheld slight motion blur. Focal length 85mm, focus on her face, background softly blurred. The scene feels quiet, intimate, and artfully erotic, like a private home moment full of life and beauty.",
