          "alias": "单女露胸红泳装酒廊沉思躺自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies sideways on a wooden outdoor lounge chair, completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, wearing only a red bikini bottom beneath the white floral halter top that has been pushed down. Her long black hair is woven into twin braids draped over her shoulders, a delicate pearl necklace resting against her collarbone, a simple bracelet on her wrist. She gazes intently at her smartphone, fingers lightly tapping the screen, a contemplative expression on her face as if browsing or taking a selfie. In the foreground, a woven rattan tray sits on a purple fabric cushion, laden with fresh cut watermelon, strawberries, a few dishes like lettuce salad and pickled vegetables, bread slices, a dark drink, a small jar of sauce, plus a transparent glass and a pink package. To the right, a small wooden side table holds a glass ashtray. The background is a stone wall of irregular warm beige rocks, behind which lush tropical foliage spreads broad leaves, sunlight dappling through. Above hangs a huge circular woven rattan lampshade in natural brown. Surrounding the scene are bamboo posts and wooden pergola structure; in the distance, traditional roof eaves and railings. The entire setting is a covered outdoor patio or resort lounge with light wood flooring. The composition is low-angle eye-level, the subject slightly left of center, body diagonally extended creating a natural visual lead. Light comes from upper right, soft and warm afternoon sunlight casting delicate shadows, moderate color saturation with warm yellows, browns, greens accented by white and red. Layers clear: foreground tray and phone details sharp, midground figure and furniture prominent, background plants and architecture blurred for depth. The relaxed, carefree atmosphere evokes Southeast Asian resort vibes, realistic life texture as if shot with a professional camera and standard lens under natural light, slight film grain and soft depth of field transition, balanced composition, focus on the interaction between person and food, conveying a leisurely summer day feeling.",
