        {
          "id": "krea2-776e7ce7580b5b6e7a0d307e",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑衬衫街道媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits casually on a wooden café chair, completely topless, her bare breasts exposed with soft natural lighting. She wears only a black short-sleeve Polo shirt unbuttoned and hanging open, revealing her chest, along with black tailored trousers and white sneakers. Her long black hair falls naturally past her shoulders, with a few loose strands framing her face. She looks directly at the camera with a calm, slightly lazy gaze, lips parted just a bit, a hint of detached sensuality. Her right hand rests lightly on the chair back, left hand raised with fingers loosely curled, as if mid-gesture. The left sleeve of her Polo bears orange “BOOKER” lettering, and a Korean text logo is visible on the chest area. From head to knees fully in frame, her body tilts slightly with relaxed elegance. Background: a cozy café interior with neatly arranged wooden tables and chairs, menu flyers on table (table number 18), other empty sets. A large window on the right shows a city street view—glass facades of opposite buildings reflecting sky and surroundings, a red Korean sign “모든게임카페”, telephone poles and cables crisscrossing, blurred distant pedestrians and cars. Hanging round white pendant lights cast soft warm glow, contrasted with cooler natural light from the window. Mid-shot composition, subject slightly left of center, window acting as natural frame, adding depth. Lighting balanced, subtle film grain and slight noise, cool color tones with warm accents, intimate and atmospheric. A candid moment of urban youth relaxation, tinged with solitary sensuality.",
