        {
          "id": "krea2-5ecd950d493130487a1cb022",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑外套车厢媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands alone at the center of a subway platform, her long, straight black hair falling softly over bare shoulders, gleaming under the warm yellow LED lights. She holds a transparent-cased smartphone in one hand, her gaze downward, lips slightly parted, with a quiet, contemplative expression. She wears only a loose, unzipped black leather jacket draped over one shoulder, leaving her chest fully exposed—her breasts soft, nipples visible, skin glowing under the mixed warm and cool light. A thin, silver chain necklace rests between her collarbones, small sparkling earrings catch the light, and multiple rings adorn her fingers, including a silver band on her left ring finger and a gold ring on her right index. The jacket falls open, revealing her bare torso, with the light fabric of a discarded pale ivory satin slip dress pooled around her waist or trailing behind her. She carries a large, textured black leather shoulder bag with natural sheen. Her body is turned slightly toward the camera, one hip cocked, stance relaxed, the jacket’s shadow tracing her ribs. Behind her, a large blue-and-white electronic train information board dominates the background: \"E line Downtown World Trade Center 0 min\", \"A line Downtown & Brooklyn Far Rockaway / JFK 2 min\", \"C line Downtown & Brooklyn Euclid Av\", and upcoming alerts for A line maintenance. The time reads 12:19:24. The scene is mid-shot, her figure slightly left of center, the board filling the left side, guiding the eye from the glowing text to her face and bare chest. To the right, empty platform stretches toward distant tracks and platform-edge doors. The floor is gray square tiles with subtle reflections, the ceiling is raw concrete with hanging metal fixtures and a \"center of platform\" sign. The lighting is a mix of warm overhead LEDs casting soft shadows and the cool blue fluorescence from the board, creating strong contrast and depth. The image feels like a high-ISO shot in low light, with subtle grain and a film-like texture, capturing a quiet moment of urban commuting with a sensual, voyeuristic edge.",
