          "alias": "单女半褪红连衣裙沙发媚态躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges on a brown leather sofa, her long, deep-red wavy hair cascading over her shoulders and chest, the ends flicking lightly with a glossy sheen under soft lighting. Her porcelain skin is flawless, with delicate facial features—large bright eyes, a subtle smoky eye makeup, thick curled lashes, and naturally pink glossy lips. She wears a bright red adidas Originals sports dress, but the zipper is pulled down to her navel, exposing her bare breasts—nipples taut—the white adidas logo and three white stripes on the sleeves framing her upper body. Her left hand rests gently on the sofa arm, fingers long and manicured; her right hand lies loosely beside her thigh. Silver hoop earrings catch the light, adding a refined touch. She leans slightly forward, gazing directly at the camera with a calm yet inviting expression. The brown leather sofa is rich with natural grain and warm tan tones, thick cushioned with clean lines. The background is a pure white wall, minimalist and uncluttered. Light streams softly from the left, creating natural shadows on her right side, highlighting her hair edges and shoulders. Mid-shot composition, head slightly tilted, sharp focus on her, background blurred. The color palette of vivid red, warm brown, and crisp white provides both contrast and harmony, resulting in a modern, elegant, and intimate personal portrait with high photographic quality and a sensual everyday atmosphere.",
