        {
          "id": "krea2-df9c1e141ec85605a9ff0535",
          "alias": "单女衬衫废墟微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the floor indoors. She has long, deep brown hair with blunt bangs, naturally falling in soft waves—smooth, glossy strands with a few stray pieces brushing her cheeks for a lazy, disheveled look. She looks slightly downward toward the camera with gentle eyes, a subtle smile, lips parted just enough to show clean white teeth. Her skin is fair and flawless, cheeks full, nose straight, features delicate and sculpted. She wears a burgundy short-sleeve cotton button-up, the fabric lightly wrinkled, the collar open wide—no top underneath—so the shirt falls open, revealing the smooth curve of her breasts and the shadow of her cleavage. The left chest area has gold embroidery; the right sleeve reads \"BIT.\" The shirt hangs loose and unbuttoned halfway down. Below, she wears loose, light blue wide-leg jeans with heavy wash marks, natural frayed edges, and slight wear at the knees. The hem falls past her ankles, stacking over classic black-and-white Vans canvas sneakers (black upper, white side stripe, white laces, rubber sole, scuffed toe). She sits relaxed, legs crossed—right knee bent forward, left leg tucked sideways. Her right hand is raised, making a V sign with the back of her hand toward the lens; a thin black hair tie circles her wrist. Her left hand rests on her right knee, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed with clear or pale pink polish. The setting is a simple interior: a white wall on the left with faint texture and mild stains; on the right, a tall dark gray object with a rough, heavily scratched surface like an abandoned cabinet or machine shell, its top edge irregular and black wheels at the base. The floor is two materials: white concrete with dust and scratches on the left, light wood laminate in horizontal planks on the right. Light falls from the upper left, soft and even, creating no harsh shadows. The palette leans cool—whites, grays, blues, and burgundy. The composition is a medium shot, the subject placed slightly left of center, body gently tilted, head low, gaze downward—intimate and casual. The foreground shows her legs and shoes, midground the torso and arms, background the wall and gray object. Visual lines lead from her hand gesture to her face, then to her eyes. Lighting highlights her face, hands, and the folds of her shirt; shadows fall softly beneath her body and on the floor. The mood is quiet and realistic, like an unguarded candid moment, with a faint film-grain texture and natural color shift, blending everyday intimacy with a polished studio feel.",
