          "prompt": "A young woman in a suggestive Christmas-themed maid outfit, standing centered against a plain light gray background. She poses slightly turned, left leg forward, right leg back, creating a natural S-curve. Her right hand lifts in a wave, fingers spread, wrist adorned with red plaid fur wristband; left hand hangs loosely. Black hair in double braids with blunt bangs, topped with a white fluffy Santa hat decorated with green holly and red berries. She looks directly at the camera with a warm but sultry smile, eyes inviting. She wears a red velvet miniskirt with white fur hem, a black leather wide belt with silver buckle accenting her waist, and a black lace corset that leaves her breasts fully exposed, nipples erect. A large red-green-white ribbon bow with white pom-poms sits at her chest. She wears white over-the-knee stockings with lace cuffs and black patent leather platform shoes with bow details, emphasizing her long legs. Soft even front lighting, vivid red, white, black tones with green accents, clean background. Professional studio look, high detail, sensual and festive.",
