          "alias": "单女半褪蓝衬衫舞台媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her sheer light-blue off-shoulder blouse unbuttoned and slipping off one shoulder, revealing the curve of her breast and a hint of a lacy bra beneath. A deep-blue denim apron with white calligraphy reading \"源来是你\" hangs loosely over her bare midriff, the apron strings untied and dangling. She holds a black microphone in one hand and the same pamphlet in the other, her gaze turned to the right, lips slightly parted, eyes dark and thoughtful. Her black hair is pulled back in a low ponytail, silver earrings catch the light, and a matching silk scarf is loosely knotted at her throat, adding a touch of elegance. She stands with a slight forward lean, hips subtly shifted, one hand resting on her thigh, the apron riding up to expose the bare skin of her stomach and hip. The bright stage lighting falls evenly on her face and body, highlighting every curve through the thin fabric. Behind her, a large LED screen shows a blue sky and green field with blurred silhouettes of people, one waving on the left, another facing away on the right. The composition is a mid-shot from the front, the woman slightly right of center, leaving room for the eye to follow her gaze. Soft shadows define her form, and the cool blue-gray palette—sky blue, denim, silver—creates a crisp yet intimate atmosphere. The image has a slight film grain and natural noise, as if captured by a professional camera at a live event, with a soft background blur that keeps the focus on her exposed skin and provocative stance. The overall mood is warm, sensual, and story-rich, blending artistic beauty with raw, everyday intimacy.",
