        {
          "id": "krea2-b685ccec50d0ec254f89a297",
          "alias": "单女半褪白短裙城市忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before an outdoor staircase of a modern building, her short ash-blonde hair neatly cut with bangs, softly curled, and adorned with a pale lavender ribbon. A few strands fall naturally beside her face, adding to her delicate, lively charm. Her fair skin is smooth and flawless, with refined features—deep, slightly melancholic eyes framed by precise liner and thick, curled lashes. Her lips are a soft pink, slightly parted with a faint smile. She wears a gray sleeveless crop top, thin and textured, with two wide white satin ribbons tied into elegant bows at the chest and waist. The top is pulled down just enough to reveal the full curves of her breasts, the satin bows barely covering her nipples. She pairs it with a high-waisted white semi-transparent long skirt, layered and flowing, with another white ribbon bow at the hip—the sheer fabric revealing the tantalizing outline of her thighs and the gentle curve of her hips. Her hands rest relaxed at her sides, her head slightly tilted, her gaze fixed intently on the viewer, as if sharing a silent, intimate moment. Behind her, a broad stone staircase rises in shallow steps of light brown stone with natural speckles. A sleek metal handrail curves beside it. Beyond, a massive glass curtain wall reflects blurred images of tree branches and sky, blending urban and natural elements. The composition places her center frame; sharp geometry of stairs and glass draws the eye to her. Soft top-left lighting caresses her face and body, casting gentle shadows and enhancing her three-dimensional form. The color palette of gray, white, and pale lavender creates a dreamy, ethereal atmosphere, with fine details and natural light effects capturing a high-end portrait quality, yet inviting a sensual, modern elegance. The slightly disheveled state of her top and the transparent skirt emphasize her exposed skin and the subtle erotic tension of the pose.",
