        {
          "id": "krea2-75d071e089374115bd93e0c6",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑外套闺房媚态坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman sits on a round gray velvet ottoman in a modern interior, her body slightly forward, one hand brushing the edge of her open black long coat, the other resting on her thigh. Underneath, she is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed with nipples hardened in the soft light. She wears black thigh-high stockings with delicate white embroidered floral patterns at the top, and glossy black patent leather platform shoes. Her lips are parted, eyes locked on the camera with a playful, confident smirk. Her short blonde hair falls naturally, catching warm highlights. The coat falls open, revealing her toned torso and the curve of her waist. The foreground focuses on her thighs, stockings, and shoes, with fine detail in the embroidery and leather sheen. The midground shows her seated pose, fabric folds and texture of the coat. Background: a minimalist room with cream walls, a large abstract black-and-white line art piece on the right featuring geometric shapes and a human silhouette, a thick textured gray pillar on the left, light beige floor tiles reflecting soft overhead warm LED light. Soft directional light from above and front creates natural shadows on her body and the setting. The composition is a medium close-up, with the subject slightly left, the art and pillar balancing the right side. The visual flow starts at her face, moves down her bare chest and abdomen, to her stocking-clad legs and shoes, then to the art and architecture, enhancing depth. The palette is monochrome black, white, and gray, accented by her golden hair and red lipstick. The atmosphere is quiet, elegant, and intensely sensual, like a high-fashion editorial or a candid boudoir portrait, captured with a professional camera for rich detail and realistic light.",
