        {
          "id": "krea2-93a81408315f3eacc4a51214",
          "alias": "单女白袜子床害羞躺",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies on her side on a soft white bed, body slightly curled, arms wrapped around a white pillow, her head resting on another white pillow. Her long black hair spills across the pillow, fair and smooth skin, soft facial contours, clear eyes looking lazily toward the camera, lips slightly upturned in a relaxed, partly shy expression. She wears only a pair of pure white mid-calf socks with slightly rolled cuffs, and a light green vertical-striped shorts with a white elastic waistband printed with \"GMORN\" – her upper body is completely bare, her breasts gently pressed against the pillow, nipples subtly visible. Her legs are elegantly shaped, her body forms a gentle diagonal from lower left to upper right. The composition is slightly from above, creating an intimate private atmosphere. Foreground shows white bedding and pillows with rich folds, realistic fabric texture. Midground is the woman's body and the details of her sleepwear (her shorts and socks), with natural light-shadow transitions. Background: a woven-textured gray headboard, rough yet warm, behind which are white semi-sheer curtains letting in soft natural light, even and bright, with curtain folds and light-shadow interplay adding depth. On the right, a tall houseplant with large, vibrant green leaves, stems upright, edges naturally curling, contrasting with the indoor environment. The overall composition is balanced and airy, visual flow starting from the face, following her body line to the bed and background. Light comes from a left window, soft and directional, creating natural shadows and highlights on her face, arms, and sheets, with delicate chiaroscuro, evoking the quiet atmosphere of morning or afternoon sun filtering through curtains. Color palette is predominantly white, light green, and gray, with a warm yellowish tint, overall cozy and comfortable, full of everyday relaxation and private home intimacy, as if capturing a lazy morning or afternoon quiet moment. The image has a lifelike, realistic quality, like a casual shot from an ordinary camera, with slight grain and natural color temperature, enhancing realism and familiarity, no over-editing, preserving raw light and shadow details, conveying a plain but beautiful living aesthetic.",
