        {
          "id": "krea2-d23be35fc5a6bf150d9bf914",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑外套街道微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a city street at dusk, bathed in the glow of urban lights, wearing an open black leather jacket with nothing underneath—her bare breasts visible, a short black skirt, white scarf loosely draped, black thigh-high boots, and black gloves. She turns sideways to glance back at the camera, a slight smile on her lips, her expression both gentle and confidently seductive. Her long hair falls naturally, bangs framing her face. The scene is framed in mid-shot, her body forming an S-curve, one leg slightly lifted, creating natural motion. In the foreground, her silhouette is sharp against a background of modern buildings adorned with festive lights, high-rises blazing with windows like countless stars. Several trees wrapped in warm yellow string lights sway in the night, their shadows mingling with neon reflections. To the left, a large, colorful installation glows in green, pink, and purple, adding a dreamy, playful touch. The ground is a calm puddle of water, mirroring the bright cityscape and her figure, forming a reflective surface with gentle ripples that enhance depth and dynamic flow. Lighting comes from ambient sources—cold white from buildings, warm yellow from trees, multi-colored from the installation—creating rich layers, contrasting warm and cool tones, highlighting her as the focal point. The overall atmosphere blends modern urban bustle, festive cheer, and intimate personal emotion, like a candid moment captured with a phone or standard camera, preserving real-life texture and warmth. Saturated but not exaggerated, the image balances highlights and soft shadows, delivering an artistic yet lifelike style that conveys the romance of the city night and her sensual presence.",
