        {
          "id": "krea2-e1f512242a4d037f2f5ef8ae",
          "alias": "单女紫泳装泳池困倦躺脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies languidly on a pink flamingo inflatable pool float. She wears a slightly unzipped light lavender long-sleeve swimsuit, the fabric clinging wetly to her curves, with white lettering across her chest, her high ponytail of loosely curled hair draping over one shoulder. Her lips part in a soft, sultry smile, eyes glancing sideways with a lazy, satisfied expression. Her right hand rests on the edge of the float, fingers trailing in the blue water, creating tiny ripples; her left hand lies casually on her stomach. The float is bright pink with gold glitter flecks, shaped with a realistic flamingo head—black beak, orange-yellow eyes, elegant curved neck and plump back. She floats in a sparkling blue pool with blue-and-white tiled edges, the water crystal clear showing subtle reflections on the bottom. Foreground shows delicate splashes and transparent droplets where water meets the float. Behind her, a huge glass wall reveals a modern minimalist indoor space with gray sofa, white tables and chairs, and air conditioning units; the glass reflects outdoor trees and sky. On the right stands a white electric fan with a metallic stand, blades still, beside a smaller portable fan. The building’s black metal frame creates sharp lines contrasting with the soft water. Natural daylight streams from the upper right, casting soft highlights on her face, arms, and the float, with short, crisp shadows. Medium shot composition, subject slightly left of center, the float’s curves guiding the eye rightward. Color palette dominated by blues and pinks, with white, gray, and green accents. A realistic, everyday summer snapshot with subtle film grain and muted tones evoking nostalgia and warmth.",
