        {
          "id": "krea2-9ca5ca91ccac0b47436a261b",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙走廊媚态跪注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman kneels on the patterned carpet in an indoor hallway, wearing a sheer black lace spaghetti-strap mini dress that barely conceals her nipples and hints at a black garter belt, with tall glossy black bunny ears perched on her head. Her long hair spills over bare shoulders, her makeup is heavy and sultry with dramatic eyeliner, her cold, mysterious gaze locked directly on the lens. Her pose is elegant yet provocative: one knee on the floor, the other leg bent, hands resting on her thighs—fingers slightly splayed, a silver ring on her left ring finger, small cross earrings glinting. The dress is hitched up slightly, revealing the lace tops of black thigh-high stockings and a sliver of bare skin above. In the foreground, a white rabbit plush lies still on the brown floral rug. Behind her, an off-white wall and a white door with a gold handle frame the scene. Warm indoor light from above and left casts soft shadows across her curves, emphasizing the sheerness of the lace and the volume of her body. Composition is vertical, centered slightly to the right, with a slight high angle that makes her gaze feel intimate. The right edge shows part of the wall and a gold room number plate, grounding the scene in reality. The color palette is black, white, beige, with warm yellow tones creating a private, cozy mood. The image looks natural and realistic, like a candid phone shot with subtle grain, capturing a moment of dark, alluring confidence and sensual self-display.",
