        {
          "id": "krea2-bd108e3db21e329d4421e585",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙衣帽间微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a dressing room or backstage area, wearing a sheer, partially transparent Lolita-style dress in a blue-pink gradient, the fabric so thin it clings to her skin and reveals her nipples beneath the lace and ruffles. The off-shoulder neckline has fallen slightly, exposing one bare shoulder and the edge of her breast. Her black hair is in two braids over her chest, a white bow on her head. She looks directly at the camera with a soft, playful smile, her eyes lined and lips pink. She holds a pink tambourine in her right hand, white lace gloves reaching above her elbows. The dress is unbuttoned at the front, showing the curve of her waist above a wide striped belt. In the background, a mirror reflects part of her figure and a white-dressed woman's back. Fluorescent lighting casts cool white light, creating subtle highlights on her face and bare skin. The scene feels candid, with a messy, lived-in atmosphere—a mix of stage prep and intimate space.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
