          "alias": "单女半褪蓝连衣裙室内媚态奔跑脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman poses for a sultry selfie, her long, sleek black hair cascading over bare shoulders, strands artfully tousled. Her flawless pale skin glows with a flawless, dewy finish; smoky blue eyeshadow accentuates her piercing blue eyes, with sharp liner and thick, curled lashes. Soft pink blush dusts her cheekbones, and her full lips are glossy and slightly parted. She wears a blue-and-white gingham dress, unbuttoned low and slipping off one shoulder, revealing a white puff-sleeve blouse underneath that is also pulled open, exposing her cleavage and the curve of her breasts. The A-line dress has a cinched waist, the fabric light and airy. A small headset microphone is clipped to her ear, with a thin yellow wire trailing behind. A crystal earring catches the dim light. One hand lazily runs through her hair; the other extends toward the camera, as if pressing the shutter. The dark room has black walls, a red glowing control panel with Korean text and warning symbols on the left, and a transparent storage shelf. The floor is light brown hardwood. Lighting falls from above and front, highlighting her forehead, nose, and chin, casting soft shadows under her collarbones and neck. The red glow contrasts with her blue-and-white outfit, creating a warm, intimate mood. The composition is a close-up, slightly tilted, with a candid, phone-camera feel—grainy and natural. She looks directly at the lens, her expression calm but with a hint of coy invitation.",
