          "prompt": "A young woman sits sideways on a dark wooden bench in a seaside park, topless, her white strappy bikini top discarded beside her, leaving her bare chest exposed. She wears low-rise bikini bottoms and a white Los Angeles Dodgers baseball cap with the black \"LA\" logo clearly visible. Her long hair falls naturally, strands lifted by a gentle breeze. She sits with her left hand resting on the bench back, right hand on her thigh, legs crossed (right over left). White high-top sneakers with three classic stripes and cream rubber soles, paired with white crew socks slightly rolled at the ankle. The background shows a calm blue ocean meeting a pale sky with thin clouds, soft diffused light like an overcast late afternoon. Foreground has square stone tiles in light brown and gray, slightly worn. To the left, a thick pine tree with dark bark and dense needles forms a natural frame. Midground features green lawn and trimmed bushes, a few fallen leaves, and a green-and-white canvas bag leaning against the bench on the right, bag open, contents vaguely visible. Composition is centered slightly left, her gaze directed right toward the distant sea, creating depth. Soft lighting, no harsh shadows, tranquil and lazy summer vibe. Colors: white, blue, green, brown. Realistic snapshot feel, shallow depth of field with slight background blur, ready for social media or personal portrait use.",
