          "prompt": "A young woman stands outdoors on a city street, wearing an oversized light gray hoodie with \"GA 19\" printed on the front, unzipped to reveal her bare chest and perky nipples. She pairs it with low-rise light blue jeans that sit just above her hips, showing the top of her black lace panties. Her short black hair with blunt bangs falls naturally, and she gives a sultry, knowing smile, eyes half-lidded and inviting. Her left hand casually touches the back of her head, while her right hand holds a black phone, a gold ring glinting on her finger. The medium shot captures her from the waist up, slightly off-center left. In the background, modern urban architecture blends with lush greenery—a leafy tree on the left casts dappled shadows, with shop glass and a sign featuring yellow letters \"E\" and \"N\" visible behind it. On the right, a sleek metal building with clean geometric lines. Dark gray brick pavement forms regular patterns, with warm sunlight slanting from the upper right, creating sharp shadows and a bright, intimate early afternoon mood. Pale blue sky with thin clouds. The overall color palette contrasts cool gray-blue and warm golden light, with soft highlights on her hair and clothes, deepening the sense of space. The image mimics a candid handheld camera shot with standard focal length, slight background blur focusing on her face, retaining enough environment for a photorealistic, slightly grainy, saturated aesthetic—like a friend's spontaneous street photo, but charged with natural sensuality and youthful allure.",
