        {
          "id": "krea2-96086ba147814cf42797587e",
          "alias": "单女全裸米毛衣咖啡厅微笑坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in front of a grill at a barbecue restaurant, her jet-black hair cascading smoothly over her bare shoulders. She wears a beige knitted cardigan left open, revealing her nude torso and full breasts with erect nipples, partially hidden by the cardigan's edges. Her face carries a sweet, satisfied smile, eyes glinting with anticipation and desire for the food—and for the viewer. A white forehead sticker reading \"烤串\" adds playful charm. She leans forward slightly, holding wooden chopsticks in one hand, the other hand idly touching her collarbone. The grill fills the lower frame with rows of metal skewers loaded with golden-brown chicken, pink pork, and bacon-wrapped rolls, some charred and glistening with oil, others raw and glistening. Red-hot charcoal glows beneath the grate, casting warm orange highlights across her skin and the food. A white rectangular plate sits on the grill, sprinkled with chili and cumin powder, beside a blue utensil. The background is a dark brick wall with a large display screen showing a pastoral landscape—green fields and winding paths. Soft white LED strips below the screen gently illuminate the brickwork, creating contrast. The composition is a close-up, with the woman slightly left of center; the grill angles from lower left to upper right, drawing the eye toward her. Her gaze aligns with the skewers, guiding the viewer's focus. Warm amber light from the coals plays across her face and breasts, while cool screen light adds depth. The mood is intimate and indulgent, capturing a mundane yet carnal moment of urban night life—steamy, sensual, authentic.",
