          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a wooden table in a seaside restaurant, her long black hair tied in a high ponytail, round sunglasses perched on her head. She is topless, wearing only the thin white straps of a swimsuit bottom, her bare breasts fully exposed. She poses elegantly sideways, left hand supporting her chin, right hand resting naturally on the table, silver nail polish on her fingers, delicate rings and earrings adorning her. Her expression is contemplative, eyes gazing towards the distant sea, as if enjoying a peaceful moment. Before her lies a lavish seafood meal: a green sauce pizza covered with fresh clams, squid, and shrimp, alongside grilled oysters, salad, and small dipping bowls. Cutlery is neatly arranged on a dark placemat, a phone lying still at the corner of the table. The entire scene is set in an open-air beach restaurant, background of a blue sky with white clouds, a calm ocean and rocky coastline, lush green vegetation and palm trees. Sunlight is bright, warm natural light. Medium shot composition, subject slightly left of center, food occupying the foreground center forming visual focus. The sea and sky in the distance create spatial layers, guiding the eye from foreground food to midground person to distant nature. Soft, layered light from upper right casts subtle shadows on her face and the table, creating a leisurely holiday atmosphere. Color palette dominated by blue, green, white, with rich food colors, presenting a fresh, natural, life-filled scene. Has a strong everyday photography texture, as if captured by an ordinary camera, with slight lens distortion and realistic noise, enhancing authenticity and intimacy. One can almost smell the sea breeze and food aroma, evoking a relaxed joyful seaside dining experience.",
