          "alias": "单女白衬衫忧伤蹲脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches before a blue gradient wall, her glossy black straight hair falling to her shoulders, bangs neatly cut, light shimmer on her eyelids, eyes gazing into the lens with a melancholic, sultry intensity, lips parted in a soft, thoughtful pout. Her right hand gently cups her chin, fingers slender and elegant, left hand resting near her knee. She wears a white vertical-stripe shirt, unbuttoned nearly to the midriff, revealing a black lace bra beneath, a bright red tie loosely knotted and hanging undone over the open shirt. A black Y-3 leather jacket is draped open, showing the logo and white lettering, three white stripes on the sleeves. A black miniskirt with delicate lace trim rides high, exposing bare thighs, thick-soled black matte-finish combat boots laced up to the ankle, glossy shine. Low-angle shot centers her slightly left, highlighting her silhouette. Background is a geometric gradient from light blue to dark blue with white modern “IDOL CHA” text; dark blue reflective floor mirrors her. Soft frontal lighting carves her face and body, clean, bright, shadows subtle. Composition balanced, details rich, photo-realistic, youthful yet sensual, color palette dominated by blue, white, black, and red accents, strong visual impact.",
