          "prompt": "A young woman stands slightly left of center in a dim, cluttered storage room, her soft brown hair with golden highlights falling in a neat fringe over her forehead. Her bright eyes gaze directly into the lens, a mix of tenderness and mystery, lips slightly parted in a natural pink hue, makeup subtle yet striking. She wears a tight black deep-V knit top (dark gray spliced sleeves), a short minimalist pair of shorts that barely cover her thighs, and black high heels, her long legs fully exposed. A delicate black choker and a silver necklace with a small pendant adorn her neck. Her right hand extends toward the camera, palm open, fingers slightly curled as if inviting touch, bathed in a harsh light that creates a glowing halo effect with bright specular highlights on the fingertips. The background is chaotic: plastic bins, cardboard boxes, file folders stacked on shelves, some with blurry labels; a glowing white star ornament hangs on the right shelf, with several similar star shapes scattered around as if added later. Yellow-and-black warning stripes on the left wall add an industrial, safety-themed edge. The scene is dominated by dark tones, with strong lighting focused on her hand and face, creating deep chiaroscuro and a cold-warm contrast. Low-angle shot looking up makes her appear imposing, with the foreground hand in extreme close-up, midground body and face, and background cluttered depth. Slight film grain and digital noise give a raw, phone-camera realism, intimate and slightly voyeuristic.",
