          "prompt": "A young woman with jet-black hair slicked back and a chic geometric silver hairpin sits on a white hotel bed, her deep eyes staring directly at the camera with a cold, confident allure. She wears a black velvet off-shoulder top edged with cream lace and small black bows, paired with high-waist black shorts and a wide white belt. Black thigh-high stockings contour her long legs. A fluffy cream-colored shearling coat drapes loosely over her shoulders. She holds a pink eyeshadow palette in one hand and a small white dish in the other, relaxed and elegant. The white bedding is naturally rumpled; two pillows sit at the headboard. Warm indoor light casts soft shadows, emphasizing her face and upper body. The slight overhead angle highlights her pose and outfit details, with the bedside table and a black electronic device in the background. The overall mood is a candid, intimate snapshot—fashionable, lazy, and subtly seductive, with a modern-retro aesthetic and a sensual, everyday beauty.",
