        {
          "id": "krea2-6ee781663a15ce2d9f7f2493",
          "alias": "单女制服楼梯戏谑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a Japanese sailor uniform stands on a staircase, her sleek black hair cascading naturally, catching golden light. She tilts her head slightly, gazing softly at the camera with a hint of a smirk, exuding a youthful, teasing allure. Her dark blue sailor jacket is partly unbuttoned, white shirt open, revealing a glimpse of bare skin and the curve of her breasts. The black tie hangs loose. A short black pleated skirt rides up as she shifts, exposing long thighs clad in black knee-high socks and shiny school shoes. One hand rests lightly on the metal railing, posture relaxed yet inviting. The stairwell is dim, gray walls and floor, with harsh sunlight streaming from above, casting dramatic shadows and warm spotlights on her body. Dust motes float in the beams. Low-angle shot looking up, she stands slightly right, leaving depth on the left. Foreground shows stairs and railings, leading the eye upward. Midground: her figure, sharp and detailed. Background: soft blur of the tunnel. Strong contrast between warm yellow light and cool grays, giving a nostalgic film-grain, slightly grungy aesthetic. The scene feels like a candid, intimate after-school moment captured on old film—innocent yet provocatively adult.",
