        {
          "id": "krea2-2fec283c6cd606b04e9c74c5",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜忧伤蹲脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches low at left of frame, wearing a tight black crop top with puffed sleeves and subtle textured fabric, unbuttoned to expose her bare chest and erect nipples. Her high-waisted black miniskirt is hitched up, revealing the top of her black-and-gray diamond-patterned thigh-high stockings and a glimpse of bare hip. She wears long black lace gloves with intricate cutouts, her fingers splayed. Thick-soled black leather combat boots with metal buckles and chunky tread catch the light. Her long brown hair falls in soft waves, neat bangs, makeup sharp with defined eyeliner and pale lips, her gaze fixed upward-right, expression cool and melancholic. Smooth pale skin, black earrings. Background is a blurred urban night street with dark gray stone pavement reflecting faint light, stair-like structures in warm ochre, dramatic side lighting from the right casting strong shadows and highlights across her face, arms, and body. The overall mood is cold, cinematic, with high contrast black-and-white tones accented by warm yellow. Medium shot, her body slightly tilted, legs crossed at the knee, knees bent, pose elegant and tense. The polished stone floor reflects her silhouette and the surrounding lights, adding depth. Shallow depth of field keeps her sharp against the soft background. Her gaze leads the eye upward-right, then back to her subtle expression. The image feels like a high-fashion editorial shot on a night street with a professional camera, rich in detail and texture, sensual and artistic.",
