        {
          "id": "krea2-e06324aac52c1610c58f0dc1",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙车厢媚态倚靠过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman in a sheer white lace dress, the fabric clinging to her curves with dramatic waist cutouts and translucent panels revealing bare skin, leans sensually against a carved stone balustrade. One hand rests on the dark gray stone, the other reaches up toward an antique black iron chandelier, her head thrown back, eyes closed in poetic reverie. Her long black hair cascades over her shoulders, catching soft light. Minimal jewelry—a delicate necklace and pearl bracelet—adds elegance. The dress features intricate lace patterns, a deep slit, and a floor-length train with fringe, blending seduction with sophistication. The background is a baroque interior with cream walls, ornate moldings, and a central black iron chandelier with multiple candles. Symmetrical niches add depth. Pale gray marble floor tiles reflect soft light. The composition places her off-center left, her arm extending upward, guiding the eye. Natural light from the left creates gentle chiaroscuro, highlighting her body and face, shadows on the right. The mood is opulent, romantic, and quietly erotic, with the texture of a high-fashion shoot set in a historic palace, yet retaining an amateur, candid realism. Focus on her interaction with the space, emphasizing her confident, powerful femininity.",
