          "alias": "单女透视粉西装微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center in a futuristic glossy pink circular arch. She has long straight black hair with blunt bangs, a bright playful smile, and sparkling eyes. She extends her arms outward in a welcoming gesture, her body leaning slightly forward with her head tilted. She wears a short pink blazer unzipped and open, exposing her bare chest and perky nipples, paired with a white fluffy mini skirt, white strappy high-heel sandals, and sheer stockings patterned with delicate floral motifs. The midground features a massive pink arch with multiple smooth, reflective layers, topped with rainbow holographic material that casts iridescent reflections. Inside the arch, the text \"L'ORÉAL PARIS GLYCOLIC SKIN & HAIR Treatment Center\" appears in sleek metallic font. The background is a soft pink room with matching carpet, walls, and a ceiling accented with warm wood slats. The composition is centered and symmetrical, drawing the eye from her exposed upper body up through the arch's curves to the brand text. The lighting is soft, warm, and evenly diffused from above and front, highlighting the natural glow of her skin and the holographic shine. Colors are layered pinks with white, silver, and rainbow accents. The scene feels like a high-end brand activation shoot, crisp and detailed, with a sensual, inviting atmosphere that blends commercial polish with candid spontaneity.",
