          "alias": "单女全裸黑西装舞台困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman sits in the dim backstage environment, her black suit jacket hanging open to reveal her bare chest, white vertical-striped shirt unbuttoned, black wide-leg trousers low on her hips. She leans back against a metal scaffold, left hand resting at her side, right hand gently on her knee. Her hair is in a low ponytail with loose strands framing her face, features delicate, eyes calm and slightly sleepy, gazing into the lens with a hint of lazy contemplation. The background is a complex grid of silver-gray steel pipes creating strong geometric lines in the darkness, the floor a smooth reflective dark surface casting blurred reflections of the figure and structure. Stage equipment and lighting rigs are faintly visible in the distance, the space swathed in heavy shadows, lit only by cold white light from above and the side, creating a cool, detached, industrial atmosphere. Medium shot composition, subject framed slightly to the right, body slightly tilted, head turned naturally toward the camera. The foreground highlights the nude torso and sharp contrast of clothing, the midground shows vertical and horizontal scaffold lines, the background fades into soft depth. Strong chiaroscuro, sharp light-dark borders, highlights concentrate on her face, shoulders, and some metal surfaces, the rest lost in gloom. Overall palette is black, white, gray with cold metallic tones, a minimalist and urban fashion aesthetic. Image texture is fine and detailed, as if shot with professional equipment, with cinematic narrative tension yet a natural amateur realism. Soft light retains layers, skin texture, fabric folds, and metal reflections all crisp. The scene is quiet and dramatic, like a moment of stillness before a show, or waiting backstage to go on, filled with unspoken anticipation and a hint of loneliness. Stable yet dynamic composition, lines guide the eye from the subject into the depth, forming a complete visual loop. Low saturation emphasizes pure black-white-gray contrast, evoking a restrained, cool aesthetic. The overall mood is modern and slightly melancholic, conjuring the solitary urban individual and the inner world hidden behind the noise.",
