          "alias": "单女半褪黑连衣裙舞台媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands confidently at the center of a spacious indoor venue, her long, soft brown hair flowing naturally over bare shoulders, catching warm amber light with subtle waves. Her facial features are delicately sculpted, skin pale and smooth, eyes clear and direct—a hint of self-assured calm in her gaze. She wears only a simple black sleeveless dress that has been pulled down to expose her full breasts, the fine-knit fabric clinging to her curves, the cross-strap bodice now framing her bare chest. The dress ends above the knee, a silver metal detail at the right waist. She holds a black studded handbag in one hand, the other hand resting casually at her side. Her legs are bare, clad only in dark grey ribbed thigh-high socks that hug her calves, and black leather platform shoes with metallic buckles and studs. Her stance is upright, legs together, body slightly turned, exuding a poised yet effortless sensuality. The background is a large event space—perhaps a fashion show backstage—with pale orange concrete floor reflecting the warm grid of yellow LED panels overhead. Deep orange pillars rise in the distance, and blurred figures of attendees sit or stand with cameras. A black metal truss with stage lights frames the left side. The composition is a medium shot from knee-up, slightly low angle, emphasizing her figure and commanding presence. Warm golden light bathes her, creating soft highlights and deep shadows on her skin and dress, enhancing every detail. The atmosphere is chic, dramatic, and unabashedly adult, like a high-fashion editorial captured live at a bustling event.",
