          "id": "krea2-2ee451fdccbfa95da7c49aa2",
          "alias": "单女露胸短裙桌边害羞站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands sideways in a warm, sunlit indoor space, her long black hair cascading naturally over her shoulders and back, the ends slightly wavy with a healthy sheen. She tilts her head down, eyes cast downward in a contemplative, shy expression, her face soft with fair, smooth skin, a straight nose, and lips gently pressed together. Her posture is elegant and relaxed. Her right hand rests lightly on a white doorframe, fingers long with red nail polish, a thin silver bracelet on her wrist. Her left arm hangs naturally, hand touching the hem of her skirt, a red string bracelet on that wrist. She is tall and slender with graceful curves. She wears an exquisite white lace long dress—almost entirely see-through—off-shoulder with ruffled lace trim along the neckline, exposing her bare shoulders and collarbone. The semi-transparent lace fabric is intricately patterned with geometric and floral motifs, layered and textured. It clings to her waist, highlighting her slim waistline, and flares into an A-line skirt with cascading lace ruffles flowing to the floor. The lace is so sheer that the contours of her bare breasts are clearly visible, her nipples pressing against the fabric, while the shadow of her pubic area is faintly hinted through the multiple layers. The dress reveals her body in a tantalizing way, combining sensuality with elegance. The background is a cozy family dining area: cream-white walls with simple trim, a vintage pendant lamp with a beige fabric shade and black metal frame casting a soft warm glow. A wooden dining table with a smooth surface holds everyday items—a gray bag, a tissue box, other small objects. Around it are several metal-framed chairs with woven cane backs, one with a beige cushion. On the left, a tall leafy green plant in a pink ceramic pot on a wooden stand adds life and color. The floor is light brown hardwood with visible grain, reflecting the light. The composition is a medium shot with the woman on the left, forming an S-curve from head to toe. The foreground includes her body and part of the doorframe, the midground shows the table, chairs, and plant, and the background leads to a kitchen doorway and wall, creating depth. Light streams in from the right through white curtains, casting soft natural light across her side and dress, creating gentle chiaroscuro on the floor and walls. The atmosphere is intimate, private, and domestic, with a slightly film-like quality, warm tone, and rich detail, as if a candid real-life moment captured on an amateur camera.",
