          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the front center of an indoor event, wearing a tight dark gray short-sleeved T-shirt that's now pulled up to expose her bare breasts, with the printed pattern and text faintly visible on the fabric. She pairs it with a black high-waisted pleated micro-miniskirt, metal rivet accents and side pockets, the hem riding high to reveal her upper thighs and a hint of her ass. Her black hair is tied in a low ponytail, loose strands falling over her face. She touches her head with one hand, the other hand resting on her hip, body slightly turned, a confident and playful expression on her face. She wears multiple silver necklaces, one with a cross pendant, and small stud earrings. Her gaze is fixed on the camera, lips parted in a sensual smirk. In her other arm, she holds a massive gray-white dinosaur skull plush toy, detailed and realistic, contrasting with her exposed skin. The background is a warm yellow wall with a white projection screen above, a black-clothed table below holding a small white fan, a clear photo frame, a spray bottle, plus other plush toys and green fabric. Medium shot composition, diagonal lines from bottom-left to top-right add motion. Focus is on the woman, shallow depth of field blurs the background. Soft frontal-left lighting illuminates her face and body, casting subtle shadows. The atmosphere blends everyday realism with surreal fun, like a candid moment from a fan meet-up. True-to-life texture, balanced saturation, warm and layered tones, giving a lived-in yet artistic visual style.",
