          "alias": "单女白衬衫媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands backstage amid a metal scaffolding structure, wearing an oversized white button-up shirt casually unbuttoned to reveal black lace bra and bare cleavage, her black tie loosely hanging, dark shorts barely covering her hips, and simple white sneakers. Her long jet-black hair falls softly over her shoulders, strands brushing her face, giving a lazy, sensual vibe. She holds a white Ibanez electric guitar, her right hand gently stroking the neck, left hand near the body, pose relaxed yet confident. Her gaze is direct, eyes carrying a defiant, focused intensity, as if just finished or about to perform. The background is industrial concert backstage: overhead metal beams, black acoustic foam-wrapped pipes, stage lights, one pipe labeled \"HammerFlex 250TD-36TK 019\". Concrete floor dark gray and rough, scattered with a black toolbox, orange caution tape, and folding chairs. Distant blurred metal structures and lights. Mid-shot composition, subject center-right, slight tilt for dynamic balance. Lighting from top stage lights, directional and soft, creating strong chiaroscuro on her face, arms, and guitar; shadows pooling on floor and surrounding structure. Overall monochrome palette with hints of metallic shine and red accents. High detail from micro-expressions to guitar texture to background complexity, capturing a raw, authentic behind-the-scenes moment with artistic tension.",
