        {
          "id": "krea2-a71848e14f04ba7fd74e61cb",
          "alias": "单女露胸白衬衫门害羞蹲脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman squats in the corner of a room with interior wooden walls, her long jet-black hair cascading over her shoulders. Her fair skin is flushed with a soft pink blush on her cheeks, and her clear eyes gaze into the lens with a hint of melancholy. Her lips are slightly parted, conveying a quiet aloofness. She wears only a white short-sleeve shirt, unbuttoned to expose her bare breasts, paired with a blue-and-white plaid suspender skirt that has a fluffy white pleated hem. White platform sneakers with lace-up bows complete the youthful look. Her hands are folded over her knees, fingers delicate, a thin silver bracelet on her wrist. Her body leans forward slightly, relaxed yet shy. The background features two light-brown wooden wall panels with prominent vertical grain, forming a corner; a metal door hinge is visible on the right wall. The floor is paved with cream marble tiles showing natural gray veining and subtle reflections. Soft, warm light falls from above left, casting gentle shadows behind her and on the floor, creating a natural chiaroscuro effect. The composition is slightly high-angle, with the woman centered just right of frame, her figure dominating the scene. Vertical lines of the walls draw the eye toward her. The overall palette is warm yellow and cream, accented by fresh blue plaid. The lighting is soft and delicate, with a slight grainy texture and low saturation, evoking a casual snap taken with a phone or simple camera. The atmosphere is serene and slightly lonely, capturing a moment of quiet waiting or reflection. The image feels both carefully composed and spontaneously real, full of everyday warmth and emotional depth, with a focus on her exposed chest and soulful eyes.",
