          "alias": "单女白浴袍雪地微笑过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman in exquisite Hanfu turns back with a sidelong glance, her jet-black hair styled in a classical bun adorned with pearls, blue hairpins, and pink blossoms, a small floral forehead ornament, delicate makeup with soft eyeshadow and pale pink lips, her gaze gentle and smiling with a hint of shy innocence. She wears a sheer white outer robe embroidered with tiny gold floral patterns, revealing a red bustier beneath, trimmed with pearl-beaded edges at the collar and cuffs, and a fluffy white fur cape over her shoulders, layered and textured. Her pose is elegant and natural, slightly turned with her head gently rotated, eyes locking with the viewer as if in silent communication. In the foreground, a thick tree trunk with clear bark texture covered in a thin layer of frost or snow, branches extending outward, creating a natural frame. The middle ground centers on her full figure, dominating the composition, while the background blurs into a lush green spring forest, tall trees with dense leaves, distant hills faintly visible. The composition uses the rule of thirds, with her positioned at the right third, leaving open space on the left, creating a sense of vastness. Shallow depth of field keeps her sharp, background softly blurred, guiding the eye from the foreground trunk to her and then into the greenery. Lighting is soft natural light from the front-left, evenly illuminating her face and clothes, producing delicate shadow transitions, rich in layers with balanced contrast. The atmosphere is tranquil, poetic, with classical beauty. Color palette is primarily white and green, accented with red and gold, harmonious with a dreamy touch. Texture is fine like a traditional painting yet retains photographic realism, creating a surreal, idyllic aesthetic—a time-traveling beauty in a spring snow forest, serene and moving. Shot with an 85mm portrait lens emulating professional camera effect, rich detail, true color reproduction, cinematic quality, meticulous composition, exquisite lighting, blending classical and modern artistic style, like a fairy stepping out of an ancient scroll with a hint of earthly warmth yet ethereal elegance.",
