          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a beige velvet sofa, wearing only a delicate lace camisole that has slipped completely off one shoulder, exposing her bare breast. Her cream-colored sweater lies pooled on the seat beside her, soft white feather trim catching the light. Dark brown hair is swept neatly to one side, glossy strands framing her sharp features. She gazes directly at the camera with calm, confident eyes, lips slightly parted in a knowing smile. Small pearl earrings glint at her ears. Her right leg is lifted high, pointed toe wrapped in a cream ballet shoe with crisscross straps and a bow at the ankle, sheer lace stockings clinging to her thigh, revealing the subtle curve of skin beneath. Her left leg bends, knee resting on the sofa cushion, body leaning forward with tension and grace. One hand rests lightly on the armrest, the other lies open on her thigh. The composition is a vertical portrait, the figure stretching diagonally from bottom left to top right, creating dynamic depth. Behind her, a tall black metal-framed window reveals a hazy winter snowscape; frozen lake and sky blur together in soft cold tones. Warm indoor light streams from the right, rimming her form in golden highlights, catching the edges of hair and skin. The palette is cream, beige, pale gray, with black and dark brown accents. Textures of plush velvet, delicate lace, fluffy feathers, and sheer hosiery create layered sensory richness. The lens is professional, shot at ISO 100, 1/125s, f/2.8, 85mm, focused sharply on her face and raised leg, with the background softly blurred. The mood is intimate, elegant, and subtly voyeuristic—a private moment captured in afternoon light, both dreamy and real, with a powerful sensual charge.",
