          "alias": "单女露胸黑西装酒店媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a luxurious hotel corridor, her long black hair falling naturally over her shoulders. She wears a black blazer, cut clean and reaching her knees, left open, revealing a sheer white satin slip dress beneath—the fabric is almost transparent, clinging to her bare skin, her nipples visible through the thin material, the skirt pooling wide around her feet. She is barefoot, her shoes discarded nearby. Her makeup is elegant: soft smoky eyes, pale lips, a confident, penetrating gaze straight into the lens. One hand rests at her side, the other lifts slightly, fingers long, a simple silver ring on one finger. Around her neck, a silver chain with a green gemstone tassel; small silver studs in her ears. The background is a warm-toned hotel corridor: cream walls with subtle texture, a geometric rug in brown and red with bamboo-like motifs. On the left wall, handwritten English: \"LEAVE SOMETHING FOR HER\" and at the lower right, a hand-drawn \"ACTION!\" with a film clapperboard. The composition is centered, the woman facing forward, with warm side-and-back lighting casting a golden rim on her hair and body, creating a soft, sensual silhouette. The image has a high-fashion yet amateur feel: slight grain, natural exposure, film-like texture, warm tone, moderate contrast, rich details—elegant but unmistakably explicit.",
