          "prompt": "A young blonde-haired blue-eyed woman, wearing only an open white academy-style jacket with black-and-white geometric trim on the lapels and cuffs, a small badge pinned to her chest, and a blue-white plaid pleated skirt — no shirt underneath, revealing her bare breasts and smooth skin. She sits on white brick steps, legs crossed (right over left), black sheer stockings hugging her long legs, and black chunky boots with high shafts that crease naturally. Her left hand gently strokes her cheek, fingers slightly curled, right hand rests on her knee. Golden hair falls in loose waves with soft pink ombre tips, shiny and layered. She looks directly at the camera with a shy, tender expression that holds a hint of invitation. Background is a clean white wall, no distractions. Soft overhead lighting highlights her face and clothing details, creating a bright, youthful atmosphere. Dominant colors: white, blue, black with accents of gold and pink. High-detail skin texture, every strand of hair visible, realistic fabric, giving a professional studio shot with a natural, candid feel.",
