        {
          "id": "krea2-ff17d6e012329a531bf27256",
          "alias": "单女露胸白衬衫城市忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a dimly lit indoor space, topless, with a loose white shirt unbuttoned and slipping off her shoulders, exposing her bare breasts. Her jet-black hair is slightly tousled, a few strands falling across her forehead. She wears thin-rimmed glasses, lenses reflecting faint cool light, her gaze intense and focused directly at the camera. Her lips are painted with a light red lipstick, standing out against the cold tones. Her left hand gently touches her hair, revealing a simple metal chain bracelet on her wrist; a small stud earring adorns her earlobe. She leans forward slightly, arms crossed over her knees, posture relaxed yet tense, as if lost in thought or deep concentration. In the foreground, an open laptop with a silver Apple logo emits a blue glow, illuminating her lower face and part of her arm. Beside it, a white mug with a simple pattern shows traces of coffee or tea, suggesting a late-night work or study session. The background features a blurred bed and pillow, light gray fabric in shadows, with vertical stripe curtains shrouded by night, creating an intimate, private space. Low-angle close-up composition, subject slightly left of center, with strong chiaroscuro from the laptop screen and side lighting. Cold blue tones dominate, with highlights on her face, hands, and fabric folds, shadows spreading outward. The lighting comes from the left front, defining her left profile while her right side fades into darkness, evoking a lonely yet focused atmosphere. The scene feels like a candid snapshot of an urban youth facing a screen late at night, blending technology with human warmth. Fine texture, low color saturation, emphasizing the purity and restraint of cool tones, bringing a calm, introspective, slightly melancholic mood.",
