          "alias": "单女露胸白连衣裙户外媚态坐持花",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a stone balustrade outdoors, wearing a translucent white lace dress with a plunging neckline that reveals her bare breasts and smooth skin, the skirt light and airy. A blue-and-gold graduation sash drapes across her shoulder, the golden trim catching the sunlight. She wears delicate silver necklace and earrings, her long black hair cascading in soft waves. She smiles, eyes warm and confident, holding a bouquet of white roses, blue hydrangeas, and greenery tied with a white ribbon bow. Her legs are elegantly crossed, silver glitter heels with pointed toes reveal her slender ankles. She leans forward slightly, one hand casually tugging the dress strap down, exposing more of her body. The background is a clear blue sky with distant city buildings, lush green bushes nearby, and a large blue sign with yellow number \"1\" and hashtag on the right. The composition centers her slightly left, the stone railing spans the bottom creating a stable frame. Light comes from upper right, warm and bright, casting clear shadows on her face, arms, and skirt, producing a three-dimensional effect. The sky softens to a pale blue gradient, echoing the blue in her sash and flowers. The overall atmosphere is youthful, celebratory, and sensual—fresh, bright, fine details, with professional lighting that feels candid. The focus is sharp on her face and the bouquet, with natural background blur, slight film grain and a hint of overexposure, giving a nostalgic, documentary feel. Balanced composition with visual lines from her pose, bouquet direction, and railing structure, drawing the eye to her, evoking a peaceful yet joyous graduation celebration infused with NSFW elegance.",
