          "prompt": "A young woman sits at an open-air street food stall in Vietnam, her light brown long wavy hair cascading over bare shoulders, a neat fringe above her brows, heavy eye makeup with bold eyeliner and thick lashes, natural glossy lips, fair luminous skin. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, a small black tattoo on her left shoulder. She gazes down at a bowl of pho, holding a bunch of fresh cilantro in her slender right hand, pink nail polish on her fingers, her left hand steadying a large white bowl filled with clear broth, thin rice noodles, and slices of rare beef, topped with scallions and cilantro, steam rising. On the table: a small red dish with spicy dipping sauce, two lime wedges and a red chili, a white bowl of pickled carrots and daikon, another bowl of fresh bean sprouts, a plate of lettuce and mint leaves, and crispy golden spring rolls. Background: a typical Vietnamese street-side eatery, blue walls with a red menu poster reading \"PHỞ HỒNG\" and opening hours, a stack of blue plastic crates and black helmets in the corner, staff visible in the back kitchen, a row of parked motorbikes on the right, gray awning casting dappled light, afternoon sunlight streaming from the right, casting long shadows on the ground and table. Close-up composition, subject centered slightly right, looking down at her food, foreground rich with ingredients and dishes, midground the woman and her meal, background the shop interior and street. Visual flow from the cilantro in her hand to the pho bowl, then to the condiments. Soft warm lighting, afternoon sunshine, overall color palette of white, green, red with blue and yellow accents, giving a casual everyday vibe like a phone snapshot with slight lens distortion and natural color saturation, detailed and atmospheric, capturing the smoky, lively feel of Southeast Asian street food.",
