        {
          "id": "krea2-881f36569936766712d6ba64",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑衬衫公寓媚态蹲注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a semi-squatting pose leans against a glossy black piano, her body revealingly clad in a transparent black chiffon blouse left open, exposing her bare breasts and nipples. She wears black-and-white houndstooth Dior brand panties and matching bra underneath—the bra now pushed aside—topped with sheer purple lace-edge thigh-high stockings. Her black hair is pulled up high in a sleek ponytail, with a few strands cascading naturally. Thin-rimmed glasses and delicate earrings frame her face. She stares straight at the camera with a cold, confident expression, left hand loosely holding a violin bow against the piano, right palm flat on the instrument's surface, dark nail polish on her fingers. The background is a smooth blue-gray gradient wall, evoking a futuristic, sterile studio. To the left stands a black Saiger violin case, its white logo gleaming. Mid-shot composition; the woman dominates the right side, creating an asymmetrical yet balanced layout. Foreground includes the piano edge and the bow; midground features the woman and violin case; background is the clean gradient. Soft light from the upper left creates strong chiaroscuro, casting subtle shadows across the floor and her body, emphasizing her curves and the textures of the translucent blouse and lace. The overall cool-toned lighting, dominated by blue and gray, imparts a mysterious, aloof atmosphere. Every detail—from the folds of the transparent fabric to the intricate lace of the stockings—is razor-sharp. Color contrast is bold: pure black-and-white punctuated by violet accents. The diagonal line of the violin bow dynamically echoes her tilted torso, enhancing tension. This is a high-fashion editorial shot, merging sleek commercial appeal with raw eroticism, exuding independence, confidence, and a cold, urban allure.",
