          "alias": "单女全裸米风衣机场媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands inside an airport boarding bridge, her chin-length dark brown hair with soft waves glowing in sunlight. She turns her head back, locking eyes with the camera—a clear, sultry gaze, lips parted into a teasing smile. Her features are sharp and elegant, skin porcelain-smooth. She wears a loose beige trench coat unbuttoned completely, hanging off her shoulders, revealing her naked chest with perky, pale breasts, nipples hardening in the cool air. Below, a white lace layered skirt hugs her hips, the hem frothy with delicate lace details, barely covering her ass. She sports sleek black knee-high boots with metal buckles, a brown quilted leather bag slung across her body, a fluffy pink flower keychain dangling. One hand tucked into her coat pocket, the other resting casually at her side. The boarding bridge interior features floor-to-ceiling X-shaped window frames, bright sunlight casting sharp geometric shadows on the dark grey floor. Through the glass, a white airplane and distant mountain silhouette are visible. The ceiling has white corrugated panels with fluorescent lights blending with natural daylight. In the background, blurred travelers walk. Composition: medium shot, subject slightly left, body angled, head turned—dynamic balance. Layers: sharp subject in foreground, boarding bridge corridor and windows in midground, tarmac and hills in background. Lighting warm and modern, color palette beige, white, pale blue, with brown and black accents. The mood is casually sensual, a stolen moment of travel intimacy, as if captured by a phone camera—realistic, detailed, effortlessly erotic.",
