          "id": "krea2-992eb6232cb532e421aa6820",
          "alias": "单女露胸灰短裤博物馆媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a round marble outdoor café table, her soft brown hair framing a delicate face with retro-style thin brown glasses. She wears a sheer white long-sleeve top, completely open and unbuttoned, revealing her bare breasts, and tight gray shorts that ride up. Her right hand supports her chin, one finger lightly touching her lips as she gazes to the left with a pensive, serene expression. She leans slightly forward, her body relaxed and natural, left hand resting on her thigh, a thin silver bracelet on her wrist. Her legs are crossed, feet on a black high stool, exuding a lazy but focused sensuality. In the foreground, the white marble table is smooth, with a black metal base. Behind, wooden shelves hold books and magazines with colorful covers (pink, orange, yellow) and clear titles like “Conseils”, “BAR”. To the right, a green “OPEN Welcome” sign in retro font with a hanging string. The background is a glass café window displaying books, paintings, and decor. An abstract art piece in red, blue, black with dynamic patterns, above it a poster: “BALZAC GALLERY Presents ascal Quennenen 'Fragments of Reality'”. A white canvas tote with “BALZAC” hangs inside. Glass reflects outdoor light and street views, adding depth. On the left, a red shopping bag with “HOME” text. Lower right, gold rail and red velvet rope hint at an open commercial space. Soft natural light from upper right casts gentle shadows, warm afternoon atmosphere. Composition centers the woman slightly right, perspective lines leading to her and the window. Foreground table and rear shelves create depth. Warm beige, cream, wood tones with red, blue, green accents. Vivid, detailed, like a candid film-photo with slight grain and natural exposure — a quiet, sensual urban moment, capturing the stillness of a woman deep in thought, her exposed body blending with the café’s literary charm.",
