          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a luxurious modern interior, her long jet-black hair with straight bangs framing her delicate, fair-skinned face. Her features are sharp and elegant, her gaze calm and slightly detached, staring directly at the camera. She exudes poised confidence. She wears a high-fashion halter-neck top made of sheer mesh, densely embroidered with tiny gold and champagne sequins that shimmer with every movement—exposing her bare breasts through the translucent fabric. Matching high-waisted A-line sequin skirt hugs her hips, the skirt hem ending just above mid-thigh, the dense circular sequins creating a rippling, light-catching effect. She lifts one hand to touch her hair, the other holds a small cream-colored square handbag with a gold metal clasp and double handles. On her feet, black open-toe stiletto heels with a thick, futuristic strap across the instep. Her body is turned slightly to the right, left leg bent, right leg straight, creating a natural, dynamic stance. Behind her, a large glass door with vertical stripes reflects blurred ambient light; the metal frame has two slender gold pulls. To the left, a pale gray stone-textured wall panel with a square metal switch plate. The floor is large white marble tiles with gold metal edging. Overall color palette: warm gold, cream, black, and soft gray. Composition is vertical, full-body shot from head to toe, with soft, warm front-top artificial lighting creating subtle shadows that accentuate the sequins' layering and the curves of her body. The image has a grainy film-like texture, slight overexposure, warm color grade, moderate contrast, giving an intimate, candid yet polished fashion moment. No watermarks or text. Focus sharp on her face and the shimmering ensemble.",
