        {
          "id": "krea2-c1f93518bc87fef33f47861a",
          "alias": "单女白泳装门媚态坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a traditional wooden longtail boat, wearing a white one-piece swimsuit with tiny pink and purple floral patterns. The swimsuit has a deep V-neckline with adjustable thin straps, clinging to her body to accentuate her elegant, sensual curves. Her long brown hair is braided into two neat pigtails resting on her chest, adorned with a white frangipani flower with a bright yellow center, contrasting softly with her skin. She stands sideways, tilting her head up slightly, looking to the right with a focused, tender gaze, lips slightly parted as if whispering or staring into the distance. Her hands rest naturally at her sides, fingers lightly touching the edge of her swimsuit, her pose relaxed and seductive. In the foreground, the cabin interior shows a beige cushioned seat with a geometrically patterned woven rug, next to a rattan basket filled with colorful flowers—pink roses, pale orange carnations, and white daisies—rich and natural in color. Behind her, the wooden planks and tall stern decoration are visible, topped with a garland of purple, blue, yellow, and white flowers. In the midground, the crystal-clear turquoise water ripples gently, reflecting sunlight and creating layered highlights. The background is a massive limestone cave, with steep, weathered rock walls and stalactites hanging from the ceiling, some areas shrouded in shadow, mysterious and deep. Bright daylight streams in from the cave entrance, illuminating the entire scene. The composition is a close-up of the woman with midground and background elements; she is positioned left of center, guiding the viewer’s gaze from her face to the depths of the cave on the right, creating visual flow. Light comes from the upper left, strong direct sunlight casting clear shadows on her face, arms, and swimsuit, while creating dramatic light-dark contrasts inside the cave, enhancing spatial depth. The overall atmosphere blends the romance of a tropical island with the grandeur of natural wonders, capturing the authentic feel of a travel photo with slight grain and true color saturation—a lifelike, intimate, and poetic summer vacation scene. Her swimsuit is slightly wet, clinging even tighter to her body, the deep V-neckline revealing her cleavage, the fabric translucent in places, hinting at her nipples beneath. The wet strands of hair and the slickness of her skin add a sensual, erotic edge.",
