          "prompt": "A young woman is captured in a sensual mid-close-up, topless with long dark brown wavy hair cascading over her shoulders, some strands framing her face with soft highlights. She wears an intricate black cat-ear headpiece adorned with silver chains and metal details. Her makeup is bold: sharp eyeliner, thick curled lashes, intense direct eye contact, and bright red lipstick, lips slightly parted. Around her neck are multiple layered silver necklaces, one with a dangling pendant. She raises one arm, clad in a sleek high-sheen black patent leather glove that reaches past her elbow, her hand gracefully positioned near her head. The rest of her upper body is completely nude, her breasts fully exposed, skin glowing under soft interior light. In the background, a wooden staircase with dark railings fades into blur, along with indistinct blue-purple posters and a distant figure operating a camera. The composition is centered slightly right, with strong foreground detail on her skin, jewelry, and glove reflections. The lighting creates smooth highlights on her face, hair, and chest, with subtle shadows adding depth. She wears a black headset microphone, the boom pointing toward her mouth, suggesting a live performance or hosting. The image has a slightly grainy, amateur-realistic quality, with uneven exposure, enhancing the authentic, candid feel of an intimate behind-the-scenes moment. The atmosphere is modern, futuristic, and charged with seductive tension, evoking a private idol meet-and-greet or rehearsal scene.",
