          "alias": "单女露胸黑靴子商店媚态站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless in front of a shop door on a city street, wearing only a pair of shiny black high-heel leather boots and a sheer purple velvet choker, her long black wavy hair cascading over her bare shoulders, soft sunlight glinting through her strands. She holds her smartphone high in her right hand, as if snapping a provocative selfie, while her left hand casually toys with the waistband of her black lace panties, her expression cold and confident, lips slightly parted, eyes locked on the lens. The foreground shows rough cement and a rusted metal planter with lush green leaves swaying in the breeze. The midground is the glass storefront with \"THE BEAD BAZAAR\" lettering, jewelry displays inside, and a UPS delivery notice taped to the door reading \"PLEASE LEAVE PACKAGES NEXT DOOR (either neighbor) 9544711087.\" The background is a textured beige stone wall with creeping vines and dry branches. The composition uses a rule of thirds: the nude woman occupies the right third, with negative space on the left. A harsh midday sun lights her right side, casting sharp shadows on the left wall and ground, creating a realistic street-photography aesthetic with slight lens distortion and fine grain, blending urban fashion, casual street snap, and vintage texture. Color palette: purple, black, beige, with moderate saturation and natural contrast. The overall mood is sensual, empowered, and candid—a stolen moment of urban allure and raw eroticism.",
