        {
          "id": "krea2-288c66d3a39083df3192dfc7",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔舞台微笑倚靠",
          "prompt": "A young Asian female figure skater glides gracefully across an indoor ice rink, wearing only a sheer white cropped sports top with her breasts fully visible through the fabric, nipples perking against the cloth, and a tiny blue denim hotpants that ride up her hips, revealing the curve of her bare ass cheeks. She wears white professional ice skates, her long legs sleek and smooth, pale skin luminous. Her black hair is tied in a high ponytail with a clip, a sweet smile on her lips, red and slightly parted, showing perfect white teeth. Her eyes are bright, focused, and full of life. Her left arm is raised high in an elegant arch, right arm hangs naturally with fingers painted bright red. Her body leans forward slightly, weight on her right leg, left leg bent backward in a graceful arabesque. The motion suggests a spinning or gliding freeze frame. Background is a blurred blue gradient ice surface with soft light spots and subtle scratch textures, creating a dreamy cool-toned atmosphere. Mid-shot composition, subject slightly left of center, body forming a beautiful diagonal line that draws the eye from her skates up to her face, emphasizing dynamic sensuality and youthful energy. Lighting from front and slightly above, uniform and soft, casting natural shadows that define her curves. Color palette dominated by whites and blues, with denim and red nail polish as accents, contrasting yet harmonious. Image has professional sharpness and realism, with slight natural grain from an amateur device, like a candid shot during informal practice or performance. Focus on full body, background blurred, highlighting her movement and erotic appeal. The scene exudes youth, vitality, and artistic sensuality—one can almost hear the scrape of blades on ice and feel the chill air. Visual flow is clear, emotion genuine, composition balanced and rhythmic, rich in detail and layers, blending professional artistry with intimate, authentic warmth.",
