        {
          "id": "krea2-1e046f3edd2dea17e5e4bea7",
          "alias": "单女半褪绿浴袍摄影棚忧伤坐跳舞",
          "prompt": "A young woman in ancient Chinese attire sits on a weathered wooden platform. She wears a loose, light green wide-sleeved robe over a cream-colored cross-collar inner garment, with a deep red brocade sash tied at her waist. The fabrics are rough, aged, with visible hand-stitched repairs; the outer sheer robe has slipped off one shoulder, baring her smooth shoulder and collarbone, the inner garment slightly pulled down, hinting at bare skin. Her hair is styled in a high bun, secured by a simple hairpin, with a few strands lightly falling across her forehead. Her face is delicate, eyes clear with a hint of melancholic longing and a subtle sensual gaze, lips slightly parted, skin fair and smooth. Her posture is elegant and calm, hands folded on her lap, fingers slightly apart, revealing a subtle, gentle tenderness. To the left, part of another figure's clothing is visible: a white base fabric with red floral embroidery, outlined in fine gold thread, a wide skirt that sways in the breeze. In the foreground, the wooden platform surface is mottled, worn, with clear grain, weathering, and moss and moisture at the edges. In the midground, the seated area is scattered with dead leaves and fine pebbles. The background is a lush vegetation-covered slope, with varying leaf shapes, some yellowing or withered. In the distance, vague tree trunks and vines intertwine, creating depth. The composition combines close-up and mid-shot, with the main figure slightly right of center. On the left, vertical calligraphy reads \"何不相渡\" in fluent brushstrokes, with varying ink intensity, and below it, small English text \"Dancing with the Tide\" in a simple, modern font. Overall color palette is cold green, gray-brown, with accents of red and white. The lighting is soft and even, coming from upper left, casting natural shadows on her face, hands, and clothing folds, enhancing three-dimensionality, with subtle reflections on the fabric highlighting texture. The atmosphere is serene, poetic, lonely yet sensual, as if frozen in an undisturbed moment. The image quality resembles a blend of professional studio and outdoor real scene, with focus on the figure's face and upper body, and background blurred appropriately, creating cinematic depth. Rich details, full layers, full of Eastern aesthetics with a sensual, intimate twist.",
