        {
          "id": "krea2-308916420f227f4d2b3625a2",
          "alias": "单女半褪金T恤沙发媚态脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges sideways on a beige fabric sofa, her long hair cascading freely. She wears a thin-strapped yellow tank top pulled taut, one strap slipping off her shoulder, and a colorful crochet mini skirt with geometric patches of pink, blue, yellow—hiked high enough to reveal bare thigh. One hand cradles her cheek, the other rests on her stomach; her gaze drops toward the lens with a lazy, contemplative sultriness. Sunlight streams through a window at left, casting sharp window-frame shadows across the sofa’s cushions and her skin. The light catches her face, bared arms, and the curve of her body, highlighting the delicate fabric textures and the shallow shadows that carve out her silhouette. On the right edge of frame, a hand grips a camera, suggesting an intimate photo session. Background: pale gray-beige wall with wooden molding, a traditional Persian rug in red and black beneath. Composition: tight close-up, her body forms a diagonal from lower-right (the photographer’s implied position) to upper-left, balancing the frame. Warm tones of cream, honey, and brown dominate, punctuated by the skirt’s rainbow hues. The mood is quiet, private, sensual—a candid moment caught in natural light, where her top threatens to reveal, and her pose invites a voyeuristic gaze.",
