          "alias": "单女白礼服衣帽间媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a cluttered dressing room, wearing a sheer white lace wedding dress with a plunging neckline that reveals the full curve of her breasts and bare shoulders. Her black hair falls naturally with blunt bangs, and a translucent veil drapes over her head, partially obscuring one eye. She wears lace gloves, one finger seductively peeling the glove off her other hand as she holds a white lipstick to her parted lips, the tip barely touching. Her gaze is direct and heavy-lidded, with a lazy, knowing smirk. She sits on a high metal-legged stool, legs crossed but the lace dress hiked up to expose her thigh and a white garter. The wooden vanity in the foreground is chaotic with open eyeshadow palettes, smeared lipsticks, powder compacts, and brushes, some spills of pink and gold powder. The background is a dim backstage area with a large mirror on the left reflecting blurred silhouettes of garments, and right side cluttered with white dresses, a blue jacket, and a brown leather jacket hanging and piled on the floor amid fabric scraps. Warm amber light from a softbox on the left side sculpts her torso and face, casting deep shadows on the right, creating strong chiaroscuro. The image emulates 1970s Kodak film: grainy, with low saturation, yellow-brown tint, vignetting, and subtle scratches. The overall mood is intimate, voyeuristic, and decadent—a bride lost in a sensual, private moment before the ceremony.",
