          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a vintage café booth, wearing only a gray sports bra pushed down to expose her bare breasts, paired with tight matching leggings. She leans slightly forward, her arms resting naturally on the round wooden table before her, posture relaxed and elegant. Her eyes gaze gently at the camera with a hint of shyness and composure, black hair falls loosely, soft bangs brushing her forehead. Her delicate facial features are refined, skin pale and smooth, face soft, lips slightly parted, exuding a quiet, captivating allure. In the foreground, the smooth dark brown solid wood tabletop shows natural grain and subtle reflections, with rounded edges and slender arched metal legs in brass finish, reflecting warm light. Midground features green velvet upholstered booth seating with vertical stripes, classic and comfortable, where she sits slightly turned toward the camera, legs naturally bent, smooth lines visible. Background is warm-toned wood paneling with vintage carved decorations, faintly showing a gold candlestick, picture frame, and blurred ornaments, creating a cozy nostalgic atmosphere. Close-up composition centers on her face and upper body, shallow depth of field blurs the background, emphasizing her. Visual flow follows her gaze and arm extension forming a diagonal from lower left to upper right, drawing focus to her facial expression. Lighting comes from soft natural light on the right, warm and even, illuminating her face and body with gentle shadow transitions. Overall mood is serene, intimate, and lifelike, as if capturing an afternoon sunlit café moment. The image has the realism of everyday amateur photography, rich in detail, moderate color saturation with a slight film grain texture, delivering a warm, earthy yet aesthetically pleasing visual experience.",
