          "id": "krea2-cea34673f58550e5b10da58c",
          "alias": "单女露胸金泳装废墟微笑坐戏水",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless in a brightly colored kayak, her bare chest exposed, with perky nipples catching the sunlight. She wears only a tiny yellow string bikini bottom tied at the hips, accentuating her slim waist. Her long dark brown hair is woven into two thick braids that fall over her breasts, with a small blue flower tucked behind her left ear. Silver hoop earrings dangle from her earlobes. She flashes a bright, carefree smile, white teeth visible, eyes sparkling with vitality as she looks directly at the camera. Her right hand gently lifts to brush a strand of hair from her forehead, while her left hand grips a silver-gray paddle, its black handle cutting diagonally across the bottom of the frame, creating a strong leading line. The kayak is white with green and orange decorative stripes; an orange-and-black life jacket rests inside the cockpit. The background is a vast tropical sea with water transitioning from shallow green to turquoise to deep blue, revealing sandy shoals and submerged rocks through the crystal-clear water. On the horizon, a small island covered in lush green vegetation rises, surrounded by a few vertical wooden posts or abandoned dock structures. The sky is a brilliant clear blue dotted with fluffy white cumulus clouds. Sunlight pours from the upper right, casting soft highlights and natural shadows across her face, arms, and skin. The water sparkles with dazzling reflections. Composition is central, with the woman slightly left of center, the kayak stretching diagonally toward the lower right, achieving visual balance. The foreground paddle and her hand are sharply detailed; the midground shows the full figure and kayak with nearby water; the background opens to the sea and distant island, creating depth. The overall mood is relaxed, joyful, and romantic, with a bright, warm, moderately saturated color palette, strong but natural contrast, appearing as a candid outdoor snapshot captured on a phone or standard camera—a genuine, documentary-style moment that blends artistic beauty with everyday life, evoking freedom, sun, youth, and the sea. No artificial traces remain; everything feels harmonious and natural, as if time froze for that smile and the memory of the ocean breeze.",
