        {
          "id": "krea2-f5a5f9ea04caa18b7b52ff8e",
          "alias": "单女露胸金毛衣街道媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a black iron railing in front of Wah Hing House on Pottinger Street, Central, Hong Kong. She wears only a light yellow knit short-sleeve top unbuttoned and open, with the matching flounced short skirt, white polka-dot thigh-high boots, black gloves, and a white headband. Her long hair falls freely, her body turned sideways, looking back at the camera with a lazy, playful expression. One hand rests on the railing, the other holds a small black diamond-stitched chain bag. Her bare breasts are fully exposed, nipples firm, skin lit by warm afternoon sunlight casting sharp shadows on the cobblestone street. The background shows a brown awning with \"LINQ\" and \"Heineken\" logos, dark glass doors, weathered walls, multiple air-conditioning units (Hitachi, Panasonic), and a signage reading \"厦大興華 WAH HING HOUSE 33-35 POTTINGER STREET\" with a graffiti-style drawing. The cobblestone street is gray, slightly stepped, with a staircase extending left, black metal railings. Composition: centered slightly right, low-angle shot enhancing her proportions and depth. Foreground: clear stone pavement and railing details. Midground: woman and shop entrance. Background: urban building layers. Lighting: direct midday/afternoon sun, strong contrast, warm glow on her skin and clothes, sharp shadow edges. Tones: warm yellow, cream, dark brown, with black and white accents. Grainy, realistic, candid street photography feel, as if snapped with a basic digital camera, conveying youthful sensuality, fashion, and urban culture.",
