        {
          "id": "krea2-1107b7e3e40a33ec9009b062",
          "alias": "单女紫泳装温泉微笑坐演奏",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at the edge of a steaming onsen, her body leaning slightly forward as she rests her chin on clasped hands. Her long, wet hair clings to her cheeks and shoulders, stray strands falling across her forehead, where a vivid red rose nestles—its petals plump and saturated, stark against her dark locks. She wears only a strapless deep-purple bikini top, the fabric taut over her full breasts, hinting at nipples beneath the sleek, damp material. A string of red-brown bead bracelets and a smooth white jade bangle circle her slender wrist, catching the soft light. Her skin is porcelain-pale, dewy, and luminous. She gazes directly into the lens with clear, tender eyes, lips slightly parted, a hint of a smile playing at the corners. Her face is soft yet sculpted, with a straight nose and fine features. The background is a dim stone grotto—rough, gray-brown walls streaked with water stains and moss, ancient and secluded. The onsen edge is built from natural, irregular stones ranging from pale yellow to deep brown, some wet with mist, reflecting faint highlights. The water is still, mirroring her silhouette and the blurred surroundings. In the midground, more rock formations and faint wooden support pillars suggest a cave or mountain spring. The composition is a tight close-up, with her figure slightly right of center, her head tilted, drawing the eye to her face and the red flower. The visual line runs from her gaze, through her hands, to the rose, creating a diagonal from lower left to upper right, adding motion and depth. Light comes from the front-side, soft and warm—like twilight—illuminating her face and shoulders, casting delicate highlights and shadows that emphasize skin texture and fabric folds, while deepening the gloom behind. The overall mood is intimate, silent, poetic. The palette is warm brown, muted purple, and gray-brown, punctuated by the red rose—romantic, languid, slightly mysterious. Details abound: water droplets falling from her hair ends, reflections on her jewelry, fine cracks in the stone, tiny ripples on the water. The scene feels audible—the trickle of water, distant echoes. The style blends fine-art photography with candid realism, mimicking a professional camera with a wide aperture in low light: sharp focus on her face and hands, with a soft bokeh background. Slight grain and film-like texture add vintage warmth. The image is immersive and narrative, evoking a tranquil night of relaxation in a mountain onsen, intimate and private, infused with East Asian aesthetic sensuality.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
