          "alias": "单女露胸白连衣裙街道温柔站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young topless woman stands on a sunlit city street, her long black hair cascading over her shoulders, strands swept by a gentle breeze. She smiles warmly, eyes clear and direct, looking straight at the camera. She wears a white collared dress with the top unbuttoned and pulled open, exposing her bare breasts, and a short brown suede jacket unzipped and hanging open at her sides. A wide brown leather belt with metal studs cinches her waist, adding a retro, edgy touch. Her left hand rests on her hip, her right hand holds a dark woven geometric handbag slung over her shoulder. Background: a black Porsche 911 parked on the right, other cars including a yellow police vehicle driving past, European-style building facades with cream walls and dark window frames, gray concrete road with clear lane markings and manhole covers. Strong late-afternoon sunlight from the upper right casts long shadows, leaving her left side in shadow and her right side brightly lit, creating a sculptural, high-contrast effect. Close-up portrait composition, slightly low angle, shallow depth of field with a blurred background. Warm color palette: browns, white, black, yellow. Natural, candid, slightly grainy photo aesthetic like a spontaneous smartphone or compact camera shot in London or New York, capturing an intimate, everyday moment of casual beauty.",
