        {
          "id": "krea2-c5df346935ca0ccba54aa69f",
          "alias": "单女半褪白毛衣街道微笑坐持包",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits by the window of an outdoor café, her soft light brown hair cascading over her bare shoulders, warm sunlight catching golden highlights in the strands. Her delicate features are framed with a gentle smile, eyes locking sensually with the lens, cheeks flushed with a healthy glow. She wears a creamy white oversized knit cardigan, slipped off one shoulder, exposing a slender collarbone and the curve of her breast, with only a thin white high-neck top clinging beneath. A fine chain necklace rests against her skin, drawing the eye downward. Her left hand rests lightly on her thigh, while her right hand holds wooden chopsticks, poised to eat. Her legs are sheathed in nude thigh-highs with subtle white polka dots, one knee slightly parted in a relaxed, inviting pose. In the foreground, a dark wood tray holds two matcha drinks—a clear glass latte and a thick matcha foam topped with crushed nuts and green powder—alongside a small white dessert and black sesame cubes. A pink leather handbag sits beside the tray, adding a soft pop of color. The mid-ground shows the café's glass door and dark wood frame, reflections of the street blurring within. Behind her, a quiet street lined with hexagonal stone pavers and red-and-white bollards stretches into dappled sunlight filtering through leafy trees. The sky is clear blue, light warm and golden. Composition is centered with her slightly left, leading the eye to her face, the chopsticks, and her exposed skin. Shadows from the right highlight the texture of her hair, the knit of the cardigan, and the curve of her body, creating a vivid, intimate sense of everyday sensuality. She looks as if she just paused in a lazy afternoon, the air thick with tea scent and subtle invitation.",
