          "prompt": "A blonde woman stands on a Parisian rooftop terrace, topless except for a sheer crimson scarf loosely draped around her shoulders, her bare breasts fully exposed, nipples visible, the red fabric sliding off one side. She wears a tight red miniskirt with a high slit, clinging to her hips, accentuating her curves, the hem barely covering her upper thighs. She steps forward in black stiletto heels with sparkling ankle straps, one leg extended, creating an elegant S-curve. Her right hand holds a black rhinestone-studded clutch, left hand resting on the black wrought-iron railing. She gazes directly at the camera, expression cool and detached, golden hair falling in soft waves, a silver tassel earring catching the light. The low-angle shot makes her appear taller, the warm golden-hour sunlight streaming from the right, casting soft shadows across her body and the dark grey floor. The foreground shows the railing with geometric cutouts; the background features the iconic Paris skyline with cream rooftops and spires, the sky a gradient from pale blue to warm amber near the horizon. The scene feels luxurious and intimate, a high-fashion editorial moment with a raw, sensual edge.",
