          "prompt": "A young woman crouches beside a wooden café table, wearing a white ruffled blouse unbuttoned to reveal her bare breasts and a tiny white miniskirt, paired with brown cowboy boots and a red shiny handbag. A colorful beaded bracelet hangs on her left wrist, while her right hand holds a vintage silver film camera aimed directly at the viewer. Her gaze is focused and soft, with natural makeup and glossy lips slightly parted, expression playful and curious. Her brown hair is half-up with loose strands around her face, skin fair and luminous. In the foreground is a close-up of her body and the camera, the midground includes the wooden table with an iced coffee, purple phone case, and a tray. The background shows a glass display case with pastries, a staff member in black uniform wearing a pink floral mask, metal faucets and shelves behind the counter, and large windows revealing leafy outdoor scenery. The ceiling is dark gray with warm pendant lights, floor is dark marble tile. Centered slightly left composition, camera lens points toward viewer as a visual lead. Soft warm light from window and indoor lamps creates a realistic, everyday calm atmosphere. Color palette dominated by white, brown, red, with accents of black and green. Fine texture with slight grain and natural light transitions, like a casual snapshot from a digital camera or phone. The scene feels both like a styled fashion shoot and a candid moment, exuding youthful energy, individuality, and urban lifestyle with a sensual twist.",
