          "id": "krea2-b7879b6f4586e52486278bed",
          "alias": "单女旗袍茶室困倦坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A young woman with purple hair, wearing an exquisite modified Chinese cheongsam, sits on a beige woven round cushion on a tatami mat. She has red-and-white gradient horn accessories on her head, giving her a demi-human or fantasy character look. Her body leans slightly back, left leg bent and raised, right leg extended gracefully. Her right hand gently holds a beige ceramic sake cup. She wears gold wrist guards and arm rings. The cheongsam is deep blue velvet, high-collared, with a sheer or cutout chest detail, red embroidered floral patterns and gold motifs at the edges, and thin black straps connecting at the shoulders and waist. Her short purple hair has bangs, and her makeup is refined: pink-purple eyeshadow, full lips. Her eyes look slightly dreamy and seductive toward the camera. The background is a traditional Japanese or Chinese interior: light beige walls, a large wooden lattice window with intricate dark brown frames, soft natural light filtering in, and blurred green plants visible outside. On the left, a white flower arrangement in a ceramic vase with thin branches. The floor is covered in dark brown tatami mats with clear texture, and a small section of dark wooden floor appears at the bottom. The composition is a mid-shot, with the figure slightly left of center, creating visual focus. Diagonal lines lead from the lower left to the subject. Layers are created by the foreground cushion, the window, and the background floral arrangement. Light comes from the side and back, soft and even, casting delicate shadows on her face, arms, and clothing, highlighting the velvet texture and sheen. The color palette is warm brown, deep blue, purple, and red with white accents—harmonious yet contrasting. The overall atmosphere is serene, mysterious, and Eastern fantasy, as if capturing a quiet moment in a traditional tea room, with strong artistic and narrative quality, like a professional portrait but retaining an intimate, everyday feel, dreamlike and emotionally charged.",
