          "id": "krea2-fbd8322aa48e1f973205c833",
          "alias": "单女露胸街道媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a wooden high stool, her bare breasts fully exposed, wearing only white strappy sandals, her black hair piled into a messy bun, a pink flower necklace resting between her breasts, holding a glass of fresh orange juice in one hand. Her gaze drops slightly toward the camera with a relaxed, sultry expression, body tilted, right leg crossed over left, left hand gently cupping the glass, right hand hanging loosely by her side. She is positioned center-left in the frame, creating a clear focal point, in front of a lush street juice stall covered in hanging vines and pink flowers, the dark wood wall covered with handwritten menu cards saying “JUICES”, “fresh fruit juices”, “no water no sugar”, and below the counter are lemons, pineapples, carrots, bottled drinks, along with a QR code sign. The entire scene is surrounded by heavy tropical greenery—potted monstera, ivy, spider plants—rising from floor to wall. Center composition with natural framing from the plants, depth created by the near-large stool and figure, midground stall with details, background plant wall providing environmental depth. Lighting from above right, sunlight filtering through leaves casting dappled shadows across her skin, face, and clothing details, soft chiaroscuro with shadows falling on the left ground and wall. Dominant green tones accented by the orange drink and pink flowers, a relaxed, carefree summer afternoon atmosphere, fine film grain and slight overexposure mimicking a natural mobile phone photo, background softly blurred to keep focus on her nude torso while preserving stall details. The visual flow runs from her face and down her bare chest to the glass, then guided upward to the upper right corner, drawn back by the vine branches, creating a circular viewing path. The overall style is chic yet natural, like a carefully composed but unposed street snap, radiating youth, freedom, and sensual confidence.",
