          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a vintage brown velvet armchair, her long jet-black hair with bangs pinned by a small white bow clip, her gaze calm and melancholic, staring directly at the camera. Her fair, delicate skin has refined natural makeup, lips pale with a hint of rosy flush. She wears a cream-white puff-sleeve blouse, unbuttoned to expose her full, bare breasts with visible nipples, the fabric falling open. Over it, a loose camel knit cardigan is slipping off one shoulder. A dark green plaid miniskirt hugs her hips, white lace-trimmed socks and black Mary Jane shoes on her feet. She holds a silver vintage film camera in both hands, gently cradling it, her pose elegant and focused. In the foreground: the camera and her hands. Midground: the armchair with scattered items—a plush teddy bear, small dolls, an open book, and assorted clutter. Background: a beige polka-dot curtain, more teddy bears on the windowsill, a makeup mirror with ring light on the right, casting soft reflections. Warm amber light slants from the left window, creating gentle chiaroscuro on her body, with dust motes floating in the air. The composition is centrally symmetrical, drawing the eye to her face and the camera, while the toys and mirror add depth. The scene exudes a private, everyday intimacy and an artistic, retro atmosphere, like a candid moment from a quiet afternoon. Color palette: warm yellow, cream, camel, accented by dark green and black. Soft, layered light with film-grain texture and slight overexposure at edges. Overall aesthetic blends Japanese girly style with vintage photography, reminiscent of a precious life fragment captured by an old camera—full of narrative and emotional tension. Details rich yet uncluttered: fabric textures, softness of plush toys, knitting of cardigan, reflections on the camera body—all sharp and immersive, as if you can feel the room’s temperature and a faint scent in the air. The composition is stable with breathing space, natural visual flow, drawing the viewer deep into the moment.",
