        {
          "id": "krea2-bb31a071296e1f565de66ed8",
          "alias": "单女白长裤室内专注站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A long-haired woman stands with her back to the camera in an ornate indoor space with decorative ceilings and retro archways. Her pose is elegant and dynamic, body slightly turned, head looking back, eyes focused with intense emotion. She wears a black off-shoulder top with wide ruffled sleeves that drape naturally, contrasting sharply with white lace-textured high-waist pants that hug her legs, accentuating smooth, curving contours. Black high-heeled boots with straight shafts and tall heels complete the look, blending fashion-forward style with theatrical tension. Her hair is deep brown, naturally curly, cascading over her shoulders, topped with a simple silver hair accessory that glints softly under the dim lighting, adding a touch of refinement and mystery. The figure occupies the center-right of the foreground, captured from a low-angle upward perspective that emphasizes her proportions and presence. The background shows a social gathering, people mingling in small groups, some holding drinks, dressed in styles ranging from casual to semi-formal, creating a relaxed yet classy party atmosphere. Wooden floors reflect warm light, glistening with a polished sheen. Intricate geometric patterns and metal beams on the ceiling form a visual framework, enhancing spatial depth and architectural beauty. Lighting comes mainly from overhead spotlights and ambient sources, creating soft shadow transitions. Purple and orange-yellow light intermingle in the air, producing a hazy glow, with dust or smoke particles catching the beams, adding layering and realism. The overall scene evokes a private, story-filled night party vibe, shot like an old camera’s candid record—slight grain and film texture, moderate saturation with a slightly oppressive tone, emphasizing the subject’s emotional expression. Composition uses blurred and out-of-focus background figures to guide the viewer’s gaze naturally to the central woman. The right edge of the frame cuts off some people, adding a sense of dynamic capture. The atmosphere balances everyday spontaneity with art-photographic narrative depth, presenting a unique aesthetic between reality and imagination.",
