        {
          "id": "krea2-d9bbb6db09b569f3303a89d4",
          "alias": "单女露胸短裙椅上媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in exquisite ancient Chinese attire sits gracefully on a dark wooden bench, her long black hair loose with a few strands falling across her forehead. Her eyes are clear and slightly lazy, red lips parted in a playful, seductive expression. Gold hair ornaments and red tassels adorn her black locks, small pearl earrings dangle from her ears. She wears a black-and-white off-shoulder top, the fabric slipping down to reveal the curve of her bare breasts, with gold floral embroidery and a red sash tied at her waist. Her long skirt flows around her, sheer nude stockings covering her legs, black high heels on her feet. Her right hand, clad in a white glove, lifts gently with palm up as if casting a spell; her left hand rests at her side, a celadon jade bangle on her wrist. Around her, pink fluffy bunny plushies and scattered flowers lie amid swirling smoke and drifting petals. Behind her, a wooden wall with two vertical calligraphy scrolls, bold ink characters visible, and a large circular halo of soft white light like a moon, surrounded by curling mist. The foreground shows a low wooden platform with thin fog, pink lotuses floating, a small pink rabbit resting on the left, and a long red silk ribbon cascading from the bench, swaying gently. The composition centers her slightly left, with the scrolls and moon as background. Warm backlighting outlines her figure, with soft side light on her face and body, creating a chiaroscuro effect. The atmosphere is serene, mystical, with floating smoke and gold dust, evoking a dreamlike, ethereal East Asian aesthetic. The shot is a medium angle, slightly low, emphasizing her noble yet sensual presence. Colors are black, white, red, gold with touches of lavender, pink, and jade. Her bare shoulder and hint of exposed nipple add an intimate, NSFW edge to this classical fantasy scene.",
