          "alias": "单女露胸舞台困倦倚靠举手",
          "prompt": "A young female figure skater spinning gracefully on a dark stage, topless, wearing only a red velvet miniskirt with black satin and silver trim, a black lace choker, and white figure skates. Her right arm hangs naturally, left hand raised with fingers slightly spread, body leaning forward, left leg bent and lifted, right leg supporting, skates pointed with blades glinting. Her dark hair flies wildly, straight bangs across the forehead, red lipstick, intense and focused gaze directly into the lens. Black lace choker tight around the neck. Pure black background with soft red bokeh lights far behind, creating a dreamy atmosphere. Center-left composition, S-curve silhouette emphasizing motion and sensual tension. Front top spotlight illuminates her bare breasts and face, casting strong shadows, right side of body darker for depth. High contrast, dominant red tones, black backdrop, stark white skates. Crisp textures, professional studio quality with live performance energy, capturing the raw blend of athletic power and erotic elegance, like a cinematic freeze of passion and grace.",
