          "id": "krea2-6607cdb05bdc2401c347cd92",
          "alias": "单女露胸金毛衣酒店俏皮坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a black velvet ottoman in a hotel room, her warm yellow sweater unbuttoned and slipping off her shoulders, revealing her bare breasts. The soft, fluffy knit frames her skin, with the ribbed cuff and hem details visible. The edge of her black sequin miniskirt peeks from under the sweater, barely covering her hips. She wears black sheer stockings and black patent leather stiletto heels with metal studs and an ankle strap, adding a retro-punk touch. Her long brown curly hair falls naturally, topped with two black bow hair ties forming playful double ponytails. She stares directly into the camera with a lazy, confident expression. Her left hand rests on her knee, fingers painted blue, while her right hand casually touches the nightstand. Beside her sits a glossy black square handbag with visible metal zipper and handle. Background: a luxury hotel corner with beige textured walls, classic crown molding, an embedded AC vent, and wooden paneling. The bed is neatly made with white pillows contrasting against a dark headboard. The floor has a light abstract-patterned carpet. Warm overhead yellow lighting creates soft shadows and a cozy, intimate atmosphere. Mid-shot composition: the woman is slightly left of center, her body tilted, legs crossed and extending to the lower right, creating visual leading lines. The foreground emphasizes the velvet ottoman’s thick texture and button tufting. Midground holds her and the handbag. Background includes the bed, wall, and partial furniture outlines. Soft top and side lighting sculpt her curves and the fabric details, giving a candid, effortless fashion snapshot feel—as if shot with an amateur camera, real and spontaneous. The color palette is warm yellow, black, and beige, harmonious and emotionally resonant.",
