        {
          "id": "krea2-89002c69bf18828f0a2ea963",
          "alias": "单女短裤雪地害羞跪脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman kneels on a soft white long-pile rug, her glossy black curly hair cascading over bare shoulders. Her skin is fair and smooth, with delicate makeup, soft eyes, pink lips, and a gentle, slightly shy gaze toward the camera as she tilts her head. She wears nothing but a white fluffy off-shoulder cropped top and matching shorts—both partially unbuttoned, revealing her neck, collarbone, slender arms, and long bare legs. Her hands cradle a pale yellow teddy bear with blushed cheeks and a black patterned ribbon. Behind her stands a decorated Christmas tree with red ball lights, shiny ornaments, and white artificial snow. Nearby are red-wrapped gifts with white bows, a brown teddy bear, and a cream curtain against deep red drapery. A lit candle in the lower left casts warm orange light, illuminating the scene. Soft light falls from the left, creating natural chiaroscuro, emphasizing her curves and the texture of the rug. The composition is centered with the woman slightly right, foreground rug and candle, midground her and the bear, background tree and gifts. Warm, dreamy holiday atmosphere with white, red, and gold tones. Professional high-definition photo with wide aperture, rich details, and moderate saturation, evoking sensual festive intimacy.",
