          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a dressing room, wearing a daringly low-cut gold sequin dress that barely covers her full, exposed breasts—the fabric clinging to her curves, with red and green gemstones adorning the dress and a few placed directly on her bare skin. Her black hair falls over her shoulders, makeup heavy with dark eyeliner and bright red lips, her gaze locked on the viewer, confident and seductive. Her body is slightly tilted, right arm extended forward, left hand resting on a pink fluffy object. The dress's metallic sheen reflects warm ring light from the vanity mirror, creating dramatic highlights on her cleavage and along her thighs. In the foreground, soft pink fabric adds texture. The background shows a mirror with circular ring lights, blurred vanity with cosmetics and scattered jewelry, shallow depth of field emphasizing her from chest to thigh. Warm gold and brown tones dominate, with cool red and green gem accents. The scene feels like a private, luxurious moment backstage—sensual, glittering, and intimate, as if captured just before a grand performance. High-end fashion photography with soft, focused lighting and a rich, tactile atmosphere.",
