          "prompt": "A young woman lounges topless on a pale grey floor, her bare skin catching soft light. She wears only a grey-blue and beige diamond-pattern knit cardigan unbuttoned, a matching long-sleeve top discarded, and a khaki skirt hiked up, white sneakers and grey mid-calf socks still on. One leg straight, one bent, right hand propping her up, left hand resting on her knee. She gazes calmly at the lens with a detached, sensual expression. Her deep chestnut hair falls in glossy waves, makeup refined but natural, lips a soft nude. Behind her, a warm wood vintage chest holds an old silver CRT TV, stacked books in red, green, blue, a pink storage box, a small sculpture, a white thermos with black lid, a gold sphere, and an exposed-bulb lamp under glass. An empty wooden hanger dangles from the chest. A two-tier open bookshelf on the left displays colorful books. Soft diffused light from above creates gentle shadows, no harsh contrast. Centered composition: body in lower frame, lines extending left and right. Visual flow from face down legs up to objects. Tones of grey, blue, brown, beige. High-res cinematic stillness, nostalgic and intimate, a quiet moment of time and memory.",
