          "alias": "单女露胸绿衬衫沙发专注坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits outdoors on a plaid sofa, her long black hair with silver-gray highlights cascading over her shoulders, ends lightly curled. She looks directly at the camera with clear, focused eyes, defined brows, fine eyeliner, thick lashes, subtle shimmery eyeshadow, straight nose, full lips in pale pink lipstick. Her skin is fair and glowing with a healthy sheen. She wears a loose green short-sleeve shirt, fully unbuttoned and open, exposing her bare breasts and a blue lace cami strap slipping off one shoulder. The left chest pocket bears 'MIU MIU' logo. She wears a beige high-waisted shorts, loose fabric falling in soft folds. Her legs are crossed, right over left, with her left hand resting on her inner thigh, fingers spread, nails polished pale. Her right hand rests on the sofa edge. On her feet are white thick-sole loafers with metal buckle, paired with gray mid-calf socks, slight wrinkles at the ankle. She sits on a cream and light-yellow plaid sofa made of plush blocks with visible stitching. The sofa is on lush green grass; the background is dense forest with tall trees, layered green leaves. Sunlight filters through the trees, casting dappled light and shadows from the left, illuminating her face, arms, and legs, with clear shadows on the ground and sofa. Center composition, subject centered, background blurred, shallow depth of field. Visual focus on her face and upper body. Overall atmosphere fresh and summery with warm, soft light. Color palette: green, beige, blue, white. Professional camera quality, cinematic texture, artistic yet candid.",
