          "alias": "单女湿身红泳装温泉沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits by the edge of a hot spring, wearing a sheer wet red long-sleeve swimsuit that clings to her every curve, the translucent fabric revealing her nipples and the outline of her body. Her deep brown hair is naturally curly, adorned with a vivid red flower. Her makeup is delicate with soft eyeshadow and full red lips, her gaze gentle as she looks toward the camera. Her right hand rests lightly on her cheek, fingers slender with shimmering silver nail polish, her left hand casually draped on the pool edge. She leans slightly forward, showcasing her elegant curves and the smooth texture of her wet skin. In the foreground, the dark gray marble edge of the hot spring is wet and reflective, with fine water droplets. A woven bamboo basket sits nearby, containing two cans of Coca-Cola, a plate of snacks, and colorful candies. Next to the basket is a rustic clay vase, round and earthy brown. In the background, a large floor-to-ceiling glass window reveals a misty mountain view, with faint trees and hazy peaks under a pale gray sky. Soft white sheer curtains drift gently in the breeze, creating a calm, intimate atmosphere. The composition combines close-up and medium shots, with the woman positioned slightly right of center, leaving space on the left for environmental details. The angle is slightly downward, enhancing the sense of presence. Lighting is soft natural light from outside, with a contrast between cool grays and warm reds, the red swimsuit drawing the eye. The background is blurred to emphasize the subject, giving depth. The scene feels like an upscale resort's outdoor hot spring, captured with a professional camera and a large aperture lens, producing high resolution, low noise, balanced saturation, a slight film grain, and natural exposure transitions. The overall mood is quiet and warm, blending modern luxury with natural relaxation, as if time has stopped for a moment of serene beauty.",
