        {
          "id": "krea2-f3b339a0a3c0af3f26d9ed8d",
          "alias": "单女黑挂脖室内媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman in a low-cut black halter dress stands center frame, her glossy black hair cascading over bare shoulders. She wears flawless makeup, full lips slightly parted, eyes locked on the camera with a sultry, confident gaze. A gold chain bracelet glints on her right wrist; her hands lightly grip a black leather handbag adorned with black feather trim and gold buckle. The dress reveals deep cleavage and a slit up the thigh, showcasing long legs in sheer black fishnet stockings with geometric cutouts and stiletto heels. She poses with a slight twist, leaning forward, exuding a poised yet sensual aura. In the foreground, multiple large reflective gold spheres of varying sizes scatter across the floor, framing the composition with mirrored highlights. She stands in the center-upper frame against a classical European interior with pale gray walls, green-trimmed wooden panel doors, and tall floor-to-ceiling windows trimmed in gold, letting in soft natural light. Modern mirrored display stands with silver-black accents hold shoes and accessories in the background. Lighting from the right window creates soft shadows across her curves and face, while the gold spheres cast bright specular reflections. The scene is rich in black, gold, white, green, and gray tones, exuding luxury, elegance, and seductive high-fashion refinement. Shallow depth of field blurs the background slightly, emphasizing her as the focal point. Shot as if with a professional camera and wide aperture, crisp details on skin, fabric, and accessories. The mood is sophisticated, sensual, and artfully commercial, suitable for an exclusive adult luxury editorial.",
