          "id": "krea2-dad39c7e4435fd311ce299ed",
          "alias": "单女露胸金T恤温室媚态站立演奏",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a greenhouse surrounded by tropical plants, wearing a pale yellow ruffled tank top long dress with a deep V-neckline that plunges to her waist, fully exposing her bare breasts, the thin fabric barely covering her nipples, one strap slipped off her shoulder, causing the dress to hang precariously, revealing her side. She stands slightly turned, left hand naturally down, right hand playing with her hair, fingers long, posture relaxed yet sensual. She smiles sweetly, eyes bright and clear, gazing directly at the camera. Her black hair is styled in a low bun adorned with small white flowers, a few tendrils falling. Her facial features are clear, skin fair and glowing, makeup subtle enhancing natural beauty. Background: a large light gray photography reflector with slight wrinkles, reflecting soft light. Left side visible professional equipment: silver metal stand, black softbox, cables. Dense tropical vegetation: tall palm trunks, broad feathery leaves, ferns layered, hanging orchids and vines, some leaves yellowing at edges. Lighting from above and side creates chiaroscuro, soft natural light casting fine shadows, warm and fresh atmosphere. Medium shot, subject slightly right of center, body slightly tilted for dynamic balance. Foreground: plants and equipment parts; midground: subject and reflector; background: lush greenery and blurred greenhouse structure. Visual flow from face and eyes to viewer, then to layered vegetation. Light direction from upper left, soft and even, simulating daylight through glass roof. Color palette: green, pale yellow, gray, metallic. Image quality delicate, strong sense of presence and documentary style, blending professional studio precision with outdoor natural vitality. Composition full but not crowded, with appropriate negative space. The subject and environment closely connected, interaction natural. Overall mood relaxed, joyful, vibrant, with a hint of fairy-tale romance, like a carefully arranged garden theater. Light transitions smooth, details clear: fabric folds, hair shine, plant textures, metal reflections. All elements combine realism and artistry.",
