        {
          "id": "krea2-fe2949e204124b04c1cadf56",
          "alias": "单女透视米毛衣乡村戏谑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in front of a Japanese rural railway crossing, her long black hair and blunt bangs framing her pale skin. She wears a gentle, teasing smile, eyes playfully seductive yet shy as she looks toward the camera. Her arms are placed behind her back, pushing her chest forward, her cream-colored chunky knit cardigan unbuttoned to reveal a sheer black lace bralette and the soft swell of her cleavage. The fluffy light-brown faux-fur collar brushes against her exposed collarbone. She wears a black miniskirt, black sheer stockings, and simple black flats. In one hand she holds a bright red velvet handbag with silver hardware, in the other a green crossbody bag with a white rabbit plush keychain. The foreground shows railway tracks and yellow-and-black warning barriers; the midground has a signal pole and small signs. The background features low Japanese houses, rolling hills, and a warm sunset. Golden backlighting creates a glowing halo around her hair and shoulders. The scene is cinematic, nostalgic, and sensual, capturing a moment of quiet erotic tension in the countryside.",
