        {
          "id": "krea2-ce64787337356c793d0c736c",
          "alias": "单女白外套海滩害羞站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a seaside observation deck, wearing a fluffy white quilted down jacket, its high collar wrapped around her neck, the fabric featuring subtle jacquard patterns for a refined texture. Beneath it, she wears only a white lace bralette, her chest partially revealed through the open jacket, with a sheer white ruffled mini skirt layered over bare legs. Her head is topped with a light beige knit beanie, black hair cascading from under it, framing her face. She turns slightly, glancing back at the camera with a soft, shy expression, her right hand gently touching the brim of the beanie. A pale blue leather square handbag hangs from her left shoulder, its metal clasp and tassel details contrasting with the white-blue palette. In the foreground, a gray concrete low wall with geometric cutouts, a small section of a modern black chair visible to the right. Midground, a winding wooden fence, trimmed shrubs, and potted bonsai pines. The ground is covered in fine sand. In the distance, waves roll, white foam hitting the shoreline; the sky is clear, soft pale blue. Bright, even natural light from upper right casts soft shadows on her face and clothing, creating subtle chiaroscuro. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with the figure placed right, gaze leading to the open sea. Background blur is moderate, preserving environmental details. The color palette is white, light blue, gray-brown, evoking a quiet, cool yet warm atmosphere. The image has a realistic, slightly grainy feel, like a candid moment on an ordinary winter afternoon, with a sense of youthful poetry and serene healing. The scene is infused with a gentle eroticism as her open jacket and bralette hint at exposed skin, and her soft, shy gaze invites intimacy.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
