          "prompt": "A young woman lounges naked on the left side of a cream fabric sofa, her long jet-black hair with straight bangs cascading over her shoulders, her soft profile tilted upward as she gazes to the right with a dreamy, half-smile. Her left hand delicately holds a single white orchid against her bare chest, fingers long and slender. A white knit cardigan lies discarded beside her, while a white slip dress pools at her waist, leaving her torso fully exposed. She leans back into the sofa, legs partially obscured by two brown leopard-print pillows, one resting against her thigh. The sofa's fine fabric texture shows in warm cream tones. To the right, a tall floor lamp with a cream conical shade and gold metal stem casts a soft amber glow. Behind, two tall gray louvered blinds reveal green trees and dappled sunlight filtering through the horizontal slats, creating interplay of light and shadow. The dark gray window frames blend into the wall for a modern minimalist interior. Medium shot, subject left of frame, gaze leading upper right for visual extension. Camera at eye level, slightly tilted for dynamic life-likeness. Warm, soft natural light from outside merges with indoor lamp, creating layered transitions. Palette dominated by cream, gray, brown, gold. This is a quiet, intimate, slightly artistic home scene with a film-like feel—medium saturation, clear but not too sharp details, as if shot on a medium-format film camera or high-end compact camera, evoking everyday warmth and authenticity. Subtle lens distortion and grain at edges enhance the documentary quality. Ample negative space allows subject and environment to coexist harmoniously, capturing a serene, beautifully erotic moment.",
