        {
          "id": "krea2-47feccac8222af4a9ff859a3",
          "alias": "单女全裸拳击黑内衣城市媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the center of a boxing ring, her long black curls cascading naturally, her skin pale and flawless. Her sharp, delicate features are set in a cold, confident stare directly into the camera, lips slightly parted, with metallic-shine makeup that catches the light. She wears a tight black shiny sports bra and shorts, the chest printed with \"EYESON 12\" in white and red, the fabric gleaming under overhead lamps, accentuating every muscular curve. Her hands are wrapped in red-and-black Pretorian boxing gloves, visible tattoos on her arms adding a rebellious edge. Long, toned legs in sheer nude stockings, barefoot, stand with balanced power. She leans slightly forward, hands resting on the warm yellow ring ropes, body tensed mid-motion — either preparing to fight or just finishing training. In the foreground, a black-white-red boxing helmet lies upside-down on the dark blue mat, scuffed and branded, hinting at real training wear. The ring posts are padded in yellow with \"PUNCHBEAR\" lettering; the ropes are soft yellow with black edge strips, sturdy and layered. The ring floor is dark blue anti-slip mat with a faded white logo. The background: a dim gym interior with high industrial ceiling, metal beams and pipes, vintage pendant lamps casting warm yellow light, creating strong chiaroscuro. Blurred fitness equipment, red plastic chairs, and wall decorations recede into shadow, drawing focus to her. The low-angle shot makes her appear taller, more imposing. Composition uses the ring's horizontal lines and vertical posts to frame her, geometric divisions adding depth and structure. Light comes from a warm yellow spotlight above left, striking sharp highlights on her face, arms, legs, and gloves, casting long shadows on the mat and floor, amplifying volume and spatial layering. Overall palette: black, yellow, red, with cool grays and metallic tones, blending modern and retro cyberpunk aesthetics. The mood fuses strength, sensual allure, and gritty urban edge, as if snatched by an amateur photographer with a pro camera in dim light — slight film grain and color shift heighten realism and life. Every detail is crisp: skin texture, glove stitching, helmet scuffs, rope weave — a hyperreal yet artistically touched visual.",
