          "alias": "单女露胸桌边媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman sits sideways at a dining table draped in white linen. She wears an ornate gold crown set with deep-colored jewels and intricate carvings, her bright golden-orange hair falling softly over her shoulders, gleaming in warm light. She is completely topless, with a delicate black string necklace hanging between her bare breasts, and ornate silver crystal earrings dangling from her ears. A serpentine metal bracelet coils around her wrist, and a ring adorns her finger. Her posture is elegant and pensive, gaze lowered toward the table. Her left hand rests lightly on the cloth, right hand near a teacup. On the table: a fine white bone-china tea bowl with relief patterns, matching saucer, small metal spoon, a dark wooden stirrer, a crystal candleholder with a tall white candle, a small glass vase with tiny flowers, and a cluster of blooming white hydrangeas in the lower right. The background is a curved warm tan wall with subtle texture, soft light falling diagonally from upper left, casting gentle shadows on her face, arms, and objects, enhancing depth. Composition uses rule of thirds: subject on right, negative space on left. Warm yellow, cream, black hues with gold and silver accents. Cinematic, intimate, sensual, as if shot with a large-aperture lens in low light.",
