          "prompt": "A young woman in a white sleeveless shirt unbuttoned to reveal her bare chest, a black tie loosely hanging, her purple-red shoulder-length hair cascading with a natural center part, soft light catching the strands, her deep green eyes clear and bright with a gentle, knowing smile. She squats on a pale gray backdrop, pose elegant and relaxed, arms extended forward, fingers slightly spread as if tracing the air, a metal ring on her left wrist, a black leather collar with small metallic studs around her neck. She wears black thigh-high stockings that cling to her toned legs, and scuffed black thick-soled shoes. The scene blends schoolgirl and dark aesthetics—topless, the collar and tie adding a cold, submissive edge. Low-angle shot, body centered slightly right, her face, hands, and lower body sharply in focus, skin texture fine, natural shadow transitions. Midground extends to her torso, fabric and stocking textures visible. Pure light gray gradient wall behind, minimal. Composition uses central symmetry and golden ratio, her body forming a diagonal S-curve guiding the eye from her face down to her legs and shoes. Warm backlight from upper left, rim light on her hair creating a soft halo, subtle shadow on the floor. Contrast strong but smooth, tones monochrome with accents of violet hair and green eyes, artistic yet candid, as if shot in a home studio with a professional camera, capturing a cosplayer in an authentic, intimate moment—a mix of deliberate styling and spontaneous ease. Image radiates a quiet, seductive charm.",
