          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔街道媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands at a city street corner, turning back to glance over her shoulder at the camera. She wears a cream-white baseball cap, brim pulled low over her forehead. Dark hair is swept into a low, elegant bun, with loose strands falling naturally beside her face. She is dressed in a cropped blue denim jacket, cut above the waist, exposing her bare, toned midriff. Jacket sleeves are rolled up. Underneath, a black-and-white polka dot blouse is unbuttoned low, revealing the swell of her cleavage and a tempting sliver of lace. A long black-and-white polka dot tie hangs loosely from her neck, trailing down past her exposed navel. Her right hand casually holds a smartphone, arm relaxed at her side. Her makeup is bold—smoky eyes, full lips, sultry yet curious gaze. The city backdrop is a typical Chinese street: tall trees with lush green leaves and clusters of pink flowers (likely bougainvillea), sunlight filtering through to cast dappled shadows on the pavement. A green taxi and parked cars can be seen in the distance. Street lamps, traffic signs, and shop signs, including a “Canon” storefront, line the road. The scene is bathed in warm afternoon light, soft and natural, with a pale blue sky and light clouds. Composition is a medium shot: the woman occupies the right side of the frame, head and upper body fully visible, body slightly tilted for dynamic flow. Her gaze directs the viewer from her face into the layered background: foreground leaves, midground street and vehicles, background buildings. Colors are dominated by blue, white, green, brown, with pink blossoms and black polka dots as accents. The lighting creates gentle contrasts across her face, clothing, and the ground, enhancing depth and realism. The overall mood is relaxed, candid, urban—captured like a spontaneous street moment, with a subtle film grain and warm color grading, feeling both natural and artfully seductive.",
