        {
          "id": "krea2-9e8ac0b19910d98c5926285d",
          "alias": "单女灰束身衣舞台微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her deep brunette hair cascading smoothly over her shoulders, with a few stray strands brushing her cheek in a lazy, effortless way. Her face is sharply defined—clean brows, heavy smokey eye makeup with bold black liner, bright clear pupils staring directly into the lens with focused confidence. Lips are slightly parted, natural and full, a faint smile curling at the corners. A tiny metallic earpiece curves from her left cheek to her mouth, the microphone catching the light. Her top is a tight grey leather-like corset that clings to her torso, leaving her arms bare. The asymmetrical design features a thick white faux-fur shoulder piece draped over her right shoulder and across part of her chest, the uneven edges soft and wild, contrasting with the sleek texture of the corset. Below, a high-waisted skirt made of layered deep red ruffles, each edge studded with silver rivets and rings, creating a ragged, deconstructed look. A wide dark brown leather belt loaded with silver studs cinches her waist, a circular metal buckle at the center. More white fur spills from the hem, intertwining with the red fabric, and long furry tassels hang from both sides, swaying with her slight movements. Her hands rest at her sides—left hand lightly on her thigh, fingers long with pale polish, right hand relaxed. She wears tall military-style olive green canvas boots, worn and practical, with multiple pockets and zippers, the cuffs slightly rolled to show her calves. The overall silhouette is powerful, raw, and intensely sensual. Background is pure black stage, only a few faint blue pinpricks in the distance like stars. A single spotlight from above-front hits her face and body, creating dramatic chiaroscuro, shadows pooling behind her and along her legs. The composition is a medium shot, slightly above eye level, centered but offset slightly left, drawing focus to her expression and the intricate, revealing details of her outfit. The mood blends theatrical performance with high-fashion erotica—a fleeting moment of captivating tension, captured with both professional sharpness and a raw, intimate authenticity.",
