          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a gray tile floor by a window, her body slightly curled, legs bent, arms loosely hugging her knees. She has long, straight brown hair with a pale violet hair clip. She is completely nude except for a black and green diamond-pattern knit scarf draped over one shoulder and a pair of white over-the-knee socks, each ankle tied with a pink satin bow. Her gaze is downcast, with a melancholic, introspective expression. The dark window frame creates a natural border; beyond it lies a snowy winter forest with bare trees and red-roofed log cabins in the distance. Soft, diffuse natural light from the window illuminates her face and body, casting gentle shadows that define her skin and the fabric’s texture. The atmosphere is quiet, cold, and intimate, with a hint of loneliness. Photorealistic, with subtle grain and natural light as if captured with a compact camera. Color palette: cool whites, grays, black, with accents of violet and green. Composition follows the rule of thirds, subject on the left, her gaze extending to the right. Slight downward camera tilt enhances the intimate feel. Detailed textures: soft skin, reflective snow, rough wood of the cabins.",
