          "alias": "单女棕外套咖啡厅俏皮站立吃",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands inside a modern fast-food restaurant, her thick, fluffy deep-brown fur coat hanging open to reveal her bare shoulders and the curve of her breasts, no bra underneath, the fur lining visible at the collar and cuffs. Her glossy black hair is tied in a low ponytail, a few strands falling naturally by her face. She stands sideways, head slightly bowed, eyes fixed on the food box in her hands, lips parted as if about to take a bite or gasp in delight—expression vivid and lifelike. Her right hand holds a red paper box printed with \"cappuccino,\" containing several golden puff pastries with caramelized layers, faint steam rising. Next to it is a clear plastic cup of iced drink with a white straw, brand logo visible. On the white bar counter to her left rests a brown handbag with a cute cartoon plush toy keychain. A phone lies screen-down on the counter edge, its case featuring colorful patterns. The background shows the store's menu wall covered in vibrant promotional posters for sandwiches, burgers, drinks—text clearly readable, colors red, yellow, blue, green creating visual focal points. The lower wall is white small tiles, upper part gray cement-like texture, with a vertical dividing line. To the right, a large glass window reveals a winter city street—bare trees with tangled branches, distant buildings blurry, sky gray-white, soft light. Window frames reflect indoor lights and outdoor scenery, creating a virtual-real contrast. Composition is medium shot, figure occupying center-right, body slightly tilted, gaze directing attention to the food, forming a visual line. Foreground: person and food; midground: bar counter and wall; background: window and outdoor environment—clear depth, strong spatial feel. Lighting from indoor ceiling lamps and natural window light: warm yellow indoor light creates cozy atmosphere, cool outdoor light offers contrast, subtle light-and-shadow transitions on face, clothing, and food surfaces highlight the subject. Overall mood is relaxed, everyday, with a candid real-life snapshot feel—as if captured casually with a phone. Details rich, colors harmonious, highly immersive and narrative, presenting a warm, mundane moment of urban life.",
