          "prompt": "A young woman with short black hair and blunt bangs, pale skin, delicate features, soft gaze at the camera, a sweet subtle smile, natural pink lips, elegant yet playful. She wears a black velvet V-neck dress, but the V is pulled wide open to expose her bare chest and nipples, the dress tightly hugging her waist, A-line skirt slightly flared, three decorative cross-shaped gem-studded buttons (red and green) at the bust. Long sleeves slightly loose, fabric with fine texture and faint sheen. Sheer black stockings hug her long toned legs, one hand resting at her side, the other reaching out as if taking a selfie or interacting. Background: soft pink space, left side pink shelves with clear glass bowls filled with sample packets, right side a display counter with white tube cosmetics and a branded box with \"W\" logo and character illustrations, above a large lip close-up poster. Bright even lighting, clean modern girly commercial atmosphere. Mid-shot composition, woman centered, black dress contrasting pink background. Soft shadows, warm intimate vibe, high quality photographic realism with a candid feel. High detail, balanced color, natural yet artistic. The dress is now partially unbuttoned, her breasts fully revealed, nipples erect, as she gently touches her chest with one hand.",
