        {
          "id": "krea2-4bac73b811b5a89cc65fd217",
          "alias": "单女黑内衣公园困倦站立出神",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the bumper car area of a nighttime amusement park, wearing a sheer black long-sleeve top that reveals the outline of her black lace bra, paired with a high-waist black leather skirt with a slit rising to her upper thigh, exposing black shorts and thigh-high leather boots. Her right hand lifts to touch the top of her head, fingers naturally curved, while her left hand hangs loosely at her side. She stares directly into the camera with a cool, slightly aloof expression. Her long black hair falls straight with blunt bangs, and she wears simple metal hoop earrings. Her makeup is precise with dark matte lips, pale skin glowing under neon lights. The background dissolves into a dreamy bokeh of blurred carnival rides in blue, purple, pink, and yellow, creating a neon-nightclub atmosphere. In the foreground left, a blurred blue-and-yellow bumper car with the number \"77\" and stickers; on the right, a blurred white bumper car printed with \"JE PISTONS\" and red graphics. The composition is centered, with the woman occupying the main focus, shallow depth of field making everything around her soft and hazy. Lighting comes from multicolored neon signs and ride lights, striking from multiple angles with soft reflections and halation, casting subtle shadows on her face for added dimension. The overall tone is cool, mostly dark with vibrant light spots, a gritty yet polished cinematic feel—like a still from a low-light night shoot with slight film grain and motion blur. She stands alone in the chaos, a self-possessed protagonist lost in thought, every distraction blurred away except her vivid, sensual presence.",
