        {
          "id": "krea2-d936d90710b7da1fcf5d0fe2",
          "alias": "单女露胸粉手套室内媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands confidently in an indoor setting, wearing a bold retro-futuristic ensemble. She is positioned slightly left of center, body angled toward the camera, head tilted, making direct eye contact with a sultry, knowing expression. Her long black hair is styled into two high, glossy ponytails. She wears pink-tinted sunglasses on her head. Her makeup is sharp: defined eyeliner, thick lashes, full pink lips, and a small nose ring with silver ear studs. She is topless except for a thin, red-and-white striped cropped top that is unbuttoned and hanging open, exposing her bare breasts, nipples perked. Over that, she wears sheer pink long-sleeved gloves that are transparent and gathered at the wrists. She wears very high-waisted pink micro-shorts that barely cover her ass, cinched with a wide brown leather belt covered in metal studs, a round buckle, and a dangling fringe. Her legs are encased in dark brown over-the-knee boots with visible stitching and buckles, wine-red knit socks peeking out at the ankles. Her right leg is lifted forward, knee bent, toe pointing, left leg planted. Both hands are raised to chest level, fingers splayed in a claw-like gesture, white nail polish catching the light. The background is a clean interior with white and light gray paneled walls, dark gray floor tiles, metal baseboards, and a soft blue-gray rug. Mid-shot, low angle, balanced composition with dynamic diagonal. Soft lighting from the left casts pale shadows, enhancing the curves of her body. The overall mood is stylish, edgy, and deeply sensual, with a slight film-grain texture, capturing a moment of bold self-expression like a backstage fashion idol ready to perform.",
