        {
          "id": "krea2-a042234d2e677635d4ef6e12",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫摄影棚冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully on a dark velvet armchair, wearing a black velvet turtleneck long-sleeve mini dress with wide cutouts at the shoulders, the skirt ending high on her upper thigh. She wears sheer black stockings and glossy black patent leather platform heels with thin ankle straps. Her black hair falls naturally, soft waves brushing her cheeks. Her makeup is defined and layered—eyeliner sharpens her deep eyes, lips full and matte dark red. She looks directly at the camera with a composed, confident expression. Her legs are crossed, one foot slightly lifted, body leaning forward, hands resting casually on the back of the chair. The composition is centered, subject slightly left, focus on her face and upper body, with her legs extending toward the frame edge, forming a stable triangle. The background is pure black, minimalist. Lighting is low-angle side light from the left front, softly illuminating her face, shoulder, and one side of her body, creating contrast with deep shadows on the right. The velvet fabric catches subtle highlights, and her skin has smooth transitions. Overall tone is black-dominated with hints of gray and metallic reflections, evoking a cool, elegant, mysterious mood. The image has a professional studio portrait feel but retains natural grain and limited dynamic range, as if shot with an entry-level full-frame camera in low light with a wide aperture. Details are crisp—fabric fibers, sheer stocking translucency, shiny shoe surfaces. The scene feels like an intimate, focused late-night shoot in a simple studio with minimal styling, conveying strong emotion and visual impact.",
