        {
          "id": "krea2-7b75a476c55d38343a3b469c",
          "alias": "单女露胸粉内衣健身房专注坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in front of lockers in a gym changing room, completely topless, her pink sports bra discarded on the bench beside her. She wears tight leggings and silver-gray sneakers, holding a white smartphone to capture her reflection in a mirror. Her face is partially hidden by her hair, her gaze focused on the screen. One leg is crossed over the other, a foot resting flat on the beige bench, the other slightly lifted. The background features a row of beige metal lockers with black NIKE logos and numbered 11,9,7,5,3,1 above and 12,10,8,6,4,2 below, perforated surfaces, clean lines. Soft warm lighting from overhead casts gentle shadows across her bare breasts, arms, and thighs, with subtle highlights on the lockers. Mid-shot composition, subject on the right occupying a third of the frame, leaving lockers as background on the left. Foreground includes the bench and her legs, midground is her body and phone, background is the locker wall. The visual path leads from her hand holding the phone to the mirror reflection, then to the locker sequence right to left. The scene feels like a casual post-workout moment, captured with a slight film grain, desaturated warm tones (pink, beige, gray), natural imperfections like locker metal texture, floor scratches, clothing wrinkles, phone case details. Her expression is relaxed, pose effortless, conveying a carefree lifestyle. The repeating locker pattern creates geometric rhythm, contrasting with her dynamic posture, emphasizing her presence. The atmosphere is intimate, realistic, and modern urban.",
