          "alias": "单女和服沙发忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a light wooden armchair, wearing a traditional kimono with the outer deep-blue loose robe slipped off her shoulders, baring her bare shoulders and the top of her chest. The inner white kimono, patterned with tiny pale purple diamonds, is hiked up to her upper thighs, revealing her completely bare legs and feet—toes naturally spread. Her hands rest folded on her lap, fingers long with neat nails. Her black hair is styled in a high bun with straight bangs falling to her cheeks. She gazes directly at the camera with a calm, slightly melancholic, contemplative expression, her eyes clear and deep as if looking into a distant memory. Soft facial features, fair and delicate skin, straight nose, lips slightly pressed. The background is a beige wall with subtle vertical texture. Soft even light from the left casts gentle shadows on the right side, creating a warm, peaceful atmosphere. Center composition, with the chair’s round wooden arms and light beige striped cushion visible. Wooden floor shows below. The image has a realistic, amateur-camera feel—like a Canon or Nikon entry-level DSLR in natural indoor light at 85mm, f/2.8, +0.3 EV, daylight white balance, subtle grain and low contrast. Tones are warm yellow, blue-gray, and pale purple, evoking a quiet Japanese aesthetic with sensual elegance.",
