        {
          "id": "krea2-06703b2a9fabc49ba095664e",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙瀑布忧伤注视",
          "prompt": "Close-up side profile of a young woman, her jet-black silky hair cascading like a waterfall, adorned with intricate blue floral hair ornaments—silver metal flowers with pale blue gemstones, layered petals translucent and crystalline, the ornamentation elegantly winding along her hairline to form a flowing decorative band. Her hair shimmers faintly in soft light, with a few strands gently falling over her cheek. She wears a flowing white ancient-style dress, the fabric sheer and translucent, with delicate embroidery at the neckline and shoulders; the sleeves reveal a hint of lace trim. Around her neck hangs a thin chain with a small blue-and-white jade pendant, and matching tassel earrings dangle from her ears, composed of blue-and-white bead strands and fine metal chains that tremble with the slightest movement. Her features are delicate, with fair, flawless skin, willow-leaf-shaped eyebrows, exquisite eye makeup with eyeliner defining deep contours, her gaze focused yet slightly melancholy, looking off to the right of the frame, lips pressed together in a serene, introspective expression. The composition is a close-up portrait, with the figure dominating the frame, a blurred background rendered in warm orange-gold tones, soft bokeh as if autumn sunlight filters through leaves, creating a dreamy shallow depth-of-field effect. Light falls diagonally from the upper right, gently illuminating her face and hair ornaments, forming chiaroscuro that highlights facial contours and accessory details, catching highlights in her hair to enhance texture. In the background, hints of wooden structures interweave with warm light and shadow, evoking a classical courtyard or indoor window-side setting. The overall palette is warm, dominated by golden and orange-red hues, contrasting with the cool tones of the hair ornaments. Visual focus is on her face and the hair decorations, with sharp focus and blurred background, creating strong layering. The image possesses an artistic, cinematic quality, as if a high-quality studio shot yet retaining the authentic feel of amateur daily photography—rich in detail, natural light transitions, harmonious colors, presenting a quiet, ethereal Eastern aesthetic.",
