        {
          "id": "krea2-58afd47716e82da5d2554eff",
          "alias": "单女连帽衫忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a cramped wooden space, wearing an unzipped leopard-print hoodie over her bare skin, black shorts clinging low on her hips. She tilts her head slightly, hands resting on her stomach, fingers grazing the hem of the hoodie with a light, deliberate touch. Her expression is pensive, almost melancholy—deep eyes cast downward toward the camera, lips slightly parted, a trace of weary sensuality in the soft shadows of her face. Her brown hair falls loose over her shoulders, partially hidden by the hood's drooping fabric. The background is a wall of vertical dark brown wooden planks, rich with natural grain and subtle light shifts; a pale rough-textured curtain edges into the frame on the right. The composition centers her slightly left, with her upper body taking up two-thirds of the frame, creating a compressed, intimate space that feels both claustrophobic and deeply personal. Warm yellow light from a single source above right hits her jaw, nose, and cheekbones in a Rembrandt-style glow, leaving the right side of her face and torso in soft shadow. The skin of her bare chest and shoulders catches the light, showing fine pores and a faint blush of warmth. Her leopard-print hoodie shows rich texture—gray-brown spots glowing in the warm tones. The whole scene has a low-saturation, retro film feel: deep browns, ochre, off-white, with subtle grain and natural contrast like a phone snapshot or a small camera's imperfect capture. The stillness is charged with a quiet, introspective eroticism—a stolen moment of solitude and self-gaze, both vulnerable and inviting.",
