        {
          "id": "krea2-a5a65a9a703bdd6caa2523b7",
          "alias": "单女露胸上衣泳池困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges languidly on a black metal-framed bed, her legs bent and raised, ankles crossed, wearing only a white top unbuttoned to expose her bare breasts and blue-and-white striped pajama bottoms pulled low on her hips. She rests her chin on her hands, gazing into the lens with a melancholic, introspective expression, her deep brown hair strewn messily over the pillow, strands falling across her cheek. The bed is neatly unmade, a blue-and-white striped quilt slightly wrinkled over the white padded mattress. The headboard is a simple black metal frame, its hard lines contrasting with the soft bedding. In the foreground, the metal bed rail cuts diagonally across the frame, guiding the eye to the woman who sits slightly off-center, body angled, head tilted forward, creating an intimate yet distant atmosphere. To the left, a wooden shelf holds a camera and bag, next to a small wooden cabinet with a green pool table model. Above, a blue metal birdcage hangs on the wall, containing a withered vine with yellow leaves drooping like a symbol of passing time. Slatted blinds at the window let warm sunlight filter through, casting soft striped shadows across the floor and wall. The scene is bathed in gentle morning or afternoon light. The color palette is white, beige, light wood, accented by black metal and blue linens, evoking Nordic minimalism. The low-angle shot, near the floor, emphasizes the bed and her presence while preserving the room layout. The visual path starts from the bed rail in the foreground, moves across her face, and continues to the shelf and window beyond, creating a fluid line. The atmosphere is quiet, warm, and intimate, blending everyday realism with artistic photography, as if captured by a professional mirrorless camera in natural light with subtle lens blur and precise focus, capturing a moment of urban solitude and quiet longing.",
