        {
          "id": "krea2-371fcb6bc4e6423e56967835",
          "alias": "单女红衬衫舞台戏谑跪脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman kneels in a half-squat on a plush white fur floor, her long silky pink hair cascading in soft waves, a neat fringe across her forehead with strands brushing her cheeks. She wears sleek black devil horns that curve upward, her makeup bold with deep purple eyeshadow, sharp eyeliner, and vivid red lips. Her red long-sleeve shirt is unbuttoned low, exposing her collarbone and the swell of her breasts, the hem tucked into a tight black miniskirt. A black tie hangs loose across her chest, adding a rebellious note. Black stockings hug her long legs, with a red lace garter strap on her right thigh, both sexy and playful. Her left hand rests lightly on the floor, while her right hand grips a black curved knife with an intricate hilt and a slender metallic blade. She stares directly at the camera, her expression teasing and mysterious, as if sharing a secret. The foreground captures her from head to knees, with rich detail and vibrant colors. The midground shows the white fur floor and part of the background structure. Behind her, a giant LED screen displays dynamic pink and purple light orbs that pulse and shift like bubbles, creating a psychedelic effect, with horizontal lines adding depth. The composition is centered, with her offset slightly left as the focal point, the camera angled slightly upward to enhance her presence. Lighting contrasts warm soft light on her skin and clothes with cool purple-pink light from the screen, evoking a futuristic, enigmatic vibe. The image is highly saturated, detailed, blending realism with surreal artistry, drawing the eye from her face to the blade and the animated backdrop—a stage of virtual fantasy, full of drama and tension.",
