        {
          "id": "krea2-7c80752b2b789cf11dabff5c",
          "alias": "单女露胸白袜子沙发戏谑交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges on a pale yellow diamond-stitched velvet sofa, her body slightly turned, legs crossed with the right one forward and left behind, ankles naturally flexed. She wears pink velvet sneakers with white ribbon bows, paired with over-the-knee white stack socks that bunch lazily around her calves, exuding a lazy-sweet vibe. Her gray long-sleeve off-shoulder top hangs loosely, the wide neckline slipped down to her sternum, revealing her collarbones and a multi-layer pearl necklace with tiny silver charms. The top's hem is white lace, matching her white layered ruffled mini skirt, which is ultra-short with intricate cutout patterns, the hem barely covering her upper thighs. A soft pink headband holds back her dark hair, which falls in messy waves past her shoulders, strands brushing her cheek. She gazes into the lens with a gentle, inviting expression, lips slightly parted, a teasing hint of a smile. The background is an indoor room with a horizontal gray-white blind window behind the sofa, soft light filtering through the slits, pale beige walls, and light gray wood flooring. The overall palette is muted with gray, white, pink, and cream, creating a fresh yet sensual atmosphere. A mid-shot composition places her slightly left of center, framing from waist to feet, emphasizing her exposed upper body and face. Natural window light falls evenly, no harsh shadows, giving a cozy, candid feel like a high-res real-life portrait with rich detail: smooth skin, visible fabric textures, glossy sneakers, and dimensional lace. She is topless, her top completely slipped down, baring her bare breasts, the pearl necklace draping between them, one hand resting on her thigh while the other plays with the lace of her skirt, which is hiked up to reveal the top of her stockings. The vibe is youthful, sweet, and deliberately risqué, a carefully composed personal photo with strong visual allure and emotional intimacy.",
