          "alias": "单女灰外套摄影棚微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a light-colored sofa, her long black hair falling naturally, strands catching soft light with barely visible highlights, the ends gently curling against her shoulders. She leans slightly forward in a three-quarter pose, a warm smile on her face, eyes clear and bright with deep pupils reflecting gentle light, delicate natural eye makeup, long thick lashes, smoothly groomed brows, straight nose, full lips with pale pink lipstick, corners of her mouth turned up in a warm inviting smile, revealing clean white teeth. Her skin is fair and smooth with a natural rosy flush, subtle highlighter on her cheeks giving a healthy glow. She wears a light blue spaghetti-strap top, light and breathable fabric, low neckline elegantly cut showing the swell of her breasts, with a gray tweed jacket casually draped over her shoulders, textured weave visible, thick fabric with slight frayed edges at shoulders and cuffs, the jacket falling in natural folds, leaving her arms and shoulders bare. A round pearl stud earring gleams on her right ear, smooth and reflective with a soft metallic sheen. The setting is indoors, a blue-and-white object (maybe a book or box) faintly visible on the left, a pink wall or partition on the right with moderate saturation and soft blur at edges, pale gray floor. Close-up portrait composition, the subject filling most of the frame, head slightly tilted, eyes directly meeting the camera creating strong visual engagement. Focus is on her facial features and expression, background blurred to emphasize the subject. Lighting from front-left, soft and even with no harsh shadows, her face fully illuminated, contours clear with slight highlights on forehead and nose bridge, adding depth. Overall atmosphere is warm, natural, and inviting. Color palette contrasts cool and warm tones – light blue, gray, and pink harmonize. The image has fine texture as if shot with a professional camera yet retains a candid everyday feel, like a relaxed moment at home or in a studio, capturing a genuine and appealing smile. Cinematic portrait style, rich in detail, layered, ideal for expressing emotion and lifestyle. The scene is clean and uncluttered, focused entirely on the subject, conveying a sense of calm, pleasure, and confidence. The eye contact and smile directly communicate warmth and goodwill to the viewer.",
