          "prompt": "A young woman with long purple hair and cat ears sits on a beige fabric sofa. She wears a snug white short-sleeve blouse, slightly unbuttoned to reveal a hint of cleavage, with a black tie at the collar. Her black high-waisted shorts hug her curves as she crosses her legs, left over right, in an elegant and teasing pose. Her right hand lightly rests on her chest, fingers grazing the fabric, while her left hand lies on the armrest. She wears glossy black patent leather stiletto heels with gold metal tips, her long legs sheathed in sheer stockings that catch the light. Her body leans forward slightly, head turned a little, eyes locked on the viewer with a soft, playful expression. Purple hair cascades in layered, glossy waves to her shoulders, and her cat ears stand upright with pink inner fur. The background is a clean modern interior: pale gray-white walls, a potted plant with long, sword-shaped bright green leaves behind the sofa, and a few blue-covered books or folders on the left armrest. The floor is light wood with visible grain. Soft diffused light comes from the upper left, casting gentle shadows and evenly illuminating her face and body. The composition is a medium shot, focusing on the woman slightly off-center right, with a shallow depth of field blurring the background. The color palette is dominated by white, black, and purple, accented by the green plant. The image has a high-end studio quality with fine detail and texture, yet feels intimate and lived-in like a home portrait. The overall aesthetic is refined, sensual, and artfully alluring.",
