          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless at the entrance of a vintage coffee shop, wearing only a beige satin lace-trimmed mini skirt, brown suede cropped jacket unbuttoned, and black stiletto heel sandals. She holds a small light bag in her left hand, one leg lifted elegantly, right hand resting on the doorframe. Her long hair falls naturally, makeup flawless, eyes soft and inviting as she gazes into the camera. The overall style blends urban fashion with a lazy, sensual vibe. She is positioned center-right of the frame. In the left foreground, a vase with dried yellow flowers adds a nostalgic touch. The background shows the coffee shop entrance with a red metal-framed glass door open wide. Above the door, a white roll-up shutter has red handwritten text: \"hopefully... maybe...\". Beside it, a red cartoon dog sign reads \"We Love Puppy\". Inside, stairs lead to the second floor, with dark red walls and abstract line decorations. In the left window, a white coffee machine and blurred figures. The exterior walls are weathered white concrete, the floor gray square tiles. The lighting is soft and warm, like natural afternoon sun. The composition is symmetrical, with the woman as the focal point. Red and white contrast creates visual impact, drawing the eye from the foreground to the midground figure and background details. The light and shadow are rich, transitions natural. The overall atmosphere blends street fashion, daily life, and artistic sensibility, as if capturing a candid moment. It has a strong Korean-style artistic feel and realistic snapshot quality, like a photo taken with an amateur camera or phone, with slight noise and natural color variation. The scene is delicate and full of story.",
