          "alias": "单女蓝外套街道媚态坐喝",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a metal bench on a city street, her long black hair cascading over bare shoulders. She has fair skin, delicate features, bright eyes, and a sultry smile, looking directly at the camera with a playful, seductive expression. She wears a blue-black pilot jacket, completely open, revealing a black spaghetti-strap mini dress with a plunging neckline, exposing ample cleavage and the curve of her breasts. The dress is tight, accentuating her figure. Her black shorts are extremely short, showcasing her long, smooth legs. She wears chunky brown-and-white sneakers with light green laces. In her right hand, she holds a dark cup with a white lid; her left hand rests on her inner thigh, fingers slightly splayed. She leans forward, pushing her chest out, head tilted, exuding confidence and allure. The background shows a modern city street corner with a glass curtain wall reflecting buildings and sky, a stainless steel low table with a glass jar drink and a blue denim jacket casually draped. Right side has a beige wall and closed door. Gray asphalt ground with metal drainage lines. High-angle shot, subject right of center, leading lines from the bench and drainage. Natural daylight, soft even light, warm morning/evening atmosphere. Cool-warm color contrast: silver gray, deep gray, blue-black jacket, skin tones, hair. Realistic, detailed, like a candid street photograph but with a sensual, adult edge.",
