          "alias": "单女女仆黑女仆装窗边戏谑站立整理头发",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a black-and-white maid outfit stands by a modern indoor window, wearing black fuzzy cat ears and a short bob with bangs, her delicate face tilted with a gentle, inviting gaze and a playful smirk. She wears a short black sleeveless dress with a low, revealing neckline showing clear cleavage, paired with an off-white lace-trimmed apron tied at the waist, the ribbon cinching her figure. The fluffy skirt barely covers her upper thighs, fully exposing her long, pale legs sheathed in sheer white thigh-high stockings and black Mary Jane heels. Her right leg is slightly bent, toe pointed, as she leans gracefully—left hand resting on the window frame, right hand lifted near her head, fingers teasingly brushing her hair. Her posture is elegant yet provocative, blending innocent cuteness with overt sexuality. The shot is taken from a dynamic low angle, with strong diagonal lines from upper left to lower right, the window frame guiding the eye to her body. Soft, bright natural light from the large right window cascades across her exposed skin and dress, creating crisp highlights and deep shadows on her left side and the floor. The background shows a blurred cityscape of high-rises with green tree dots, evoking an urban atmosphere. The overall color palette is black, white, cream, and muted greens, with a subtle film-grain texture. The focus is sharp on her face and curves, with a shallow depth of field blurring the background. The scene captures a private, intimate moment of cosplay in a daily environment, emphasizing youthful freedom and self-expression with a sensual twist.",
