          "prompt": "A young woman with vibrant orange-red hair sits in the corner of an indoor hallway, wearing a white short-sleeve shirt unbuttoned to expose her bare breasts and a deep blue pleated miniskirt hiked up to reveal her thighs. Her hair is braided into a thick plait that falls behind her, with neat bangs across her forehead. She gazes softly at the camera, a faint smile on her lips, her right hand gently resting under her chin in an elegant, contemplative pose. Her body is slightly turned toward the right of the frame, head facing the lens, creating a natural sense of interaction. In the foreground, a dark blue canvas duffel bag with a gray shoulder strap and an orange plush toy keychain partially obscures her legs, adding depth to the composition. The background is a blurred indoor hallway with pale beige walls and a row of windows that let in soft natural light, warm and gentle, evoking a tranquil atmosphere. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with the subject occupying the right half, leaving space on the left for visual flow. The focus is sharp on her face and upper body, while the background is out of focus to emphasize her. Light spills diagonally from the right windows, creating a soft backlight effect that outlines her silhouette with a subtle glow and catches fine highlights in her hair and skin. Shadows blend naturally. The color palette is dominated by warm whites, orange-red, and deep blue, with harmonious, layered tones. The scene exudes a quiet, everyday school-life atmosphere, as if capturing a peaceful after-school moment. The image has high realism, fine detail, slight film grain, and authentic light textures, resembling a professional portrait. It feels warm, gentle, and youthful, suggesting a snippet from a coming-of-age story, reflecting the character's inner softness and hopes for the future. No extraneous elements distract—all components serve the theme. The composition is simple yet deep, with a smooth visual path from the bag to the person to the background, inviting the viewer to imagine she has just finished her studies and is about to head home or onward. The scene is rich in narrative and emotional tension, like a frozen moment of a distant bell and footsteps, yet held still in eternal memory. The aesthetic is highly realistic yet retains a dreamy quality, both believable and fantastical, captivating and expressive.",
