          "prompt": "A young woman sits on stone steps, her long beige coat open to reveal a bare chest beneath, with a light sweater and black skirt discarded around her waist. She wears only the white fringe scarf draped loosely across her shoulders, her right hand gently brushing through her hair, her left hand resting on a blue-and-white book with a faint Korean title. She turns her head slightly toward the camera, her gaze soft and contemplative, dark hair falling naturally, strands lifting in the breeze. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, exuding a literary, intellectual sensuality. Behind her rises a tall stone building, its rough, weathered surface bearing a metal plaque engraved with \"COLLEGE OF SOCIAL SCIENCES\" in Korean and English. The architecture is dark gray stone with arched windows framed in dark wood, some partially wrapped in climbing vines. Withered branches and sparse leaves are visible in the background, ground covered in light gray flagstones, a low wooden fence nearby, and distant building outlines. The composition is a close-up and medium shot, the woman positioned left of center, drawing the main visual focus in an asymmetrical yet balanced layout. The perspective is slightly low, emphasizing her upright form and the building’s grandeur. Soft, even light from an overcast sky bathes the scene in warm, natural tones, with delicate shadows that create a quiet, nostalgic, slightly melancholic atmosphere. Colors center on beige, gray, brown, and black, with touches of blue for cool-warm contrast. The image feels finely detailed and realistic, as if captured with a professional camera, yet retains a casual, everyday authenticity—evoking a serene afternoon on an urban campus, blending the refined composition of art photography with the intimate spontaneity of life.",
