          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a full-length mirror with an arched frame, taking a selfie with her phone, her reflection clear in the glass. Her body is slightly turned toward the lens, head tilted down, eyes focused on the screen. Her long hair falls in soft, glossy layers of deep brown and light caramel, the ends slightly tousled for a casual, sexy look. She wears a loose-fitting cream-white long blazer, unbuttoned to reveal a sheer floral print camisole inside, her nipples barely visible through the thin fabric. Her high-waisted shorts match the blazer, the waist tie hanging loosely, creating elegant folds. On her feet, black-and-white pointed stilettos with sleek leather and a fine heel. Her right hand holds a silver-gray smartphone with three rear cameras; her fingers grip the edge, nails painted pale pink. Her left hand hangs naturally, slightly bent, holding a small black rounded backpack slung over her right shoulder, forming a diagonal line. She is positioned slightly left of center, the composition balancing symmetry and asymmetry. The background is a white vertical venetian blind, light filtering through to create soft shadow stripes on the wall and floor. The floor is light gray tile, reflecting faint silhouettes. On the left, part of a black vertical structure (possibly a mirror stand); on the right, a partial glass door with a white metal frame and silver handle, revealing a room beyond. The scene is modern minimalist, lit by soft diffuse light from above and front, giving even illumination and subtle shadows. The palette is cream, light gray, black, with small colorful accents, creating a sophisticated, lived-in feel. The vertical composition focuses on the figure but leaves room for background details, drawing the eye from her face and phone down her body to the mirror and blinds. It captures an intimate, candid moment—like a stylish dressing-room selfie that's both planned and spontaneous, exuding urban confidence and a touch of seduction.",
