          "prompt": "A young woman in a seductive maid outfit stands on a rainy night street, her black long-sleeve shirt unbuttoned and pushed wide to expose her bare breasts, white lace collar and cuffs contrasting against her skin. She wears a cream-white apron with ruffled edges, the A-line skirt lifting high to reveal black thigh-high stockings and glistening black loafers. A cat-eared white maid cap sits on her black twin-tail hair, while a fluffy black cat tail curves behind. She gently grips the cap's brim with both hands, tilting her head back slightly, her gaze soft and inviting, a shy yet sultry smile on her lips. The composition places her center-left, occupying most of the frame; background is a blurred urban street with red neon signs and storefront lights reflecting off wet pavement. Warm orange light spills from left-side walls, while cool blue light strikes from the right, creating a stark color contrast. A pale blue awning or sign structure is faintly visible above. Shot in medium close-up, focus on face and upper body, shallow depth of field blurring the surroundings. Multiple light sources: cold white overhead, blue side light, warm yellow from distance, with her face evenly lit by a soft front light. Shadows transition smoothly, fabric texture visible, apron folds catching light. The scene balances cool blue and warm orange, evoking a quiet, mysterious nighttime atmosphere. The image aesthetic resembles professional photography with high detail, cinematic quality, yet feels like a candid street encounter with a late-night maid—sensual, story-rich, and artfully composed.",
