          "prompt": "A young woman with short black hair sits on the brick steps of a white wooden cottage, wearing only a white lace headpiece and a sheer white maid apron over her bare skin, the apron's ruffled edges framing her exposed breasts and nipples. Her deep blue long-sleeved dress is unbuttoned and discarded around her waist, one strap falling off her shoulder. She crosses her legs elegantly, right leg over left, white thigh-high stockings clinging to her slender calves, black patent Mary Jane shoes with metal buckles on her feet. She leans slightly sideways, one hand resting on her knee, the other gently lifting the edge of her apron, her nipples slightly peaked. Her gaze is direct, soft smile, eyes clear and inviting. Background: the weathered white cottage with a half-open window, sheer curtains, a wrought-iron lantern. To the right, a cascade of purple and pink roses climbs a white wooden fence, with a stone fountain with an angel statue partially hidden among blooms. Sunlight streams from upper right, creating backlighting and dappled shadows across her skin. Low-angle shot emphasizing her form, foreground of rough red brick steps with erosion marks. Midground includes her, the roses, fountain, and cottage. Background of fence and more greenery. Strong contrast of bright sunlit areas and soft deep shadows. Color palette of white, blue, green with rose purple and pink accents. Overall a warm, nostalgic afternoon garden scene with natural amateur photography feel, sensual and intimate.",
