        {
          "id": "krea2-05d27ac360fe3073d50701ea",
          "alias": "单女露胸灰连衣裙城市沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long brown hair and blunt bangs sits on the fuel tank of a red Ducati Panigale S motorcycle, wearing a loose gray sleeveless dress that has slipped down to reveal her bare breasts and erect nipples. She leans slightly sideways, her right hand resting lightly on the handlebar, left hand hanging naturally, fingers loosely holding the laces of a pair of gray-pink high-top sneakers. Her gaze drifts right, lips slightly parted, expression a mix of contemplation and aloofness, pose elegant and relaxed, exuding an edgy urban street style. Foreground clearly shows the motorcycle's front details: red-and-white body, gold inverted forks, black handlebars, mirrors, white \"DUCATI PANIGALE S\" decals, Italian flag tricolor stripes on the tank. Metal parts reflect soft highlights; tires and exhaust pipe visible. The dangling gray-pink sneakers add a touch of everyday life and playfulness. Midground captures the woman's body and part of the bike; her long legs, knees bent, wearing black boots, body contours flowing seamlessly with the motorcycle. Background shows a blurred city streetscape with distant yellow columnar buildings, pedestrian and vehicle silhouettes, gray pavement. Shallow depth of field focuses on the woman and motorcycle, background softly blurred, creating strong visual layering. Low-angle shot, subject placed left of frame, leaving right space for dynamic movement and breathing room. Diagonal lines of the bike guide the eye from foreground to midground, forming natural visual flow. The woman's head and the front of the bike create a stable triangular composition. Lighting from upper right simulates dawn or dusk natural light; soft warm golden tones cast even side light across her face and body, producing delicate shadow transitions. Highlights on the motorcycle's surface accentuate its streamlined design and metallic texture. Atmosphere quiet yet narrative-rich, blending elements of speed and passion with everyday gentleness, capturing a paused moment in urban life with poetic romance. Image style balances commercial photography precision with documentary realism, colors moderately saturated, contrast soft, evoking a film-like texture with rich detail and emotional tension.",
