          "alias": "单女绿旗袍沙发困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully in a vintage wooden armchair, wearing a stunning green cheongsam adorned with blooming peonies, peonies, and lotus flowers in rich reds, pinks, and oranges against lush green leaves. The dress is cut to perfectly hug her curves, but the top is unbuttoned to the waist, revealing her full, bared breasts and the smooth, pale skin of her décolletage. Her black hair is swept into a low bun with straight bangs, framing her delicate, porcelain face. Her makeup is impeccable: smoky amber eyes with defined liner and thick lashes, lips painted a glossy, deep red. She gazes downward with a dreamy, slightly melancholic expression, one hand resting at her throat with long, elegant fingers, the other hand placed on the curved arm of the chair. The old wooden chair has a black seat cushion with tiny white dots. Behind her, vertical dark brown wood paneling adds depth. Soft, warm side lighting from the left highlights her face, the open front of the cheongsam, and the glossy sheen of her bare skin, casting gentle shadows to the right. The whole scene has a nostalgic, film-like quality, evoking a 1930s/40s interior portrait—sensual, intimate, and steeped in Eastern elegance.",
