          "id": "krea2-1ba250c1c346a15626e5cf0d",
          "alias": "单女金浴袍庭院忧伤站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A graceful woman in luxurious ancient Chinese garb stands on a wooden corridor bridge of a traditional Chinese building. Her long, ink-black hair flows softly over her shoulders, adorned with delicate golden floral ornaments and tassels; a few loose curls fall over her forehead, adding gentle charm. She is turned sideways, eyes lowered, with a serene yet slightly melancholic expression, lost in distant thoughts. Her right hand holds a classical oil-paper umbrella—its main colors red, blue, and white with intricate geometric patterns, topped with a golden pagoda-shaped handle. Her left hand extends naturally, fingertips slightly curled, as if touching the faint light. Her wide, flowing sleeves are semi-transparent silver-white gauze over a golden brocade inner robe, embroidered with cloud and dragon-phoenix motifs that shimmer in the light. The hem of her skirt trails on the ground, layers of fabric rippling like water. She stands beside a dark-brown wooden railing, weathered and textured. The background evokes a Jiangnan water town or ancient courtyard: mottled walls, gray tiles, a warm yellow lantern hanging under the eaves casting soft halos on the wood and carved window lattices. Distant blurred building outlines create depth. The composition is a medium close-up, with the subject positioned left of center, her body in a diagonal S-curve. Visual flow leads from the umbrella tip upward to the sky, then down along her arm and skirt, forming a dynamic loop. The light source is back-right, a mix of sunset backlight and side light. Sunlight penetrates the umbrella, casting hazy patches on her body, edges of her clothing glowing with golden rim light, while long shadows stretch across the ground and railing, creating strong contrast and volumetric form. The overall mood is serene, poetic, rich in Eastern aesthetic—both imperial opulence and a hint of loneliness and nostalgia. Color palette: warm yellow, ochre, silver-white, and gold, with harmonious cool-warm contrast. The image is finely detailed, as if shot with a high-resolution camera, with subtle film grain and natural lens flares, exuding a realistic yet artistic cinematic quality, capturing a moment of eternal beauty. Her inner robe is loosely draped, revealing one bare shoulder and the curve of her breast, the sheer gauze hinting at her nakedness beneath, the nipple faintly visible. The sensual exposure adds a layer of intimate vulnerability to the classical scene.",
