          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市媚态坐脱衣（3）",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a gray fabric sofa, her black shoulder-length hair with airy bangs falling naturally, ends slightly curled, soft and layered. She leans slightly to the side, head tilted, eyes locked on the lens with a cool, detached gaze. Lips parted just a little, full and naturally pink. Sharp facial features, fair skin, high nose bridge. She wears a white long-sleeve shirt, collar unbuttoned wide, revealing her collarbone, neck, and a generous glimpse of bare cleavage. The soft fabric drapes naturally, sleeves rolled up to her slender wrists. The shirt is tucked into a black high-waist pencil skirt that hugs her curves, accentuating long legs. Black stockings with a subtle sheen cover her legs; a small pale band-aid sticks to her right knee, adding a realistic touch. A blue lanyard with a transparent ID card holder hangs around her neck, the card showing her photo and info, swaying slightly with her movement. Behind her, two large black-and-white portrait photographs show silhouetted faces with strong light-shadow contrast. The wall is light gray, smooth, giving a modern feel. The overall lighting is soft and dim, coming from the front left, creating a warm, intimate atmosphere. Shadows gradient across her right side and the background wall, adding depth. The composition centers her slightly left of frame, body forming an S-curve, hands resting naturally on her thighs, relaxed yet elegant. The visual line flows from her face down to the ID card, stockings, and legs. Color palette is mostly black, white, gray, accented by the blue lanyard and pink lips, creating cool-warm contrast. The scene feels like an urban office worker's everyday moment, blending professional restraint with a private, lazy sensuality—as if shot in an office break area or private space. Camera at eye level, mid-focal length, shallow depth of field keeping her sharp while the background slightly blurs. The image is detailed, textured, with layered light and shadow, resembling professional portrait photography yet retaining a real-life feel. The overall atmosphere is quiet, melancholic, mysterious, hinting at a story about workplace identity and self-expression.",
