          "alias": "单女露胸白毛衣城市媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the metal railing of an urban elevated bridge, her long, smooth red-brown hair cascading down. She wears a dark blue baseball cap with a cute Hello Kitty pattern on the brim, slightly tilted as she looks back at the camera with a sultry, lazy gaze, lips parted in a seductive pout. She is topless, her bare breasts fully exposed, with a loose white knitted cardigan unbuttoned and pushed aside, sleeves rolled to her elbows, revealing slender arms. She wears a black-and-white checkered miniskirt, hiked up high to show the tops of her thighs and the white fabric of her panties peeking out. On her feet are white chunky sneakers with intricate mesh and line details, a visible brand logo on the tongue, and over-the-knee white knit socks bunched casually around her calves. Her left hand holds a crumpled newspaper with \"International\" visible, her right hand rests near her knee, a simple silver ring on her finger. Beside her is a silver reflective crossbody bag that glints in the sunlight. The overall pose is relaxed yet provocatively confident, street-style chic. A slightly tilted low-angle shot emphasizes depth and dynamics. Background is a wide elevated road with blurred white lane markings, distant lanes and bridge structures. Strong sunlight from the upper right casts clear shadows, creating high contrast and a warm, bright afternoon atmosphere. The cool tones of the metal railing balance the warm tones of her skin and clothing. Colors are white, gray, blue, and red-brown, harmonious. Detailed, realistic, as if shot with a professional camera in outdoor natural light, capturing an everyday but exquisitely styled moment. The diagonal lines of the railing guide the eye to her face and bare torso, while the open background provides breathing room. The lighting enhances three-dimensionality and gives a warm, realistic texture. The scene freezes a mundane yet charming urban afternoon, conveying a free, individualistic, trendy lifestyle with an explicit adult twist.",
