        {
          "id": "krea2-4613c7c3635288bbf6eda81b",
          "alias": "单女露胸棕连衣裙床媚态躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies elegantly sideways on a bed draped in light blue silky satin sheets. She is topless, her bare breasts fully exposed, wearing only a sheer black net long sleeve that drapes over her arms, adding a layered, mysterious texture. Her deep brown high-neck dress is discarded beside her. Her long black hair cascades over the pillow in soft, glossy waves. Her delicate face, with arched eyebrows and deep, seductive eyes, stares directly at the camera, lips slightly parted in a rosy rose shade, exuding a cold yet sensual allure. One hand rests lightly on her bare chest, the other curves naturally beside her body. Multiple gold bangles and a thin chain bracelet adorn her wrist, with small gold earrings adding a touch of luxury. Her body forms an elegant S-curve, head tilted to reveal a graceful neck and collarbone. Scattered on the sheets are pink cherry blossom petals and clusters of pink-white hydrangeas, some petals floating as if caught in a gentle breeze, creating a dreamy, romantic atmosphere. The background is a clean white wall. Shot from a top-down angle, the subject is slightly left of center, achieving a balanced asymmetrical composition. Soft, diffused light from above highlights the satin's sheen and the smooth texture of her skin, with no harsh shadows. The color palette of light blue, deep brown, and pink-white creates a cool-warm contrast, evoking a serene, elegant, and slightly melancholic mood. The overall style blends high-fashion artistry with the intimate feel of amateur photography, rich in detail and poetic tension.",
