        {
          "id": "krea2-31899ee7a8794662c5d66d84",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙车厢忧伤坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits inside a subway car, her soft brown hair falling in natural waves with straight bangs, pale flawless skin, delicate and sculpted features, deep melancholic eyes staring into the lens, light pink lips slightly parted, exuding a quiet mysterious aura. She wears a sheer black mesh bodycon dress, hugging her slender waist and long curves, cutouts at shoulders and back revealing smooth skin, sensual and elegant. Black elbow-length leather gloves, her left hand gripping the overhead metal rail, right hand resting at her side, relaxed and confident posture. She leans slightly against a cream padded seat, legs crossed in an S-curve, right leg bent, left extended. A black leather handbag with silver hardware sits beside her, sleek and reflective. Background is typical subway interior: curved cream/beige cushioned seats, window glass reflecting her silhouette, soft light streaming in, silver-gray metal frames and handrails, blurred transit map or ads on walls. Mid-shot composition, subject occupying right frame, empty space on left, window reflection adding depth. Foreground: woman and bag; midground: seats and structure; background: interior details and faint outside view. Lighting from fluorescent ceiling tubes (cool white) mixed with natural window light, creating chiaroscuro, even illumination on face with soft shadows. Color palette dominated by black, brown, gray, evoking urban night solitude and fashion. Strong cinematic, art-photography feel, like a captured moment of inner monologue. Style blends modern urban aesthetics with vintage photographic texture, high-resolution, rich detail, shallow depth of field, subtle background blur, smooth light transitions, calm and narrative. Suitable for fashion magazine cover or luxury brand campaign, conveying a cool, independent, alluring woman in a moment of quiet self-expression.",
