          "prompt": "A young woman with short black hair sits topless on a turquoise jet ski, her bare breasts exposed, wearing only a colorful striped bikini bottom with light blue straps. She has multiple layered necklaces and bracelets, a gold bangle on her left wrist, red nail polish on her right hand gripping the handlebar. Her body is slightly turned to the left, gaze distant, expression focused yet relaxed. Sunlight glistens on her smooth, toned skin, highlighting her defined abs and lean muscle lines. The jet ski is blue-green, with a blue control panel, black handles, red emergency kill switch, and Thai text \"บูม ดีด้า\" with number \"235-33865\". The water reflects the blue sky and surrounding shapes. Background: a vast tropical beach with clear water transitioning from shallow green to deep blue. Several jet skis float nearby, one yellow with a person in a life vest, another white further away. Tourists sit or stand on the sandy beach. The distant coastline is lined with dense green vegetation. The sky is clear blue, bright sunlight from above casts soft shadows, adding depth. Medium shot composition, subject on the right side, dominating the frame. Foreground details of the jet ski are sharp. Midground shows the woman and jet ski fully, with water and distant boats. Background includes beach, crowd, and hills. Realistic light and shadows enhance three-dimensional space. Slight noise and grain simulate amateur camera quality, giving a candid, documentary feel. Overall mood: relaxed, joyful, full of summer vacation vibe.",
