          "alias": "单女黑连体衣沉思站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A female character in a revealing black tactical bodysuit, vibrant magenta hair gleaming under the light, straight bangs and black sunglasses perched on her forehead. She wears a tight black sleeveless top with long gloves, cross-strap waist, black lace-trimmed shorts, sheer black stockings, and high heels with pink ankle ties. Her outfit is partially unzipped, exposing curves and cleavage. She holds a giant purple katana with a white geometric-patterned hilt. She stands sideways, body slightly forward, head turned to the camera, sharp eyes and a confident smirk. Background is a deep purple gradient fading from dark to bright purple, with soft reflective ground. Medium shot, slightly high angle, soft front and top lighting creating contour shadows. Sci-fi style blending Eastern warrior and modern fashion, purple dominant with black and white accents. The scene feels cool, mysterious, and charged, with a commercial photography quality yet candid realism.",
