          "id": "krea2-e49a108d819dc5113723da61",
          "alias": "单女露胸白短裤公园媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a white silk picnic mat in a grassy park, her long silver-gray hair flowing softly in the evening light, her delicate face staring directly at the camera with a cold, aloof, and seductive expression. She is completely topless, her bare breasts fully exposed, wearing only high-waist white shorts that reveal her slender waist, and shiny white stiletto heels with a simple pearl anklet. She sits with one leg crossed over the other, her right hand gently stroking a small Yorkshire terrier with fluffy brown-and-white fur, perked ears, and wide curious eyes looking at the lens; the dog wears a decorative collar. The picnic mat is scattered with food boxes, bread, cheese, snacks, and a black coat lies nearby. In the background, a large tree with clear bark texture, lush branches, rows of tall palm trees and other greenery, parked cars and building outlines visible in the distance. The sky is a soft twilight blue, warm golden sunlight streams from the right, creating natural shadows and a gentle, dramatic atmosphere. The composition is low-angle, the woman slightly left of center, her body forming a diagonal from lower left to upper right, with the mat's folds enhancing depth. The mood is quiet, sensual, and cinematic, with fine film-grain texture, shallow depth of field, and a fashion-magazine style that blends realism with intimate, adult appeal.",
