        {
          "id": "krea2-d1612f3c1e8439934e37d1d1",
          "alias": "单女半褪灰风衣机场戏谑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on an escalator in an airport terminal, her shoulder-length black bob with bangs framing a teasing gaze into the lens, a soft smirk playing on her lips. She wears a light gray casual trench coat unbuttoned and slipping off one shoulder, revealing a sheer white lace bralette and tiny white shorts beneath, the ensemble stylish yet sensual. A brown leather crossbody bag hangs at her side, a pink fluffy animal keychain with white and yellow accents dangling playfully. Her left hand grips the metal handrail, body turned slightly in a natural half-length pose, the open coat exposing the curve of her side and bare midriff. Behind her, huge glass walls show planes, service vehicles, and runways under a pale blue sky, sunlight streaming from the upper right casting sharp geometric shadows on the floor and escalator steps. The metallic frame and glass architecture create a clean, modern look. Soft haze diffuses the horizon, lending a quiet, open atmosphere. The medium shot places her left of center, her expression and posture drawing the eye, while the converging lines of the terminal lead into the distance. The foreground shows the metal handrail and steps, midground is the woman and her bag, background airport tarmac. Lighting from the upper right defines her right side with highlights, leaving the left in soft shadow, accentuating her collarbone and the thin fabric. Overall palette of gray, white, blue punctuated by the pink keychain. The image has a natural phone-photo quality with slight grain and shallow depth of field, 35mm, balanced exposure, capturing a candid moment of relaxed anticipation, a mix of everyday realism and artful sensuality.",
