        {
          "id": "krea2-7221f48f53a0b81c16442749",
          "alias": "单女半褪毛衣门微笑坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a black leather booth at a cozy café, her long, jet-black hair cascading over her bare shoulders. Her porcelain skin glows under the warm light, her delicate features framed by a soft side-glance toward the camera. A subtle, knowing smile plays on her lips as she lifts a silver spoon to her mouth, the tip touching her moist lips, a trace of cream left on the spoon. She wears only a deep burgundy knit cardigan, now hanging open, revealing a thin floral-print slip dress that has slipped off one shoulder, exposing the curve of her collarbone and the top of her lacy bra. One hand rests casually at her side, her body leaning forward in an intimate, relaxed pose. The dark tabletop holds a tall glass of pale yellow milkshake topped with whipped cream, a clear water glass catching soft light, and a white Hello Kitty plush with a pink bow. A blue nylon backpack sits nearby. The booth’s vertical stripes and the clean modern wall with gold trim frame her. In the background, a small abstract painting, a flat-screen menu display, a black door, a lush green plant in a gold pot, and a black trash can with a white tissue peeking out. The scene is warm, natural, with a slight film grain, focus on her face—slightly blurred background. 4:3 aspect ratio, as if a friend’s candid shot. The atmosphere is intimate, everyday, but now with a lingering sensual undertone as the strap of her dress threatens to fall further.",
