        {
          "id": "krea2-521aa3d08754a4c96915e3ab",
          "alias": "单女露胸围巾瀑布微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "An elegant female stands sideways, topless, her long hair cascading like a waterfall, glowing with natural luster under soft light. She slightly tilts her head, eyes looking upward with a gentle smile, serene and expectant. Her skin is fair and delicate, soft contours, refined features, high nose bridge, light lip color, simple silver earrings. Her bare breasts are fully exposed, with only a sheer scarf with blue and yellow abstract patterns draped across her shoulders gracefully, the scarf lined with gold trim and intricate embroidery. The scarf is tied at one side, forming a flowing shape over her chest. Her white dress is partially unbuttoned and falls open, revealing her smooth torso. The background is a dreamy gradient of light green and pale blue, as if in a misty fairyland. To the right, a semi-transparent net-like structure floats, woven from fine threads, adorned with dried flowers in pink, orange, white—various blooms fully open or budding, petals layered, colors soft. The net drifts gently in the breeze, creating a light and ethereal atmosphere. The composition is a medium shot, the figure slightly left of center, body tilted into a natural S-curve. Visual flow extends from her face to the floral decoration behind. Light pours from above left, creating soft backlighting that outlines her form, edges of hair glowing gold, face evenly lit with natural shadow transitions. The light creates delicate chiaroscuro on the fabric and skin, highlighting texture. Background is blurred, foreground scarf and flowers sharp, midground figure crisp, background hazy and flowing. Color palette: white, light green, pale blue, warm beige, soft peach-orange tones. Mood is fresh, romantic, dreamy, with a strong artistic feel, like a meticulously rendered digital painting yet retaining photographic realism, as if captured with a professional camera in bright indoor light. Focal length moderate, focus precise, bokeh natural, image quality fine, details rich, color saturation moderate. Overall effect is both realistic and surreal, evoking the vitality of spring.",
