        {
          "id": "krea2-19dffb63bb11654854ba8910",
          "alias": "单女露胸媚态注视",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a young woman with glossy black hair swept up into a high bun, secured by a large pink polka-dot bow headband, with a few loose strands brushing her forehead and cheeks. She wears a light green cartoon-style hairclip adorned with tiny transparent beads and a pink bow. Her eyes are large and bright, with earthy-toned eyeshadow and thick, long lashes, gazing directly at the camera with a soft, inviting expression. Rosy pink blush highlights her cheekbones, and her full lips are painted with a pale pink gloss, slightly parted in a sweet, sensual smile. She is topless, revealing her smooth bare shoulders and the full curve of her breasts, with a colorful beaded necklace of pink, blue, and yellow tones, featuring a blue starfish pendant resting between her breasts. Her ears are adorned with round blue-green earrings. Her right hand gently cups her chin, fingers long and nails decorated with white polish and black dots, some nails accented with tiny stars or hearts; she wears several rings: a pale blue heart ring, a yellow-green gradient oval ring, and a gold-chain ring with a pink flower. The background is pure white, simple and clean. The composition centers her face and upper body, with soft, diffused lighting from above front, creating delicate shadows and smooth skin texture, evoking a high-resolution commercial portrait. The overall mood is sweet, dreamy, playful, and intensely sexual, with a palette of pink, white, and blue accented by green and yellow, blending youthful charm with explicit adult allure.",
