          "prompt": "A young woman in an exquisite orange embroidered halter gown, her dress sheer and daringly cut to reveal her bare breasts and toned back, the skirt a cascade of ivory ruffled long gauze. She stands in a three-quarter pose, glancing back over her shoulder directly at the camera, her black hair pinned into an elegant low bun with a few loose strands falling across her cheek. Her makeup is natural and luminous with soft lips, simple earrings and a bracelet adorn her. Her right hand lightly holds a vintage handbag in brown and beige patchwork with ornate patterns, her posture confident and composed. She is positioned right-of-center, dominating the frame. In the foreground sits a classic gold-carved vanity table with a glass top that reflects ambient light and partial surroundings. On the table, a retro desk lamp with a warm yellow glow, its shade made of cream fabric and its base of silver metal with carved details. Next to it, a transparent glass display cabinet houses porcelain pieces. The background is a spacious, bright European-style luxury hotel suite, walls in soft cream, ceiling trimmed with white plaster molding. In the distance a dark wooden door and a white door are visible, with a hallway leading to other rooms on the left. The interior features a pink velvet sofa, wooden side table, TV cabinet with a flat-screen TV (screen off, black), and in the corner a bouquet of reddish-brown dried flowers in a clear vase. The floor is covered with a yellow rug bearing floral patterns. The overall composition uses an oblique perspective, with the figure and furniture forming a diagonal line of sight. Lighting comes mainly from the lamp and overhead diffused sources, creating a warm, soft indoor atmosphere with rich light-and-shadow layers—local highlights around the lamp and smooth, natural shadows. The color palette revolves around warm orange, beige-gold, and pale pink, accented with white and dark wood tones, achieving a harmonious elegance blended with everyday luxury. The image feels meticulously detailed and crisp, as if shot with a professional camera, evoking high-fashion editorial quality while retaining the warmth and realism of daily life—a quiet, stylish moment like a film still.",
