          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a covered corridor of a classical Jiangnan garden, her cream-colored silk cheongsam partially unbuttoned at the neck and side, revealing one smooth bare shoulder and the upper curve of a full breast, the fabric falling open to expose a taut nipple and the delicate line of her ribs. The dress's fine vertical stripes and subtle sheen catch the light, its intricate frog closures and lace trim undone above the waist. The high slit rides up her thigh, showing soft bare skin all the way to her hip. She cradles a blue-and-white porcelain vase filled with white orchids, her hands gentle against the cool glaze, the flowers' layered petals brushing against her exposed chest. Her hair is swept up in a high bun, a pink orchid clip tucked at the temple, loose strands falling to frame her serene face. Her eyes are cast downward, lips pale pink, skin luminous and flawless. The soft side-backlight from the upper right traces the curve of her breast and shoulder, casting warm shadows across her collarbone. She leans slightly against the stone balustrade, one leg bent forward, the other planted, creating a quiet, seductive stillness. The foreground is her full figure, dominating the frame; midground shows weathered wooden pillars, gray walls, and smooth stone; background blurs into dense green foliage and a pond's reflection, sunlight dappling the scene. The low-angle shot emphasizes her height and the depth of the garden. The palette is cream, gray-green, and celadon blue, with a nostalgic, poetic feel, as if captured on vintage film with natural grain and slight overexposure, rich in detail and serene eroticism.",
