          "prompt": "A young woman sits outdoors at a wooden desk, topless, wearing only a dark mini skirt and beige over-the-knee boots. Her white shirt is unbuttoned and hangs open, a brown knit cardigan slipping off her shoulders, partially revealing her bare breasts. She turns elegantly to the side, looking back over her shoulder at the camera with a gentle, sensual smile, her slightly wavy hair falling naturally, some strands tucked behind her ear. Her right hand rests lightly on the desk, left hand on her crossed knee, fingers long and relaxed. On the desk sits a vintage cream-colored computer monitor with colorful sticky notes (pink, blue, green, yellow) on its gray screen; beside it a white keyboard, a red cup, and a small metal can. She sits on a modern swivel chair with wooden seat and back, black metal frame, her legs crossed smoothly, soft shadows from left lighting accentuating the curves of her thighs. The dense green forest background is dappled with sunlight through leaves, creating a warm, nostalgic atmosphere. Composition balances the woman slightly right and the computer/desk on the left, guiding the eye from screen to her face and smile. Soft daylight from above and left casts natural highlights on her skin, visible clothing wrinkles, and subtle skin texture. Color palette: greens, browns, whites, with colorful sticky notes and red cup as accents. The image has a filmic quality, slight grain and mild overexposure, like a cherished old photo capturing an intimate, serene afternoon, with background bokeh enhancing the subject.",
