        {
          "id": "krea2-34a4162e13f651c6b99f2e1a",
          "alias": "单女白挂脖街道媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a wooden bench outside a city street-side café, her long, silky black hair cascading freely and stirring gently in the breeze. She stares directly into the lens with deep, sultry eyes, her expression cool and aloof, lips slightly parted in a lazy, inviting pout. She wears a sheer white halter top with thin straps that highlight her collarbones; the fabric is nearly transparent, revealing the firm outline of her nipples through the delicate material. Loose sleeves with gathered cuffs create a balloon effect. She pairs this with high-cut white shorts that hug her hips and cream-colored over-the-knee boots. Her left hand rests casually on her thigh, fingers long and polished with pale nail lacquer, while her right hand drapes over the edge of the bench. She leans forward slightly, her posture relaxed yet elegantly provocative. In the foreground lies the light wooden bench, simple in design with natural grain, holding a black leather handbag (square, zipper visible), an open magazine, and a phone. The ground is gray terrazzo with subtle grain. Behind her, a massive glass storefront reflects blurred images of buildings, pedestrians, and traffic across the street, while also mirroring her own figure, creating a layered interplay of reality and reflection. Through the glass, the café interior is visible: a bar, chairs, and displays, all softly lit with warm indoor light blending with the outdoor natural light, evoking an everyday urban atmosphere. The composition is centered, with the woman slightly right of center, drawing focus to her face, while reflections and foreground objects add depth. Light comes from front-left, soft and diffused, like an overcast or early morning sky, casting no harsh shadows and highlighting her skin's texture and clothing details. The color palette is clean and crisp—whites, creams, black, and taupe—contrasting boldly yet muted. The mood is quiet, intimate, as if capturing a lazy afternoon moment, saturated with urban chic and a lived-in sense of realism, resembling a high-resolution street photograph with meticulous composition, rich details, and subtle play of light and shadow, brimming with story and aesthetic allure.",
