        {
          "id": "krea2-23ccc3ae6764b158867a51b9",
          "alias": "单女全裸黑内裤纯色背景媚态坐",
          "prompt": "A young woman in futuristic cyberpunk fashion sits naked from the waist up, her grey-black gradient hair tied into twin tails behind her shoulders with silver strands falling over her bare chest. She wears large black headphones with mechanical arms and glowing details, her expression mysterious and seductive as she parts her lips slightly. Her torso is fully exposed, skin smooth and pale, with only a black high-waisted thong and white mesh netting wrapping around her hips and waist. She sits on a pure white background, one leg bent with foot on the floor, the other raised, wearing chunky white platform sneakers. Her left hand lifts near her head, showing a black wristband and metal ornament; her right hand braces on the floor. A white loose jacket drapes over her thigh. The scene includes vertical English text \"Teach me to hear\" with a star sparkle on the left, and a wavy white line like sound data on the right. Soft front-left lighting highlights her bare chest and contours, with subtle shadows. Mid-shot composition, black-white-gray palette with metallic accents, clean futuristic atmosphere, professional high-fashion portrait quality.",
