          "prompt": "A female ballet dancer stands en pointe on her left leg, right leg extended high onto a barre, her body gracefully arched in profile. She wears only a sheer nude tulle skirt, her bare back and breasts fully exposed, nipples visible through the translucent fabric. Her long hair falls freely, her gaze distant and focused, embodying serene artistic obsession. The dance studio is filled with mirrors reflecting her nude form from multiple angles. Soft warm overhead light casts gentle shadows on the gray floor, where faint reflections of her legs and the worn wooden barre appear. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with her figure at the right golden point, the diagonal barre leading the eye upward. Subtle film grain and natural exposure give the image a nostalgic, authentic feel, merging professional composition with raw, intimate sensuality.",
