        {
          "id": "krea2-ef721ed27b576280cc5aa63e",
          "alias": "单女露胸白短裤窗边微笑坐手持物",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a light gray carpet, topless, holding a colorful plaid basketball above her head with both hands. She wears only white athletic shorts and pink plaid slippers, her long black hair falling naturally. A gentle, knowing smile plays on her lips as she looks to the right, a blue-white plaid hair tie on her left wrist and small earrings. Her pose is relaxed and playful, body slightly leaning forward, the basketball framing her bare chest. Foreground left: two blue basketballs and folded towels—one blue-white striped, one green plaid. Midground: she is center-right, the visual focus. Background: plain light gray-white wall, no decoration. Light streams from upper left, casting soft shadows and a warm light band across the carpet. Sunlight through a window creates a clear patch on the floor, bright and inviting. Center-symmetric composition. Colors pink, blue, white, bathed in cozy warm light. The scene feels like a candid home snapshot—slight film grain, natural light transitions. Focus on her face and the basketball; background slightly blurred. Soft, even lighting, a calm and intimate home atmosphere. Her expression is genuine, her movement casual yet suggestive. Youthful energy and a relaxed, sensual vibe. Color harmony balances sweet girlishness with sporty edge. Rich details: folds of her shorts, the texture of the basketball, bare skin, clear shadow gradients from highlights to soft darkness. Realistic yet artistic.",
