        {
          "id": "krea2-a567cbb60f7381838736de96",
          "alias": "单女白西装摄影棚媚态跪侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman kneels on the black studio floor, wearing a crisp white suit jacket open to reveal a sheer white bra and her toned midriff, matched with high-waisted white trousers. She tilts her head slightly upward to the left, lips parted, eyes focused and contemplative, as if lost in thought or gazing at a distant goal. Her long hair falls naturally, strands brushing her cheek. Her right hand rests gracefully on her hip, fingers splayed, exuding elegance and quiet power. The backdrop is a pure black curtain, with a white reflector and metal stand visible on the left, plus a studio light with an orange cord, hinting at the real, gritty production setting. Low-angle composition places her slightly right of center, body angled, creating a strong diagonal leading the eye upward. Foreground elements like the light and reflector frame the scene, adding depth. Soft left-front light sculpts her face and bare upper chest, casting natural shadows and highlighting the subtle sheen on the white fabric. The stark black background contrasts with the clean white suit, making her pop. The overall tone is monochrome with a single orange wire accent—controlled yet raw. The mood is quiet, focused, and artistic, capturing an intimate moment between takes: the professional discipline mingled with a private, sensual self-expression. Details are sharp—fabric creases, skin texture, reflections on metal stands. The image feels like a high-fashion editorial shot with a rough, amateur edge—flawed lighting, slight tilt, raw equipment visible—balancing luxury with authenticity.",
