          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a vintage sofa in a retro living room, wearing a deep emerald silk dress with a plunging neckline that falls open to reveal her bare breasts, the fabric clinging to her curves and cinched at the waist by a delicate tie, the skirt pooling on the floor with subtle ruffled edges. Her tousled black hair cascades over her shoulders, soft highlights catching the light. She gazes downward, eyes half-lidded, her right hand cradling her chin with fingers slightly curled, a simple metal bracelet on her wrist, her left hand resting on her thigh, fingertips brushing the silk, her body leaning forward in a graceful S-curve that accentuates her exposed cleavage and toned form. To the left, a tall beige terracotta vase overflows with purple and green dried flowers and foliage, set on a dark wooden stool with worn grain. The sofa is gray fabric with wide cushions and two square pillows—one pale pink, one light brown—creases visible on their soft surfaces. Behind her, two windows: left with dark wood frames and climbing green vines casting blurry shadows, right with white frames and a string of warm yellow bulbs glowing softly, illuminating a French calligraphy sign: “Ici nous on crée de beaux souvenirs.” The wall is rough cement, light gray-brown with irregular mottling, the floor dark hardwood with subtle reflections. Natural light from the right window combines with the warm overhead glow, creating soft shadows that trace her face, arms, and the curves of her body. The composition places her slightly left, her gaze directing the eye toward the vase and windows, with a camera angle slightly below eye level. The palette is warm yellows, cream, pale green, and deep brown—a nostalgic, artistic atmosphere, as if captured on old film in a quiet afternoon. The scene feels intimate, sensual, and deeply relaxed—a silent moment of beauty and longing.",
