          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a mirror in her bedroom, taking a selfie. She wears only a sheer gray Victoria's Secret triangle bra with \"Calvin Klein\" across the white trim, her nipples clearly visible through the thin fabric, and matching panties. A silver cross necklace hangs at her neck. Her black hair is pulled back into a sleek low bun, her fair skin glowing, lips slightly parted, eyes locked on the camera with a lazy, confident expression. In her right hand she holds a black smartphone with a blue-purple gradient case, aimed at the mirror. Her left hand casually tugs at the edge of her pink striped bathrobe, pulling it open to reveal more of her body. The robe is loose, tied at the waist, its soft towel texture creating folds around her shoulders. She leans slightly, one shoulder bare, posing elegantly yet provocatively. The background: a minimalist light gray wall, a dark gray door frame with a metal handle and a square control panel, two black switches. Soft overhead light casts a warm-cool tone, no harsh shadows. The image looks like a candid mirror selfie from a high-pixel phone, with slight grain and motion blur, adding a real, intimate feel. The composition centers on her reflection, drawing the viewer's eye to her face and down her body. The atmosphere is private yet inviting, a quiet moment of self-expression and desire.",
