          "alias": "单女全裸媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits bare-skinned on a sunlit lawn, her body nude except for a sheer pink floral-print slip that drapes loosely over one shoulder, pooling around her hips on the lush green grass. The delicate fabric is translucent, revealing her nipples and the curve of her breasts, the floral pattern in pink, lavender, and pale blue. She leans slightly sideways, hands resting on her bare thighs, one leg bent, the other stretched out, posing with a relaxed yet inviting openness. Her long black hair falls freely over her shoulders, catching the breeze. She gazes upward to the right, lips parted, expression soft and contemplative. Her skin glows with a healthy sheen in the warm sunlight, every contour of her face and body defined by gentle shadows. Foreground shows detailed grass blades with dew drops and scattered fallen leaves. She occupies the left third of the frame, her body angled to create dynamic balance. Background features white-barked birch trees with a pruned Japanese bonsai tree beside them, and a dark gray wooden fence with weathered grain, behind which a white wall is barely visible. Composition uses rule of thirds with plenty of negative space to the right. Light comes from upper left, warm golden sunlight filtering through leaves, casting dappled shadows on her skin and the ground, with highlights on her hair, shoulders, and the sheer fabric. Soft cinematic bokeh, shallow depth of field (equivalent to 85mm f/2.8), film-like grain and texture. The scene is intimate, serene, and subtly erotic, capturing a timeless moment.",
