        {
          "id": "krea2-a1d6700ba6a2fd49b3bc8623",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙城市媚态倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman leans back against a metal railing in a half-squat pose, her black hair slicked close to her skull, makeup sharp and sultry—winged eyeliner, full crimson lips, flawless pale skin. She wears a tight leopard-print slip dress, wet-look fabric clinging to every curve, thin straps digging into her shoulders, cleavage pushed high, waist cinched, hem riding high on her thighs. Her bare legs are smooth and glossy, a thin gold chain hangs at her throat, two gold bangles on her wrist. In one hand she holds a slightly crumpled newspaper, text and images blurred. The setting is a gritty urban alley at night: rough concrete walls, black glass doors reflecting ambient city lights, a white pipe running vertically beside her. Hard sidelight from the right casts dramatic shadows across her face and body, emphasizing her collarbones, the curve of her hips, the sheen of the dress. The metal railing is silver-gray, reflecting faintly, guiding the eye to her centered off-left position. She looks directly into the lens with a cold, confident stare, lips slightly parted, body angled with a subtle tension that suggests raw sexuality. The palette is deep grays, black, and brown, punctuated by the warm amber of the leopard spots. High contrast, cinematic grain, street-style photography—capturing a moment of bold, independent, erotic allure.",
