          "alias": "单女露胸蓝毛衣卧室微笑躺",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies sideways on a soft bed, wearing a light blue knitted cardigan left open to reveal her bare breasts, matching light blue shorts, and a light blue headband. Her long black hair falls naturally. She gives a gentle, warm smile with clear bright eyes and a faint blush on her cheeks. Her left hand props up her chin, while her right hand rests casually on an open fashion magazine showing a modern design of an orange spiral staircase. Beside her are a perfume sample and a lipstick. On the right side, a white bone china teacup with pale yellow roses sits on a delicate saucer. The background features soft light blue sheets and dark blue pillows, with natural folds and gentle shadows. The overall color palette is cool blue and white, creating a tranquil, cozy bedroom atmosphere. The composition is a top-down view, with the figure centered slightly left, her body diagonally extended to guide the eye. The foreground emphasizes her facial expression and hand details; the midground shows the magazine, cosmetics, and tea set; the background is simple bedding. Soft light comes from the left, creating natural shadow transitions and rich layered lighting. The mood is warm, quiet, and lazy—like a peaceful afternoon. The photography style resembles a professional portrait but retains a real-life texture, using a large aperture for a shallow depth of field, with the background naturally blurred and the focus sharply on her face and hands. The colors are harmonious and artistic, presenting a fresh, elegant home aesthetic that captures an intimate, beautiful moment.",
