          "prompt": "A young woman lounges on a balcony sofa at a tropical resort, her long black hair cascading over bare shoulders. Her skin is flawless and pale, with sharp, delicate features. She playfully winks one eye, a soft sweet smile on her lips, her gaze lazy and seductive. She wears a tight white-and-beige striped spaghetti-strap sundress, the thin straps slipping off one shoulder to reveal her collarbone and the hint of a bare breast. The dress clings to every curve, riding high up her thighs as she shifts. Her right hand rests on the strap of a pink canvas bag, while her left hand casually trails along the edge of a red striped sofa cushion. A simple purple bracelet dangles from her wrist. The overall pose is relaxed yet inviting, exuding a natural elegance. The foreground is a close-up of her sitting on a brown-and-red woven sofa with visible texture and slight wear. In the background, Southeast Asian architecture—gray-blue tiled roofs stacked in layers, white columns and railings—creates a geometric frame. Tall coconut trees sway gently in the soft breeze beyond. The sky is a muted gray-white, diffuse natural light from an overcast or thin cloud cover. The composition places the subject slightly left-center, with vertical lines from balcony railings and diagonal rooflines guiding the eye. Focus is on her facial expression and upper body. Lighting is soft, with warm tones of cream, pink, gray-blue, and brown, evoking a cozy, intimate vacation vibe. The camera angle is slightly downward, mimicking a handheld shot, with subtle motion blur and grain, as if snapped on a casual phone or compact camera. Edges slightly out of focus, enhancing a candid, life-like feel. The overall aesthetic is natural, spontaneous, and undeniably sensual—a daily travel snapshot with a teasing, NSFW edge.",
