        {
          "id": "krea2-9a1dff908cac29f45170c8fd",
          "alias": "单女露胸棕连衣裙楼梯媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "An elegantly dressed woman sits alone in a spacious cinema auditorium, wearing a deep brown satin dress that clings to her curves, with the bodice plunging low to reveal the swell of her bare breasts, the fabric slipping slightly off one shoulder. Her long golden hair cascades in soft waves over her shoulders, framing a delicate face with flawless fair skin and sultry makeup—rosy lips, smoky eyes gazing left with a melancholic allure. She wears a simple round necklace and thin bracelet; one hand rests on her bare thigh, pushing the skirt’s slit aside to expose its pale length. She crosses her legs, black strappy heels dangling from one foot. The red velvet seat is wide and plush, with a visible cup holder, her number tag distinct. The surrounding rows are empty, creating an intimate, lonely aura. Warm amber light spills from above, casting dramatic chiaroscuro across the dark wood-paneled walls and the carpeted floor with red stripes. Low-angle shot emphasizes her long silhouette and the dress pooling around her, the hem riding up to reveal her inner thigh. The focus is sharp on her face and décolletage, with soft bokeh in the deep perspective of the theater stairs and empty seats. The scene feels like a cinematic moment, both luxurious and charged with quiet sensuality, ready for a story to unfold.",
