        {
          "id": "krea2-2b3e4926b44769f720129365",
          "alias": "单女露胸粉短裙沙发媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a plaid fabric sofa, her bare breasts exposed, wearing only a pink floral long skirt and white cotton socks, brown curly hair falling over her shoulders, a gentle, sensual smile on her face. She holds a bunch of pale purple daisies high in her right hand, her left hand resting on the floor, relaxed and elegant. The scene is cozy and nostalgic: a vintage green electric fan with still blades to the left foreground, scattered blue flowers beside it, an old CRT TV on a wooden cabinet showing a blurry screen, a potted plant on top, colorful posters and illustrations on the wall including Japanese text, butterfly patterns, and photos. A black vintage radio by the wall, a wooden guitar leaning against the sofa to the right, a glass vase with a large bouquet of pale purple daisies nearby. Warm yellow sunlight streams from the left, illuminating her face and bare torso, casting clear shadows on the floor. The floor has a beige woven mat with scattered grapes and a wicker basket of fruit. Composition centered on the woman, with objects arranged in foreground, midground, and background, creating rich layers. The visual flow starts from her face, follows the raised flowers to the wall decorations, then back to the fan and flowers on the ground, forming a circular viewing path. Overall warm tones of yellow, beige, light pink, and lavender, with touches of green and brown. The image has a realistic, slightly grainy film-like quality with natural light transitions, capturing an intimate, everyday moment. All elements build a space full of story, emotional warmth, and artistic beauty, evoking a sense of peaceful, poetic life.",
