        {
          "id": "krea2-9bcc1add0c693223c85bdc5a",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫闭眼站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands beneath the metal scaffolding backstage, wearing a loose, long white shirt-dress with a dark slim-check tie loosely knotted at her unbuttoned collar, sleeves rolled carelessly to her elbows, revealing her wrists. Her untucked white shirt-dress hangs open slightly, exposing a glimpse of a black lace bralette and the curve of her cleavage. Her long, wavy black hair falls naturally, strands brushing her cheeks and shoulders. She tilts her head back, eyes closed, a playful, satisfied smile on her lips. Her right hand grips the metal bar above her; her left hand flashes a V-sign, a simple gold chain bracelet at her wrist. The pose is relaxed, expressive, as if savoring a private moment before the show. The background is an intricate industrial metal scaffold structure—silver-gray steel pipes crisscross, some wrapped in black insulation, with scuff marks and colorful tape, creating a raw, working-environment feel. In the distance, blurry stage lights and set pieces are faintly visible. The space is dim, lit by soft warm light from above-left, casting natural highlights and shadows across her face and body, emphasizing her curves and the texture of her dress. The composition is low-angle, slightly off-center with her right of center, the scaffold lines drawing the eye upward to her. A thick black hose cuts diagonally from the lower left, adding dynamic space. The overall palette is cool metallic grays and dark tones, contrasting sharply with her white dress, evoking a modern yet nostalgic industrial aesthetic. The image has fine grain and slight noise, mimicking a candid phone or compact camera shot backstage—capturing an intimate, unguarded, sexually charged moment of individuality and peace, away from the spotlight.",
