          "alias": "单女全裸绿短裙庭院忧伤跪手持物",
          "prompt": "A young woman kneels on stone ground, her black hair piled high in an ornate gold crown studded with pearls and jewels, dangling tassels swaying in the faint breeze. A red floral bindi adorns her forehead. She is nude from the waist up, her full breasts exposed, skin pale and smooth, nipples taut in the warm firelight. She wears only a green silk skirt with gold embroidery and a wide golden belt holding a jade pendant. Her hands rest naturally on her knees, her expression melancholic and thoughtful, lips parted as if whispering. Long gold-and-white earrings swing gently. To her right, a roaring fire casts flickering orange light across her face and bare torso, creating dramatic shadows. The background shows blurred figures and dark drapes, a desolate ancient courtyard. The composition places her slightly left of center, the fire at lower right for balance. Medium shot, focus on her face and bare upper body, shallow depth of field. Lighting from the fire sculpts her curves, highlighting the gold crown and jewelry. Tones of green, gold, and orange dominate, evoking a solemn, mysterious, classical beauty. Cinematic film still style, rich details, high saturation, realistic light and shadow, emotionally charged.",
