          "alias": "单女半褪灰连衣裙酒店微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a hotel bed, her soft brown medium-length hair with straight bangs falling naturally, catching the gentle light with a subtle sheen. Her eyes are clear and warm, lips curved in a faint smile, gaze slightly off-camera, creating an intimate connection. She wears a deep gray sleeveless dress with a high waist, snug bodice, pleated waist detail, and a fluffy A-line skirt of cotton-linen texture with fine weave. The thin straps are trimmed with white lace. She has small silver hoop earrings. Her hands rest lightly on her knees, posture relaxed and composed, but the dress is hiked up high on one thigh, revealing bare skin. The top is unbuttoned, slipping off one shoulder, exposing the curve of her breast. The background is a modern hotel room: a neat bed with white sheets and pillows to the right, wooden headboard with warm light brown grain, a large glass partition behind reflecting soft yellow indoor light, creating hazy shadows with geometric patterns. Lighting comes from the left, a mix of warm natural light and room lamps, casting even illumination on her face, smooth skin texture, subtle highlights on hair edges. Medium-shot portrait, subject slightly left of center, body angled right, head tilted, engaging the viewer. Foreground includes part of the bed, midground her full figure and bed, background the glass and wall. Layers clear, visual flow from her face outward, with the dress hemline and bed lines guiding the eye. Overall tones gray, white, brown, harmonious and calm, with a private, slightly languid atmosphere. Realistic everyday snapshot feel with refined details, capturing natural beauty and tender mood. Soft lighting, no harsh contrast. She appears relaxed and at ease in a domestic state, evoking quiet comfort and seductive intimacy.",
