          "alias": "单女白衬衫花园忧伤脱衣",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a young woman with long, glossy black hair that dances gently in the breeze, strands kissed by the setting sun. Her face is dotted with natural freckles, and her skin is smooth and translucent. Her eyes are clear, slightly melancholic, gazing off-camera, lips slightly parted in a quiet, contemplative state. She wears a simple white shirt, unbuttoned low to reveal the delicate line of her collarbone and the beginning of her soft cleavage. In her hand, she holds a bouquet of pale purple irises with layered petals and soft gradient edges, long stems, elegant like fresh-cut garden blooms. Behind her, the endless sea stretches out, deep blue-purple water with gentle waves, the horizon meeting a sky painted in soft pink-purple sunset hues, thin clouds, and shimmering light patches on the water. Strong backlight from the left catches her hair, creating a soft halo of light. On the right, two distinct bokeh circles—one golden, one white—add a dreamy quality. The composition is a close-up, the woman dominating the frame, head tilted slightly, her gaze interacting subtly with the viewer. The foreground flowers guide the eye from petal to face to the distant sea-sky line. Warm golden sunset light contrasts with the cool blue water, evoking a romantic, slightly bittersweet mood. The image has fine grain, subdued color saturation, filmic texture and vintage tones, like a moment captured on analog film at dusk. No distractions, focused on her emotional expression and natural harmony—quiet, pure, and story-rich. NSFW.",
