          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits astride a vintage Honda Super Cub motorcycle, her white shirt unbuttoned and hanging open, fully exposing her bare chest and firm nipples. She wears a brown argyle knit vest left loose, a khaki miniskirt hiked high on her thighs, white thigh-high socks, black chunky loafers, and a light brown beret tilted on her head. Her long black hair cascades naturally, bangs brushing her forehead. She gazes into the lens with a soft, knowing smile, eyes half-lidded and inviting. Her hands grip the handlebars, body leaning forward slightly, relaxed yet poised, as if she has just stopped or is about to ride off. The scooter has a deep green body with white front panel and rear fender, a round headlight, orange turn signals glowing, HONDA logo on the dash, black side mirrors, and a Super Cub badge on the side. The foreground is a tight close-up of the scooter’s front, highlighting its metal curves and plastic textures. The midground frames the woman from the waist up, her bare skin contrasting with the vintage machine. The background is a graffiti-covered wall with green plant motifs and abstract color patches, with a brick arch on the right. Warm sunlight falls from the upper left, casting soft shadows across her torso and the scooter, creating a golden-hour glow. The color palette is warm: browns, greens, whites, with orange accents. A low-angle shot emphasizes the woman and scooter’s presence, with slight background blur for depth. The scene feels candid, as if captured with everyday amateur equipment, rich in detail and texture, evoking urban youth, retro nostalgia, and an intimate, everyday moment.",
