          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a city street, her long, straight black hair falling naturally over her shoulders, her pale skin smooth and flawless. She wears delicate framed glasses, her deep eyes gazing into the lens as she slightly tilts her head, lips parted in a confident, lazy smirk, painted with a hint of red lipstick. Her black short-sleeve T-shirt, with white trim at the collar and cuffs, is pulled up to expose her bare midriff and toned stomach, revealing she is topless underneath, the fabric bunched above her breasts. She wears a high-waist pair of loose blue jeans with a metal chain hanging from the belt loop, one hand resting casually on her waist, fingers brushing the exposed skin, the other hand hanging relaxed at her side. The background shows a typical Southeast Asian street scene with a white building with a red roof, green trees, trimmed bushes, a traffic cone in the foreground, and an overpass structure above. The light is soft and diffused from a cloudy sky, giving a cool, film-grain aesthetic. The composition is a mid-shot, her body slightly tilted off-center, creating dynamic balance, with the cone adding depth. The overall mood blends urban modernity with a raw, everyday sensuality, capturing a candid moment of street-level allure.",
