          "prompt": "A stunning Eastern classical beauty in exquisite Hanfu, her face ethereal and pure, skin like creamy white jade, delicate and smooth. Her eyes are deep and bright, gazing forward with gentle composure, cherry-red lips slightly parted. A small red floral huadian adorns her forehead, adding classical allure. Her long black hair is piled high in an elegant ancient updo, adorned with intricate gold ornaments—phoenix-shaped hairpins, dangling step-swaying tassels, and a jeweled crown studded with pearls and gems, shimmering in gold. She wears a white-based Hanfu with flowing, lightweight fabric, embroidered with red cloud motifs and gold patterns; the collar and cuffs have gold trim. Underneath, a red low-cut bodice hugs her curves, revealing ample cleavage, also embroidered with gold, with a round jewel at the center. In her right hand, she holds a white feather fan with fluffy plumage and tiny bead edging, the black handle smooth. She stands slightly turned, head facing the camera, gaze calm and noble, a soft smile playing on her lips. The foreground focuses on her face and upper torso, with the Hanfu slipping slightly to bare one pale shoulder, hinting at sensuality. The background is blurred—soft blue gradient on the left, warm red on the right suggesting lanterns or flowers, creating cool-warm contrast. The lighting is warm, golden, from the front-left, highlighting her skin's texture and the three-dimensionality of her dress. The overall atmosphere is quiet, elegant, with a touch of seductive allure, like a high-end boudoir portrait with cinematic quality and rich cultural essence.",
