          "prompt": "A young woman sits sideways on a white Honda scooter, her oversized cream chunky-knit cardigan hanging open to reveal a sheer black lace bralette and smooth cleavage. She wears a short brown pleated skirt hiked high on her thighs, one leg dangling freely. Her long black hair falls in waves, blunt bangs framing her face as she gazes into the distance with parted lips, a hint of melancholy and detachment. Her left hand rests lazily on the handlebar, body leaning slightly forward, exuding a casual, sensual urban vibe. The scooter is classic retro design—white body, dark green tank and tail accents, a polished \"HONDA\" metal badge visible. Low-angle shot looking up, emphasizing her long legs and the scooter's curves. Foreground detail of the handlebars and dashboard, crisp and realistic. Midground centers on the woman and scooter, slightly left of frame. Background: a historic street lined with red-brick European buildings, arched windows and doorways, weathered walls, a silver car in the distance, other scooters parked, blurred pedestrians. Bright blue sky with soft clouds, warm afternoon sunlight streaming from upper right, casting gentle shadows. Warm tones—cream, tan, brick orange, teal, sky blue—with film-grain texture and slight overexposure, like a vintage analog photo. Shallow depth of field keeps the subject sharp while softly blurring the background, enhancing depth and intimacy. The scene captures a candid, nostalgic moment of street life, blending urban energy with a quiet personal space, dripping with artistic and retro eroticism.",
