          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a minimalist indoor setting, topless, wearing only loose blue jeans unbuttoned at the waist, her bare skin exposed from the waist up. Her long black hair falls naturally, a few strands brushing her cheek, giving a casual, alive feel. She gazes directly at the camera, eyes clear with a hint of contemplation, lips slightly parted as if whispering or just finished speaking. Her pose is relaxed yet elegant, left hand resting on her knee, a delicate silver ring on her ring finger adding a refined detail. She is positioned slightly left of center, body turned subtly right, head tilted, creating dynamic balance. The foreground shows her upper body and part of her bare torso, clearly defined, midground includes her arms, hand, and part of the chair. Background is a pure light beige wall, clean and distraction-free. Composition follows the rule of thirds, focus on her face and upper body, ample negative space guiding attention to her expression and mood. Lighting is soft natural light or a softbox from the left, evenly illuminating her skin, forming subtle chiaroscuro on her face, nose bridge and cheekbones have gentle highlights, shadows softly cast on the right side of her face and neck. The folds of her jeans catch subtle light and shadow, enhancing three-dimensionality, her hair shows interplay of gloss and shadow, suggesting a moist texture. Overall atmosphere is calm, introspective, and narrative, with a palette of white, blue, and beige, harmonious with a cool tone, evoking a fresh, gentle, slightly detached modern feel. The image quality resembles professional portrait photography with film grain and realistic light layers, yet retains the natural feel of everyday life, as if captured on a quiet afternoon with a high-end camera. The composition is stable yet breathable, the relationship between subject and environment harmonious, with good spatial depth and rich detail without clutter, presenting a serene, tender, emotionally charged visual experience.",
