          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a white wooden table in an outdoor café, wearing a sheer white lace slip dress that clings to her body, the delicate fabric revealing her bare breasts, nipples hard against the lace. The dress has a soft pink inner lining, adding a romantic shimmer. Her long dark brown hair falls in loose waves, strands brushing her cheek, lending a lazy, sensual air. She turns slightly to the side, eyes cast downward into the distance, pensive, lips parted in a silent sigh. Her right hand rests casually on the table, a simple silver ring on her ring finger, left hand gripping the table edge, posture elegant but relaxed. On the table: a glass of orange-yellow iced drink with black straw, and a clear glass of water with condensation beads. Beside her, a woven straw handbag in beige with black palm leaf pattern, brown leather handles. Background: a light gray brick wall, slightly worn. Light from left side casts soft natural illumination on her face, arm, and fabric folds, creating rich shadows. Mid-shot composition, subject left, gaze leading off-frame. Color palette: white, beige, light gray, soft pink, orange-yellow. Slight film grain and vignette, as if captured on an old film camera. 50mm prime lens at f/2.8, shallow depth of field, soft bokeh. The scene is warm, nostalgic, with a quiet erotic tension.",
