          "id": "krea2-473ca12dd3564944a9427f42",
          "alias": "单女露胸白T恤花园沉思倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a field of blooming yellow tulips, shot from a low angle looking up. She wears a wide-brimmed straw hat with a thin green edge, her dark short hair falling naturally. Her face is delicate, eyes clear and slightly pensive as she looks at the camera, head slightly tilted, expression soft and serene. She wears only a thin white lace camisole top, fully topless with her nipples visible through the sheer fabric, the top barely covering her breasts, revealing her collarbone, shoulders, and the full curve of her bare chest. A thin gold chain necklace rests on her skin. Her body is slightly turned, natural and relaxed. In the foreground, giant yellow tulips with thick, plump petals, half-open, bright and vibrant, with sturdy stems occupying the lower left and center, creating strong visual leading lines and depth. Some flowers are blurred at the edges for bokeh effect. The woman is in the upper right of the frame, her body slightly leaning, relaxed. The background is a clear blue sky and dense green trees with bright emerald leaves under sunlight, branches interwoven. The composition is diagonal from the lower left flowers to the upper right figure, enhancing motion and depth. Lighting is bright soft natural light from above right, with dappled shadows through tree leaves. Her face is evenly lit, skin texture fine, clothing folds visible. Atmosphere is warm, bright, full of life and romance. Color palette is yellow, white, blue, green, harmonious. The yellow tulips are the focal point, contrasting with sky and trees. The image feels like a spontaneous phone snapshot, with slight film grain and noise, capturing a beautiful afternoon garden moment, realistic yet artistic. Rich in detail, layered, with both everyday life and poetic atmosphere, evoking spring warmth and hope.",
