        {
          "id": "krea2-d73667ff62b68d4f9ce7faca",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝礼服摄影棚困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in the corner of an intimate indoor studio, topless except for a deep blue velvet and tulle gown that has slipped down from her shoulders, pooling around her waist and revealing her full bare breasts. The dress features a satin bodice, elegant square neckline with ruffle trim, and natural shoulder frills; the waist and skirt are densely embroidered with blue sequin floral motifs and three-dimensional blossoms, offering a luxurious, refined texture. Her dark brown shoulder-length hair has blunt bangs and soft waves, and she gazes directly at the camera with clear, tender eyes. Her makeup is natural with pale pink lips. Her right hand rests lightly on her bare chest, a blue butterfly-shaped ring on her finger; her left hand rests on the floor, nails painted light blue. Her posture is composed yet languid, radiating quiet elegance. The foreground shows the voluminous multi-layered translucent tulle skirt spreading across the ground, with soft light from the left creating delicate chiaroscuro on the fabric. She is positioned slightly to the right of center, body leaning forward, head tilted. In the background right stands a large dried floral arrangement of roses, baby’s breath, and eucalyptus in cream, light brown, pale pink, and gray-green. Left is a white carved wooden frame holding part of a vintage clock with a cream face and visible Roman numerals. Above, a wooden shelf holds white candles and a bronze decorative box. Walls are light gray, floor is light gray tile. Low-angle shot emphasizes her regal presence and the dress’s opulent details. The visual flow, guided by her eyes and hand gesture, draws attention to her face and bare chest. The warm, soft lighting from the left creates natural shadows, gentle and unforced, evoking a peaceful, artistic atmosphere—like an elegant portrait in a private space, with the authenticity of amateur equipment yet the finesse of professional photography. The overall scene is romantic, poetic, vintage, rich in detail, layered, and harmoniously colored, balancing dreamlike fantasy with everyday intimacy.",
