        {
          "id": "krea2-4a734caf2cbba1888260bc55",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫舞台困倦蹲脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches on the gritty backstage floor of a dimly lit concert venue, her long black hair cascading loosely over bare shoulders. Her porcelain skin catches soft frontal light, contrasting with deep shadows. She gazes directly at the lens with tired, intense eyes, resting her cheek on her right hand in a languid pose. She wears a loose white shirt-dress, unbuttoned to reveal a black lace bralette and the curve of her breasts, the collar tied with a black ribbon. The sleeves are rolled up, exposing slender arms and a gold chain bracelet. On her feet are white star-print sneakers. Beside her leans a white electric guitar with dual pickups and a tremolo system, its maple neck and tuning pegs visible, a black strap draped over the body. The background is a complex lattice of silver-gray metal scaffolding, crisscrossed with cables and equipment, lit by overhead and side stage lights that create stark chiaroscuro. The floor is rough concrete with scuffs and stains. The scene is bathed in low-saturation blue-purple tones, with the subject slightly off-center left, the guitar balancing the composition diagonally. The perspective is slightly high-angle, with scaffolding lines receding into soft focus, giving depth. The mood is cinematic and documentary-style, like a candid shot after a performance — intimate, melancholic, and charged with raw, youthful sensuality. Natural grain and subtle color shifts enhance the unpolished, emotional realism.",
