          "alias": "单女黑短裙户外媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an outdoor natural setting, wearing a striking red-and-black cutoff top where the red fabric diagonally exposes her cleavage and bare shoulders, the black ribbed long sleeves contrasting with the loose red section that leaves her midriff partially bare. She pairs it with a high-waisted black velvet mini-pleated skirt embroidered with delicate white and pink floral patterns, catching the soft light. Her arms are crossed in front of her chest, one hand resting over the other, her body slightly turned, head tilted back, eyes gazing toward the lens with a thoughtful, sensual expression. Her long black hair spills loosely over her shoulders, a few strands falling across her face. The background is a textured gray concrete wall with vertical lines, overgrown by lush green vines climbing a bamboo trellis. A cluster of pale yellow roses blooms in the left foreground. Mid-shot composition places her center-right, framed by greenery and wall depth. Natural daylight from the right casts soft shadows, highlighting the contours of her face, the glossy velvet, and the glossy sheen of her exposed skin. The mood is a blend of urban cool and natural warmth, with rich blacks, vibrant reds, and greens, accented by gray and pale yellow. The image has a cinematic shallow depth of field, bokeh background, sharp focus on her eyes and subtly parted lips, evoking a quiet, confident allure—a staged street-style portrait with an intimate, NSFW edge.",
