        {
          "id": "krea2-56d35827631685f6a1aaffd2",
          "alias": "单女浴袍泳池忧伤注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a flowing pale cyan Hanfu, her hair piled high in a bun, studded with small white magnolia blossoms, loose strands of black hair whispering across her cheeks in the breeze. Her gaze is sharp and deep, staring straight ahead with a mix of determination and melancholy; a thin blood-red cut marks her right cheek, vivid against her fair skin, lending her a tragic, wounded beauty. She grips an ancient longsword with both hands—the blade cold silver, the hilt wrapped in black cloth—the sword tip slanting upward from the lower left to the upper right, splitting the frame. Her body is slightly turned, creating dynamic balance. The background blurs into deep green, with pale white cherry blossoms trembling in the soft breeze, evoking a dreamy, poetic mood. Light is cool and gentle, coming from the front left, illuminating her face and the folds of her silk robe; shadows pool on her right and behind, enhancing depth. Her robe is disheveled at the shoulder, one strap slipped down, exposing her bare shoulder and collarbone, the pale skin contrasting with the blood and the cold fabric. The composition is a close-up that focuses on her facial expression and the sword, guiding the eye from the tip to her eyes, then down to her hand on the hilt. The tones are cold greens and pale blues, accented with red blood and the white of the magnolias and cherry blossoms. The texture is ultra-detailed: the weave of the silk, the glossy sheen of the blade, the fine pores of her skin, the slight sheen of sweat on her brow. The overall atmosphere is one of elegant ruin—a warrior woman exhausted yet resolute, posed in a moment of stillness after battle, the cherry blossoms hinting at fleeting beauty and the price of survival. The framing and lighting make it feel like a high-end portrait shot, both artistic and raw, with a palpable sensuality in the exposed skin and the tension in her hands.",
