        {
          "id": "krea2-4ffc7a3d5c77277bff10b2b4",
          "alias": "单女露胸白T恤街道戏谑蹲脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches low on outdoor concrete steps, her deep red hair spilling naturally over bare shoulders and down her back. She is topless, her fair skin smooth and luminous, a soft, teasing smile on her lips as she glances directly at the lens with playful, gentle eyes. On her head, a black-and-white knitted beanie with a gray ribbed brim and abstract pink-and-white logo. Her only upper garment is a loose white short-sleeve T-shirt, unbuttoned and hanging open, revealing her bare chest; the shirt bears black-and-red text including “ONLINE-CERAMICS” and a bold red letter logo. She wears baggy black cargo pants with multiple pockets and creases, paired with chunky black platform sneakers. In her right hand, she grips a small metal hammer—silver head, black textured handle—while her left hand rests casually on her knee. Her body leans slightly forward, head tilted, offering a flattering side-angle view. The composition is a mid-shot, focused on her from the waist up, positioned left of center. Behind her, a lush green landscape of trimmed shrubs and broad-leafed evergreens; a black wrought-iron fence with curling ornamental patterns stands in the background, with steps and a building wall faintly visible beyond. On the right edge, a bicycle rear wheel with visible spokes peeks into the frame. The ground is gray concrete with fine cracks and wear. A yellow pipe or guardrail cuts across the bottom left, its bright color contrasting the scene. Soft, even overcast daylight creates a natural, cool-toned atmosphere with subtle shadows and moderate saturation, retaining a warm human feel. The mood is relaxed, everyday, with a gritty street-style and youth-culture vibe. The viewer’s eye is drawn from her face to the hammer, then to her exposed skin and playful expression. Background details are rich but not cluttered, lending an authentic, slightly humorous sense of reality. A minor grain and low-pass filter effect, with mild motion blur and color shift, heightens the documentary-like, spontaneous feel—like a film snapshot of a rebellious, free-spirited young woman enjoying her independence.",
