          "id": "krea2-4a3692efd0c08019c4f2258a",
          "alias": "单女全裸舞台微笑站立演奏",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her long black hair tied in a high ponytail with a few loose strands framing her forehead, giving her a playful, energetic look. Her skin is fair and smooth, features delicate and well-defined, eyes clear and bright with a gentle, confident gaze. She turns her head slightly toward the camera, a subtle smile playing on her lips. She is completely naked, her bare skin glowing under the stage lights, her slender waist and elegant curves fully exposed. Her left hand lightly touches her neck, fingers tracing her collarbone, while her right hand rests on her hip, body tilted slightly in a confident, sensual pose. The background is a blurred stage lighting effect, predominantly purple and blue, with soft light cascading across her form, creating beautiful layers of light and shadow that enhance a dreamy atmosphere. Faint outlines of stage equipment are visible in the distance, all blurred to keep the focus on her. The composition is a mid-shot, with her positioned slightly right of center; visual lines lead from her face down along her body to her legs, forming a smooth visual flow. The main light comes from slightly above and in front, evenly illuminating her face and torso, while subtle shadows form on her back and sides, adding depth. The overall mood is warm yet dynamic, as if capturing a fleeting performance moment—full of youthful vitality and artistic allure. This is an image with depth, atmosphere, and artistry, as if shot with a professional camera—rich in detail, moderate color saturation, realistic texture—while retaining the natural, intimate feel of everyday amateur photography.",
