          "alias": "单女战士米浴袍森林媚态站立躲藏",
          "prompt": "A young woman in elaborate ancient battle regalia stands in a mist-shrouded dark forest, her long black hair piled high beneath an intricate black phoenix crown adorned with gold threads, silver strands, and blue-green gems shaped like soaring dragons. A small golden forehead ornament glints between her brows. Her eyes are deep and resolute, exuding cold, proud beauty. Her makeup is exquisite, red lips slightly parted, the bright hue contrasting sharply with her pale skin. She wears a cream-white silk robe draped with a gold-embroidered cape, the shoulders and cuffs adorned with raised golden dragon motifs; the fabric is lustrous and fine. Beneath, a black lace bustier is visible at the plunging neckline, revealing the swell of her cleavage and the delicate pattern of lace against her skin. A simple black pearl necklace encircles her throat. In her right hand she grips a black-hilted sword, the blade hidden behind her back; a gold bracer carved with auspicious cloud patterns wraps her wrist. Her stance is elegant yet powerful, body slightly turned, left hand lightly touching the sword hilt, her gaze forward as if ready for battle or a meditative decision. The foreground captures her half-length figure, dominating the composition; the midground shows blurred rocks and dead branches; the background is dense gray-blue mist enveloping the forest, tree forms barely visible, creating a mysterious atmosphere. Symmetrical composition with the figure slightly off-center right, the eye naturally drawn from face to sword. Lighting from upper left, soft backlighting gilds her hair and robe edges with golden halos, casting subtle shadows on her face and shoulders, enhancing depth and dimensionality. Color palette: cold grays, cream white, gold, with black accents—a noble yet lethal Eastern fantasy style. Cinematic quality, shallow depth of field from a large-aperture lens, focus on the subject with natural bokeh. Detailed, realistic, dramatic, telling a story of a female warrior or cultivator from ancient scrolls—stillness holding explosive power, ethereality mixed with resolve, a fusion of beauty and strength, her body partly exposed through the sheer silk and low-cut neckline, hinting at sensuality beneath the armor.",
