          "id": "krea2-7086949f170e9d8dd2d02428",
          "alias": "单女白内衣街道媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "Night falls, the city street draped in a deep blue twilight, quiet and mysterious. A woman stands with her back to the camera beside a black car, her silhouette defined by soft streetlights and headlights. Her long, jet-black hair falls smoothly over her shoulders, adorned with a delicate hairpin. She wears a white lace bra, thin straps resting gently on her collarbones, the intricate lace texture clearly visible, exuding sensuality and elegance. A shimmering pearl necklace glints with silver highlights in the dim light. Her right hand rests lightly on the car door edge, fingers long and natural; her left hand lifts slightly, as if about to touch or push open the window. Her body leans subtly, revealing graceful curves. The background is a blurred city nightscape, faint outlines of distant high-rises, traffic streams, headlights forming bright spots, light reflecting off the wet road in flowing patterns. Bare tree branches interlace, leafless, conveying a wintery bleakness. The sky gradients from deep blue to dark purple near the horizon. The overall color tone is cool, but the light on her figure and the details of her clothing provide warm contrast. The composition is a medium shot, with the woman occupying most of the right frame, leaving the left for the road and distance, creating visual balance. The foreground shows the car's smooth body reflecting ambient light, enhancing realism; the midground captures the interaction between woman and vehicle; the background extends into the urban street and buildings, guiding the eye into the distance. The visual focus is on her back and the texture of the lace bra, with bokeh light spots from headlights and streetlights serving as leading elements, drawing attention from foreground to midground to background, creating an intimate urban night atmosphere. Lighting comes from front and side headlights and streetlights, resulting in a combination of backlight and side light, making her silhouette distinct, skin texture delicate, shadows soft. The overall mood blends street documentary realism with the romance and tension of art photography, as if capturing an accidental yet story-filled moment. Shot with a high-ISO camera, simulating slight noise and grain from amateur equipment in low light, enhancing the sense of presence and everyday life. A medium focal length lens, with appropriate background blur to emphasize the subject. Color saturation is slightly lowered, emphasizing the real texture under cool tones and natural light. The composition has a slight tilt, adding dynamics and instability, increasing narrative and emotional impact. The overall style is between casual snapshots and artistic creation, with both everyday randomness and aesthetic intention.",
