        {
          "id": "krea2-5b724e0980fd97a3c2eb724a",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤室内媚态坐舔咬",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman sits in an industrial indoor setting, her smooth pale-gold hair falling naturally over her shoulders and chest, glossy with cool-toned highlights. Her fair skin is luminous with refined features—long, sculpted brows, heavy smoky eye makeup, sharp eyeliner, thick curled lashes. She gazes into the lens with a dazed, seductive look, lips parted, tongue lightly licking her upper lip, exuding a sexy and slightly playful attitude. She wears a black lace camisole top with a deep neckline, revealing her collarbones and the upper curve of her breasts. The hem of the top meets a white lace corset-like band that creates a striking contrast, with vertical pleats adding texture and volume. A wide black leather belt with metal buckle and rivet details cinches her waist, emphasizing Gothic fashion. She pairs this with a black mini skirt, black stockings that accentuate her long legs, and black high heels. Her hands rest naturally on her knees, fingers long with dark nail polish and several simple silver rings. A thin chain cross necklace hangs at her throat, adding a hint of mystery. She sits on the black leather seat of a golf cart, the vehicle’s surface smooth with stitched edges, its sturdy structure and wheels partially visible. The background is a gray brick wall with neatly aligned rows and clear mortar lines, slightly rough. Above, several thick white insulated pipes cross the frame, wrapped in thermal material with metal valves and fixtures. To the left, a dark equipment box or control panel is faintly visible; on the right wall, a white fire alarm panel reads \"DEFIB\". The overall lighting is dim, with a key light from the front illuminating her figure in soft shadows, while the background remains in low backlight, creating a cold, private, slightly underground atmosphere. The composition is a medium portrait shot, subject centered slightly to the right, leaning forward, head tilted, eyes locked on the camera for strong visual guidance. The camera angle is near eye-level with a slight upward tilt, enhancing her presence and posture. The color palette is dominated by black, gray, and white, with her blonde hair as the accent. The overall tone is cool and tense, with delicate light and shadow play: highlights concentrate on her face, arms, and hair, while shadows blend naturally into the background, boosting depth and dimensionality. The image appears highly realistic, rich in detail, as if shot with professional equipment in low light, with slight film grain and natural noise, giving an artistic yet candid feel reminiscent of a live-action portrait full of personality and emotion.",
