          "alias": "单女全裸白束身衣舞台媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, dark hair swept into a high updo with loose strands framing her face. Her makeup is sharp and sensual—deep red lips slightly parted, piercing cold eyes, flawless pale skin, defined cheekbones, and heavy, layered eye makeup with sharp liner and thick lashes. She wears a barely-there white lace strapless bustier that clings to her torso, the intricate floral pattern sheer enough to reveal the faint outline of her nipples and the curve of her breasts. The corseted waist is cinched with thin white lacing and a black satin bow. Voluminous white fluffy fur sleeves puff around her shoulders and arms, contrasting with the tight lace underneath. Below, she wears high-waist black leather pants, glossy and tight across the hips, with slight wrinkles at the knees and a wide black belt studded with silver rivets and dangling chains. A layered pearl necklace with a heart-shaped black gem pendant rests against her exposed collarbone and the soft hollow of her throat. Her hands rest naturally at her sides, fingers long and elegant, posture poised and confident. Blue stage lights beam from behind and the side, creating dramatic shafts of light and soft halos in the background, the cool tones contrasting with her warm skin and dark clothing. Medium shot, head tilted slightly, eyes locked directly on the viewer. Key light from upper left sculpts her face and torso, while shadows deepen on the right, enhancing the three-dimensional feel. The scene exudes both the energy of a live performance and the refined sensuality of an artful nude—the sheer fabric and bold makeup heightening the adult, teasing atmosphere.",
