        {
          "id": "krea2-71aca30ba0ab518ee682b99c",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝牛仔节庆俏皮站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in front of a vibrant outdoor music festival backdrop, her jet-black hair pulled into a high ponytail with blunt bangs across her forehead. She has pale, flawless skin and delicate features, staring directly at the camera with a playful smirk. She is topless, her bare chest exposed with perky nipples, wearing only a white sleeveless high-neck crop top that has been unzipped or removed, leaving her torso completely nude. Her flat stomach and slender waist are fully visible. She pairs this with dark blue ripped denim shorts, the edges frayed and torn, and thigh-high ripped denim boots with white spots, the shafts covering her calves over sheer nude fishnet stockings that accentuate her long legs. She wears layered silver necklaces (fine chains, cross pendant, beads), a silver bracelet and watch on her left wrist, and a ring on her right ring finger. Her hands hang naturally at her sides, one hand tucked into a pocket, posture relaxed and confident. Behind her stands a huge colorful promotional poster: on the left, geometric shapes in yellow, blue, and red; on the right, the bold black serif text \"Lollapalooza\" on a purple background, modern lettering. Below the poster, black wavy lines decorate; above, dense tree branches filter sunlight into dappled shadows. The lighting is bright and soft, casting a warm golden tone. The composition is a mid-shot portrait with the woman filling two-thirds of the frame, the background one-third. Colors are saturated and contrasting—pink-purple, blue, yellow, red—clashing with her white(now absent) top, creating a lively, fashionable, youthful vibe with strong pop culture energy. The image feels like a candid moment captured on a sunny afternoon at the festival, photorealistic and natural, as if shot with a professional camera or high-end phone, preserving real detail and lighting changes, full of life and documentary feel, pulsing with the festival's energy and the free-spiritedness of youth.",
