          "id": "krea2-50da339267fbd5b7949fee69",
          "alias": "单女全裸蓝牛仔酒廊微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits forward on a modern, curved black slatted chair back, wearing nothing but a red-and-white Arsenal home jersey unbuttoned and hanging open over bare skin, the club crest and \"Emirates\" sponsor clearly visible on the chest, \"VISIT RWANDA\" on the sleeve, white collar, red shoulder stripes—no undershirt, her pale breasts partially exposed, nipples hard against the fabric. She wears faded light-blue jeans with natural creases and slight wear, unbuttoned at the waist, revealing the top of her lace thong. Her brown hair is slicked back neatly, forehead smooth, features delicate, skin fair and luminous. She gazes intently at the camera with soft, focused eyes, lips parted in a faint, knowing smile. Her right hand cradles her chin, fingers long with pale pink polish, left hand resting above it, body tilted slightly in a poised, contemplative pose. The background is a dense pattern of black vertical strips forming a curved geometric arc, contrasting with her soft curves. Light falls from upper left, creating gentle chiaroscuro, highlights on her nose, cheekbones, and chin, shadows subtle. The jersey's red appears vivid and saturated, white sleeves crisp, denim texture visible. Medium-shot portrait, subject centered slightly left, the background lines drawing focus to her face and exposed skin. Color palette dominated by red, white, black, with pale blue and nude accents. The scene feels like a candid, effortlessly stylish moment in a café or lounge, shot on a film camera with natural grain and shallow depth of field, background blurred just enough to emphasize her, blending artistic beauty with everyday sensuality.",
