        {
          "id": "krea2-1759f1cf765185a2df7db61f",
          "alias": "单女黑外套城市媚态站立脱衣（2）",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a warm wooden bookshelf, her black leather jacket unzipped and pushed open to reveal a sheer white lace bralette, her perky breasts clearly visible through the fabric, nipples pressing against the lace. She wears a short black lace skirt that rides up her thigh as she leans against the shelf, one leg bent with her foot resting on a lower shelf, the other leg straight in white thick-soled sneakers. Her long wavy hair cascades over her shoulders, large hoop earrings catching the light, her gaze soft and inviting directly at the camera. In one hand she casually holds a green-covered book, her pose relaxed yet sensual, body slightly tilted. The background is a deep brown wooden bookshelf filled with classic novels, a vintage camera, framed cityscape photo, albums like \"100 Million Streams,\" design books (Less is More, Space, New Urban Housing), ceramic pots, and art catalogs. A few old books are stacked on the floor, with a woven basket peeking from the left edge. The composition is a mid-shot portrait, subject centered right, bookshelf creating depth. Soft warm light from the front illuminates her face and body, highlighting the sheer lace and her skin, with gentle shadows. The color palette is warm browns, blacks, whites, and the green book, with a film-grain texture and low saturation, evoking a nostalgic, intimate afternoon in a private library or café nook, blending modern urban style with intellectual allure. The scene feels both candid and curated, poetic, with a hint of melancholy—perfectly capturing a contemporary young woman's aesthetic and inner world.",
