        {
          "id": "krea2-53518c92a7d7452ad60754a7",
          "alias": "单女全裸舞台微笑站立摆拍",
          "prompt": "A young female figure skater stands on the ice, completely nude except for white figure skates, her body glistening under the arena lights. Her short hair is a gradient of light gold and dark brown, with a neat fringe and slightly tousled waves. She beams a bright, joyful smile, eyes sparkling with confidence. One hand is clenched in a fist held at her chest, the other resting lightly on her hip as she leans forward in a dynamic, energetic pose. The ice surface is scratched and tinted blue, reflecting cool light. The background is a blurred arena with faint audience silhouettes and overhead lights. Medium shot, with the figure taking up two-thirds of the frame. Soft, even overhead lighting creates natural shadows on her skin and contrasts with the cold reflections from the ice. The scene has a cinematic feel, like a sports photograph captured in high frame rate, with subtle film grain and natural exposure variation, conveying a moment of post-performance relief and joy.",
