        {
          "id": "krea2-dbdab77e425b58df0a090c63",
          "alias": "单女透视金T恤街道微笑站立举手",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a nighttime street, her long, glossy black hair partially tied into a loose ponytail, with strands casually framing her face. Her skin is fair and smooth, her features sharp and refined, her eyes bright and expressive as they gaze softly at the camera. A slight, playful smile curves her lips, exuding youthful confidence and allure. She wears a sheer, blue plaid mesh crop top over a yellow spaghetti-strap camisole that barely covers her chest, leaving her flat stomach and elegant waistline fully exposed. Below, she sports a pair of camouflage cargo shorts, loose-fitting with multiple pockets, blending street edge with sultry appeal. She raises her hands, fingers interlaced in front of her chest, revealing stunning purple-to-blue gradient nails adorned with glittering sequins and tiny diamond accents. Large silver hoop earrings dangle from her ears, simple yet chic. The background is a blurred city nightscape, with warm yellow streetlights and faint silhouettes of greenery and buildings. In the foreground, the roof of a deep blue car reflects ambient light, its sleek metallic lines adding depth. The subject is centered, right-of-frame, drawing focus to her face and upper body, then down to her hands, outfit, and posture. Lighting comes from the side-front, softly illuminating her face and form, creating natural shadow transitions that enhance her curves and highlights. The atmosphere feels modern, cinematic, and alive—as if captured by a full-frame camera with a wide aperture, blending cool tones of the outfit with warm yellow light. Every detail is crisp: the texture of the fabric, the glossy nails, the luminous skin. The composition exudes a high-fashion, youth-drama energy, filled with sensuality and emotion, like a freeze-frame from an edgy street-style ad. NFSW elements: the sheer top reveals her bare skin underneath, hinting at nudity; her confident, direct gaze and subtle pose convey a seductive narrative.",
