          "id": "krea2-c9e759542f0414eeae33e14a",
          "alias": "单女米风衣城市媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an indoor stairwell, her shoulder-length dark brown hair falling in straight layers with natural bangs, her soft facial features gazing calmly into the lens, lips slightly parted, expression carrying a quiet, aloof elegance. She wears a long cream trench coat left open, revealing a sheer white lace cropped top with intricate ruffled details that barely covers her breasts, paired with a high-waisted brown suede shorts cinched with a wide leather belt featuring a metal ring buckle, emphasizing her waist. Her legs are bare, ending in brown suede mid-calf boots with chunky soles. Her left hand hangs naturally at her side, right hand tucked into the coat pocket, body turned slightly toward the camera in a relaxed, balanced pose. The background is a gray marble staircase with metal anti-slip edges, silver stainless steel railings reflecting ambient light, and a dark interior space beyond, evoking a nighttime urban atmosphere. Warm yellow light falls from the upper right, softly illuminating one side of her face and body, casting natural shadows on the steps and behind her, enhancing depth. The composition centers her slightly left, with the staircase lines guiding the eye upward. The color palette is cream, tan, gray-black, creating a warm yet cool urban-night mood. The image has a realistic, slightly grainy, soft-focus quality as if captured with a casual device in low light, preserving a sense of authenticity. The overall vibe is modern, independent, and subtly sensual.",
