          "prompt": "A young woman with lustrous black hair pulled into a sleek low ponytail, a few loose strands framing her face, pale flawless skin, sharp delicate features, deep seductive eyes with defined eyeliner and thick curled lashes, soft nude-pink lips curved in a subtle knowing smile. She stands in a three-quarter pose, head slightly turned toward the camera, direct confident gaze. Wearing a crisp white sleeveless blouse, unbuttoned just enough to expose her collarbone, the curve of her shoulders, and the top of her lace-trimmed bra, the shirt's hem split for movement; a colorful silk scarf printed with blue, green, yellow geometric and floral patterns tied around her neck, left hand casually holding one corner, fingers long and slender, right hand draped over her shoulder holding an olive-green suede jacket loosely over her left shoulder—the soft matte texture catching warm light. Her body leans slightly, right shoulder raised, left arm relaxed, creating elegant tension. Foreground crisp focus on her face and upper torso, background blurred with out-of-focus crowd and a grid of grey metal railings, deep depth of field. Composition offset with subject on the right, negative space on the left, her gaze leading the eye. Bright natural sunlight from upper right, casting soft highlights and shadows across her face—nose, cheekbones, chin—highlighting the blouse's folds. Atmosphere blends urban street casual with high-fashion editorial, refined yet intimate. Tones of white, olive green, vibrant scarf colors against cool grey background, saturated yet natural, slight film grain and soft overexposed edges for a candid real-life feel.",
