          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her light brown hair wild and windswept, strands clinging to her forehead. She is completely topless, revealing her full, bare breasts with soft nipples peaking in the cool stage light. Her pale skin glows, face soft, eyes downcast with a gentle smile. Silver hoop earrings and a wireless mic headset mark her as a performer. She wears a black oversized hoodie, but it is shoved down her arms and bunched at her elbows, leaving her torso naked from the waist up. The hoodie’s loose sleeves hang, while her flat stomach and waist are fully exposed. She wears ripped, faded denim shorts, white stitching at the waist, a blurred brand logo on the side. In her left hand, a transparent crystal microphone; her right hand hangs free, nails painted red. A delicate corsage of white, green, and pale purple flowers tied with a light green ribbon is pinned just above her left breast, adding a sweet yet erotic contrast. Behind her hangs a purple banner with white Korean text and “i-dle & NEVERLAND” in English. The background is deep purple velvet with subtle gradients, and a faint pixelated giant hand glows purple in the distance, evoking a tech-noir concert vibe. The shot is medium, centered on her, head slightly tilted, gaze downward, inviting. Light from a spotlight above warmly illuminates her front, casting soft shadows and a cool purple hue, creating a dreamy, melancholic night-concert atmosphere. The image feels raw and real, like a fan’s casual phone capture, freezing the most natural, vulnerable, and sensual moment of her performance.",
