          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, topless, wearing only a red scarf draped diagonally across her bare chest, its end falling to her thigh, with white geometric patterns. She has on low-rise ripped light-blue denim shorts and a wide brown leather belt with a silver ornate buckle. Her black hair has purple highlights, a blunt fringe, and glows under the lights. She stretches both arms out to the sides, body tilted forward in a dynamic dance pose, nipples visible between the scarf edges. Her makeup is intense: pink-to-purple gradient eyeshadow, sharp liner, glittering corner accents, a tiny beauty mark on her cheek, and bright red lipstick. She wears gold hoop earrings and a headset mic, wire running from left ear to mouth. Her eyes lock on the camera, focused and expressive. A bright white linear stage light blazes from above, creating strong chiaroscuro across her skin and clothing. The background is dark and blurred, with subtle outlines of stage gear. She is centered, full body in frame, arms forming a wide V. The lighting contrasts cold white and hot red, with film-grain texture, high saturation, and a raw live-concert feel, as if captured by a professional camera at the peak moment.",
