        {
          "id": "krea2-aac9a2b35b8193b1edd7d483",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝连衣裙咖啡厅微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the wooden counter of a coffee shop, her long dark brown hair falling naturally with soft waves catching the warm light. She is completely topless, her full breasts exposed, skin pale and smooth, nipples slightly erect. Her face is delicate with refined features, a gentle smile and tender eyes fixed on the lens, exuding both confidence and warmth. She wears only a pale blue skinny-strap slip dress unzipped and pulled down to her waist, the white lace trim at the neckline and hem now framing her bare torso. In her right hand she holds a transparent plastic cup with green drink and \"KOBAN\" logo; her left hand raises a thumbs-up gesture. A simple silver bracelet adorns her wrist, a thin chain necklace around her throat. Her posture is relaxed, body leaning slightly sideways against the counter, exuding a casual yet seductive confidence. The foreground: warm wooden counter surface with visible grain, several black coffee grinders, a stack of paper cups, metal stirrers, filter paper holders. Midground: interior of the coffee shop, left side shows partial red brick wall with rough texture and warmth, right side has a dark green grid window frame revealing faint greenery outside. On the wall hangs a large coffee-bean-themed decorative painting (sacks of beans, rich detail), and another poster showing coffee brewing process with warm tones. In the background, a male staff member in a brown T-shirt and cap works with his back to the camera, operating equipment; further away another employee in a beige cap works. Composition: centered slightly left, slightly low angle to emphasize her figure and expression, using the counter edge and wooden beam across the frame as leading lines for depth. Lighting: mix of warm indoor yellow light and natural window light, creating a bright cozy atmosphere, soft shadows, even light on her face. Color palette dominated by green, brown, beige, with accents of pale blue and white; harmonious. The overall scene has an everyday artistic feel, as if captured by an amateur camera with slight grain and motion blur, simulating real photography, capturing a relaxed, idle moment in a café with strong lived-in warmth and human touch.",
