          "alias": "单女室内媚态自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman captures a selfie, wearing round thin metal-framed glasses with transparent lenses that reflect faint ambient light, the frames glowing softly under sunlight. Her eyes lock onto the lens, green eyeshadow harmonizing with the reflected light, brows naturally arched and well-shaped. Her lips are glossed with light pink, slightly parted, exuding casual sensuality and languor. Dark brown hair is carelessly tied up with loose strands falling over her forehead and cheeks, adding a rebellious touch. She wears a black high-neck sleeveless ribbed top that catches subtle shadows, her bare shoulders smooth, with a small tattoo visible just below her left shoulder—details faint but recognizable. The composition is a close-up selfie, head slightly tilted, body turned, creating dynamic balance. Foreground is her face and upper body, background a light gray wall with rough texture and irregular light patterns; a dark shadow at the corner suggests a doorframe or furniture. Light streams from the left, casting strong chiaroscuro, illuminating her right face, shoulder, and arm while softening shadows on the left side and neck, enhancing facial contours and fabric folds. The overall palette is cool—black, gray, white—accented by green eyeshadow and pink gloss, evoking a calm, restrained yet tender mood. The eye is drawn to her eyes and lips, the direct gaze and slight pose engaging the viewer. The scene blends everyday casualness with fashion-photography refinement, as if snapped on a phone in a plain room, elevated by lighting and composition into artistic beauty with fine texture, realism, and a touch of surreal stillness and elegance.",
