          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her wavy brown hair cascading over bare shoulders, soft strands catching the spotlight. Her skin is pale and flawless, features sharp and delicate—eyes bright and slightly upturned with a focused, almost intimate gaze. Lips part in a knowing half-smile, as if sharing a secret with the viewer. Her right hand lifts to her chin, black nails and a silver ring glinting, the gesture deliberate and seductive. She wears a daring white stage outfit: a high-neck cropped top, now undone to expose her cleavage, with crisscross leather straps and lace details hugging her torso; a multi-layered ruffled mini skirt, uneven edges trimmed with purple faux fur and metal studs; a wide white belt with round holes cinching her waist. Her body angles to the side, accentuating her curves, long bare legs smooth and toned, ending in simple white ankle boots. The deep black background is scattered with purple light bokeh, like distant stars, creating a dreamy, mysterious atmosphere. Medium shot from slightly below, focusing on her torso and thighs, emphasizing her expression, pose, and the intricate details of her outfit. A stage spotlight from above front softens her face and body, casting dramatic shadows that sculpt her form, with subtle reflections on hair, skin, and accessories. The warm lighting contrasts with cool purple halos, blending romance and edgy glamour. The image feels like a high-end live performance capture—rich textures, balanced composition, blurred background, and a cinematic quality that draws the eye from her face to her hand to the revealing costume, all while retaining an authentic, sensual presence.",
