        {
          "id": "krea2-cd2ac97780f415553f903989",
          "alias": "单女湿身上衣舞台困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in ornate celestial-inspired attire stands at a worn wooden railing, her head crowned with a delicate black cat-ear headdress adorned with gold filigree and feather details. Her jet-black hair is pinned up, threaded with red beads and cascading tassels, a tiny red floral emblem dotting her forehead. Her wide, crystal-clear eyes are locked on the viewer, pupils dilated, lips slightly parted in a mix of surprise and curiosity. She wears a deep purple cloak with fine shimmering textures, hanging open to reveal a low-cut black top that exposes the curve of her collarbone and the swell of her cleavage. Gold embroidery gleams at her shoulders and collar. A multi-layered metal choker sits at her throat, one strand holding a ruby pendant that rests between her breasts. Long beaded earrings sway as she leans forward, her wrists wrapped in multiple red-string bracelets and metal cuffs, fingers adorned with rings. Her left hand grips a black smartphone with a white label on its back, while her right hand rests on a striped paper sheet. The rough wooden railing shows wear and chipped paint, bathed in warm brown-red light. In the softly blurred background, a shadowy figure in pale traditional clothing stands out of focus. The scene is drenched in a dreamy mix of purplish-red and warm yellow light, casting soft shadows and highlights across her face and costume. The composition is a medium close-up, slightly off-center, with her body leaning forward and her gaze direct, creating an intimate, voyeuristic tension. The foreground sharpens the railing and her hands, while the background dissolves into a cinematic haze, capturing a stolen moment of raw emotion and sensual allure, as if snatched backstage during a performance. The image carries a gritty, real-life texture with subtle grain, evoking an amateur candid shot that feels both staged and spontaneous.",
