          "alias": "单女露胸舞台困倦站立出神",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her long deep-brown hair falling naturally with a soft sheen under the lights, partially pulled back to reveal her delicate ear and a white in-ear monitor. Her gaze is focused and tender, head slightly turned as if lost in thought, skin fair and flawless, makeup refined with subtle lavender eyeshadow and natural pink lips. She wears a slim silver necklace and large hoop earrings. She is completely topless, her bare chest fully exposed, smooth skin catching the stage glow, with only the microphone held in her right hand partially obscuring one breast. Her left hand hangs at her side, a simple ring visible on one finger. Her posture is poised, shoulders relaxed, exuding the confident presence of a professional performer. The background is pure black stage space dotted with scattered colorful light spots—red, blue, green, yellow—in varying sizes, creating a dreamy bokeh effect and strong depth. The composition is a medium close-up, with the subject slightly right of center, showing from knees up, shot from a low angle to emphasize her stature and stage presence. Lighting comes from front and above, evenly illuminating her face and upper body, creating soft rim light and subtle shadows on her skin folds, enhancing volume. The colorful spots in the background blur into shallow depth of field, focusing on her facial expression and the microphone. The overall atmosphere is warm yet dynamic, merging the heat of a live concert with a quiet, intimate beauty. Image texture is rich, color saturation moderate, details crisp, as if captured by professional photography yet retaining a natural, lifelike feel—ideal for portraying an idol singer's ephemeral charm on stage, conveying youth, dreams, and the power of music.",
