          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a fitness gym, grinning brightly directly at the camera, her natural brown hair slightly wavy, strands glossy under soft lighting, fair skin glowing, cheeks lifted by her smile, vivid red lipstick, eyes sparkling with vitality. She wears striking red-and-white Adidas boxing gloves, smooth material, red vivid, white with three classic stripes, held high at chest level, crossed into a heart shape—conveying warmth and power. She is topless, flat abs and slender waist revealed, skin glistening with a light sheen of sweat. She wears tight blue athletic leggings, soft fabric hugging her curves, texture visible. Her pose is relaxed; arms bent, subtle muscle definition in her arms, radiating health and strength. Background: typical indoor gym, left a silver multi-function training machine with reflective metal frame, right a white squat rack with adjustable holes, a window in the distance letting in natural light, city skyline faintly visible, blue anti-slip flooring, blue yoga mats or foam rollers nearby. Composition: centered symmetry, boxing gloves as focal point, leading to her face and gesture. Lighting from front and side, soft and even, slight highlights on gloves, creating depth and texture. Overall atmosphere warm, positive, sporty yet intimate. Color palette red, white, blue, contrast vivid but not harsh, evoking health, sunshine, everyday hope. Photographic style resembles amateur phone or compact camera, subtle depth of field with background softly blurred, sharp subject, highly detailed, natural, vivid, infectious life energy—as if feeling her joy and love for life.",
