        {
          "id": "krea2-78d0a0cd8e8695deba4cc20a",
          "alias": "单女半褪粉连帽衫城市微笑倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman leans against a white column in a bright indoor space, her body slightly twisting as she lifts her right leg, toes pointing against the column, creating an elegant and dynamic pose. She wears a pink velvet hoodie with fluffy light-colored trim, the hood pulled down, the zipper fully undone to reveal her bare chest and peaked nipples, the soft fabric hanging open off one shoulder. Her black high-waisted shorts ride high, barely covering her ass cheeks, showing off her long, toned legs. Black over-the-knee stiletto heel boots hug her calves, the thin heels adding height and tension. Her deep brown hair falls in loose waves around her shoulders, makeup sharp with defined eyeliner and soft pink lips, eyes locked on the camera with a playful, confident smirk. Her left hand rests lightly on the column, right hand hangs casually at her side. A small brown faux-fur backpack hangs from her shoulder, a red cartoon plush keychain dangling—a smiling character with a tiny hat and a white heart shape with Japanese text. The composition places her center-right in the midground, the column rising full frame to create vertical lines. The background shows a bright public interior with light beige glossy tile floor, a glass door to the left with green and yellow posters printed with Japanese text and icons, a metal cart visible through the glass, and blurred structural elements and windows in the distance. Right side has transparent glass partitions hinting at another space. White ceiling with recessed lighting casts soft, even light from above and the side, creating gentle shadows and natural highlights that sculpt her curves and the texture of the velvet, skin, and boots. Color palette dominated by pink, black, and white, with red and green accents, giving an urban street-style editorial feel with a sensual, youthful, confident vibe.",
