          "alias": "单女白内衣公寓困倦站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before an ornate mirror, taking a selfie. She wears a white lace lingerie set with pink and green floral patterns—the top is a cross-strap design that barely covers her breasts, and the low-rise panties feature delicate lace trim, highlighting her flat stomach and a small silver belly button piercing. Her deep brown hair is braided into a side braid over her left shoulder, with neat bangs. Her makeup is precise, with defined eyeliner, voluminous lashes, and full natural-colored lips. Her skin is fair and smooth. She holds a black smartphone in her right hand for the mirror selfie, the camera lens visible, her fingers long with light nail polish. She stands slightly sideways, body tilted, left hand resting naturally at her side. Her pose is elegant yet confident, her gaze directly into the lens, expression cold and contemplative, lips slightly pressed, radiating an intimate yet distant allure. The composition centers her slightly to the right, with the phone and her reflection in the foreground, her full-body reflection in the middle, and a vintage gold Baroque mirror frame with intricate carvings. The right edge of the mirror is visible; the left and back are thick cream-colored vertical pleated curtains. Light streams in from behind, creating bright rim lighting that makes the curtains translucent and casts a soft glow on her body, emphasizing her curves and the lingerie. The scene is warm and private, with a palette of cream, pale pink, soft green, and gold. The classic mirror-selfie composition adds depth, drawing focus to her face and upper torso while the ornate background enriches the artistry. The lighting is natural and soft, without harsh shadows, making the image bright and airy, as if captured in a sunlit moment in a serene room. The overall feel is like a carefully arranged indoor portrait—romantic, languid, and intensely sensual, capturing feminine self-expression with a touch of mystery. Details are sharp, from