          "id": "krea2-2069e41d33ba0ab99093a0bc",
          "alias": "单女露胸绿毛衣城市困倦站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands outdoors at dusk, her soft light brown long curly hair cascades over her shoulders, strands gently blowing in the breeze, showing a subtle gradient from light brown to warm gold at the tips, with natural highlights and shadows creating a vivid three-dimensional texture. Her facial features are delicate and chiseled, skin fair and luminous, facial contours clear yet soft. Her gaze is calm and focused towards the camera, lips slightly parted with a soft pink gloss, makeup clean and natural, emphasizing her natural beauty. She is topless, her bare breasts exposed, nipples visible, wearing only a light green knitted cardigan that is wide open, showing her chest. The cardigan has cable knit texture, ribbed cuffs and hem, zipper half open, giving a relaxed casual style. She wears blue high-waist jeans, fitted, with classic stitching and metal buttons adding a vintage touch. Her right hand holds a white canvas tote bag, the strap hanging down naturally; her left hand loosely holds a green bottle-shaped item, possibly a drink or perfume. Her posture is relaxed, body slightly turned, weight shifted forward, capturing a dynamic moment of walking. The background is a blurred city nightscape, distant building outlines faintly visible, lights forming circular bokeh spots creating dreamy light flares. The sky shows a blue-purple gradient, echoing the cool-toned shadows on the ground, evoking a serene and slightly melancholic atmosphere. Composition uses central framing, subject slightly right, occupying the main visual space. Foreground is sharp on the subject, midground shows lower body and part of the environment, background completely blurred with shallow depth of field to emphasize the subject. Visual guidance comes from the subject's direct eye contact, with her hand gestures and the tote bag lines creating secondary leading paths. Lighting is from the side and above, soft and even without harsh contrasts, her face uniformly lit, shadows gentle. Overall mood is quiet, tender, with a romantic urban night vibe. Color palette is dominated by cool blues and gray-greens, with small warm accents creating a cool-warm contrast that enhances depth. The image has the realistic texture of a casual daily shoot, slight grain and natural exposure control give it a candid street photography feel, as if captured spontaneously. The style is simple and fresh, combining fashion sense and approachability, suitable for portraying a modern urban young person's daily outfit and emotional state.",
