        {
          "id": "krea2-1e367e9368eea68e20ce42d9",
          "alias": "单女露胸灰毛衣室内微笑蹲脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches on the indoor floor, her long, silky black hair flowing with a black bow clip pinned in it. She playfully winks her right eye, a gentle, sweet smile on her lips, her expression cute and shy yet subtly seductive. She wears a gray knit cardigan, open wide, with a white collared shirt unbuttoned down to her navel, revealing her bare breasts and a hint of lace from a black bra. A black velvet flower adorns her left shoulder. Her lower body is clad in black thigh-high socks and chunky black loafers with metal studs, her feet pressing against the black-and-white marble tiles. She leans forward, her right hand lightly touching a cartoon graffiti on the white cabinet beside her. The composition centers on her from left to mid-frame. The background features a white storage cabinet with a hand-drawn cartoon girl: brown twin-tails, huge heart-shaped eyes, a light blue dress, and a giant light blue ribbon, rendered in bold, playful lines. On top of the cabinet are stacked CDs and books, along with a handwritten card and photos, evoking a personal collection space. Soft, natural light falls from above front, illuminating her face and the details of her clothing and exposed skin, with gentle shadows. The color palette is mostly gray and white, accented with black, light blue, and brown, giving a clean, youthful feel. The mid-shot composition balances the figure and background, using floor texture and her pose to draw the eye toward the cabinet and graffiti, while her gaze and hand gesture create visual interaction with the cartoon. The overall atmosphere is warm, intimate, and casually erotic—like a real-life moment captured with a camera, blending artistic flair with everyday sensuality.",
