          "alias": "单女露胸浴袍山野忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a rock beside a mountain stream, her traditional Hanfu outer robe open, exposing her bare breasts. The light blue fabric is airy, with intricate blue-and-white geometric patterns at the cuffs and collar; a red ribbon falls from the neckline as the only adornment. Her beige long skirt spreads over the stone, smooth with natural folds and shifting light. Her black hair is coiled high, a few loose strands brushing her shoulders. She has a delicate, pensive face—downcast eyes, faint red lips, a subtle, melancholic smile. Her hands rest folded on her knees, fingers long and graceful. Foreground left, wildflowers and leafy branches with red berries add life and color. Behind, blurred gray-green rocks and dense forest fade into the distance. Soft natural light from above-left falls across her face and torso, casting gentle shadows on her skin and the fabric’s texture, highlighting the curve of her breasts and the contours of her figure. The rule-of-thirds composition places her on the right, leaving space for the environment. The scene is serene, poetic, and timeless—a classical Eastern beauty in a tranquil, sensual moment, blending historical elegance with modern photographic detail. Focus is sharp on her face and upper body, with the background softly blurred for depth.",
