          "alias": "单女半褪米外套舞台困倦倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sleeps quietly against the back of a deep blue velvet sofa, her light brown hair styled with blunt bangs and a loose messy bun, stray strands brushing her cheeks. Her eyes are closed, thick lashes fanned out, straight nose, lips slightly parted with steady breathing, a mix of serenity and exhaustion on her fair glowing skin. She wears a cream-white puffy jacket fully unzipped, revealing a black lace bralette with silver metal studs, the jacket slipping off one shoulder to expose smooth skin and collarbone. A multi-layer earring set dangles from her left ear, a long chain earring swaying gently as her head tilts. She leans into the soft velvet, body slightly arched, shoulders relaxed, one arm draped naturally, partially covered by a light yellow cartoon-patterned plush blanket with gray and white animal prints. The deep blue velvet shows fine texture and subtle creases, plush cushions. Background is a pure black acoustic panel wall, vertical seams, matte finish, creating a quiet, intimate, slightly oppressive space. Mid-shot close-up from a slight overhead angle, subject right of center, head near right edge, asymmetrical yet balanced. Soft side lighting from left, illuminating face, neck, and exposed skin, casting gentle shadows and highlighting the velvet's sheen. Overall mood is still, languid, subtly melancholic, as if a private moment backstage after an intense performance. Slight grain and desaturated tones give a candid, real-life, amateur-camera feel, breathing and distant silence palpable.",
