          "alias": "单女黑毛衣户外忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a nighttime outdoor scene, her long, soft golden blonde curls cascading over her forehead and shoulders, with delicate highlights catching the dim light. Her skin is fair and luminous, her features refined—eyes lowered in a gentle, pensive gaze, thick lashes curving upward, straight nose, full lips with a pale pink tint, a subtle downturn of the mouth conveying sadness and calm. She wears only a black open cardigan, falling open to reveal her bare chest and breasts—nipples slightly erect in the cool night air. The cardigan’s soft fabric drapes with natural folds, emphasizing her slender waist and elongated silhouette. In her right hand, she holds a handbag with classic floral and geometric patterns, cream background with deep blue and black designs, metal handle gleaming. The background is a city nightscape with distant high-rises and blurred lights, while in the foreground a metallic scaffolding structure of silver-gray pipes crisscrosses, supporting a rough black drape that hangs unevenly, suggesting a makeshift stage or filming setup. A wooden pole with visible grain and wear is in the upper left corner. The composition is slightly tilted, the woman positioned center-right, head tilted down, looking toward her handbag, shot from a slightly high angle, emphasizing her face, nudity, and clothing details. Lighting comes from the front left, soft yet directional, creating chiaroscuro on her skin, hair, and the bag, with shadows deepening on one side. The atmosphere is quiet, mysterious, like a backstage moment caught informally, with subtle grain and mild blur of a casual phone photo. Tonal palette is cool black-and-white with warm yellow lights, evoking urban night solitude and intimacy. The image feels cinematic and candid, hinting at a private, unguarded instant behind the scenes.",
