        {
          "id": "krea2-c6d9da72f7183a8c145b3dd2",
          "alias": "单女灰外套椅上微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a simple wooden-framed chair, wearing a loose, textured dark gray long-sleeve coat, unbuttoned open to reveal a black lace bra and her bare midriff. She pairs it with an extremely short skirt that rides high up her thighs, sheer white over-the-knee stockings, and glossy black patent Mary Jane shoes with metal buckle details. Her long brown hair falls straight behind her shoulders with blunt bangs, held back by a thin black headband. She sits slightly sideways, leaning back casually, her right hand holding a book with a colorful geometric-patterned cover (red, yellow, brown blocks) upright. A soft smile plays on her lips as she looks directly at the lens with a calm, confident, yet subtly seductive gaze. Her left hand rests naturally on her inner thigh, fingers grazing the edge of the book. The foreground focuses tightly on her lower body and feet, the white stockings crisp against her calves, the shiny black shoes reflecting soft light. The floor is light wood with delicate grain, warm and glossy. The background is a plain beige wall, creating a minimalist space. The chair has a modern design with black metal or painted wood arms and back, a woven rattan seat, and angled cross-struts. The composition is slightly from above, with the woman placed center-right, leaving negative space on the left. The focus is on her face and the book, with a shallow depth of field blurring the background subtly. Light comes from the front left, casting soft, even shadows across her skin and clothes, highlighting her collarbones, the curve of her breasts, and the folds of her coat. The overall mood is warm, intimate, and artistic—like a spontaneous yet sensual midday shoot, with realistic detail, filmic color tones, and gentle bokeh. No distractions; every element serves her quiet, confident allure.",
