          "alias": "单女滑板棕外套城市媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a bright yellow-to-white gradient background, her worn brown leather jacket fully open and pushed off her shoulders, revealing her bare chest and toned abdomen. She wears only the unzipped jacket and a pair of tight gray knit pants, with the jacket's collar slightly raised. Her black hair is in a low ponytail with loose strands framing her face. She sports round metal-frame glasses and gold hoop earrings, one hand gripping a black skateboard with white wheels, the other resting on her hip. Her stance is relaxed yet confident, legs slightly apart, body angled toward the camera. The sunlight from the left sculpts her skin and the leather, casting warm shadows. Background is a pure split of warm lemon yellow above and clean white below, creating striking contrast. Her expression is calm, direct, and slightly sultry, exuding cool urban sensuality. Mid-shot framing captures from waist to top of head. The scene blends high-fashion studio quality with raw street attitude, showcasing her exposed skin against the textured leather and smooth skateboard.",
