        {
          "id": "krea2-0736c6bc494b18e4daba01a8",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙街道害羞站立注视",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman stands as the focal point, her silky golden hair cascading freely, strands lifting in a gentle breeze with a soft, warm honey glow and darker roots for realistic depth. Her face is chiseled with high cheekbones, fair skin flushed with a natural rose hue, heavy dramatic eye makeup with dark liner and thick lashes giving an intense, almost cold stare. Full lips are coated in deep crimson lipstick, slightly parted with a hint of a smirk, her expression cool and captivating. She angles her body slightly toward the camera, her breasts perky and prominent beneath a black lace slip dress—the top is a tight corset of intricate lace with thin straps, cinched waist accentuating her hourglass figure, nipples visibly pressing against the sheer fabric. Below, the skirt is a multi-layered ruffled lace miniskirt with scalloped edges, swaying with her subtle movement. Her hands are folded just above her abdomen, fingers long with pale polish, a simple silver ring on each ring finger, thumbs gently grazing the lace as if adjusting it. In the foreground, a grey fabric-covered object—perhaps a chair or prop—shows fine texture and creases, with a metallic pole on the right reflecting distorted surroundings. The background is softly blurred: lush green foliage with vivid emerald leaves layered naturally, and in the far left, a partially visible man in a black suit and mask, his upper body and head emerging, adding an air of mystery and narrative. The composition is a mid-shot close-up from a slightly low angle, making her appear tall and commanding. Lighting is bright and soft with sunlight from above and side, creating smooth shadows and a slight rim light on the trees and her body. Colors of black, white, gold, and green dominate—black lace against gold hair, pale skin contrasting with the verdant background. The mood oscillates between high fashion, sensuality, and candid realism, as if a planned street shoot or a stolen moment. The image is richly detailed, combining professional photography with aesthetic rawness—raw, seductive, and powerfully artistic.",
