          "alias": "单女空姐蓝连衣裙镜前惊讶跪脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a deep blue airline stewardess dress with white lace trim, the top unbuttoned to reveal her cleavage and bare skin, wearing a matching blue-and-white striped cap, long hair flowing over her shoulders, delicate eye makeup and pale pink lip gloss, posing playfully in front of a mirror indoors. She kneels on one knee on a soft white fluffy rug, body tilted slightly, holding a bright pink smartphone in her left hand to take a selfie, right hand on the floor for balance. Her expression is surprised and lively, mouth slightly open, eyes locked on the camera, exuding energetic and personal charm. She wears white lace thigh-high stockings, one high heel visible at the edge. The overall look blends professional uniform with intimate sensuality. Background: cream wall with a white power outlet, a gold circular decoration on the left edge, a large green monstera plant on the right with broad leaves extending into the upper right corner, a black-and-white cylindrical storage bin next to it, light gray wood-grain floor. The mirror reflection is clear, showing the full spatial perspective. Composition: mirror selfie angle, subject left of center, phone as foreground element adding interaction, dynamic pose, low-angle shot enhancing depth. Interior ambient light, soft and even, no harsh shadows, bright and warm home atmosphere. Color palette: blue, white, pink, green, fresh and layered. The image feels like a real, casual moment captured with a phone, full of self-expression and private intimacy, with rich details: fabric folds, lace texture, carpet fluff, skin glow, leaf veins, smooth light transitions, moderate color saturation. Artistic yet lifelike visual aesthetic.",
