        {
          "id": "krea2-f2801e8100e5a9372b312791",
          "alias": "单女露胸衬衫雪地媚态坐持手机",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long black hair in a ponytail, fair skin, and delicate features sits sideways on a modern chair with a metal frame and brown leather cushion. She crosses her legs right over left, relaxed, left hand bringing a white wired earbud to her ear, right hand holding a phone, looking down at the screen with a focused, slightly contemplative expression—but now topless, her bare breasts exposed, the white off-shoulder crop top and loose long-sleeve shirt discarded on the chair beside her. She wears only tight plaid shorts and shiny red high rain boots with a brand logo, plus rings and earrings. Before her stands a round metal table with a red \"HUNTER\" handbag, a small doll, and glasses. The floor is light cement with natural texture and wear. Behind her, a dark brown wooden wall holds a metal coat rack hung with black, white, and dark blue T-shirts; a colorful skateboard leans nearby. Potted cacti and a large leafy plant sit in the corner. A round wall lamp casts warm yellow light. To the right, a display cabinet and a large screen showing a snowy mountain or glacier contrast with the warm interior. Soft overhead recessed lighting and the wall lamp create a cozy atmosphere. Medium shot, the woman is center-left, body slightly tilted, eyes downcast but now with a subtle smirk. Slight high angle captures her full figure and surroundings, with clear perspective and visual flow from her face and hands, along the earbud wire to the phone, then to the red bag and the screen. Light comes from left and above, creating smooth shadows and reflections on the floor and table. The scene blends everyday relaxation with fashion-art feel, like a high-quality photo. Color palette: warm browns, cream, red-brown, black, green, with her bare skin adding a sensual focal point.",
