          "id": "krea2-9dd6977c083511e2e102d615",
          "alias": "单女窗边微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A classical Eastern beauty stands sideways by a window, wearing an elaborate Hanfu with its front loosely open, revealing her bare shoulders and the soft swell of her breasts. Her intricately styled black hair is adorned with pink peach blossoms and white jade hairpins; a vermillion beauty mark graces her forehead. Her brows are like distant mountains, her eyeliner traces a delicate curve, long lashes quiver, and her eyes lower, gazing at the fruit in her hand. A gentle smile curls at her lips. The pale pink embroidered Hanfu is made of light, soft fabric, with floral motifs stitched on the shoulders and sleeves, and pearl trims at the collar and cuffs, exuding noble elegance. Her right hand gently holds a leafy branch bearing two plump, juicy peaches—her slender white fingers, tipped with delicate floral nail art, lightly touch the peach’s surface as if feeling its warm texture. To the left, a translucent white gauze curtain embroidered with pink flowers and butterflies sways in the breeze, casting dappled light and shadow. Sunlight streams diagonally through the window, illuminating her face and robes with a hazy glow, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. Tight close-up composition: the figure dominates the frame, with her head and hands as visual focus; the gauze curtain acts as a foreground element adding depth. The midground shows her upper body and the peach branch, while the background is a soft white curtain and natural light. The overall palette is soft pink and white, accented by green leaves and warm orange peaches, harmonious and unified. The delicate backlighting outlines her form with a subtle glow, her face evenly lit, warm and bright. The scene overflows with poetic romance, like an ancient painting blending traditional aesthetic charm with modern photographic refinement. High-resolution capture, details crisp, texture lifelike, exuding strong artistic appeal and beauty.",
