          "alias": "单女紫浴袍镜前微笑举手",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an exquisite ancient Hanfu, the outer layer a sheer lavender gauze robe left slightly open, revealing a low-cut deep red velvet inner bodice, clear cleavage and bare shoulders, the delicate dark floral embroidery at the collar and cuffs, a purple silk belt with three-dimensional butterfly ornaments, pearls and crystal beads loosely tied. Her hair is styled in a classical high cloud bun decorated with purple flowers, golden tassels, and tiny butterfly hairpins, a few strands falling naturally by her face. She holds an ornate round hand mirror with pink gems and gold carvings, a strawberry motif in the center, smiling at the mirror with bright eyes and a slight grin showing white teeth, her left hand raised in a playful wave, fingers spread, right hand steadying the mirror, elegant and sensual. In the foreground right, a red-and-white checkered makeup bag with green zipper, cosmetics and small items visible inside, next to a pink thermos and a drink. The background is the interior of a luxury RV, dark red wood-textured panels with slight reflections, metal round door handles and recessed lights, cream white ceiling with a round ceiling light, a light curtain behind. Soft warm lighting from the front right creates gentle highlights and shadows on her face, hands, and clothing, emphasizing the sheer fabric, skin, and contours. Overall palette purple, red, pink with warm yellow light, blending classical and modern, dreamy and realistic, as if an ancient court lady time-traveled into a contemporary camper, the scene full of life, artistic beauty, and a candid, snapshot-like feel with rich detail and narrative.",
