          "id": "krea2-34ecf86fac9704fd8b49b47a",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑短裤舞台冷淡站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her soft light-brown hair falling naturally over her shoulders, strands catching the light and framing her face. Her makeup is precise and layered—smoky eyeshadow contrasting with bright eyes, full rose-red lips slightly parted as if about to speak or sing. She wears a small headset mic, its cord trailing from her ear to her collar, clearly in performance mode. She is topless, her bare chest visible, smooth skin glowing under the lights. She wears high-waisted black shorts that hug her hips, and deep blue patent leather thigh-high boots with chunky heels, adding a sleek, powerful edge. Her left hand hangs naturally, fingers long with deep red nails; her right hand is slightly raised, wrist relaxed, pose elegant and confident. A silver chain necklace adorns her neck. The foreground shows her full body, centered. Behind her is a simple white backdrop with subtle shadows, a vertical silver glitter strip on the left sparkling like stars, and a black metal coat rack on the right holding a dark jacket, with some clothes scattered at its base. The floor is light gray with fine texture. The composition is a medium shot, slightly low angle, emphasizing her tall posture and presence. She is positioned slightly left, leaving space for the rack and background. Visual flow starts at her face, follows her eyes, body curves, down to legs and boots. Lighting comes from front and above, illuminating her front evenly, creating soft shadows behind and to the side for depth. The silver strip and her skin reflect highlights. The mood is modern and artistic—stage energy blended with cool elegance. The color palette is mostly black, white, and silver, with blue accents, giving a cool, high-end look. The image feels like a professional studio shot with a high-res camera and wide aperture, focus sharp on her, background slightly blurred while retaining enough environmental detail, capturing a thrilling moment on stage.",
