          "prompt": "A blonde young woman with blue eyes sits topless on a wooden bench at a city bus stop at night, her white long-sleeved shirt unbuttoned and completely open, exposing her bare breasts, while still wearing a dark blue pleated schoolgirl skirt, a deep blue silk bow loosely hanging at the collar, black opaque tights, and thick-soled black Mary Jane shoes. Her golden bob falls naturally, straight bangs covering her forehead, her gaze calm and slightly detached directly at the camera, makeup subtle but polished, skin pale and smooth, lips slightly pursed, expression neutral and composed. She sits with hands folded on her knees, body leaning slightly forward, head tilted a bit, creating a poised yet role-play aura. In the foreground, gray square paving stones show wear, with a crushed red soda can suggesting urban life. She sits on a smooth wooden bench with fine scratches and a metal frame backrest. Behind her, a glass bus shelter reflects dim streetlights and blurred street scenes; inside, a large bus route map displays Korean text and route numbers \"10\", \"5\", \"15-2\", and the URL \"경기도버스정보시스템 m.gbiso.go.kr\". In the deep background, night streets and building outlines are visible, with warm yellow light spilling from windows, the sky a gradient from deep blue to ink black. The composition is centrally balanced, with the subject slightly left of center, her eyes meeting the viewer, strong visual focus. Negative space on the left contrasts with the glass wall and pillar on the right, enhancing depth. Lighting comes from front and above—likely streetlamps or shelter lights—soft but directional, casting subtle shadows on her face, clothing folds, and the ground, with glass reflections adding layers. The overall mood is quiet, slightly lonely, as if a frozen moment on an ordinary night, blending realistic street textures with a surreal character presence. The color palette is cool blue-gray with warm yellow accents, creating sharp contrast. Details like shirt cuff buttons, skirt pleats, metal shoe decorations, and hair texture are clearly visible. The lens mimics real camera capture with standard focal length and moderate depth of field, the background slightly blurred to emphasize the subject. The style feels like a still from a film, evoking the character's identity and story.",
