        {
          "id": "krea2-af0033c0945a7952fe716b88",
          "alias": "单女束身衣舞台微笑站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, beaming with a radiant, effervescent smile, her bright eyes full of life as she faces the camera, teeth bared in a wide, natural grin that lifts her cheeks into soft curves, her long dark hair pulled up into a high bun with a few stray wisps falling playfully across her forehead. She wears intricate earrings and a lavish choker with metal clasps and chain details, blending vintage and modern edge. Her stage outfit is a daring, cropped corset top in cream and brown with ruched texture and crisscross lacing, cinched tight at the waist and adorned with large metal grommets, decorative buckle straps, and woven rope accents—her bare midriff exposed, her breasts pushed up into soft, full cleavage. The short skirt flares in layered ruffles of pale beige, barely covering her upper thighs. Sheer white fishnet stockings cling to her long legs, with a wide brown leather band wrapped around her right knee. She grips a silver-gray microphone in her right hand, its fine metal mesh head catching the light, while her left hand lifts in a relaxed, inviting gesture, fingers slightly curled. Her body angles slightly toward the audience, poised and confident. The background is a hazy concert venue, dark shapes of a crowd barely visible under swirling blue and violet stage lights, dotted with glowing fan sticks. To the left, a blurred silhouette of another performer in similar style stands in shadow. The composition is a medium close-up, centered slightly to the right, sharp focus on her face and bare torso, with soft highlight and shadow play across her smooth skin and the subtle sheen of her fabrics. Warm skin tones, cream, and brown contrast against cool blue-violet light, creating a rich, dramatic atmosphere—intimate, sensual, and electric, as if captured in a live concert moment with crisp detail and artistic flair.",
