          "alias": "单女短裙高塔专注坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a revealing sailor-style cosplay sits on the concrete ledge of a modern skyscraper rooftop, her black hair long and straight with neat bangs, makeup sharp, gaze focused upward as she raises one hand in a graceful gesture. She wears a deep blue cropped sailor top, unbuttoned to expose her bare chest and breasts, a matching micro-pleated skirt barely covering her thighs, black thigh-high stockings, and chunky black platform shoes. A light purple jacket is draped open over her shoulders, a black backpack slung over one shoulder, a white ID badge clipped at her waist. Her legs are crossed, one foot dangling, the other planted firmly on the ledge. Beside her stands a massive red sci-fi weapon, its long blade etched with intricate gold patterns and circular ornaments, a dragon-like hilt with white tassels hanging below. The background features towering glass-curtain skyscrapers reflecting the sunset sky, soft orange-pink clouds, warm backlight from the left casting a halo around her silhouette, long shadows on the ground. Low-angle shot looking up, emphasizing her heroic stance, with a wooden platform in the foreground adding depth. The entire scene has a cinematic, high-quality portrait feel, blending realistic urban grit with anime fantasy.",
