          "id": "krea2-6020322cdb2e2e66a240c240",
          "alias": "单女露胸礼服室内媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman in an exquisitely detailed floral-printed gown stands in an ornate interior, her gaze fixed directly at the camera with a calm, aristocratic expression. Her face is meticulously made up with dramatic eyeliner and warm coral lips, blending retro and modern beauty. Her long black hair is partially swept up, with a few strands falling naturally around her cheeks, adding a soft, sensual flair. She wears a long-sleeved dress dominantly pale lavender and white, covered in delicate wisteria and leaf patterns. The fabric is sheer like transparent gauze, barely concealing her bare breasts and the erect nipples beneath. A huge white camellia brooch at the collar contrasts with a black velvet bow, drawing the eye to her exposed cleavage. The shoulders and cuffs are densely embellished with glowing pearls and crystals, and her wrists and fingers are adorned with layered gem bracelets and unique rings. Her hands are elegantly clasped in front of her torso, but the sheer fabric reveals the curves of her hips and the hint of her pubic mound. Beside her stands a tall cylindrical decorative column in pale grey-green with bas-relief motifs of shells, flowers, and small animals. In the background, a dark arched doorway emits warm yellow light, creating a mysterious, intimate atmosphere. The overall lighting is dim, with soft back and side lights casting subtle rim light and shadows, emphasizing her three-dimensional form and the layered texture of the extremely sheer dress. The tone is warm with a filmic, slightly faded, retro quality, with mild vignetting and grain. The composition is central symmetrical, her body directly in the center, drawing focus to her face, the translucent fabric, and the jewels. The column partially blocks one side of her body, adding depth. The scene feels like a high-fashion editorial from the late 20th century, full of cinematic stillness and erotic elegance, capturing a moment of frozen, exquisite sensuality.",
