          "alias": "单女空姐红制服机场媚态坐脱衣（2）",
          "prompt": "A flight attendant in a red uniform sits gracefully on a gray seat inside the aircraft cabin. Her vivid red long-sleeved shirt is unbuttoned halfway, exposing her cleavage and a lacy black bra beneath, with a red-and-white striped scarf loosely tied around her neck. She wears a beige knee-length pencil skirt that is slit up the side, revealing her bare thigh as she crosses her legs elegantly—right leg over left. A thin red belt cinches her waist, and a green work badge hangs from her chest. Her black high-heeled shoes rest on the dark gray floor with circular anti-slip texture. She holds a silver-gray phone handset to her ear with both hands, fingers long and nails perfectly manicured. A black smartwatch wraps around her wrist. Her long black hair is tied in a low ponytail, soft strands falling over her shoulders. She offers a warm, seductive smile, her gaze intense and focused on the handset as if speaking intimately. In the background, gray seat backs and seatbelts with white labels are visible, along with metal frame edges and a dark gray floor mat with circular dimples. The cabin is lit by soft overhead lighting, casting natural shadows from above left, accentuating the curves of her body and the texture of her clothing. The composition is a medium shot, slightly angled, with the flight attendant occupying the center, her body language both professional and provocatively relaxed. The color palette is dominated by red, beige, and gray, creating a harmonious yet vivid contrast. The scene has a realistic, candid feel, as if captured by a camera during a pre-flight moment, with rich detail and lifelike textures. The focus is on her expression and the subtle tension in her pose, conveying a blend of charm, warmth, and subtle eroticism.",
