          "alias": "单女半褪紫手套樱花媚态蹲注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an exquisite Japanese-style ensemble crouches on a smooth light gray floor, her glossy black hair with blunt bangs crowned by white fox ears adorned with red bows and gold filigree. Her makeup is flawless—soft pink eyeshadow, deep red lips, and two rosy blush dots on her cheeks; her gaze is playful and seductive, locking onto the lens. She wears a deep purple glove on her right hand, fingers lightly brushing her cheek, while her left hand braces on the floor, a red string bracelet circling her wrist, nails painted vivid scarlet. Her kimono jacket is pushed off one shoulder, revealing a cream-colored lace-trimmed camisole with crimson geometric patterns and cherry blossom embroidery. The skirt of the same red kimono parts to expose long, toned legs. She wears red strappy stilettos with thick gray soles, red cords and tiny metal bells wrapped around her ankles. The black sash around her waist is cinched tight, adorned with gold knots, blue ornaments, and red flowers. Shot from a low angle, she dominates the foreground left. Behind her, a bright indoor space with rows of fluorescent lights casts even cool white illumination, causing soft reflections on the floor. Blurred visitors and booth outlines create a lively yet intimate atmosphere. The shallow depth of field sharpens her face and upper body, her expression both innocent and wanton. The palette is red, white, black with accents of pink and gold. Every detail—from the glance to the bells on her ankles—radiates youthful allure and artistic sensuality.",
