          "id": "krea2-e33c1c198f250d36f8f1faf2",
          "alias": "单女全裸黑丝袜窗边媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits elegantly on the edge of an indoor windowsill, her body slightly turned toward the camera, head naturally tilted, deep brown hair loose and flowing over her shoulders, strands gently brushing her cheeks. Her gaze is calm and intense, direct, with a hint of contemplation and detachment, lips slightly parted, exuding cool confidence and inner tension. She wears only sheer black lace thigh-high stockings and tall stiletto heel sandals—black with thin crisscross straps and ankle buckles—her body otherwise bare, one shoulder exposed more, the black fabric of the dress discarded except for a high choker collar tight around her neck, contrasting with her naked torso. Her full breasts are revealed, nipples hard, skin glowing. A fluffy black feather mini skirt remains, layered feathers soft and voluminous, lifting with her pose. One leg is bent, foot lightly touching the ground; the other stretches out, creating a poised, expressive silhouette. Behind her, a massive floor-to-ceiling window frames rolling green mountains, dense vegetation, soft peaks fading into distant mist, pale blue sky, bright yet soft light. Interior walls are light gray, clean, white metal window frames, modern and minimal. Composition places the woman slightly left of center, her form taking up two-thirds of the frame from feet to head, asymmetrical balance. Foreground: sharp details of her body and feathers; midground: windowsill and wall; background: blurred natural landscape through depth of field. Lighting from the right window, natural and even, illuminates the right side of her face, arm, and leg, creating subtle chiaroscuro, shadows on her left side and wall, enhancing volume. Light highlights her skin with a dewy sheen, catches the feathers and her bare flesh. Atmosphere: serene, elegant, with a cool, sensual edge, capturing an intimate moment that blends high-fashion editorial with raw eroticism, as if shot on professional film with cinematic texture and artistic composition. Palette: black, white, gray, with green from the window, crisp yet harmonious, clean, premium modern aesthetic.",
