        {
          "id": "krea2-29c9c29070e694cb2750c1f1",
          "alias": "单女半褪金礼服沙发媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A stunning woman in a magnificent golden sequin gown sits elegantly on a dark antique wooden armchair. The dress features an off-shoulder neckline, with dense gold sequins covering her shoulders and chest, creating a dazzling effect. The waist is cut out with exquisite openwork, revealing smooth, bare skin. The skirt cascades to the floor like a golden river, pooling around her. Her posture is poised yet relaxed, one leg crossed over the other, her right hand resting lightly on her knee, left hand draped over the chair's arm, fingers long and adorned with a simple ring. Her black hair is swept up in a high bun, exposing her graceful neck, with long gold tassel earrings dangling. Her makeup is precise—lined eyes, soft rose lips, high cheekbones, fair skin—all exuding a luxurious sensuality. The dress has slipped slightly off one shoulder, hinting at bare skin beneath. The background is an elegant room with light green patterned wallpaper, a gold-framed vintage painting above, and a dark glass table corner visible. The chair is rich mahogany with wine-red velvet upholstery. Soft side lighting from the right illuminates her face and the glittering sequins, casting deep shadows. The composition is a mid-shot, slightly angled, her eyes looking off-camera with a contemplative gaze. The focus is on her upper body and the dress's details, with a blurred background. The color palette is gold, cream, dark brown, and pale green. The overall image feels like a high-end fashion shoot, capturing a private, intimate moment with a touch of bare skin and suggestive elegance.",
