          "alias": "单女金礼服客厅困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "Young woman sits upright on an ornate vintage yellow velvet sofa, wearing a luxurious gold sequined gown with an off-shoulder neckline, deep V-cut exposing her ample cleavage, and intricate crystal-sequin geometric patterns across the bodice. The dress has a sheer, revealing cutout at the waist, showing a glimpse of her toned midriff and the curve of her hip, with the tight fit hugging every contour. Her black hair is swept into an elegant high bun with a few loose strands falling forward, and she wears tiny silver earrings, a delicate metal bracelet, and pale pink nail polish. Her eyes are slightly downcast, gazing to the side with a soft, dreamy expression, lips slightly parted, one hand resting lightly on her collarbone as the gown slips a bit off her opposite shoulder, baring more skin. Background features beige wallpaper with vintage floral patterns and a framed painting with gold ornate border showing blue flowers. The sofa cushions have brown and red rose motifs. The composition is a medium close-up, woman positioned left of center, body slightly turned, head tilted, creating an elegant dynamic. Soft warm backlight from the left illuminates her silhouette, making the sequins sparkle and casting delicate shadows across her skin and the sheer fabric. The overall palette is gold, yellow, and beige with dark hair and blue accents, exuding a luxurious, sensual, cinematic atmosphere—a private moment of refined eroticism captured in a lavish living room.",
