        {
          "id": "krea2-5061104b4558897f48129632",
          "alias": "单女全裸黑外套广场媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the corner of an industrial art space, her reddish-brown hair with blunt bangs, gaze calm and direct into the lens, expression natural and relaxed, lips slightly parted in a hint of thought. She wears a black glossy leather jacket, loose fit with lapel collar and metal buttons, cuffs and hem slightly puffy—jacket open, revealing her bare chest and perky nipples. No top underneath. Her lower body is nude, a light blue skirt discarded, exposing smooth thighs and pubic area. On her feet, grey-white over-the-knee boots with matte leather and mesh panels, square toe, rising to mid-thigh. Her right hand is in the jacket pocket, left hand hanging naturally, body angled slightly toward the camera, exuding effortless coolness and erotic grace. The subject is centered left, occupying two-thirds the frame, head slightly above mid-line. Foreground: rough cement floor with fine grain and wear, deep gray, reflecting faint warm light. Left side: an irregular natural rock on a stand, brownish, rough texture. Right side: low concrete pedestal, smooth but textured. Background: unpainted concrete wall with stains and water marks, natural gray-brown gradient. Ceiling: exposed concrete, dark, with a vintage industrial hanging lamp, clear glass shade, exposed tungsten bulb, emitting warm yellow light from above, casting soft shadows. Light illuminates the right side of her face and body, left side in shadow, creating strong chiaroscuro. Color palette: gray, black, brown, with her pale skin and boots adding contrast. Composition: vertical rectangle, slightly low angle, emphasizing her height and depth. Architectural lines guide the eye to her. Slight film grain, moderate clarity, details rich but not oversharpened, evoking a real, private, story-filled moment in a minimalist modernist gallery.",
