        {
          "id": "krea2-fd94493ad0790489f3605291",
          "alias": "单女露胸学生蓝衬衫衣帽间沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a walk-in closet, wearing a blue-and-white vertical-striped short-sleeve shirt with a delicate bow tied at her chest, left open to reveal her bare breasts and a hint of cleavage. She pairs this with an off-white pleated miniskirt trimmed with metal studs at the hem, a wide dark brown leather belt with a silver buckle cinching her waist—blending retro schoolgirl chic with modern edge. On her feet, white high-top boots with wrinkled shafts create a soft, layered look. In her right hand she carries a small black-polka-dotted white bag; her left hand hangs naturally, holding a black smartphone. Her long, naturally brown hair falls in soft waves over her bare shoulders, her head slightly bowed, lips gently parted, gaze focused and contemplative. She stands in a casual, elegant pose, as if choosing an outfit or about to go out. The foreground shows warm wooden herringbone flooring with clear grain. On the left stands a large floor-length mirror with a white frame, reflecting the other side of the room—a clothing rack filled with garments (striped tops, denim jackets, dresses in black, white, gray with some light accents), several handbags, and a few black high heels scattered on the floor. Behind the rack, a black glass cabinet with transparent doors shows neatly organized contents. The background wall is off-white, adorned with a delicate floral-and-vine relief. On the right, a window with white sheer curtains lets in soft natural light, casting dappled shadows across the floor and wall. The overall atmosphere is bright and warm. The composition is centered with the subject slightly left, the camera angled slightly downward for an intimate daily-life feel. Her posture and gaze draw the eye to the floor and her mirror reflection, adding depth and narrative. Natural light is soft and even, with no harsh contrast, giving a realistic, cozy homey vibe. The color palette is predominantly off-white, light brown, pale blue, and black, harmoniously balanced. The image quality is akin to a high-end photograph with subtle film grain and slight overexposure, mimicking a casual snapshot. The frame is full but not cluttered, balancing the focal subject with rich environmental details—embodying a spontaneous yet refined lifestyle aesthetic.",
