        {
          "id": "krea2-1679e87f8a347147f71a5699",
          "alias": "单女露胸桌边微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a wooden table by the sea, topless, her bare breasts gently exposed, dark hair falling naturally as she tilts forward, right hand brushing through her hair, left hand resting on the table, eyes soft and inviting toward the camera, a slight smile as she sucks on a straw in a lemon ice drink. On the table: a blue-covered book and a clear glass vase with two pale pink lilies. Background: endless sandy beach and blue ocean, distant slim wooden posts and a simple wooden frame, sky soft gray-white, warm morning or evening light. Close-up composition, figure on the right dominating the frame, wooden table from lower left to center forming a stable triangle. Foreground sharp, midground figure and table, background blurred. Visual lines from table edge, arms, and gaze lead to her face. Light from front-side creates soft shadows and highlights, evoking a calm, lazy vacation mood. Colors: natural off-white, light blue, green — fresh, delicate, with slight film grain and texture, as if taken with an old camera. Rich details, layered, strong everyday life feel and artistic beauty. Overall style like a fashion magazine spread but with realness and intimacy.",
