          "prompt": "A young female tennis player in a form-fitting red long-sleeve sports top and a very short black tennis skirt, standing on an indoor court, body slightly turned to the right in a ready-to-strike pose. Her right hand grips a white tennis racket, the head facing forward, left hand supporting the grip below, arms held steady before her chest in a professional stance. Her brown hair is pulled back in a high ponytail, a few strands drifting in motion. Her face is clear and focused, eyes locked ahead, lips slightly parted, breath steady. Her skin is fair, with small silver stud earrings adding a touch of elegance. The red top clings tightly, accentuating the athletic curves of her torso and breasts, with a subtle sheen that contrasts against the black skirt, which barely covers her hips, revealing the smooth skin of her thighs. The background is a dark green court divider with slight wrinkles, natural texture, and shadow variations, enhancing realism. The floor is a typical indoor hard court, light green, flat with fine grain. The composition is a medium shot, subject slightly left of center, body angled for dynamic balance, her gaze drawing the eye to the right, creating narrative depth. Light comes from above left, soft and even, no harsh shadows, making every detail of her face, the tight red top over her firm body, and the exposed legs visible. Color saturation is moderate, the red-and-black striking against the muted green background. The atmosphere is tense and still, as if the match is about to begin or has paused. Full of youthful energy, strength, and competitive tension, with a real photographic feel, like a professional camera captured the most natural, expressive moment—yet retains the intimacy of casual equipment: slight grain, natural exposure, and true ambient reflections. The image is artistic yet grounded, with harmonious tones, smooth light transitions, rich layers, and fine details, conveying a blend of focus, resilience, and beauty, evoking the spirit of sport. The outfit leaves little to the imagination, the tight top pushing up her chest, the skirt riding high as she moves, a sensual athleticism in every curve.",
