        {
          "id": "krea2-e6dd220b4c07dc64fbc62a62",
          "alias": "单女白西装雪地忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a black leather sofa in a minimalist white winter ski suit, the hood of her white down jacket with black \"KONN\" logo pulled back, her long hair falling freely over her shoulders. She gazes coolly off to the left, her expression detached and introspective. Her body leans slightly forward, right leg bent with foot resting on the armrest, left leg dangling, wearing thick white fur-lined snow boots with laces and branding. The puffy, glossy down jacket is partially unzipped, revealing bare skin beneath—no top or bra underneath, her breasts partially exposed against the white fabric. White compression leggings and knee pads cling to her legs, emphasizing a futuristic, functional aesthetic. A blurred black object (table or camera gear) obscures the foreground, adding depth. Her hand rests lightly on her knee, arm bent, creating a graceful curve. The background is a modern interior with dark gray horizontal-lined walls, a faint window or door frame glowing with warm orange light from a fireplace or lamp, contrasting with the cool tones. Lighting comes from the right rear, casting side-backlight that outlines her figure, highlights fabric folds and fur texture, and creates soft shadow transitions on her face and body. Low-angle shot from below makes her appear taller and more imposing. Composition leaves negative space on the left, balanced by background elements on the right. Monochrome palette with hints of warm light, evoking a calm, high-end, slightly lonely atmosphere. Photographic style mimics a professional studio shot with a candid, imperfect feel—slight lens blur, edge vignetting, film grain. Her expression is serene, lips slightly pressed, exuding quiet strength. Hair glistens subtly, skin smooth with minimal natural makeup. The scene feels like a metaphor for winter adventure and urban solitude, blending technology, fashion, and everyday life—simple yet sophisticated.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
