          "prompt": "A young woman in a glamorous gold sequin dress that has slipped down to her waist, exposing her bare breasts with erect nipples, stands elegantly against a soft circular halo background. Her auburn curly hair falls naturally over her shoulders, catching warm golden highlights, with vintage waves at the ends. She stands sideways, body slightly tilted, right hand lifted to her cheek, fingers slender with a simple ring, left hand resting on her hip, wrist adorned with a delicate metal bracelet. A layered gold chain necklace glitters at her throat, small earrings complement the look. Her makeup is refined and layered—deep eyeliner, thick curled lashes, full lips with a subtle pearl sheen. Her gaze is soft and focused toward the camera, face clearly defined, skin pale and smooth, bathed in a soft glow. The overall palette is warm gold, with a large circular light source behind her creating strong backlighting, fading from bright center to dim edges, evoking a dreamy, luxurious atmosphere. The foreground is sharp, with every sequin on her dress reflecting tiny glints like starlight. The midground contrasts light and shadow to enhance depth, while the background is completely blurred into a warm circular field, no distractions. The composition is classic symmetrical yet dynamic—the subject slightly off-center right, her diagonal pose breaking the symmetry, guiding the eye from her face down to her waist curve and then to the full dress details. Visual flow is driven by light intensity changes; the backlighting creates a clear rim light, casting soft shadows on her face and front body, boosting dimensionality. The lighting is warm and high-end, with gold tones conveying luxury, elegance, and confidence. The overall scene resembles a high-fashion photoshoot in a studio, yet retains a candid feel, as if captured at a private party or gala. Shot with a full-frame camera and a large-aperture prime lens, 85mm, f/1.8, shutter speed 1/125 sec, ISO 200, precise