          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an industrial interior space, her deep brown hair with straight bangs, exquisite makeup with heavy eyeliner and full lips, eyes locked on the lens, expression confident and slightly cold, exuding a wild yet elegant aura. She wears a leopard-print corset top with gold metal accents at the chest, highlighting her defined shoulders and waist. Over it, a voluminous, fluffy brownish-yellow faux-fur coat, thick and layered, with wide sleeves draping loosely over her arms. She wears high-waisted black shorts lined with numerous gold chains and fringe, swaying slightly, revealing bare thighs. High-top black leather boots with cutout lace-up details and metal rivets, thin chain embellishments at the ankles. A wide black leather belt with double gold buckles and multiple metal loops cinches her waist. The outfit blends wild, luxurious, and punk elements. She stands slightly left of center, body turned slightly, hands lightly resting on the coat's edge, pose composed. To the left foreground, a light-colored tabletop with black legs. The floor is cement, pale gray with fine cracks and wear marks. The background is a large indoor venue with exposed metal truss structure overhead, intersecting beams forming a geometric grid. Distant blue stage lights cast cool-toned light on walls and equipment. Multiple warm yellow string lights extend along metal supports, creating soft halos contrasting with cold blue light, adding dramatic chiaroscuro. Right side has black curtains or barriers, partially illuminated, showing light-to-dark transitions. Composition is centered with the woman as the main visual focus; background is blurred to emphasize her, with clear perspective and strong depth of field, gradually blurring from foreground to background. Visual path leads from her face, along her body contours, to the background lights, creating a multi-layered visual route. Lighting is a mix: key light from the front, simulating stage lighting, evenly illuminating her front with soft shadows; back and sides are darker, producing high contrast. Cold blue backlight and warm string lights together create complex, rich color tones. Overall color palette is dark, with local highlights and bright accents boosting visual impact. The image has a strong stage-like, post-modern fashion feel, rich in detail and realistic texture, as if captured backstage before a professional performance. Camera angle is eye-level, close to the subject, capturing her full body and part of the environment, presenting a real, vivid, story-filled moment. Image style resembles high-quality amateur photography with subtle grain and natural motion blur, enhancing on-site and documentary atmosphere. The overall vibe is both glamorous and gritty, showcasing a unique urban nightlife allure.",
