          "id": "krea2-19c6798bca107ecf321f456b",
          "alias": "单女挂脖城市媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a bright indoor event venue, her slender, athletic figure and refined features accentuated by glossy black hair with faint warm-brown highlights, a straight blunt fringe, and soft, confident eyes gazing directly at the camera. She wears a daring, formfitting silver sequin two-piece set: a cropped halter top that leaves her midriff fully exposed, adorned with fine metallic chains and fringe that barely brush the skin of her bare stomach, shimmering under the lights; the long sleeves are encrusted with dense sequins, reflecting multicolored sparks. The high-waisted miniskirt, barely covering the tops of her thighs, is trimmed with layers of translucent sequin strips that flutter with the subtlest movement, revealing glimpses of her silhouette. Her hands rest naturally at her sides—a simple silver ring on her right ring finger, a black-strapped watch on her left wrist. Behind her, a pure white promotional wall displays \"LISA\" and \"DENT PLUS WHITE\" in bold letters, with a green cross logo, softly lit by diffused reflections. At the right edge, a black professional camera with its screen glowing is held by a crew member, lens pointed directly at her. The composition is a medium shot, slightly off-center left, her head tilted just so, relaxed yet poised. Lighting comes from above and front, soft and even, with no harsh shadows—her skin glows with a subtle sheen, every strand of hair visible, the sequins exploding into countless tiny highlights. The overall palette is silver and white, clean, high-fashion, yet intimate. A hint of the cameraman's hand and equipment in the foreground adds a truthful, behind-the-scenes vibe. Her expression is no longer merely polite; it carries a playful, seductive confidence—a slight pout on her glossed lips, a knowing glint in her eyes. She stands as if caught in a moment of casual allure, the metal chains and sequins whispering against her bare skin, the short skirt teasing with every breath. The image feels both glamorous and spontaneously real—a perfect capture of modern urban sensuality and polished chic.",
