        {
          "id": "krea2-d5752253c5c8a7a34e92c918",
          "alias": "单女半褪白浴袍困倦注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman with flowing black hair in an ancient updo, stray strands brushing her cheeks, wears a partially open white silk robe that slips off one shoulder, baring her breast with a visible nipple. She gazes ahead with clear, focused eyes, lips slightly parted in quiet determination. Her right hand holds a transparent crystal sword aloft, the blade sharp and icy, while her left hand extends forward with fingers curved in an elegant, potent gesture. The wide sleeves of the robe billow softly, revealing the texture and folds of the fabric. Behind her, a misty grey-green curtain hangs with subtle light and shadow, creating an ethereal, dreamy atmosphere. To the right, a few dried golden reeds catch the warm light, adding rustic warmth. The composition is centrally balanced, with her positioned slightly left, her face and body illuminated by a soft, directional light from the left, casting delicate highlights and shadows that enhance the sensual curve of her exposed breast and the crystalline sword’s gleam. The background is softly blurred, drawing focus to her serene yet powerful expression. The full-frame shot makes her upper body the focal point, with the robe’s drape accentuating her form. Colors are white, grey, and green with gold accents, harmonizing a tranquil yet potent aura, as if a mythical swordswoman is casting a secret spell in a silent valley. The lighting and shallow depth-of-field mimic a professional camera capture, rendering fine details in her skin and the fabric, blending classical fantasy with realistic sensuality.",
