        {
          "id": "krea2-0c232e59ba7b49dffdd92365",
          "alias": "单女黑西装街道媚态脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a partially unzipped black racing suit, hands slowly lifting a glossy full-face motorcycle helmet from her head. The helmet’s sleek black surface gleams with sharp white and red geometric lines, a “GSP” logo on the side. The transparent visor reflects her deep eyes and part of her face. Her long, red-brown hair cascades naturally over her bare shoulders, catching soft golden light. She wears a black-and-white racing jacket, open to reveal a black lace bralette and smooth cleavage; the jacket’s chest bears colorful patches, and dark gray knitted cuffs peek from the sleeves. Close-up bust framing, the helmet centered above as she grips its edges with both hands, motion fluid—captured mid-removal or just before a ride. Blurred outdoor background with pale gray sky and distant buildings, cool atmosphere. Golden sunlight from upper left side falls across her cheek, hair, and helmet rim, creating delicate highlights and soft shadows. Rich contrast in materials—metal, plastic, skin. Shallow depth of field keeps her sharp against a soft background. Tones of black, white, gray accented by her auburn hair and bright helmet details. Visual flow from her eyes in the visor, down her hair, across her exposed torso to her posture—merging speed and freedom with strength and sensuality. Style blends street photography realism with high-fashion editorial, as if shot with a large-aperture prime lens, slight film grain and natural exposure, balancing everyday feel with dramatic tension.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
