        {
          "id": "krea2-fb82f05a726b3b767b1b13b8",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣车厢媚态脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman takes a sultry selfie in a cramped metallic room, wearing a cream knit beanie with dark gray geometric patterns, its brim rolled up to reveal stray black strands of hair. Her long, silky raven locks cascade over her bare shoulders, a few strands brushing her flushed cheek. She wears a tight, cropped light gray-green tank top with blurred dark gray lettering and numbers, unzipping her loose dark gray wool coat to expose the white lace trim at her wrists and a tantalizing glimpse of her midriff. Her left hand slips into her pocket, while her right hand holds a pale blue smartphone with a triple camera module, partially obscuring her face as she poses in the mirror. One eye is closed, the other half-lidded, lips parted in a playful, inviting expression. White wireless earbuds rest in her ears, her nails painted pale pink, a delicate silver ring on her ring finger. The background is a closed, textured brown wall with vertical seams and a round keyhole, a green vertical strip on the right edge suggesting a door frame or partition—like a subway car, elevator, or changing room. The composition uses a mirror reflection, the subject slightly left of center, her body tilted for dynamic naturalism, focus on her face and upper torso with soft background blur. Cool front lighting casts a gentle, even glow over her skin, creating a subtle sheen, minimal shadows, evoking an intimate, private atmosphere. The palette blends gray, white, blue, and green against warm skin tones, creating contrast and harmony. Visual path leads from her eyes, along the phone line, to her hand, and back to her expression. The scene brims with casual, youthful sensuality, as if a candid shot with an ordinary phone, rich in detail and layered texture, blending fashion elements with raw, lived-in authenticity—a modern urban young adult in a moment of relaxed, self-aware allure.",
