        {
          "id": "krea2-f68d551ab6733c49e662bb90",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍户外媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands outdoors in bright sunlight, her long pink hair cascading naturally with soft highlights and subtle gradient, slightly tousled ends and neat bangs framing her face. She wears a modified white silk qipao with a black dragon motif, high side slits revealing her legs, white ribbon ties with black bead accents dangling at the hips, a traditional Mandarin collar with black frog buttons, and a heart-shaped cutout at the bust that emphasizes her cleavage, the glossy fabric clinging to her curves. She raises both hands, palms forward, fingers elegantly extended, her gaze locked on the camera with a playful, confident smirk, lips naturally red, makeup sharp with defined eyeliner and thick lashes, fair skin glowing. She wears white thigh-high stockings and a white garter belt, her long legs smooth and toned. The light comes from her front right, creating soft shadows on her left side and background. The background is blurred, showing rough brown rock-like formations with subtle greenery and distant out-of-focus figures. The composition is a medium shot, centered on her upper body and face, with shallow depth of field. The overall tone is bright, fresh, combining classical Eastern aesthetic with modern fashion, exuding sensual charm and youthful allure.",
