        {
          "id": "krea2-79968d50ebaf37f7ac1ce6cd",
          "alias": "单女半褪白浴袍摄影棚媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A classical Eastern beauty in exquisite Hanfu, standing sideways with an elegant posture, her gaze soft and inviting toward the camera, a knowing, sensual smile on her lips. Her hair is styled in a high, ornate bun, adorned with a golden crown dripping with intricate flowers and dangling beads, a small red flower bindi at her forehead. She wears a layered red-and-white Hanfu: the outer layer is a sheer white silk robe, partially open and slipping off one shoulder, revealing a bare shoulder and the curve of her breast; the inner red brocade dress is cut low, exposing cleavage and the upper swell of her chest, with intricate gold embroidery swirling over the fabric. A wide gold belt cinches her waist, metal ornaments catching the light, while the sleeves fall open, showing a pale yellow lining with orange floral patterns. Her hands are clasped loosely in front, fingers slender and nails naturally polished. The background is a plain gray-brown gradient wall, no distractions. Medium shot, subject positioned slightly left, body curving into an S-shape, guiding the eye from her face down along the exposed skin and flowing fabric. Light comes from the front right, soft and warm, casting delicate shadows that emphasize the smoothness of her skin and the texture of the silk. The overall mood is serene yet seductive, blending ancient elegance with a modern sensual glamour, as if captured in a professional studio but with an intimate, amateur authenticity. Warm tones, rich details, artistic composition.",
