        {
          "id": "krea2-f9ddff47a4611a58aa100749",
          "alias": "单女露胸米风衣媚态蹲脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches on the open observation deck of a high-rise building, wearing a khaki trench coat unbuttoned and open, revealing her bare breasts, no shirt or bra underneath. Her long brown hair falls naturally, a pink mask covers the lower half of her face, her eyes lowered and focused intently on her leg. She is in the act of pulling up the side zipper of a black leather high-heeled boot, her right hand with slender fingers and burgundy nail polish gently lifting the zipper, her left hand steadying the boot shaft. The glossy black leather boots are tight against her legs, showing natural creases and subtle shine, pointed toe and stiletto heel. The trench coat hem lifts slightly, exposing bare upper thigh skin. Close-up low-angle shot, dynamic diagonal composition from top left to bottom right, foreground emphasizes the boot and hand details with sharp focus, midground shows her body and sensual pose, background is a vast city skyline with tall buildings and streets visible, clear blue sky, bright sunlight from the right casting soft shadows. Wooden deck floor with visible grain, metal railing at the edge. Warm, bright tones with slight film grain and natural color shift, simulating a real smartphone photo. Highlights on her skin, boot surface, and coat shoulders, shadows pooling under her thighs and on the floor. Intimate, quietly erotic moment, capturing the mundane yet charged act of adjusting footwear before or after a commute, the focus and stillness making it intensely personal. Modern urban aesthetic blending fashion with raw sensuality.",
