          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙花园微笑倚靠回眸",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a low-cut green silk slip dress with red paisley print, her long black hair cascading naturally, gently cradling a pure white lop-eared rabbit whose soft fur presses against her bare shoulder. The dress hangs loosely, revealing the curve of her breasts and the outline of her nipples through the thin fabric. She turns her head slightly, glancing back with a warm, inviting smile, her eyes clear and soft. She wears large circular metal earrings with dark gemstones and geometric patterns, a black leather chain bag with wrinkled texture and shimmering gold chain slung across her shoulder. The background is lush green grass and blurred dark foliage. Golden sunlight slants from the left, casting bright highlights and soft shadows on her body, creating a warm, dreamy atmosphere. Medium close-up composition, subject slightly off-center right, body leaning subtly toward the camera, guiding the viewer’s gaze. Foreground emphasizes the intimate interaction with the rabbit, midground shows fabric details and accessories, background soft focus to highlight the subject. Overall green tones with red and white accents, strong but not harsh contrast, natural yet artistic look like a high-quality outdoor portrait with fine skin texture, clear hair strands, and realistic material rendering. The scene is full of life and tenderness, like a quiet summer afternoon in a garden, capturing pure emotional connection between human and animal. Style blends fashion and candidness, with studio-quality light and outdoor authenticity, resulting in an elegant yet approachable visual beauty.",
