          "alias": "单女透视黑连衣裙城市戏谑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a red carpet, her long brown wavy hair with natural bangs falling softly, makeup flawless, eyes bright and confident, lips slightly parted as if teasing the camera. She wears a black sheer mesh long-sleeved dress, the fabric completely transparent, revealing her bare skin and the outline of her nipples through the netting; the design is bold with cutouts at the shoulders and chest, exposing the upper curves of her breasts. The dress is tight at the waist, accentuating her slender figure, and the hem ends at mid-thigh, showing off her long bare legs. Her hands are clasped together in front of her abdomen, a simple ring on her left hand, right hand resting lightly on top, her posture elegant yet relaxed. On her feet, black high-heeled strappy sandals with multiple thin straps crisscrossing from ankle to mid-calf, a chunky platform sole adding a modern edge. The background is a dark gray MTV Video Music Awards promotional wall with repeating white \"VMA\" logos and a small figure holding a flag, forming a geometric pattern. The floor is dark carpet, subtle texture. Composition is medium shot, subject slightly off-center to the right, body angled toward the camera, head turning slightly left, creating natural dynamic balance. Lighting from front and above, soft and even, highlights the gloss of her skin and the texture of the sheer fabric, with slight shadows behind and on the floor enhancing depth. Color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, with her warm skin and hair tone standing out against the cool backdrop. The overall image exudes a modern urban fashion aesthetic, high-impact visual artistry, as if captured at a high-end entertainment event with a professional camera, rich in detail from the fabric's weave to the shoe structure, realistic yet polished like a fashion editorial, with an NSFW edge due to the sheer dress revealing her nude body beneath.",
