          "prompt": "A young woman stands next to a red 2024 Ferrari SF-24 F1 car, her tight red jumpsuit unzipped to the waist, exposing her bare breasts, the fabric still bearing Ferrari Prancing Horse, Shell, and Santander logos, with “Jisoo” stitched at the neckline and black-and-yellow shoulder stripes. Her long black hair falls naturally over her shoulders, her gaze calm and confident, lips slightly parted, staring directly at the camera. She bends her right knee slightly, left leg straight, right hand resting lightly on the car’s front wing, left hand hanging down. She wears shiny red high heels and black thigh-high stockings, creating a strong visual contrast—elegance and power. The car’s bright red bodywork features black aero parts, number “24”, and sponsor decals (HP, CEVA, GliR, etc.), with “2024” and “meUY.com” on the rear. The background is the Ferrari team garage: red-and-white structure reading “SCUDERIA FERRARI FORMULA 1 TEAM”, DHL and Shell billboards above, garage door half-open revealing equipment and crew, the track stretching into distance with fences and a few spectators. Sunny day, strong side lighting from the right casting soft shadows, enhancing depth and texture. Mid-shot composition, woman slightly left of center, car dominating lower left, forming a stable triangle guiding the eye upward. Foreground emphasizes her interaction with the car, midground shows pit lane atmosphere, background uses perspective lines for depth. Dominant red tones with black, white, and metallic gray, saturated yet natural, smooth light transitions, high contrast highlighting her curves and the car’s gloss. Slight film grain and natural exposure as if shot by an amateur camera, blending realism with artistic lighting and color, capturing a pre-race moment full of speed, passion, and technical precision—now with a raw, sensual edge.",
