          "prompt": "A young woman with vibrant red hair stands before a colorful, whimsical TV studio set, wearing a tight white spaghetti strap mini dress with a flared ruffled hem, the fabric clinging to her curves and revealing a deep neckline—her breasts partially exposed, nipples barely hidden by the thin straps. She poses with her hands on her hips, body slightly turned, head tilted toward the camera with a sultry smile, eyes half-lidded and lips parted, showing her teeth. Her skin is flawless, makeup dramatic with smoky eyes and glossy pink lips. A simple black choker necklace accents her neck. She wears black chunky platform boots with shiny straps, adding edge. She stands front-center, in focus, against a large cartoon TV set with a giant green sign reading \"동물농장\" in Korean, with white outlines and a \"TV\" logo. A massive white polar bear plushie wearing a yellow hat stands to her left, alongside blue octopus, purple bird, and orange elephant cartoon characters on a wooden stage with steps and green artificial grass. A red vintage suitcase covered in travel stickers sits in the lower right corner, and a leafy tree with orange fruit is on the right. The lighting is bright and soft from the front and sides, casting gentle shadows, creating a relaxed studio atmosphere. The composition is a medium shot from knees up, with a shallow depth of field making her pop against the vivid background. The overall feel is playful yet intensely sexy, as if a candid moment from a risqué variety show.",
