          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a smooth circular mirror platform, her body leaning slightly forward, right hand resting on the edge, left hand casually at her side. She is completely topless, her bare chest exposed, nipples erect, skin pale and smooth. Her black hair falls naturally over her shoulders, some strands blowing lightly in the breeze. Her face is clear, eyes locked on the camera with a cold, confident expression, lips slightly parted. She wears only a red-trimmed white short-sleeve T-shirt that is unbuttoned and pushed aside, revealing her breasts, and a red-black plaid pleated mini skirt, its hem flared and layered, with visible seam details at the waist. Her right leg is covered in a black thigh-high stocking above the knee, while her left leg is bare, creating visual contrast. She wears shiny black high-heeled boots with smooth lines. The mirror platform reflects her lower body and legs, the reflection slightly distorted and surreal. The surface is clean, reflecting the ambient colors. The background is a gradient blue-purple sky, transitioning from deep blue at the top to light purple at the bottom, with thin clouds, soft even light. The overall atmosphere is dreamy and still. To the left, a small metal support structure (possibly studio equipment) is visible; to the right, a green plant with slender leaves and small white flower clusters naturally extends at the edge. The composition is centered, with the figure slightly below center, dominating the frame. The mirror platform creates a downward visual guide toward her legs and reflection, while the open sky above adds depth. Lighting comes from straight ahead, soft and even, with no harsh shadows, emphasizing her nude torso and clothing details. The color palette is blue, purple, red, and white, contrasting yet harmonious, blending futuristic and retro school-girl aesthetics, with strong artistic and fashion sensibilities, as if a frame from a cinematic photoshoot, full of narrative and imagination. The camera angle is slightly below eye level, enhancing her height and presence. Details are rich, layers distinct, blending casual daily life with professional precision.",
