          "alias": "单女露胸棕短裙庭院戏谑站立",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a sunlit courtyard, wearing only a loose green off-shoulder top that falls open to expose her bare breasts, paired with a short brown pleated skirt that rides up her thighs, yellow work boots, white socks with black cuffs. She leans one hand on a black umbrella tilted to block the sun, her long black hair cascading freely, her face clear and confident, eyes locked on the camera with a teasing, self-assured smirk. Her right hand flashes a victory sign, her body twisted slightly, right leg lifted with toes resting on a white iron chair, skirt hiked high, revealing bare skin and a glimpse of her underwear. The scene is framed with her centered left, following rule of thirds. Background: dense green foliage, a weathered light beige wall, a white iron table and chairs, black-and-white diamond tile floor. Soft sunlight streams through leaves, casting dappled shadows across her face, chest, and skirt, warming her skin and highlighting her curves. The palette blends greens, browns, and whites for a relaxed, intimate afternoon mood.",
