        {
          "id": "krea2-c666db09067cabb86980f7d2",
          "alias": "单女黑旗袍舞台媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage in a black modified cheongsam, its gold frog buttons and piping tracing an elegant silhouette. The high slit reveals her long legs clad in black stockings and thigh-high lace garter belts, merging traditional Oriental aesthetics with modern sensuality. She holds a microphone in her right hand, left arm lifted naturally, her pose confident and expressive. Her gaze is fixed on the audience with a soft yet compelling stare, lips slightly curved in a gentle, determined smile. Dark brown hair falls freely over her shoulders, minimalist earrings adding a touch of refinement. Behind her, a giant LED screen displays blurred colored light effects, predominantly blue-violet with green and pink patches, creating a dreamy, dynamic stage atmosphere. Framed in a medium shot, the figure occupies the left-center, body slightly turned, forming a natural visual lead. The camera angle is slightly low, emphasizing her upright posture and presence. Light comes from above and front, softly and evenly illuminating the subject, with delicate chiaroscuro on her face and dress. Highlights catch her cheekbones, hands, and the gold details of the cheongsam, while shadows merge into the body's contours and fabric folds, enhancing three-dimensionality. Background lights contrast with the foreground subject, making her stand out. The overall color palette blends warm and cool tones, preserving the stage's vitality and tension without losing artistic calm. The image resembles a professional studio or live performance shot, captured by a high-megapixel camera with a slight film grain and natural motion blur, adding a documentary-like authenticity. Composition is balanced yet dynamic, the subject's posture relaxed, movements fluid, as if this is a breathtaking moment during a song or performance. The abstract background colors sharply contrast with the clear figure, reinforcing the visual focus. The overall ambiance balances modernity and Oriental charm, full of stage charisma and personal aura. Rich light-and-shadow layers, moderate color saturation, crisp details—all reveal a style that is both powerful and delicate, like a carefully composed stage photograph capturing the performer's most captivating instant.",
