          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙门媚态倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman leans elegantly against a classic arched doorway, her long blonde hair with blunt bangs framing a sweet, seductive smile as she gazes softly into the lens. She stands slightly sideways, right leg lifted and bent, toes just touching the ground, left arm hanging naturally, right hand teasingly lifting the hem of a sheer black lace dress that molds to her curves. The intricate floral-patterned lace leaves little to the imagination, with pink lingerie clearly visible beneath, adding a layer of erotic mystery. Her black stiletto heels with metallic details elongate her legs. The warm olive-green textured wall behind her is adorned with two ornate gold sconces casting a soft amber glow, creating a luxurious yet intimate atmosphere. The wooden archway features fine carvings and vertical grooves, enhancing depth. Dark gray rough concrete floor contrasts with the smooth wall. Medium shot from waist to feet, slightly low angle emphasizing her long limbs. Lighting from the sconces creates gentle chiaroscuro, with subtle shadows on the lace pattern intensifying its tactile realism. Tones of olive, black, gold, skin, and pink harmonize. The composition draws the eye to her face and gaze, the arch framing her as the central subject. The scene feels like a stolen romantic moment, poised between high-fashion editorial and raw sensuality, with the dress’s transparency offering a bold, NSFW reveal of her figure.",
