          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless on a forest path, wearing only form-fitting olive green leggings, white high socks, and white canvas sneakers, a black crossbody bag slung over one shoulder. Her long hair falls naturally as she glances back over her shoulder at the camera, right hand gripping a hiking stick, body slightly tilted with left leg forward and right leg back, emphasizing a graceful S-curve—healthy, fit, sensual. Her delicate features are relaxed, eyes clear, lips curved in a subtle smile. The foreground is a dirt path covered with dead leaves and exposed tree roots, scattered with gravel and twigs. To the left, a steep soil bank covered in dense ferns and low shrubs in varied greens. To the right, towering trees with cracked trunks and thick branches form a natural arch overhead. The midground shows a winding trail leading deep into layered woods, colors shifting from bright lime to deep forest green. In the background, distant mountain ridges are faintly visible, the sky broken into soft light spots through the foliage, creating a gentle Tyndall effect with subtle light-and-shadow play. The overall palette is natural greens accented by earthy browns and the figure's pale skin and clothing tones. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with the woman on the right, her gaze guiding the eye left along the path into the forest, framed by tree branches. The foreground roots and leaves add texture and realism, the curving trail creates dynamic leading lines, and the layered background trees enhance depth. The atmosphere is calm yet alive—a blend of outdoor wilderness and urban casual style, like a spontaneous moment captured on a phone or compact camera during a woodland walk. Light is diffused overcast, soft and even, with no harsh shadows, keeping colors balanced and details sharp. The aesthetic is documentary-style, raw and intimate, evoking the scent of soil and fresh greenery, a perfect harmony of nature and the human form.",
          "description": "",
