        {
          "id": "krea2-5b8c5ac7cea317582af0faf7",
          "alias": "单女露胸桌边温柔坐",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits indoors, her long black hair falling naturally in soft, glossy strands that brush her cheeks and shoulders. She is topless, bare skin smooth and pale, the delicate silver chain with a small heart pendant resting against her chest. She wears nothing above the waist, her gray V-neck top discarded out of frame. She focuses intently on a silver laptop on a white desk, a white stylus beside it. A black phone glows faintly at the edge of the scene. The composition is a medium close-up, her body slightly turned, revealing the curve of one bare breast as she leans forward. Soft, even light from above front highlights her collarbone, jawline, and the subtle shadow under her neck. The plain white wall and clean desk create a minimalist backdrop. Her expression is calm and absorbed, lips slightly parted. The image has a candid, phone-captured realism with slight grain and natural color, quiet and intimate.",
