        {
          "id": "krea2-50efd9905467f0ed812c0a32",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙舞台媚态站立比耶",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage in a vibrant red velvet strapless mini dress, the fabric clinging tightly to her body, accentuating her elegant and sensual curves. She wears long matching opera gloves that extend from her fingertips to her elbows, the material soft and luxurious. In her hand she holds a white microphone, her fingers gently gripping the middle, her posture relaxed and natural. Her gaze is fixed directly at the lens, exuding confidence and a lazy, seductive allure. Her long black hair is slightly curled, with straight bangs neatly covering her forehead, the strands catching the light with a soft sheen. Her makeup is flawless—full red lips, metallic-toned eye shadow, and a silver chain necklace around her throat adding a touch of glamour. Behind her left shoulder, a vintage circular decorative piece is faintly visible, possibly a stage prop or background element. On the right edge of the frame, another woman's hand appears, making a peace sign, a thin silver bracelet hanging from her wrist; the arm is sleek and fair-skinned. The composition centers on the main subject with a medium shot; she stands slightly tilted, her body turned in a way that creates dynamic grace. The foreground is sharp, the subject prominent. The background is a dark chain-link fence with a regular grid pattern, evoking an industrial yet modern feel. Behind the fence, large green tropical leaves are scattered, their veins clear and colors vivid, creating a striking contrast with the red dress and delivering a strong visual punch. Lighting comes from front and above, bright and focused, revealing every detail of her face and clothing, while delicate gradients play across the background and shadows. Cool blue-green lights cast from the sides and rear illuminate the leaves and parts of the background, producing a interplay of light and shadow that deepens the sense of space. The overall atmosphere is energetic and stylish, as if set in a nightclub, concert, or party scene—both professional in its stage presence and casually real. The color saturation is high, contrast strong, composition tight but uncluttered. The viewer's eye is first drawn to the red dress, then follows the subject's gaze and body language to the background elements, forming a complete narrative. The image carries an artistic yet lifelike quality, as if captured by professional gear in low light, with a subtle grain and texture that enhance realism. The framing uses central symmetry combined with diagonal guiding lines, creating a stable yet dynamic look. The light-to-shadow transition is natural, the layers distinct, delivering a premium visual effect.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
