          "prompt": "Young female model, topless, wearing only a black micro-mini skirt and black high heels, retro pilot helmet with transparent goggles and metal details, long brown hair falling over bare shoulders, sensual smile, eyes locked on camera, straddling a red-and-white scooter, hands gripping the handlebars, confident and provocative pose, smooth orange-red bodywork with white front and fenders, round dual headlights, black rectangular mirrors, thick tires, silver rims, visible engine and foot pedals, pure white studio wall with silver \"SUPER CUB\" logo, soft shadow on wall, dark gray display platform with black edge, faint \"NEWSIS\" watermark bottom right, medium shot centered slightly left, top-front soft lighting, warm tones, high detail, commercial product photography aesthetic, youthful dynamism blended with tech chic, explicit nudity.",
