        {
          "id": "krea2-d48f224dfd7931f8eff2eee1",
          "alias": "单女露胸连体衣舞台媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her long dark brown hair cascading naturally, strands catching the faint light. She wears a transparent, sheer bodysuit with geometric patterns and metallic trim, clinging to her curves and revealing her bare breasts and toned body beneath—no underwear. A black high-waisted leather mini skirt hugs her hips, crisp and minimal. Black high-shine leather thigh-high boots complete the look. She grips a black microphone in her right hand, body slightly twisted, glancing back over her shoulder at the lens with a focused, confident stare. Her lips part slightly, as if mid-song or about to speak, her pose exuding power and raw sensuality. The backdrop is a dimly lit industrial stage, surrounded by silver-gray scaffolding with orange connectors, rough and authentic. A large warm yellow spotlight from the right illuminates her, creating strong chiaroscuro—half her face and body lit, the other in shadow, enhancing depth. The dark reflective floor captures her silhouette and the scaffolding's outline. Composition is mid-shot, figure left-of-center, body forming an elegant S-curve, arm raised with the mic pointing diagonally upward. Visual flow draws from her face to the mic, then back to the lights and scaffolding, adding depth. The atmosphere is tense, electric, blending futuristic and industrial aesthetics—a raw urban nightlife, performance art passion. Slight grain and film-like texture mimic amateur live-shot authenticity. Color saturation is moderate, highlighting her skin and outfit details, with the background slightly overexposed for an impromptu concert feel. The frame is tight, focusing on her, background elements supporting without overwhelming. It captures a moment of musical liberation and self-expression—powerful, independent, utterly captivating.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
