        {
          "id": "krea2-c4906d8b455897c3aecd277b",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙咖啡厅困倦坐持食物",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a fine dining table in an upscale restaurant, wearing a blue-and-white striped spaghetti-strap dress with white lace trim at the neckline, her dress slightly slipping to reveal a hint of cleavage. A delicate gold chain necklace rests on her chest, with pearl earrings, rings on her fingers, and silver-gray nail polish. She holds a small, colorful piece of food with her right hand, eyes half-closed, a satisfied smile on her lips as if savoring the taste. Her dark hair is neatly pinned up, revealing a smooth forehead and refined features. In the foreground, a cream-colored tablecloth, a red plate with a silver knife, and a white porcelain plate with folded napkin. A bouquet of pink flowers with white accents is visible at the lower right corner. The elegant restaurant interior features gray-brown botanical wallpaper, warm yellow lighting from wall sconces and ceiling lamps casting soft shadows. In the distance, an arched wooden door with dark brown frame emits warm orange light; beside it stands a smooth white column. Other tables are set with wine glasses, cutlery, small vases, one with a transparent glass bottle of drink and stemware, another with pink flowers. A black-framed mirror on the wall reflects the interior. The composition centers on the woman with a close-up perspective, slightly tilted for a natural candid feel, emphasizing her expression and hand gesture. The visual flow leads from the foreground plate and food to her face, then to the background environment. Warm, soft lighting creates a romantic dining atmosphere, capturing an elegant, unposed moment as if taken with an amateur camera—rich in detail, realistic texture, and an artistic, everyday charm.",
