        {
          "id": "krea2-2840061eff3f751c808111c8",
          "alias": "单女露胸白旗袍舞台戏谑蹲脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches low on the stage in a semi-squat, her sheer white qipao printed with pink roses and green leaves, now unbuttoned to expose her bare breasts and smooth midriff. The dress is sleeveless, with delicate gold embroidery at the collar and side slit that rides high to her hip, revealing the full length of her toned thighs. She cups her cheeks with both hands, fingers splayed, light blue nails grazing her skin. The headset mic curves from her right ear to her lips. Her long black hair whips back, catching the spotlight. Her eyes are soft, her lips parted in a teasing smile, skin luminous with a dewy glow. The background is a blur of deep blue stage lights scattered with purple and white specks, faint silhouettes of the audience beyond. Medium close-up, slightly tilted down, emphasizing the curve of her breasts and the arch of her back. The light angles from above, casting gentle highlights on her sweat-slicked skin and the sheen of the fabric. The image feels like a stolen moment of performance—sensual, intimate, and charged with the rhythm of music and distant cheers.",
