        {
          "id": "krea2-670abddd17d1f28337de495d",
          "alias": "单女红旗袍闺房媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a vintage interior, wearing an exquisitely tailored red silk cheongsam with a deep plunging neckline and high slit that reveals her toned thigh. The dress is embroidered with three-dimensional rose motifs outlined in shimmering gold thread, glowing under warm light. A black fur stole drapes over her right bare shoulder, contrasting against the scarlet fabric. She wears layered white pearl necklaces that brush her exposed collarbones. Her long dark brown hair with green highlights cascades in loose curls over her shoulders. Her makeup is bold and retro—sharp eyeliner, thick lashes, and deep wine-red lips. Her porcelain skin glows, and her face is angular and elegant. She stands slightly turned, one hand resting on a wooden antique table, her long fingers tipped with dark red nail polish. The background features baroque wallpaper in cream with gold floral scrolls, and a heavy gold velvet curtain with vertical folds. Sunlight streams through a window at right, creating dramatic beams with visible Tyndall effect, casting soft shadows across her face, arms, and the cheongsam's slit. Medium-shot portrait composition, she is slightly left of center, body angled, facing the camera with a deep, story-filled gaze. The lighting is warm, golden-hour, evoking a nostalgic, romantic atmosphere reminiscent of a 1920s Shanghai socialite in her private boudoir, awaiting a significant encounter. The image feels cinematic, sensual, and intimately personal, blending haute couture photography with the raw texture of film.",
