          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a metal-frame barstool, her long black hair cascading in soft, wavy layers, a few strands brushing her cheek and shoulder in the breeze. She wears a loose black jacket, unzipped and falling off one shoulder, revealing a lacy white bralette and the smooth curve of her collarbone. A short white A-line skirt barely covers her upper thighs, the fabric light and slightly ruffled. She holds a clear plastic dessert cup filled with layers of red jam, creamy white topping, and fresh strawberry slices, her fingers elegant with pale pink nails. Her body leans forward slightly, legs crossed high, one knee bent suggestively. She smiles softly, eyes clear and inviting, looking directly at the lens. The background is a light beige wall with subtle texture, a rough gray concrete floor showing cracks and wear. Natural light streams from the left, warming her skin and hair, casting soft shadows. The composition is a medium shot, focused on her upper body, the dessert, and the exposed skin. The mood is intimate, candid, and sensual, with a warm, unfiltered realism.",
