          "prompt": "A young woman stands sideways in a sunlit ancient alley, completely topless, her bare breasts exposed and softly shadowed by the warm sunlight. She wears only a loosely tied pink bow collar around her neck, cream high-waist straight pants unbuttoned at the waist, a black belt undone, and a red-black plaid retro backpack slung over one shoulder. Her dark hair is in a low ponytail with a light floral scarf. She slightly lowers her head, a gentle, knowing smile on her lips, eyes gazing left as if at something intimate. In the foreground, bicycle handlebars and a vintage bell gleam in the light. Behind her, a mottled gray brick wall with peeling posters and potted green plants. Strong sunlight cascades from upper right, casting dramatic highlights across her nude torso and deep shadows on the rest. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with her body on the right, the bicycle guiding the view. The scene has a warm, nostalgic film-grain vibe, capturing a quiet, sensual afternoon moment—like a still from an indie film, rich with poetic eroticism.",
