        {
          "id": "krea2-2910a4172cd2f8c4695abe61",
          "alias": "单女庭院忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a three-quarter profile, her long, ink-black hair loose and silky, adorned with an intricate silver floral crown whose layered petals catch the cold metallic light, contrasting against her flawless, pale skin. Her delicate features are accentuated by refined eye makeup—her deep, melancholic gaze fixed on the distant horizon, lips slightly parted in a vivid, warm red. She wears a traditional yellow-and-white Hanfu, its soft fabric draping naturally with subtle wrinkles, but the collar has slipped open, revealing a bare shoulder and the upper curve of her breast, the inner grey underlayer pushed aside to expose smooth, luminous skin. The close-up composition places her slightly off-center, head tilted, evoking an elegant, vulnerable pose. Foreground details are crisp on her face and headpiece, while the background melts into warm yellow bokeh—blurred green foliage and faint outlines of traditional wooden eaves and pillars, creating deep depth. Soft, directional light from upper left casts a gentle rim glow on her hair and face, with natural shadows enhancing her cheekbones and collarbone. The mood is quiet, wistful, with a cinematic film-grain texture and subtle color shifts—warm amber tones dominant, accented by silver and pale green. The scene feels like a frozen moment in a spring courtyard, imbued with classical poetry, where her partially exposed form adds a sensuous, natural grace without losing the refined elegance of the setting.",
