        {
          "id": "krea2-42df3ed019b66c0f38148c18",
          "alias": "单女半褪蓝衬衫户外媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a natural outdoor setting, her long black hair softly wavy and cascading, with a few loose strands framing her face. Black sunglasses are casually perched on her head. Her delicate features and fair skin glow under soft light, her eyes clear and bright, gazing at the camera with a sultry, focused expression. Her lips gently purse around a pink straw, holding a translucent cup with white text and a pink straw, the drink catching the evening light. She wears a blue-and-white striped shirt, the top buttons undone, revealing the swell of her breasts and a hint of lacy bra beneath. A gray knit vest hangs open, and a red tie with white stripes and a small gold pin is loosely knotted at her neck, the knot slightly pulled down. Her left hand cups the drink, fingers long and elegant, nails neatly trimmed. The background is a serene forest clearing with dry yellow grass, bare trees with tangled branches, a gray-blue sky, and soft evening light. A light curtain with handwritten script hangs on the left, beside a wooden fence and a simple metal chair. The composition is a close-up, subject slightly right of center, body tilted, chin lifted, creating a natural visual flow toward her face and the drink. Diffused backlight from the side casts a warm rim light on her skin and hair, with delicate highlights on her cheeks and strands. The overall atmosphere is warm, nostalgic, with a film-grain feel, contrasting cool blues and grays with the pink drink and her warm skin. The scene feels intimate and candid, blending innocent youth with a modern, sexy edge—a quiet moment frozen in time, exuding effortless charm and sensual allure.",
