        {
          "id": "krea2-a7e8995c544392d3b74e6976",
          "alias": "单女露胸摄影棚害羞坐注视",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a young topless woman with deep brown eyes and thick curled lashes, her gaze clear and intensely focused on the lens. Her long black hair falls naturally, slightly tangled and damp, with a few strands brushing her forehead, adding a casual and lazy allure. Her skin is fair and smooth, cheeks flushed with a soft pink blush. Her lips are full, soft, naturally pink, slightly parted in a hint of a half-smile, giving a pure yet maturely sensual vibe. Her facial contours are soft and graceful, features delicate and three-dimensional—straight nose, naturally arched brows. She is completely bare-chested, her shoulders and collarbones elegantly outlined. In her right hand she gently holds half a sliced guava, the vibrant red flesh juicy and textured, tiny seeds evenly distributed, skin a yellow-green gradient with natural gloss. Her left hand rests on the edge of a white plate below, where the other half of the guava sits. The fruit is fully cut, cross-section clearly visible, creating strong color contrast. The background is a clean white wall or backdrop, simple and uncluttered, highlighting the subject and fruit with a bright, airy feel. Lighting comes from front left above, soft and even—typical studio softbox or ring light effect. Her face is evenly lit with smooth shadow transitions, no harsh dark areas. Highlights appear on her forehead, nose bridge, and cheekbones, forming a three-dimensional contour, with clear catchlights in her eyes enhancing liveliness. A side light from the right fills in, reducing shadow depth while keeping skin texture translucent. The background takes on a soft gray-white tone from diffused light. Overall color palette is warm white, contrasted by the guava’s vivid red and green, warm and cool interweaving for rich visual layers. Composition is centered and symmetrical, the woman facing the camera directly, her gaze meeting the viewer’s, creating strong visual guidance that locks attention on her expression and the guava. The foreground subject and fruit are sharp and detailed, mid-range shows her shoulders, neck, and hand movements, background fully blurred with very shallow depth of field, emphasizing the subject. The lighting atmosphere is warm and intimate, with a hint of private daily-life feel—as if shot at home or in a studio with professional gear, yet retaining casual authenticity. The overall style blends artistic beauty with lifestyle, suitable for fashion, beauty, health, or lifestyle themes. Image texture is delicate, detail-rich, color saturation moderate without over-editing, presenting a natural, high-end look, resembling a high-quality portrait from a DSLR with a large-aperture lens, with slight film grain and soft color transitions, enhancing a retro and gentle mood. No text, watermark, or distracting elements; focus on emotional expression and food aesthetics, conveying a fresh, healthy, joyful attitude.",
