          "id": "krea2-f888bbcef883bc1c921b2f75",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道冷淡坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the stone steps before a classical Victorian building at dusk. She has long, sleek black hair cascading freely, her body slightly turned as she glances back over her shoulder with a soft, lazy gaze. Her arms are crossed loosely beneath her chest, pressing her breasts upward—her white short-sleeve T-shirt is unbuttoned low, revealing the top curve of her cleavage and the strap of a black lace bralette. She wears a high-waisted light brown mini skirt with metal buckle details at the side, the hem riding high on her thighs as she sits. Chunky black boots with buckle straps frame her legs. Beside her, a plaid shirt is draped carelessly over the stone, and a black backpack rests nearby. The grand Victorian building behind her boasts ornate columns, carved railings, and stained-glass windows glowing with warm golden light that spills across the facade. To the left, a vintage streetlamp casts a soft amber glow through its transparent shade. Dark green trees sway gently in the breeze. The sky fades from deep blue to pale violet near the horizon, where the modern “FRASER” high-rise silhouette stands in contrast, blending old and new. Low-angle shot, the woman is positioned in the lower right of the frame, dominating the composition. The lamp and staircase create leading lines toward her body. Warm yellow light from the lamp and building interiors contrasts with the cool twilight sky, highlighting her silhouette and the exposed skin of her arms, collar, and thighs. The image mimics a candid street photo with slight grain and natural lens distortion, evoking a real nighttime capture—intimate, cinematic, and charged with unspoken desire.",
