          "id": "krea2-4fd18a2c5d78961d530409c2",
          "alias": "单女棕外套公园微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully on a park bench, her long jet-black hair cascading naturally over her shoulders. She wears a warm, inviting smile and her eyes are clear and bright, exuding an elegant charm. Her short, fluffy brown suede coat is unbuttoned, revealing a tight black mini skirt and sheer black stockings that hug her long legs. On her feet are tall brown leather boots with simple metallic buckles, the leather stretching snugly around her ankles. Her hands are clad in deep brown long leather gloves, perfectly fitted. She sits sideways on the wooden bench, legs crossed, one hand resting on her knee, the other slightly raised. Beside her lies a small beige handbag with a gold clasp. The wooden bench shows signs of age, with black ironwork trim. Behind her, an open park scene unfolds: lush green grass, bare winter trees, a gray overcast sky, soft diffused light. A man and woman walk casually on a path in the midground, and a few birds peck at the grass in the distance. The composition centers on her, shot from a low angle, with the bench leading the eye into the background. A few dry leaves lie on the ground in the foreground, adding a seasonal feel. The mood is quiet, slightly melancholic, yet stylish and sensuous—like a candid street photograph with a subtle erotic edge. Her skirt rides up as she crosses her legs, revealing more of her stocking-clad thighs, and the open coat hints at the curve of her breasts beneath a thin black top.",
