        {
          "id": "krea2-b702d2a71771ae1fee456af9",
          "alias": "单女灰连衣裙厨房媚态站立伸展",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before the kitchen mirror, wearing a tight gray long-sleeve dress that molds to her curves, the back zipper pulled low to reveal a tantalizing strip of bare skin. Her blonde hair cascades in soft, tousled waves over her shoulders, and her eyes meet the lens with a confident, almost defiant stare. One hand gently cups the nape of her neck, while the other rests on the wooden counter, arching her back slightly to emphasize her silhouette. A delicate gold necklace catches the light, drawing attention to her collarbone and the hint of cleavage visible where the dress's neckline is slightly tugged down. The mirror doubles her image, adding depth and a voyeuristic quality. In the foreground right, a black phone stand holds a smartphone, capturing the intimate moment. The kitchen background features a white fridge, a drawer-style dishwasher, pale beige walls with a framed landscape print, and a white door. Warm yellow overhead light bathes the scene, softening shadows and highlighting the curve of her hips and the sheen of the dress's fabric. The wooden floor gleams faintly, grounding the domestic yet sensual atmosphere. Every detail feels casually deliberate—a snapshot of quiet self-possession and barely concealed desire.",
