        {
          "id": "krea2-7115e4756168fc8462fcc11c",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝毛衣书店困倦站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless in a cozy, artsy bookstore, body angled sideways, head tilted back slightly, lips parted in a playful, thoughtful pout. Black thin-rimmed glasses sit on her nose, lenses catching soft indoor light. Her long dark hair is tied in a low, messy ponytail, stray strands brushing her cheeks, adding a careless, lazy allure. She wears only a blue-red-white striped fluffy cardigan, unbuttoned, sleeves rolled up to reveal a blue shirt collar (but no shirt beneath), exposing her bare chest and perky nipples. Over one shoulder hangs a fine brown leather handbag with metal buckle and brand embossing. Her right hand reaches toward a bookshelf, fingertips brushing a vertical book as if selecting or browsing; her left hand hangs naturally, a black wristband visible. The foreground captures her half-body clearly, dominating the frame. The composition uses a mid-close shot with the figure angled from lower left to upper right, creating a diagonal dynamic line. The visual path starts from her facial expression, moves up along her gaze to the top of the bookshelf, then back down to her hand motion, forming a closed observation loop. The midground shows dense white bookshelves neatly lined with books in green, pink, purple, black covers; spines display titles like \"FLOWER POWER\", \"THE HOME BAKING BOOK\", \"PARIS\", \"BERLIN\" – some with illustrations or patterns, building an intellectual, cultural atmosphere. The background is a light wall with faint \"Boulangerie\" lettering and blurred decorative posters. The floor features red-brown retro tiles in geometric patterns, adding a sense of age and warmth. Lighting comes from warm indoor yellow light, source slightly front-left, casting even light on her face and body, soft shadows falling on the shelves and wall behind, creating natural chiaroscuro. Book edges and the leather bag reflect subtle highlights, enhancing material realism. The color palette is warm brown-yellow, blue-red, and white, harmonious and layered, blending everyday intimacy with artistic photography aesthetics. The overall mood is relaxed, artsy, slightly playful, as if casually snapped by an old but reliable film camera, capturing a genuine, warm slice of urban life. A slight lens blur gives a dreamy, grainy, film-like glow, making the scene feel real and tender.",
