        {
          "id": "krea2-8eafb2c2911277126697ca10",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙沙发沉思坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits centered on a deep brown leather sofa, wearing a burgundy velvet slip dress with black lace trim at the plunging neckline and sides. The neckline is pulled low, exposing generous cleavage and the tops of her breasts. One strap falls off her shoulder, revealing bare skin. The thigh-high slit shows a black strap garter wrapped around her bare thigh. She gently touches the back of her head with her right hand, her left holding a clear plastic cup with a pink straw containing a light drink. Her gaze is downward, soft and contemplative. Long hair cascades over her shoulders. Flawless makeup with full crimson lips, small silver earrings. The dress clings to her curves, with natural fabric wrinkles. Background is a simple white wall with subtle texture and scratches, a vertical metal conduit on the right. Center composition, subject slightly lower. Soft warm lighting from the left front creates gentle shadows on her body and the sofa. Color palette: burgundy, dark brown, black, white. Realistic everyday photo style, slight camera tilt, focus on her face and upper body. The atmosphere is intimate, relaxed, and sensuous, capturing a quiet private moment of afternoon solitude.",
