          "prompt": "Two young women sit side by side on a gray yoga mat in a bright gym, bodies leaning forward, both focused on a pink phone screen. One holds the phone, taking a selfie into a mirror; the other turns her head with a flirtatious smile. They wear tight workout gear: left woman in a lavender sports bra that barely contains her breasts and high-waisted gray yoga pants that cling to every curve, white socks; right woman in a light gray sports bra with visible nipple outlines and matching yoga pants, black grip socks with individual toe separation. Their poses are relaxed but charged—the selfie-taker's free hand rests suggestively on her inner thigh, while her companion's hand hovers near the other's waist. Foreground focus on their bodies and feet: legs toned with subtle muscle definition, toes subtly curling in the socks. Sunlight streams from a left window, casting warm, dappled shadows across the floor and walls, creating a golden-hour glow. Midground includes a wooden ballet barre spanning the top of frame, supported by dark metal poles. Background: a large floor-to-ceiling window showing lush green trees swaying in the breeze, creamy white walls, open shelving with blue exercise balls, dumbbells, yoga mats, and a small speaker. The composition is centered with the subjects slightly below center, their gaze pulling toward the phone screen and outward to the viewer. Floor reflections and mirror finish enhance depth. Lighting blends natural and artificial warm tones, with soft highlights on glistening skin—sweat on collarbones and temples. The image has a realistic, slightly grainy film quality, moderate saturation, rich details, crisp subject, and shallow depth of field blurring the background. It captures a casual yet intimate moment, radiating easy sensuality, athletic energy, and the warmth of close friendship—a precious, slightly naughty snapshot.",
