          "alias": "单女露胸白袜子广场媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on an indoor staircase, her long straight black hair spilling over her shoulders, fair smooth skin glowing in warm light. She is completely topless, her small breasts exposed, one hand resting under her chin, the other loosely holding a cream square handbag. Her legs are parted, revealing black patent Mary Jane shoes with metal buckles and white slouchy socks bunched at her ankles. The black-and-white plaid sleeveless dress is unbuttoned and falling open at her sides. She gazes at the camera with a lazy, seductive smirk, body slightly turned for a dynamic pose. The stairs are carpeted in gray-brown abstract patterns, with a black metal handrail leading upward. Light from the upper left creates a dramatic beam, casting sharp shadows on the light beige wall. Slightly low-angle shot, warm intimate mood, high-end private residence atmosphere. Rich details, soft shadows, a blend of vintage fashion and raw sensuality.",
