        {
          "id": "krea2-5388fdca5d84a82d624fd2c7",
          "alias": "单女露胸灰牛仔广场困倦坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the back seat of a vintage red scooter, completely topless, her bare skin glowing in soft natural light. She wears only low-rise dark gray flared jeans with frayed hems and black chunky boots, her right hand gently touching her hair, left hand resting on the seat. Her long wavy dark brown hair falls over her shoulders, face soft with minimal makeup, pale pink lips, small earrings. She looks upward to the right with a dreamy, seductive expression. The background is a city street corner with a shop window displaying clothes and hats, white square tiles on the wall. The classic orange-red scooter has chrome details, a light green leather seat, and yellow turn signals. Mid-shot composition, woman on the right, scooter diagonally from lower left. Soft sunlight from the left creates warm shadows, slight film grain and vignette, a lazy afternoon urban vibe. Details include dust on tile seams, minor scratches on the bike, fabric folds, fallen leaves. Overall poetic, nostalgic, and sensually intimate.",
