          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a white metal stool at a Thai street food stall, wearing only a black short-sleeved modified cheongsam dress unbuttoned and hanging open, revealing her bare breasts, red geometric trim at collar and sides, slender frame, legs crossed, elegant yet relaxed pose, dark hair in two braids draped over shoulders, gold hoop earrings, right hand holding a smartphone with clear case taking a selfie, camera pointed at her face, left hand resting on knee with bright red nail polish, eyes focused on the screen, head slightly tilted, lips parted, expression contemplative and confident. Medium shot centered on her, foreground shows stainless steel counter with bottles of sauces, a green tea drink, a white plastic basket of menus and flyers, a paper receipt with Thai text, counter edge reflective. Background is typical Southeast Asian street food stall, blue-and-white Thai sign reading “ต้มเลือดหมู ก๋วยจั๊บหน้าใส ควายกินวุ้นปลา” with red Thai text “ลากรองใน 3 หนู” beside it, glass display case below with food samples, old bamboo sliding door on right, worn and scratched, wooden frame with visible grain and nail marks, interior of shop with white tile walls, fluorescent lights overhead, cool bright lighting, wires and ceiling fan visible, creating lived-in atmosphere. Left edge shows a sliver of another person's white clothing, suggesting nearby activity. Color palette mainly black, white, gray, with accents of red and green. Lighting from overhead fluorescents and natural daylight blending into soft shadows. Floor is dark gray concrete, slightly rough with water stains and dirt. Overall scene has a documentary feel, as if captured by a real camera or phone, strong sense of presence and story. Composition stable, visual focus on her action and facial expression, background rich but not cluttered, layers from foreground counter to midground figure to background stall structure, strong depth. Atmosphere blends modern urban life with traditional street culture, fashionable yet gritty, unique Southeast Asian street vibe. Texture is fine, details abundant, color saturation moderate, light transitions natural, yielding a realistic yet slightly artistic everyday photography style.",
