          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a weathered Southeast Asian colonial building, her brown workwear jumpsuit unbuttoned and pulled down to her waist, exposing her bare breasts and toned torso, the open fabric revealing a matching leather belt cinched at her hips. Her hair falls in soft waves, a calm yet pensive expression on her face as she looks to the right. In her left hand, she holds a brown canvas bag with white lettering, her right arm hangs naturally, a delicate chain bracelet on her wrist. She wears light brown short boots, her pose elegant and relaxed. Foreground: gray stone steps. Midground: her and a wrought iron gate with gold curved patterns. Behind: beige wall, wooden shutters, half-open glass window with white curtains. Potted plants—monstera and small flowers—on the corner. Stone pavement scattered with purple petals. Background: sloped red tile roof covered with moss and withered vines, small purple flowers growing from gaps, white decorative columns under eaves, stone pillars topped with round stone balls, lush greenery. Camera slightly low angle, central-right composition, figure occupying two-thirds of frame. Earth tones: brown, beige, gray-green. Soft diffuse light, slightly desaturated, quiet nostalgic atmosphere like a real street photo with realistic texture, moderate background blur. The overall scene conveys a leisurely, poetic urban moment, with sensual exposure adding intimate warmth.",
