        {
          "id": "krea2-a5f8df6356904e0e02ea390d",
          "alias": "单女蓝泳装泳池微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long brown hair partly tied in a high ponytail, the rest falling naturally and slightly wet against her cheeks and neck, stands at the edge of a pool, smiling brightly and looking directly at the camera with lively eyes. She wears a white short-sleeved top, unbuttoned halfway to reveal a deep cleavage and her bare torso, with dark blue stripes on the cuffs and sides, paired with high-waisted dark blue bikini bottoms with thin white trim, hugging her hips tightly. Her body angles slightly toward the camera, her left hand resting lightly on the blue metal pool railing, her right hand hanging naturally at her side, her pose relaxed and sensual. The background shows clear blue pool water with gentle ripples reflecting soft sunlight; blurred green foliage and building outlines are visible in the distance, creating a serene outdoor atmosphere. Mid-shot composition, the figure positioned left of center, using the diagonal pool edge line to guide the eye, enhancing depth. Soft natural lighting from the upper right highlights her skin and swimwear, casting delicate glistening highlights and creating sparkling reflections on the water surface. Overall tones of blue and white complement warm skin tones, evoking a refreshing summer day vibe. The image feels realistically detailed, like a professional photograph capturing a moment of playful, youthful freedom and joy, as if one can feel the breeze through her hair and the cool splash of water. The composition is balanced and dynamic, with clear focus on her facial expression and body language, radiating a carefree, relaxed summer aesthetic.",
