        {
          "id": "krea2-3b0de5016ac659761ae67391",
          "alias": "单女露胸米旗袍门微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a Japanese-style wooden lattice door, wearing a cream-white modified cheongsam dress with delicate dark patterns, sleeveless to reveal slender arms, traditional Chinese mandarin collar, and an A-line skirt that falls naturally. Her long dark brown hair is slightly curled and draped over her shoulders, with neat bangs covering her forehead. Her makeup is refined, with clear eyeliner and full lips, giving a gentle yet slightly playful vibe. In her right hand, she holds an open pink folding fan with repeated white patterns, light wood ribs, half covering her face, creating an air of subtle mystery. Her gaze is direct at the lens, eyes curious and confident. Her left hand hangs naturally, a gold bracelet on her wrist adding detail. The background is a dark brown wooden lattice door with regular grid structure, letting through dim interior light. Above the door hangs a striking pink 3D lettering \"hudabeauty\" in modern design, flanked by a few spherical red paper lanterns with wrinkled texture emitting soft warm light. The scene is at night or under interior lighting, with artificial light from the right and above, forming warm side lighting that defines her face and body contours while casting regular shadows on the lattice. The light-shadow contrast is soft, creating a quiet and cozy atmosphere. Composition is central, with the woman slightly left of center; the fan acts as a visual guide, drawing the eye from her face to the fan surface and back to the overall image. The background text and lanterns balance the frame. Colors are pink, cream-white, and dark brown, forming harmonious cool-warm contrast. The overall image has strong visual impact, blending Oriental aesthetics with modern commercial flair, like a carefully styled fashion portrait yet retaining a natural feel. Simulated with a full-frame mid-range camera, standard prime lens, ISO around 400, moderate shutter speed, accurate exposure, controlled depth of field with slight background blur to highlight the subject. Image texture is delicate, rich in detail, presenting an artistic yet lifelike photographic effect. For NSFW: The woman is topless, the cheongsam unbuttoned down the front, exposing her breasts. The fan is held slightly lower, still partially covering one nipple but revealing the other. She has a subtle, inviting smile, eyes locking with the viewer. The warm light accentuates her curves, and the overall atmosphere is sensual yet elegant.",
