          "id": "krea2-e8618e41c508119f53e0c272",
          "alias": "单女露胸衬衫忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless before a deep crimson backdrop, her bare skin glowing under soft overhead light. She wears only an unbuttoned plaid shirt slipping off one shoulder, with white socks and colorful sneakers; a pale blue handbag with gold metal buckle rests beside her. She hugs her knees, one hand cradling her cheek, her gaze direct and melancholic. Black hair falls naturally, strands framing her face. Scattered around her are green branches laden with plump red berries, lush leaves contrasting against the dark wall. The left side features huge white \"ELLE\" text with \"TAIWAN\" and URL below; vertical Chinese characters on the right read \"IU 李知恩 青春正盛\" alongside other magazine headers like \"高爾宣·孫盛希\" and \"YOUNG VOICE\" running vertically at the bottom right. The composition is centered, her nude form the focal point, the berries and bag adding texture. Lighting is uniform from above-front, casting subtle shadows, enhancing her contours. The palette mixes deep red, black, white with green and red accents, evoking a polished yet candid editorial style—sensual, artistic, and commercial.",
