          "id": "krea2-392fb053a6c8f4e8781f821a",
          "alias": "单女灰长裤酒廊微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits sideways on a metal outdoor chair, her body angled toward the camera, a warm smile on her lips as she gazes off to the left. Her long, sleek black hair falls naturally over her bare shoulders. She wears a sheer white low-cut top, completely unbuttoned, revealing her full, round breasts with nipples erect. In her hand, she holds a clear plastic cup filled with iced cold brew coffee—ice cubes floating, a white straw inserted, the cup’s brand logo visible. Her lower half is clad in tight gray athletic leggings, a small brand mark on the thigh, and she wears white platform sneakers with pink-purple laces and light blue mid-calf socks with a black logo on the left foot, while the right foot is in a white high-top sneaker with white long socks bearing a black Nike logo. Beside her, another person sits in a matching chair, a small round glass table between them holding a green matcha drink. The background is a glass curtain wall with horizontal gray-green blinds, reflecting blurred trees and sky, with faint English letters “OF WA” visible. The setting is a modern café or lounge outdoor area on a light gray concrete floor. Side sunlight casts soft, even light and natural shadows. Medium shot composition: the woman occupies the right side of the frame, with left negative space, her gaze and drink directing attention forward. The mood is relaxed, youthful, and sensual. Color palette: gray, white, pale purple, pink-purple, and green—fresh and natural. The image appears hyper-realistic, as if shot on a professional camera in daytime, capturing a casual urban lifestyle full of gentle, vibrant energy and rich, harmonious details.",
