          "id": "krea2-7f6f763b076ebcc683199fcd",
          "alias": "单女全裸高跟鞋阳台媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on the glass balcony edge of a modern high-rise, completely nude except for sheer transparent high heels and a small beige handbag dangling from her left hand. Her dark, slightly wavy hair cascades freely over her shoulders, catching the soft, even light. She wears sparkling earrings and a watch, her makeup bold with red lips and a direct, confident gaze into the lens. Her body is slightly turned, one leg bent and lifted, her right hand resting lightly on the glass railing, the pose sculptural and sensual. The background shows a blurred city skyline in a hazy blue dawn or dusk light. The glass railing reflects her silhouette and the surroundings, adding depth. The floor is gray tile with clean lines. The composition centers her slightly right, using diagonal rails and a stretching corridor to guide the eye, creating strong perspective. Soft, even light illuminates her face and body, highlighting every curve and detail. The overall mood is a blend of urban cool and feminine warmth, resembling a high-end fashion editorial shot—cinematic, detailed, with a slight film grain and subtle color saturation. The image feels both dreamlike and hyper-real, capturing a moment of elegant exposure, balancing stark modern architecture with the softness of bare flesh.",
