          "alias": "单女全裸广场媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands nude against a light gray seamless backdrop, her body bare except for a wide brown leather belt with a gold square buckle cinched at her waist. Her deep brown hair falls naturally over her shoulders, sleek with a soft sheen. Her face is elegantly made up with defined eyeliner and a subtle lip color, her gaze direct and confident, expression calm yet assertive. Around her neck, a black leather choker with a silver rose-shaped metal pendant adds a punk-elegant edge. Her hands rest at her sides or in imaginary pockets, body slightly tilted with head lifted, creating a dynamic yet relaxed pose. The composition is a mid-shot, figure centered slightly right, with soft top-left key light casting warm golden highlights over her skin, face, shoulders, and arms, evoking a sunset or warm indoor studio glow. Subtle shadows on the right wall enhance depth and dimensionality. The overall tone balances cool grays and warm yellows, with a slight film grain and desaturated palette, resembling a high-quality amateur studio photograph. Details like skin texture, leather sheen, and metal reflections are crisp. The image blends fashion editorial with raw sensuality, evoking a youthful, confident, and subtly explicit aesthetic.",
