        {
          "id": "krea2-fefb84112eadead6c6ab5c7c",
          "alias": "单女露胸棕挂脖酒店微笑站立吃",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless at the balcony railing of a tropical resort hotel, her shoulder-length hair with soft curls and natural bangs, fair skin, delicate side profile, biting a golden chip with relaxed, focused enjoyment, a slight smile of contentment. She wears only a deep brown and white polka-dot halter dress that is fully open at the back, exposing her bare shoulders, neck, and entire back, leaving her breasts fully visible from the side. In her left hand she holds a red chip bag with \"CORN\" printed on it; her right hand brings a golden chip to her mouth, fingers long with black nail polish. Her body leans slightly forward, resting against the wood-and-white-metal railing, casual and natural. Background: open ocean view with calm blue water fading from light to deep blue, clear horizon, bright blue sky dotted with fluffy white cumulus clouds, strong sunlight from the upper right casting soft highlights on her hair, shoulders, and arms, with faint shadows on the railing and ground. Midground: lush palm trees in dense dark green clusters along the shore, some shadows reflecting on the sea, distant beach and low buildings barely visible. Foreground: the balcony's wooden handrail and vertical white metal bars, clean modern lines. Composition: vertical rectangle, subject on the left side in the lower half, gaze leading from her face toward the distant horizon, creating depth. Mood: relaxed, joyful, sensual summer vacation vibes. Warm bright tones, moderate saturation, slight film grain, natural light transitions, rich detail, candid snapshot feel - an unpolished, real-life travel moment captured on a phone, with gentle overexposure and natural grain for an intimate, story-like visual.",
