        {
          "id": "krea2-90f6ef9310c6a64a1ce41aea",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙媚态坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a deep crimson setting, wearing a sheer black lace slip dress with a plunging neckline, the delicate lace pattern barely visible in the dim light, giving an air of refined mystery. Her hair is swept up in a high bun adorned with red blossoms and silver hair ornaments that catch faint cool glints. Her makeup is precise: winged eyeliner framing sultry eyes, full red lips matching the palette. She gazes downward with a melancholic, introspective expression, her arm bent, elbow resting on her knee, palm cradling her chin in an elegant, relaxed pose. Multiple stacked gold bangles shimmer warmly on her wrist, while her other hand hangs naturally, fingers long and pale against the red backdrop. In the foreground, several translucent red paper umbrellas are slightly opened, their edges soft and blurred, with faintly visible handles, evoking an Eastern traditional atmosphere. The subject dominates the center-left of the frame, captured from a slightly tilted angle that adds dynamic tension. Her body curves into an S-shape, head tilted gently, creating a graceful line. The background is a pure red gradient from deep to dark, uncluttered, emphasizing the silhouette and color contrast. Light falls from an upper diagonal source, focusing on her face and upper body, creating strong chiaroscuro with deep shadows that enhance depth and drama. Soft halos rim her shoulders, arms, and face, lending a warm, hazy mood. The umbrellas catch partial illumination, their surfaces glowing subtly, adding depth. The overall palette is dominated by red, with black, gold, and skin tones, highly saturated yet not harsh, creating striking visual impact. The uneven lighting underscores emotional expression—a quiet, story-filled atmosphere that feels like a private moment where Eastern aesthetics meets modern sensibility. The image has a cinematic, detail-rich quality like a professional fashion editorial, yet retains the authenticity of amateur equipment with slight grain, natural exposure transitions, and imperfect shadows, making the scene both polished and warmly lifelike.",
