        {
          "id": "krea2-8f2e711189a9e3cee97e4d93",
          "alias": "单女露胸米连衣裙泳池微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a wooden table, topless, her cream puff-sleeve dress slipping down to pool around her waist, revealing her bare breasts. She wears sunglasses perched on her head, a pearl necklace, and a simple watch. Her face beams with a relaxed, joyful smile, eyes half-closed, as she holds a blue-green English novel \"The Message\" by Mai Jia in her left hand, spine toward the camera. Her right hand reaches toward a plate of food. On the table are two white plates, each with a paper-wrapped sandwich filled with fresh lettuce, tomato, and purple bread; beside them, a transparent cup of iced coffee or milk tea, with a straw and black holder. The background is a mottled cement wall with peeling white paint, revealing gray patches and irregular textures—a vintage industrial feel. To the right, a white-framed window shows faint green plants and wire fencing outside, letting soft natural light stream in from the upper right, illuminating her side profile and exposed chest, casting warm, bright chiaroscuro. The composition is a close-up, with the woman slightly tilted right of center, looking left. The scene is warm with cream, gray-brown tones, accented by green and purple from the sandwich fillings. The lighting is soft, film-like, with subtle grain and natural exposure, evoking a candid, real-life moment of sensual ease on a lazy afternoon.",
