          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a white brick windowsill, her long, sleek black hair falling naturally, pale smooth skin, delicate features, eyes calm and deep, slightly tilted head gazing at the lens, lips parted, expression carrying a hint of laziness and contemplation, wearing a black tweed double-breasted short jacket left unbuttoned to reveal a white high-neck knit top that clings to her curves, black miniskirt, sheer black stockings, and tall black leather pointed-toe heeled boots, legs crossed with one foot lightly touching the floor, the other slanted, her right hand resting on the sill, long fingers with white nail polish, left hand hanging naturally, retro yet stylish overall look. The background features a multi-pane window with green frames, bright soft light from outside creating strong backlighting that outlines her silhouette, the window frame edges show slight wear and rust adding industrial texture, white brick wall texture clear with subtle stains and age, light pouring in from the right window casting soft shadows on the wall and her body, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. Medium shot composition, subject slightly left of center, body leaning slightly, gaze making subtle eye contact with the viewer, window frame lines guide the eye rightward enhancing depth. Light mainly from the right creates natural chiaroscuro, emphasizing her contours and clothing details. Predominant black, white, and gray tones with minimal gold buttons and white clothing, elegant and high-contrast color palette, strong cinematic and film-grain feel, as if a photograph taken in an old industrial loft or art studio. Camera simulated as medium-format film, 85mm, f/2.8, 1/125s, ISO 200, slight grain and soft bokeh, smooth light transition, no blown highlights or crushed blacks, overall quiet, artistic, vintage, and narrative, like a treasured image of an afternoon moment, rich in detail from fabric texture to skin glow to brick roughness, presenting a professional yet lifelike realism. To make NSFW: unbutton the jacket further, showing the white knit top revealing a hint of cleavage or slipped shoulder, or adjust her pose to be more suggestive (e.g., hand sliding up her thigh, or one boot resting on the sill, or lips parted wider with a sultry look). Keep the refined aesthetic but add an adult sensual edge.",
