        {
          "id": "krea2-05740fd1d54d82b393706a19",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝牛仔山野微笑坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits atop a yellow-and-silver mountain bike, her long brown hair cascading to her waist, with a natural fringe falling over her forehead. She beams a radiant smile, revealing bright teeth, her eyes sparkling with vitality. Her right hand lifts to touch her forehead in a playful gesture, while her left hand grips the handlebar securely, leaning slightly forward in a relaxed, confident pose. She wears no top, her bare breasts exposed, with a delicate red string bracelet on her wrist adding a pop of color. Her light blue denim shorts are frayed and faded, with the top button undone, hinting at casual sensuality. The bike features a \"DUNLOP\" logo on the frame and a yellow smiley-face reflector on the handlebar; metallic parts gleam softly in the light. The background is lush green forest and bushes, with layered vegetation and distant trees blurred into a hazy green. The foreground shows a gray asphalt road with a faint concrete curb. The mid-shot composition places the woman slightly left of center, with the bike dominating the foreground, creating stable visual weight. A low-angle shot emphasizes her youthful energy. Golden sunlight streams from the upper right, filtering through leaves to cast dappled light across her face, hair, and body, creating soft highlights and gentle shadows. The warm yellow and green tones, moderate saturation, and fine texture mimic a professional camera with a wide aperture, giving strong depth of field and natural bokeh. The scene captures a carefree, intimate summer afternoon—a stolen moment full of youthful vitality and warmth.",
