          "prompt": "A young woman stands atop a black-and-white striped cylindrical pedestal in the center of an open plaza, wearing a sleek black form-fitting long-sleeve dress with multiple heart-shaped cutouts across her chest and waist, connected by shimmering silver metal chains, blending futuristic and romantic aesthetics. Her hair is swept up in a high bun, with a few strands catching the sunlight in golden highlights. Her makeup is immaculate, eyes slightly glazed and seductive as she gazes toward the lens, lips parted in a high-fashion allure. She wears black stiletto heels with thin straps, her posture graceful and confident, arms hanging naturally at her sides, with a minimalist metal bracelet on one wrist and a fine chain necklace around her neck. The overall look exudes modern artistic chic. In the foreground, the cylindrical sculpture features vertical black-and-white stripes, its surface resembling marble or concrete with rough yet layered texture; she stands atop it, her feet on a smooth metallic reflective surface. The midground reveals the plaza floor covered in gray tiles, dotted with geometrically arranged identical striped cylinders and low stools. In the distance, a few blurred pedestrians—some taking photos, others strolling—add natural life. The background is a majestic classical European Baroque building with beige stone façade, multiple arched colonnades, columns, carved window frames, and balcony railings; the roofline is adorned with stone statues. The building appears solemn and elegant under a clear blue sky. The sun is positioned in the upper left, creating dramatic backlighting with intense starbursts and lens flares, rays piercing the air to form distinct beams that highlight her silhouette and hair, casting a warm, dreamy glow. The composition is centrally symmetrical, with the subject slightly right of center, dominating the visual focus. A wide-angle lens introduces slight perspective distortion, enhancing spatial depth. The ground’s geometric patterns guide the eye inward, creating a visual rhythm. High contrast: blown-out highlights in bright areas, rich shadows in darker regions. The color palette is primarily black, white, and gray, accented by the sky’s pale blue and the sunlight’s warm yellow, giving a cool yet harmonious tone. The mood blends urban fashion with avant-garde exhibition art, as if a real-life-virtually intertwined runway show. The image quality mimics professional studio-level high-definition while retaining a candid street-photography feel—detailed, layered, and offering a realistic yet surreal aesthetic experience.",
