          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a studio with a solid-colored background, wearing a beige ruffled sleeveless dress, the bodice pulled down to expose her bare breasts, the olive green knit cardigan slipping off her shoulders and draping loosely around her arms. Her dark hair falls naturally, soft bangs brushing her forehead. She gazes downward, head slightly tilted, expression calm with a hint of melancholy, lost in thought. One hand gently holds a bouquet of blooming white orchids, petals pure as snow with pale yellow centers, slim green stems and leaves contrasting softly with her light clothing. Her other hand rests on the floor, supporting her weight, legs bent. A brown leather riding boot rests diagonally against her calf, its smooth surface warm and vintage-textured. Her ankles and legs are elegantly curved, skin fair and smooth. Overall pose relaxed and graceful. Composition slightly left-centered, figure dominating the frame. Background is a simple light gray wall. Soft light comes from the left, creating chiaroscuro, with shadows naturally extending on the right wall and floor, enhancing depth. Lighting is quiet and introspective. Color palette includes gray, olive green, beige, cream, white, and brown, harmonious and artistic. The image has a professional studio feel with a natural everyday touch. Shot at medium focal length with moderate depth of field, focus sharp on her face and the orchids, background slightly blurred to emphasize the subject. Visual flow moves from her gaze and hand gestures to the flowers, then to her overall pose, evoking a still, contemplative, poetic atmosphere. Rich details: fabric wrinkles, leather luster, delicate petal texture, fine hair strands are all visible. Style blends fashion and artistry, suitable for high-end fashion photography or personal art portraiture, conveying tenderness, introspection, and elegance. Minimalist design draws full attention to the woman and her emotional expression. Composition is balanced with tension, light and shadow delicate, layers distinct, presenting a serene beauty of modern aesthetics.",
