        {
          "id": "krea2-5e5799a0f739de637300015a",
          "alias": "单女露胸和服街道媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a moonlit city street at night, her ornate kimono partially open to reveal her bare breasts and smooth décolletage. The flowing furisode is primarily jade green, embroidered with intricate butterflies and floral motifs in gradients of pale to deep green, accented with white, soft blue, and gold blossoms. A large blue-and-black butterfly dominates the center of the skirt, surrounded by cherry blossoms, plum flowers, and delicate vine patterns. The silk fabric catches the streetlight, creating soft highlights and shadows. A wide brocade obi cinches her waist, decorated with geometric patterns and embroidered details, with colored tassels and traditional knots dangling. Her short brown hair is slightly tousled, adorned with a blue flower tucked behind one ear. She gracefully raises her right hand to shield her forehead as if feeling the night breeze or gazing into the distance, her left hand hanging loosely at her side, fingers lightly curled. Her gaze drifts upward and to the side, expression serene yet contemplative. Her face is soft with natural pink lips and minimal makeup, embodying a blend of traditional elegance and modern sensuality. She wears simple cream-colored geta sandals, standing on gray square pavement tiles that reflect faint light. The background is a blurred cityscape: distant skyscrapers, neon lights in warm yellow, cool white, and orange-red, forming beautiful bokeh. Modern architecture with metal beams and street lamps lines the street, casting bright white light. The composition is a mid-shot, with her positioned slightly left, body subtly turned, head tilted upward, creating a graceful line. The focus is on her face and the intricate kimono details, especially the large butterfly. Lighting comes from side and above, casting soft highlights on her skin and the silk, with a faint shadow on the ground. The overall palette is cool—jade, gray-blue, black—contrasted with warm yellow light, evoking a dreamy, poetic atmosphere. The scene captures a fleeting moment of serene eroticism, blending Japanese aesthetic refinement with the alienation of modern urban night.",
