          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless on a weathered wooden pier, wearing only low-rise green-and-white daisy-print bikini bottoms tied at her hips. Her deep brown hair is piled high in a loose bun, with soft strands falling across her forehead. She gazes directly at the camera, a mix of shyness and confidence in her expression, her hands resting lightly on the rusted metal railing. Her body turns slightly, highlighting her bare breasts, smooth sun-kissed skin, and the gentle curve of her waist. She wears simple white flip-flops, feet planted on the metal grid floor. Blurred wooden posts in the foreground frame the composition, drawing focus to her figure. In the midground, aged wood pillars and rusted metal beams show rich textures of decay. The background opens onto a calm sea in pale aqua-green, shimmering with sunlight, a clear horizon, and a soft blue sky with thin clouds. Natural daylight from the side casts subtle shadows, accentuating her silhouette and skin texture. Lighting is warm, even, and gentle. The composition places her slightly left of center, with diagonal pier lines enhancing depth. Color palette of green, blue, and tan feels cohesive and vibrant. The scene has an authentic amateur photography quality, as if captured spontaneously during a seaside holiday. Camera angle is nearly eye-level with a mild wide-angle effect. Details are crisp: skin texture, swimsuit fabric folds, rust patches, water ripples. The overall mood is relaxed, inviting, and sensual, blending natural beauty, youthful allure, and industrial decay into a striking seaside portrait.",
