          "prompt": "A young woman in a dark blue school blazer, white shirt, and deep blue tie sits on stone steps before a traditional Japanese shrine. Her shoulder-length black hair falls loose, head tilted back as she gazes up, expression calm and contemplative. Her blazer is slightly open, the white shirt unbuttoned at the top, revealing a hint of collarbone and the edge of a beige camisole. Her skirt rides up as she sits, exposing her thighs. Her hands rest naturally on her knees, legs slightly apart. She wears black socks and black leather shoes. A small red badge is pinned to the left chest of her blazer. The shrine is built of dark brown wood, with a thick braided rope and red-and-white shimenawa hanging above the entrance, a red tassel dangling. The wooden lattice door is ajar. The gray stone steps are weathered, with moss and scattered pink cherry blossom petals. A white sign with Japanese text is posted beside the door. Behind, dense green trees form a deep backdrop. Soft, even light suggests overcast or early morning, with a cool, muted color palette of wood, stone, blue, and white. The composition is centered, with the woman in the lower middle, shrine above, and layered depth from steps to shrine to forest. The image has a slightly grainy, natural saturation, like a candid photo taken on an ordinary yet poetic afternoon, evoking nostalgia, youth, and a touch of melancholy.",
