          "id": "krea2-95441e00f57fcd68ba8c7e09",
          "alias": "单女和服街道忧伤站立回眸",
          "prompt": "At night on a rain-slicked city street, a young woman in an elegant kimono stands with her side turned, glancing back at the camera with a deep, melancholic gaze. Her kimono is partially undone, revealing bare shoulders and the soft curve of her breasts, the fabric slipping to expose her smooth skin. The kimono is a vivid blue-green adorned with intricate floral patterns—white, purple, blue blossoms—and vibrant butterflies that seem ready to take flight. A golden and purple woven obi cinches her waist, its tassels and metal ornaments catching the neon glow. Her hair is styled in an updo with a white silk flower and loose tendrils framing her face. She holds a single red rose in her right hand, its petals full and dark, pressing lightly against her bare collarbone. Her left hand hangs naturally, the sleeve sliding back to reveal her slim wrist. She stands at a crosswalk, the wet asphalt reflecting the blur of neon signs and car headlights. The background is a modern cityscape with high-rises, glowing billboards, and hazy light orbs from out-of-focus traffic. A silhouette of a passerby in a dark coat fades into the distance. Composition is golden-ratio left-center, with the camera low angle making her appear taller and closer. Lighting comes from ambient street lamps, a soft front-right key illuminating her face and exposed skin, with shadows filled by cool blue and warm yellow reflections. The mood is sensual isolation, a fusion of tradition and modernity, with film-grain texture capturing a moment of erotic melancholy.",
