          "alias": "单女露胸白外套街道害羞站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on an outdoor street, her brown medium-length hair falling naturally to her shoulders with slight waves and straight bangs, her eyes clear and gentle, lips slightly parted, expression carrying a hint of shyness and contemplation, looking directly at the camera. She wears a fluffy white coat fully open, revealing her bare torso and erect nipples, the high collar and wide cuffs framing her exposed skin. Beneath, a light gray high-neck knit top is absent, leaving her topless. Dark blue jeans with frayed, worn cuffs hug her hips, a black leather belt with visible metal buckle cinched at her waist. Her right hand holds a glossy black handbag, left hand rests on a faded blue metal utility pole with peeling paint and sticker marks, arm crossing in front of her chest. The background is a blurred city street with white building walls, faint window outlines, and a low bush with autumn red-yellow leaves on gray pavement. The composition centers her slightly left, body tilted, head turned toward the lens, creating an intimate and shy eye contact. Soft diffused overcast light, cool blue-gray tones, subtle film grain texture. Every detail is sharp: the coat's fiber fluff, denim folds, bag reflection, pole's weathered surface. The mood is quiet, everyday, slightly melancholic, like a candid street photograph captured on an ordinary afternoon, now charged with a stripped-back sensuality.",
