        {
          "id": "krea2-7befd4229a333aa9fc712463",
          "alias": "单女露胸白外套广场忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a sleek black modern chair, her thick dark brown curls cascading naturally, the voluminous strands partially veiling one side of her face. Her gaze drops downward, lips slightly parted, exuding a melancholy, contemplative air—soft facial features, fair skin, straight nose bridge, blending youthful innocence with mature sensuality. She wears a loose white fluffy coat, its surface adorned with three-dimensional blue flowers in gradient shades, each petal detailed with subtle shadows and textures for a realistic, soft tactile feel. The coat is unzipped and hanging open, exposing her bare chest—full, firm breasts with erect nipples visible against the pale skin. Inside, a pale blue long-sleeve top is pushed aside, revealing her collarbones and the curve of her cleavage. She wears a cream-white high-waisted skirt with fine diamond quilted texture, cut simply and form-fitting, accentuating her thighs. On her legs are light blue sheer stockings, smooth and cool-toned, shimmering slightly. Her feet are in cream-white pointed-toe high heels with sleek lines and slender stiletto heels. One leg is crossed over the other, knee bent, ankle relaxed. Her hands are adorned with multiple vintage gold rings and bracelets—one ring set with a red gem, another bracelet with intricate openwork floral design. Her left hand rests lightly on the chair's backrest, fingers naturally extended, posture relaxed. The foreground focuses on her lower body and legs, clearly showing stockings, shoes, and crossed-leg pose. Midground frames her upper body and clothing, including coat, skirt, and hair. Composition centers on her, slightly offset to the left, creating asymmetrical yet balanced visual structure. The background is a simple white wall, smooth and bare; the floor is covered in dark gray square tiles with neat grout lines, reflecting faint light—clean, minimalist space. A second black chair of similar design is partially visible, adding depth and realism. Shot in medium portrait angle, camera positioned slightly below eye level, capturing her pose from the side, enhancing depth and immersion. Visual flow follows her leg lines upward through the body, then via her head and gaze direction downward, forming a slow S-curve. Lighting comes from front left, simulating natural window light or soft studio lamp—even, gentle, with subtle shadows on her right side and chair edges, creating smooth transitions. Overall atmosphere is quiet, intimate, with a touch of detachment. Color palette dominated by blue, white, and cream, accented by black furniture—harmonious, evoking a serene moment in modern urban life, as if a casual snapshot taken in a café corner or art studio. The image feels hyper-real, like film photography with slight grain and color shift, enhancing warmth and narrative. The overall image conveys a gentle, vulnerable yet independent femininity—stylish yet lived-in.",
