        {
          "id": "krea2-46384bff4f99ad6bc1809b91",
          "alias": "单女露胸桌边微笑坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits indoors at a birthday celebration, wearing only a light green paper birthday crown with colorful letters reading \"HAPPY BIRTHDAY\" and red/yellow polka dot decorations, her deep brown medium-length hair falling naturally, glinting in soft light. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, with a radiant wide smile, eyes crinkled from laughter, teeth showing, and a smear of cream on her cheek—pure, genuine joy. She wears no clothes, only a silver thin bracelet on her left wrist and blue-and-white striped nail art on her right hand. Her hands are raised: right index finger pointing up, left slightly bent in a celebratory gesture. She leans forward slightly, full of energy and delight. On the table in front is a two-layer cream cake covered in smooth white frosting, topped with several black candles and bright red cherries, with delicate piped frosting along the edge. Background is a flat light gray wall, creating a clean simple space. Multiple translucent circular bubbles float around—some with a slight halo effect—creating a dreamy atmosphere, distributed above and around her head, adding motion and festive mood. Centered composition, her face and the cake as focal points, camera angle slightly below eye level, making the subject prominent and drawing viewers in. Lighting from front-left, soft and even on her face and cake, shadows weak, warm and bright. Overall colors: light blue, white, pale green, with red cherries and colorful crown accents—fresh, harmonious palette. The mood is relaxed, joyful, full of life and youthful energy. Image has a candid snap-shot feel, as if taken with a phone or portable camera—rich in detail but not over-polished, retaining slight grain and noise. Moderate focal length, shallow depth of field: foreground sharp, background softly blurred, maintaining realistic environment. Also visible: scattered candies and decorations on the table, adding richness and storytelling. Entire scene conveys a warm, authentic, infectious birthday moment of pure happiness.",
