          "alias": "单女露胸米风衣广场媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a modern grey fabric armchair, her shoulder-length hair with bangs falling softly as she gazes thoughtfully to the right foreground, her expression quiet and introspective. Her skin is fair and flawless, delicate features with slightly parted lips. Her body is relaxed, right hand resting gently on her thigh, left hand draped over the armrest. She wears a loosely fitted beige trench coat with subtle sheen, the double-breasted design visible, collar slightly raised—completely open, revealing her bare chest and torso, nipples exposed. Underneath, no inner wear; instead, a pale green high-neck knit sweater is casually discarded, leaving her topless. She pairs this with a white lace-trimmed skirt, the delicate edge details clear, her long legs stretched out, sheathed in black over-the-knee boots that contrast sharply with her exposed skin. Beside her rests a brown leather handbag with classic quilted pattern, a pink fluffy charm attached—round face and white pom-pom adding a cute touch. Foreground shows a corner of a round white table, glossy surface reflecting light. Background features a wooden cabinet with two clear glass candleholders—one square, one cylindrical—each holding a white candle, warm light glowing from within the cabinet. The scene is bathed in warm amber tones, light from left and above creating soft shadows, subtle highlights on her coat and skin. The wood grain, fabric textures, and leather details are crisp. Composition is mid-shot, she is centered slightly left, body turned slightly, gaze leading outside the frame. Depth is established by foreground table, midground figure and sofa, background cabinet and wall. Color palette: beige, brown, grey, white, pale green—harmonious and cozy, yet elegantly sensual. The overall atmosphere is quiet, sophisticated, capturing a moment of urban femininity, as if a high-end lifestyle photography shot, radiating understated luxury and erotic poise.",
