        {
          "id": "krea2-3efe4e3098f66ac67751099f",
          "alias": "单女全裸摄影棚媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young female model stands in half-body portrait at center frame, her jet-black, thick blunt-cut short hair tousled by a light breeze to one side, strands naturally drifting and catching the light with a healthy sheen, some falling across her cheek and neck for a lazy, sensual feel. Her delicate, sculpted features meet the camera with deep, confident eyes, a hint of mystery in her gaze; her eye makeup is layered and precise—smoky shadow and sharp liner define her contours, with long, curled lashes. Her full, slightly parted lips wear a natural nude-pink gloss, giving a modern yet elegant finish. She is completely topless, her bare shoulders and collarbones exposed, smooth pale skin glowing with a healthy sheen. Her left hand is raised to her chest, fingers long and adorned with multiple wide gold rings—simple, textured bands—while several gold bangles stack on her wrist, engraved and metallic. Around her neck hang two gold chains: one fine with a small pendant, the other thicker with a geometric gemstone charm. Her earlobes feature circular gold earrings, simple but strong. Her skin is flawless, luminous. The pose is relaxed yet powerful. Background is a pure light-brown tone, like a soft studio backdrop, minimal and elegant. Composition is centered, with the subject slightly tilting her head, eyes locked on the viewer for strong visual impact. Text is integrated: top left large light-blue “VOGUE,” below “THAILAND” and “JULY 2021 NO.102 LALISA MANOBAL”; bottom right “YOUNG & WILD” with Thai script; center-lower “EVERYBODY LOVES LISA” in modern sans-serif. Lighting is key—main source from front-left, soft and even, highlighting forehead, nose bridge, cheekbones, collarbones, with smooth shadow gradation and subtle bokeh between subject and background. The overall mood is fashion-forward, artistic, yet intimate—a high-end magazine cover with a raw, realistic feel, saturated colors, rich detail, and a composed, elegant, wild, and contemporary aesthetic.",
