          "id": "krea2-1ea638619c67526ec825d435",
          "alias": "单女露胸西装桌边闭眼坐持杯",
          "prompt": "A young topless woman sits gracefully at the center, eyes closed with a blissful smile, her black hair pinned up with white flower ornaments and pearl earrings. She wears a sparkling bracelet on her left wrist and a simple brilliant ring on her right ring finger. Her hands lift gently, fingers slightly parted, as if receiving warmth and blessings, holding a martini glass with clear liquid that catches the light. Multiple arms extend from all sides, each holding a champagne flute or cocktail—some in dark suit cuffs, others with delicate wrists and silver bangles, or adorned with fine rings—forming a circular array around her, creating a celebratory circle. Behind, deep brown heavy curtains with natural folds, and faint \"TENG HUANG\" text in the upper right, suggesting a brand event or private celebration. Left wall is light gray, smooth. Below, a black-clothed table with scattered tiny glittering particles, adding luxury. Composition is centrally symmetric, with the woman as focal point, arms and glasses radiating outward. Lighting is exquisite: main source from front-left, softly illuminating her face and bare torso, highlighting curves and skin texture, with subtle highlights on cheeks and neck. Side light on glasses and hands creates contrast and depth. Warm gold and deep brown tones dominate, contrasting with her bare skin and transparent glassware. Rich details: fine creases on the tablecloth, bubbles in glasses, nail polish, jewelry reflections—all vividly realistic, like a professional still from a high-end film. The atmosphere is both intimate and luxurious, capturing a ritual of celebration and emotional warmth.",
