          "prompt": "A young woman kneels gracefully in an elegant pose against a deep charcoal gradient backdrop. She wears a black velvet off-shoulder dress with a plunging neckline, the hem adorned with fluffy black feathers that part to reveal her bare thighs. A black beret with double-C logo and sparkling crystal accents sits atop her head. Around her neck, layers of pearl strands and a black diamond-choker combine classic and modern styles. Her makeup is flawless—sharp black eyeliner, smoky eyeshadow, warm rosewood lips, and luminous pale skin. She tilts her head slightly, gazing directly at the camera with a sultry, mysterious expression. One hand lightly touches loose pearls scattered on the floor, the other rests on her knee. Her long fingers show dark nail polish. Her legs are together, revealing two black cross tattoos on her knees. The composition is a mid-shot portrait, with her body forming an S-curve, offset to the left. Soft directional light from the right front creates gentle chiaroscuro, highlighting her face, neck, and hands, while shadows contour her body. The all-gray gradient background transitions from light to dark gray, creating a clean, high-end atmosphere. The overall mood is cool, dramatic, and artistic, with a semi-nude, sensual edge as the dress’s décolletage exposes the upper curve of her breasts and part of her bare back. The image feels like a studio fashion editorial with real skin texture and intimate, confident tension.",
