        {
          "id": "krea2-44d3ce0a23a5c437747977ba",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣厨房媚态坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a kitchen counter, wearing a short black-and-white striped knit sweater that leaves her midriff bare, paired with only a white lace thong peeking from the waistband. Her legs are crossed at the ankles, dangling naturally, posture relaxed and inviting. On her head, a fluffy white faux-fur cat-ear hat adds a playful, soft touch. Her deep brown wavy hair falls over her shoulders, makeup precise with pink-to-purple gradient eyeshadow, sharp eyeliner, voluminous lashes, and pale pink lips. A faint blush dusts her cheeks. She brings one fingertip to her lips in a \"shush\" gesture, her gaze slightly hazy, locking directly with the camera. The foreground focuses on the smooth, toned lines of her legs and bare skin glowing under warm light. The middle ground shows her torso and the surrounding kitchen scene: behind her, a window with cream-colored horizontal blinds lets in soft light, its glass covered with assorted stickers—a cartoon face, a black heart monogram, a vintage record cover. On the counter to the right lies a blue vinyl sleeve reading \"STARVING ARTISTS CREW,\" next to a green glass beer bottle and a brown liquor bottle with faded labels. To the left, an off-white retro radio with worn knobs. The whole scene is bathed in warm, amber-toned light from the side, creating soft shadows and a nostalgic, intimate mood. Composition centers slightly left on her body, with layered depth from the counter objects. The image has a grainy, film-like texture, slightly faded colors, subtle vignetting, and a candid, street-photography-meets-Japanese-portrait aesthetic—capturing a quiet, private moment of youthful introspection with a sensual edge.",
