        {
          "id": "krea2-383530828f3c65309732084f",
          "alias": "单女露胸连衣裙门媚态坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a low red brick wall, her long black hair with blunt bangs cascading freely. She is topless, her bare breasts fully exposed, nipples slightly hardened in the warm afternoon light. A sweet, sultry smile plays on her lips as she gazes softly at a white plate in her hands, which holds two delicate small cakes topped with cream and a ripe red berry. She holds the plate steadily, her posture elegant yet relaxed. She wears only a pair of white platform wedge sandals with thin ankle straps, her right leg bent with toes resting against the brick wall, left leg dangling down naturally. Beside her rests a woven straw handbag in beige with brown leather handles and a heart-shaped leather accent. The background is an outdoor courtyard: to the left, the red brick wall with visible mortar lines and a blue-and-white poster reading \"Take the red shoes & go out\" with cartoon animal illustrations; to the right, lush green shrubs with tiny yellow flowers peeking through. Behind, a few rough stone steps lead to a building entrance, its glass doors reflecting the surroundings. The lighting is soft and warm, late afternoon sun slanting from upper right, casting gentle shadows across her skin, the dress (now absent), and the ground. Composition is a mid-shot from a slight high angle, the woman positioned left, her body diagonally extending, focus on her hands and the plate. Foreground includes brick wall and ground, midground shows the woman and bag, background has plants and building. The color palette is warm—orange-red brick, green foliage, pale sky, and the woman's bare skin tones creating a harmonious, sensual atmosphere. The style blends realistic everyday life with artistic photography, as if captured by a phone camera, yet exuding a tranquil, tender, and erotic mood.",
