          "alias": "单女白衬衫户外忧伤站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in front of a green wire fence outdoors, wearing a simple white short-sleeved shirt, unbuttoned halfway down to reveal her bare midriff and the swell of her breasts beneath a thin, wet fabric that clings to her skin. She pairs this with loose, light-colored short shorts, a thin beige belt at her waist, and her black shoulder-length hair hangs naturally, slightly damp as if she just came from the water, with bangs neatly covering her forehead. She wears transparent round glasses, the lenses catching soft light, her eyes clear and focused as she looks directly at the camera, lips slightly parted in a contemplative, slightly melancholic expression. The background is lush green foliage layered in sunlight, creating dappled shadows on the diamond-patterned fence. Thick green metal bars cross the foreground, adding depth. The composition places her slightly right of center, body slightly turned, face straight to camera, establishing strong eye contact. Sunlight streams diagonally from above, highlighting her silhouette, wet shirt, and the subtle curve of her breasts. The overall lighting is bright and soft, natural daylight filtering through leaves, casting warm golden highlights on her skin and the wet fabric, which becomes semi-transparent. The color palette is dominated by greens, white, beige, and skin tones, with a saturated yet gentle look. The scene has a magazine cover feel, capturing a candid, mundane yet poignant summer moment, evoking a sense of youthful, natural, sensual beauty. The text \"mina\" and \"夏の「ご近所」服。\" appear as small typography integrated into the design.",
