        {
          "id": "krea2-7c54a91454a4716dff90cbc8",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙纯色背景严肃躺躲藏",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies on her side against a pure white background, wearing a light blue gingham spaghetti-strap dress, its hem trimmed with delicate lace and a single emerald bead at the strap. Her shoulder-length black hair frames a fresh, clear face, eyes lowered, gazing softly at the birthday cake before her. The dress's strap has slipped down, baring one breast, the nipple peeking out, her body natural and relaxed. She holds a lighter in one hand, gently bringing the flame to a candle on the cake. The cake is a two-tiered cream confection covered in white frosting, topped with bright red cherries and star-shaped decorations, sitting on a pink round tray atop a transparent glass base. Several thin black candles rise from the cake, a few already lit, their small flames casting warm orange-gold light. Colorful star-shaped confetti in gold, blue, red, and other hues scatters across the white floor and around her dress hem, like festive rain. The shot is taken from a low angle, with a diagonal composition running from the lower left to the upper right, guiding the eye from the cake to her face and hands, then to the blank wall beyond, creating deep perspective. Lighting is soft and even, the main source front-left, illuminating her face and body while leaving a natural shadow on the right. The overall palette is cool—soft blues and whites—creating a fresh, serene atmosphere, while the warm flame and red cherries provide a dramatic warm-cool contrast. The image has a slight film grain, a touch of overexposure, and gentle vignetting at the edges, as if captured by an old camera in an intimate, private birthday moment. The style balances everyday intimacy with artistic stillness, like a nostalgic photograph of real life, full of delicate emotion and appreciation for a beautiful moment.",
