          "prompt": "A young woman squats in the dim backstage area, her long, sleek black hair falling over bare shoulders, her unbuttoned white shirt hanging open to reveal her full, exposed breasts and smooth stomach. A black silk tie is loosely draped around her neck, undone, creating a stark contrast against her pale skin. She rests her chin on her left hand, fingers grazing her jawline, while her right hand lies slack on her knee, a gold watch with a woven band glinting on her wrist. She wears clean white sneakers and ankle socks, legs slightly parted. Her expression is downcast, pensive, with a hint of melancholy. Behind her, a tangled structure of silver-gray scaffolding with yellow warning labels and \"Art Design\" text, industrial cables, an orange wrench, and scattered debris litter the floor. A white electric guitar is propped against the scaffolding. The lighting is cold blue-purple, casting soft shadows across her body. The camera angle is high and slightly tilted, with grainy, amateur-quality texture. The scene feels quiet, intimate, capturing a raw, private moment of exhaustion and solitude after a performance.",
