          "alias": "单女米西装城市忧伤蹲脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches on an outdoor red brick path, wearing only an unbuttoned beige suit jacket and a short black skirt, her black pointed flats kicked off to the side. Her long blonde hair with light brown highlights blows gently in the breeze. She turns sideways to the right, her gaze distant, expression focused and calm. Her hands rest loosely in her lap, revealing a bare chest under the open jacket. A small white bag with pearl trim and purple striped fabric tassels hangs across her shoulder. The foreground is rough red-brown brick with tiny green grass sprouting between the cracks. Midground shows dry, curled yellow grass and low shrubs, with a thick dark pine tree standing center-right, its needles visible. Background: a heavy gray sky, soft diffused light, faint water and sparse vegetation in the distance. Composition uses rule of thirds, her body positioned left third, gaze leading to open right space. Slight overhead angle enhances depth. Lighting is overcast, no harsh shadows. Earth tones dominate: beige, brown, dark green, gray. A quiet, restrained, slightly melancholic atmosphere. The image is detailed, realistic, like a candid photo, balancing everyday life and art. Moderate saturation, soft contrast, realistic style with emotional tension, conveying urban solitude and contemplation.",
