        {
          "id": "krea2-1a3545487e6474f2a46051f6",
          "alias": "单女露胸白衬衫城市媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a winding urban staircase, captured from a high-angle perspective as she tilts her head back, grinning radiantly at the camera with her mouth open, showing white teeth, her bright eyes full of life. Her black hair blows across her face in the breeze, natural and vivid. She's topless, her bare breasts fully exposed, wearing only a white-and-yellow striped shirt unbuttoned and hanging open, paired with blue denim overalls lowered to her hips and white sneakers. Her left hand gently lifts to touch her hair, revealing a simple ring on her ring finger. The overall look is casual and stylish, but with a bold, sensual edge. She dominates the left foreground of the composition. The stairs are deep gray concrete with yellow anti-slip strips on each edge, slightly worn and stained. White metal railings with subtle rust and dirt flank the steps, lending a lived-in feel. The staircase extends into a strong perspective leading to a S-curved street, its surface wet and reflective from recent rain. Multiple cars—red, white, silver sedans and white vans—move orderly along the road, one red car especially eye-catching. Flanking the street are typical Chinese urban buildings: older red-brick residential blocks and beige modern apartments, mixed styles, windows of varied sizes, some balconies with drying laundry. Green trees and shrubs add life. The background layers of buildings rise and fall, creating rich spatial depth. The image is shot with a fisheye lens, giving slight barrel distortion that enhances visual impact and depth. The light is soft and even, overcast or early morning/late afternoon diffuse light, no harsh shadows. Color saturation is moderate with a warm, slightly retro filter, lending a nostalgic, cozy atmosphere. Light and shadow transitions are natural, details crisp from the subject's face to the ground texture. The overall composition is dynamic and full of everyday vitality, as if capturing an ordinary yet joyful moment with an old film camera, brimming with youthful energy and urban life.",
