          "prompt": "A young female barista in a cream long-sleeve shirt unbuttoned to expose her bare breasts, wearing a deep gray apron loosely tied, a vintage khaki cap, standing inside an artsy café, both hands steady holding a black metal tray with three drinks: an iced latte with straw, a caramel macchiato in a clear glass, and a hot drink in a bright yellow ceramic cup with saucer. She gazes directly at the camera with calm, focused eyes, her body slightly turned, relaxed posture, one hand lightly gripping the tray edge, the other stabilizing a corner, exuding professional confidence. The foreground shows clear ice cubes, layered liquids, condensation beads on the glass. Behind, a mottled cement wall with natural cracks and stains, industrial and vintage feel, a black-and-white art poster of pixel sun and clouds reading \"DAELIM MUSEUM\", beside a shelf with neatly stacked books/magazines with yellowed edges. Right side a metal rack with pamphlets and items. Composition centered slightly left, side light from left window casting soft shadows on her face, arms, and tray, warm nostalgic tones in gray, brown, yellow, low saturation, moderate contrast, slight film grain and color shift, vignette edges, quiet and peaceful atmosphere, like a frozen daily moment blending professional precision with inner tenderness. She is topless under the apron, nipples visible through the open shirt.",
