          "prompt": "A young woman sits on dim concrete stairs, topless except for a blue-white striped halter top pulled down to expose her breasts, wearing a sheer white mini skirt that reveals her thighs and panties, black thick-soled combat boots, white ankle socks. Her body leans slightly back, one hand propping her up, the other hanging loose. Head tilted, she stares directly at the camera with deep, distant eyes, bright red lipstick stark against the cool-toned scene. Black wavy hair with bangs partly covers her forehead. Foreground shows rough worn cement steps with cracks and wear marks. Low-angle shot from below, she fills the left-center frame. Background is a narrow interior with peeling paint, stains on the walls, a dark closed door faintly visible on the right. Light from above or side creates strong chiaroscuro, with local highlights and shadows. The moody, ambiguous lighting feels like an old halogen lamp or natural light through cracks. Film grain and slight noise give a vintage aesthetic, low saturation with cool teal-gray tones, warm accents from her lipstick and skin sheen. Details include boot reflections, fabric wrinkles, hair texture, wall scratches and dust. Slight vignette at edges enhances the nostalgic feel. The tight composition blends figure and environment into a gritty urban decadence, capturing a rebellious, free-spirited moment—like a stolen frame from a film, intimate and raw.",
