        {
          "id": "krea2-957c344a3d7d84336471e262",
          "alias": "单女露胸白连衣裙沙发忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman sits topless on a light gray fabric sofa, wearing only a sheer white transparent slip dress that falls open, revealing her bare breasts and nipples. The dress drapes in soft folds, exuding a relaxed, effortless vibe. Her legs are crossed, pose relaxed and elegant, holding a green plush dinosaur toy tied with a red ribbon. She tilts her head slightly to the right, her gaze thoughtful and tender, with clear facial features, fair smooth skin, and delicate natural makeup with pale lips. A simple silver ring and thin chain bracelet adorn her fingers and wrist. Her look balances youthful charm and mature allure. On the left, a decorated Christmas tree glows with small white twinkling lights, warm and bright, accented with red berry ornaments and tiny trinkets, creating a festive atmosphere. The background shows a light beige interior wall with fine texture, a dark gray heavy curtain on the right with deep folds, and a brown cushion or instrument case faintly visible behind the sofa. The composition centers the woman slightly to the right, with the Christmas tree diagonally to the left, creating visual balance and guiding the eye. The foreground includes her legs, hands, and part of the skirt with rich detail; the midground shows her upper body, the plush toy, and the lower part of the tree; the background features the wall, curtain, and distant furniture outlines, with clear depth. Lighting comes from the Christmas tree lights and warm indoor sources, soft and even, cast from the front left, creating natural shadows on her face, arms, and skirt, evoking a cozy, private home atmosphere. The overall color palette is white, beige, and light gray, with green and red accents, harmonious and unified. The image feels like a casual candid shot taken at home with a normal camera, with slight noise and natural blur at edges enhancing realism. The composition isn't overly perfect, retaining everyday spontaneity and truth. Visual leads from the tree's brightness to the woman, then through her gaze outward, sparking imagination. The mood is quiet, warm, filled with festive sweetness and a hint of melancholy, like a winter afternoon sunbeam by the window, evoking a sense of home and inner softness.",
