          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully on the edge of a cream fabric sofa, her black halter dress undone and slipped down, leaving her breasts fully exposed, the broad bow neckline now framing her bare skin. She wears a short black feathered skirt, the feathers fluffy and lifting, and black sheer stockings with cutouts and pearl accents that emphasize her long, curved legs. In her right hand, she holds a small black leather handbag with a gold clasp; her left wrist bears a gold bracelet, hand resting casually on the sofa arm. Her long, jet-black hair falls over her shoulders, face delicate with light makeup, eyes locked on the camera with a confident, sultry stare. Behind her, a modern interior with dark gray textured walls; white display stands hold a terracotta sphere, vintage wooden sandals, a classical plaster head, metal ornaments, and a pair of cream flats on a wooden tray. To the left, a service worker in white shirt and black pants stands with his back to the viewer before a gold-framed mirror that catches part of the scene. The foreground shows the soft cream sofa with matching linen cushions. The shot is medium frame, woman slightly right of center. Lighting is warm and even from indoor sources, creating smooth shadows. The palette is black, white, gray, with gold and cream accents. The image is highly detailed, like a professional photo—fabric folds, feather texture, stocking sheen, metal reflections, natural grain and exposure giving both art and realism, emphasizing the woman's naked elegance and urban confidence.",
