          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙摄影棚媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "An elegant woman sits gracefully on a classic carved wooden chair. She wears a black long-sleeved dress with large pink ruffled trim at the neckline, creating a strong visual contrast. The dress has a high slit on one side, revealing her long, bare thigh and shapely leg. She wears black pointed-toe stiletto heels with metal studs and crossed straps, delicate yet intensely sexy. Her pose is relaxed and natural, legs crossed, one hand lightly resting on the armrest, the other hand placed beside her thigh, drawing attention to the exposed skin. Her hair is slightly wavy, neatly styled up, with a few strands of hair framing her face. Her eyes are lowered, exuding a calm, introspective, and subtly seductive aura. Clear facial contours, flawless makeup, soft lip color, small earrings add detail. She sits on a vintage-style chair with dark red velvet upholstery and gold carved trim. Beside her on the floor is a black velvet handbag with a metal brand logo. The overall composition centers on the figure, captured in a medium shot, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame. The background is a thick dark purple velvet curtain with rich folds and dramatic interplay of light and shadow. On the right, part of a mottled wall is visible, with a grayish tone, forming a cool-warm contrast with the warm light. Light comes from the left side, creating strong chiaroscuro, illuminating the side of her face, arms, legs, and shoes, casting long shadows on the curtain, highlighting three-dimensionality. In the foreground, her legs and the ground create perspective, guiding the eye toward the center. Midground is the figure and chair, background is the curtain and wall, clear layers. Colors are mainly black, purple, red, with gold accents. Overall atmosphere is luxurious, mysterious, and dramatically charged, like a high-end fashion photograph, as if from a private dinner or backstage moment, with cinematic light and shadow storytelling. The image is rich in details, with warm and intense tones, realistic textures, as if shot in a studio with softbox and side lighting, creating delicate skin and fabric rendering. Moderate focal length, controlled depth of field, natural background blur, highlighting the subject. The overall image has strong artistic sense and aesthetic taste, combining the intimacy of everyday life with the ritual of high fashion. Composition is stable yet dynamic, precise lighting use, harmonious color palette, presenting a quiet, sensual, and captivating feminine allure.",
