          "prompt": "A young woman sits outdoors on a yellow folding chair, wearing a black loose coat left open, her white turtleneck sweater pushed down to expose her bare breasts, a short gray plaid skirt riding high on her thighs, and black over-the-knee boots. She elegantly turns sideways to glance back at the camera, one hand gently brushing her hair, expression soft and inviting. Her brown hair falls naturally over her shoulders with straight bangs, makeup subtle, eyes clear. The background is a city street at night, trees lined with dense warm yellow fairy lights creating dreamy bokeh. Soft circular lens flares from the lights. Dark gray cobblestone ground scattered with a few withered leaves. Several identical yellow metal chairs and small round tables around. Blurred pedestrians and modern building silhouettes in the distance. Low-angle shot, subject positioned left of frame, composition layered: foreground sharp yellow chair and her lower body, midground subject and part of the street, background soft-lit trees and city night. Visual lines from the chair and her pose lead into the depth of bokeh. Lighting mainly from the string lights, soft and even, warm amber tones contrasting with her black clothing. Overall warm, serene, urban romantic feel. Shot like a professional night portrait with cinematic quality, rich detail, moderate saturation, slight vignetting, shallow depth of field isolating her while retaining ambient mood. Slight film grain and natural light transitions. Captured with a full-frame camera, large aperture prime lens, ISO 800-1600, shutter around 1/60s, exposure +0.3, daylight white balance, subtle post-processing to enhance realism and artistry.",
