        {
          "id": "krea2-c398fdfa548456a53e7357af",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫办公室媚态坐脱衣（5）",
          "prompt": "A young woman half-sits on the edge of a black office desk, leaning back slightly, her left leg bent with toes touching the ground, right leg extended gracefully, showing off long legs and a slender figure. She wears a white short-sleeve blouse with sleeves rolled up, unbuttoned and hanging open, revealing her bare chest without a bra, exposing her nipples and the curves of her breasts, along with her collarbone and part of her taut stomach. A dark gray high-waisted denim shorts sits low on her hips, accentuating her slim waist and flat belly. Black lace over-the-knee stockings with intricate patterns contrast elegantly with the outfit. Her right hand adjusts her glasses, fingers long, a simple ring on her ring finger. Her gaze drops downward toward the camera, lips slightly parted, expression carrying a mix of laziness and mystery. Her black hair is tied up in a loose messy bun with a few strands falling over her cheeks, adding a carefree, rebellious touch. The background is a plain white wall featuring an art poster with the words \"A Monster\" and a blurred English slogan; below it, the faint outline of black high heels is visible. The composition is a medium shot, the figure positioned center-right, body angled diagonally, creating a dynamic visual flow. On the left foreground, an old white printer or fax machine sits, next to it a coiled phone cord and an open notebook with crisp white paper, edges slightly creased. The desk surface is glossy black, reflecting soft highlights. Lighting is soft and even, from a front-left softbox, creating a bright clean indoor atmosphere with rich shadow transitions. The face, arms, and legs are well-lit, shadows transitioning naturally. Text and patterns on the background wall are slightly blurred due to distance, enhancing spatial depth. The color palette is dominated by white, black, and gray, with small touches of skin tone and metallic sheen. The overall style blends modern urban sophistication with an intimate, candid feel, as if capturing a spontaneous moment in an office corner on an afternoon – a realistic, amateur photography vibe with everyday texture. The scene is detailed but not cluttered, full of narrative and emotional tension, presenting a visual experience that is both fashionable and authentically sensual.",
