        {
          "id": "krea2-2073808a3922420f4232fdf8",
          "alias": "单女红旗袍害羞站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands slightly right of center, wearing a red cheongsam with gold embroidery. Her long hair transitions from dark brown to light blonde, cascading in soft waves over her shoulders, a few strands brushing her face. She poses with a subtle sideways tilt, eyes downcast, lips parted, expression gentle and shy. The cheongsam has a high collar and sleeveless cut, with gold frog buttons and intricate floral patterns across the bodice. The front slit reveals her collarbone, and the fabric is sheer in places, hinting at her bare skin beneath. Her right hand lightly toys with her hair, fingers delicate. The background dissolves into soft red and white bokeh, evoking festive lantern light and abstract shadows. The composition is a close-up, slightly low angle, with warm directional light from the left, highlighting her face and the sheen of the silk. Tones of red, gold, and white dominate, creating an intimate, elegant, and subtly erotic atmosphere. The image has a grainy, film-like quality with soft focus and warm saturation, resembling a vintage portrait imbued with poetic tension and a modern, sensual edge.",
