        {
          "id": "krea2-891b04b533b64a57b8685e00",
          "alias": "单女黑西装博物馆媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a three-quarter profile, wearing a black blazer and high-waist pleated miniskirt, her black shoulder-length hair with slightly curled ends and neat bangs framing her face. She gazes down at her phone, fingers lightly touching the screen, posture elegant and absorbed. The blazer is sharply tailored with a cinched waist and three-button cuffs; underneath, a sheer black bodysuit clings to her torso, leaving her nipples faintly visible. The high-waist pleated skirt flares with motion, edges lifting suggestively, and her long legs are fully exposed as the skirt barely covers her upper thighs. She wears black stiletto heels with ankle straps. She is positioned center-left, facing right, head slightly tilted, eyes lowered, expression focused and serene. The background is a vivid red geometric modular wall; a bright white light source from the left casts a soft halo, while on the right, an orange-red pillar and display shelf hold cosmetic bottles, one labeled \"LORS OF SEOUL.\" The floor is pale reflective tile, showing her mirrored reflection. Medium shot composition, with visual flow from her face down to her legs and then to her phone. Strong chiaroscuro from the left light creates sharp shadows on her right cheek, arm, and leg, while her bare upper chest and side are subtly highlighted. The overall tone is black and red, high contrast, modern and commercial-exhibition chic, as if captured at a luxury brand event. The scene mixes fashion coldness with life’s warmth, a meticulously designed urban portrait of elegant, absorbed sensuality.",
