        {
          "id": "krea2-5c2be5173b879283374eafbf",
          "alias": "单女全裸窗边忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A classical Eastern beauty, nude except for a sheer pink veil draped over her face, her long black hair cascading like ink, adorned with an elaborate silver lotus hair crown studded with rubies and pearls, delicate bead chains and red tassels swaying gently. Her eyes, visible through the translucent veil, gaze left with a mix of melancholy and determination, skin porcelain-smooth. She stands in a graceful three-quarter pose, one hand lifting the edge of the veil, her bare breasts fully exposed, soft side light from a window caressing her curves and creating subtle highlights on her skin and hair. Background softly blurred, hints of wooden lattice and a dark antique desk, shallow depth of field focused on her eyes and crown. Cinematic quality with slight film grain, muted pink, silver, and pale gray tones accented by red, evoking a dreamy, sensual Eastern aesthetic.",
