          "id": "krea2-b1e274946b29cabf194083af",
          "alias": "单女露胸海报媚态阅读",
          "prompt": "Close-up portrait of a young woman with deep black hair and bright brown eyes, her gaze calm and powerful, right hand gently touching her cheek, silver-glitter nail polish catching the light, a few strands of hair falling naturally across her face. She is topless, her bare skin warm and smooth, wearing only a black chain necklace that accentuates her collarbone and the swell of her breasts, the nipples slightly visible beneath soft shadows. The composition is a near vertical close-up, centered slightly left, with the black background creating stark contrast. Text at top reads “VOGUE” in large white sans-serif, below it “KOREA”, to the right “NOT JUST A VOICE - THE VOICE”, bottom left has “LEADER. VOCALIST. POWERHOUSE HAEWON” in white uppercase, followed by a short English description. Lighting comes from the front-left, soft and layered, illuminating her face, bare chest, and hands, with subtle transitions into shadow, enhancing volume and sensuality. The mood is elegant yet raw, confident and unapologetic. The palette is monochrome with warm skin tones and a hint of red on the lips. The image has a slight film grain and natural lens flare, like a high-quality editorial shot. A barcode in the lower-right corner reinforces the magazine cover aesthetic. The entire scene fuses fashion, music, and personal magnetism, evoking a staged celebrity interview or album promotional portrait, deeply intimate and visually striking.",
