        {
          "id": "krea2-be48e8020c5f825dfb0c3a7f",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑外套城市忧伤站立交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a Parisian balcony, topless under a black leather jacket left open, her gray blazer and cream ruffled inner discarded, black shorts and high black boots on. She lounges lazily against the black wrought-iron railing, long wavy hair falling naturally, eyes slightly dazed and fixed on the lens. In the foreground, a pot of colorful wildflowers—blue hydrangeas, orange irises, and tiny yellow blossoms—bursts with green leaves, adding vibrant romance. Beyond, classic Parisian buildings with gray-brown stone walls, dark gray mansard roofs, and neat dormer windows stretch into the distance; more roofs and chimneys fade into a overcast gray-white sky. Soft, even light creates no harsh shadows, evoking a quiet, melancholic mood. Composition follows the rule of thirds: she is left-center, a visual anchor, with the railing’s verticals contrasting the building’s horizontals. She tilts slightly, legs crossed, natural and dynamic. A wooden bench and metal-frame table and chairs are partially visible in the midground. The palette is gray, black, white, with bright floral accents. The image resembles a high-end camera shot—crisp details, controlled grain, cinematic storytelling—capturing a moment before the afternoon sun fully rises, exuding urban poetic solitude like a classic French new-wave frame, realistic and full of narrative.",
