        {
          "id": "krea2-4d2dcdbb2f4c9180d14a6d39",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫摄影棚沉思倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman leans sideways against a white table, her slightly wrinkled white striped shirt unbuttoned and hanging open, sleeves rolled to elbows, revealing her bare chest and smooth skin. She wears a tight black miniskirt and black stockings, her long hair falling naturally, thin-rimmed glasses on her nose with red lips and light nails. Her right hand holds a silver pen-like object, left hand on the table, body slightly forward, gaze down with contemplative focus. The composition is mid-shot left, dynamic S-curve. In foreground: white table edge, a dark brown crocodile-leather handbag, strap hanging, a scattered black-and-white photo. Midground aside from her: a white marble male head sculpture on beige cloth-covered plinth. Background: rough cement wall with stains, a long fluorescent tube overhead emitting cold white light, black ceiling with exposed red fire pipes and black electrical conduits. Left side: a white bulletin board with a retro newspaper-style poster reading \"DETECTIVE NEWS UNALLOYD 17 WINTER OPEN!\" and \"Be a reader\", \"Reading Club book\", and a small security camera. Overall scene: industrial art studio vibe, lighting from overhead fluorescent creating strong chiaroscuro, shadows on her back and floor, cool and mysterious atmosphere. Color palette: black, white, gray with accents of red, brown, skin tone. Visual flow from face down to hands and table items. Tight, layered composition. Shot simulates amateur real-camera effect with slight noise and color shift, capturing a candid moment. Mood: modern urban fashion meets quiet artistic space, private and restrained emotion, like an afternoon in a café or art studio, a natural life fragment. Full of story and detail tension, strong visual appeal and emotional resonance.",
