        {
          "id": "krea2-be77744c2144d92ff35b3113",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙桌边微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a low wooden table in a Japanese izakaya, her shoulder-length dark brown hair falling around her face, round wire-rimmed glasses perched on her nose. She beams a radiant, genuine smile, eyes crinkling into crescents, lips parted to show white teeth, cheeks flushed with joy. She wears only a loosely unbuttoned white dress shirt, revealing a black lace bra and the generous swell of her bare cleavage; the shirt falls open, exposing her smooth skin. Her left hand rests lightly on the tabletop, while her right hand holds a glass of golden beer, foam delicate and liquid clear, raising it in a toast directly at the camera. Her posture is relaxed and inviting. On the table sit several Japanese dishes—a sashimi platter in a blue-and-white ceramic bowl, vibrant red, orange, and green accents; a plate of fresh green vegetables; a small dish of condiments; an empty bowl. A dark glass beer bottle stands at the corner, its label slightly blurred but realistic. The table is unfinished wood, lightly worn with natural grain. She sits cross-legged on a tatami mat, wearing dark pants and red socks; a light gray cloth bag rests beside her feet. The background is a typical Japanese restaurant interior: cream-colored walls, an old CRT TV playing a blurry show, a round wall clock showing afternoon time, a sheet of Japanese text (maybe a menu or notice) taped to the wall, and a shelf of bottles and jars visible on the right. Strong depth of field. The composition uses a low-angle shot, camera near the floor shooting upward from beneath the table, making the woman the prominent, approachable focus. The foreground shows the table and food, the midground holds her figure, while the background gradually blurs, creating natural visual flow from the table to her face and then to the environment. Warm yellow indoor light pours from the upper left, casting bright highlights on her face and the table, with soft shadows easing into the darker areas. The overall mood is cozy, nostalgic, and lived-in. The palette leans warm—browns, creams, pale beige—with a slight film-grain texture, moderate saturation, and a vintage filter effect. Rich details, her expression vivid and natural, the scene feels like a candid, precious everyday moment captured by an amateur camera, full of warmth and story.",
          "description": "",
