          "id": "krea2-09564a751805964d5326a915",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙街道媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a city street at night, her golden curls catching the warm amber glow of streetlights, strands lightly brushing her cheeks, adding a lazy, seductive air. She wears a sleek, bright red sleeveless dress that hugs her curves like a second skin—low-cut, with a high neckline that frames her collarbone and the swell of her breasts, the shiny fabric rippling with every subtle movement. Her makeup is sharp: dark eyeliner and smoky shadow make her eyes intense and inviting, while deep wine-red lips part slightly, glistening, as if holding back a secret promise. She turns her body just enough to emphasize her silhouette, one hand resting lazily on her hip, the other hanging loose, confident and alluring. The shallow depth of field blurs the bustling city background into warm bokeh, with neon strips tracing the architecture beyond. The light falls from above, casting soft shadows across her face, hair, and the tempting curve of her neck and cleavage. The mood is intimate, cinematic, and powerfully sensual—like a high-end fashion shoot caught in a candid, late-night moment.",
