        {
          "id": "krea2-6a42d9a67a09c26357da3074",
          "alias": "单女湿身黑外套街道叛逆站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a fusion of futuristic and street culture, her short hair with blunt bangs, the tips dyed vivid purple, eyes sharp and deep, staring directly at the lens, expression calm with a hint of defiance, lips slightly parted, revealing a rebellious personality. She wears a glossy black leather jacket draped off her shoulders, leaving her torso mostly bare except for a skimpy white tank top that barely covers her chest, black high-waist denim shorts with frayed hem details, and black stiletto heels with metal zippers and decorative buckles. Her left hand hangs naturally, right hand resting on a stack of blue plastic crates behind her, posture relaxed yet powerful. In the foreground left, industrial blue crates are piled, with yellow and white text reading \"PRINCIPALITY OF ZEON\", \"MARINE TRANSPORTATION FLEET\", \"CAUTION\", plus \"E-A-F\" and \"SBL\" labels. One crate top holds a brightly colored racing helmet in orange, black, and white, with \"RACING\" and \"SBL\" on the side, its glossy surface reflecting a high-tech gleam. The background is a diamond-mesh wire fence, soaked in purple-blue neon light that streams through the grid, creating dappled shadows. A red glowing sign with white letters \"Sup\" hangs on the wall, partially obscured but prominent, beneath which a horizontal LED strip emits cold white light. In the upper left corner, green vines hang, their leaves turning dark red under the purple light, adding a wild contrast. The composition is centered with the figure slightly right of center, focus on her face and half-naked upper body, camera slightly low-angle to enhance her presence. Dramatic lighting from rear and side neon lights creates strong chiaroscuro, her silhouette outlined in purple and blue, skin reflecting a soft sheen, shadows blending into the environment. The atmosphere is cyberpunk urban nightlife, modern yet retro, dynamic and mysterious. Color palette is dark blue, purple, black with accents of orange-red and white, high saturation, strong contrast, rich layers, realistic textures: glossy leather, cold metal zippers, matte plastic crates, smooth helmet coating, wet leaves. The scene is still but tense, like a freeze-frame before an explosion, a cinematic character close-up with strong narrative and visual impact.",
