          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙舞台媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her long, jet-black hair cascading over her shoulders, strands brushing her face with a lazy, sensual grace. Her skin is fair and flawless, features sharp and alluring—smoky eye makeup, thick lashes, a deep, hypnotic gaze that pierces the lens, and bold red lips contrasting the cool tones. She wears a small headset, indicating a live performance or recording. Her body is bare except for a single-shouldered black leather dress that has fallen open, revealing her full breasts, nipples taut against the air. The dress’s crumpled leather clings to her waist and hips, emphasizing her curves, and she wears long matching leather gloves from wrist to elbow, scuffed and wrinkled from use. Her stance is confident and relaxed—hips slightly angled, head tilted, right hand hanging loose, left hand brushing the hem of the dress, which rides high on her thighs. Behind her, a dim stage with gray walls and hanging lights casts soft blue-white glow, creating blurred reflections on the floor. Medium shot, from chest to knees, slight low angle, making her appear taller and more commanding. Lighting from front and above falls on her face and torso, highlighting the glossy leather and bare skin, with deep shadows accentuating every line. The atmosphere is tense and intimate—a mix of theatrical glamour and raw, private vulnerability. Tones are stark black, white, gray, punctuated by her red lips. The image feels both cinematic and candid, with subtle grain and motion blur adding realism.",
