          "prompt": "A young Asian woman kneels naked on a white inflatable paddleboard, her long black hair damp and tousled, skin glistening with water and sunlight. She smiles leisurely, eyes locked on the camera, lips parted as if about to speak or breathe softly. She is completely nude, her bare breasts exposed, nipples visible, her body relaxed and open. She holds a black double-sided paddle with both hands, grip firm but casual, the blade crossing her torso diagonally from upper left to lower right. Her thighs press against the board, water droplets clinging to her skin. The paddleboard surface has brown anti-slip pads and blue circular anchors, with an orange buoyancy aid tied by black rope on the left. The water is emerald green, shimmering with ripples and bright highlights. In the distance, calm sea meets pale blue sky with a clear horizon, thin white clouds near the edge. Low-angle shot, subject centered slightly above, broad background emphasizing movement and space. Bright natural daylight from upper right, soft shadows, high saturation in blue, green, white, and orange. Realistic texture, water beads on hair and skin, reflections on board, depth in layered sea tones. Style like amateur camera capture, authentic and travel-documentary, but with artistic composition and light. Clean composition, no distractions, focus on the subject's freedom and closeness to nature, conveying a relaxed, sensual summer vibe. The feeling of sea breeze and sun warmth is tangible.",
