          "prompt": "A young woman stands beneath a metal scaffolding, her long golden-blonde hair cascading in soft waves over her shoulders, with some strands curling naturally across her chest, the color blending from warm gold to brown, glossy and reflective. Her makeup is bold and sensual: sharp eyeliner, thick lashes, smoky shadow, bright eyes catching the light, full lips painted with vivid red lipstick, slightly parted in a confident, teasing smile. Her skin is pale and smooth, with defined cheekbones, a straight nose, and a sharp jawline. She wears a tight red dress with a cinched waist, the fabric clinging to her curves, revealing deep cleavage through a low neckline trimmed with delicate black lace, the lace extending to the cuffs. A black bow sits symmetrically at the center of her chest, and vertical black straps run from her waist down to her thighs. One of the straps is slightly loose, hinting at easy removal. Her right hand is raised, fingers curled, nails painted pink with tiny white flowers, a silver bracelet on her wrist. Her left hand rests on her hip, fingertips grazing the hem of the dress, which has ridden up to expose the top of her thigh. The background is an industrial metal scaffolding of silver-gray tubes with slight rust and wear, forming a grid, secured with bolts. Hanging from the tubes are several red heart-shaped balloons, glossy and metallic, reflecting bright highlights. Behind her is a light gray cement wall with fine cracks and stains, a blue louvered vent in the corner. The floor is gray cement, dusty and scratched. The composition is low-angle, the woman positioned slightly right of center, her head tilted, eyes locked directly on the viewer, creating an intimate, provocative gaze. Some red balloons and scaffolding bars intrude into the foreground, adding depth. Lighting is warm, coming from the right, casting soft highlights on her face and body, with natural shadows enhancing her curves. The contrast is strong between the red