          "prompt": "A young woman crouches on dark hardwood floors, her long blonde hair cascading naturally, strands gleaming softly in candlelight. She wears a black spaghetti-strap top and pale pink shorts, with white strappy heeled sandals, one hand elegantly supporting her chin as she gazes directly at the lens—a look of languid contemplation, lips slightly parted, makeup refined with metallic shimmer eyeshadow. In the foreground stands an ornate silver vintage candelabra with three burning white candles, flames flickering, casting warm orange-gold light. The candelabra features intricate curling ornaments and浮雕 details with subtle patina, creating an antique elegance. The candlelight forms soft halos in the air, illuminating her face and body while casting long shadows on the floor. In the midground, behind her, white wainscoting rises to vintage floral wallpaper in beige with repeated floral or geometric motifs, slightly worn for nostalgia. On the right, a black wrought-iron shelf holds another candleholder and blurred items, with distant stairs and a door faintly visible, light entering from behind creating subtle chiaroscuro. Shot from a low angle, the candelabra is centered in the lower frame, the woman positioned slightly right, creating visual focus leading from the glowing candles upward to her face. Candlelight is the primary source, creating strong contrasts concentrated on her face, hands, and the candelabra, while the rest fades into shadow. The atmosphere is warm, intimate, and mysterious, steeped in vintage romance. Tones: warm yellow, cream white, deep brown, with silver and black accents. The overall texture appears as if shot on old film, with slight grain and color shifts—a story-laden old photograph. The setting suggests an aged interior—perhaps an old apartment or vintage restaurant—refined but not lavish, rich in detail, with layered light and shadow. The scene is quiet, emotionally charged, radiating a sense of solitary yet captivating artistry.",
