          "prompt": "A futuristic female ninja warrior in a sleek black leather and metal combat suit, her short wavy black hair framing a sharp, focused face with pale skin, a slight pout, and intense eyes. She wears a tight black bodysuit with gold geometric armor plates on shoulders and chest, a wide white cloth belt with frayed edges, and layered white bandages partially torn from her arms, revealing bare skin. Her right hand is encased in a complex gold metal gauntlet with spiked knuckles, while her left hand grips a glowing jade-green lightsaber blade, its energy trailing a bright green arc across the frame from lower left to upper right. Her body is twisted in a dynamic combat stance, left leg forward, right back, weight shifted, muscles defined. She wears high-cut black shorts with metal rings and leather straps, and a large circular metallic device on her back reflects ambient light. The composition is a medium close-up against a pure black background, with dramatic lighting from the left, creating soft shadows and highlighting her face, arms, and the blade. The green light contrasts with gold accents, evoking a tense, mysterious atmosphere. The image has high artistic and cinematic quality with detailed textures (leather wrinkles, metal reflections, bandage fibers) and slight imperfections (lens blur, subtle grain, soft bokeh) for a hybrid digital-realistic look. Colors are black, gold, and green. The subject exudes calm power, blending Eastern warrior aesthetics with futuristic tech. The prompt is NSFW: the torn bandages expose skin, the tight suit accentuates curves, and the pose is sensually dynamic.",
