          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙害羞跪",
          "prompt": "A young female figure skater kneels on the pristine white ice, wearing a revealing deep pink rhinestone-studded competition dress with puffy sheer sleeves and a plunging neckline that barely contains her breasts, the bodice embroidered with floral patterns and sparkling sequins, the short multilayered tulle skirt riding up to expose her bare thighs and the edge of a lace thong. Her long beige gloves cover her hands as she presses her fingertips against her flushed cheeks, tears shimmering in her eyes, looking down at the ice with a mix of shame and erotic vulnerability. Her right knee rests on the ice, left leg bent for support, white skate boots tightly laced. The background is a blurred indoor rink with faint red and blue boards. Medium shot, slightly tilted angle, lighting from above highlights her curves and the slick ice surface, creating a dramatic, sensual contrast between cold white ice and warm pink fabric. The scene captures a moment of intense emotional and physical exposure, both fragile and arousing.",
