          "alias": "单女露胸粉毛衣媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the corner of a pure white wall, leaning slightly against it with her body tilted. Her long black hair cascades down, strands gently blowing in the breeze. She is topless, wearing only the pink short-sleeved knit cardigan unbuttoned, leaving her breasts fully exposed and nipples visible. The cardigan hangs open, three black buttons undone, ribbed cuffs at the sleeves. She pairs it with a high-waist black A-line mini skirt, hem crisp and clean, and black strappy high-heeled sandals with thin stiletto heels, her overall look stylish and provocative. She crosses her arms under her chest, right hand resting on her left arm, left hand placed on her right knee above the skirt, legs crossed with her right leg lifted, toes pointing to the ground, pose both relaxed and confident. Her face is calm and focused, eyes looking directly at the lens, lips painted with soft coral lipstick, makeup refined and natural, eyebrows clearly shaped, eyeliner outlining her eyes, lashes thick and curled. Small gold hoop earrings at her ears, detail refined. Background is a minimal outdoor scene, light gray concrete floor, a few blurred steps in the distance, sky bright gray-white, soft even lighting with no harsh shadows. Composition is slightly diagonal with the subject right of center, filling the frame, the wall creating strong geometric lines leading the eye to her body. Foreground shows her full figure and clothing details, midground the space between wall and her, background blurred environmental elements. Soft even light, clean bright modern atmosphere. Tones white, pink, black, high contrast but not harsh. Overall fresh natural feel, high-end fashion aesthetic, fine image texture, realistic skin texture, natural fabric folds, as if shot with a professional camera with a slight film grain. Moderate focal length, precise depth of field, subject sharp while preserving background depth. The image conveys urban female independence and composure, artistic beauty and everyday life, style modern fashion portrait, strong visual appeal and emotional resonance.",
