          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an outdoor street-style scene, topless, her bare chest exposed, wearing only an olive green high-waist half-skirt with a white string-tie belt at her waist, a blue-green geometric scarf loosely knotted around her neck, and a thick chain necklace. Her long hair is pulled back into a sleek low ponytail, makeup refined with a natural look, eyes staring directly at the camera with a calm, confident expression, lips slightly parted in a lazy, sensual fashion. In her right hand she holds a brown suede-textured handbag with metal buckle details and layered pleats, her left hand hangs naturally, nails painted deep red. Her body is slightly turned but her head faces the lens, creating direct eye contact. The foreground places her slightly left of center, medium-shot framing highlighting her upper body and bare chest, background is a blurred city street with cobblestones, silhouettes of passersby, and a distant photographer holding a camera. Natural daylight from the upper right casts clear shadows, creating contrast and realistic outdoor lighting. The overall palette is white, brown, green with blue and orange accents, high-fashion photography quality, sharp details on skin texture, fabric folds, leather sheen, and hair smoothness. The atmosphere is cool, elegant yet sensual, like a candid street-style capture of a fashion week moment, full of narrative and contemporary edge.",
