        {
          "id": "krea2-836c4d58ebb70a3de884a46a",
          "alias": "单女露胸白T恤街道媚态站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands beside a yellow gas pump at a sunlit gas station, wearing a sheer white cropped tank top that barely conceals her bare breasts, her nipples visible through the damp fabric, paired with a tight black leather pleated miniskirt that rides high on her hips, exposing her toned midriff and the curve of her thighs clad in nude pantyhose. Her long black hair falls in loose waves, catching the midday light, and she gazes at the lens with a soft, inviting smirk, her eyes half-lidded with a lazy sensuality. A silver chain bracelet dangles from her left wrist, while a black leather cuff wraps her right forearm. She holds a bright yellow plastic bucket by its handle—the bucket marked with a bold triangular warning sticker and “ATTENTION,” filled to the brim with clear liquid, its glossy surface reflecting the surrounding scene. Her body leans slightly to one side, one foot forward, accentuating the curve of her hip and the long line of her legs. The foreground is dominated by the vivid yellow bucket, occupying the lower third of the frame. The woman anchors the center-left, her sheer top and exposed skin drawing the eye. Behind her, a gray metal roll-up door is plastered with colorful but faded “AJAX” posters. The gas pump reads “3 Regular” and “Quality Fuels,” with visible wear and a yellow hose hanging beside it. The scene is bathed in harsh noon sunlight, casting deep shadows from the right, highlighting the texture of her clothes, the gloss of her legs, and the rough asphalt with its cracks and oil stains. The composition centers her, guiding the eye from the bucket up to her face, then to the advertising and architectural background. The color palette is yellow, white, black, with muted grays and saturated poster hues. The image has a high-resolution, film-grain quality, blending everyday street realism with a staged, cinematic sexiness—a quiet, charged moment of mundane beauty made provocative.",
