        {
          "id": "krea2-7411fcb3d5102118389149a0",
          "alias": "单女红旗袍城市媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a revealing red floral cheongsam, the high slit pulled open to expose her toned bare thighs, sits back on a vintage wooden rocking chair. Her right hand lazily grips the chair's chain, while her left hand holds a black peacock feather fan tipped with vivid emerald and gold eyes. She gazes into the camera with a soft, confident smirk, lips slightly parted. Her black hair is styled in an elegant updo, small earrings glint. She wears white strappy stiletto heels that accentuate her arched feet and slender ankles. The cheongsam is loosely fitted, hinting at her curves; the top buttons are undone, showing a hint of cleavage. The scene is a dim room with aged dark wooden floorboards, the rocking chair is carved with traditional Chinese lattice patterns, a cream velvet cushion with subtle creases beside her. Through a window, blurry city skyline at dusk, soft gray light. The composition places her slightly right, body in an S-curve, legs crossed and extending to the right, camera looking down slightly. Side rear lighting casts warm highlights on her face and the cheongsam's red floral fabric, with soft shadows on the floor and chair. The color palette is warm red, dark brown wood, black fan feathers, creating a luxurious, private, and subtly erotic atmosphere—a captured moment of quiet, sensual elegance with a modern edge.",
