          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a marble bench, her white long-sleeved shirt unbuttoned to reveal a black lace bralette and cleavage, paired with a black sleeveless dress featuring asymmetrical hem and waist pleats. She crosses her legs, right over left, wearing open-toe bright red patent leather stiletto heels. In her hand, she holds a small black quilted handbag with gold chain and hardware. She wears layered necklaces—a pearl strand and a thin gold chain—with simple drop earrings. Her dark hair falls naturally with straight bangs, and she stares directly at the camera with confident, seductive eyes. Makeup is flawless with nude pink lips and smooth pale skin. The background is a modern interior with white marble walls veined in gray, a hexagonal honeycomb brass mosaic tile panel on the left reflecting warm light, and a double spherical milk-glass wall lamp on the right emitting soft yellow glow. The marble floor has subtle seams. Composition is medium shot, woman centered slightly right, body leaning back with a relaxed yet provocative pose, bench lines leading to lower left. Lighting is soft and layered from the lamp and ambient light, emphasizing facial features and clothing details with natural shadows. Overall tone is black-and-white with pops of red and gold, high contrast yet harmonious, exuding a sophisticated, cool elegance with a sensual edge, like a high-fashion editorial shot with lifelike texture.",
