        {
          "id": "krea2-fa0e0e297269d6bc9f3075a5",
          "alias": "单女露胸艺伎红和服节庆神秘站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an elaborate Japanese festival cosplay, topless, her pale skin exposed, wearing only a deep blue obi and delicate red-and-gold cords supporting a circular sand-filled charm with white tassels and small bells. Her headdress is a red-and-white fox mask with gold patterns and red flower ornaments, black-tipped ears rising above. Dark hair falls in straight bangs over her forehead; her face bears a subtle geisha-style makeup with clear eyeliner, soft lips, and two small red dots on her cheeks. Her eyes are gentle yet mysterious, gaze slightly averted. She stands in a graceful contrapposto, one gloved hand resting lightly on her chin, the other hanging loosely at her side. The semi-transparent sheer silk sleeves trimmed with lace cascade off her shoulders, framing her bare upper body. She wears a deep red kimono-style skirt studded with gold and blue floral motifs, the fabric pooling at the floor. The background is a festive Eastern traditional space filled with hundreds of red orb-shaped lanterns glowing warm orange, each topped with gold tassels and intricate patterns. Dense rows of long red bead curtains hang from the ceiling, embedded with tiny sparkling lights, creating a flowing, dreamlike effect of light and shadow. The composition centers her, framed by front bead curtains that guide the eye inward. Lighting is soft and warm, emanating from lanterns and bead lights, casting subtle high-contrast shadows on her face and body, enhancing the volume. The scene is vivid, saturated, and richly detailed, blending traditional and modern, realistic and fantastical, with no watermarks—a professional yet candid feel.",
