        {
          "id": "krea2-6da896d44366228ea22d2792",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝毛衣咖啡厅媚态坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on an aged white wooden bench outdoors, her long dark brown wavy hair falling loosely over bare shoulders. She wears a blue-and-green striped knit beanie with cat ears, a white tag reading \"LOVERBOY\" in red. Her body is topless, the soft white lace dress slipped down and bunched at her waist, revealing her full breasts and erect nipples. A loose dark gray coat hangs off one shoulder, exposing her bare skin. A thin silver necklace rests at her collarbone. She wears beige platform ankle boots with wrinkled leather. Her legs are closed, a black handbag resting on her knees. She leans slightly to the side, her gaze calm and sensual toward the camera, lips slightly parted. Sunlight streams from the right, casting strong shadows across her skin, the bench, and her clothing. In the background, a café window reflects urban high-rises and leafless trees; a sign reads \"WE LOVE DOGS (a bunch) UNFORTUNATELY WE CAN'T HOST THEM IN OUR CAFE WOOF WOOF!\" with a dog sketch. A potted plant with long leaves sits beside the bench, partially shaded. The shot is medium, slightly overhead, with warm golden light, soft lens flare, and a natural grain, evoking a candid street photograph—intimate, serene, and explicitly nude from the waist up.",
