        {
          "id": "krea2-a2e6d51c38d3aea9f26e7759",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙街道困倦站立阅读（2）",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long black hair and a simple white headband stands before a living green wall on a city street. She wears a black sleeveless dress with white polka dots, a deep V-neck trimmed with white lace and ribbon ties, the bodice revealing a generous amount of cleavage and the outline of her nipples through the sheer lace. The dress is open to the navel, held together by loose black buttons that barely meet. Her makeup is flawless—sharp eyeliner, soft pink lips. She holds a coffee cup in her right hand, left hand resting at her side, a light gray purse slung over her shoulder. She stands slightly sideways, gazing into the camera with a warm, confident look that hints at sleepy seduction. Behind her, the green wall is dense with pine needles and a few brown pinecones; to the right, a shop window displays a red abstract sculpture, a beige lamp, stacked books, and a vintage speaker, with a pink neon sign reading “New” glowing softly. The natural light comes from front-right, softly highlighting her face and the curve of her chest. The scene feels like a candid moment in an urban café district, shot with a 50mm lens at close range, with shallow depth of field blurring the background slightly. The overall tone is artistic, sensual, and intimate—a slice of youthful city life with a NSFW edge.",
