          "alias": "单女露胸白衬衫公园微笑站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a park path, her white sleeveless button-up shirt undone and hanging open, revealing her bare breasts, with an olive green suede skirt hugging her hips, brown snakeskin high heels, and black hair tied in a low ponytail. She turns to look back over her shoulder, her body slightly tilted, a soft, knowing smile on her lips, eyes warm and inviting. In the foreground, two rows of dark green metal benches show wear and peeling paint, scattered with dry leaves and small debris on the gravel path. Midground: lush lawn and flowering yellow forsythia bushes. Background: a classic Parisian building with cream walls, white trim, dark gray roof, ornate balcony railings, and tall trees, some bare, some budding. Sky layered with thick blue-white clouds. Light from upper left casts soft side-backlighting, creating dappled shadows on her skin and the ground. Composition follows rule of thirds—she is left-center, looking right. Slight downward camera angle for a natural feel. Color palette: natural greens, warm browns, soft grays. The scene exudes a quiet, sensual afternoon atmosphere, like a candid photo captured in natural outdoor light, rich in detail and texture, blending urban elegance with a gentle, erotic tension.",
