        {
          "id": "krea2-c1f98ea669b4f32d9352dc14",
          "alias": "单女半褪黑连衣裙庭院困倦躺展示",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies prone on a pale beige stone-tiled courtyard floor, wearing a tight black short-sleeve dress with ruffled collar and cuffs that clings to her curves, paired with black platform boots and black fishnet stockings that dig into her thighs. Her hair is piled into a messy bun with stray strands falling across her forehead and cheek; she turns her face toward the left, eyes half-lidded and dreamy, lips slightly parted, showcasing clear jawline, fair skin, straight nose, and small earrings. Her hands are folded before her, fingers long with red nail polish, a tiny tattoo visible on her wrist. Her body is slightly curled, knees bent, legs naturally extended, the pose languid and relaxed, with her dress riding up slightly to reveal the tops of her stockings and the hint of bare skin above. In the foreground, her body and arms fill the lower frame. Midground features a white stone railing and a classical marble statue of a semi-nude male figure—defined muscles, elegant posture—standing on a plinth surrounded by dense trimmed green shrubbery with layered leaves. Background includes a thick white column with subtle texture on the left, more greenery and structures beyond. Low-angle shot from near ground level, creating depth from the tiled floor to railing and statue to column. Soft, bright sunlight from upper right casts clear shadows on her skin and the ground, creating highlights on her curves and the statue’s contours. Monochrome palette accented by green foliage and red nails, with realistic texture on stone joints, water stains, carved details, leaf veins, and fabric wrinkles. Composition is balanced, subject slightly right, leaving breathing space on the left, evoking a quiet melancholic eroticism.",
