        {
          "id": "krea2-581452e0cef285d5fbba7740",
          "alias": "单女露胸灰连体衣城市媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands by a metal railing on an urban viaduct, her soft golden hair cascading over bare shoulders, strands brushing her cheek. She wears nothing but a sheer gray jumpsuit, unzipped to reveal her bare breasts and toned stomach, the fabric clinging to her hips. One hand holds a small white object near her lips, the other rests on the railing. Her head is slightly lowered, eyes half-lidded, with a subtle, knowing smirk. Large round metal earrings catch the light. Behind her, Bangkok's high-rises and Thai signage stretch into a clear blue sky, wires and cars below. Soft afternoon sunlight from the upper right creates sharp shadows on her skin, highlighting her curves. The composition is medium shot, her figure dominant left-center, with the railing leading the eye into the urban depth. The scene feels candid, like a stolen moment, with natural grain and gentle lens distortion, exuding quiet sensuality and urban solitude.",
