          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a wooden bench in a cafe, her beige oversized blazer hanging open, revealing her bare breasts, a light floral slip dress pushed down to her hips, nude thigh-high stockings, legs crossed, elegant and relaxed, right hand cradling her chin, a silver ring on her finger, eyes fixed on the camera with a contemplative, lazy gaze, brown wavy hair falling softly in glossy strands. To her left is a wooden tabletop with white square tiles, natural grain and slight wear, a corner slightly lifted. Background is a light beige wall with fine texture and subtle shadow, a pale yellow cabinet door visible at the corner. On the floor to the right sits a black leather backpack, clean lines, metal hardware and adjustable straps, smooth surface reflecting faint light. Indoor warm lighting from the upper left creates soft chiaroscuro, even light on her face and body, shadows falling to the right and behind, a cozy atmosphere. Medium shot, subject positioned right of center, left hand resting on the table edge, right hand under chin, body slightly leaning forward forming a stable triangular composition. Foreground shows a close-up of the table surface highlighting material detail, midground holds the subject and backpack, background the wall and cabinet, clear layering, visual lines leading from the table edge to the subject, then through her gaze toward the viewer, enhancing interaction. Light source from the left front produces natural highlights and shadows, giving strong three-dimensionality, with bounce light from floor and wall adding spatial depth. Color palette of beige, light brown, and black, harmonious and unified, evoking a quiet, daily yet refined life, like a real, still moment in an afternoon cafe, strong documentary feel and lifestyle aesthetic, image quality akin to a professional camera shot, rich detail, controlled noise, a soft film-like grain, clean composition with no distracting elements, emphasizing the subject's mood and environmental authenticity, balanced with ample negative space for breathing room, delicate light treatment, natural contrast preserving detail while creating a warm ambiance. Overall style leans toward modern urban women's daily wear and life documentation, blending fashion with approachability, suitable for social media sharing or fashion magazine spreads.",
