          "prompt": "A silver-haired young woman in a semi-undone Gothic Lolita outfit sits on stark white concrete stairs. Her wide-brimmed hat adorned with green flowers and white feathers is tilted back, her silver hair cascading over bare shoulders. She wears a gray sleeveless dress, the bodice partially unbuttoned to reveal her breasts, with a black ruffled bolero jacket hanging open. Lace and bows edge the collar and cuffs, while the skirt hem is trimmed with fluffy white feathers. Black striped stockings climb her long legs, ending in black pointed-toe high heels. She lounges lazily, one hand on the step, the other resting on her thigh, body leaning forward, gaze directly at the lens with a melancholic expression. Strong backlight from above creates a dramatic silhouette, with soft halos around her skin and hair. Two blurred bird shapes are faint in the background. Low-angle shot, slightly out of focus, with film grain and desaturated cool tones—gray, white, black. The scene feels like a cinematic moment of lonely elegance, a solitary figure in an abandoned stairwell, half undressed, caught in a moment of silent waiting or farewell.",
