          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a city railway pedestrian bridge, turning back to look over her shoulder, her long black wavy hair falling naturally and lifting gently in the breeze. She is completely topless, her firm bare breasts exposed, nipples slightly erect against the cool air. She wears only a pair of cream-white high-waist faux leather shorts that hug her hips, the smooth material catching a soft sheen. Her right leg is slightly raised, revealing her bare ankle, and she wears white chunky heeled mules. Her hands are loosely clasped in front of her, one hand resting just below the other, fingers intertwined, her posture conveying a mix of shyness and quiet confidence. Her gaze is lowered, expression serene and focused. She occupies the right third of the frame. The foreground is a tiled pedestrian walkway in gray, brown, and pink squares with yellow tactile strips. The midground shows the bridge's metal structure, curved canopy supports, clear glass railings, and a wire mesh fence; beyond are two parallel train tracks on gravel, receding into the distance. The background is a dense cityscape of aging residential buildings in beige and gray, windows lined with air conditioning units, scattered greenery. The sky is overcast, casting a soft, even light with no harsh shadows. The composition uses diagonal perspective, drawing the eye along the tracks and bridge structure. The overall color palette is cool—grays, whites, creams—with warm accents from the tiles and distant ochre buildings. The image has a realistic, amateur photo style with slight grain and natural color rendering, capturing an intimate, quiet urban moment.",
