          "alias": "单女浴袍户外沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a flowing light-blue Hanfu stands center frame, her outer robe partially slipped off her shoulders to reveal a sheer orange-red inner robe and the curve of her bared breasts. The robe's delicate embroidery and white brocade trim frame her skin; a deep brown woven belt cinches her waist, from which hangs a tasseled jade-and-coral waist ornament. Her black hair is piled high, adorned with blue-and-white butterfly hairpins and silver tassel earrings. She holds a sheaf of paper in one hand, her gaze focused forward, while her other hand lightly touches her hair, her expression serene yet intent. Her face is soft with light makeup, lips pale, eyes thoughtful. In the foreground, blurred green shrubs fringe the frame. The midground shows the film set: on the left, a crew member in blue work clothes and black cap operates a camera; on the right, another actor in matching blue costume stands in profile, concentrating. In the background, a white tent and wooden scaffolding are visible, with thin frost on bare branches, evoking a cold winter dawn. The composition is central, shallow depth of field makes the woman sharp against a soft background. Slight low angle gives her a towering presence. Light comes from upper left, natural and soft, creating subtle highlights on her cheek and shoulder, shadows in the folds of her clothing. The overall palette is cool blue with warm orange-red accents, a quiet narrative atmosphere. The image feels like a candid moment from a professional outdoor shoot — the actress studying her script between takes, blending the elegance of historical costume with the reality of modern filmmaking. The blurred figures and equipment in the background heighten the sense of a live production, while her partial undress adds an intimate, NSFW edge to the otherwise poised scene.",
