          "id": "krea2-34f8485a2dd5af6c9fe85972",
          "alias": "单女红外套废墟媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in front of an industrial abandoned building, wearing a shiny red leather jacket unzipped to reveal her bare chest, the jacket's chrome zippers and stitching catching the light. Her black hair is pulled into a high ponytail with loose strands falling; she wears tiny gold earrings and a thin gold necklace. She holds a rusted metal ladder with her right hand and a black motorcycle helmet with red stripes and a YEMA logo in her left. Her left hand rests on her hip, her expression confident and direct at the camera. She wears only the open red jacket and blue denim shorts with frayed edges, metal chain and star studs on the sides, and white high-top boots with fine texture stitching. The background is a cracked, peeling concrete wall, an old wooden ladder on the left. Soft side lighting from above creates natural shadows across her body and face, contrasting the vivid red jacket with the cold gray industrial tones. The scene feels raw, sensual, and cinematic.",
