          "prompt": "A young woman topless, wearing only a red fluffy open cardigan, her bare breasts exposed, a red Santa hat with white trim and pom-pom on her head, soft brown curly hair with straight bangs, glowing in warm light, delicate makeup with shimmery eyeshadow, full red lips, small silver nose stud. She turns slightly, looking back over her shoulder with a sweet, inviting smile, one hand lifting a strand of hair, fingers well-manicured. A large Christmas tree on the right, covered in fake snow, red and gold ornaments, bells, pinecones, warm reflections. A smaller tree on the left with white snow and red decorations. Pure black background for contrast. Medium shot, S-curve body pose, soft backlight creating a golden rim on her hair and shoulders, warm orange highlights on her skin. Sensual, festive mood, rich reds, whites, golds against deep black. Professional studio lighting, cinematic depth, intimate holiday feel.",
