        {
          "id": "krea2-83f8dd73cc119e36bd58b103",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙窗边微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long glossy black hair sits in a cozy vintage room, wearing a white polka dot spaghetti strap dress that has slipped down to expose her bare shoulders, the curve of her breasts, and her pink nipples just visible above the fabric. She tilts her head with a soft, inviting smile, eyes bright and languid, body angled toward the camera. One hand rests casually on her bare thigh, the dress hiked up to reveal her white socks and Mary Jane shoes. Beside her, a giant beige teddy bear in a red scarf leans against striped pillows. In the foreground, a wooden desk cluttered with books and a small black device; a dark wooden bookshelf packed with vintage tomes dominates the left, while a green multi-pane window with Christmas garlands, red ornaments, and a LED string lights the right. Cold natural light streams in, mixing with warm indoor glow, casting soft shadows over her skin and the furniture. The stone wall behind has a vintage candlestick. The composition is balanced, with the woman and teddy as focal points, evoking a warm, nostalgic, intimate, and slightly sensual winter afternoon.",
