        {
          "id": "krea2-cf9debf60f86eb4afb9ec8b4",
          "alias": "单女半褪白连衣裙沙发忧伤脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman reclines elegantly on a soft cream curved sofa, wearing a delicate white lace slip dress with thin straps, one strap slipping off her shoulder, revealing the upper curve of her bare breast. The intricate knit and openwork pattern of the lace is visible in the soft light, the hem resting above her knees, flowing lightly. Her legs are crossed—right leg slightly bent, left extended—wearing white knitted ankle socks with ruffled cuffs that add a playful, tender touch. Her long brown hair falls loosely over her shoulders, a few strands gently resting on her forehead, with a healthy, soft shine. She relaxes naturally, her right hand resting on the sofa edge, fingers long, nails trimmed and painted pale pink; her left hand rests lightly on her left knee, palm slightly open. She turns slightly, head tilted, gazing directly at the camera with a clear, luminous look, a hint of melancholy and thoughtfulness, lips slightly parted, naturally pink. Her face is softly contoured, skin fair and flawless. The background is a plain white wall, clean and minimal, drawing focus to her. Soft light from the left casts gentle shadows across her face, arms, and dress, enhancing the three-dimensional form and curves. Medium shot, her figure dominates the center-right of the frame, body forming an S-curve, creating visual rhythm. Foreground includes the soft sofa cushion and part of the dress, midground her full body, background pure white, offering depth and perspective. The mood is tranquil, intimate, romantic, and poetic, with a palette of white and cream evoking a clean, warm, almost innocent sensuality, as if a quiet morning moment captured. High detail from fabric texture to hair sheen and subtle lighting, blending artistic photography with a candid, lifelike feel. All focus remains on her, conveying a pure, natural, yet sexually charged emotional experience.",
