        {
          "id": "krea2-6df1cc4001923f19b425e578",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑束身衣废墟媚态蹲侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches on gray tiled steps, her brown hair with straight bangs framing a sharp, cold gaze. She stares defiantly into the lens, her face perfectly made up with deep red lips and a sultry, cruel expression. She's topless, wearing only a black lace-trimmed corset that barely contains her breasts, delicate black fishnet stockings with floral patterns, and black high heels. A black feather-trimmed coat slips off her right shoulder, exposing her skin. Her right hand rests at her side, left hand on her knee, body leaning forward, head tilted, exuding a dangerous, sexually charged presence. The composition is vertical, subject left-center, with gray tile wall and steps in the midground, and a geometric pattern of white grout lines behind. The camera angle is slightly high, capturing her full form. Light comes from front-left, soft and even, molding her curves, casting subtle shadows on the wall and floor. The palette is black, white, gray, punctuated by black lace, feathers, and the red of her lips. The mood is cool, mysterious, like a private shoot in an abandoned underground space, with cinematic depth of field, rich detail, and a filmic grain that blends art and raw sensuality.",
