        {
          "id": "krea2-a7cca0ff5c6a8576eccabf6d",
          "alias": "单女全裸挂脖市场媚态站立摆拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands nude in the center of a dim indoor market aisle, her body adorned only by a cascade of silver sequins and golden fringe draping from a barely-there halter top and micro skirt, the bright yellow fabric clinging to her curves. She wears a pink cowboy hat with shimmering bead and fringe trim, dark curls spilling over bare shoulders. Her makeup is flawless, eyes locked on the camera with a cool, detached expression. A simple silver necklace rests against her collarbone, and fluorescent yellow heels elevate her stance. Her legs are together, hands at sides, posing with deliberate fashion-model tension. The foreground shows rough concrete floor with dappled light and shadows, scattered yellow and green plastic crates (one with blurred red Thai text), and a bag of fruit. In the background, a blue pickup truck loaded with white-netted cargo, deeper darkness with stall outlines, a red plastic bucket, a bicycle, and green metal beams with industrial lighting casting cold white glow. Light slants from upper right, creating long shadows and harsh edge lighting that highlights her bare skin and the metallic dress details. The composition is centered, with vivid yellow, pink, green, blue against gray shadows, giving a gritty yet surreal, theatrical street-photography vibe. Slight film grain and muted saturation evoke a late-afternoon analog photo, blending documentary realism with exaggerated fashion. The scene feels both mundane and dreamlike, her nudity adding raw sensuality to the market's everyday chaos.",
