          "id": "krea2-1a0b211d3e024f479e1805f1",
          "alias": "单女黑泳装车厢媚态坐回眸",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a bathtub, wearing a tiny black string bikini that barely covers her curves, her long naturally wavy hair falling with light gray ombré tips. She turns her body sideways, looking back over her shoulder at the camera with a soft, lazy gaze, lips slightly parted and painted pale pink. Her skin is fair and smooth, her neck and shoulders elegantly defined, arms slender, fingers long—her right hand lifts lightly to her cheek, fingertips curling gently, while her left hand rests on her thigh. She leans forward slightly, her posture graceful and relaxed, emphasizing her healthy, full figure. Behind her, a massive floor-to-ceiling window frames a wide ocean view: crystal-clear turquoise water, a few small boats moored in the shallows, green hills in the distance with faint building outlines on the peaks. The sky is bright blue with sparse white clouds, sunlight streaming through the glass, illuminating her body and the room. The walls are covered in beige subway tiles with a fine texture; the bathtub is white ceramic with rounded edges. The indoor light is soft and warm, contrasting with the bright daylight outside. Composition is a medium shot, with the subject positioned slightly left of center, occupying about two-thirds of the frame, leaving the right side open to showcase the sea view, creating a strong visual contrast. Foreground includes the tub edge and part of the wall, midground is the woman, background is the vast seascape—layered depth. The visual flow starts from her face, then extends out to the ocean and hills, evoking a serene, idyllic mood. Light comes from the window on the right, creating natural chiaroscuro, with even illumination on her body and soft shadows. Overall color palette is blue, green, and beige, sharply contrasted by the black bikini. The scene feels like a summer vacation, intimate yet open, as if captured on a quiet morning or afternoon when the sun is just right. The image has a realistic, natural feel with slight grain and soft color bias, like a candid snapshot from an everyday camera—comfortable, romantic, slightly sensual, exuding a leisurely holiday vibe.",
