        {
          "id": "krea2-5ef872c08115c245c66399d5",
          "alias": "单女半褪米毛衣广场微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a wooden bench at an outdoor café, her light beige knit cardigan open and hanging loosely off one shoulder, revealing a partially unbuttoned blue-and-white striped shirt that exposes the top of her lace bra and the swell of her breasts. She wears a matching hairband, her brown hair cascading freely, and a short plaid skirt that rides up her thighs as she casually rests one foot on the bench, her white thigh-high stockings and deep brown square-toe heels accentuating her long legs. Her other foot dangles, and beside her sits a brown leather handbag. She looks down with a soft, knowing smile, one hand lightly touching the edge of a menu folder while the other lifts slightly as if to turn a page, her posture relaxed yet inviting. The foreground holds a wooden table covered with a blue-and-white gingham cloth, clean and bare. In the background, modern building walls with glass windows reflect the surroundings, black iron wall lamps line the surface, and a cascade of white sheer curtains billows in the breeze, casting soft dappled light. A spiral staircase, greenery, and blurred cityscape are faintly visible in the distance. The composition is a mid-shot, with the subject slightly left of center, leaning forward to draw attention to her hands and the menu. The background is softly blurred, and the lighting is bright and warm, with natural shadows transitioning across her skin. The color palette is beige, blue, and white with brown accents, creating a fresh, summer-afternoon mood. Every detail is crisp—the texture of her clothes, the text on the menu, the gaps between wooden planks, the folds of the curtains—giving it a cinematic, high-quality photo realism with a casual, intimate, and subtly erotic feel, full of youthful charm and romantic allure.",
