        {
          "id": "krea2-0afe99cc05131cafad5ac605",
          "alias": "单女露胸白连衣裙博物馆微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a brown velvet sofa in a cozy café, her sleek black hair falling naturally over bare shoulders. She is completely topless, her pale skin luminous under the soft light, her small, perky breasts fully exposed. She faces the camera with a slight tilt of her head, a subtle, knowing smile on her lips, her right hand resting elegantly under her chin, fingers long and delicate. A white cotton dress with red and green floral print is bunched around her waist, the pearl-trimmed ruffle collar undone and hanging open. A thin silver bracelet encircles her left wrist, and small circular earrings catch the light. On the marble table before her sits a glass of iced coffee with creamy foam and a metal straw, beside a slice of lemon cheesecake topped with pale yellow cream and a fresh lemon slice, a stream of golden honey dripping over the edge, glistening. The foreground focuses on the table and dessert. She is centered in the mid-frame, slightly below the middle, with a gallery wall behind her filled with vibrant art prints—yellow tulips, pink and orange blooms, and playful text like \"LOVE IN GARDEN\", \"SPRING LOVE\", \"FLOWER MEMEMI BLOOM\" in wooden frames. The lower wall is gray wainscoting, the upper part light gray. The room glows with a mix of overhead and natural window light, casting soft shadows across her face, hair, and bare torso. The scene radiates warmth, high color saturation in yellows, pinks, greens, whites, creating a cheerful, artistic mood. The image is crisp and detailed, like an amateur photo with a refined aesthetic, capturing a serene, erotic moment of an afternoon coffee break.",
