        {
          "id": "krea2-8ca8239ccd644f868a0b8993",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙室内媚态倚靠跳舞",
          "prompt": "A young female figure skater in a sheer, low-cut, lilac ice dance costume performs a flawless single-foot spin at the center of an indoor rink. Her body leans gracefully to one side, right leg straight and supporting, left leg extended backward with toe pointing, arms flowing wide—right hand reaching forward, left hand hanging naturally, fingers slightly spread as if conversing with the air. She wears a confident, sultry smile, eyes focused and alive; her long black hair swirls around her in soft arcs. Her face is clear-skinned, cheeks flushed with a healthy glow, lips parted just enough to reveal white teeth, exuding youthful vitality and allure. Her dress is a form-fitting lilac sleeveless gown with a deep V neckline, adorned with three-dimensional pink flowers and sparkling crystal beads that shimmer under the lights. Matching lace gloves encircle her arms, tiny gems at the wrists. White ice skates with sleek leather and neatly tied laces reflect cold metallic gleam. On the ice, a distinct glide mark and scattered fine shavings sparkle like stars. The background is a blurred indoor arena with faint audience rows; warm yellow top lights bathe the scene, creating a soft, dreamy halo that highlights her figure. Shadows and reflections on the ice enhance depth and texture. The composition is a mid-shot, with the skater positioned slightly left, her body forming a diagonal line that draws the eye from her skates up to her face, emphasizing dynamic motion. The foreground shows the ice and trail, midground captures her full spinning pose, and background is a soft-focus venue. The overall image feels cinematic, poetic, and slightly grainy, mimicking a real amateur sports photograph with natural lens distortion. Color saturation is moderate, tones warm, details rich, light transitions smooth—blending professional artistry with a raw, lifelike aesthetic.",
