          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the back of a red and white high-performance sport motorcycle, wearing a glossy black latex catsuit unzipped to her navel, exposing her bare breasts with erect nipples, the shiny material clinging to her curves. Her long hair flows in the night breeze, makeup flawless, red lips parted, eyes locking onto the camera with a cold, confident, and seductive gaze. She wears long black gloves, left hand resting on the handlebar, right hand behind her, legs spread slightly, wearing high-shine black leather boots. The motorcycle is red with white and black accents, \"CLUBMAN\" on the tank, visible frame, silver exhaust. Foreground details of the engine and exhaust, midground shows her and the bike in a low-angle shot, her body slightly turned, head looking back over her shoulder. Background: night city street, warm yellow lights on buildings, glass reflections, wet asphalt with reflections. The composition uses dynamic diagonal lines, ample space on the left. Lighting from front-right highlights her bare chest and glossy suit, creating soft shadows, red reflections on the bike, warm neon background contrasting with cool metal. Overall: sensual, powerful, cinematic realism, urban night vibe, a fusion of mechanical aesthetics and raw sexuality.",
