        {
          "id": "krea2-b054ae767b2eea6005f43c6e",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑连衣裙椅上忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a wooden chair indoors, body slightly tilted, legs crossed, elegant and relaxed. She wears a black lace-trimmed spaghetti-strap dress with fine vertical stripes and delicate scalloped lace at the neckline and straps—the dress has slid down her shoulders, leaving her bare breasts exposed, nipples visible. Her hair is piled into a loose bun with tendrils framing her face. She wears thin-rimmed glasses, her gaze calm and distant, with a hint of aloofness. Her left hand rests under her chin, a dark bead bracelet on her wrist. Her skin is fair and smooth, illuminated by warm yellow light. She wears black stiletto heels. The chair is dark brown wood. Behind her stands a dark upright piano with a cream lampshade lamp atop, casting soft light that highlights her bare chest and face. A grey plush teddy bear leans against the piano. The walls are light beige, floor is herringbone wood. Composition centers her, with piano and lamp in background. Lighting creates soft shadows across her breasts and neck. The atmosphere is intimate, quiet, slightly melancholic, capturing a raw, unposed moment of domestic sensuality.",
