        {
          "id": "krea2-3e7610162a8b8d1cd41d843f",
          "alias": "单女全裸白牛仔海滩困倦坐自慰",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits inside a beach tent, her black hair pinned in a sleek low bun with loose strands brushing her cheek, bare-breasted, one hand gently fingering the shimmering tassels on the transparent tent fabric, the other resting on an open puzzle box filled with blue-and-white mosaic tiles. She wears only a pair of off-white high-waisted denim shorts with natural frayed hem, leaving her torso completely nude, soft shadows contouring her skin. A small woven basket beside her holds a single sunflower and green leaves. Outside, golden sand meets a hazy blue sea under a pink-orange gradient sky, warm sunlight slanting through the tent, backlighting her figure in a halo of glow. Inside, countless long, glossy tassels in pink, purple, and gold hang from the ceiling, swaying in a gentle breeze, scattering rainbow flecks of light. The entire scene is veiled in a soft-focus mist, dreamy and romantic, with a film-grain texture and slight lens blur, as if captured by an old analog camera. Close-up framing through the tent’s curved entrance, with tassels in the foreground, her body and hands in the midground, and the distant sea-sky horizon leading the eye out. The main light comes from the front-right, creating delicate shadow transitions. A palette of sand, lime green, off-white, pale pink, and light blue dominates, evoking a quiet, healing, poetic summer afternoon. The image feels intensely cinematic and intimate, like a stolen moment of freedom and self-discovery.",
