          "alias": "单女白T恤阳台微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on the stone floor of an outdoor balcony or patio, wearing a tight white sleeveless printed T-shirt with colorful cartoon graphics and letters, her chest slightly outlined, paired with a blue-and-white plaid miniskirt that flares naturally in soft folds, revealing a hint of upper thigh. She wears light blue canvas sneakers and white knee-high socks, her black hair tied up in a high bun secured with a blue floral patterned hair clip. She leans sideways against a beige wall, her left hand gently cupping her chin, right hand resting casually on her hip, creating an elegant S-curve. Her gaze meets the camera with a soft, confident smile. The mid-shot framing captures her from waist to feet, with the background featuring light curtains and a glass door, the curtains diffusing warm sunlight. A vintage brass wall lamp hangs on the right wall. The stone floor is irregular dark gray with visible texture. Lighting comes from the left front, casting soft shadows on the wall and floor behind her. The scene is bathed in white, blue, and beige tones, creating a serene afternoon atmosphere with a candid, documentary feel. The focus is on her, with a slightly blurred background, emphasizing her figure. The visual flow starts from her face, follows the curves of her body down to her feet, creating a smooth visual path that balances realism and artistic aesthetic.",
