          "alias": "单女拳击黑短裤霓虹夜景媚态站立展示",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands inside a boxing ring, wearing a black thin-strap sports crop top that leaves her midriff bare, revealing toned abs and a slim waist, paired with low-rise black shorts with white side stripes, showcasing her hip bones and long lean legs. Her black hair is tied in a high ponytail with loose strands falling across her forehead, adding a touch of softness. She wears glossy red boxing gloves, one hand casually resting on the silver ring ropes, her body slightly tilted, head turned, eyes locked on the camera with a mix of confidence, focus, and challenge. Her makeup is flawless—full red lips, flawless pale skin, sharp facial features. The shot is a medium close-up, with the subject slightly off-center right, the foreground crisp on the gloves and ropes with rich detail, while the background is a blurred gym interior with the \"CMAG\" sign on the dark wall, distant blue neon lights, and faint training equipment, creating a modern urban fitness vibe. Lighting from above and side sculpts soft shadows across her face and arms, highlighting muscle definition and skin texture, with warm light on her body contrasting against cool background tones, adding depth and visual punch. The overall mood fuses strength and sensuality—athletic intensity and feminine allure, with a slight sheen of sweat on her skin, suggesting a recent workout. The image has a professional studio quality yet retains a candid, real feel, as if snapped mid-training pause, capturing a moment of poised determination with a subtle erotic undertone.",
