          "alias": "单女红挂脖沙发微笑站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A young woman with glossy black hair and blunt bangs stands before a warm red-brown backdrop, a bright red headband matching her cropped red knitted halter top that reveals her gently rounded pregnant belly. Her right hand caresses her bump softly, while her left holds a small paper basket of three bright red apples. She wears a delicate white lace-trimmed layered mini skirt that cinches at her waist, highlighting her slender figure. She stands in front of a vintage brown velvet tufted sofa, its fabric rich and soft. She is positioned slightly left of center, body turned slightly toward the camera, forming an elegant S-curve. Medium shot from knees up, emphasizing her pregnancy and tender expression. Her face glows with a serene, happy smile of maternal anticipation. The scene is bathed in soft, warm light from the front-right, casting gentle shadows on her skin and clothing. The color palette is harmonious: reds, whites, and browns. The composition draws the eye first to her face, then to the apples, then to her hand on her belly. The mood is intimate, sensual, and full of quiet joy—a professional maternity shoot with a soft, artistic feel. She seems to hum a lullaby, her love for the future palpable in every detail.",
