        {
          "id": "krea2-8568dbcfe19cd0a15a803c26",
          "alias": "单女白礼服微笑倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A figure skater glides across pristine ice, her black hair swept into an elegant bun with a small white feather ornament adorning it. She wears a white gown studded with rhinestones, the bodice sheer and revealing perky nipples beneath the sparkling fabric, while the translucent layers at her shoulders and back expose smooth skin. Her expression is focused yet soft, lips parted in a gentle smile as she gazes forward. Her body leans slightly forward, right leg straight and supporting, left leg extended behind with toe lightly brushing the ice, forming a graceful arc. Arms are bent, hands gently overlapping at her chest, fingers long and delicate. The skirt floats around her, occasionally lifting to reveal long, toned legs and a flash of bare thigh. She wears white ice skates with sleek metal blades carving faint lines into the glistening ice, which reflects cool light and her silhouette. The background blurs into distant stands and soft overhead light creating a diffused, dreamy atmosphere. Mid-shot composition, figure on the left, the right side open to suggest forward motion and anticipation. The scene is bathed in white with hints of pale pink and silver, giving a pure, ethereal, and highly sensual artistic feel, capturing strength and grace.",
