        {
          "id": "krea2-1df0ccb5ed20c0e8d4621b5f",
          "alias": "单女米风衣街道忧伤站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a city street, her black short hair with blunt bangs framing a fair-skinned face. Her makeup is delicate: subtle pink and gold shimmer on eyelids, natural coral-red lips. She gazes at the camera with a melancholic, slightly detached expression, head tilted down, lips pressed together, exuding a quiet loneliness and introspection. She wears a long beige trench coat, classic lapel, double-breasted, with clean shoulder lines, open to reveal a low-cut white T-shirt that shows a hint of cleavage. A puffy black down jacket is worn over it but unzipped, collar high but partially pushed aside, exposing her neck and collarbone. Her right hand holds a skewer of sizzling grilled meat—glazed, reddish-brown, shiny with oil. Her left hand carries a small pink suede purse with \"AUX\" on it, and a black chain strap slung across her shoulder, metallic glint. Background: urban street lined with lush green trees, distant modern buildings with glass facades reflecting the overcast sky. Pedestrians and cars move past, crosswalk markings, traffic signs, streetlights. Soft, diffused light, cool color palette—gray, beige, black with touches of green and pink. Centered composition; focus on her face and the meat skewer. Foreground: her figure; midground: street and people; background: architecture and trees. Smooth, shadowless lighting. Ambience: calm, everyday urban scene infused with solitude, like a captured moment on an ordinary afternoon. Fine texture, rich detail, natural colors, realistic photographic style with subtle film grain—sharp but not over-sharpened, retaining natural noise and light transitions, creating a genuine, story-rich atmosphere with a touch of erotic tension.",
