          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, wearing a black long-sleeve shirt unbuttoned to reveal a leopard-print bodysuit clinging to her curves, its deep V-neckline exposing generous cleavage. The shirt's collar is tied with a large black bow, ruffled cuffs framing her black lace-gloved hands. Multiple gold and leopard-print bangles stack on her wrists. She wears a black beret with white trim, her long black hair falling over her shoulders, bangs neatly covering her forehead. Her hands adjust the headset mic near her glossy lips, mouth slightly open, eyes locked on the camera with a confident, focused gaze. Her body leans forward, waist taut, long legs clad in sheer black stockings that gleam under the lights. The blurred gray metallic background suggests industrial stage equipment. Medium shot, symmetrical pose, arms raised to either side of her head, creating a striking visual. Light from front above highlights her face and the rich textures of leather, lace, and leopard print. Color palette: black, brown, gold. The leopard pattern appears vivid and layered. The mood blends modern and retro, like a high-res concert photograph capturing a sensual, professional stage presence. Slight low-angle enhances her commanding aura, with soft background blur, cinematic quality, evoking music and live energy. A perfect fusion of fashion, performance, and photography.",
