        {
          "id": "krea2-215d5e82d26c428c7f532d4c",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙媚态站立注视（2）",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands beside an antique loom, her white dress now sheer and clinging to her curves, the translucent fabric revealing the outline of her nipples and the gentle swell of her hips. Her hair is loosely pinned in a half-updo, stray strands brushing her cheeks as she gazes downward with a soft, contemplative expression. A delicate, transparent shawl slips from one shoulder, exposing the bare skin of her collarbone and the upper curve of her breast, its edges embroidered with tiny beads that catch the light like dewdrops. The layered skirt pools around her feet in cascading folds, lifting slightly with a subtle breeze to hint at the shape of her thighs. Her right hand rests on the wooden beam of the loom, fingers long and relaxed, while the loom itself is weathered wood with patinated metal fittings, white cotton threads wound around its spindles. Behind her, a gradient wall shifts from deep blue to pale lavender, with hanging fabrics in soft green and beige bearing faint patterns. A red panel adds a warm contrast to the cool tones. The composition centers on her, body slightly turned to the right, her gaze cast downward in a moment of intimate focus. Soft, diffused light from the front-left sculpts her face and casts delicate shadows across the translucent fabric, emphasizing the natural curves of her body. The atmosphere is serene, poetic, and subtly erotic—a fusion of modern fashion photography and timeless craftsmanship, capturing the quiet sensuality of a tradition renewed.",
